#: ../../export/content/applications/hr.rst:5
msgid "Human resources"
msgstr "人力資源"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals.rst:5
msgid "Appraisals"
msgstr "評估"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:3
msgid "360 Feedback"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Appraisals** app lets managers gather feedback on their direct "
"reports from colleagues, and from anyone else who works with them, such as "
"customers or partners. This input gives managers a fuller view of each "
"employee's strengths, growth areas, and collaboration skills."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的**員工評核**應用程式讓管理人員可向直屬下屬的同事及其他合作對象（例如客"
"戶或合作夥伴）收集意見回饋。這些意見有助管理人員更全面了解每位員工的強項、待"
"改善之處及協作能力。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:9
msgid ""
"360 feedback relies on surveys from the **Surveys** app. To request "
"feedback, navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, and enable the :guilabel:`360 Feedback` option in the *Appraisals"
" Plans* section, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"360 度意見回饋功能需使用 **問卷調查** 應用程式的問卷。要請求意見回饋，請前往 "
":menuselection:`員工評估應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並啟用 :guilabel:`360 度"
"意見回饋` 選項（位於 *評估計劃* 部分），然後點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:16
msgid "360 feedback dashboard"
msgstr "360 度回饋儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:18
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`360 Feedback` dashboard displays all the surveys configured "
"for the **Appraisals** app. To view the surveys and their statistics, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Configuration --> 360 "
"Feedback`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:22
msgid ""
"The 360 Feedback dashboard, displaying the available appraisal surveys."
msgstr "360 度反饋儀表板，顯示可用的評核問卷。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:25
msgid ""
"Each survey is presented on its own card, along with the following "
"information:"
msgstr "每份問卷均會以獨立卡片顯示，並附有以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:27
msgid ":guilabel:`Survey Name`: The name of the specific survey."
msgstr ":guilabel:`問卷名稱`：特定問卷的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible`: The user responsible for the survey, including the "
"month and year the survey was created."
msgstr ":guilabel:`負責人`：負責該問卷調查的用戶，並包含問卷建立的年份及月份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Questions`: The number of questions in that particular survey."
msgstr ":guilabel:`問題`：該問卷中的問題數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Average Duration`: The average time participants take to complete"
" the survey."
msgstr ":guilabel:`平均時間`：參與者完成問卷調查所需的平均時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Registered`: The number of people who were asked to answer the "
"survey."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已登記`：獲邀填寫問卷的人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Completed`: The number of people who have completed the survey."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已完成`：已完成問卷調查的人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:35
msgid ""
"To test the survey, click the :guilabel:`Test` button. This opens the survey"
" in a new tab to preview the questions without submitting answers. Close the"
" tab to return to the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"若要測試問卷調查，請按一下:guilabel:`測試`按鈕。這會在新分頁中開啟問卷調查，"
"以便預覽問題而不提交答案。關閉分頁即可返回儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:38
msgid ""
"To create a new survey, click :guilabel:`New`, then configure the survey as "
"any other :doc:`survey <../../marketing/surveys/create>`. Surveys created "
"from this dashboard are automatically set as :guilabel:`Appraisal` surveys, "
"which makes them available in the **Appraisals** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:45
msgid "Request feedback"
msgstr "請求意見回饋"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:47
msgid ""
"To request feedback from a colleague, navigate to the **Appraisals** app, "
"and click on the appraisal card to open it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:50
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Ask Feedback` button, and an *Ask Feedback* pop-up "
"window appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:53
msgid ""
"Only confirmed appraisals (with an :guilabel:`Ongoing` status) display the "
":guilabel:`Ask Feedback` button."
msgstr ""
"只有已確認的績效評估（狀態為:guilabel:`進行中`），才會顯示:guilabel:`徵詢意"
"見`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:56
msgid "Fill out the following fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Survey Template`: Select the survey to send. The first available "
"survey is selected by default."
msgstr ":guilabel:`問卷範本`：選擇要發送的問卷。系統預設會選擇第一份可用的問卷。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Answer Deadline`: The date by which the feedback must be "
"submitted. This date is automatically set to the :guilabel:`Appraisal Date`."
" Use the calendar selector to modify the date, if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recipients`: Select the people asked to provide feedback. All "
"contacts from the **Contacts** app can be selected, such as customers or "
"suppliers. Multiple recipients may be selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`收件人`：選擇獲邀提供意見的人員。您可選擇 **聯絡人** 應用程式中的"
"所有聯絡人（例如客戶或供應商），並可同時選擇多位收件人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:68
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Search More` is selected, a *Search: Recipients* pop-up window"
" loads, and only displays employees by default."
msgstr ""
"如果選擇 :guilabel:`搜尋更多`，系統會載入 *搜尋：收件人* 彈出式視窗，預設只顯"
"示員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Subject`: The email subject, populated with `Take part in "
"(Employee Name) appraisal`. Modify it, if desired."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`主旨`：電郵主旨，系統會自動填入 `參與（員工姓名）的評核`。如有需要"
"，可自行修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:74
msgid ""
"Type in any additional comments in the space provided, if desired. The email"
" template copy is *not* displayed in the pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可在提供的欄位輸入任何額外備註。電郵範本副本 *不會* 在彈出視窗中顯"
"示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:77
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send`, and the feedback requests are sent by email to the "
"specified recipients. Recipients who are appraisal officers also receive an "
"activity to fill out the survey."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`傳送`，系統隨即會透過電郵向指定收件人傳送意見回饋請求。身兼評"
"估負責人的收件人亦會收到填寫問卷的活動通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:80
msgid ""
"The Ask Feedback pop-up window, requesting feedback from two colleagues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:86
msgid "View results"
msgstr "檢視結果"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:88
msgid ""
"To view the results, click the :icon:`edit_square` :guilabel:`Feedbacks` "
"smart button on the appraisal form. This smart button displays the number of"
" completed feedback requests out of the total number of requests. It only "
"appears once feedback has been requested, and is only visible to the "
"appraisers."
msgstr ""
"要查看結果，請點擊評估表單上的 :icon:`edit_square` :guilabel:`意見回饋` 智能"
"按鈕。此智能按鈕會顯示已完成意見回饋請求數目與總請求數目。該按鈕只會在提出意"
"見回饋請求後出現，且僅對評估人員可見。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:93
msgid ""
"The *Feedback Surveys* list loads, and presents everyone requested to submit"
" feedback. Each line displays the following information:"
msgstr ""
"*意見回饋調查* 清單隨即載入，並列出所有獲邀提交意見回饋的人員。每一行均會顯示"
"以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Partner`: The name of the person who was requested to submit "
"feedback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: An icon indicating if the feedback was :ref:`completed "
"<appraisals/completed-360>` or :ref:`not <appraisals/new-360>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`狀態`：顯示意見回饋 :ref:`已完成 <appraisals/completed-360>` 或 "
":ref:`未完成 <appraisals/new-360>` 的圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:99
msgid ":guilabel:`Deadline`: The date and time the survey must be completed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`截止日期`：必須完成問卷調查的日期和時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Survey`: The name of the survey, which is :guilabel:`360 "
"Feedback` by default."
msgstr ":guilabel:`問卷調查`：問卷調查的名稱，預設為 :guilabel:`360 度意見回饋`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:102
msgid "The list of all feedback requests for an appraisal."
msgstr "評核的所有意見回饋請求清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:106
msgid ""
"Feedback requests that have been sent but have **not** been started are "
"referred to as *new*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:108
msgid ""
"To view all responses, click the :guilabel:`See results` button. The "
"combined feedback loads in a new tab. If the feedback requests use several "
"surveys, a *Choose Survey* pop-up window loads. Select the survey in the "
":guilabel:`Survey` field, then click :guilabel:`See Results`."
msgstr ""
"要查看所有回覆，請點擊 :guilabel:`查看結果` 按鈕。整合後的意見回饋會在新分頁"
"中載入。如果意見回饋請求使用了多份問卷，系統會顯示 *選擇問卷* 彈出視窗。請在 "
":guilabel:`問卷` 欄位中選擇問卷，然後點擊 :guilabel:`查看結果`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:112
msgid ""
"To ask feedback from more people, click the :guilabel:`Ask Feedback` button "
"above the list."
msgstr "要向更多人徵詢意見，請點擊列表上方的 :guilabel:`徵詢意見` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:117
msgid "Completed 360 feedback"
msgstr "已完成 360 度回饋"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:119
msgid ""
"Feedback requests that have been completed display a green "
":guilabel:`Completed` status tag on the *Feedback Surveys* list."
msgstr ""
"已完成的意見回饋請求會在 *意見回饋問卷* 清單上顯示綠色的 :guilabel:`已完成` "
"狀態標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:122
msgid ""
"To view the individual responses of a completed feedback form, click "
":icon:`open_in_new` :guilabel:`See Answers` at the end of the line, and the "
"person's individual responses load in a new tab."
msgstr ""
"要查看已完成意見回饋表的個別回覆，請點擊該行末端的 :icon:`open_in_new` "
":guilabel:`查看答案`，該名人士的個別回覆便會在新分頁中載入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:126
msgid "Close the tab when the review is complete."
msgstr "完成檢視後，請關閉該分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:131
msgid "New 360 feedback"
msgstr "新 360 度意見回饋"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:133
msgid ""
"Feedback requests that were sent but have not been started display a blue "
":guilabel:`New` status tag on the *Feedback Surveys* list."
msgstr ""
"已發送但尚未開始填寫的意見調查請求，會在 *意見調查* 清單中顯示藍色的 "
":guilabel:`新建` 狀態標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:136
msgid ""
"If necessary, the request can be resent. Click :icon:`check_box` "
":guilabel:`Resend` at the end of the line, and an *Ask Feedback* pop-up "
"window loads. Click :guilabel:`Send` to resend the feedback request."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可重新發送請求。點擊資料行末端的 :icon:`check_box` :guilabel:`重新"
"發送`，系統會載入 *請求意見回饋* 彈出視窗。點擊 :guilabel:`發送`，即可重新發"
"送意見回饋請求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/360.rst:140
msgid ""
"To resend several requests of the same survey at once, tick the checkbox "
"next to the requests, then click :icon:`redo` :guilabel:`Resend all`. In the"
" *Ask Feedback* pop-up window that loads, click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"如要一次過重新發送同一問卷的多項請求，請勾選請求旁的複選框，然後點擊 "
":icon:`redo` :guilabel:`全部重寄`。在載入的 *徵求意見* 彈出視窗中，點擊 "
":guilabel:`發送`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Appraisal analysis"
msgstr "評核分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Appraisals** app has the ability to report on all the appraisals in "
"the system, including past, present, and future appraisals, and their "
"respective final ratings."
msgstr ""
"**績效評估** 應用程式可就系統中的所有評估（包括過去、現在及未來的評估）及其各"
"自的最終評級產生報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:8
msgid ""
"This report helps managers determine how employees are doing overall. If the"
" majority of appraisals have a status of *Needs improvement*, it may "
"indicate that employees need more training to successfully perform their "
"jobs. If the majority of appraisals have a status of *Strongly Exceed "
"Expectations*, it may indicate that employees are not challenged enough, and"
" may benefit from promotions or increased levels of responsibility."
msgstr ""
"此報表有助管理人員掌握僱員的整體表現。如大多數工作評核的狀態為 *需要改進* ，"
"可能表示僱員需要更多培訓才能勝任工作。如大多數工作評核的狀態為 *遠超預期* ，"
"則可能表示僱員現時所受挑戰不足，或可考慮給予晉升機會或增加職責。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:14
msgid ""
"To view the *Appraisal Analysis* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Reporting --> Appraisal Analysis`. On the"
" *Appraisal Analysis* page, a report loads displaying all the appraisals "
"created in the past 365 days, in a default stacked bar chart. Appraisals are"
" grouped first by :guilabel:`Department`, then by :guilabel:`Final Rating`."
msgstr ""
"要檢視 *評估分析* 報表，請前往 :menuselection:`評估應用程式 --> 報告 --> 評估"
"分析`。在 *評估分析* 頁面中，系統會載入一份報表，以預設的堆疊柱狀圖顯示過去 "
"365 天內建立的所有評估。評估會先按 :guilabel:`部門` 分組，再按 :guilabel:`最"
"終評分` 分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:19
msgid ""
"The displayed ratings correspond to the configured :ref:`Evaluation Scale "
"<appraisals/rate>` options, and each rating has its own color on the report."
" Appraisals without a final rating yet appear as :guilabel:`None`. The "
"default options for the *Evaluation Scale* are: :guilabel:`Needs "
"improvement`, :guilabel:`Meets expectations`, :guilabel:`Exceeds "
"expectations`, and :guilabel:`Strongly Exceed Expectations`."
msgstr ""
"顯示的評級對應已設定的 :ref:`評核等級 <appraisals/rate>` 選項，且每個評級在報"
"表上都有各自的顏色。尚未有最終評級的評估會顯示為 :guilabel:`無`。*評核等級* "
"的預設選項為：:guilabel:`有待改善`、:guilabel:`符合期望`、:guilabel:`超越期"
"望` 及 :guilabel:`遠超期望`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:25
msgid ""
"Roll over any column's segment to view the number of appraisals with the "
"respective final rating. To view the specific appraisals within a segment, "
"click on it. A list displaying each employee's :guilabel:`Name`, "
":guilabel:`Department`, :guilabel:`Appraisal Date`, and :guilabel:`Status` "
"for every appraisal appears. Return to the *Appraisal Analysis* report by "
"clicking the breadcrumb menu."
msgstr ""
"將游標移至任何欄的分段上，即可查看各個最終評級的績效評估數量。按一下某個分段"
"，即可查看該分段內的具體績效評估。系統會顯示一份清單，列出每項評估中每位員工"
"的 :guilabel:`姓名`、:guilabel:`部門`、:guilabel:`評估日期` 及 :guilabel:`狀"
"態`。按一下階層導覽選單，即可返回 *績效評估分析* 報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:30
msgid ""
"The default report includes appraisals that have been scheduled but not "
"completed (appraisals with a status of *Draft* or *Ongoing*). To **only** "
"view completed appraisals, click into the search bar, then click "
":guilabel:`Done` in the :icon:`filter_alt_f` :guilabel:`Filters` column. The"
" report reloads, displaying only completed appraisals with a final rating."
msgstr ""
"預設報表包含已排程但尚未完成的評估（即狀態為 *草稿* 或 *進行中* 的評估）。若"
"要 **僅** 檢視已完成的評估，請點擊搜尋列，然後點擊 :guilabel:`已完成`（位於 "
":icon:`filter_alt_f` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 欄內）。報表會重新載入，僅顯示附有"
"最終評分的已完成評估。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:35
msgid ""
"To view only appraisals for the signed-in user's team, click into the search"
" bar and click :guilabel:`My team` in the :icon:`filter_alt_f` "
":guilabel:`Filters` column. This report only displays the employees the user"
" manages. This allows the user to better understand their team's performance"
" by showing how many employees are performing either above or below "
"expectations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:41
msgid ""
"To hide a metric from the report, click its label above the chart. Hidden "
"metrics are indicated by a strikethrough on the label. Click the label again"
" to make the metric visible."
msgstr ""
"如要在報表中隱藏某個指標，請點擊圖表上方的對應標籤。已隱藏的指標會在標籤上顯"
"示刪除線。再次點擊該標籤即可重新顯示指標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_analysis.rst:44
msgid "A report showing all the appraisals for the Appraisal Analysis report."
msgstr "顯示所有評核紀錄的報表，用於評核分析報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:3
msgid "Appraisal templates"
msgstr "評估範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:7
msgid ""
"The **Appraisals** app uses a preconfigured default template that is general"
" enough to apply to all employees. If desired, the default template "
":ref:`can be modified <appraisals/modify-template>`. If different templates "
"are needed, such as department-specific appraisal templates, new templates "
":ref:`can be created <appraisals/create-template>`."
msgstr ""
"**評核**應用程式使用預先配置的預設範本，內容足夠通用，適用於所有員工。如有需"
"要，你:ref:`可以修改 <appraisals/modify-template>`預設範本。如果需要不同的範"
"本（例如部門專用的評核範本），亦可:ref:`建立 <appraisals/create-template>`新"
"範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:15
msgid "Modify appraisal templates"
msgstr "修改評核範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:17
msgid ""
"If needed, changes can be made to the default template. To view the "
"templates, navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Configuration --> "
"Appraisal Templates`."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可更改預設範本。要檢視範本，請前往 :menuselection:`考核應用程"
"式 --> 配置 --> 考核範本`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:20
msgid ""
"All templates appear in a list view. The default template is named "
":guilabel:`Default`. Click the template to view its details, and make any "
"desired changes."
msgstr ""
"所有範本都會顯示在列表檢視中。預設範本名為 :guilabel:`預設`。按一下範本即可檢"
"視詳情，並作出任何所需更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:23
msgid "The template form contains the following fields:"
msgstr "範本表單包含以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Short Name`: The name of the template, displayed in the "
":guilabel:`Template` field of the appraisals."
msgstr ":guilabel:`簡稱`：範本的名稱，顯示在評估的 :guilabel:`範本` 欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: The company the template is available for. Leave this "
"field empty to make the template available for all companies. This field "
"only appears in a multi-company database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：此範本適用的公司。若將此欄位留空，範本將適用於所有公司。此"
"欄位僅會在多公司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Departments`: The departments the template is available for. "
"Leave this field empty to make the template available for all departments. "
"On an appraisal, only the templates linked to the employee's department, or "
"without any department, can be selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`部門`：可使用此範本的部門。如留空此欄位，範本將適用於所有部門。在"
"績效評估中，只能選擇與員工所屬部門關聯的範本，或未指定任何部門的範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`360 Feedback Survey`: The :doc:`360 feedback <360>` surveys that "
"can be selected when asking for feedback on appraisals using this template. "
"Leave this field empty to allow every survey. This field only appears if the"
" *360 Feedback* setting is enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`360 度意見回饋問卷`：使用此範本要求為績效評估提供意見時，可選擇的 "
":doc:`360 度意見回饋 <360>` 問卷。將此欄位留空即可允許使用所有問卷。此欄位僅"
"在啟用 *360 度意見回饋* 設定時才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee Feedback`: The questions the employee answers in their "
"self-assessment."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工意見回饋`：員工在自我評估中回答的問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Manager Feedback`: The questions the appraisers answer."
msgstr ":guilabel:`經理意見`：評估人員需要回答的問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:38
msgid ""
"The default appraisal template, with the employee and manager feedback "
"questions."
msgstr "預設的績效評估範本，包含員工及主管的反饋問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:42
