msgid "Create appraisal templates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:136
msgid ""
"Large companies with many departments may prefer department-specific "
"appraisal templates rather than a universal default template. Creating and "
"using department-specific templates can be helpful if specific feedback is "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"擁有多個部門的大型企業，可能會傾向使用部門專用的績效評估範本，而非通用的預設"
"範本。如需收集特定意見回饋，建立並使用部門專用範本會非常有幫助。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:141
msgid ""
"An appliance repair company has two main types of employees: office workers "
"who handle administrative tasks and scheduling, and field repair technicians"
" who perform repairs at customers' homes."
msgstr ""
"一間電器維修公司有兩類主要員工：負責處理行政事務及排程的辦公室職員，以及上門"
"為客戶進行維修的外勤維修技術員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:145
msgid ""
"This type of company may create two different appraisal templates, one for "
"the office workers and one for the on-site repair technicians."
msgstr ""
"此類公司可建立兩個不同的績效評估範本，一個供辦公室員工使用，另一個供現場維修"
"技術員使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:148
msgid ""
"To create a new appraisal template, navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals "
"app --> Configuration --> Appraisal Templates` and click the :guilabel:`New`"
" button in the corner. Enter a :guilabel:`Short Name`, set the "
":guilabel:`Company` and :guilabel:`Departments` the template is intended "
"for, if needed, then write the questions in the :guilabel:`Employee "
"Feedback` and :guilabel:`Manager Feedback` sections, using the :doc:`rich-"
"text editor <../../essentials/html_editor>`."
msgstr ""
"如要建立新的評估範本，請前往:menuselection:`績效評估應用程式 --> 配置 --> 評"
"估範本`，然後點擊角落的:guilabel:`新增`按鈕。輸入:guilabel:`簡稱`，並按需要設"
"定範本適用的:guilabel:`公司`及:guilabel:`部門`，接著在:guilabel:`員工意見回"
"饋`及:guilabel:`主管意見回饋`部分編寫問題（使用:doc:`富文字編輯器 <../../"
"essentials/html_editor>`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:154
msgid ""
"Additionally, a new appraisal template can be created by duplicating an "
"existing template and modifying the copy. To duplicate a template, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Configuration --> Appraisal "
"Templates`, then click on the template being duplicated. Click the "
":icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then click "
":icon:`content_copy` :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"此外，你亦可複製現有評估範本並修改複本，以建立新的評估範本。如要複製範本，請"
"前往 :menuselection:`評估應用程式 --> 配置 --> 評估範本`，然後點擊要複製的範"
"本。點擊 :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`（操作）` 圖示，然後點擊 "
":icon:`content_copy` :guilabel:`複製`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:159
msgid "First, rename the template, then make any desired changes."
msgstr "首先重新命名範本，然後進行任何所需的更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/appraisal_templates.rst:162
msgid ""
"Drag and drop the templates in the list view using the "
":icon:`drag_indicator` :guilabel:`(drag handle)` icon to reorder them. The "
"first available template in the list is selected by default on new "
"appraisals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:3
msgid "Goals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Appraisals** application allows managers to set and track clear "
"goals for their employees. Continuous progress towards goals gives employees"
" a concrete target between reviews, and gives managers reliable insights "
"when evaluating performance."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **評估** 應用程式讓管理人員為員工設定及追蹤明確的目標。持續推進目標不僅"
"能為員工在各次評核之間提供具體方向，亦能讓管理人員在評估表現時獲得可靠的參考"
"依據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:9
msgid ""
"Goals can be prepared in advance as *goal templates* in the :ref:`goals "
"library <appraisals/goals-library>`, then :ref:`assigned to employees "
"<appraisals/goals/assign>`."
msgstr ""
"目標可預先於 :ref:`目標庫 <appraisals/goals-library>` 中建立為 *目標範本*，然"
"後 :ref:`指派給員工 <appraisals/goals/assign>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:13
msgid ""
"No goal templates come preconfigured in the **Appraisals** app; all goals "
"must be :ref:`added to the database <appraisals/add-goals>`."
msgstr ""
"**員工評估** 應用程式並無預先配置的目標範本；所有目標均須 :ref:`新增至資料庫 "
"<appraisals/add-goals>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:19
msgid "Goals library"
msgstr "目標庫"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:21
msgid ""
"The *Goals Library* houses all the goal templates configured in the "
"database, and is where new goal templates are added. To view all the "
"currently configured goal templates, navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals "
"app --> Configuration --> Library`, and the *Goals Template* dashboard "
"loads. All goal templates are displayed in a default list view, and each one"
" displays the following information:"
msgstr ""
"*目標庫* 存放資料庫中所有已配置的目標範本，亦是新增目標範本的地方。要檢視所有"
"現時已配置的目標範本，請前往 :menuselection:`評估應用程式 --> 配置 --> 目標"
"庫`，系統便會載入 *目標範本* 儀表板。所有目標範本均以預設列表檢視顯示，每個範"
"本都會顯示以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:27
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:138
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: The name of the goal."
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`：目標的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recommended for`: The *skills* and levels the goal works towards."
" If an employee wants to advance a skill listed in the "
":guilabel:`Recommended for` column, the goal is an effective way to attain "
"that skill level."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`建議適用`：目標致力達成的 *技能* 及級別。如員工希望提升 "
":guilabel:`建議適用` 欄中所列的技能，該目標便是達到該技能級別的有效途徑。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sub Goals`: The various goals that must be achieved to complete "
"the specified goal. These can also be referred to as *prerequisites*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`子目標`：為完成指定目標而必須達成的各項目標。這些亦可稱為 *先決條"
"件* 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:34
msgid ""
"To view how goals are nested, click the :icon:`family_history` "
":guilabel:`(Hierarchy)` icon in the top-right corner."
msgstr ""
"要檢視目標的巢狀結構，請按一下右上角的 :icon:`family_history` :guilabel:`（階"
"層架構）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:40
msgid "Create new goals"
msgstr "建立新目標"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:42
msgid ""
"To add a new goal to the goals library, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Configuration --> Library`, click the "
":guilabel:`New` button, and a blank *Goals Template* form loads. Fill out "
"the following information on the form:"
msgstr ""
"若要將新目標新增至目標庫，請前往 :menuselection:`評核應用程式 --> 配置 --> 目"
"標庫`，點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統會載入空白的 *目標範本* 表單。請在表單"
"上填寫以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:46
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: Enter a name for the goal in this field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`：在此欄位輸入目標的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Parent Goal Template`: If the goal is a sub-goal under another "
"goal, referred to as a *parent goal*, select it using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Skills`: Click the :icon:`add` :guilabel:`(add)` icon to"
" select the skill and level the goal helps to reach. In the *Select Skills* "
"pop-up window, select the skill :guilabel:`Category`, the :guilabel:`Skill`,"
" and the :guilabel:`Skill Level`, then click :guilabel:`Save & Close`. When "
"an employee is evaluated on that skill during an appraisal, the goal is "
"recommended for them."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預期技能`：按一下 :icon:`add` :guilabel:`（新增）` 圖示，以選擇此"
"目標有助達成的技能及等級。在 *選擇技能* 彈出視窗中，選擇技能 :guilabel:`類"
"別`、:guilabel:`技能` 及 :guilabel:`技能等級`，然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存並關"
"閉`。當員工在評核期間獲評估該項技能時，系統會向其推薦此目標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Usual Timing`: Enter the typical amount of time, in months, the "
"goal takes to achieve. When the goal is assigned to an employee, the "
"deadline is calculated based on this field. This field is required."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`通常所需時間`：輸入達成目標通常所需的時間（以月為單位）。當目標指"
"派給員工時，系統會根據此欄位計算截止日期。此為必填欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Add any relevant :ref:`tags <appraisals/add-tags>` using "
"the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`標籤`：使用下拉式選單新增任何相關:ref:`標籤 <appraisals/add-tags>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:60
msgid ""
"A company wants to help employees become comfortable presenting to "
"colleagues and customers. To set up this goal, the goal is named `Public "
"Speaking Training`."
msgstr ""
"一間公司希望協助員工在向同事及客戶進行簡報時更感自在。為設定此目標，目標名稱"
"設為 `公開演說培訓`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:63
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Expected Skills` is `Public Speaking: L3`. This means that "
"when an employee is evaluated on the `Public Speaking` skill below the `L3` "
"level, they are recommended the `Public Speaking Training` goal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:67
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Usual Timing` is set to six months, meaning that it is "
"typical for an employee to take six months to achieve the goal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:70
msgid "Last, the tags `Soft Skills` and `Training` are assigned to the goal."
msgstr "最後，將 `軟技能` 及 `培訓` 標籤指派至該目標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:72
msgid "The goal template form, populated for a public speaking training goal."
msgstr "已填入公開演講培訓目標的目標範本表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:76
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:130
msgid "Description tab"
msgstr "描述分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enter any relevant information in this tab to provide information, context, "
"and assistance to the employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:81
msgid ""
"This text is visible to the employee, and may include steps to take, any "
"benefits from achieving the goal, and how they can achieve it. Use the "
":doc:`rich text editor <../../essentials/html_editor>` to customize the "
"information provided."
msgstr ""
"此文字對員工可見，可包含應採取的步驟、達成目標後的好處，以及達成方法。請使用 "
":doc:`富文字編輯器 <../../essentials/html_editor>` 自訂所提供的資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:86
msgid ""
"The `Public Speaking Training` goal populates the *Description* tab with a "
"short description of the goal, a checklist of the steps to complete, as well"
" as instructions for whom to contact to book a seat in the next workshop "
"session."
msgstr ""
"`公開演講培訓` 目標會在 *描述* 分頁中填入目標簡述、完成步驟清單，以及預約下一"
"場工作坊名額的聯絡指引。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:91
msgid "Sub-Goals tab"
msgstr "子目標分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:93
msgid ""
"Certain goals can only be achieved after completing related goals, referred "
"to as *sub-goals*. When this applies, the necessary sub-goals must be added "
"to the *Sub-Goals* tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:96
msgid ""
"To add a sub-goal, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and a *Create Sub Goal "
"Template* pop-up window loads. The form contains the same fields as the "
":ref:`goal template <appraisals/add-goals>`, except the :guilabel:`Parent "
"Goal Template` field. Fill out the pop-up window, then click :guilabel:`Save"
" & Close` if only one goal is needed, or :guilabel:`Save & New` to save the "
"goal and add another."
msgstr ""
"要新增子目標，請按一下 :guilabel:`新增資料行`，隨即會載入 *建立子目標範本* 彈"
"出視窗。表單包含與 :ref:`目標範本 <appraisals/add-goals>` 相同的欄位，但不包"
"括 :guilabel:`上層目標範本` 欄位。填妥彈出視窗後，若只需一個目標，請按一下 "
":guilabel:`儲存並關閉`；若要儲存目標並新增另一個目標，請按一下 :guilabel:`儲"
"存並新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:102
msgid ""
"The `Public Speaking Training` goal has three sub-goals configured: "
"`Presentation Skills Workshop`, `Present at a Team Meeting`, and `Present at"
" a Customer Event`. Each sub-goal has its own :guilabel:`Usual Timing`, and "
"is recommended for a different level of the `Public Speaking` skill."
msgstr ""
"`演講培訓` 目標已設定三個子目標：`簡報技巧工作坊`、`在團隊會議上發表簡報` 及 "
"`在客戶活動上發表簡報`。每個子目標都有自己的 :guilabel:`常規時間`，並建議用於"
"不同級別的 `公開演講` 技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:107
msgid "The various sub-goals for the public speaking training goal."
msgstr "公開演講培訓目標的各項子目標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:113
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "標籤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:115
msgid ""
"Adding tags to goals can help when viewing the goals report, to see how many"
" goals with specific tags are assigned to employees. They also can aid with "
"keeping various goals organized, and see which goals are related to one "
"another."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:119
msgid ""
"To view all the current tags, and add new ones, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Configuration --> Tags`. All tags appear "
"in a list view. No tags come preconfigured, so all tags must be added to the"
" database."
msgstr ""
"如要檢視所有現有標籤並新增標籤，請前往 :menuselection:`評估應用程式 --> 配"
"置 --> 標籤`。所有標籤均會顯示於清單檢視中。系統並無預先設定任何標籤，因此所"
"有標籤都必須加入資料庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:123
msgid ""
"To add a new tag, click the :guilabel:`New` button in the corner, and a new "
"line appears at the bottom of the list. Enter the tag name, then press "
"return or click away from the field. Click on a colored dot at the end of "
"the line to select a color for the tag."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:127
msgid "The list of tags and their colors."
msgstr "標籤及其顏色的清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:131
msgid "View employee goals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:133
msgid ""
"To view all goals assigned to employees, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Goals`. This presents all the goals for "
"every employee, in a default list view, grouped by :guilabel:`Employee`."
msgstr ""
"如要查看分配給員工的所有目標，請前往 :menuselection:`績效評估應用程式 --> 目"
"標`。此頁面會以預設清單檢視顯示每位員工的所有目標，並按 :guilabel:`員工` 分組"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:136
msgid ""
"Click on an employee to expand the listed goals. Each goal displays the "
"following information:"
msgstr "按一下員工以展開列出的目標。每個目標均會顯示以下資訊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Progress`: The percentage of progress the employee has achieved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:140
msgid ":guilabel:`Employee`: The employees assigned to the goal."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：獲指派此目標的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:141
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Deadline`: The time remaining until the goal should be achieved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`截止日期`：距離應達成目標的剩餘時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:143
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Progress` percentages all appear in gray until a goal has "
"been achieved. Once achieved, the :guilabel:`Progress` displays `100%` and "
"appears in green."
msgstr ""
"在目標達成前，所有 :guilabel:`進度` 百分比均會顯示為灰色。達成目標後"
"，:guilabel:`進度` 會顯示 `100%` 並轉為綠色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:146
msgid "Any goals whose :guilabel:`Deadline` has passed appear in red text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:149
msgid "Only employees with goals assigned to them appear in the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:150
msgid ""
"Goals that have sub-goals are not listed: only their sub-goals are. To view "
"the parent goal, open one of its sub-goals, then click the smart button "
"displaying the parent goal's name: a hierarchy view displays the parent goal"
" and its sub-goals."
msgstr ""
"系統不會列出設有子目標的目標，只會列出其子目標。如要檢視上層目標，請開啟其中"
"一個子目標，然後點擊顯示上層目標名稱的智能按鈕，系統便會以階層檢視顯示上層目"
"標及其子目標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:154
msgid "A list of goals for all employees."
msgstr "所有員工的目標清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:160
msgid "Assign goals to employees"
msgstr "為員工指派目標"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:162
msgid ""
"Once goals have been configured in the database, the next step is to assign "
"goals to employees. Configured goals can be :ref:`assigned to employees "
"<appraisals/goals/existing>`, and new goals can be :ref:`created and "
"assigned <appraisals/goals/new>`."
msgstr ""
"在資料庫中設定好目標後，下一步便是將目標指派給員工。已設定的目標可:ref:`指派"
"給員工 <appraisals/goals/existing>`，亦可:ref:`建立並指派 <appraisals/goals/"
"new>`新目標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:169
msgid "Assign existing goals"
msgstr "指派現有目標"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:171
msgid ""
"To assign goals to employees, first open the main *Goals* dashboard by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Goals`. Click the "
":guilabel:`Open Library` button and a *Goals Template Library* pop-up window"
" loads, displaying all the currently configured goal templates. Click the "
"checkbox next to each goal being assigned to employees."
msgstr ""
"如要向員工指派目標，請先前往:menuselection:`績效評估應用程式 --> 目標`以開啟"
"主要*目標*儀表板。點擊:guilabel:`開啟範本庫`按鈕後，系統會載入*目標範本庫*彈"
"出視窗，顯示所有現已配置的目標範本。勾選要指派給員工的每個目標旁邊的核取方塊"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:176
msgid ""
"The goals library where goals can be selected to assign to an employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:179
msgid ""
"Next, click the :guilabel:`Continue` button and a *Select Employees* pop-up "
"window loads. Click the checkbox next to each employee being assigned the "
"selected goals, then click the :guilabel:`Add Goals to Employees` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:183
msgid ""
"The pop-up window closes, and a goal is created for each selected employee, "
"along with its sub-goals. The deadline of each goal is set according to its "
":guilabel:`Usual Timing`, and the employee's manager is set as the goal's "
"manager. The goals now appear on the *Goals* dashboard."
msgstr ""
"彈出視窗會關閉，系統會為每位選定的員工建立目標及其子目標。每個目標的截止日期"
"會根據其:guilabel:`慣常時間`設定，並將該員工的管理員設為目標管理員。目標隨即"
"會顯示在 *目標* 儀表板上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:188
msgid ""
"Goals can also be assigned during an appraisal: in the *Skills* tab of the "
"appraisal, click the :guilabel:`Recommend Goals` link of a skill to open the"
" goal templates that help to reach a higher level for this skill. See "
":ref:`appraisals/skills`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:195
msgid "Assign new goals"
msgstr "指派新目標"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:197
msgid ""
"If a goal does not exist, it can be created and assigned to an employee from"
" the *Goals* dashboard. To create new goals, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Goals`, and click :guilabel:`New` in the "
"corner to open a blank goal form. Add the following information on the form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:201
msgid ""
"Goal name: Type in a brief name for the goal in the first field, such as "
"`Improve your English level`."
msgstr "目標名稱：在第一個欄位輸入簡短的目標名稱，例如 `改善英語水平`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:203
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: Select the employees being assigned the goal using the"
" drop-down menu. Once this field is populated, the employees' managers "
"populate the :guilabel:`Manager` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:205
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Progress`: Click the current percentage of competency for the "
"goal. The options are :guilabel:`0%`, :guilabel:`25%`, :guilabel:`50%`, "
":guilabel:`75%`, or :guilabel:`100%`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`進度`：點擊目標目前的能力百分比。選項包"
"括:guilabel:`0%`、:guilabel:`25%`、:guilabel:`50%`、:guilabel:`75%`或:guilabel:`100%`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:207
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manager`: Select the managers following the goal using the drop-"
"down menu, if not already selected."
msgstr ":guilabel:`管理人員`：如尚未選擇，請使用下拉式選單選擇跟進該目標的經理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Deadline`: Enter the due date for the goal using the calendar "
"selector."
msgstr ":guilabel:`截止日期`：使用日曆選擇器輸入目標的截止日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Add any relevant :ref:`tags <appraisals/add-tags>` to the "
"goal using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: Enter any details regarding the goal in this "
"section."
msgstr ":guilabel:`描述`：在此部分輸入與目標相關的任何詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:215
msgid ""
"Some goals can be broken down into steps, which may be input as a checklist."
" A checklist is a tool the employee may use to mark their progress."
msgstr ""
"部分目標可細分為多個步驟，並作為檢查清單輸入。檢查清單是員工可用來標記進度的"
"工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:218
msgid ""
"To reuse the goal for other employees, click the :guilabel:`Save as "
"Template` button. A copy of the goal, without the employees, is added to the"
" :ref:`goals library <appraisals/goals-library>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:221
msgid ""
"A goal created for an employee, with its progress, manager, deadline, and "
"tags."
msgstr "為員工建立的目標，包含其進度、主管、截止日期及標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:225
msgid "Update employee goals"
msgstr "更新員工目標"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:227
msgid ""
"Typically, goals are updated during an employee appraisal. To update goals, "
"click the :guilabel:`Goals` smart button on the appraisal form to view and "
"update the employee's goals. However, in some cases, it is necessary to "
"update goal progress *outside* of an appraisal. This could be from an "
"employee completing a course, receiving a certification, or documenting goal"
" progress or completion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:233
msgid ""
"To update a goal's progress percentage outside of an appraisal, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Goals`. Expand the employee whose goals "
"are being updated, and click on an individual goal to open the goal record."
msgstr ""
"如要在評估以外更新目標的進度百分比，請前往 :menuselection:`評估應用程式 --> "
"目標`。展開需要更新目標的員工，然後按一下個別目標以開啟目標記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:237
msgid ""
"Click the new :guilabel:`Progress` box to set the new progress level. It is "
"recommended to add notes in the :guilabel:`Description` section, as the "
"employee progresses with the goal. The notes should include dates the "
"progress changed, and any supporting information regarding the change. "
"Progress changes are also logged in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"點擊新的:guilabel:`進度`方格以設定新的進度級別。隨著員工推進目標，建議"
"在:guilabel:`描述`部分新增備註。備註應包含進度變更的日期及相關輔助資料。進度"
"變更亦會記錄在訊息記錄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:242
msgid ""
"The progress of a goal with sub-goals **cannot** be updated manually; the "
"progress is calculated by averaging all its sub-goals. For example, if one "
"of three sub-goals is done (`100%`), another one is at `50%`, and the last "
"one is at `0%`, the parent goal's :guilabel:`Progress` is `50%`. On a sub-"
"goal, the smart button displays how many of its sibling sub-goals are done."
msgstr ""
"包含子目標的目標 **無法** 手動更新進度；其進度是透過計算所有子目標的平均值而"
"得出。例如，三個子目標中，如果一個已完成（`100%`）、另一個為 `50%`，而最後一"
"個為 `0%`，則父目標的 :guilabel:`進度` 為 `50%`。在子目標上，智能按鈕會顯示已"
"完成多少個同層級子目標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:248
msgid "Completed employee goals"
msgstr "已完成的員工目標"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:250
msgid ""
"When a goal has been met, it is important to update the record. Navigate to "
":menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Goals`. Expand the employee whose goals "
"are being evaluated, and click on an individual goal to open the goal "
"record."
msgstr ""
"達成目標後，務必更新記錄。請前往 :menuselection:`評估應用程式 --> 目標`。展開"
"正在評估目標的員工項目，然後按一下個別目標以開啟該目標記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:254
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Mark as Done` button in the corner. A green "
":guilabel:`Done` banner appears in the upper corner of the goal form, and "
"the :guilabel:`Progress` changes to :guilabel:`100%`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:257
msgid ""
"A goal with sub-goals is automatically marked as done once all its sub-goals"
" are done."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:260
msgid ""
"On the *Goals* dashboard, completed goals are indicated with a green "
":guilabel:`100%` tag in the :guilabel:`Progress` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/goals.rst:263
msgid "A sub-goal form marked as done, with the parent goal smart button."
msgstr "標記為已完成的子目標表單，當中附有上層目標智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:3
msgid "Conduct appraisals"
msgstr "進行評核"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:5
msgid ""
"This guide explains the end-to-end appraisal workflow in Odoo, from creation"
" to final rating, showing how managers and employees collaborate at each "
"stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:8
msgid ""
":ref:`Employee self-assessment <appraisals/employee-feedback>`: The employee"
" completes the *Employee's Feedback* template. Responses remain hidden until"
" the employee shares them with the appraisers."
msgstr ""
":ref:`員工自我評估 <appraisals/employee-feedback>`：員工填寫 *員工意見回饋* "
"範本。在員工將回覆分享給評估人之前，回覆會保持隱藏狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:11
msgid ""
":ref:`Manager feedback <appraisals/manager-feedback>`: While the employee "
"works on their section, the manager reviews goals, gathers peer input if "
"needed, and fills out the *Manager's Feedback* template. Feedback can remain"
" hidden until the appraisal meeting."
msgstr ""
":ref:`主管意見 <appraisals/manager-feedback>`：當員工處理其部分時，主管會檢視"
"目標、在需要時收集同事意見，並填寫 *主管意見* 範本。在評估會議之前，意見可保"
"持隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:14
msgid ""
":ref:`Appraisal review <appraisals/review>`: Manager and employee meet to "
"discuss both feedback sections, update skills and goals, and agree on next "
"steps. The meeting can be scheduled directly from the appraisal or the "
"calendar."
msgstr ""
":ref:`考核檢討 <appraisals/review>`：經理與員工會面，討論雙方的意見回饋部分、"
"更新技能與目標，並商定後續步驟。會議可直接透過考核頁面或日曆安排。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:17
msgid ""
":ref:`Completion and rating <appraisals/complete>`: After the discussion, "
"the manager assigns a final rating, adds any private notes, and marks the "
"appraisal as done. The record then locks unless it is reopened for further "
"edits."
msgstr ""
":ref:`完成及評分 <appraisals/complete>`：討論結束後，經理會給予最終評分、加入"
"任何私人備註，並將評核標記為完成。除非重新開啟以作進一步編輯，否則該記錄將會"
"鎖定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:21
msgid ""
"Throughout the process, optional actions, such as requesting peer feedback "
"or logging private manager notes, enhance the appraisal's accuracy and "
"relevance."
msgstr ""
"在整個過程中，你可選擇執行額外操作（例如請求同事提供意見或記錄經理私人備註）"
"，以提升績效評估的準確性及相關性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:27
msgid "Employee self-assessment"
msgstr "員工自我評估"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:29
msgid ""
"Once an appraisal is confirmed (a status of :guilabel:`Ongoing`), the "
"employee is required to fill out the self-assessment."
msgstr "評核一經確認（狀態為 :guilabel:`進行中`），員工便須填寫自我評估。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:33
msgid ""
"Only confirmed appraisals can be worked on. If an appraisal is still in "
":guilabel:`Draft`, feedback cannot be recorded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:36
msgid ""
"After the employee is notified that an appraisal is confirmed and scheduled,"
" they are requested to fill out their half of the appraisal template. A blue"
" banner at the top of the appraisal reminds them to fill out their feedback "
"before the :guilabel:`Appraisal Date`, then share it with the appraisers."
msgstr ""
"員工獲通知評核已確認並安排後，便須填寫評核範本中屬於自己的一半內容。評核表頂"
"部的藍色橫幅會提醒員工於 :guilabel:`評核日期` 前填寫意見，然後與評核人分享。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:41
msgid ""
"Employees can click on the link in the confirmation email to navigate to the"
" appraisal, or they can open their appraisal in the **Appraisals** app. To "
"do this, open the **Appraisals** app, then click on the appraisal card."
msgstr ""
"員工可點擊確認電郵中的連結前往評估頁面，或在 **員工評估** 應用程式中開啟其評"
"估。要執行此操作，請開啟 **員工評估** 應用程式，然後點擊評估卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:45
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Employee's Feedback` half of the default template includes "
"the following sections: :guilabel:`My work`, :guilabel:`My future`, and "
":guilabel:`My feelings`. Each of these sections consists of several "
"questions for the employee to answer, allowing the employee to perform a "
"self-assessment, and provide feedback on how they feel about the company and"
" their role."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:51
msgid "Complete the self-assessment"
msgstr "完成自我評估"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:53
msgid ""
"The employee feedback remains hidden from management while the employee is "
"performing their self-assessment: appraisers only see a blurred section with"
" the message :guilabel:`Self Assessment will show here once published`. Once"
" the employee has completed their half of the appraisal, they click the "
"toggle between :guilabel:`Private` and :guilabel:`Shared to Appraisers`. "
":guilabel:`Shared to Appraisers` turns green, and their responses are then "
"visible to the appraisers."
msgstr ""
"員工進行自我評估期間，其意見會對管理層隱藏：評核人只會看見一個模糊處理的部分"
"，並顯示「:guilabel:`自我評估發佈後將顯示於此`」訊息。員工完成其負責的評估部"
"分後，只要點按:guilabel:`私人`與:guilabel:`已分享予評核人`之間的切換掣"
"，:guilabel:`已分享予評核人`便會變成綠色，其回覆隨即會對評核人顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:61
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`expand_content` :guilabel:`(Expand Employee's Feedback)` "
"icon next to the section title to fill it out in a larger pop-up window. The"
" same icon is available next to the :guilabel:`Manager's Feedback`."
msgstr ""
"點擊區域標題旁邊的 :icon:`expand_content` :guilabel:`（展開員工意見回饋）` 圖"
"示，即可在較大的彈出視窗中填寫。該圖示亦可在 :guilabel:`經理意見回饋` 旁邊找"
"到。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:68
msgid "Manager feedback"
msgstr "經理意見回饋"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:70
msgid ""
"While the employee is completing their :guilabel:`Employee's Feedback` "
"section, the manager fills out the :guilabel:`Manager's Feedback` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:74
msgid ""
"Multiple appraisers can be selected in the :guilabel:`Appraisers` field in "
"the top half of the appraisal form. Anyone added as an appraiser is able to "
"review the appraisal and populate the :guilabel:`Manager's Feedback` "
"section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:78
msgid ""
"Typically, managers conduct appraisals with their employees, one on one. "
"Some cases may require more than one appraiser, such as an annual review for"
" an upper management position, or for an employee being promoted."
msgstr ""
"一般而言，經理會與員工進行一對一的績效評估。在某些情況下，可能需要多於一位評"
"估人，例如高層管理職位的年度評估，或員工獲晉升時的評估。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:82
msgid ""
"Before the manager fills out their portion of the appraisal, managers "
"typically ask for :ref:`additional feedback <appraisals/ask-feedback>` from "
"the employee's coworkers, to better understand all the achievements and "
"challenges for the employee."
msgstr ""
"在經理填寫其負責的評核部分之前，通常會向該僱員的同事徵詢 :ref:`額外意見 "
"<appraisals/ask-feedback>`，以更全面了解該僱員的所有成就及面臨的挑戰。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:86
msgid ""
"Once the manager has all the information they need to evaluate the employee,"
" they fill out the :guilabel:`Manager's Feedback` section of the appraisal "
"form. The manager's half has the following sections: :guilabel:`Feedback`, "
":guilabel:`Evaluation`, and :guilabel:`Improvements`."
msgstr ""
"經理取得評估員工所需的所有資訊後，便會填寫評估表中的 :guilabel:`經理意見` 部"
"分。經理填寫的部分包含以下章節：:guilabel:`意見回饋`、:guilabel:`評估` 及 "
":guilabel:`改進建議`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:90
msgid ""
"The manager's appraisal focuses on the employee's accomplishments, as well "
"as identifying areas of improvements, with actionable steps to help the "
"employee achieve their goals in both the long and short term."
msgstr ""
"主管的績效評估著重於員工的成就，同時找出可改進之處，並制定切實可行的步驟，協"
"助員工實現長遠及短期目標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:94
msgid ""
"When the feedback section is completed, the manager clicks the toggle "
"between :guilabel:`Private` and :guilabel:`Shared to Employee`. "
":guilabel:`Shared to Employee` turns green, and their responses are then "
"visible to the employee."
msgstr ""
"填寫完意見回饋部分後，管理人員可點擊 :guilabel:`私人` 與 :guilabel:`已分享給"
"員工` 之間的切換開關。:guilabel:`已分享給員工` 會變為綠色，員工隨即可查看管理"
"人員的回覆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:99
msgid ""
"Some managers prefer to keep their feedback hidden from the employee until "
"they :ref:`meet with the employee <appraisals/review>` to discuss the "
"appraisal."
msgstr ""
"部分經理傾向將自己的意見向員工隱藏，直到他們:ref:`與員工會面 <appraisals/"
"review>`討論績效評估為止。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:105
msgid "Ask for feedback"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:107
msgid ""
"As part of the appraisal process, the manager can :ref:`request feedback for"
" an employee <appraisals/360-request-feedback>`  from anyone in the company "
"about an employee. In Odoo, this is referred to as *360 Feedback*."
msgstr ""
"在評估流程中，主管可就某位員工向公司內任何人士 :ref:`請求員工意見回饋 "
"<appraisals/360-request-feedback>`。在 Odoo 中，這稱為 *360 度意見回饋*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:111
msgid ""
"Feedback is requested from coworkers and anyone else who works with the "
"employee. This is to get a more well-rounded view of the employee, and aid "
"in the manager's overall assessment."
msgstr ""
"系統會向同事及其他與該員工共事的人員徵詢意見回饋，以便更全面地了解員工的表現"
"，並協助經理進行整體評核。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:115
msgid ""
"To request feedback, the *360 Feedback* setting must be enabled, and the "
"appraisal **must** be confirmed. Once confirmed, an :guilabel:`Ask Feedback`"
" button appears in the corner of the form."
msgstr ""
"若要請求意見回饋，必須啟用 *360 度意見回饋* 設定，且績效評估 **必須** 已確認"
"。確認後，表單角落會出現:guilabel:`請求意見回饋`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:121
msgid "Appraisal review"
msgstr "績效評估審閱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:123
msgid ""
"Once both portions of an appraisal are completed (the :ref:`employee "
"<appraisals/employee-feedback>` and :ref:`manager <appraisals/manager-"
"feedback>` feedback sections), it is time for the employee and manager to "
":ref:`meet and discuss the appraisal <appraisals/schedule>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:127
msgid ""
"During the appraisal meeting, the manager reviews both the :ref:`Employee's "
"Feedback <appraisals/employee-feedback>` section as well as their own "
":ref:`Manager feedback <appraisals/manager-feedback>`."
msgstr ""
"在評核會議期間，經理會同時審閱 :ref:`員工意見回饋 <appraisals/employee-"
"feedback>` 部分，以及他們自己的 :ref:`經理意見回饋 <appraisals/manager-"
"feedback>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:131
msgid ""
"Additionally, the employee's :ref:`skills <appraisals/skills>` and "
":doc:`goals <goals>` are reviewed at this time, and updated as needed."
msgstr ""
"此外，此時亦會檢視員工的:ref:`技能 <appraisals/skills>`及:doc:`目標 <goals>"
"`，並按需要進行更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:137
msgid "Schedule appraisal review"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:139
msgid "Meetings to review appraisals are scheduled from the appraisal itself."
msgstr "評估檢討會議可直接於評估中安排。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:141
msgid ""
"To schedule an appraisal meeting, navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals app"
" --> Appraisals`, and click on the desired Kanban card."
msgstr ""
"如要安排績效評估會議，請前往 :menuselection:`績效評估應用程式 --> 績效評估`，"
"然後點擊所需的看板卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:144
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Schedule Meeting` button and the *Meetings* calendar "
"loads on the :guilabel:`Appraisal Date`. Click on the desired time slot on "
"the calendar and a *New Event* pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:148
msgid ""
"The meeting title is populated with `Appraisal of (Employee Name)`, and the "
"meeting is linked to the appraisal. The employee, the appraisers, and the "
"current user are added as attendees by default. Add anyone else who should "
"be in the meeting, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"會議標題會自動填入 `（員工姓名）的評估`，而會議亦會連結至該評估。系統預設會將"
"該員工、評核人員及現時使用者加入為出席者。如有需要，可自行加入其他應出席會議"
"的人士。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:152
msgid ""
"Adjust the date and time, and add a :guilabel:`Room or Location`, such as "
"`Main Conference Room`, or click :icon:`add` :guilabel:`Video conference` "
"for an online meeting, if desired. Any notes or additional information can "
"be added in the :icon:`sticky_note_2` :guilabel:`(Notes)` field."
msgstr ""
"調整日期及時間，並加入 :guilabel:`房間或地點`（例如 `主會議室`）；如有需要，"
"亦可點擊 :icon:`add` :guilabel:`視像會議` 進行網上會議。任何備註或額外資訊均"
"可於 :icon:`sticky_note_2` :guilabel:`(備註)` 欄位中加入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:156
msgid ""
"Once all the desired changes are complete, save the meeting. It now appears "
"on the calendar, and the attendees are invited by email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:160
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button in the upper corner to schedule an "
"appraisal meeting using the full-screen meeting form with additional "
"options."
msgstr ""
"按一下上方角落的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，使用包含更多選項的全螢幕會議表單安排"
"評核會議。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:163
msgid ""
"The New Event pop-up window for an appraisal meeting, with the employee and the manager as\n"
"attendees."
msgstr ""
"評核會議的「新活動」彈出視窗，當中的出席者為員工及\n"
"經理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:168
msgid ":doc:`../../productivity/calendar`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../productivity/calendar`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:173
msgid "Review employee skills"
msgstr "檢視員工技能"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:175
msgid ""
"Part of an appraisal is evaluating an employee's skills and tracking their "
"progress over time. Once an appraisal is confirmed, the *Skills* tab of the "
"appraisal form auto-populates with the skills from the :ref:`employee form "
"<employees/skills>`. Additionally, if the :guilabel:`Target Job` field is "
"populated, the corresponding skills also appear in the *Skills* tab, and the"
" progress expected for the job appears in the :guilabel:`Job Target` column."
" Any skill that meets the :guilabel:`Target Job` requirements is green, and "
"skills that fall short are red."
msgstr ""
"績效評估的其中一部分是評核員工的技能並持續追蹤其進度。確認評估後，評估表單"
"的*技能*分頁會自動填入來自:ref:`員工表單 <employees/skills>`的技能。此外，若"
"已填寫:guilabel:`目標職位`欄位，相應的技能亦會顯示在*技能*分頁中，而該職位預"
"期的進度則會顯示在:guilabel:`職位目標`欄。凡符合:guilabel:`目標職位`要求的技"
"能均會顯示為綠色，未達標的技能則會顯示為紅色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:182
msgid ""
"Each skill is grouped with like skills, and the following information is "
"displayed for each skill:"
msgstr "每項技能會與同類技能歸為一組，每項技能均會顯示以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:184
msgid ":guilabel:`Skill Level`: The employee's current level for the skill."
msgstr ":guilabel:`技能等級`：員工目前在此技能的等級。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:185
msgid ":guilabel:`Current`: The progress corresponding to the skill level."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:186
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Target`: The skill level expected for the selected "
":guilabel:`Target Job`, if any."
msgstr ":guilabel:`職位目標`：所選:guilabel:`目標職位`的預期技能等級（如有）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:187
msgid ":guilabel:`Justification`: Notes explaining the change in skill level."
msgstr ":guilabel:`理由說明`：解釋技能等級變更的備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:188
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Current Goals`: The completion of the employee's :doc:`goals "
"<goals>` linked to this skill. When goal templates of the library can help "
"the employee reach a higher level, a :guilabel:`Recommend Goals` link "
"appears. Click it to open the matching goal templates, and assign them to "
"the employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`目前目標`：與此技能關聯的員工 :doc:`目標 <goals>` 完成情況。當目標"
"庫中的目標範本可協助員工達到更高水平時，畫面上會顯示 :guilabel:`推薦目標` 連"
"結。點擊該連結即可開啟相符的目標範本，並將其指派給員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:193
msgid ""
"If a :guilabel:`Skill Level` has changed since the last appraisal, the level"
" must be updated."
msgstr "如果自上次評估以來:guilabel:`技能等級`有所變更，必須更新該等級。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:196
msgid ""
"The *Skills* tab does **not** appear on the appraisal until the appraisal is"
" confirmed. While the appraisal is ongoing, it is only visible to the "
"appraisers, not to the employee being evaluated."
msgstr ""
"*技能* 分頁在評估獲得確認前，**不會** 顯示於評估中。在評估進行期間，該分頁僅"
"對評估人顯示，受評員工並不可見。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:199
msgid ""
"The Skills tab of an appraisal, with job targets and goal recommendations."
msgstr "績效評估中的「技能」分頁，顯示職位目標及目標建議。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:203
msgid "Update skills"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:205
msgid ""
"If a skill level changes, the skill should be updated to reflect the current"
" level. To update a skill, click its :guilabel:`Skill Level`, revealing a "
"drop-down menu of all available levels. Click on the new level for the "
"skill. Once selected, the :guilabel:`Current` field updates accordingly. "
"Next, click into the :guilabel:`Justification` field for the skill, and "
"enter any relevant details explaining the change, such as `Took a fluency "
"language test` or `Received Javascript certification`."
msgstr ""
"如果技能等級有所變更，應更新該技能以反映目前等級。要更新技能，請點擊"
"其:guilabel:`技能等級`，系統會顯示所有可用等級的下拉式選單。點擊該技能的新等"
"級。選取後，:guilabel:`目前`欄位會隨即更新。接著，點擊該技能的:guilabel:`說"
"明`欄位，並輸入任何解釋變更的相關詳情，例如 `通過語言流利度測試` 或 `獲得 "
"Javascript 認證`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:212
msgid ""
"To :ref:`add new skills <employees/skills>`, click the :guilabel:`Add new "
"skills` button at the bottom of the skills list, and an *Update Skills* tab "
"loads. Select the :guilabel:`Category`, :guilabel:`Skill`, and "
":guilabel:`Skill Level` for the new skill, and click :guilabel:`Save & "
"Close` to add one skill, or click :guilabel:`Save & New` to add more skills."
msgstr ""
"如要 :ref:`新增技能 <employees/skills>`，請按一下技能清單底部的 :guilabel:`新"
"增技能` 按鈕，系統便會載入 *更新技能* 分頁。為新技能選擇 :guilabel:`類"
"別`、:guilabel:`技能` 及 :guilabel:`技能等級`，然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存及關"
"閉` 以新增一項技能，或按一下 :guilabel:`儲存及新增` 以新增更多技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:218
msgid ""
"When adding a skill to a category the employee already has a skill for, "
"click the :guilabel:`Add` button at the end of the category line, and a "
"blank line appears at the bottom of the category. Configure the fields to "
"add the skill."
msgstr ""
"當要為員工已有技能的類別新增技能時，請點擊該類別行末端的 :guilabel:`新增` 按"
"鈕，類別底部隨即會出現一個空白行。設定相關欄位即可新增該技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:222
msgid ""
"Skill changes made in the appraisal are applied to the employee form when "
"the appraisal is marked as done, and are logged in the appraisal's chatter. "
"The next time an appraisal is confirmed, the updated skills populate the "
"*Skills* tab."
msgstr ""
"當評估標記為完成時，在評估中所作的技能變更會套用至員工表單，並記錄於評估的對"
"話串中。下次確認評估時，已更新的技能會填入 *技能* 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:229
msgid "Complete an appraisal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:231
msgid ""
"After the appraisal has been filled out by both the employee and the "
"manager, and both parties have met and discussed the employee's performance,"
" the manager then :ref:`logs any notes <appraisals/notes>`, and "
":ref:`assigns a rating <appraisals/rate>`."
msgstr ""
"當員工與經理雙方均填妥評估，並已會面討論員工表現後，經理便可 :ref:`記錄備註 "
"<appraisals/notes>`，並 :ref:`給予評分 <appraisals/rate>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:235
msgid ""
"When completed, click the :guilabel:`Mark as Done` button in the corner of "
"the appraisal form."
msgstr "完成後，點擊評核表單角落的 :guilabel:`標記為完成` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:237
msgid ""
"Once the appraisal is marked as *Done*, the status changes from "
":guilabel:`Ongoing` to :guilabel:`Done`, and the :guilabel:`Mark as Done` "
"button changes to a :guilabel:`Reopen` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:241
msgid ""
"When an appraisal is marked as done, it is locked and modifications are not "
"possible. To make any changes to an appraisal with a status of "
":guilabel:`Done`, click the :guilabel:`Reopen` button, then make any needed "
"modifications. Once all modifications are complete, click the "
":guilabel:`Mark as Done` button again."
msgstr ""
"當評估標記為完成後，系統會將其鎖定，無法再進行修改。如需更改狀態為 "
":guilabel:`已完成` 的評估，請按一下 :guilabel:`重新開啟` 按鈕，然後進行所需的"
"修改。完成所有修改後，再次按一下 :guilabel:`標記為完成` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:247
msgid ""
"To start an ongoing appraisal over, click the :guilabel:`Reset` button. "
"After confirmation, the appraisal returns to :guilabel:`Draft`, the "
":guilabel:`Final Rating` is cleared, and all manually entered content in the"
" *Employee's Feedback* and *Manager's Feedback* sections is erased."
msgstr ""
"如要重新開始進行中的績效評估，請點擊 :guilabel:`重設` 按鈕。確認後，評估會退"
"回至 :guilabel:`草稿` 狀態，:guilabel:`最終評級` 會被清除，而 *員工意見回饋* "
"及 *經理意見回饋* 部分中所有手動輸入的內容亦會被刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:255
msgid "Add a private note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:257
msgid ""
"Managers can log notes on an appraisal that are **only** visible to other "
"managers. Enter any notes in the *Private Note* tab. This can be done "
"anytime during the appraisal process."
msgstr ""
"經理可以在績效評估中記錄**僅**供其他經理檢視的備註。請在*私人備註*分頁中輸入"
"任何備註，並可在評估過程中的任何時間進行此操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:260
msgid ""
"The employee being evaluated does **not** have access to this tab, and the "
"tab does **not** appear on their appraisal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:263
msgid "The tab is optional and does not affect the final rating."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:268
msgid "Provide a final rating"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:270
msgid ""
"After both the manager and employee have met to discuss the employee's "
"performance, the appraisal must be given a :guilabel:`Final Rating`."
msgstr "經理與員工會面並討論員工的工作表現後，必須為評估給予 :guilabel:`最終評級`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:273
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select the rating for the employee. The default "
"options are: :guilabel:`Needs improvement`, :guilabel:`Meets expectations`, "
":guilabel:`Exceeds expectations`, and :guilabel:`Strongly Exceed "
"Expectations`. The :guilabel:`Final Rating` is never visible to the "
"employee."
msgstr ""
"使用下拉式選單為員工選擇評級。預設選項包括：:guilabel:`有待改"
"進`、:guilabel:`符合預期`、:guilabel:`超越預期`及:guilabel:`遠超預"
"期`。:guilabel:`最終評級` 永不向員工顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:278
msgid ""
"To add a new rating, navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals app --> "
"Configuration --> Evaluation Scale`. The ratings of the current company are "
"presented in a list view. To add a new rating, click the :guilabel:`New` "
"button in the corner, and a blank line appears at the bottom of the list. "
"Enter the new rating, then press the enter key, or click away from the line."
" Add as many new ratings as needed. Drag and drop the lines using the "
":icon:`drag_indicator` :guilabel:`(drag handle)` icon to reorder the "
"ratings."
msgstr ""
"如要新增評分，請前往 :menuselection:`評估應用程式 --> 配置 --> 評估等級`。畫"
"面會以列表視圖顯示目前公司的評分。如要新增評分，請點按角落的 :guilabel:`新"
"增` 按鈕，列表底部隨即會出現空白行。輸入新評分，然後按 Enter 鍵，或在該行以外"
"的位置點按。按需要新增多個評分。使用 :icon:`drag_indicator` :guilabel:`（拖曳"
"圖示）` 圖示拖放各行，以重新排序評分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:285
msgid ""
"Click :menuselection:`Appraisals` in the top menu to return to the "
":guilabel:`Appraisals` dashboard, click on the appraisal, then select the "
"desired :guilabel:`Final Rating`."
msgstr ""
"點擊頂部選單中的 :menuselection:`績效評估`，返回 :guilabel:`績效評估` 儀表板"
"，點擊該評估項目，然後選擇所需的 :guilabel:`最終評級`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:289
msgid ":doc:`../appraisals/goals`"
msgstr ":doc:`../appraisals/goals`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:290
msgid ":doc:`../appraisals/appraisal_analysis`"
msgstr ":doc:`../appraisals/appraisal_analysis`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/new_appraisals.rst:291
msgid ":doc:`../appraisals/skills_evolution`"
msgstr ":doc:`../appraisals/skills_evolution`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:3
msgid "Schedule appraisals"
msgstr "安排績效評估"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Appraisals** app helps managers run recurring performance reviews. "
"Each review can include a self-assessment and can follow any schedule the "
"company sets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:8
msgid ""
"Regular appraisals turn day-to-day work into clear goals and measurable "
"skill targets. They also supply the objective evidence HR needs for raises "
"or promotions, and keep individual performance aligned with company KPIs."
msgstr ""
"定期考核能將日常工作轉化為清晰目標及可量化的技能指標，同時為人力資源部提供加"
"薪或晉升所需的客觀依據，並確保個人表現與公司關鍵績效指標（KPI）保持一致。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:12
msgid ""
"Reviews can be :ref:`scheduled automatically <appraisals/auto>` through an "
":ref:`appraisal plan <appraisals/appraisal-plan>` that triggers evaluations "
"at set intervals, :ref:`launched for a group of employees "
"<appraisals/campaign>` with an appraisal campaign, or :ref:`created manually"
" <appraisals/manual>` whenever needed, such as before a promotion or "
"department transfer."
msgstr ""
"考核可透過 :ref:`自動排程 <appraisals/auto>` 方式進行，即利用在固定時間間隔觸"
"發評估的 :ref:`考核計劃 <appraisals/appraisal-plan>`；亦可透過考核活動 "
":ref:`為一組員工啟動 <appraisals/campaign>`，或在有需要時（例如晉升或調職前"
"） :ref:`手動建立 <appraisals/manual>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:17
msgid "An appraisal goes through three statuses:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:19
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Draft`: The appraisal is created, but not yet started. The "
"employee and appraisers cannot record feedback yet."
msgstr ":guilabel:`草稿`：考評已建立，但尚未開始。員工及考評人暫時未能記錄意見回饋。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:21
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ongoing`: The appraisal is confirmed. The employee and appraisers"
" fill out their feedback, and the appraisal card displays a green "
":guilabel:`Confirmed` ribbon."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`進行中`：評估已確認。員工與評估人填寫意見回饋，而評估卡片會顯示綠"
"色的 :guilabel:`已確認` 橫幅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Done`: The appraisal is completed and locked. The appraisal card "
"displays a purple :guilabel:`Done` ribbon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:29
msgid "Automatic scheduling"
msgstr "自動排程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:31
msgid ""
"To ensure no appraisal is missed, enable automatic scheduling by going to "
":menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"為確保不會遺漏任何評核，請前往 :menuselection:`評核應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設"
"定` 啟用自動排程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:34
msgid ""
"The *Appraisals Plans* section determines the frequency with which "
"appraisals are scheduled. These settings are company-specific."
msgstr "*評估計劃* 部分決定了安排員工評估的頻率。這些設定視乎個別公司而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:37
msgid ""
"The Appraisals Plans section of the settings, with the default timeline and 360 Feedback\n"
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"設定中的「評核計劃」部分，已啟用預設時間軸及 360 度\n"
"意見回饋。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:44
msgid "Appraisals plans"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:46
msgid ""
"By default, the first appraisal is planned six months after the employee's "
"contract start date, the second one six months after that, and then one "
"appraisal every twelve months."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:49
msgid ""
"To modify this schedule, change the number of months in the fields of the "
":guilabel:`Appraisals Plans` setting (:guilabel:`(#) months after "
"recruitment`, :guilabel:`then after (#) months`, :guilabel:`then every (#) "
"months.`), then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"若要修改此時間表，請在 :guilabel:`評估計劃` 設定的欄位中更改月數"
"（:guilabel:`入職後 (#) 個月`、:guilabel:`然後在 (#) 個月後`、:guilabel:`然後"
"每 (#) 個月一次。`），然後點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:54
msgid ""
"Changing the :guilabel:`Appraisals Plans` field updates every employee "
"record whose :guilabel:`Next Appraisal Date` is empty."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:60
msgid "Appraisals automation"
msgstr "評核自動化"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:62
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Appraisals Automation` option to have Odoo "
"automatically create *and* confirm appraisals when an employee's "
":guilabel:`Next Appraisal Date` is reached."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`評估自動化` 選項後，當到達員工的 :guilabel:`下次評估日期` 時"
"，Odoo 會自動建立 *並* 確認評估。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:65
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Appraisals Automation` option is enabled, Odoo uses the "
"configured :guilabel:`Appraisals Plans` to compute the :guilabel:`Next "
"Appraisal Date` displayed in the :ref:`Work tab <employees/work-info-tab>` "
"of the employee form, for every employee who does not have an ongoing "
"appraisal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:70
msgid ""
"When enabled, Odoo automatically creates an appraisal using the employee's "
"manager as the appraiser, its :guilabel:`Appraisal Date` is set eight days "
"after the :guilabel:`Next Appraisal Date`, and the manager receives a "
"scheduled activity to fill out the appraisal."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，Odoo 會自動建立評核，並以員工的經理作為評核人；其 :guilabel:`評核日"
"期` 會設定為 :guilabel:`下次評核日期` 後的第八天，而經理亦會收到填寫評核的已"
"安排活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:74
msgid ""
"This option is enabled by default. If this option is disabled, appraisals "
"are not created automatically, and must be :ref:`launched in a campaign "
"<appraisals/campaign>` or :ref:`created manually <appraisals/manual>`."
msgstr ""
"此選項預設為啟用。如停用此選項，系統不會自動建立績效評估，而必須:ref:`透過活"
"動啟動 <appraisals/campaign>`或:ref:`手動建立 <appraisals/manual>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:81
msgid "Launch an appraisal campaign"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:83
msgid ""
"An *appraisal campaign* creates appraisals for several employees at once, "
"such as for a yearly review cycle. To launch a campaign, open the "
"**Appraisals** app, click the :guilabel:`Launch Campaign` button on the main"
" *Appraisals* dashboard, and an *Appraisal Campaign* pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""
"*評核活動*可一次為多位員工建立評核，例如用於年度績效檢討週期。要啟動活動，請"
"開啟**評核**應用程式，在*評核*主儀表板上點擊:guilabel:`啟動活動`按鈕，系統便"
"會載入*評核活動*彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:88
msgid ""
"Fill out the following fields in the pop-up window. All fields are required."
msgstr "請在彈出視窗中填寫以下欄位。所有欄位均為必填。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employees`: Select the employees to evaluate. Leave this field "
"empty to create an appraisal for **all** employees of the company. Managers "
"who are not appraisal officers can only select the employees they manage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`員工`：選擇要評估的員工。如果將此欄位留空，系統會為公司 **所有** "
"員工建立績效評估。非評估負責人的經理只能選擇自己管理的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manager`: Select who conducts the appraisals. This field is only "
"visible to Appraisals administrators: for other users, the appraisals are "
"conducted by the employee's manager."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`經理`：選擇負責進行評估的人員。此欄位僅對評估管理員可見；對於其他"
"用戶，評估將由員工的經理負責進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee's Manager`: Each appraisal is conducted by the "
"employee's direct manager set on their employee form."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工的經理`：每次考核均由員工表單上所設定的直屬經理進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other`: All appraisals are conducted by the employees selected in"
" the :guilabel:`Others` field that appears beneath."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`其他`：所有評估均由下方出現的 :guilabel:`其他` 欄位中所選取的員工"
"進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Appraisal Template`: Select the :doc:`appraisal template "
"<appraisal_templates>` to use for all appraisals of the campaign."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`評核範本`：選擇用於此活動所有評核的:doc:`評核範本 "
"<appraisal_templates>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:103
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Appraisal Date`: The date by which the appraisals should be "
"completed. By default, this is one month from the current date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:106
msgid ""
"If some employees cannot be included, a warning appears at the bottom of the"
" pop-up window, for example when an employee does not have a manager, or "
"already has an appraisal on the same date with the same appraisers. In the "
"latter case, the existing appraisal is used instead of creating a new one."
msgstr ""
"若部分員工無法納入，彈出視窗底部會顯示警告，例如員工沒有直屬經理，或在相同日"
"期已有由相同評核人負責的績效評估。若屬於後者，系統會使用現有的績效評估，而不"
"會建立新的評估。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:111
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Schedule` to create the appraisals. The page reloads to "
"display only the appraisals created for the campaign, in a default Kanban "
"view. All appraisals have a status of :guilabel:`Ongoing` so the employees "
"and appraisers can start filling them out immediately."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`安排` 以建立評估。頁面會重新載入，並以預設看板檢視模式僅顯示"
"為該活動建立的評估。所有評估的狀態均為 :guilabel:`進行中`，讓員工及評估人可立"
"即開始填寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:115
msgid ""
"The Appraisal Campaign pop-up window, configured for three employees with the Yearly\n"
"meeting template."
msgstr ""
"評估活動彈出視窗，已為三名員工設定年度\n"
"會議範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:122
msgid "Manually schedule an appraisal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:124
msgid ""
"Managers can schedule an appraisal at any time, outside the regular cycle."
msgstr "經理可隨時在常規週期以外安排績效評估。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:126
msgid ""
"For example, if an employee is promoted, or transfers to a new role or a new"
" department, an appraisal is scheduled to assess performance in the current "
"role."
msgstr ""
"例如，若員工獲得晉升，或調任至新職位或新部門，系統便會安排績效評估，以評核員"
"工在現有職位的表現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:129
msgid ""
"To create a new appraisal, open the :menuselection:`Appraisals` app, and "
"click the :guilabel:`New` button in the corner. This opens a blank appraisal"
" form."
msgstr ""
"如要建立新的績效評估，請開啟 :menuselection:`績效評估` 應用程式，然後點擊角落"
"的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕。這會開啟空白的評估表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:132
msgid ""
"First, select the employee being evaluated in the :guilabel:`Employee to "
"review` field using the drop-down menu. Once an employee is selected, their "
"manager populates the :guilabel:`Appraisers` field. The :guilabel:`Job` and "
":guilabel:`Department` fields (and the :guilabel:`Company` field, in a "
"multi-company database) are populated according to the information on the "
"employee record."
msgstr ""
"首先，使用下拉選單在 :guilabel:`待評估員工` 欄位選擇要評估的員工。選定員工後"
"，其經理會自動填入 :guilabel:`評估人員` 欄位。系統亦會根據員工記錄中的資料，"
"自動填入 :guilabel:`職位` 及 :guilabel:`部門` 欄位（在多公司資料庫中，還包括 "
":guilabel:`公司` 欄位）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:138
msgid ""
"If another appraisal with the same employee and appraisers is already "
"ongoing, a warning appears at the top of the form."
msgstr "如果同一位員工和評估人已有另一項評估正在進行中，表單頂部便會顯示警告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:141
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Appraisal Date` is when the appraisal is scheduled to be "
"completed. The default deadline is one month from the current date, but can "
"be adjusted using the calendar selector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:144
msgid ""
"Last, select the desired :guilabel:`Template`. The first available "
":doc:`appraisal template <appraisal_templates>` populates this field by "
"default. Using the drop-down menu, select a different template if desired. "
"This field is **only** visible while the appraisal's status is "
":guilabel:`Draft`."
msgstr ""
"最後，選擇所需的:guilabel:`範本`。此欄位預設會填入第一個可用的:doc:`評核範本 "
"<appraisal_templates>`。如有需要，可使用下拉式選單選擇其他範本。此欄"
"位**僅**在評核狀態為:guilabel:`草稿`時顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:150
msgid ""
"Only universal templates (templates not restricted to a specific department)"
" or templates specific to the employee's department are available."
msgstr "只有通用範本（不限於特定部門的範本）或員工所屬部門的專屬範本可供使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:153
msgid "A new appraisal form with the top half filled out."
msgstr "已填妥上半部分的新評核表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:156
msgid ""
"Once the information in the top half of the appraisal form is complete, "
"click the :guilabel:`Confirm` button in the corner. The status changes to "
":guilabel:`Ongoing`, and both the employee and appraisers can start to fill "
"out the appraisal."
msgstr ""
"填妥評估表上半部的資訊後，按一下角落的 :guilabel:`確認` 按鈕。狀態會變更為 "
":guilabel:`進行中`，員工及評估人員即可開始填寫評估。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:160
msgid ""
"Two additional fields appear once the appraisal is confirmed: a "
":guilabel:`Final Rating` and a :guilabel:`Target Job` field. The "
":guilabel:`Target Job` allows the manager to select a job position the "
"employee may be working towards. When a job position is selected in this "
"field, any required skills for the job appear in the *Skills* tab. This aids"
" in seeing where the employee stands in regards to the job requirements "
":doc:`during the appraisal <new_appraisals>`. The :guilabel:`Final Rating` "
"field is populated when the appraisal is :ref:`completed <appraisals/rate>`."
msgstr ""
"確認評估後，系統會顯示兩個額外欄位：:guilabel:`最終評分` 欄位及 :guilabel:`目"
"標職位` 欄位。經理可使用 :guilabel:`目標職位` 欄位選擇員工正在爭取的職位。在"
"此欄位選擇職位後，該職位所需的任何技能都會顯示在 *技能* 分頁中，這有助 "
":doc:`在評估期間 <new_appraisals>` 了解員工與職位要求之間的差距"
"。:guilabel:`最終評分` 欄位會在評估 :ref:`完成 <appraisals/rate>` 後自動填寫"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:167
msgid ""
"Once the appraisal is marked as done with a :guilabel:`Final Rating`, a "
":guilabel:`Next Appraisal Date` field appears, populated with the date of "
"the next appraisal according to the :ref:`appraisal plan "
"<appraisals/appraisal-plan>`. If no plan applies, the field displays "
":guilabel:`On demand`."
msgstr ""
"當評估標記為完成並填入 :guilabel:`最終評級` 後，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`下次評"
"估日期` 欄位，並根據 :ref:`評估計劃 <appraisals/appraisal-plan>` 自動填入下次"
"評估的日期。如沒有適用的計劃，該欄位會顯示 :guilabel:`按需要`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:174
msgid "Manage several appraisals at once"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:176
msgid ""
"Several appraisals can be processed at the same time from the list view. "
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Appraisals`, click the "
":icon:`reorder` :guilabel:`(List)` icon, and click the checkbox next to each"
" appraisal to process. Then, click the :icon:`settings_f` "
":guilabel:`Actions` button, and select one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"你可從列表檢視同時處理多份員工評估。前往 :menuselection:`員工評估應用程"
"式 --> 員工評估`，點擊 :icon:`reorder` :guilabel:`（列表）` 圖示，並勾選每份"
"要處理的員工評估旁的核取方塊。然後，點擊 :icon:`settings_f` :guilabel:`操作` "
"按鈕，並選擇以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:181
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send By Email`: Opens a *Send By Email* pop-up window to send a "
"message to the selected employees."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`透過電郵發送`：開啟 *透過電郵發送* 彈出視窗，向已選擇的員工發送訊"
"息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:183
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Confirm`: Confirms the selected appraisals, and their status "
"changes from :guilabel:`Draft` to :guilabel:`Ongoing`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`確認`：確認已選取的評核，其狀態會由 :guilabel:`草稿` 變更為 "
":guilabel:`進行中`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:185
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mark as Done`: Completes the selected appraisals, including "
":guilabel:`Draft` ones. If an appraisal is selected with a status of "
":guilabel:`Done`, an error message appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:187
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reset`: Sets the selected appraisals back to :guilabel:`Draft`, "
"excluding any with a status of :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`重設`：將所選評估重設回:guilabel:`草稿`狀態，但狀態為:guilabel:`已"
"完成`的評估除外。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:190
msgid ""
"With :guilabel:`Confirm` and :guilabel:`Reset`, appraisals that are not in "
"the expected status are skipped, and a warning notification is displayed."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`確認` 和 :guilabel:`重設` 時，未處於預期狀態的評估會被略過，"
"並顯示警告通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:194
msgid ":doc:`new_appraisals`"
msgstr ":doc:`new_appraisals`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/schedule_appraisals.rst:195
msgid ":doc:`appraisal_templates`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:3
msgid "Skills evolution"
msgstr "技能發展"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo's **Appraisals** app, it is possible to view how employees' skills "
"progress over time in the :ref:`Skills Evolution <appraisals/identify-"
"skills-evolution>` report."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 的 **員工評估** 應用程式中，您可以在 :ref:`技能演變 <appraisals/"
"identify-skills-evolution>` 報表中查看員工技能隨時間的進展。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:8
msgid ""
"Managers can use this report to see how the skills of their teams evolve, "
"which skills improve the most, and which ones need more training."
msgstr ""
"管理人員可使用此報表查看團隊技能的演變情況、哪些技能進步最多，以及哪些技能需"
"要更多培訓。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:14
msgid "Skills evolution report"
msgstr "技能發展報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:16
msgid ""
"To access the *Skills Evolution* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Reporting --> Skills Evolution`."
msgstr ""
"要查看 *技能發展* 報告，請前往 :menuselection:`員工評估應用程式 --> 報告 --> "
"技能發展`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:19
msgid ""
"The report is built from the skill history of the active employees, as "
"recorded on their :ref:`employee form <employees/skills>`. Each time a skill"
" level changes for any employee, for example when an appraisal is marked as "
"done, a new snapshot date is added to the report. For each snapshot date, "
"the report lists the skill levels of all employees at that date."
msgstr ""
"此報告根據現職員工於其:ref:`員工表單 <employees/skills>`中所記錄的技能歷史紀"
"錄建立。每當任何員工的技能水平有變動時（例如當工作評估標記為完成時），報告便"
"會新增一個快照日期。對於每個快照日期，報告會列出所有員工在該日期的技能水平。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:24
msgid ""
"By default, the report is displayed in a list view, grouped first by month "
"(:guilabel:`Date: Month`), then by :guilabel:`Skill Type`, then by "
":guilabel:`Skill`. Each line displays the following information:"
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，報表會以列表檢視顯示，首先按月份（:guilabel:`日期：月份`）分組，"
"其次按:guilabel:`技能類型`分組，然後按:guilabel:`技能`分組。每一行均會顯示以"
"下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:28
msgid ":guilabel:`Date`: The date of the snapshot."
msgstr ":guilabel:`日期`：快照的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:29
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:130
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:23
msgid ":guilabel:`Employee`: The name of the employee."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：員工姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:30
msgid ":guilabel:`Skill Type`: The category the skill falls under."
msgstr ":guilabel:`技能類型`：該技能所屬的類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:31
msgid ":guilabel:`Skill`: The specific, individual skill."
msgstr ":guilabel:`技能`：具體的個人技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Average Progress (%)`: The progress corresponding to the "
"employee's skill level at that date. On grouped lines, this column displays "
"the average progress of the group."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`平均進度 (%)`：員工在該日期的技能等級所對應的進度。在分組行上，此"
"欄會顯示該群組的平均進度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Assessed`: The number of employee skills included in the "
"line or group."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已評估總數`：資料行或群組中包含的員工技能數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:36
msgid "The Skills Evolution report, grouped by month, skill type, and skill."
msgstr "技能演變報表，按月份、技能類型及技能分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:39
msgid ""
"The report is also available as a :icon:`bar_chart` :guilabel:`(Graph)` "
"view, which displays the average progress of each skill over time as a line "
"chart, and as a :icon:`oi_view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` view."
msgstr ""
"此報表亦提供 :icon:`bar_chart` :guilabel:`（圖表）` 檢視模式，以折線圖顯示各"
"項技能隨時間變化的平均進度，同時亦提供 :icon:`oi_view-pivot` :guilabel:`（樞"
"紐分析表）` 檢視模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:43
msgid ""
"This report can be modified to find specific information by adjusting the "
":ref:`filters <search/filters>` and :ref:`groupings <search/group>` set in "
"the search bar at the top. The available groupings are "
":guilabel:`Department`, :guilabel:`Employee`, :guilabel:`Skill Type`, "
":guilabel:`Skill`, and :guilabel:`Date`."
msgstr ""
"可透過調整頂部搜尋欄中設定的:ref:`篩選條件 <search/filters>`及:ref:`分組 "
"<search/group>`，修改此報表以尋找特定資訊。可用的分組包括:guilabel:`部"
"門`、:guilabel:`員工`、:guilabel:`技能類型`、:guilabel:`技能`及:guilabel:`日"
"期`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:49
msgid ""
"The report only displays the skills of the companies currently selected in "
"the company selector."
msgstr "此報表僅顯示目前在公司選擇器中所選公司的技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:55
msgid "Use case: Skill development over time"
msgstr "使用案例：隨時間發展技能"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:57
msgid ""
"It can be helpful to view how a skill progresses over time for the entire "
"company. This may aid managers in determining which skill levels remain flat"
" and need to be focused on, and which skills employees are making "
"continuous, steady progress towards."
msgstr ""
"查看整個公司的技能隨時間推移的進展情況會很有幫助。這有助管理人員了解哪些技能"
"水平停滯不前並需要重點改進，以及員工在哪些技能上正持續穩定地進步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:61
msgid ""
"In this example, the report is modified to see how programming skills "
"evolved across the company."
msgstr "在此範例中，報表經過修改，以查看程式設計技能在整個公司中的演變情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:63
msgid ""
"First, navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Reporting --> Skills "
"Evolution`. Click into the search bar, type `Programming`, then select "
":guilabel:`Search Skill Type for: Programming` in the drop-down menu. Then, "
"click the :icon:`bar_chart` :guilabel:`(Graph)` icon in the upper corner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:67
msgid ""
"The line chart displays one line per skill, with the snapshot dates on the "
"x-axis (horizontal axis), and the average progress of the employees for that"
" skill on the y-axis (vertical axis). A rising line indicates that employees"
" improved in that skill."
msgstr ""
"折線圖會為每項技能顯示一條線段，x 軸（橫軸）顯示快照日期，y 軸（縱軸）顯示員"
"工在該技能上的平均進度。線段上升表示員工在該技能有所進步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:71
msgid ""
"A line chart showing the average progress of the programming skills over "
"time."
msgstr "顯示編程技能隨時間平均進度的折線圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:75
msgid ""
"To hide a skill from the chart, click its label in the legend beneath the "
"chart. Click the label again to display it."
msgstr ""
"要從圖表中隱藏某項技能，請點擊圖表下方圖例中的對應標籤。再次點擊該標籤即可重"
"新顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:81
msgid "Use case: Review employee skill progression"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:83
msgid ""
"Before meeting with an employee to discuss their appraisal, it is helpful "
"for managers to assess the employee's skills and evaluate their progress "
"over time. This may aid managers when assigning new goals and reviewing how "
"the previous working period went."
msgstr ""
"在與員工會面討論其績效評估之前，管理人員可先評估員工的技能並檢視其長遠進度，"
"這將會有所幫助。這有助管理人員設定新目標，並檢討上一個工作週期的表現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:87
msgid ""
"In this example, the report is modified to review how the skills of a "
"specific employee evolved, in preparation for their next appraisal."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，報表經過修改，以便檢視特定員工的技能演變情況，為其下一次績效評估"
"作準備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:90
msgid ""
"First, navigate to :menuselection:`Appraisals app --> Reporting --> Skills "
"Evolution`, and clear the default groupings in the search bar. Next, type "
"the name of the employee, in this example, `John Doe`. Select "
":guilabel:`Search Employee for: John Doe` in the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"首先，前往:menuselection:`考核應用程式 --> 報表 --> 技能演變`，並清除搜尋列中"
"的預設分組。接着，輸入員工姓名（本例為 `John Doe`）。在下拉式選單中選"
"擇:guilabel:`搜尋員工：John Doe`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:94
msgid ""
"Next, click the :icon:`oi_view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon in the "
"corner. Click the :guilabel:`Measures` button, select :guilabel:`Average "
"Progress (%)`, and deselect :guilabel:`Count`. In the pivot table, click the"
" :icon:`add_box` :guilabel:`Total` row header, and select :guilabel:`Skill`."
" Then, click the :icon:`add_box` :guilabel:`Total` column header, select "
":guilabel:`Date`, then :guilabel:`Month`."
msgstr ""
"接下來，點擊角落的 :icon:`oi_view-pivot` :guilabel:`（樞紐分析表）` 圖示。點"
"擊 :guilabel:`計量` 按鈕，選擇 :guilabel:`平均進度（%）`，並取消勾選 "
":guilabel:`計數`。在樞紐分析表中，點擊 :icon:`add_box` :guilabel:`總計` 列標"
"題，然後選擇 :guilabel:`技能`。接著，點擊 :icon:`add_box` :guilabel:`總計` 欄"
"標題，選擇 :guilabel:`日期`，再選擇 :guilabel:`月`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:100
msgid ""
"The pivot table now displays the progress of the employee's various skills "
"for each snapshot month, making it easy to spot which skills improved "
"between appraisals."
msgstr ""
"樞紐分析表現在會顯示每個快照月份中員工各項技能的進度，方便輕鬆識別在兩次績效"
"評估之間有所提升的技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:103
msgid "A pivot table showing the progress of an employee's skills by month."
msgstr "按月顯示員工技能進度的樞紐分析表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:107
msgid ":doc:`Odoo essentials reporting <../../essentials/reporting>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Odoo 基礎報告 <../../essentials/reporting>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/appraisals/skills_evolution.rst:108
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:71
