msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:5
msgid "Approvals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:7
msgid ""
"The **Approvals** app in Odoo allows employees to make official requests for"
" a variety of things, allowing management the ability to review requests and"
" then either approve or refuse them. This keeps all requests in one "
"centralized location, providing clear organization and transparency for all "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 中的 **審批** 應用程式讓員工可以就各類事項提交正式申請，方便管理層審閱申"
"請並決定批准或拒絕。這可將所有申請集中於同一位置，使所有申請井然有序且具透明"
"度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:15
msgid "Approval types"
msgstr "審批類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:17
msgid ""
"When requesting an approval, the category, or *type*, must be specified. The"
" following approval categories are preconfigured:"
msgstr "申請批核時，必須指定類別（即 *類型*）。系統已預先配置以下批核類別："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:20
msgid ":guilabel:`Business Trip`: For requesting work-related travel."
msgstr ":guilabel:`出差`：用於申請因公差旅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:21
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Borrow Items`: For requesting physical items the company owns or "
"sells, for a specified period of time."
msgstr ":guilabel:`借用物品`：用於申請借用公司擁有或銷售的實體物品一段指定時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`General Approval`: For requests that do not fit in any of the "
"other categories."
msgstr ":guilabel:`一般批核`：適用於不符合任何其他類別的申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Approval`: For requesting any type of external contract,"
" excluding :doc:`employee contracts <payroll/contracts>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Application`: For requesting *prior approval* for "
"company-related expenses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:29
msgid ""
"This approval type is **only** used when requesting approval *in advance* "
"for an expense the company directly pays for. This category should **not** "
"be used for expenses employees are seeking reimbursement for. That is done "
"through the :doc:`Expenses app <../finance/expenses/log_expenses>`."
msgstr ""
"此審批類型**僅**用於為公司直接支付的開支*預先*申請審批。員工申請報銷的開"
"支**不應**使用此類別，報銷應透過 :doc:`開支應用程式 <../finance/expenses/"
"log_expenses>` 辦理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:34
msgid ":guilabel:`Car Rental Application`: For requesting a rental car."
msgstr ":guilabel:`租車申請`：用於申請租車。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Referral Award`: For requesting job referral awards that were"
" earned but not completed through the :doc:`Referrals <referrals>` app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`職位推薦獎金`：用於申請已賺取但未透過 :doc:`推薦 <referrals>` 應用"
"程式完成的職位推薦獎金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Procurement`: Used for requesting work-related items such as "
"office supplies, tools, etc."
msgstr ":guilabel:`採購`：用於申請與工作相關的物品，例如辦公用品、工具等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create RFQ's`: Used for requesting a quote for items from a "
"vendor. This only appears if the **Purchase** app is installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`建立詢價單`：用於向供應商要求項目報價。此選項只會在安裝了 **採"
"購** 應用程式時顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:42
msgid ""
"If necessary, approval categories can be :ref:`modified or created "
"<approvals/categories>`."
msgstr "如有需要，可:ref:`修改或建立 <approvals/categories>`審批類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:47
msgid "Approval requests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:49
msgid ""
"The **Approvals** app dashboard displays a card for each approval category. "
"To create a new approval request, open the **Approvals** app, click the "
":guilabel:`New Request` button on the approval category card that best fits "
"the request, and a blank approval form loads. Fill out the following "
"sections and tabs on the form, then :ref:`submit the request "
"<approvals/submit>`."
msgstr ""
"**審批** 應用程式儀表板會為每個審批類別顯示一張卡片。要建立新審批申請，請開"
"啟 **審批** 應用程式，並按一下最符合申請內容的審批類別卡片上的 :guilabel:`新"
"申請` 按鈕，系統便會載入空白的審批表單。填寫表單上的以下部分及分頁，然後 "
":ref:`提交申請 <approvals/submit>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:55
msgid ""
"If the category is not immediately known, click the :guilabel:`New Request` "
"button in the upper-left corner of the dashboard to open a generic request "
"form. Once the :guilabel:`Category` is selected, the corresponding fields on"
" the form appear."
msgstr ""
"如果未能即時確定類別，請點擊儀表板左上角的:guilabel:`新請求`按鈕，以開啟一般"
"請求表單。選取:guilabel:`類別`後，表單上便會顯示相應欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:59
msgid ""
"For users with the *Officer: Approve all requests* access right, the "
":guilabel:`To Review` button on each card displays the number of submitted "
"requests of that category waiting for the current user's approval. Click it "
"to open these requests."
msgstr ""
"對於擁有 *專員：批核所有申請* 存取權限的用戶，每張卡片上的:guilabel:`待審"
"核`按鈕會顯示該類別中等待目前用戶批核的已提交申請數量。點擊該按鈕即可開啟這些"
"申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:64
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:252
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:34
msgid "General information section"
msgstr "一般資料部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:66
msgid ""
"The top half of the form contains all of the general information regarding "
"the request. Fill out the following fields in the top half of the form:"
msgstr "表單的上半部包含申請的所有一般資料。請填寫表單上半部的以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:70
msgid ""
"All the fields listed below, except :guilabel:`Quantity`, appear on the form"
" for the :guilabel:`General Approval` category. If a different "
":guilabel:`Category` is selected, some fields are hidden, according to the "
":ref:`category configuration <approvals/categories>`."
msgstr ""
"除:guilabel:`數量`外，以下列出的所有欄位均會顯示於:guilabel:`一般審批`類別的"
"表單上。若選擇其他:guilabel:`類別`，系統會根據:ref:`類別配置 <approvals/"
"categories>`隱藏部分欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Approval Subject`: Enter a short title for the request, such as "
"`Customer Visit in Chicago`. If the category uses an automated sequence, "
"this field is filled automatically with a reference number when the request "
"is saved."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`審批主題`：為申請輸入簡短標題，例如 `芝加哥客戶拜訪` 。若該類別使"
"用自動編號序列，儲存申請時，此欄位會自動填入參考編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Request Owner`: The person responsible for the approval request. "
"The signed-in user populates this field by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`申請負責人`：負責處理批核申請的人員。此欄位預設會自動填入已登入的"
"使用者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: The selected category appears in this field, but can "
"be changed using the drop-down menu, as long as the request is not "
"submitted."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類別`：所選類別會顯示於此欄位中；只要申請尚未提交，你仍可使用下拉"
"式選單更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: Using the calendar selector, set the date and time the "
"request is for. This field **only** appears if :guilabel:`Payment "
"Application` or :guilabel:`General Approval` is selected for the "
":guilabel:`Category`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`日期`：使用日曆選擇器設定申請所屬的日期及時間。此欄位**僅**在選"
"取:guilabel:`付款申請`或:guilabel:`一般審批`作為:guilabel:`類別`時才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Period`: Using the calendar selector, set the start and end dates"
" and times for the request. This field **only** appears if "
":guilabel:`Business Trip`, :guilabel:`Borrow Items`, :guilabel:`Car Rental "
"Application`, or :guilabel:`General Approval` is selected for the "
":guilabel:`Category`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`期間`：使用日曆選擇器設定申請的開始及結束日期與時間。此欄"
"位**僅**在選擇:guilabel:`出差`、:guilabel:`借用物品`、:guilabel:`租車申"
"請`或:guilabel:`一般審批`作為:guilabel:`類別`時才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Location`: Enter the specific location the approval request is "
"for. This field **only** appears if :guilabel:`Business Trip` or "
":guilabel:`General Approval` is selected for the :guilabel:`Category`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`地點`：輸入審批申請所涉及的具體地點。此欄位 **只會** 在選取 "
":guilabel:`商務出差` 或 :guilabel:`一般審批` 作為 :guilabel:`類別` 時出現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contact`: Select the point of contact for the request using the "
"drop-down menu. The available options are from the **Contacts** app. This "
"field **only** appears if :guilabel:`Contract Approval`, :guilabel:`Payment "
"Application`, :guilabel:`Job Referral Award`, or :guilabel:`General "
"Approval` is selected for the :guilabel:`Category`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`聯絡人`：使用下拉式選單選擇申請的聯絡人。可用選項來自 **聯絡人** "
"應用程式。此欄位 **只會** 在選擇 :guilabel:`合約批核`、:guilabel:`付款申"
"請`、:guilabel:`職位推薦獎金` 或 :guilabel:`一般批核` 作為 :guilabel:`類別` "
"時顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: The currently logged-in company populates this field by"
" default, and **cannot** be changed. This field **only** appears in multi-"
"company databases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quantity`: Enter the number of items being requested in this "
"field. This field **only** appears if :guilabel:`Procurement` is selected "
"for the :guilabel:`Category`. For categories with products, the quantity is "
"set on each line of the *Products* tab instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount`: Enter the amount being requested. This field **only** "
"appears if :guilabel:`Contract Approval`, :guilabel:`Payment Application`, "
":guilabel:`Procurement`, or :guilabel:`General Approval` is selected for the"
" :guilabel:`Category`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`金額`：輸入申請的金額。此欄位 **只會** 在選取 :guilabel:`合約批"
"核`、:guilabel:`付款申請`、:guilabel:`採購` 或 :guilabel:`一般批核` 作為 "
":guilabel:`類別` 時出現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:103
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reference`: Enter any relevant reference for the request in this "
"field. This field **only** appears if :guilabel:`Contract Approval` or "
":guilabel:`General Approval` is selected for the :guilabel:`Category`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`參考`：在此欄位輸入任何與申請相關的參考資料。此欄位 **只** 會在選"
"擇了:guilabel:`合約批核`或:guilabel:`一般批核`作為:guilabel:`類別`時顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:108
msgid ""
"Each approval type presents different fields on the approval form. This is "
"because each *approval type* has its own required fields. If the *type* is "
"not immediately known, click the :guilabel:`New Request` button at the top "
"of the page to open a generic request for approval form. Once the "
":guilabel:`Category` is selected, the corresponding fields on the form "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"每種審批類型在審批表單上都會顯示不同的欄位，因為每種*審批類型*都有各自的必填"
"欄位。如果您暫時不確定所需*類型*，請點擊頁面頂部的:guilabel:`新增申請`按鈕，"
"以開啟通用審批申請表單。選擇:guilabel:`類別`後，表單上便會出現相應的欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:113
msgid "The top half of an approval form filled out for a business trip."
msgstr "已填妥的公幹審批表單上半部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:117
msgid "Products tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:119
msgid ""
"If any configured products in the database are being requested, they must be"
" listed in the *Products* tab. This tab **only** appears if "
":guilabel:`Borrow Items`, :guilabel:`General Approval`, or :guilabel:`Create"
" RFQ's` is selected in the :guilabel:`Category` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:123
msgid ""
"To add a product, click :guilabel:`Add a line` and a blank line appears. "
"Using the drop-down menu, select the product being requested. Once selected,"
" the product's name and :guilabel:`Internal Reference` code populate both "
"the :guilabel:`Products` and :guilabel:`Description` fields. Update the "
":guilabel:`Description` field, if desired. The :guilabel:`Quantity` is "
":guilabel:`1.00` by default, but can be updated if necessary."
msgstr ""
"要新增產品，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`，隨即會出現空白行。使用下拉式選單選"
"擇所要求的產品。選擇後，產品名稱及 :guilabel:`內部編號` 代碼會自動填入 "
":guilabel:`產品` 及 :guilabel:`說明` 欄位。如有需要，可更新 :guilabel:`說明` "
"欄位。:guilabel:`數量` 預設為 :guilabel:`1.00`，但可視乎需要更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:132
msgid ""
"The *Description* tab is where any information to clarify the request is "
"entered. Add any relevant information in this tab."
msgstr "*說明* 分頁用於輸入任何有助釐清申請的資料。請在此分頁中新增任何相關資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:138
msgid "Approver(s) tab"
msgstr "審批人分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:140
msgid ""
"The *Approver(s)* tab lists the people responsible for approving the "
"request. The approvers configured on the :ref:`approval category "
"<approvals/categories>` populate this tab by default."
msgstr ""
"*批核人* 分頁會列出負責批核請求的人員。預設情況下，此分頁會自動填入在 "
":ref:`批核類別 <approvals/categories>` 中設定的批核人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:143
msgid ""
"To add an approver, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and a blank line appears. "
"Using the drop-down menu, select the desired user. Repeat for all other "
"approvers. There is no maximum number of users for this tab. Only internal "
"users can be selected as approvers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:147
msgid ""
"To indicate a user **must** approve the request, click the checkbox in the "
":guilabel:`Required` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:150
msgid ""
"As users are added, their :guilabel:`Status` remains :guilabel:`New`. Once "
"the request is submitted, the :guilabel:`Status` changes to :guilabel:`To "
"Approve`, and each approver receives an activity to approve the request. "
"Approvers can approve the request in any order."
msgstr ""
"加入用戶時，其:guilabel:`狀態`會維持為:guilabel:`新增`。提交申請後"
"，:guilabel:`狀態`會變更為:guilabel:`待批准`，而每位批核者都會收到一項批准該"
"申請的活動。批核者可按任何順序批准申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:154
msgid "The Approver(s) tab with two approvers listed, one of them required."
msgstr "「核准人」分頁，當中列出兩名核准人，其中一名為必須核准人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:158
msgid "Attach documents"
msgstr "附加文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:160
msgid ""
"All approval requests include the option to attach relevant documents. To "
"attach a document, click the :guilabel:`Attach Document` button at the top "
"of the page, and a file explorer window loads. Navigate to the desired file,"
" select it, then click :guilabel:`Open` to attach it. Multiple documents can"
" be selected and added at the same time."
msgstr ""
"所有審批申請均包含附加相關文件的選項。要附加文件，請點擊頁面頂部的 "
":guilabel:`附加文件` 按鈕，系統隨即載入檔案總管視窗。瀏覽並選取所需檔案，然後"
"點擊 :guilabel:`開啟` 即可附加。您可同時選取並加入多份文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:165
msgid ""
"Once attached, a :icon:`book` :guilabel:`Documents` smart button appears at "
"the top of the page, indicating how many documents are attached. "
"Additionally, the documents are listed in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"附加後，頁面頂部會出現 :icon:`book` :guilabel:`文件` 智能按鈕，顯示已附加的文"
"件數量。此外，文件亦會列於通訊欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:169
msgid ""
"Some categories, such as :guilabel:`General Approval`, require at least one "
"document. When submitting a request with missing documentation, an *Invalid "
"Operation* pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""
"部分類別（例如 :guilabel:`一般批核`）需要至少一份文件。提交缺少文件的請求時，"
"系統會載入*無效操作*彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:175
msgid "Submit request"
msgstr "提交申請"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:177
msgid ""
"Once the form is complete and all tabs are configured, click "
":guilabel:`Submit` to submit the request. The status changes to "
":guilabel:`Submitted`, and the request appears on the *Approvals to Review* "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"填妥表格並設定所有分頁後，點擊 :guilabel:`提交` 以提交申請。狀態會變更為 "
":guilabel:`已提交`，該申請亦會顯示於 *待審核的批准* 儀表板上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:181
msgid ""
"To modify the request after it is submitted, click :guilabel:`Cancel` to "
"cancel the submitted request, then click :guilabel:`Back To Draft` to modify"
" the record. Once all changes are made, click :guilabel:`Submit` to submit "
"it again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:186
msgid "Approved requests cannot be deleted, but they can be archived."
msgstr "已批核的申請無法刪除，但可以封存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:191
msgid "Manage approvals"
msgstr "管理審批"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:193
msgid ""
"After requests are submitted, they must be approved by the approvers listed "
"in the :ref:`Approver(s) tab <approvals/approvers>`. To view approvals "
"awaiting action, navigate to :menuselection:`Approvals app --> Manager --> "
"Approvals to Review`, and the *Approvals to Review* dashboard loads. All "
"approvals awaiting action by the user appear in a default list view."
msgstr ""
"提交申請後，必須由 :ref:`審批人分頁 <approvals/approvers>` 中列出的審批人批核"
"。要查看待處理的審批，請前往 :menuselection:`審批應用程式 --> 管理員 --> 待審"
"核的審批`，系統便會載入 *待審核的審批* 儀表板。所有等待用戶處理的審批都會以預"
"設列表檢視顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:198
msgid "All approval requests waiting for approval, the user is assigned to."
msgstr "已指派給該用戶且等待批核的所有批核申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:202
msgid ""
"Only *submitted* requests that the user is assigned as an approver for "
"appear in the *Approvals to Review* dashboard. To view all requests, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Approvals app --> Manager --> All Approvals`. "
"Requests created by the current user are listed in :menuselection:`Approvals"
" app --> My Approvals --> My Requests`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:207
msgid ""
"To approve or refuse a request, click the individual request on the "
"*Approvals to Review* dashboard and the individual request form loads. "
"Requests can also be approved or refused directly from the "
":guilabel:`Approval` activity displayed in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"要批准或拒絕申請，請在 *待審核的審批* 儀表板上按一下個別申請，系統便會載入該"
"申請表單。您亦可直接從溝通欄顯示的 :guilabel:`審批` 活動中批准或拒絕申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:211
msgid ""
"A request to borrow conference chairs, with the Approve and Refuse buttons "
"showing."
msgstr "借用會議室椅子的申請，畫面上顯示「批准」及「拒絕」按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:214
msgid ""
"To approve the request, click the :guilabel:`Approve` button on the "
"individual approval request form. In the *Approver(s)* tab, the approver's "
":guilabel:`Status` changes to :guilabel:`Approved`, and the text appears "
"green. The request's status changes to :guilabel:`Approved` once all "
"required approvers, and at least the :guilabel:`Minimum Approval` number of "
"approvers set on the category, have approved it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:220
msgid ""
"To deny the request, click the :guilabel:`Refuse` button on the individual "
"approval request form. The approver's :guilabel:`Status` changes to "
":guilabel:`Refused`, and the text appears red. As soon as one approver "
"refuses the request, the request's status changes to :guilabel:`Refused`."
msgstr ""
"若要拒絕申請，請在個別批核申請表單上點擊 :guilabel:`拒絕` 按鈕。批核人的 "
":guilabel:`狀態` 會變更為 :guilabel:`已拒絕`，文字亦會顯示為紅色。只要有一位"
"批核人拒絕申請，該申請的狀態便會隨即變更為 :guilabel:`已拒絕`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:224
msgid ""
"An approver who already approved or refused a request can click the "
":guilabel:`Withdraw` button to cancel their decision. Their "
":guilabel:`Status` changes back to :guilabel:`To Approve`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:228
msgid ""
"Users with the *Officer: Approve all requests* access right for the "
"**Approvals** app can approve a request without waiting for the approvers. "
"On the *Approvals to Review* dashboard, click the checkbox next to the "
"desired request, click the :icon:`settings_f` :guilabel:`Actions` button, "
"then :guilabel:`Force Approval`. Alternatively, on the individual request "
"record, click the :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then "
":guilabel:`Force Approval`."
msgstr ""
"擁有 **審批** 應用程式 *主任：批准所有申請* 存取權限的用戶，無須等待審批人即"
"可批准申請。在 *待覆核的審批* 儀表板上，點擊所需申請旁邊的核取方塊，點擊 "
":icon:`settings_f` :guilabel:`操作` 按鈕，然後選擇 :guilabel:`強制批准`。或者"
"，在個別申請紀錄中，點擊 :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`（操作）` 圖示，然後選"
"擇 :guilabel:`強制批准`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:237
msgid "Configure approval categories"
msgstr "設定審批類別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:239
msgid ""
"To modify an approval category, or create a new one, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Approvals app --> Configuration --> Approval Categories`. "
"The *Approval Categories* dashboard loads, with all currently configured "
"categories in a list view. Click on a category to open it, or click "
":guilabel:`New` to create a new one."
msgstr ""
"如要修改審批類別或建立新類別，請前往:menuselection:`審批應用程式 --> 配"
"置 --> 審批類別`。系統會載入*審批類別*儀表板，並以列表檢視顯示所有目前已配置"
"的類別。點擊某個類別即可開啟，或點擊:guilabel:`新增`以建立新類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:244
msgid "Fill out the following fields in the top of the form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:247
msgid "Some fields only appear if the related app is installed."
msgstr "部分欄位只會在安裝相關應用程式後才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:249
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Approval Category`: The name of the category, displayed on the "
"dashboard card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:250
msgid ":guilabel:`Description`: A short description of the category."
msgstr ":guilabel:`描述`：此類別的簡短描述。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:251
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create RFQ's`: Click this checkbox to have the request create a "
"quote request."
msgstr ":guilabel:`建立報價請求`：點選此勾選框，即可讓該申請建立報價請求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:252
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Automated Sequence`: Click this checkbox to automatically "
"generate the :guilabel:`Approval Subject` for the requests. When selected, a"
" :guilabel:`Prefix Code` field appears. Enter a code to use when submitting "
"requests."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`自動序號`：勾選此核取方塊，即可為申請自動產生:guilabel:`審批主"
"題`。選取後，畫面會顯示:guilabel:`前綴代碼`欄位。請輸入提交申請時使用的代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:255
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: The company the category belongs to. This field only "
"appears in multi-company databases."
msgstr ":guilabel:`公司`：該類別所屬的公司。此欄位僅在多公司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:258
msgid ""
"In the *Configuration* section of the *Options* tab, select whether each "
"field of the request form is :guilabel:`Required`, :guilabel:`Optional`, or "
"not displayed (:guilabel:`None`): :guilabel:`Document`, :guilabel:`Contact`,"
" :guilabel:`Date`, :guilabel:`Period`, :guilabel:`Product`, "
":guilabel:`Quantity`, :guilabel:`Amount`, :guilabel:`Reference`, and "
":guilabel:`Location`. The :guilabel:`Document` option can only be "
":guilabel:`Required` or :guilabel:`Optional`."
msgstr ""
"在 *選項* 分頁的 *配置* 部分中，選擇申請表各欄位為 :guilabel:`必"
"填`、:guilabel:`選填`，或不顯示（:guilabel:`無`）：:guilabel:`文"
"件`、:guilabel:`聯絡人`、:guilabel:`日期`、:guilabel:`期間`、:guilabel:`產"
"品`、:guilabel:`數量`、:guilabel:`金額`、:guilabel:`參考` 及 :guilabel:`位"
"置`。:guilabel:`文件` 選項只可設為 :guilabel:`必填` 或 :guilabel:`選填`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:265
msgid ""
"In the *Approvers* section, configure who approves the requests for the "
"category:"
msgstr "在 *審批人* 部分，設定誰負責審批此類別的申請："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:267
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee's Manager`: Click this checkbox to add the manager of "
"the request owner as a required approver for every request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`員工經理`：勾選此核取方塊，將申請人的經理設為每項申請的必要審批人"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:269
msgid ""
"User list: Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add a default approver, and click"
" the :guilabel:`Required` checkbox if their approval is mandatory."
msgstr ""
"用戶清單：點擊 :guilabel:`新增一行` 以新增預設批核人；如必須經其批核，請剔選 "
":guilabel:`必須` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:271
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Minimum Approval`: Enter the number of approvals needed to "
"approve the request. A warning appears if this number is greater than the "
"number of default approvers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`最少審批人數`：輸入批准申請所需的審批人數。如果此數字大於預設審批"
"人人數，系統會顯示警告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:274
msgid ""
"The Business Trip approval category form, with its options and approvers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/approvals.rst:278
msgid ""
"To add custom fields to the requests of a category, open one of its "
"requests, click the :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then click"
" :icon:`settings_applications` :guilabel:`Edit Properties`. The new "
"properties appear on all the requests of this category."
msgstr ""
"要為某個類別的申請加入自訂欄位，請開啟該類別的其中一個申請，點擊 "
":icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`(操作)` 圖示，然後點擊 "
":icon:`settings_applications` :guilabel:`編輯屬性`。新屬性會顯示在該類別的所"
"有申請上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:5
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:974
msgid "Attendances"
msgstr "考勤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Attendances** application functions as a time clock. Employees are "
"able to check in and out of work using a :ref:`dedicated device in kiosk "
"mode <attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>`, while users are also able to check in "
"and out of work :ref:`directly from the database <attendances/check-in>`. "
"Managers can see who is available at any given time, create reports to see "
"everyone's hours, and gain insights on which employees are working overtime "
"or checking out of work earlier than expected."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **考勤** 應用程式可用作打卡鐘。員工可使用 :ref:`處於資訊站模式的專用"
"裝置 <attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>` 上下班打卡，而用戶亦可 :ref:`直接從資料"
"庫 <attendances/check-in>` 上下班打卡。經理可隨時查看誰人在崗、建立報表以檢視"
"所有人的工時，並了解哪些員工正在加班或比預期提早下班。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:16
msgid "Access rights"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:18
msgid ""
"Understanding access rights is essential to navigating the **Attendances** "
"application."
msgstr "了解存取權限對使用**出勤**應用程式至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:20
msgid ""
"Every user in the database is able to check in and out directly from the "
"database, without needing access to the **Attendances** app. Additionally, "
"all users can access their own attendance records from their employee form "
"in the **Employees** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:24
msgid ""
"Access to both the **Attendances** application and the various features "
"within the application is determined by access rights."
msgstr "存取 **考勤** 應用程式及該應用程式內各項功能的權限，均由存取權限決定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:27
msgid ""
"To see what access rights a user has, navigate to the "
":menuselection:`Settings app --> Users & Companies --> Users`, and click on "
"an individual user. The :guilabel:`Access Rights` tab is visible by default."
" Scroll down to the *Human Resources* section to view the settings. For the "
":guilabel:`Attendances` field, the following options appear:"
msgstr ""
"要查看用戶擁有哪些存取權限，請前往 :menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 用戶及公"
"司 --> 用戶`，然後點擊個別用戶。預設會顯示 :guilabel:`存取權限` 分頁。向下捲"
"動至 *人力資源* 部分即可檢視設定。在 :guilabel:`考勤` 欄位中，會顯示以下選項"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No`: The user does **not** have access to the **Attendances** "
"application, and is **not** able to open the app, even though it appears on "
"the main database dashboard. An *Access Error* pop-up message appears when "
"the application is clicked. The user can only check in and out of the "
"database either through an :ref:`attendance kiosk <attendances/kiosk-mode-"
"entry>` or the :doc:`attendance icon <attendances/check_in_check_out>` in "
"the top-right corner of the Odoo database, which is visible at all times, in"
" every application)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`否`：用戶**沒有** **考勤** 應用程式的存取權限，即使該應用程式顯示"
"在主資料庫儀表板上，用戶亦**無法**開啟該應用程式。點按該應用程式時，會彈出*存"
"取錯誤*訊息。用戶只能透過:ref:`考勤終端機 <attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>`或 "
"Odoo 資料庫右上角的:doc:`考勤圖示 <attendances/check_in_check_out>`（在每個應"
"用程式中均會一直顯示）來在資料庫中簽到及簽退）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Officer: Manage all attendances`: The user has full access to all"
" employee attendance records, including the ability to modify and create "
"records, but does **not** have access to the configuration menu and "
"settings."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`主任：管理所有出勤記錄`：用戶對所有僱員的出勤記錄擁有完整存取權限"
"，包括修改及建立記錄的權限，但 **沒有** 配置選單及設定的存取權限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Administrator`: The user has full access to the entire "
"**Attendances** application, with no restrictions. They can view all "
"employee attendance records, enter :ref:`kiosk mode <attendances/enable-"
"kiosk-mode>` from the application, access all :doc:`reporting "
"<attendances/attendance_reporting>` metrics, and make modifications to the "
"settings."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`管理員`：使用者擁有整個 **出勤** 應用程式的完整存取權限，不受任何"
"限制。他們可查看所有員工的出勤記錄、從應用程式進入 :ref:`Kiosk 模式 "
"<attendances/enable-kiosk-mode>`、存取所有 :doc:`報表 <attendances/"
"attendance_reporting>` 指標，以及修改設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:49
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:626
msgid "Approvers"
msgstr "審批人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:51
msgid ""
"An approver is a user assigned to review and manage an employee's attendance"
" records. An approver is typically a manager, though that is not required. "
"Approvers without administrative rights can access and modify attendance "
"records **only** for the employees they are assigned to. This is the only "
"exception where non-admin users can view records in the **Attendances** app."
msgstr ""
"批核者是指獲指派審核及管理員工考勤記錄的用戶。批核者通常為經理，但並非必須。"
"沒有管理員權限的批核者 **僅可** 存取及修改其獲指派員工的考勤記錄。這是唯一允"
"許非管理員用戶在 **考勤** 應用程式中查看記錄的例外情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:56
msgid ""
"To view the attendance approver for an employee, navigate to the "
":menuselection:`Employees` application and click on the specific employee. "
"Click on the :guilabel:`Settings` tab, scroll to the *Approvers* section, "
"and check the :guilabel:`Attendance` field. The person selected is able to "
"view that employee's attendance records, both on the **Attendances** "
"application dashboard as well as in the attendance reports, and make "
"modifications to their records."
msgstr ""
"如要檢視員工的出勤批核人員，請前往 :menuselection:`員工` 應用程式並按一下該名"
"員工。按一下 :guilabel:`設定` 分頁，捲動至 *批核人員* 部分，然後查看 "
":guilabel:`出勤` 欄位。所選人員可在 **出勤** 應用程式儀表板及出勤報告中檢視該"
"員工的出勤記錄，並對其記錄作出修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:63
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:22
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:14
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:976
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:10
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/employment_hero.rst:16
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:16
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:12
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:65
msgid ""
"Few configurations are needed in the **Attendances** app. Determining how "
"employees check in and out, defining how the kiosks function, and "
"determining how extra hours are computed are all configured in the settings "
"menu. Navigate to the :menuselection:`Attendances app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` to access the settings menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:71
msgid ""
"Any configuration item with a :icon:`fa-building-o` :guilabel:`(building)` "
"icon is a company-specific configuration. Items without a :icon:`fa-"
"building-o` :guilabel:`(building)` icon apply to all companies within the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"任何帶有 :icon:`fa-building-o` :guilabel:`（建築物）` 圖示的配置項目均為公司"
"專屬配置。沒有 :icon:`fa-building-o` :guilabel:`（建築物）` 圖示的項目則適用"
"於資料庫內的所有公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:78
msgid "Modes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:80
msgid ""
"This section specifies how employees log in and out, and how absences are "
"handled."
msgstr "此部分指定員工如何登入及登出系統，以及如何處理缺勤情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attendances from Backend` :icon:`fa-building-o`: Activate this "
"feature to allow users to check in and out directly from the Odoo database. "
"If this is not activated, users must use a kiosk to check in and out of "
"work."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`從後台打卡考勤` :icon:`fa-building-o`：啟用此功能，即可讓使用者直"
"接透過 Odoo 資料庫進行上班及下班打卡。若未啟用，使用者必須使用自助登記站進行"
"上班及下班打卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Automatic Check-Out` :icon:`fa-building-o`: Activate this feature"
" to automatically check out employees according to their working schedule, "
"after a buffer of time has passed. When enabled, a :guilabel:`Tolerance` "
"field appears below this option. Enter the amount of time, in hours, that "
"must elapse after an employee's working hours have ended, before they are "
"automatically checked out."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`自動簽退` :icon:`fa-building-o`：啟用此功能後，系統會根據員工的工"
"作時間表，在經過一段緩衝時間後自動為員工簽退。啟用後，此選項下方會顯"
"示:guilabel:`寬限時間`欄位。請輸入員工工作時間結束後，必須經過多少時間（以小"
"時為單位），才會自動為員工簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:92
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Automatic Check-Out` option enabled, and the "
":guilabel:`Tolerance` set to `2.00` hours, an employee checks in to work at "
"9:00 AM and forgets to check out at 5:00 PM. At 7:00 PM, they are "
"automatically checked out."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`自動簽退` 選項並將 :guilabel:`容差` 設為 `2.00` 小時後，如果"
"員工在上午 9:00 簽到上班，但忘記在下午 5:00 簽退，系統會在晚上 7:00 為其自動"
"簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Absence Management` :icon:`fa-building-o`: Activate this feature "
"to log any absences that are not associated with a time off request, such as"
" vacation time or sick time, on the :doc:`attendance report "
"<attendances/attendance_reporting>`. This does **not** apply for employees "
"with a flexible working schedule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:102
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:483
msgid "Extra Hours"
msgstr "額外工時"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:104
msgid ""
"This section specifies how extra time (sometimes referred to as *overtime*) "
"is calculated, including when extra time is counted and what time is not "
"logged."
msgstr ""
"此部分指定如何計算額外工時（有時稱為 *加班* ），包括何時計算額外工時，以及哪"
"些時間不會被記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:107
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tolerance Time In Favor Of Company`: Enter the amount of time, in"
" minutes, that is **not** counted towards an employee's overtime. When an "
"employee checks out, and the extra time logged is below the specified "
"minutes, the extra time is **not** counted as overtime for the employee. "
"When an employee checks out, and the extra time logged is more than the "
"specified minutes, the extra time **is** counted as overtime for the "
"employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`有利公司的寬限時間`：輸入**不會**計入員工加班的時間（以分鐘為單位"
"）。員工簽退時，如記錄的額外時間少於指定分鐘數，該段額外時間**不會**計為員工"
"的加班時間；如記錄的額外時間多於指定分鐘數，該段額外時間則**會**計為員工的加"
"班時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:114
msgid ""
"A company sets the :guilabel:`Tolerance Time In Favor Of Company` to `15` "
"minutes, and the working hours for the entire company are set from 9:00 AM "
"to 5:00 PM."
msgstr ""
"某公司將 :guilabel:`對公司有利的寬限時間` 設為 `15` 分鐘，並將整間公司的工作"
"時間設為上午 9:00 至下午 5:00。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:117
msgid ""
"An employee checks in at 9:00 AM. If the employee checks out at 5:14 PM, the"
" extra 14 minutes are **not** counted towards their overtime. If the "
"employee checks out at 5:17 PM, they earn 17 minutes of overtime."
msgstr ""
"一名僱員於上午 9:00 簽到。如果該僱員於下午 5:14 簽退，額外的 14 分鐘 **不"
"會** 計入其加班時間；如果於下午 5:17 簽退，則可獲得 17 分鐘的加班時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:121
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tolerance Time In Favor Of Employee`: Enter the amount of time, "
"in minutes, that an employee is given, which does **not** adversely affect "
"their attendance if they log less time than their working hours. When an "
"employee checks out, and the total time logged for the day is less than "
"their specified working hours and less than this specified grace period, "
"they are **not** penalized for their reduced hours. When an employee checks "
"out, and the total time logged for the day is less than their specified "
"working hours and more than this specified grace period, they **are** "
"penalized for their reduced hours."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:130
msgid ""
"A company sets the :guilabel:`Tolerance Time In Favor Of Employee` fields to"
" `15` minutes, and the working hours for the entire company are set from "
"9:00 AM to 5:00 PM."
msgstr ""
"某公司將 :guilabel:`對員工有利的寬限時間` 欄位設為 `15` 分鐘，並將整間公司的"
"辦公時間設為上午 9:00 至下午 5:00。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:133
msgid ""
"An employee checks in at 9:05 AM. If the employee checks out at 4:55 PM, "
"even though they logged a total of 10 minutes less than their full working "
"hours, they are **not** penalized for this discrepancy, and they are logged "
"as working a full eight-hour day. If the employee checks out at 4:40 PM, "
"they **are** penalized, and they are logged as only working 7 hours and 35 "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"一名員工在上午 9:05 打卡上班。如果該員工在下午 4:55 打卡下班，即使他的總工時"
"比標準工時少 10 分鐘，他亦 **不會** 因這項差異而受罰，系統仍會記錄為工作滿八"
"小時的一天。如果該員工在下午 4:40 打卡下班，他則 **會** 受罰，系統只會記錄他"
"工作了 7 小時 35 分鐘。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Hours Validation` :icon:`fa-building-o`: Click on either "
"the radio button next to :guilabel:`Automatically Approved` to have all "
"extra time automatically approved, or :guilabel:`Approved by Manager` if all"
" extra time should be reviewed and approved by a manager."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:143
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display Extra Hours`: Activate this box to display the extra "
"hours logged by an employee when they check out with a kiosk, or when a user"
" checks out in the database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`顯示額外工時`：啟用此勾選框，即可在員工透過自助服務終端機簽退，或"
"用戶在資料庫中簽退時，顯示員工所記錄的額外工時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances.rst:147
msgid ""
"Approved extra hours can be deducted from an approved time off request."
msgstr "已批准的加班時數可從已批准的休假申請中扣除。"

