#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:3
msgid "Attendance logs"
msgstr "出勤紀錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:5
msgid ""
"When entering the **Attendances** application, the :guilabel:`Overview` "
"dashboard is presented by default, and displays all the user's attendance "
"logs (their check in and check out information) for the current day. If the "
"user has the required :ref:`access rights <attendances/access-rights>` or is"
" an :ref:`approver <attendances/approvers>` for specific employees, those "
"employees' attendance logs also appear on the :guilabel:`Overview` "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"進入 **出勤** 應用程式時，系統預設會顯示 :guilabel:`概覽` 儀表板，當中列出使"
"用者當日的所有出勤記錄（包括簽到及簽退資料）。如果使用者擁有相關的 :ref:`存取"
"權限 <attendances/access-rights>`，或是特定員工的 :ref:`審批人 <attendances/"
"approvers>`，該等員工的出勤記錄亦會顯示於 :guilabel:`概覽` 儀表板上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:11
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Overview` dashboard displays the current day, segmented by "
"hour, with the current hour highlighted in yellow. The appearance of the "
":guilabel:`Overview` dashboard is determined by the :ref:`working schedule "
"<employees/schedule>` set on the employee's records. Each employee's working"
" hours appear in white, while all other hours appear in gray. This allows "
"managers to visually determine if an employee is working outside of their "
"working hours."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:17
msgid ""
"Employees populate the rows, alphabetically by first name. Each attendance "
"log displays the total hours along with the specific check in and check out "
"times. The log colors indicate the following statuses:"
msgstr ""
"員工按名字的字母順序排列於各列。每筆考勤紀錄均顯示總工時以及具體的簽到及簽退"
"時間。紀錄顏色代表以下狀態："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:21
msgid "Gray: Completed entries where the employee has checked in and out."
msgstr "灰色：員工已完成簽到及簽退的記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:22
msgid ""
"Green: Active entries where the employee checked in but has not yet checked "
"out."
msgstr "綠色：進行中的記錄，表示員工已簽到但尚未簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:23
msgid ""
"Red: Entries with any errors (e.g. employees have double entries, or forget "
"to check out)."
msgstr "紅色：有任何錯誤的記錄（例如員工重複登記，或忘記簽退）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:25
msgid ""
"The overview dashboard presenting the information for the week, with the current day\n"
"highlighted."
msgstr ""
"顯示本週資訊的概覽儀表板，當中會突出顯示\n"
"當天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:29
msgid ""
"A color-coded bar indicates how many hours out of the total expected hours "
"the employee has logged for the day. Rollover the color bar to view the "
"details for the employee's current day. Solid colors indicate the logged "
"hours (with both a start and end time), while pale colors indicate the "
"employee is signed in, but has not signed out yet. Only *completed* "
"attendance logs (records with a check in and check out time) appear in the "
"summary of the logged time."
msgstr ""
"彩色編碼進度條顯示員工當日在總預期工時中已記錄的時數。將滑鼠移至彩色進度條上"
"方，即可查看員工當日的詳細資料。實心顏色代表已記錄的工時（同時包含開始及結束"
"時間），而淺色則代表員工已簽到但尚未簽退。只有 *已完成* 的出勤記錄（同時具備"
"簽到及簽退時間的記錄）才會顯示在已記錄時間摘要中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:36
msgid ""
"Abigail Peterson is scheduled to work from 9:00 AM to 12:00 PM, then take a "
"one-hour lunch break from 12:00 PM to 1:00 PM, then work from 1:00 PM to "
"6:00 PM, for a total of eight hours."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:39
msgid ""
"Abigails checks in at 9:00 AM, and checks out at 12:00 PM. She logs in again"
" at 1:00 PM. The current time is 2:15 PM. The rollover information displays "
"`3h / 8h`, indicating Abigail has logged three completed working hours out "
"of a total of eight. There is a pale green line that extends past the "
"summary block, indicating she checked in at 1:00 PM, but has not yet checked"
" out. The length of the pale green line indicates the time worked."
msgstr ""
"Abigail 於上午 9:00 簽到，並於中午 12:00 簽退。她在下午 1:00 再次登入。目前時"
"間為下午 2:15。滾動彙總資料顯示 `3h / 8h`，表示 Abigail 在總共 8 小時中已完"
"成 3 小時的工時記錄。摘要區塊後方延伸出一條淺綠色線條，表示她於下午 1:00 簽到"
"，但尚未簽退。該淺綠色線條的長度代表目前的工作時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:45
msgid ""
"The rollover green bar indicating Abigail logged 3 hours, and is currently "
"logged in."
msgstr "懸停綠色橫條表示 Abigail 已記錄 3 小時，且目前處於登入狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:48
msgid ""
"The **Attendances** dashboard allows for changing the displayed time period,"
" either :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month`, "
":guilabel:`Quarter`, :guilabel:`Year`, or a custom time period. To instantly"
" return the dashboard to the present date, click the :guilabel:`Today` "
"button at any time."
msgstr ""
"**出勤** 儀表板支援更改顯示的時間範圍，可選擇 "
":guilabel:`日`、:guilabel:`週`、:guilabel:`月`、:guilabel:`季`、:guilabel:`年` "
"或自訂時間範圍。要隨時將儀表板即時重設為目前日期，按一下 :guilabel:`今天` 按"
"鈕即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:54
msgid ""
"Any attendance logs that have errors appear in red, indicating they need to "
"be resolved by a user with the proper :ref:`access rights "
"<attendances/access-rights>` or are :ref:`approvers <attendances/approvers>`"
" for the employees with the errors."
msgstr ""
"任何出勤記錄如出現錯誤，便會以紅色顯示，表示需要由具備適當:ref:`存取權限 "
"<attendances/access-rights>`的使用者處理，或由該員工的:ref:`審批人 "
"<attendances/approvers>`解決。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:61
msgid "Filters and groups"
msgstr "篩選條件及分組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:63
msgid ""
"Sometimes, attendance officers and managers need to view specific records, "
"such as all automatic checkouts, to determine which employees chronically "
"forget to check out, or by department, to determine which team is working "
"the most overtime."
msgstr ""
"有時，考勤專員及經理需要檢視特定記錄（例如所有自動簽退記錄），以找出長期忘記"
"簽退的員工；或按部門檢視，以了解哪個團隊的加班時數最多。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:67
msgid ""
"For these cases, use the search bar to select a :icon:`fa-filter` "
":guilabel:`Filters` or :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Group By`, or combine "
"both to present the desired information."
msgstr ""
"在這些情況下，請使用搜尋欄選擇 :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選` 或 "
":icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`分組`，或同時結合兩者以呈現所需資訊。"

