#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:121
msgid ""
"Odoo records both the time and location for every check-in and check-out, "
"with fields varying by the method used. These detailed attendance logs can "
"confirm where an employee was on any given workday. This can be useful for "
"companies with hybrid working schedules, who may need to perform audits to "
"ensure proper compliance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:126
msgid ""
"To view an attendance log, click on any attendance entry on the "
":guilabel:`Overview` dashboard, and the attendance log appears in a pop-up "
"window. This log displays a summary, including the following information:"
msgstr ""
"如要查看考勤紀錄，請點擊 :guilabel:`概覽` 儀表板上的任何考勤項目，考勤紀錄便"
"會在彈出視窗中顯示。此紀錄會顯示摘要，包括以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:131
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:24
msgid ":guilabel:`Check In`: The date and time the employee checked in."
msgstr ":guilabel:`簽到`：員工簽到的日期及時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Check Out`: The date and time the employee checked out. This "
"**only** appears if the employee has checked out."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`簽退`：員工簽退的日期及時間。此項目 **僅** 在員工已簽退時才會顯示"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:134
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Worked Time`: The amount of time the employee logged for that "
"specific entry, in an hour and minute format (HH:MM)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作時間`：員工為該特定記錄登錄的時間長度，以小時及分鐘格式（HH:MM"
"）顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Worked Extra Hours`: The unpaid overtime hours worked beyond the "
"expected working schedule for that specific entry (shows **only** when "
"present for the employee)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`額外工作時數`：該特定記項中超出預期工作時間表的無薪加班時數（**僅"
"在**該員工有此記錄時顯示）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:138
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Hours`: The approved overtime for that specific entry (the "
":guilabel:`Worked Time` minus the approved :guilabel:`Worked Extra Hours`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:141
msgid "The details on the attendance log pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:147
msgid "Check in/check out details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:149
msgid ""
"Additional detailed check in and check out information for the attendance "
"log is available. Click the :icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`(expand)` icon in "
"the upper-right corner of the attendance log, and the detailed record loads."
msgstr ""
"考勤紀錄亦提供額外的詳細簽到及簽退資訊。點擊考勤紀錄右上角的 :icon:`fa-"
"expand` :guilabel:`（展開）` 圖示，即可載入詳細紀錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:153
msgid ""
"The following additional information appears for both the *Check In* and "
"*Check Out* sections, which appear in the expanded attendance log."
msgstr "在展開的考勤紀錄中，*簽到* 及 *簽退* 部分均會顯示以下額外資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mode`: The attendance submission method. The available options "
"are:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`模式`：考勤提交方式。可用選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:158
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Systray`: The employee checked in or out :doc:`directly from the "
"database <../attendances/check_in_check_out>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`系統托盤`：僱員:doc:`直接從數據庫 <../attendances/"
"check_in_check_out>`簽到或簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:160
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Kiosk`: The employee checked in or out using an :ref:`attendance "
"kiosk <attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`自助服務站`：員工使用 :ref:`考勤自助服務站 <attendances/kiosk-"
"mode-entry>` 簽到或簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:162
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual`: The employee's manager or an **Attendances** app "
"administrator :ref:`manually created the attendance record "
"<attendances/create-records>`. This typically occurs when an employee "
"forgets to check in or check out."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`手動`：員工的主管或 **出勤** 應用程式管理員 :ref:`手動建立了出勤記"
"錄 <attendances/create-records>`。這通常發生在員工忘記簽到或簽退時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`IP Address`: The device's IP address used to check in or out."
msgstr ":guilabel:`IP 位址`：裝置用作簽到或簽退的 IP 位址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:167
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Browser`: The web browser the employee used to check in or out."
msgstr ":guilabel:`瀏覽器`：員工簽到或簽退時使用的網頁瀏覽器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:168
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Localisation`: The city and country associated with the "
"computer's IP address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:169
msgid ""
":guilabel:`GPS Coordinates`: The coordinates when the user checked in or "
"out. To view the coordinates on a map, click the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`View on Maps` button beneath the GPS coordinates. This opens a "
"map in a new browser tab, with the location pointed out."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`GPS 座標`：用戶簽到或簽退時的座標。要在地圖上查看座標，請點擊 GPS "
"座標下方的 :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`在地圖上查看` 按鈕。這會在新的瀏"
"覽器分頁中開啟地圖，並標示該位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:173
msgid "The detailed information for an attendance entry."
msgstr "考勤記錄的詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:177
msgid "Attendance errors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:179
msgid ""
"Entries that contain an error appear on the overview dashboard in red. In "
"the :icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`(Gantt)` view, the entry appears with a red "
"background; in the :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(List)` view, the entry "
"text appears in red."
msgstr ""
"包含錯誤的記錄會在概覽儀表板上以紅色顯示。在:icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`（甘"
"特圖）`檢視中，該記錄會以紅色背景顯示；在:icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`（清"
"單）`檢視中，記錄文字會以紅色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:183
msgid ""
"An error occurs when an employee has checked in but not checked out within "
"24 hours, or when a single check-in period exceeds 16 hours."
msgstr ""
"如員工已簽到但未於 24 小時內簽退，或單次簽到時段超過 16 小時，系統便會顯示錯"
"誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:186
msgid ""
"To fix the error, the attendance entry must be modified or deleted. Click on"
" the entry to reveal a pop-up containing the details for that particular "
"entry. To modify the :guilabel:`Check In` or :guilabel:`Check Out` "
"information, click on the :guilabel:`Check In` or :guilabel:`Check Out` "
"field, and a calendar selector appears. Click on the desired date, then use "
"the time selector beneath the calendar to select the specific time for the "
"entry. When the information is correct, click :guilabel:`Apply.`"
msgstr ""
"要修正錯誤，必須修改或刪除該出勤紀錄。點擊該紀錄，即可顯示包含該項紀錄詳情的"
"彈出視窗。若要修改:guilabel:`簽到`或:guilabel:`簽退`資料，請點擊:guilabel:`簽"
"到`或:guilabel:`簽退`欄位，系統隨即會顯示日曆選擇器。點擊所需日期，然後使用日"
"曆下方的時間選擇器選取該紀錄的具體時間。確認資料無誤後，點擊:guilabel:`套用"
"。`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:193
msgid ""
"When all the information on the pop-up is correct, click :guilabel:`Save & "
"Close`. When the entry no longer has an error, the entry appears in gray "
"instead of red."
msgstr ""
"當彈出視窗上的所有資料正確無誤時，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存並關閉`。當記項不再有錯"
"誤時，該記項會由紅色變為灰色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_logs.rst:196
msgid ""
"To delete an entry, click the red :guilabel:`Delete` button on the pop-up "
"window instead of making modifications to the entry."
msgstr ""
"如要刪除項目，請按一下彈出視窗上的紅色 :guilabel:`刪除` 按鈕，而不要修改該項"
"目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:27
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:28
msgid "Onboarding"
msgstr "入職流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Attendances** application allows for various ways to check-in and "
"check-out of work. Managers or HR workers may need to train employees on the"
" various methods available. Odoo's **Attendances** application has an "
"onboarding feature to aid with employee training."
msgstr ""
"**出勤**應用程式支援多種上班打卡及下班打卡方式。管理人員或人力資源人員可能需"
"要培訓員工使用各種可用方法。Odoo 的**出勤**應用程式設有入門引導功能，以協助進"
"行員工培訓。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:9
msgid ""
"To open the *Onboarding* screen, navigate to :menuselection:`Attendances app"
" --> Configuration --> Onboarding`. The screen loads an onboarding "
"dashboard, with three options to check-in: :ref:`manually "
"<attendances/onboard-manual>`, with a :ref:`barcode <attendances/onboard-"
"barcode>`, or with an :ref:`RFID token <attendances/onboard-rfid>`."
msgstr ""
"要開啟 *入職* 畫面，請前往 :menuselection:`考勤應用程式 --> 配置 --> 入職`。"
"畫面會載入入職儀表板，提供三種簽到方式：:ref:`手動簽到 <attendances/onboard-"
"manual>`、使用 :ref:`條碼 <attendances/onboard-barcode>`，或使用 :ref:`RFID "
"權杖 <attendances/onboard-rfid>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:15
msgid "This can be done on either a PC or tablet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:17
msgid ""
"The onboarding screen in the Attendances app, with three options to check-"
"in."
msgstr "「考勤」應用程式的入門畫面，提供三個簽到選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:21
msgid ""
"When onboarding employees using the *Onboarding* interface, any attendance "
"logs created are reflected in the database. This means that employees who "
"check-in during onboarding training are logged into work in the "
"**Attendances** app."
msgstr ""
"使用 *入職* 介面為員工辦理入職時，任何建立的出勤紀錄都會反映在資料庫中。這表"
"示在入職培訓期間簽到的員工，亦會在 **出勤** 應用程式中記錄為已上班。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:25
msgid ""
"If managers want to use the *Onboarding* dashboard as a training *only*, "
"they must check attendance records and make any necessary modifications, so "
"all attendance records are accurate and reflect the correct working hours."
msgstr ""
"如果經理希望將 *入職* 儀表板 *僅* 用作培訓用途，必須檢查考勤記錄並作出任何必"
"要修改，以確保所有考勤記錄準確無誤，並反映正確的工作時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:32
msgid "Manual selection"
msgstr "手動選取"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:34
msgid ""
"On the *Onboarding* screen, click or tap on the image above the text "
":guilabel:`Select on Tablet`. A dashboard loads with all employees listed in"
" a default Kanban view. All Kanban cards indicate the employee's current "
"status with either a red :guilabel:`Absent` or a green :guilabel:`On Site` "
"text in the upper-right corner of the card."
msgstr ""
"在*入職引導*畫面上，點擊或輕觸 :guilabel:`在平板電腦上選擇` 文字上方的圖片。"
"系統會載入儀表板，並以預設的看板視圖列出所有員工。所有看板卡片的右上角都會以"
"紅色 :guilabel:`缺席` 或綠色 :guilabel:`在場` 文字顯示員工目前的狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:39
msgid ""
"The manual selection check in screen in the Attendances app onboarding."
msgstr "考勤應用程式入門引導中的手動選擇簽到畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:42
msgid ""
"Navigate to the desired employee, then click or tap their Kanban card. The "
"employee is automatically checked-in or checked-out depending on their "
"status in the **Attendances** app. The screen briefly displays a *Welcome* "
"or *Goodbye* screen with the current date and time, along with any "
"previously logged attendance hours."
msgstr ""
"前往目標員工，然後點按或輕觸其看板卡片。系統會根據員工在**考勤**應用程式中的"
"狀態，自動為其簽到或簽退。畫面會短暫顯示*歡迎*或*再見*畫面，並列出目前的日期"
"、時間及先前已記錄的考勤時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:47
msgid ""
"After the specified period of time designated in the :ref:`kiosk settings "
"<attendances/kiosk-settings>` has elapsed, the screen reverts to the main "
"*Onboarding* dashboard. To exit the screen sooner, click the :guilabel:`OK` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"當超過 :ref:`自助服務站設定 <attendances/kiosk-settings>` 中所指定的時間後，"
"畫面便會返回主要的 *入職* 儀表板。如要提早離開畫面，請點擊 :guilabel:`確定` "
"按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:52
msgid ""
"The list of departments on the left-side or the search bar at the top can be"
" used to navigate to the desired employee."
msgstr "可使用左側的部門列表或頂部的搜尋欄，前往所需的員工記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:58
msgid "Badge with barcode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:60
msgid ""
"The second option available to check-in or check-out is to use an ID badge "
"that has a barcode on it. Click or tap on the center image above the text "
":guilabel:`Badge with Barcode on Tablet`, and a dashboard loads displaying "
"two options: :guilabel:`Scan your badge` and :guilabel:`New Set-up "
"(Employee/Badge)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:65
msgid ""
"If the employee has an ID badge with a barcode, click the :guilabel:`Scan "
"your badge` button to scan the barcode using either the device's camera or a"
" dedicated barcode scanner. A *Barcode Scanner* pop-up window loads and "
"displays the area being scanned. Scan the barcode to check in or check out "
"of the database."
msgstr ""
"如果員工持有附有條碼的識別證，請點擊 :guilabel:`掃描您的識別證` 按鈕，使用裝"
"置的相機或專用條碼掃描器掃描條碼。系統會載入 *條碼掃描器* 彈出視窗並顯示掃描"
"區域。掃描條碼即可在資料庫中簽到或簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:70
msgid "The barcode scanning dashboard from the Onboarding screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:74
msgid ""
"The **Barcode** app does **not** need to be installed to use the barcode "
"option."
msgstr "使用條碼選項時，並 **不需要** 安裝 **條碼** 應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:77
msgid "Create a new barcode"
msgstr "建立新條碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:79
msgid ""
"If the employee does *not* have a barcode, click the :guilabel:`New Set-up "
"(Employee/Badge)` button to bring up the *Set-up* pop-up window. Using the "
"drop-down menu beneath the text :guilabel:`Select Employee Without Badge`, "
"select the *existing* employee who does **not** have a barcode. Next, enter "
"the new barcode in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"如果員工 *沒有* 條碼，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增設定（員工/識別證）` 按鈕以開啟 "
"*設定* 彈出視窗。使用文字 :guilabel:`選擇沒有識別證的員工` 下方的下拉式選單，"
"選擇 **沒有** 條碼的 *現有* 員工。接著，在相應欄位輸入新條碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:84
msgid ""
"Once completed, click the :guilabel:`Set the Badge` button. The *Set-up* "
"pop-up window closes, and a notification stating `Badge assigned "
"successfully!` appears in the upper-right corner of the *Onboarding* "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"完成後，點擊:guilabel:`設定員工證`按鈕。*設定*彈出視窗隨即關閉，而*入職*儀表"
"板的右上角會出現通知，顯示 `已成功指派員工證！`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:88
msgid ""
"The new badge number appears in the *RFID/Badge Number* field in the "
"*Settings* tab on the :ref:`employee's form <employees/new_employee/hr-attn-"
"pos>`."
msgstr ""
"新的員工證編號會顯示在:ref:`員工表單 <employees/new_employee/hr-attn-pos>`的 "
"*設定* 分頁中的 *RFID/員工證編號* 欄位內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:91
msgid "A barcode set-up pop-up window with a new barcode entered."
msgstr "已輸入新條碼的條碼設定彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:95
msgid ""
"The *Set-up* pop-up window **only** creates a new barcode and stores the "
"number on the employee's record. The barcode must be printed to scan it with"
" the :guilabel:`Badge with Barcode on Tablet` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:99
msgid ""
"If the employee already has a barcode on their profile, the current barcode "
"is replaced with the newly entered one."
msgstr "如果員工的個人檔案上已有條碼，現有條碼將會被新輸入的條碼取代。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:103
msgid "Create a new employee"
msgstr "建立新員工"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:105
msgid ""
"If an employee has **not** been created in the system, a new employee can be"
" added to the database from the *Set-up* pop-up window. Type in the "
"employee's name in the field below :guilabel:`Create the name of the new "
"employee below`, then click the :guilabel:`Confirm` button."
msgstr ""
"如果系統中 **尚未** 建立員工，可從 *設定* 彈出視窗將新員工新增至資料庫。在 "
":guilabel:`在下方建立新員工名稱` 下方的欄位輸入員工姓名，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`確認` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:109
msgid ""
"The *Set-up* pop-up window closes, and a notification stating `Employee "
"created successfully!` appears in the upper-right corner of the *Onboarding*"
" dashboard."
msgstr ""
"*設定*彈出式視窗會關閉，*入職*儀表板右上角會顯示通知，提示「`已成功建立員工"
"！`」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:113
msgid ""
"The *Set-up* pop-up window only creates a new employee record in the "
"**Employees** app. A barcode must be created and printed to scan it with the"
" :guilabel:`Badge with Barcode on Tablet` option."
msgstr ""
"*設定* 彈出視窗只會在 **員工** 應用程式中建立新的員工紀錄。必須建立並列印條碼"
"，才能透過 :guilabel:`平板電腦條碼識別證` 選項進行掃描。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:119
msgid "RFID token"
msgstr "RFID 權杖"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:121
msgid ""
"The third option available to check in on the *Onboarding* dashboard is to "
"use an RFID token. Click the button above the text :guilabel:`RFID Token "
"with reader on tablet` to bring up a dashboard with two options: "
":guilabel:`Scan your badge`, or :guilabel:`New Set-up (Employee/Badge)`."
msgstr ""
"在*入職*儀表板上簽到的第三個選項是使用 RFID 權杖。點擊:guilabel:`配合平板電腦"
"讀卡器的 RFID 權杖`文字上方的按鈕，即可開啟包含兩個選項的儀表板"
"：:guilabel:`掃描您的識別證`或:guilabel:`新設定（員工／識別證）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:125
msgid ""
"If the employee has an RFID token, click the :guilabel:`Scan your badge` "
"button to scan the RFID token using a connected RFID reader."
msgstr ""
"如果員工持有 RFID 感應卡，請按一下 :guilabel:`掃描您的員工證` 按鈕，透過已連"
"接的 RFID 讀卡機掃描 RFID 感應卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_onboarding.rst:129
msgid ""
"To use this feature, both RFID key fobs *and* an RFID reader **must** be "
"purchased. Follow the manufacturer's directions to install the RFID reader "
"and set up the RFID key fob."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:3
msgid "Attendance reporting"
msgstr "出勤報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Attendances** app report helps managers find attendance issues with "
"employees before they become a problem. The report can give insights on "
"trends by determining :ref:`which employees are working more overtime "
"<attendances/overtime>`, and who is :ref:`not working their full shifts "
"<attendances/absent>`."
msgstr ""
"**出勤** 應用程式報表有助管理人員在員工出勤問題惡化前及早察覺。該報表能透過確"
"定 :ref:`哪些員工加班較多 <attendances/overtime>`，以及誰 :ref:`未有完成完整"
"更期 <attendances/absent>`，從而提供趨勢分析。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:11
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:12
msgid "View report"
msgstr "檢視報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:13
msgid ""
"To view the attendances report, click :guilabel:`Reporting` in the top menu."
" The default report displays attendance information for current employees "
"over the past three months, in a default :icon:`oi-view-pivot` "
":guilabel:`Pivot table`. The rows are populated by employee, while the "
"columns are populated by the various attendance records. All entries are "
"grouped by month."
msgstr ""
"要檢視考勤報告，請按一下頂部選單中的 :guilabel:`報告` 。預設報告會以預設的 "
":icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`樞紐分析表` 顯示現職員工過去三個月的考勤資料"
"。資料列按員工顯示，資料欄則顯示各項考勤紀錄。所有項目均按月分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:18
msgid "The columns presented are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:20
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Worked Hours`: The total logged time the employee worked for the "
"month."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:21
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Hours`: The number of hours the employee should have "
"worked for the month, calculated from their :ref:`working schedule "
"<employees/schedule>`, configured on their employee form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Difference`: The difference from the :guilabel:`Expected Hours` "
"and the :guilabel:`Worked Hours` for the employee that month."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`差異`：該員工當月 :guilabel:`預期工時` 與 :guilabel:`工作時數` 之"
"間的差額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Balance`: The difference between the *approved* overtime, and the"
" *total* overtime worked."
msgstr ":guilabel:`結餘`：*已批准* 的加班時數與 *總* 加班時數之間的差額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:29
msgid ""
"To present different information, adjust the filters and groups in the same "
"way as in the :guilabel:`Overview` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"如要顯示其他資料，請按照與 :guilabel:`概覽` 儀表板相同的方式調整篩選條件及分"
"組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:32
msgid ""
"The default report view, with all the optional view buttons highlighted."
msgstr "預設報表檢視，所有可選檢視按鈕均已重點標示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:38
msgid "Use case: monthly overtime"
msgstr "使用案例：每月加班"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:40
msgid ""
"Overtime affects a company's bottom line, as most companies budget for "
"employee salaries. When salaries exceed the expected amount, companies may "
"see a rise in overhead costs when salary budgets are exceeded. This is why "
"the attendance report is needed, to ensure no excessive overtime is logged."
msgstr ""
"加班會影響公司的盈利，因為大多數公司都會為員工薪金編製預算。當薪金超出預期金"
"額及預算時，公司的營運開支亦可能會隨之上升。因此，公司需要考勤報告，以確保不"
"會記錄過多的加班時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:45
msgid ""
"To view a specific month's overtime, by employee, click "
":guilabel:`Reporting` in the top menu of the **Attendances** app. Remove the"
" default :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Date: Month > Employee` grouping in the"
" search bar. Click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(Toggle Search "
"Panel)` icon at the end of the search bar, then click :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`Date`, and click the desired month."
msgstr ""
"如要按員工查看特定月份的加班時間，請按一下 **出勤** 應用程式頂部選單中的 "
":guilabel:`報告`。移除搜尋列中預設的 :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`日期：月"
"份 > 員工` 分組。按一下搜尋列末端的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(切換搜"
"尋面板)` 圖示，然後按一下 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`日期`，再按一下所"
"需的月份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:50
msgid ""
"Next, click the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` button in the "
"upper-left corner, and deselect :guilabel:`Expected Hours` and "
":guilabel:`Worked Hours`. This presents the :guilabel:`Difference` and "
":guilabel:`Balance` attendance data for the selected month, grouped by "
"employee."
msgstr ""
"接下來，點擊左上角的:guilabel:`度量` :icon:`fa-caret-down` 按鈕，並取消選"
"取:guilabel:`預期工時`及:guilabel:`實際工時`。這樣便會按員工分組顯示所選月份"
"的:guilabel:`差異`及:guilabel:`結餘`出勤資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:55
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Difference` shows the month's total overtime logged, and the "
":guilabel:`Balance` shows the portion still unapproved. Click the "
":guilabel:`Difference` column to sort by the amount of overtime. The highest"
" positive number is the most overtime logged for that month."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:60
msgid ""
"In the below example, a total of 38 hours and 53 minutes of overtime was "
"approved for the month of April. :guilabel:`Michael Williams` has the most "
"overtime, with 10 hours and 25 minutes logged. Of that overtime, only 25 "
"minutes was unapproved, for a total of ten paid overtime hours."
msgstr ""
"在以下範例中，四月份合共批准了 38 小時 53 分鐘的加班時間。:guilabel:`Michael "
"Williams` 的加班時間最多，記錄為 10 小時 25 分鐘。在該加班時間中，只有 25 分"
"鐘未獲批准，合共為 10 小時有薪加班時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:64
msgid "The attendances report, showing only overtime for the month of April."
msgstr "出勤報告，僅顯示四月份的加班時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:70
msgid "Use case: absenteeism"
msgstr "使用案例：缺勤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:72
msgid ""
"Employees with a negative :guilabel:`Difference` indicate that they have not"
" worked their expected shifts. This can be from forgetting to log in and out"
" of work, or for working less hours than expected, without any approved time"
" off."
msgstr ""
"員工的:guilabel:`差異`為負數，表示他們未有按預期班次工作。這可能是因為忘記打"
"卡上下班，或在沒有獲批休假的情況下，實際工時少於預期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:76
msgid ""
"To view the attendance data for the last three months, to identify any "
"trends, first open the **Attendances** app report. Next, click the "
":guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` button in the upper-left corner, "
"and ensure  **only** :guilabel:`Difference` is selected."
msgstr ""
"要查看過去三個月的出勤數據以識別任何趨勢，請先開啟 **出勤** 應用程式報表。然"
"後，點擊左上角的 :guilabel:`指標` :icon:`fa-caret-down` 按鈕，並確保 **只** "
"選取 :guilabel:`差異`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:80
msgid ""
"Next, reset the row data by clicking :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` "
":guilabel:`Total` at the top of the rows. Then click :icon:`fa-plus-square` "
":guilabel:`Total` and select :guilabel:`Employee`. Click the "
":guilabel:`Difference` column name to sort by the total difference in logged"
" hours from the expected hours."
msgstr ""
"接下來，按一下資料列頂端的 :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`總計` 以重設"
"資料列數據。然後按一下 :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`總計` 並選取 "
":guilabel:`員工`。按一下 :guilabel:`差異` 欄名稱，以按已記錄時數與預期時數的"
"總差異進行排序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:85
msgid ""
"The employee who worked the least has the highest negative balance. Click on"
" any of the numbers for the employee to view the detailed individual "
"attendance records."
msgstr ""
"工作時數最少的員工會有最大的負結餘。點擊該員工的任何數字，即可查看詳細的個人"
"考勤紀錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:89
msgid ""
"In the below example, the company has only been opened for two months, so "
"data is only available for the last two months, even though the filter "
":guilabel:`Last 3 Months` is active."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:92
msgid ""
"From this report, it is determined that :guilabel:`Abigail Peterson` worked "
"the least amount of hours over the past two months, working 25 hours less "
"than was expected."
msgstr ""
"根據此報告，:guilabel:`Abigail Peterson` 在過去兩個月的工作時數最少，比預期"
"少 25 小時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/attendance_reporting.rst:95
msgid ""
"The attendance report showing the highest absences for the last two months."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:3
msgid "BioTime integration"
msgstr "BioTime 整合"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:5
msgid ""
"BioTime is a third-party attendance application that, when integrated with "
"Odoo, retrieves attendance *punches*, or records, from a BioTime server. "
"These are converted into attendance records, eliminating the need to record "
"employee check-ins and check-outs manually in the **Attendances** app."
msgstr ""
"BioTime 是一款第三方考勤應用程式。與 Odoo 整合後，系統會從 BioTime 伺服器擷取"
"考勤 *打卡*（即記錄），並將其轉換為考勤記錄，無需在 **考勤** 應用程式中手動記"
"錄員工的簽到及簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:11
msgid ""
"The integration is built for *Biotime Cloud* **only**. This integration "
"connects to the BioTime software, **not** to ZKTeco terminals. Device "
"compatibility depends on BioTime itself. Check the official BioTime "
"supported device list for the installed version before adding a new "
"terminal."
msgstr ""
"此整合功能**僅**適用於 *Biotime Cloud*。此整合連接至 BioTime 軟件，**而非** "
"ZKTeco 終端機。裝置相容性取決於 BioTime 本身。在新增終端機前，請先查看所安裝"
"版本的 BioTime 官方支援裝置清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:16
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安裝"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:18
msgid ""
"To configure the database, a module must be installed first. Open the "
"**Apps** application, remove the default filter in the search bar, and "
"search for `ZKTeco`. Install the :guilabel:`Attendances ZKTeco BioTime` "
"module."
msgstr ""
"如要設定資料庫，必須先安裝一個模組。開啟 **應用程式** 應用程式，移除搜尋列中"
"的預設篩選條件，然後搜尋 `ZKTeco` 。安裝 :guilabel:`考勤 ZKTeco BioTime` 模組"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:25
msgid ""
"To configure the BioTime integration, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Attendances app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Scroll to "
"the *ZKTeco BioTime* section and configure the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"要配置 BioTime 整合，請前往 :menuselection:`考勤應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`。"
"捲動至 *ZKTeco BioTime* 部分並配置以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company Name`: Enter the company name that is registered on the "
"BioTime server. This is used to identify which company's data to retrieve if"
" the server hosts more than one."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司名稱`：輸入已在 BioTime 伺服器註冊的公司名稱。如伺服器託管多間"
"公司，此欄位用於識別要擷取哪間公司的數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Server URL`: Enter the full URL of the ZKTeco BioTime server."
msgstr ":guilabel:`伺服器網址`：輸入 ZKTeco BioTime 伺服器的完整網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email`: Enter the email address used to authenticate the BioTime "
"server."
msgstr ":guilabel:`電郵`：輸入用於驗證 BioTime 伺服器的電郵地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Password`: Enter the password used to authenticate the BioTime "
"server."
msgstr ":guilabel:`密碼`：輸入用於驗證 BioTime 伺服器的密碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transaction Fetch Window`: Enter the number of days of punch data"
" fetched from the BioTime server on each sync. Set the window of time wide "
"enough to cover the sync interval, so no punches are missed if a sync runs "
"late."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`交易擷取視窗`：輸入每次同步時從 BioTime 伺服器擷取的打卡資料天數。"
"請將時間範圍設定得足夠長以涵蓋同步間隔，避免因同步延遲而遺漏任何打卡記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Check-out Lookback`: Enter the number of days to search backward "
"for an open check-in when matching a check-out. If none is found within that"
" window, the check-out is left unmatched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:39
msgid ""
"Once the fields are filled in, click :guilabel:`Save`, then click the "
":guilabel:`Test Connection` button in the *ZKTeco BioTime* section. After a "
"successful connection, data can be fetched."
msgstr ""
"填寫欄位後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`，然後在 *ZKTeco BioTime* 部分點擊 "
":guilabel:`測試連線` 按鈕。連線成功後，即可擷取資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:43
msgid "Fetch transactions"
msgstr "擷取交易"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:45
msgid ""
"The devices connected to the BioTime server are referred to as *terminals*. "
"Each attendance record identifies which terminal generated the transaction."
msgstr ""
"連接至 BioTime 伺服器的裝置稱為 *終端機*。每筆考勤記錄都會識別產生該筆交易的"
"終端機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:48
msgid ""
"BioTime stores each punch as a single check-in or check-out record, while an"
" **Attendances** app record in Odoo combines both check-in and check-out "
"information in a single record. For this reason, punches retrieved from "
"BioTime are first stored separately in the database before being converted "
"into **Attendances** app records."
msgstr ""
"BioTime 會將每次打卡儲存為單獨的簽到或簽退記錄，而 Odoo 中的 **出勤** 應用程"
"式記錄則將簽到和簽退資訊結合在同一筆記錄中。因此，從 BioTime 擷取的打卡記錄會"
"先分別儲存在資料庫中，然後才轉換為 **出勤** 應用程式記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:53
msgid ""
"To view the fetched BioTime records, navigate to :menuselection:`Attendances"
" app --> Overview --> ZKTeco Transactions`. Each ZKTeco Transaction record "
"displays the following information:"
msgstr ""
"若要查看擷取的 BioTime 記錄，請前往 :menuselection:`考勤應用程式 --> 概"
"覽 --> ZKTeco 交易記錄`。每筆 ZKTeco 交易記錄均會顯示以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: The employee linked to the transaction. This is "
"matched using the :guilabel:`ZKTeco employee ID` field in the *Settings* tab"
" of the :ref:`employee form <employees/new_employee/hr-attn-pos>`. If no "
"match is found, a warning appears in the :guilabel:`Processing Note` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`員工`：與該交易關聯的員工。系統會使用 :guilabel:`ZKTeco 員工 ID` "
"欄位（位於 :ref:`員工表單 <employees/new_employee/hr-attn-pos>` 的 *設定* 分"
"頁）進行配對。若找不到相符項目，:guilabel:`處理備註` 欄位會顯示警告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Punch Time`: The punch time recorded on the BioTime server, "
"converted to the user's time zone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Either `Check-In` (mapped to a value of 0) or `Check-Out` "
"(mapped to a value of 1) on the BioTime server. Any other value is not "
"supported, and a warning notes that a valid type must be selected before "
"processing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Terminal`: The terminal, or device, that generated the "
"transaction."
msgstr ":guilabel:`終端機`：產生該交易的終端機或裝置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attendance`: The attendance record generated once the transaction"
" is processed. This field is empty until processing succeeds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is Processed`: Indicates whether the transaction has been "
"converted into an attendance record."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已處理`：顯示該交易記錄是否已轉換為考勤記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Processing Note`: Displays a warning when the transaction cannot "
"be matched or processed, for example when no matching employee or no valid "
"type is found."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`處理備註`：當無法配對或處理交易時（例如找不到相符員工或有效類型）"
"，顯示警告訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Zkteco Transaction`: The ID of the transaction on the BioTime "
"server."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Zkteco 交易`：BioTime 伺服器上的交易 ID。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:75
msgid ""
"Transactions automatically sync every 12 hours. To fetch them manually at "
"any time, click :guilabel:`Fetch` from the *ZKTeco Transactions* dashboard."
msgstr ""
"交易每 12 小時自動同步一次。如需隨時手動擷取交易，請在 *ZKTeco 交易* 儀表板上"
"按一下 :guilabel:`擷取`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:79
msgid "Process transactions"
msgstr "處理交易"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:81
msgid ""
"Processing the ZKTeco transactions converts them into **Attendances** app "
"attendance records. How a transaction is handled depends on its type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:84
msgid ""
"*Check-in* transactions create a new attendance record, unless the employee "
"already has an open attendance record (a check-in with no matching check-"
"out)."
msgstr ""
"*上班打卡* 記錄會建立一筆新的考勤記錄，除非員工已有未完成的考勤記錄（即已上班"
"打卡但尚未下班打卡）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:87
msgid ""
"*Check-out* transactions are linked to the earliest open attendance record "
"found within the :guilabel:`Check-out Lookback` period as configured in the "
"settings menu, using that record's check-out time."
msgstr ""
"*簽退* 交易會連結至在設定選單中設定的 :guilabel:`簽退回溯` 期間內找到的最早未"
"完成考勤記錄，並使用該記錄的簽退時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:92
msgid ""
"An employee **cannot** have two open attendance records at the same time."
msgstr "員工 **不可** 同時擁有兩項進行中的出勤記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:94
msgid ""
"To process a transaction, select it and click :guilabel:`Process`. If "
"processing fails, check the :guilabel:`Processing Note` field for the "
"reason. Once the record is corrected, click :guilabel:`Process` again. If "
"the punch data itself looks wrong or incomplete, click :guilabel:`Re-Fetch` "
"to pull it again from the BioTime server before reprocessing. Both actions "
"are available for a single transaction, or in bulk from the list view."
msgstr ""
"若要處理交易，請選取該交易並點擊 :guilabel:`處理`。若處理失敗，請查看 "
":guilabel:`處理備註` 欄位以了解原因。更正記錄後，請再次點擊 :guilabel:`處"
"理`。若打卡數據本身有誤或不完整，請先點擊 :guilabel:`重新擷取` 以從 BioTime "
"伺服器重新載入數據，然後再重新處理。以上兩項操作均適用於單筆交易，亦可從列表"
"檢視中批量執行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:100
msgid "The attendance records selected to be processed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:104
msgid ""
"In this example, a check-in transaction cannot be processed because an "
"earlier attendance record is still open. The transaction on January 28 is "
"not processed because an attendance record with a check-in on January 28 is "
"already open. That record must be checked out before the employee can check "
"in again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:109
msgid ""
"Once a ZKTeco Transaction is processed successfully, its associated "
"attendance record appears in the transaction's Attendance field, and the "
"attendance record's mode is set to BioTime, distinguishing it from "
"attendance entered manually or through other check-in methods."
msgstr ""
"當 ZKTeco 交易處理成功後，其關聯的出勤記錄會顯示在交易的出勤欄位中，而出勤記"
"錄的模式會設為 BioTime，以區別於手動輸入或透過其他打卡方式建立的出勤記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:113
msgid "The BioTime check-in with an error for January 28th."
msgstr "1 月 28 日出現錯誤的 BioTime 簽到記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/biotime_integration.rst:117
msgid ""
"A processed ZKTeco Transaction **cannot** be deleted while it remains linked"
" to an attendance record. Delete the attendance record first."
msgstr ""
"當已處理的 ZKTeco 交易仍連結至考勤紀錄時，**無法**將其刪除。請先刪除相關的考"
"勤紀錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:3
msgid "Check in and out"
msgstr "簽到及簽退"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Attendances** application allows users, who are logged into the "
"database, to check in and out without needing to go into the **Attendances**"
" application, or use a kiosk. For smaller companies, where every employee is"
" also a user, this feature may be useful."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **考勤** 應用程式允許已登入資料庫的用戶直接簽到及簽退，無需進入 **考"
"勤** 應用程式或使用自助終端機。對於每位員工同時亦為系統用戶的小型公司而言，此"
"功能相當實用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:9
msgid ""
"A user can check in and/or out on the main database Odoo dashboard, or while"
" inside any application. To do so, in the upper-right corner of the top main"
" header menu, which is always visible regardless of what application the "
"user is in, a :icon:`fa-circle` :guilabel:`(red circle)` or :icon:`fa-"
"circle` :guilabel:`(green circle)` is visible. Click on the colored circle "
"to reveal the attendance widget, enabling the user to check in or out."
msgstr ""
"使用者可在 Odoo 資料庫主儀表板或任何應用程式內進行簽到及／或簽退。無論目前身"
"處哪個應用程式，頂部主標題選單的右上角都會一直顯示 :icon:`fa-circle` "
":guilabel:`（紅色圓點）` 或 :icon:`fa-circle` :guilabel:`（綠色圓點）`。按一"
"下該彩色圓點即可顯示出勤小工具，讓使用者簽到或簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:18
msgid "Check in"
msgstr "簽到"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:20
msgid ""
"If the attendance widget circle is red, this indicates the user is not "
"currently checked in. Click the :icon:`fa-circle` :guilabel:`(red circle)`, "
"and the attendance widget appears, displaying a green :guilabel:`Check in` "
":icon:`fa-sign-in` button."
msgstr ""
"如果考勤小工具圓圈顯示為紅色，即表示用戶目前尚未簽到。點擊 :icon:`fa-circle` "
":guilabel:`（紅色圓圈）`，考勤小工具便會顯示，並出現綠色的 :guilabel:`簽到` "
":icon:`fa-sign-in` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:24
msgid "Top right main menu with check in button highlighted."
msgstr "右上角主選單，當中突出顯示簽到按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:27
msgid ""
"When the user checks in from the database, the **Attendances** app logs the "
"location details for the user, including the IP Address and GPS coordinates."
msgstr ""
"當用戶從資料庫簽到時，**出勤** 應用程式會記錄用戶的位置詳情，包括 IP 位址及 "
"GPS 座標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:31
msgid ""
"For the **Attendances** app to log the location details, the user must allow"
" their computer to access their location information."
msgstr "為讓 **考勤** 應用程式記錄位置詳情，用戶必須允許電腦存取其位置資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:34
msgid ""
"If the user has not already checked in and out during the current work day, "
"this button is the only visible item in the widget. If the user has "
"previously checked in and out, a :guilabel:`Total today` field appears above"
" the button, and the total amount of time that has been logged for the day "
"appears in that field, in an :guilabel:`HH:MM` (hours:minutes) format."
msgstr ""
"如果用戶在當前工作日尚未進行簽到及簽退，此按鈕將是小工具中唯一顯示的項目。如"
"果用戶早前曾簽到及簽退，按鈕上方會出現 :guilabel:`今日總計` 欄位，並以 "
":guilabel:`HH:MM`（小時：分鐘）格式顯示當日已記錄的總工時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:39
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Check in` :icon:`fa-sign-in` button to check in. The "
":icon:`fa-circle` :guilabel:`(red circle)` in the top menu changes to green,"
" and the widget changes appearance, as well. The widget updates to reflect "
"that the user has checked in, by changing the green :guilabel:`Check in` "
":icon:`fa-sign-in` button to a yellow :guilabel:`Check out` :icon:`fa-sign-"
"out` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:45
msgid "Click anywhere on the screen to close the attendance widget."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:48
msgid "Check out"
msgstr "簽退"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:50
msgid ""
"If the user is checking out for the first time, :guilabel:`Since HH:MM "
"(AM/PM)` appears at the top of the widget, with the time the user checked in"
" populating the time field. Beneath that line, the hours and minutes that "
"have elapsed since checking in are displayed in a :guilabel:`HH:MM` format. "
"As time passes, this value is updated to reflect the hours and minutes that "
"have passed since the user checked in."
msgstr ""
"如果用戶首次簽退，小工具頂部會顯示:guilabel:`自 HH:MM (AM/PM)`，時間欄位會填"
"入用戶簽到的時間。該行下方會以 :guilabel:`HH:MM` 格式顯示自簽到起經過的小時和"
"分鐘數。隨著時間推移，此數值會自動更新，以反映用戶簽到後經過的時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:56
msgid ""
"If the user has previously checked in and out, additional fields are "
"presented. A :guilabel:`Before HH:MM (AM/PM)` field appears, in addition to "
"the :guilabel:`Since HH:MM (AM/PM)` field. The times displayed in both of "
"these fields match, and are populated with the most recent check in time. "
"Beneath the :guilabel:`Before HH:MM (AM/PM)` field, the previously logged "
"time is displayed, in an :guilabel:`HH:MM` (hours:minutes) format."
msgstr ""
"如果用戶之前曾簽到及簽退，系統會顯示額外欄位。畫面會出現 :guilabel:`於 HH:MM "
"(上午/下午) 之前` 欄位，以及 :guilabel:`自 HH:MM (上午/下午) 起` 欄位。這兩個"
"欄位顯示的時間相同，並會自動填入最近一次的簽到時間。在 :guilabel:`於 HH:MM "
"(上午/下午) 之前` 欄位下方，會以 :guilabel:`HH:MM`（小時:分鐘）格式顯示先前記"
"錄的時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:62
msgid ""
"In addition, beneath both of these fields, a :guilabel:`Total today` field "
"appears. This field is the sum of both the :guilabel:`Before HH:MM (AM/PM)` "
"and :guilabel:`Since HH:MM (AM/PM)` fields, and is the total time that is "
"logged for the user, if they were to log out at that moment."
msgstr ""
"此外，在這兩個欄位下方會顯示一個 :guilabel:`今日總時數` 欄位。此欄位為 "
":guilabel:`HH:MM (AM/PM) 之前` 及 :guilabel:`自 HH:MM (AM/PM) 起` 兩個欄位的"
"總和，表示用戶若於該刻登出時所記錄的總時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:66
msgid ""
"As time passes, both the :guilabel:`Since HH:MM (AM/PM)` and "
":guilabel:`Total today` fields are updated live. To check out, click the "
"yellow :guilabel:`Check out` :icon:`fa-sign-out` button. The attendance "
"widget updates again, displaying the :guilabel:`Total today` field with the "
"logged time, while the yellow :guilabel:`Check out` :icon:`fa-sign-out` "
"button changes to a green :guilabel:`Check in` :icon:`fa-sign-in` button."
msgstr ""
"隨着時間推移，:guilabel:`自 HH:MM (AM/PM) 起` 及 :guilabel:`今日總計` 欄位均"
"會即時更新。要簽退，請點擊黃色的 :guilabel:`簽退` :icon:`fa-sign-out` 按鈕。"
"出勤小工具會再次更新，在 :guilabel:`今日總計` 欄位顯示已記錄的時間，同時黃色"
"的 :guilabel:`簽退` :icon:`fa-sign-out` 按鈕會變為綠色的 :guilabel:`簽到` "
":icon:`fa-sign-in` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:72
msgid ""
"When the user checks out from the database, the **Attendances** app logs the"
" location details for the user. This information is logged **only** if the "
"user grants permission."
msgstr ""
"當用戶從數據庫簽退時，**考勤**應用程式會記錄該用戶的位置詳細資料。**僅當**用"
"戶授予權限時，系統才會記錄此資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:75
msgid ""
"The pop-up that appears when an employee checks in inside the database."
msgstr "員工在資料庫內打卡簽到時出現的彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/check_in_check_out.rst:79
msgid ""
"The number of times a user can check in and check out is unlimited. Users "
"can check in and out without any time elapsing (a value of 00:00). Each time"
" an employee logs in and out, the information is stored and appears on the "
"main **Attendances** dashboard, including check-ins and check-outs with no "
"time value."
msgstr ""
"使用者可無限次簽到及簽退，亦可在沒有任何時間經過的情況下簽到及簽退（數值為 "
"00:00）。每次員工登入及登出時，系統都會儲存該資訊並顯示於主 **考勤** 儀表板上"
"，包括沒有時間數值的簽到及簽退記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:3
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "硬件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:5
msgid ""
"Employees who are **not** database users, and therefore, do **not** have "
"access to the **Attendances** app, must sign in and out of work using a "
"kiosk. The following are the physical requirements for setting up a kiosk."
msgstr ""
" **並非** 資料庫用戶、因此 **沒有** 權限存取 **考勤** 應用程式的員工，必須使"
"用自助終端機簽到及簽退。以下是設置自助終端機的實體設備要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:10
msgid "Kiosk devices"
msgstr "自助終端裝置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:12
msgid ""
"A kiosk is a self-service station, where employees can :ref:`check in and "
"out of work <attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>` with either a :ref:`badge "
"<attendances/hardware/badges>` or an :ref:`RFID key fob "
"<attendances/hardware/rfid>`. Typically, these devices are dedicated as "
"kiosks only, but any device with an internet browser is able to be set up as"
" a kiosk."
msgstr ""
"自助服務終端機是員工 :ref:`進行上下班簽到及簽退 <attendances/kiosk-mode-"
"entry>` 的自助站，可使用 :ref:`識別證 <attendances/hardware/badges>` 或 "
":ref:`RFID 感應匙扣 <attendances/hardware/rfid>` 進行操作。這些裝置通常專用作"
"自助服務終端機，但任何裝有互聯網瀏覽器的裝置均可設定為自助服務終端機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:17
msgid ""
"A kiosk is used by navigating to the webpage specified in the "
":ref:`configuration <attendances/kiosk-settings>` section of the "
"**Attendances** app."
msgstr ""
"如要使用自助服務站，請瀏覽 **出勤** 應用程式 :ref:`設定 <attendances/kiosk-"
"settings>` 部分所指定的網頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:20
msgid "Kiosks are set up using one of the following types of devices:"
msgstr "自助終端機可使用以下其中一種裝置類型設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:22
msgid "Laptop or Desktop computer"
msgstr "手提電腦或桌上電腦"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:23
msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "平板電腦"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:24
msgid "Mobile phone (Android or iOS)"
msgstr "手提電話（Android 或 iOS）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:27
msgid ""
"Touchscreens are easy to use, and tablets and mobile phones take up less "
"space. That is why most consider using a smaller device with a touchscreen "
"as a kiosk."
msgstr ""
"輕觸式螢幕易於使用，而平板電腦和手提電話佔用的空間較少。因此，大多數人會考慮"
"使用較小型的輕觸式螢幕裝置作為自助服務終端機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:30
msgid ""
"It is recommended to place kiosks on a secure stand, or mount them securely "
"on a wall."
msgstr "建議將自助終端機放置在穩固的底座上，或穩固地安裝在牆壁上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:52
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:3
msgid "Badges"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:37
msgid ""
"Badges are a way for employees to quickly sign in and out from a kiosk, as "
"badges are scanned by the kiosk's camera to identify the employee."
msgstr ""
"員工可使用識別證在自助終端機快速打卡簽到及簽退。自助終端機的鏡頭會掃描識別證"
"，以辨識員工身份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:40
msgid ""
"To generate a badge, first navigate to the :menuselection:`Employees app`. "
"Next, click on the desired employee card to open the employee's form, then "
"click the :guilabel:`Settings` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:43
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`ATTENDANCE/POINT OF SALE/MANUFACTURING` section, there "
"is a :guilabel:`Badge ID` field. If this field is blank, click "
":guilabel:`Generate` at the end of the :guilabel:`Badge ID` line, and the "
"field is automatically populated with a new badge ID number. Then, click "
":guilabel:`Print Badge` at the end of the badge ID number to create a PDF "
"file of the badge."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`考勤/銷售點/製造`部分下，設有:guilabel:`識別證編號`欄位。如此欄"
"位為空白，請點按:guilabel:`產生`（位於:guilabel:`識別證編號`行末端），系統便"
"會自動填入新的識別證編號。然後，點按識別證編號末端的:guilabel:`列印識別證`，"
"即可建立識別證的 PDF 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:48
msgid ""
"If a badge ID number is already present on the employee form, there is no "
":guilabel:`Generate` button, only a :guilabel:`Print Badge` button."
msgstr ""
"如果僱員表單上已有員工證編號，便不會顯示 :guilabel:`產生` 按鈕，只會顯示 "
":guilabel:`列印員工證` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:51
msgid ""
"The employee's badge contains the employee's photo, name, job position, "
"company logo, and a barcode that can be scanned at a kiosk to check in and "
"out."
msgstr ""
"員工證包含員工相片、姓名、職位、公司標誌，以及可在自助終端機掃描以進行簽到及"
"簽退的條碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:54
msgid ""
"Badges can be printed for employees using any thermal or inkjet printer."
msgstr "可使用任何熱敏式打印機或噴墨打印機為員工列印識別證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:56
msgid "A badge for an employee that is created from the Employees app."
msgstr "從「員工」應用程式建立的員工證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:60
msgid ""
"Badges are **not** required, as employees can manually identify themselves "
"on the kiosk."
msgstr "**無須** 使用識別證，因為員工可在自助終端機上手動確認身份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:63
msgid "Barcode scanners"
msgstr "條碼掃描器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:65
msgid ""
"When using badges to check in and out, the barcode **must** be scanned to "
"identify the employee. This can be done with the kiosk's camera, if one is "
"available on the device."
msgstr ""
"使用工作證簽到及簽退時，**必須**掃描條碼以識別員工身份。如果自助終端機裝置備"
"有鏡頭，可使用該鏡頭進行掃描。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:68
msgid ""
"If a camera is **not** available on the kiosk device, an external barcode "
"scanner must be used to scan badges."
msgstr "如果自助終端裝置**沒有**配備鏡頭，則必須使用外置條碼掃描器掃描員工證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:71
msgid ""
"Kiosks work with most USB barcode scanners. Bluetooth barcode scanners are "
"also supported for devices without USB ports, or if a wireless connection is"
" desired."
msgstr ""
"自助終端機支援大多數 USB 條碼掃描器。對於沒有 USB 連接埠的裝置，或如需使用無"
"線連線，亦支援藍牙條碼掃描器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:74
msgid ""
"Follow the manufacturer's instructions on the barcode scanner to properly "
"connect the barcode scanner to the kiosk device."
msgstr "請按照條碼掃描器製造商的指示，將條碼掃描器正確連接至自助終端機裝置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:78
msgid ""
"If the barcode scanner is connected directly to a computer, it :doc:`must be"
" configured <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/hardware>` to use the "
"computer's keyboard layout."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:82
msgid "An IoT box is **not** required to use a barcode scanner."
msgstr "使用條碼掃描器 **不需要** IoT 盒。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:87
msgid "RFID key fob readers"
msgstr "RFID 感應匙扣讀卡器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:89
msgid ""
"Instead of using a :ref:`badge <attendances/hardware/badges>`, employees can"
" scan a personal RFID key fob with an RFID reader to check in and out of "
"work."
msgstr ""
"員工無需使用:ref:`員工證 <attendances/hardware/badges>`，只需使用 RFID 讀卡器"
"掃描個人 RFID 鑰匙扣，即可打卡上班及下班。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:92
msgid ""
"It is **required** to purchase *both* RFID key fobs and an RFID reader to "
"use this method to check in and out. Follow the manufacturer's directions to"
" install the RFID reader, and set up the RFID key fob."
msgstr ""
"要使用此方法簽到及簽退，您 **必須** *同時* 購買 RFID 鑰匙扣及 RFID 讀卡器。請"
"按照製造商的指示安裝 RFID 讀卡器，並設定 RFID 鑰匙扣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/hardware.rst:97
msgid "An IoT box is **not** required to use RFID key fobs."
msgstr "使用 RFID 感應匙扣並 **不** 需要 IoT 盒。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:3
msgid "Kiosks"
msgstr "自助終端機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Attendances** app allows employees to check in and out of work "
"directly from the database or a kiosk."
msgstr "Odoo 的 **考勤** 應用程式讓員工直接透過資料庫或自助登記站進行上班及下班打卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:8
msgid ""
"A kiosk is a :doc:`dedicated device <hardware>` (a PC, tablet, or mobile "
"phone) for employees to use when they check in and out."
msgstr ""
"自助終端機是供員工在簽到及簽退時使用的 :doc:`專用裝置 <hardware>`（個人電腦、"
"平板電腦或手提電話）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:11
msgid ""
"Kiosks are needed for employees who do **not** have access to the database."
msgstr "**沒有** 資料庫存取權限的員工需要使用自助終端機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:13
msgid ""
"Only employees with access to the Odoo database can check in and out from "
"the **Attendances** app, and they are referred to as *users*."
msgstr ""
"只有具備 Odoo 資料庫存取權限的員工，才可在 **考勤** 應用程式中簽到及簽退，這"
"些員工稱為 *使用者*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:17
msgid ""
"If employees :ref:`check in and out <attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>` using a "
"badge or an RFID, then an :doc:`accessible device <hardware>` in :ref:`Kiosk"
" Mode <attendances/kiosk-mode>` **must** be available in order to use these "
"two methods."
msgstr ""
"如果員工使用工作證或 RFID :ref:`簽到及簽退 <attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>`，"
"則 **必須** 備有一部 :doc:`可用裝置 <hardware>` 並開啟 :ref:`自助終端機模式 "
"<attendances/kiosk-mode>`，方可使用這兩種方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:24
msgid ""
"To use kiosks in the **Attendances** application, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Attendances app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and "
"configure the :ref:`Modes section <attendances/kiosk-mode>` and the "
":ref:`attendances/kiosk-settings`."
msgstr ""
"要在 **考勤** 應用程式中使用自助打卡機，請前往 :menuselection:`考勤應用程"
"式 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並設定 :ref:`模式部分 <attendances/kiosk-mode>` 及 "
":ref:`attendances/kiosk-settings`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:28
msgid ""
"Once all desired settings have been configured, click the :guilabel:`Save` "
"button on the :guilabel:`Settings` page to activate and enable them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:34
msgid "Modes section"
msgstr "模式區段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:36
msgid ""
"Determine how an employee checks in at a kiosk, either by searching for "
"their name (:guilabel:`Manual Selection`), scanning an employee ID or key "
"fob (:guilabel:`Barcode/RFID`), or both."
msgstr ""
"決定員工如何在自助服務站打卡上班，可選擇搜尋姓名（:guilabel:`手動選擇`）、掃"
"描員工識別證或感應匙扣（:guilabel:`條碼/RFID`），或兩者皆可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:40
msgid ""
"On the settings page, using the drop-down menu for the :guilabel:`Kiosk "
"Mode` :icon:`fa-building-o` field in the :guilabel:`Modes` section, make the"
" desired selection. Options are :guilabel:`Barcode/RFID`, "
":guilabel:`Barcode/RFID and Manual Selection`, or :guilabel:`Manual "
"Selection`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:46
msgid ""
"The **Barcode** application **does not** need to be installed to use one of "
"the Barcode/RFID settings."
msgstr "使用其中一項條碼／RFID 設定 **無須** 安裝 **條碼** 應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:52
msgid "Kiosk Settings section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:54
msgid ""
"The various settings in the :guilabel:`Kiosk Settings` section determine how"
" employees check in and out with kiosks."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`自助終端機設定` 部份中的各項設定，決定員工如何使用自助終端機簽"
"到及簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Barcode Source` :icon:`fa-building-o`: This setting appears "
"**only** if one of the two *Barcode/RFID* selections were configured for the"
" :ref:`Kiosk Mode <attendances/kiosk-mode>` setting."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`條碼來源` :icon:`fa-building-o`：此設定 **僅** 在為 :ref:`自助終端"
"模式 <attendances/kiosk-mode>` 設定配置了兩個 *條碼/RFID* 選項之一時才會顯示"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:61
msgid ""
"If available, select how barcodes are scanned at the kiosk from the drop-"
"down menu. Barcodes can be scanned with a dedicated :guilabel:`Scanner`, or "
"with a device's :guilabel:`Front Camera` or :guilabel:`Back Camera`."
msgstr ""
"如適用，請從下拉式選單選取自助終端機掃描條碼的方式。你可以使用專"
"用:guilabel:`掃描器`，或裝置的:guilabel:`前置鏡頭`或:guilabel:`後置鏡頭`掃描"
"條碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display Time` :icon:`fa-building-o`: Determine how many seconds a"
" check-in/check-out confirmation message remains on the kiosk screen before "
"returning to the main check-in screen."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`顯示時間` :icon:`fa-building-o`：決定簽到／簽退確認訊息在返回主簽"
"到畫面之前，於自助終端機螢幕停留的秒數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee PIN Identification`: Click this checkbox to require "
"employees to use a unique PIN to check in. PINs are configured on each "
"individual employee record. Refer to the :ref:`new employee documentation "
"<employees/hr-settings>` for more information on setting up PINs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attendance Kiosk Url`: Odoo generates a unique web address (URL) "
"to use a device as a kiosk, without having to sign in to the Odoo database. "
"When setting up a kiosk device, navigate to this unique web address in a web"
" browser to present the **Attendances** app kiosk."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`考勤自助終端網址`：Odoo 會產生一個專屬網址（URL），讓您在無需登入 "
"Odoo 資料庫的情況下，將裝置用作自助終端。設定自助終端裝置時，只需在網頁瀏覽器"
"中前往此專屬網址，即可顯示**考勤**應用程式的自助終端介面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:74
msgid ""
"These kiosk URLs are **not** secured with any type of access code. Anyone "
"who has the URL can access the **Attendances** app kiosk. If the URL is "
"compromised for any reason, such as in the event of a security breach, click"
" :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Generate new URL`, located beneath the link, "
"to generate a new URL and update the kiosk accordingly."
msgstr ""
"這些自助終端機網址 **並未** 設有任何存取碼保護。任何擁有該網址的人均可存取 "
"**考勤** 應用程式的自助終端機。若網址因任何原因（例如發生保安漏洞）而外洩，請"
"按一下連結下方的 :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`產生新網址`，以產生新網址並相"
"應更新自助終端機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:82
msgid "Kiosk mode"
msgstr "自助終端模式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:84
msgid ""
"Entering *Kiosk Mode* is **only** available for users with specific "
":ref:`access rights <attendances/access-rights>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:87
msgid "*Kiosk Mode* can be activated in two different ways:"
msgstr "可以透過兩種不同方式啟用*自助服務機模式*："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:89
msgid ""
"Navigate to the :menuselection:`Attendances app`, and click :guilabel:`Kiosk"
" Mode` in the top menu. The device then signs out of Odoo and enters *Kiosk "
"Mode*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:91
msgid ""
"Navigate to the :menuselection:`Attendances app --> Configuration`. In the "
":guilabel:`Kiosk Settings` section, use the link in the "
":guilabel:`Attendance Kiosk Url` field to open *Kiosk Mode* on any device."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`出勤應用程式 --> 配置` 。在 :guilabel:`自助終端設定` 部"
"分，使用 :guilabel:`出勤自助終端網址` 欄位的連結，即可在任何裝置上開啟 *自助"
"終端模式* 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:95
msgid ""
"The Attendances Kiosk URL field in the settings section of the Attendances "
"application."
msgstr "「考勤」應用程式設定部分中的「考勤自助服務站網址」欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:99
msgid ""
"As a security measure, once a device is in *Kiosk Mode*, it is not possible "
"to go back into the database without signing back in."
msgstr "為保障安全，裝置一旦進入 *Kiosk 模式*，便無法在未重新登入的情況下返回資料庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:103
msgid ""
"At any time, a new kiosk URL can be generated, if needed. Click the "
":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Generate a new Kiosk Mode URL`"
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可隨時產生新的自助服務模式網址。按一下 :icon:`fa-refresh` "
":guilabel:`產生新的自助服務模式網址`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:106
msgid ""
"The kiosk loads, displaying the current date and time, along with the "
"following banner at the top: :guilabel:`Connect an RFID reader, and scan a "
"token. 'Read the Documentation'/ 'Buy an RFID Device`."
msgstr ""
"自助終端機載入後會顯示目前日期及時間，並在頂部顯示以下橫幅：:guilabel:`連接 "
"RFID 讀卡器並掃描憑證。「閱讀說明文件」/「購買 RFID 裝置」`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:109
msgid ""
"Click the text link :guilabel:`Read the Documentation` to open the "
":doc:`corresponding documentation <../attendances/hardware>` in a new tab. "
"Click the text link :guilabel:`Buy an RFID Device` to open a new tab with "
"available products to purchase on Amazon. Close either tab to return to the "
"kiosk."
msgstr ""
"點擊文字連結 :guilabel:`閱讀文件`，以在新分頁中開啟:doc:`相應文件 <../"
"attendances/hardware>`。點擊文字連結 :guilabel:`購買 RFID 裝置`，以在新分頁中"
"開啟 Amazon 上可供購買的產品頁面。關閉任一分頁即可返回自助服務站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:113
msgid ""
"At the end of the text, an :guilabel:`X` appears. Click the :guilabel:`X` to"
" close the banner. Closing the banner hides it from that point on, and "
"*cannot be enabled again*."
msgstr ""
"在文字結尾會出現一個 :guilabel:`X`。點擊 :guilabel:`X` 即可關閉橫額。關閉後，"
"該橫額將會從此隱藏，且 *無法再次啟用*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:116
msgid ""
"To exit *Kiosk Mode*, either close the tab in the web browser or return to "
"the main log-in screen of Odoo."
msgstr "要退出 *自助終端模式*，可關閉網頁瀏覽器中的分頁，或返回 Odoo 的主登入畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:122
msgid "Check in and out with a kiosk"
msgstr "使用自助終端機簽到及簽退"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:125
msgid "Badge"
msgstr "徽章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:127
msgid ""
"To check in or out using a badge, tap the :icon:`fa-barcode` :guilabel:`Scan"
" your badge` image in the center of the kiosk."
msgstr ""
"如要使用識別證簽到或簽退，請輕按自助終端機中央的 :icon:`fa-barcode` "
":guilabel:`掃描您的識別證` 圖像。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:130
msgid "The Attendances Kiosk view displaying the scan badge image."
msgstr "顯示掃描職員證圖像的「出勤」自助終端視圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:133
msgid ""
"Then, scan the barcode on the badge using the method configured in the "
":ref:`Kiosk Settings <attendances/kiosk-settings>` section of the "
"configuration menu."
msgstr ""
"然後，使用設定選單中 :ref:`Kiosk 設定 <attendances/kiosk-settings>` 部分所配"
"置的方法，掃描識別證上的條碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:136
msgid ""
"Once the barcode is scanned, the employee is checked in or out, and a "
":ref:`confirmation message <attendances/confirmation>` appears with all the "
"information."
msgstr ""
"掃描條碼後，系統會為員工完成上班或下班打卡，並顯示 :ref:`確認訊息 "
"<attendances/confirmation>`，當中包含所有資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:140
msgid "RFID"
msgstr "RFID"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:142
msgid ""
"To check in or out using an RFID key fob, scan the fob with an RFID reader."
msgstr "如要使用 RFID 感應鑰匙扣打卡簽到或簽退，請使用 RFID 讀卡器掃描鑰匙扣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:144
msgid ""
"Once scanned, the employee is either checked in or checked out, and a "
":ref:`confirmation message <attendances/confirmation>` appears with all the "
"information."
msgstr ""
"掃描後，員工便會完成簽到或簽退，並會顯示包含所有資料的 :ref:`確認訊息 "
"<attendances/confirmation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:148
msgid "Manually"
msgstr "手動"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:150
msgid ""
"Users who do not have a scannable badge or an RFID fob can manually check in"
" and out at a kiosk."
msgstr "沒有可掃描職員證或 RFID 感應扣的使用者，可在自助終端機手動簽到及簽退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:152
msgid ""
"Tap the :icon:`fa-user-o` :guilabel:`Identify Manually` button on the kiosk,"
" and a screen appears with all the employees who can be checked in or out. "
"Tap on a person to check them in or out, and a :ref:`confirmation message "
"<attendances/confirmation>` appears."
msgstr ""
"點按自助終端上的 :icon:`fa-user-o` :guilabel:`手動識別` 按鈕，畫面隨即會顯示"
"所有可簽到或簽退的員工。點按員工即可為其簽到或簽退，並會顯示 :ref:`確認訊息 "
"<attendances/confirmation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:156
msgid "To find a specific person, either:"
msgstr "要尋找特定人員，可選擇以下任一方式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:158
msgid ""
"Search: Tap into the search bar and enter the desired person's name. As the "
"name is typed, matching results are displayed on the screen."
msgstr "搜尋：輕觸搜尋列並輸入所需人士的姓名。輸入姓名時，螢幕上會顯示相符的結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:160
msgid ""
"By department: Tap on any desired selection in the department section, "
"located on the left side of the screen, to **only** view employees from that"
" specific department. The number at the end of each listed department "
"represents how many employees that department has."
msgstr ""
"按部門：點選畫面左側部門區域中的任何所需項目，即可 **僅** 檢視該特定部門的員"
"工。每個列出部門名稱末尾的數字，代表該部門的員工總數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:165
msgid "PIN"
msgstr "PIN 碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:167
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Employee PIN Identification` checkbox was ticked in the "
":ref:`Kiosk Settings <attendances/kiosk-settings>` section of the "
"configuration menu, the employee is prompted to enter a PIN when manually "
"checking in or out."
msgstr ""
"如果 :guilabel:`員工 PIN 碼識別` 核取方塊已獲勾選（位於配置選單的 :ref:`自助"
"終端設定 <attendances/kiosk-settings>` 部分），員工在手動打卡簽到或簽退時，系"
"統便會提示其輸入 PIN 碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:171
msgid ""
"After the employee is selected, a number pad appears with a message. When "
"checking in, :guilabel:`(Employee) Please enter your PIN to check in` "
"appears above the numbers. When checking out, :guilabel:`(Employee) Please "
"enter your PIN to check out` appears above the numbers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:175
msgid ""
"Tap in the PIN using the number pad, then tap :guilabel:`OK` when done. The "
"employee is then checked in or out, and a :ref:`confirmation message "
"<attendances/confirmation>` appears."
msgstr ""
"使用數字鍵盤輸入 PIN 碼，完成後輕按 :guilabel:`確定` 。員工隨即完成上班或下班"
"打卡，並會顯示 :ref:`確認訊息 <attendances/confirmation>` 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:178
msgid "The pop-up that appears when prompted to enter a pin."
msgstr "系統提示輸入 PIN 碼時顯示的彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:184
msgid "Confirmation message"
msgstr "確認訊息"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:186
msgid ""
"When an employee checks in or out, a confirmation message appears, with all "
"the check-in or check-out information."
msgstr "當員工簽到或簽退時，系統會顯示確認訊息，當中包含所有簽到或簽退資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:189
msgid ""
"When checking in, the :guilabel:`Welcome (Employee)` message appears, along "
"with the current date and time. If the employee has already checked in and "
"out that day, an :guilabel:`Hours Previously Today: HH:MM` message also "
"appears, showing the total hours logged earlier."
msgstr ""
"簽到時，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`歡迎（員工）` 訊息以及目前的日期和時間。如果員"
"工當日已簽到及簽退，系統亦會顯示 :guilabel:`今日較早時數：HH:MM` 訊息，列出較"
"早前記錄的總時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:193
msgid ""
"When checking out, :guilabel:`Goodbye (Employee)` appears, as well as the "
"date and time of checkout. Beneath the message is an :guilabel:`Hours Today:"
" HH:MM` field, with the total hours and minutes logged for the day."
msgstr ""
"簽退時，畫面會顯示 :guilabel:`再見（員工）`，以及簽退的日期和時間。該訊息下方"
"設有一個 :guilabel:`今日工時：HH:MM` 欄位，顯示當日已記錄的總小時及分鐘數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:197
msgid ""
"Beneath both the \"welcome\" and \"goodbye\" messages is an :guilabel:`OK` "
"button. To exit the screen before the preset time in the kiosk, tap the "
":guilabel:`OK` button."
msgstr ""
"在「歡迎」及「再見」訊息下方均設有 :guilabel:`確定` 按鈕。如要在自助終端預設"
"時間結束前離開畫面，請點按 :guilabel:`確定` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/kiosks.rst:200
msgid "The goodbye message with all the employee's check out information."
msgstr "包含員工所有簽退資訊的告別訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:3
msgid "Work approvals and overtime"
msgstr "工作審批及加班"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Attendances** app requires management oversight in order to ensure "
"all logged attendances are correct, especially overtime hours and incomplete"
" shifts."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **出勤** 應用程式需要管理層監督，以確保所有已記錄的出勤資料準確無誤，"
"特別是加班時數及未完成的班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:11
msgid "Management dashboard"
msgstr "管理儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:13
msgid ""
"All attendance records that require approval, typically due to overlapping "
"work entries or unapproved time off, are managed from a centralized "
"management dashboard. To access this, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Attendances app --> Management`."
msgstr ""
"所有需要審批的考勤記錄（通常因工作記錄重疊或休假未獲批准所致）均可在集中管理"
"儀表板中管理。要存取此儀表板，請前往 :menuselection:`考勤應用程式 --> 管理`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:17
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Management` dashboard only displays attendance records for "
"current employees that need to be approved, in a default list view. This is "
"due to the two default filters in the search bar, the :guilabel:`To Approve`"
" and :guilabel:`Active Employees`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:21
msgid "Each attendance record displays the following information:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:25
msgid ":guilabel:`Check Out`: The date and time the employee checked out."
msgstr ":guilabel:`簽退`：員工簽退的日期及時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Worked Time`: The number of worked hours the employee logged."
msgstr ":guilabel:`工作時間`：員工記錄的已工作時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:27
msgid ":guilabel:`Worked Extra Hours`: The amount of overtime worked."
msgstr ":guilabel:`額外工作時數`：已加班的時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:28
msgid ":guilabel:`Extra Hours`: The total approved extra hours."
msgstr ":guilabel:`額外工時`：已核准的總額外工時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:30
msgid ""
"The Attendances app Management dashboard, displaying entries needing "
"approval."
msgstr "「考勤」應用程式的管理儀表板，顯示需要審批的記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:36
msgid "Approvals and refusals"
msgstr "批准及拒絕"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:38
msgid ""
"Attendance records can be approved and refused directly from the "
":ref:`Management dashboard <attendances/dashboard>`. At the far-right of "
"each record, :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Approve` and :icon:`fa-times` "
":guilabel:`Refuse` buttons appear. Click the corresponding button to either "
"approve or refuse the logged attendance record."
msgstr ""
"考勤記錄可直接於 :ref:`管理儀表板 <attendances/dashboard>` 中批准或拒絕。在每"
"筆記錄的最右側，會顯示 :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`批准` 及 :icon:`fa-times` "
":guilabel:`拒絕` 按鈕。點擊相應按鈕即可批准或拒絕已記錄的考勤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:44
msgid ""
"When approving or refusing attendance records from the "
":guilabel:`Management` dashboard, it is **not** possible to view the details"
" of the attendance record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:48
msgid "Partial approvals"
msgstr "部分批核"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:50
msgid ""
"It is possible to approve a portion of the logged :guilabel:`Extra Hours` "
"and not the full amount. To approve only a portion of overtime, click into "
"an attendance record to view the details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:53
msgid ""
"The top half of the record displays the specific check in and check out "
"details, including the method used. The :guilabel:`Check In` and "
":guilabel:`Check Out` information in the top half of the form can be "
"modified, if needed. Click into the desired field, and make any needed "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"記錄的上半部分會顯示具體的簽到及簽退詳細資料，包括所用的方式。如有需要，可修"
"改表單上半部分的 :guilabel:`簽到` 及 :guilabel:`簽退` 資料。點擊目標欄位，然"
"後進行所需更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:57
msgid ""
"The bottom half of the form contains the *Overtime Details* tab. This tab "
"lists the overtime rules used to calculate the extra hours, along with the "
"pay rate and status. The extra hours listed in this tab can be modified, "
"allowing for partial overtime approval."
msgstr ""
"表單下半部分設有 *加班詳情* 分頁。此分頁列出用於計算額外工時的加班規則，以及"
"薪率及狀態。您可修改此分頁中列出的額外工時，以便批核部分加班時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:61
msgid ""
"Click into the :guilabel:`Extra Hours (encoded)` field of the line being "
"modified. Enter the amount of hours being approved in an `HH:MM` format, "
"then click :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Approve` at the end of the line."
msgstr ""
"點擊要修改之明細行中的 :guilabel:`額外工時（已編碼）` 欄位。以 `HH:MM` 格式輸"
"入要批准的時數，然後點擊該行末端的 :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`批准`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:65
msgid "A detailed attendance record."
msgstr "詳細的出勤紀錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:68
msgid ""
"After editing and approving the :guilabel:`Extra Hours (encoded)` field, the"
" status changes to :guilabel:`Approved`, and the :guilabel:`Extra Hours` "
"field in the top half of the form updates to display the approved overtime."
msgstr ""
"編輯並批核:guilabel:`額外工時（已登記）`欄位後，狀態會變更為:guilabel:`已批"
"核`，而表單上半部分的:guilabel:`額外工時`欄位會更新，以顯示已批核的加班時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:73
msgid ""
"Once partial overtime is approved, it is still possible to deny overtime by "
"clicking the :icon:`fa-times` icon next to the :guilabel:`Extra Hours` field"
" in the top half of the form, or clicking :icon:`fa-times` "
":guilabel:`Refuse` at the end of the overtime entry in the *Overtime "
"Details* tab."
msgstr ""
"批准部分加班後，仍可點擊 :icon:`fa-times` 圖示（位於表單上半部分 "
":guilabel:`額外工時` 欄位旁），或點擊 :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`拒絕`（位"
"於 *加班詳情* 分頁中加班記錄末端），以拒絕加班。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:79
msgid ""
"Occasionally, verifying an employee's location when checking-in may be "
"needed. The method the employee checked-in to work is found on the "
"individual record, in the :guilabel:`Mode` field."
msgstr ""
"有時可能需要核實員工簽到時的位置。員工上班簽到的方式可在個人記錄的 "
":guilabel:`模式` 欄位中查看。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:82
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Mode` field is not modifiable, as it only logs the method the"
" attendance record was created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:85
msgid "The possible options are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Kiosk`: The employee physically checked in or out using a "
":doc:`kiosk <kiosks>` device. The employee was present at the kiosk to "
"check-in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Systray`: The employee checked in or out :doc:`directly from the "
"database <check_in_check_out>`. Depending on the :guilabel:`IP Address` "
"displayed on the detailed attendance record, the employee's location at the "
"time of check-in can be determined."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`系統列`：員工:doc:`直接從資料庫 <check_in_check_out>`進行簽到或簽"
"退。根據詳細出勤記錄上顯示的 :guilabel:`IP 位址`，可判斷員工簽到時的位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual`: The record was created manually in the **Attendances** "
"app. This is typically done by management, to add a missing record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`手動`：此記錄是在**考勤**應用程式中手動建立。這通常由管理層執行，"
"用以補加遺漏的記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:96
msgid "Convert overtime to time off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:98
msgid ""
"Some companies allow for the conversion of overtime into time off. To "
"convert all or a portion of overtime into time off, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Attendances app --> Management`. Click on the desired "
"attendance record to view the specific attendance details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:102
msgid ""
"In the *Overtime Details* tab, adjust the amount of overtime being converted"
" to time off in the :guilabel:`Extra Hours (encoded)` field, if necessary. "
"Next, click the checkbox in the :guilabel:`Compensable as Time Off` column, "
"indicating the overtime should be converted to time off. Click :icon:`fa-"
"check` :guilabel:`Approve` at the end of the line, and the status changes to"
" :guilabel:`Approved`, and the :guilabel:`Extra Hours` field in the top half"
" of the form updates to reflect the approved overtime."
msgstr ""
"在 *加班詳情* 分頁中，如有需要，可在:guilabel:`額外工時（已輸入）`欄位調整轉"
"換為休假的加班時數。接著，勾選:guilabel:`可折算為休假`欄中的核取方塊，表示該"
"加班應轉換為休假。點擊該行末端的:icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`批准`，狀態便會變"
"更為:guilabel:`已批准`，而表單上半部分的:guilabel:`額外工時`欄位亦會隨之更新"
"，以反映已批准的加班時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:109
msgid "An attendance record with 2 ours of overtime converted to time off."
msgstr "將 2 小時加班轉換為休假的出勤記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:115
msgid "Create attendance records"
msgstr "建立考勤記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:117
msgid ""
"When necessary, users with the required :ref:`access rights <employees/work-"
"info-tab>` are able to create attendance records manually in the "
"**Attendances** app. Some situations requiring this is when employees forget"
" to check in and out for shifts, as employees cannot retroactively create "
"attendance records."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，具備所需:ref:`存取權限 <employees/work-info-tab>`的用戶可在**出"
"勤**應用程式中手動建立出勤記錄。員工無法補建過往的出勤記錄，因此當員工忘記在"
"更次上下班打卡時，便需要此操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:122
msgid ""
"To add a missing attendance record, navigate to :menuselection:`Attendances "
"app --> Overview --> Dashboard`. Click the :guilabel:`New` button in the "
"upper-left corner to open a *Create* pop-up window. Enter the following "
"information on the form, then click :guilabel:`Save & Close`:"
msgstr ""
"若要補加遺漏的考勤記錄，請前往 :menuselection:`考勤應用程式 --> 概覽 --> 儀表"
"板`。按一下左上角的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，開啟 *建立* 彈出視窗。在表單中輸入"
"以下資料，然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存並關閉`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: Select the employee the record is being created for. "
"The signed-in user populates this field, by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`員工`：選擇要為其建立記錄的員工。此欄位預設會自動填入目前登入的用"
"戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Check In`: Using the calendar, select the check in date and time,"
" then click :guilabel:`Apply`. By default, the current date is selected, and"
" the time is set to `12:00:AM`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`簽到`：使用行事曆選擇簽到日期及時間，然後按一下 :guilabel:`套用`。"
"系統預設會選取目前日期，並將時間設為 `12:00:AM`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Check Out`: Using the calendar, select the check out date and "
"time, then click :guilabel:`Apply`. By default, the following date is "
"selected, and the time is set to `12:00:AM`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`簽退`：使用日曆選擇簽退日期及時間，然後點擊 :guilabel:`套用`。系統"
"預設會選取翌日日期，時間則設為 `12:00:AM`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Worked Time`: This field is automatically populated with the "
"difference from the selected :guilabel:`Check In` and :guilabel:`Check Out` "
"times. This field **cannot** be modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作時間`：此欄位會根據所選 :guilabel:`簽到` 與 :guilabel:`簽退` "
"時間的差額自動填入。此欄位**無法**修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:134
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Hours`: This field is *not* modifiable as overtime must be "
":ref:`approved <attendances/approve-refuse>`. This field displays zero "
"(`00:00`) by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/management.rst:137
msgid ""
"An Attendances app record form, filled out for Mike Smith for January 27, "
"2026."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:3
msgid "Overtime rulesets"
msgstr "加班規則集"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Attendances** app allows for the configuration of overtime rules to"
" determine if and when employees earn overtime, and at what rate."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的**考勤**應用程式可讓您設定加班規則，以決定員工是否及何時可獲得加班費，"
"以及計算倍率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:9
msgid ""
"No overtime rulesets come preconfigured in the **Attendances** app; all "
"overtime rulesets must be created."
msgstr "**考勤** 應用程式沒有預先配置的加班規則組合，所有加班規則組合均須自行建立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:13
msgid "Create an overtime ruleset"
msgstr "建立加班規則集"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:15
msgid ""
"To create an overtime ruleset, navigate to :menuselection:`Attendances app "
"--> Configuration --> Overtime Rulesets`. Any existing overtime rulesets "
"appear in a default list view, and display the ruleset :guilabel:`Name`, the"
" :guilabel:`Rate Mode`, and the :guilabel:`Rules Count` (the number of rules"
" configured for the ruleset)."
msgstr ""
"要建立加班規則集，請前往 :menuselection:`出勤應用程式 --> 設定 --> 加班規則"
"集`。任何現有的加班規則集都會顯示在預設清單檢視中，並顯示規則集的 "
":guilabel:`名稱`、:guilabel:`費率模式` 及 :guilabel:`規則數量`（為該規則集設"
"定的規則數量）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:20
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button, and a blank :guilabel:`Rulesets` form "
"loads. Enter the following information on the top half of the form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:23
msgid ":guilabel:`Ruleset Name`: Enter a name for the ruleset."
msgstr ":guilabel:`規則集名稱`：輸入規則集的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rate Combination Mode`: Using the drop-down menu, select how the "
"overtime rate is calculated. The options are:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`倍率組合模式`：使用下拉式選單選擇加班費率的計算方式。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Maximum Rate`: The highest rate is used to determine the overtime"
" pay. For example, if there are two available rates of 150% and 125%, the "
"highest available rate, 150%, is applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sum of all rates`: A combination of all applicable overtime rates"
" is used to calculate the overtime pay. Odoo calculates the rate by adding "
"the *extra* pay rates (above 100%)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`所有比率總和`：系統會結合所有適用的加班費率來計算加班費。Odoo 會透"
"過將 *額外* 薪酬比率（超過 100% 的部分）相加來計算該比率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:34
msgid ""
"Two overtime rates are created, one for 150% and the other for 120%. The "
":guilabel:`Sum of all rates` option is selected. The overtime rate applied "
"is 170%."
msgstr ""
"已建立兩個加班費率，一個為 150%，另一個為 120%。已選擇 :guilabel:`所有比率總"
"和` 選項。適用的加班費率為 170%。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:37
msgid ""
"The calculation used to determine this rate is: 100% (baseline) + (150-100)%"
" + (120-100)% = 170%."
msgstr "計算此比率的算式為：100%（基準）+ (150-100)% + (120-100)% = 170%。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:40
msgid ":guilabel:`Description`: Enter a brief description for the ruleset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Country`: Using the drop-down menu, select the country the "
"ruleset applies to."
msgstr ":guilabel:`國家/地區`：使用下拉式選單，選擇該規則集適用的國家/地區。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:44
msgid "Overtime rules"
msgstr "加班規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:46
msgid ""
"Once the main information of the ruleset is created, the next step is to add"
" the individual rules. Click :guilabel:`Add a line` at the bottom of the "
"*Overtime Rules* tab of the :guilabel:`Ruleset` form, and a *Create Rule* "
"pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""
"建立規則集的主要資訊後，下一步是新增個別規則。按一下 :guilabel:`新增資料行`（"
"位於 :guilabel:`規則集` 表單的 *加班規則* 分頁底部），系統隨即會載入 *建立規"
"則* 彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:50
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Rule Name` in the corresponding field. Next, enter the "
"following information in the *Definition* tab:"
msgstr "在相應欄位中輸入 :guilabel:`規則名稱`。接下來，在 *定義* 分頁中輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:54
msgid "Condition section"
msgstr "條件區段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:56
msgid ""
"This section determines what logged time counts as overtime. Rules can be "
"based on :ref:`quantity <attendnaces/quantity>` or :ref:`timing "
"<attendnaces/timing>`."
msgstr ""
"此部分決定哪些已記錄的時間會計算為加班。規則可基於 :ref:`數量 <attendnaces/"
"quantity>` 或 :ref:`時間 <attendnaces/timing>` 設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:62
msgid "Based on quantity"
msgstr "按數量計算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:64
msgid ""
"If overtime is accrued when the total logged hours for a day or week exceed "
"what is expected, select the :guilabel:`Quantity` radio button for the "
":guilabel:`The rule is based on` field. Configure the rest of the fields in "
"the *Condition* section as follows:"
msgstr ""
"如每日或每週的總記錄工時超出預期時數而會累計加班，請選取 :guilabel:`數量` 單"
"選按鈕（於 :guilabel:`規則依據` 欄位），並按以下方式設定 *條件* 部分的其餘欄"
"位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`If the worked hours on a (Day/Week) differs`: First, select if "
"the total expected time is calculated by the :guilabel:`Day` or "
":guilabel:`Week`, using the drop-down menu. Next, select if the difference "
"is compared:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`from the amount defined on the contract`: Select this option if "
"the overtime is based on the working hours :ref:`defined on the employees "
"contract <payroll/gen-info>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`合約所定義的金額`：如果加班是根據 :ref:`員工合約中定義的工時 "
"<payroll/gen-info>` 計算，請選擇此選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`from a specific duration`: Select this option if the overtime is "
"based on a specified amount of time. If this is selected, a "
":guilabel:`Duration to exceed` field appears. Enter the number of "
":guilabel:`hours` in an `HH:MM` format the employee must exceed each "
":guilabel:`Day` or :guilabel:`Week`, depending on what is selected in the "
":guilabel:`If the worked hours on a (Day/Week) differs` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`從特定時長`：如加班是根據指定時長計算，請選取此選項。選取此選項後"
"，畫面會顯示:guilabel:`須超出的時長`欄位。請以 `HH:MM` 格式輸入員工必須超出"
"的:guilabel:`小時`數，套用於每:guilabel:`日`或每:guilabel:`週`，具體取決"
"於:guilabel:`如（日/週）工作時數有所不同`欄位的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`With a tolerance in favor of the employer of`: This field defines"
" a buffer of time that is *not* considered overtime. Enter the amount in a "
"`HH:MM` format. For example, if this field is set to `00:15`, and an "
"employee logs an 8 hour and 13 minute workday, the extra 13 minutes is "
"**not** counted as overtime."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`對僱主有利的寬限時間`：此欄位設定 *不會* 被視作加班的緩衝時間。請"
"以 `HH:MM` 格式輸入時數。例如，若此欄位設為 `00:15` ，而員工記錄了 8 小時 13 "
"分鐘的工作日，該額外的 13 分鐘 **不會** 計入加班時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`With a tolerance in favor of the employee of`: Enter the amount "
"of extra time given to an employee as overtime, in a `HH:MM` format. For "
"example, if this field is set to `00:15`, and an employee logs an 8 hour and"
" 48 minute workday, the missing 12 minutes **are** counted as overtime, for "
"a total of one full hour of overtime (instead of only 48 minutes of "
"overtime)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`有利於僱員的寬限時間為`：以 `HH:MM` 格式輸入給予僱員作為加班的額外"
"時間。舉例而言，若此欄位設為 `00:15`，而僱員記錄了 8 小時 48 分鐘的工作時數，"
"不足的 12 分鐘**會**計算為加班，合計共一整小時加班（而非僅計算 48 分鐘加班）"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:92
msgid "Based on timing"
msgstr "根據時間"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:94
msgid ""
"If overtime is accrued only on specific days or at specific times, select "
"the :guilabel:`Timing` radio button for the :guilabel:`The rule is based on`"
" field. Configure the rest of the fields in the *Condition* section as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"如果加班只限於特定日子或特定時間累計，請選擇 :guilabel:`時間` 單選按鈕（位於 "
":guilabel:`規則基於` 欄位）。請按以下方式設定 *條件* 部分的其餘欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`With a tolerance in favor of the employer of`: This field defines"
" a buffer of time that is *not* considered overtime. Enter the amount in a "
"`HH:MM` format. For example, if this field is set to `00:15`, and an "
"employee logs a 40 hour and 13 minute workweek, the extra 13 minutes is "
"**not** counted as overtime."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`對僱主有利的容許誤差時間為`：此欄位定義 *不會* 被視作加班的緩衝時"
"間。請以 `HH:MM` 格式輸入時間長度。例如，若此欄位設為 `00:15`，而僱員在一週內"
"記錄了 40 小時 13 分鐘的工作時間，多出的 13 分鐘 **不會** 計入加班時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`With a tolerance in favor of the employee of`: Enter the amount "
"of extra time given to an employee as overtime, in a `HH:MM` format. For "
"example, if this field is set to `00:15`, and an employee logs a 40 hour and"
" 48 minute workweek, the missing 12 minutes **is** counted as overtime, for "
"a total of one full hour of overtime (instead of only 48 minutes of "
"overtime)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`對員工有利的寬限時間`：以 `HH:MM` 格式輸入計算為員工加班的額外時間"
"寬限。例如，若此欄位設為 `00:15`，而員工在一週內記錄了 40 小時 48 分鐘的工作"
"時間，缺少的 12 分鐘 **亦會** 計入加班時間，合共計算為完整 1 小時加班（而非"
"僅 48 分鐘加班）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`If the employee works`: Click the radio button to select the "
"period of time defined for accruing overtime. The options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`如果員工工作`：點擊單選按鈕以選擇定義為累積加班時間的時段。選項包"
"括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On any working day`: Select this option if overtime is accrued if"
" an employee works outside of a specified set of hours for any working day. "
"When selected, a :guilabel:`Between` field appears, listing `00:00` and "
"`24:00` hours, by default. Adjust the working times in an `HH:MM` for both "
"fields, defining the specific working hours an employee earns overtime for."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`於任何工作日`：若員工在任何工作日於指定時段以外工作即會累計加班，"
"請選擇此選項。選擇後，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`介乎` 欄位，預設列出 `00:00` 及 "
"`24:00` 時。請以 `HH:MM` 格式調整兩個欄位的工作時間，以界定員工可獲得加班的特"
"定工作時段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:115
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Between` hours are set to `09:00` and `17:00`. An employee "
"works from 7:00 AM until 4:00 PM. The employee earns 2 hours of overtime, "
"for the hours between 7:00 AM and 9:00 AM."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`介乎` 時數設為 `09:00` 及 `17:00`。一名員工由上午 7:00 工作至下"
"午 4:00。該員工可獲得 2 小時加班時間，計算時段為上午 7:00 至上午 9:00。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On any non-working day`: Select this option if overtime is "
"accrued if an employee works outside of a specified set of hours for any "
"non-working day. When selected, a :guilabel:`Between` field appears, listing"
" `00:00` and `24:00` hours, by default. Adjust the working times in an "
"`HH:MM` for both fields, defining the specific working hours an employee "
"earns overtime for."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在任何非工作日`：如員工在任何非工作日的指定時段以外工作會累積加班"
"時數，請選取此選項。選取後，畫面上會顯示 :guilabel:`介乎` 欄位，預設列出 "
"`00:00` 及 `24:00` 小時。請在兩個欄位中以 `HH:MM` 格式調整工作時間，以界定員"
"工可獲計算加班的特定工作時段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:124
msgid ""
":guilabel:`When employee is off`: Select this option if overtime is accrued "
"on any day the employee is *not* scheduled to work."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`員工休假時`：如果員工在 *未* 獲編排工作的任何日子裡工作皆會累計加"
"班時數，請選擇此選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Outside of a specific schedule`: Select this option if overtime "
"is accrued when employees work outside of a selected :doc:`working schedule "
"<../payroll/working_schedules>`. When selected, a :guilabel:`Schedule` field"
" appears. Using the drop-down menu, select the working schedule used to "
"determine overtime."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:132
msgid "Action section"
msgstr "動作區段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:134
msgid ""
"Once the criteria set in the *Condition* section are met, the *Action* "
"section determines how any approved extra time is handled."
msgstr ""
"一旦符合 *條件* 部分設定的準則，*動作* 部分便會決定如何處理任何已批核的額外時"
"間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay extra hours`: Enable this checkbox if overtime hours are paid"
" out. If enabled, a percentage field appears to the right of the checkmark, "
"populated with the rate defined on the overtime :ref:`work entry type "
"<payroll/work-entry-types>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work entry type to use`: This field only appears if the "
":guilabel:`Pay extra hours` field is enabled. Using the drop-down menu, "
"select what :ref:`work entry type <payroll/work-entry-types>` is created for"
" the overtime. By default, :guilabel:`Overtime Hours` is selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`要使用的工作記錄類型`：此欄位只會在啟用 :guilabel:`支付額外工時` "
"欄位時顯示。請使用下拉式選單，選取為加班建立的 :ref:`工作記錄類型 <payroll/"
"work-entry-types>`。系統預設選取 :guilabel:`加班時數`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:144
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Give back as time off`: Enable this checkbox if the overtime "
"should be converted to time off, instead of being paid out."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`轉為休假補回`：如果應將加班時數轉換為休假而非發放薪金，請勾選此核"
"取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:148
msgid "Example overtime ruleset"
msgstr "加班規則集範例"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:150
msgid ""
"A United States-based company wants to grant time and a half overtime to all"
" employees who work more than their 40-hour work week, or work on any non-"
"working day. To configure this, they create a ruleset called `Overtime`, "
"with a :guilabel:`Rate Combination Mode` set to :guilabel:`Maximum Rate`. "
"The country is set to :guilabel:`United States`, and a "
":guilabel:`Description` is entered explaining the overtime rules."
msgstr ""
"一間位於美國的公司希望為每週工作超過 40 小時或在任何非工作日工作的員工提供 "
"1.5 倍加班費。為此，他們建立了一個名為 `加班` 的規則集，並將 :guilabel:`費率"
"組合模式` 設為 :guilabel:`最高費率`。國家/地區設為 :guilabel:`美國`，並輸入 "
":guilabel:`描述` 以說明加班規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:156
msgid "The top half of the overtime ruleset for the example."
msgstr "範例中加班規則集的上半部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:159
msgid ""
"Two rules are configured in the *Overtime Rules* tab: :ref:`Employee "
"Schedule Rule <attendnaces/schedule-rule>` and :ref:`Non Working Days Rule "
"<attendnaces/hours-rule>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:165
msgid "Employee schedule rule"
msgstr "員工排班規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:167
msgid ""
"The *Employee Schedule Rule* is based on :guilabel:`Quantity`, and employees"
" accrue overtime if they work more than the :guilabel:`amount defined on the"
" contract` on any given :guilabel:`Day`. No tolerance set for either the "
"employee or the employer. If the employee works overtime, they are paid at a"
" rate of :guilabel:`150%`, and the time is logged as :guilabel:`Overtime "
"Hours` on their attendance log."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:173
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:186
msgid ""
"The rule set for an employee who works more than their scheduled work day."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:179
msgid "Non-working days rule"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/overtime.rst:181
msgid ""
"The *Non-Working Days Rule* is based on :guilabel:`Timing`, and employees "
"accrue overtime if they work :guilabel:`on any non-working day`, regardless "
"of the time. No tolerance is set for either the employee or the employer. If"
" the employee works overtime, they are paid at a rate of :guilabel:`150%`, "
"and the time is logged as :guilabel:`Overtime Hours` on their attendance "
"log."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:3
msgid "Time off ledger"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Time Off Ledger* report in the **Attendances** app helps managers by "
"flagging missing hours on employee attendance records. This allows managers "
"to determine if employees are forgetting to sign in or out, decide if time "
"off needs to be approved, and potentially flag patterns."
msgstr ""
"**考勤** 應用程式中的 *休假總帳* 報表會標示員工考勤記錄中遺漏的時數，從而協助"
"管理人員。這可讓管理人員判斷員工是否忘記簽到或簽退、決定是否需要批核休假，以"
"及及早發現異常模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:10
msgid "View time off ledger report"
msgstr "檢視休假分類賬報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:12
msgid ""
"To view the *Time Off Ledger* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Attendances app --> Reporting --> Time Off Ledger`. The "
"report displays a nested list of missing attendance hours from the last two "
"months. All entries are grouped by month, then employee. Click the "
":icon:`fa-caret-right` :guilabel:`(triangle)` icon to display the list of "
"employees, then click the :icon:`fa-caret-right` :guilabel:`(triangle)` icon"
" on the individual employee to view all the detailed attendance records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:18
msgid ""
"When expanded, each individual record displays the following information:"
msgstr "展開後，每項個別記錄都會顯示以下資訊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:20
msgid ":guilabel:`Employee`: The employee with missing hours."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：缺少工時的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:21
msgid ":guilabel:`Date`: The date the missing hours are from."
msgstr ":guilabel:`日期`：缺漏工時所屬的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:22
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Hours`: The number of hours the employee should have "
"worked that day, calculated from their :ref:`working schedule "
"<employees/schedule>`, configured on their employee record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預期工時`：員工當日應工作的時數，根據其員工記錄中所設定的 :ref:`工"
"作時間表 <employees/schedule>` 計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Worked Hours`: The total logged time the employee worked that "
"day."
msgstr ":guilabel:`工作時數`：員工當日已記錄的總工作時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Approved Time Off`: The approved hours of time off for that day."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Difference`: The difference between the :guilabel:`Expected "
"Hours` and the :guilabel:`Worked Hours` for the employee that day."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`差異`：員工當天的:guilabel:`預計時數`與:guilabel:`已工作時數`之間"
"的差距。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:30
msgid ""
"The time off report, expanded to show the missing records for Anita Oliver "
"from July 2026."
msgstr "休假報表，已展開以顯示 Anita Oliver 由 2026 年 7 月起的缺失記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:34
msgid "Resolve conflicts"
msgstr "解決衝突"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:36
msgid ""
"When missing hours appear on the report, the entries should be investigated "
"to determine the issue. The common reasons for missing attendance records "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"當報表出現缺漏時數時，應調查相關記錄以找出問題所在。出勤記錄缺漏的常見原因包"
"括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:39
msgid ":ref:`Forgot to log in to work that day. <attendances/forgot-log>`"
msgstr ":ref:`忘記在當天登入上班。 <attendances/forgot-log>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:40
msgid ""
":ref:`Forgot to request time off that day. <attendances/forgot-request>`"
msgstr ":ref:`忘記在當天申請休假。 <attendances/forgot-request>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:41
msgid ""
":ref:`Their time off request was not approved for that day. "
"<attendances/unapproved-time-off>`"
msgstr ":ref:`他們當日的休假申請未獲批准。 <attendances/unapproved-time-off>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:42
msgid ""
":ref:`They requested time off for part of their workday, but did not log any"
" attendance records for the remainder of the time. <attendances/forgot-"
"partial-log>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`他們申請了當天部分工作時間的休假，但未為餘下時間登記任何考勤記錄。 "
"<attendances/forgot-partial-log>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:45
msgid ""
"Once the reason for the missing entry is determined, the required records "
"can be updated. Once updated, the related entries are no longer displayed in"
" the *Time Off Ledger* report."
msgstr ""
"確定遺漏紀錄的原因後，即可更新所需紀錄。更新後，相關項目便不會再顯示於*休假分"
"類賬*報表中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:51
msgid "Forgot to log in to work"
msgstr "忘記登入上班"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:53
msgid ""
"Occasionally, employees forget to log in and out of the **Attendances** app."
" When this occurs, the employee's manager must :ref:`create the attendance "
"records <attendances/create-records>` retroactively in the **Attendances** "
"app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:60
msgid "Forgot to request time off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:62
msgid ""
"If the employee did not request time off, the employee's manager or time off"
" officer must :ref:`create the missing time off request "
"<time_off/management/missing>` retroactively in the **Time Off** app."
msgstr ""
"如員工未有申請休假，其主管或休假管理員必須在 **休假** 應用程式中事後:ref:`補"
"建遺漏的休假申請 <time_off/management/missing>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:69
msgid "Time off request was unapproved"
msgstr "休假申請已取消批准"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:71
msgid ""
"If the employee requested time off and the employee's manager or time off "
"officer did not approve the request in time, the :ref:`request must be "
"approved <time_off/management/manage-time-off>` in the **Time Off** app."
msgstr ""
"如果員工已申請休假，而員工的經理或休假管理員未能及時批核，便必須在 **休假** "
"應用程式中 :ref:`批准申請 <time_off/management/manage-time-off>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:78
msgid "Partial time off day missing attendance records"
msgstr "部分休假日子缺少考勤記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/attendances/time_off_ledger.rst:80
msgid ""
"Occasionally, employees request time off for part of the workday, and are "
"expected to work the remainder of the day. When employees forget to log in "
"and out for the partial workday, the employee's manager must :ref:`create "
"the attendance record <attendances/create-records>` retroactively in the "
"**Attendances** app."
msgstr ""
"有時員工會申請部分工作日的休假，並須在當天餘下時間工作。當員工忘記為該部分工"
"作日打卡登入及登出時，員工的經理必須在**考勤**應用程式中補行:ref:`建立考勤記"
"錄 <attendances/create-records>`。"

