#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Presence Display`: Select how the employee's availability status "
"is calculated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`在勤顯示`：選擇如何計算員工的在勤狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Based on attendances`: Employees are marked available when "
":ref:`checked into <attendances/check-in>` the **Attendances** app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`根據出勤記錄`：當員工在 **出勤** 應用程式中 :ref:`簽到 "
"<attendances/check-in>` 時，系統會將其標記為有空。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Based on user status in system`: Employees are marked available "
"when they :doc:`log in to Odoo <attendances/check_in_check_out>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Advanced Presence Control`: When enabled, presence status can be "
"calculated from operational signals rather than check-ins or logins:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`進階在勤控制`：啟用後，系統可根據操作訊號而非簽到或登入來計算在勤"
"狀態："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:103
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Based on number of emails sent`: An employee is marked present if"
" they send at least # emails per hour; otherwise, they are marked absent. "
"Enter the minimum number of emails that must be sent in the :guilabel:`Sent "
"Emails` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`根據已發送電郵數量`：如果員工每小時發送至少 # 封電郵，便會被標記為"
"出席；否則會被標記為缺席。請在 :guilabel:`已發送電郵` 欄位中輸入必須發送的最"
"少電郵數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Based on IP Address`: An employee is marked present only when "
"connected from one of the specified corporate IP addresses. Enter the IP "
"addresses in the :guilabel:`IP Addresses` field, separating each address "
"with a comma."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`根據 IP 位址`：員工只有在從指定的公司 IP 位址之一連線時，才會被標"
"記為出席。請在:guilabel:`IP 位址`欄位中輸入 IP 位址，並以逗號分隔每個位址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skills Management`: Enable this option to display the "
":ref:`resumé tab <employees/resume>` on employee profiles. This allows for "
"the display of :ref:`work experience <employees/resume>`, :ref:`skills "
"<employees/skills>`, and :doc:`certifications <employees/certifications>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`技能管理`：啟用此選項可在員工個人資料中顯示:ref:`履歷分頁 "
"<employees/resume>`。這可顯示:ref:`工作經驗 <employees/resume>`、:ref:`技能 "
"<employees/skills>`及:doc:`認證 <employees/certifications>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:116
msgid "Work organization"
msgstr "工作安排"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:118
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select the default :guilabel:`Company Working "
"Hours`. The default options are a :guilabel:`Standard 40 hours/week` or an "
":guilabel:`Appointment Resource Default Calendar`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:121
msgid ""
"The available working hours listed are the same as the configured "
":doc:`working schedules <payroll/working_schedules>` in the **Payroll** app."
" Working hours can be created and modified from both the **Payroll** and "
"**Employees** apps."
msgstr ""
"所列出的可用工作時間，與 **薪酬** 應用程式中設定的 :doc:`工作時間表 <payroll/"
"working_schedules>` 相同。你可在 **薪酬** 及 **員工** 應用程式中建立及修改工"
"作時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:126
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:231
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "合約"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:128
msgid ""
"Define the number of days in advance that a manager is notified about an "
"upcoming contract or work permit expiration in the respective "
":guilabel:`Contract Expiration Notice Period` and :guilabel:`Work Permit "
"Expiration Notice Period` fields."
msgstr ""
"請分別在 :guilabel:`合約到期通知期` 及 :guilabel:`工作許可證到期通知期` 欄位"
"中，設定在合約或工作許可證即將到期前多少天通知經理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:133
msgid "Salary configurator"
msgstr "薪酬配置器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:135
msgid ""
"Define how long an offer remains valid when extending a job offer or "
"changing a salary. Enter the duration, in days, in the :guilabel:`Salary "
"Package Configurator` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:138
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:151
msgid ""
"This field only appears if the **Salary Configurator** module is installed."
msgstr "此欄位只會在已安裝 **薪酬設定器** 模組時才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:141
msgid "Extra time off allocation"
msgstr "額外休假分配"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:143
msgid ""
"During salary package negotiations, enable the checkbox in this section if "
"additional time off requests are allowed. When enabled, select the "
":doc:`Time Off Type <time_off/time_off_types>` created for the additional "
"days using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"在薪酬方案協商期間，如允許申請額外休假，請勾選此部分的核取方塊。啟用後，使用"
"下拉式選單選擇為額外天數建立的 :doc:`休假類型 <time_off/time_off_types>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees.rst:147
msgid ""
"The default available options are :guilabel:`Paid Time Off`, "
":guilabel:`Compensatory Days`, and :guilabel:`Extra Time Off`. If other time"
" off types are configured in the **Time Off** app, they are available in the"
" drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo, employees can earn badges, either automatically through "
":doc:`challenges created in the CRM app "
"<../../sales/crm/optimize/gamification>`, through **eLearning** courses, or "
"manually, as managers decide to award them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:9
msgid ""
"Badges are a way to gamify the work day, can be created for any reason, and "
"can be granted to any user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:13
msgid ""
"Badges can **only** be awarded to :doc:`users of the database "
"<../../general/users>`, *and* if the **eLearning** app is installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:17
msgid "View available badges"
msgstr "查看可用徽章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:19
msgid ""
"To view the available badges that are configured by default, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Employees app --> Configuration --> Badges`."
msgstr ""
"如要查看預設配置的可用徽章，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 配置 --> "
"徽章`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:22
msgid ""
"All badges appear in a default Kanban view, with the badge's "
":guilabel:`Name` and image displayed. Additionally, the number of users "
"awarded the badge for both the current month, and in total, appears, along "
"with the badge description, and the avatar for each user who received the "
"badge."
msgstr ""
"所有徽章均會以預設的看板檢視顯示，並展示徽章的:guilabel:`名稱`及圖片。此外，"
"還會顯示本月及累計獲頒該徽章的用戶人數、徽章說明，以及每位獲獎用戶的頭像。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:26
msgid ""
"Each badge has a :guilabel:`Grant` button to :ref:`award the badge "
"<employees/grant_badge>` from the :guilabel:`Badges` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"每個徽章都設有 :guilabel:`頒發` 按鈕，可用於 :ref:`頒發徽章 <employees/"
"grant_badge>`（在 :guilabel:`徽章` 儀表板進行）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:29
msgid "All the available badges, on the Badges dashboard."
msgstr "徽章儀表板上所有可用的徽章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:33
msgid "Create badges"
msgstr "建立徽章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:35
msgid ""
"Badges can be created in the database when the default badges are not "
"sufficient. This can be done from the :guilabel:`Badges` dashboard in the "
"**Employees** app, or from the **CRM** app."
msgstr ""
"當預設徽章不足使用時，您可以在資料庫中建立新徽章。這可透過 **員工** 應用程式"
"中的:guilabel:`徽章`儀表板或 **CRM** 應用程式進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:38
msgid ""
"To add a badge in the **Employees** app, first navigate to "
":menuselection:`Employees app --> Configuration --> Badges`, then click the "
":guilabel:`New` button in the upper-left corner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:41
msgid ""
"Fill out the badge form as outlined in the :ref:`CRM documentation "
"<crm/create-rewards>`."
msgstr "請按照 :ref:`CRM 說明文件 <crm/create-rewards>` 中的說明填寫徽章表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:44
msgid ":ref:`CRM Gamification <crm/create-rewards>`"
msgstr ":ref:`CRM 遊戲化 <crm/create-rewards>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:47
msgid "View employee badges"
msgstr "檢視員工徽章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:49
msgid ""
"To view badges awarded to an employee, open the **Employees** app, and click"
" on an employee record. Click on the :guilabel:`Received Badges` tab to view"
" any awarded badges."
msgstr ""
"要查看頒發給員工的徽章，請開啟 **員工** 應用程式，然後點擊員工記錄。點擊 "
":guilabel:`已獲得徽章` 分頁，即可查看所有已頒發的徽章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:53
msgid ""
"If this tab is not visible, it means there is no :guilabel:`Related User` in"
" the :guilabel:`Settings` tab. Once a user is populated in the "
":guilabel:`Related User` field, the :guilabel:`Badges` tab appears."
msgstr ""
"如果看不到此分頁，即表示未有指定 :guilabel:`關聯使用者`（於 :guilabel:`設定` "
"分頁中）。一旦在 :guilabel:`關聯使用者` 欄位填入使用者，:guilabel:`徽章` 分頁"
"便會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:60
msgid "Grant badges"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:62
msgid ""
"To grant a badge to an employee, open the employee record, and click into "
"the :guilabel:`Received Badges` tab. Click the :guilabel:`Grant a Badge` "
"button to load a :guilabel:`Reward Employee` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"要向員工頒發徽章，請開啟該員工記錄，然後按一下 :guilabel:`已獲徽章` 分頁。按"
"一下 :guilabel:`頒發徽章` 按鈕，以載入 :guilabel:`獎勵員工` 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:66
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select the badge being awarded in the "
":guilabel:`What are you thankful for?` field. The default options are "
":guilabel:`Good Job`, :guilabel:`Problem Solver`, and :guilabel:`Brilliant`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`您感謝的事項是甚麼？` 欄位中，使用下拉式選單選擇要頒發的徽章。"
"預設選項包括 :guilabel:`做得好`、:guilabel:`解難高手` 及 :guilabel:`表現卓"
"越`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:71
msgid ""
"Additional options appear (e.g., :guilabel:`Get Started`, :guilabel:`Power "
"user`, :guilabel:`community Hero`) which are associated with challenges. "
"These are automatically granted through completed challenges. While these "
"can be awarded at any time, it is advised to grant badges manually that are "
"*not* associated with a challenge."
msgstr ""
"系統會顯示與挑戰相關的其他選項（例如：:guilabel:`開始使用`、:guilabel:`進階用"
"戶`、:guilabel:`社群英雄`）。這些徽章會在完成挑戰後自動頒發。雖然隨時都可以頒"
"發這些徽章，但建議只手動頒發 *並非* 與挑戰相關的徽章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:76
msgid ""
"Next, enter a brief summary of why the badge is being granted in the field "
"displaying :guilabel:`Describe what they did and why it matters (will be "
"public)` field. Last, click the :guilabel:`Reward Employee` button, and the "
"badge is awarded, and is visible in the :guilabel:`Badges` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:82
msgid ""
"Users cannot grant themselves badges. An error message appears if attempted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:84
msgid "The 'Reward Employee' field populated."
msgstr "「獎勵員工」欄位已填入內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:5
msgid ""
"When jobs require specific knowledge, training, or certifications, it is "
"necessary to track employees' certifications to ensure they are properly "
"trained and that the necessary documentation is in place."
msgstr ""
"當職位需要特定知識、培訓或認證時，必須追蹤員工的認證情況，以確保他們已接受適"
"當培訓並備妥所需文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:9
msgid ""
"When jobs require specific knowledge, track employee certifications (e.g., "
"classes, tests, seminars) to verify required skills. Odoo accepts any "
"certification type without restriction."
msgstr ""
"當職位需要特定知識時，可追蹤員工的認證（例如課程、測試、研討會），以核實所需"
"技能。Odoo 支援任何類型的認證，並無限制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:13
msgid ""
"To add certifications to an employee profile and to access the "
"*Certifications* report, the **Surveys** app **must** be installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:17
msgid "Create certifications"
msgstr "建立認證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:19
msgid ""
"No certifications are preconfigured in Odoo's **Employees** app; therefore, "
"all certifications must be added to the database. To create a certification,"
" navigate to the :menuselection:`Employees app --> Configuration --> Skill "
"Types`. Click the :guilabel:`New` button in the upper-left corner, and a "
"blank *Skill Types* form loads."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **員工** 應用程式未有預先配置任何認證，因此所有認證都必須加入資料庫。"
"要建立認證，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 配置 --> 技能類型`。按一"
"下左上角的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統會載入空白的 *技能類型* 表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:24
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:91
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:16
msgid "Enter the following information on the form:"
msgstr "在表單上輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skill Type`: Enter the type of certification being added. This "
"acts as the *category*, and individual certifications are nested beneath it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`技能類型`：輸入要新增的認證類型。這將作為 *類別*，而各項認證則會巢"
"狀排列於其下。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:306
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Color`: Click on the existing color to view the available colors."
" Click the desired color to select it."
msgstr ":guilabel:`顏色`：點擊現有顏色即可檢視可用顏色，然後點擊所需顏色以選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certification`: Click the toggle to indicate the skill is a "
"certification. The toggle turns green when it is active."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`認證`：按一下切換按鈕，以標示該技能為一項認證。啟用時，切換按鈕會"
"變成綠色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skills`: Click :guilabel:`Add a line` and enter the "
":guilabel:`Name` for the specific certification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Levels`: Click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and enter a "
":guilabel:`Name` and :guilabel:`Progress` percentage (`0`-`100`) for each "
"level. Set a :guilabel:`Default Level` by clicking the toggle on the desired"
" line (only one level can be selected)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`等級`：點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`，並為每個等級輸入 :guilabel:`名"
"稱` 及 :guilabel:`進度` 百分比（`0`-`100`）。點擊所需資料行上的切換按鈕，即可"
"設定 :guilabel:`預設等級`（僅可選擇一個等級）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:39
msgid ""
"A United States-based company requires its employees to complete various "
":abbr:`OSHA (Occupational Safety and Health Administration)` training and "
"certify that the training is complete."
msgstr ""
"一間位於美國的公司要求員工完成各項 :abbr:`OSHA (美國職業安全及健康管理局)` 培"
"訓，並證明已完成培訓。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:43
msgid ""
"The company creates a new skill type and enters :guilabel:`OSHA Training` in"
" the :guilabel:`Skill Type` field."
msgstr ""
"公司建立新的技能類型，並將 :guilabel:`OSHA 培訓` 輸入至 :guilabel:`技能類型` "
"欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:46
msgid ""
"The various courses are entered in the *Skills* section, including "
":guilabel:`OSHA 3115 - Fall Protection`, :guilabel:`OSHA 3095 - Electrical "
"Standards`, and more."
msgstr ""
"各項課程均在 *技能* 部分輸入，包括:guilabel:`OSHA 3115 - 墜落防"
"護`、:guilabel:`OSHA 3095 - 電氣標準`等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:49
msgid ""
"There is only one level in the *Levels* section, :guilabel:`Certified`, "
"which is set to :guilabel:`100%`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:52
msgid "The skill type form configured for various OSHA training courses."
msgstr "為各項 OSHA 培訓課程配置的技能類型表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:56
msgid "View certifications"
msgstr "檢視認證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:58
msgid ""
"To view a full list of all employee certifications, navigate to the "
":menuselection:`Employees app --> Learning --> Certifications`."
msgstr ""
