":guilabel:`Week`, or :guilabel:`Day`. To change the presented time frame "
"groups, click the search bar, then click :icon:`fa-check` "
":guilabel:`Validity Stop` :icon:`fa-caret-down`, and select the desired time"
" frame."
msgstr ""
"時間範圍可設為 :guilabel:`年`、:guilabel:`季`、:guilabel:`週` 或 "
":guilabel:`日`。要更改顯示的時間範圍分組，請點擊搜尋欄，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"check` :guilabel:`有效終止` :icon:`fa-caret-down`，再選擇所需的時間範圍。"

