msgstr ":guilabel:`認證類型`：為認證設定的 *技能類型*。你可以將其視為認證的 *類別*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:145
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Validity Start`: When the employee received the certification."
msgstr ":guilabel:`有效開始日期`：員工取得認證的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/certifications.rst:146
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certification Level`: The level the employee achieved for the "
"certification. This is determined by the configured levels on the *skill "
"type*."
