msgid ""
"After the form is completed, click the :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` "
":guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon to manually save the changes. When saved, a"
" :guilabel:`DEPARTMENT ORGANIZATION` chart appears in the right of the "
"department card, illustrating where the department lies in the organization,"
" and how many employees are within each listed department."
msgstr ""
"填妥表格後，按一下:icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`（手動儲存）`圖示以手動"
"儲存變更。儲存後，部門卡片右側會顯示:guilabel:`部門組織`圖表，展示該部門在機"
"構中的位置，以及每個列出部門的員工人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:30
msgid "The department for with all fields filled out."
msgstr "已填妥所有欄位的部門表單。"

