msgid ""
"To view the currently configured departments, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Employees app --> Departments`. All departments appear in a "
"Kanban view, and are listed in alphabetical order."
msgstr ""
"如要檢視目前已設定的部門，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 部門`。所有"
"部門均會以看板檢視顯示，並按字母順序排列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:45
