#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:61
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: The name of the department."
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`：部門的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:62
