#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allocation Requests`: The number of unapproved allocation "
"requests for employees in the department :ref:`awaiting approval "
"<time_off/management/manage-allocations>`. This **only** appears if there "
"are requests to approve."
msgstr ""
