"顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`New Applicants`: The number of :ref:`new applicants "
"<recruitment/recruitment_flow/new>` for a position within the department. "
"This **only** appears if there are new applicants."
