#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expenses`: The number of employees in the department with "
":doc:`open expenses to approve <../../finance/expenses/approve_expenses>`. "
"This **only** appears if there are any expenses waiting for approval."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`開支`：部門中有 :doc:`待批核開支 <../../finance/expenses/"
