#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Absence`: The number of employees with approved time off for the "
"current day."
msgstr ":guilabel:`缺勤`：當日已獲批休假的員工人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:78
msgid ""
"Color bar: the selected color for the department appears as a vertical bar "
"on the left side of the department card."
msgstr "顏色條：為部門所選的顏色會以垂直條形式顯示於部門卡片左側。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:82
