"departments beneath it. All child departments of the first-level child "
"departments are folded."
msgstr ""
"要以階層檢視查看部門，請按一下右上角的 :icon:`fa-share-alt fa-rotate-90` "
":guilabel:`（階層）` 圖示。部門會以組織架構圖格式顯示，最高層級的部門位於最上"
"方（通常為 `Executive Management`），其他所有部門則位於其下方。第一層子部門的"
"所有子部門均為摺疊狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:111
msgid ""
"Each department card displays the :guilabel:`Department Name`, the "
":guilabel:`Manager` (and their profile image), the :guilabel:`Number of "
"Employees` in the department, and the number of any child departments."
msgstr ""
"每張部門卡片都會顯示:guilabel:`部門名稱`、:guilabel:`主管`（及其個人資料相片"
"）、部門的:guilabel:`員工人數`，以及任何下級部門的數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:115
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Unfold` button on a department card to expand it. Once "
"expanded, the :guilabel:`Unfold` button changes to a :guilabel:`Fold` "
"button. To collapse the department, click the :guilabel:`Fold` button. Only "
"**one** department *per row* can be unfolded at a time."
msgstr ""
"按一下部門卡片上的 :guilabel:`展開` 按鈕即可將其展開。展開後，:guilabel:`展"
"開` 按鈕會變為 :guilabel:`摺疊` 按鈕。要收合該部門，請按一下 :guilabel:`摺"
"疊` 按鈕。*每一行*每次只可展開**一個**部門。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:119
msgid ""
"Click anywhere on a department card to open the department form. Click the "
":guilabel:`(#) Employees` smart button to view a list of all the employees "
"in that department."
msgstr ""
"按一下部門卡片上的任何位置，即可開啟部門表單。按一下:guilabel:`(#) 員工`智能"
"按鈕，即可查看該部門所有員工的清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departments.rst:122
msgid "The departments presented in a hierarchy view."
msgstr "以階層檢視顯示的部門。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:5
msgid ""
"When an employee leaves, the working relationship between the employee and "
"the company must end. In Odoo, this is referred to as the *end of "
"collaboration*. First, open the **Employees** app, locate the employee "
"leaving the company, and click on their employee card."
msgstr ""
"當員工離職時，員工與公司之間的僱傭關係必須終止。在 Odoo 中，這稱為 *終止合"
"作*。首先，開啟 **員工** 應用程式，找出離職員工，然後按一下其員工卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:10
msgid ""
"This should be done *after* the employee has been fully :doc:`offboarded "
"<offboarding>`."
msgstr "此操作應在員工完全:doc:`離職 <offboarding>` *之後* 進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:13
msgid "End of collaboration pop-up"
msgstr "結束合作彈出視窗"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:15
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon in the corner, and a "
"drop-down menu appears. Click :guilabel:`End of Collaboration`, and an *End "
"of collaboration* pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"點按角落的 :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`（操作）` 圖示，隨即會顯示下拉式選單。"
"點按 :guilabel:`結束合作`，系統會顯示 *結束合作* 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:18
msgid "Fill out the following fields on the form:"
msgstr "在表格中填寫以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:20
msgid ""
":guilabel:`End Reason`: Select the reason the employee is leaving the "
"company, using the drop-down menu. Three default options are available:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`結束原因`：使用下拉式選單選擇員工離職的原因。系統提供三個預設選項"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fired`: Select this option when an employee is being let go, and "
"the company has given notice."
msgstr ":guilabel:`解僱`：當員工被公司辭退且公司已發出解僱通知時，請選取此選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Resigned`: Select this option when the employee no longer wishes "
"to be employed, and the employee has given notice."
msgstr ":guilabel:`辭職`：當員工不欲繼續受僱並已發出離職通知時，請選擇此選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Resigned: Retired`: Select this option when the employee is "
"retiring."
msgstr ":guilabel:`離職：退休`：當員工退休時，請選取此選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:30
msgid ""
"If a new departure reason is needed, a new one can be created. Close the "
"*End of collaboration* pop-up window, and navigate to "
":menuselection:`Employees app --> Configuration --> Departure Reasons`. "
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button, and a blank line appears at the bottom of "
"the list. Enter the new reason, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"如需新增離職原因，請先關閉 *結束合作* 彈出視窗，然後前往 :menuselection:`員工"
"應用程式 --> 設定 --> 離職原因`。按一下 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，清單底部便會出"
"現空白行。輸入新的離職原因，再按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dismissal Date`: Select the date the departure starts using the "
"calendar selector."
msgstr ":guilabel:`解僱日期`：使用日曆選擇器選取離職開始日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Departure Date`: Using the calendar selector, enter the actual "
"day the employee leaves the company."
msgstr ":guilabel:`離職日期`：使用日曆選擇器輸入員工離開公司的實際日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:40
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Dismissal Date` may differ from the :guilabel:`Departure "
"Date` in cases where the employee must be notified of their termination for "
"a set period of time before their last day of work. In this situation, the "
":guilabel:`Dismissal Date` is the date the employee is given notice, and the"
" :guilabel:`Departure Date` is their last day at work."
msgstr ""
"如員工須在最後工作日之前獲提前通知終止僱傭關係一段指定時間，:guilabel:`解僱日"
"期` 可能會與 :guilabel:`離職日期` 不同。在此情況下，:guilabel:`解僱日期` 為向"
"員工發出通知的日期，而 :guilabel:`離職日期` 則為其最後工作日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:46
msgid "Planned actions tab"
msgstr "已計劃行動分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:48
msgid ""
"The *Planned Actions* tab is where automated actions are set. Check the box "
"in the options below to perform the related actions:"
msgstr ""
"*已規劃動作* 分頁用於設定自動化動作。請勾選以下選項中的核取方塊，以執行相關動"
"作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: Check the :guilabel:`Archive` option to archive the "
"employee."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：勾選 :guilabel:`封存` 選項，即可封存該員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contracts`: Check the :guilabel:`Set Contracts End Date` option "
"to end the employee's current contract and delete any future versions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`合約`：勾選 :guilabel:`設定合約結束日期` 選項，以結束員工的目前合"
"約並刪除任何未來版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fleet`: Check the :guilabel:`Unassign Company Car` option to "
"remove the employee as the driver for their current company car and "
":ref:`assign the next driver <fleet/new_vehicle/new-driver>`, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`車隊`：勾選:guilabel:`取消指派公司車輛`選項，即可移除該員工現有公"
"司車輛的司機身份，並在適用時:ref:`指派下一位司機 <fleet/new_vehicle/new-"
"driver>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Equipment`: Check the :guilabel:`Unassign Equipment` option to "
"unassign the employee from any assigned equipment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`設備`：勾選 :guilabel:`取消指派設備` 選項，以取消指派給該員工的任"
"何設備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Appraisals`: Check the :guilabel:`Delete Future Appraisals` "
"option to cancel all appraisals scheduled after the contract end date and "
"archive all goals."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`員工評估`：勾選 :guilabel:`刪除未來評估` 選項，即可取消合約結束日"
"期後安排的所有評估，並將所有目標封存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Off`: Check the :guilabel:`Cancel Future Requests` option to"
" set the running allocation's validity end date and cancel all future time "
"off requests."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`休假`：勾選:guilabel:`取消未來申請`選項，以設定現行配額的有效結束"
"日期，並取消所有未來的休假申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Action at`: Select when the above actions are done. The options "
"are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Departure date`: Select this option to have all actions done on "
"the configured :guilabel:`Departure Date`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`離職日期`：選擇此選項，即可在已設定的 :guilabel:`離職日期` 執行所"
"有操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other date`: Select this option to have all actions done on a "
"specific day other than the configured :guilabel:`Departure Date`. When "
"selected, an :guilabel:`Apply date` field appears. Leave the field blank to "
"have the actions done immediately, or select a date using the calendar "
"selector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:72
msgid ""
"The End of collaboration pop-up window configured for an employee leaving on"
" November 17."
msgstr "為 11 月 17 日離職員工設定的「結束合作」彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:76
msgid "Detailed reason tab"
msgstr "「詳細原因」分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enter any information regarding the employee's departure in this field."
msgstr "在此欄位輸入有關員工離職的任何資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:81
msgid "Process departure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:83
msgid ""
"Once the *End of collaboration* pop-up window is configured, click the "
":guilabel:`Apply` button, and the configured actions are scheduled for the "
"dates set on the form."
msgstr ""
"設定好 *結束合作* 彈出式視窗後，按一下 :guilabel:`套用` 按鈕，系統便會按表單"
"上設定的日期排程已設定的動作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:86
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Departure date` is reached, the employee record is "
"archived if the :guilabel:`Archive` option was selected, and a red banner "
"appears on the employee record, stating :guilabel:`Archived`."
msgstr ""
"到達 :guilabel:`離職日期` 後，如果先前選取了 :guilabel:`封存` 選項，系統會封"
"存該員工記錄，並在員工記錄上顯示紅色橫幅，註明 :guilabel:`已封存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:91
msgid ""
"If any issues exist that prevent Odoo from archiving the employee, the "
"detailed reasons appear in a *Validation Error* pop-up window. Close the "
"warning pop-up, correct the issues, and click :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:95
msgid "An employee record marked as archived."
msgstr "已標記為封存的員工記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:99
msgid ""
"It is possible to archive an employee without using the :guilabel:`End of "
"Collaboration` option, but it is **not** recommended as there is less "
"flexibility with related actions."
msgstr ""
"不使用 :guilabel:`結束合作` 選項亦可封存員工記錄，但 **不** 建議這樣做，因為"
"相關後續操作的靈活性會較低。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:102
msgid ""
"To archive an employee instead of ending the collaboration, click the "
":icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon on the employee record, and click"
" :guilabel:`Archive`."
msgstr ""
"若要封存員工而非終止合作，請點擊員工記錄上的 :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(操"
"作)` 圖示，然後點擊 :guilabel:`封存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:105
msgid ""
"The employee is archived, their contract end date is set to the current "
"date, and all appraisals, goals, and future time off are canceled. Any "
"vehicles in the **Fleet** app assigned to the employee remain, as well as "
"any assigned equipment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/departures.rst:109
msgid ""
"For these reasons, it is recommended to use the :guilabel:`End of "
"Collaboration` method when an employee departs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:5
msgid ""
"Many employees are given various items to use while they work, such as "
"laptops, phones, and printers. Most companies track their equipment, to see "
"who is using what, as well as having a record of important information "
"regarding the equipment, such as serial numbers, warranty information, and "
"maintenance history."
msgstr ""
"許多員工在工作時都會獲發各種物品使用，例如手提電腦、電話和打印機。大多數公司"
"都會追蹤設備去向，了解誰在使用哪件設備，並記錄設備的重要資訊，例如序號、保養"
"資料和維護記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:11
msgid ""
"To track employee equipment, the **Maintenance** app *must* be installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:16
msgid "Individual employee equipment"
msgstr "個別員工設備"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:18
msgid ""
"Employee equipment is tracked on the employee record. To view all equipment "
"currently assigned to an employee, navigate to the "
":menuselection:`Employees` app, and click on the desired employee record."
msgstr ""
"員工設備會在員工記錄中追蹤。要查看目前指派給某名員工的所有設備，請前"
"往:menuselection:`員工`應用程式，並點擊所需的員工記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:21
msgid ""
"At the top of the record, an :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`Equipment Count` "
"smart button appears, with a number indicating how many, if any, items are "
"currently assigned to that employee."
msgstr ""
"在記錄頂部會顯示一個 :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`設備數量` 智能按鈕，上面的數"
"字表示目前指派予該名員工的項目數量（如有）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:24
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`Equipment Count` smart button, and all"
" equipment currently assigned to the employee appears in individual Kanban "
"cards."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`設備數量` 智能按鈕，目前指派予該員工的所有設"
"備會以個別看板卡片顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:27
msgid ""
"Each Kanban card displays the equipment's name and model on the first line, "
"followed by the serial number (if available), and lastly, the employee's "
"name. Any current maintenance requests appear at the bottom of the card in a"
" red box."
msgstr ""
"每張看板卡片的第一行均會顯示設備名稱及型號，其次為序號（如有），最後為員工姓"
"名。任何現有的保養要求則會以紅色方框顯示於卡片底部。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:31
msgid "A Kanban view of all equipment for an employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:35
msgid "A serial number is **not** required when logging equipment."
msgstr "登記設備時，**無須**提供序號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:38
msgid "All employee equipment"
msgstr "所有員工設備"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:40
msgid ""
"To view all equipment for all employees, start on the :ref:`equipment record"
" of an individual employee <employees/equipment>`."
msgstr ""
"要查看所有員工的全部設備，請先前往 :ref:`個別員工的設備記錄 <employees/"
"equipment>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:44
msgid ""
"It does not matter what employee is selected, or whether they have any "
"equipment assigned to them. This step is only used to get to the "
":guilabel:`Equipment` list."
msgstr ""
"無論選擇哪位員工，或該員工有否獲分配任何設備，都無關重要。此步驟僅用於前往 "
":guilabel:`設備` 清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:47
msgid ""
"In the Kanban view of the employee's equipment, clear the default "
":guilabel:`Assigned Employee` filter in the search bar. This presents *all* "
"equipment in the database, including those assigned to individual employees "
"and whole departments."
msgstr ""
"在員工設備的看板檢視中，清除搜尋列內預設的:guilabel:`已指派員工`篩選條件。這"
"會顯示資料庫中的*所有*設備，包括指派給個別員工及整個部門的設備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:51
msgid ""
"Click into the search bar, and select :guilabel:`Employee` in the :icon:`oi-"
"group` :guilabel:`Group By` column. The equipment is now organized in a "
"Kanban view, by employee."
msgstr ""
"點擊搜尋欄，選取 :guilabel:`員工`（位於 :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`分組依"
"據` 欄）。設備現已按員工以看板檢視方式排列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:54
msgid ""
"In the Kanban view displaying all employee equipment records, equipment can "
"be reassigned by clicking and dragging an equipment card to the desired "
"employee. This changes ownership of the equipment."
msgstr ""
"在顯示所有員工設備記錄的看板檢視中，您可以點擊並將設備卡片拖曳至目標員工，以"
"重新指派設備。此操作會變更設備的擁有權。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:58
msgid "A Kanban view of all equipment for all employees."
msgstr "所有員工全部設備的看板檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:62
msgid "Add equipment to an employee record"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:64
msgid ""
"To add equipment to an employee's record, open the "
":menuselection:`Employees` app, click on the desired employee record, then "
"click the :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`Equipment Count` smart button at the "
"top."
msgstr ""
"若要將設備加入員工記錄，請開啟 :menuselection:`員工` 應用程式，按一下所需的員"
"工記錄，然後按一下頂部的 :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`設備數量` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:68
msgid ""
"All equipment currently assigned to the employee appears in individual "
"Kanban cards. To add a new equipment record, click the :guilabel:`New` "
"button in the upper-left corner, and a blank :guilabel:`Equipment` form "
"loads."
msgstr ""
"目前已指派給該員工的所有設備會顯示在個別的看板卡片中。要新增設備記錄，請點擊"
"左上角的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統便會載入一張空白的 :guilabel:`設備` 表單"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:72
msgid ""
":doc:`Fill out the equipment form "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment>` for the employee's "
"equipment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`填寫設備表單 <../../inventory_and_mrp/maintenance/add_new_equipment>`，"
"記錄員工的設備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:76
msgid ""
"Instead of filling out a new :guilabel:`Equipment` form for the same item, a"
" form can be duplicated, then updated."
msgstr ""
"無需為同一項目重新填寫新的 :guilabel:`設備` 表單，您可以複製現有表單並進行更"
"新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:79
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Equipment` form, click the :icon:`fa-gear` "
":guilabel:`(Actions)` icon in the upper-left corner, then select :icon:`fa-"
"clone` :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`設備` 表單上，點擊左上角的 :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`（操作"
"）` 圖示，然後選擇 :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`複製`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:82
msgid ""
"An identical form appears, with *all* the information filled out, except for"
" the :guilabel:`Serial Number`."
msgstr "系統會顯示一張相同的表單，當中已填妥 *所有* 資料，惟 :guilabel:`序號` 除外。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/equipment.rst:85
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Serial Number` on the form, and make any other "
"necessary changes, such as the assigned :guilabel:`Employee`."
msgstr ""
