#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:144
msgid "Invite employees"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:69
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`eLearning Courses` dashboard, invite employees to take a"
" course. Navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app --> Learning --> "
"eLearning`, click on the desired course from the list, and the course form "
"loads. Click the :guilabel:`Add Attendees` button and an *Enroll Attendees "
"to (Course Title)* pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`電子學習課程` 儀表板中，可邀請員工報讀課程。前往 "
":menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 學習 --> 電子學習`，在列表中點選所需課程以載"
"入課程表單。點選 :guilabel:`新增參加者` 按鈕，系統便會彈出 *為（課程標題）報"
"名參加者* 視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:74
msgid ""
"Add all desired employees to the :guilabel:`Recipients` field using the "
"drop-down menu. All employees in the database are available in this list."
msgstr ""
"使用下拉式選單將所有需要的僱員加入至 :guilabel:`收件人` 欄位。資料庫中的所有"
"僱員均會顯示在此清單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:78
msgid ""
"To filter only employees, click into the :guilabel:`Recipients` field, then "
"click :guilabel:`Search more...`."
msgstr ""
"若要只篩選員工，請按一下 :guilabel:`收件人` 欄位，再按一下 :guilabel:`搜尋更"
"多...`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:81
msgid ""
"In the *Search: Recipients* pop-up window that loads, filter the results by "
"clicking into the search box and selecting :guilabel:`Employees` in the "
":icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` column. Only employees are presented, "
"excluding other companies or vendors. Click the checkbox to the left of the "
":guilabel:`Name` column to select all employees."
msgstr ""
"在載入的 *搜尋：收件人* 彈出視窗中，點擊搜尋欄並選擇 :guilabel:`員工`（位於 "
":icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 欄內），以篩選結果。系統只會顯示員工，"
"排除其他公司或供應商。點擊 :guilabel:`名稱` 欄左側的核取方塊，即可全選所有員"
"工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:86
msgid ""
"The email uses the default `Elearning: Add Attendees to Course` "
":guilabel:`Mail Template`, which includes a dynamic subject line that "
"includes the course's name."
msgstr ""
"該電郵會使用預設的 `網上學習：新增參加者至課程` :guilabel:`電郵範本`，其動態"
"主旨行會包含課程名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:89
msgid ""
"Make any desired changes to the email, attach any necessary files, then "
"click :guilabel:`Send` to invite the employees."
msgstr "按需要修改電郵內容，並附加所需檔案，然後點擊 :guilabel:`發送` 以邀請員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:92
msgid ""
"Once the invitation is sent, the recipients appear in the attendees list. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-graduation-cap` :guilabel:`Attendees` smart button to "
"view all invited attendees."
msgstr ""
"邀請發送後，收件人便會出現在參加者列表中。點擊:icon:`fa-graduation-cap` "
":guilabel:`參加者`智能按鈕，即可查看所有受邀參加者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:95
msgid ""
"Once the employee completes the eLearning course, the training appears on "
"their employee record, in the :ref:`Resume <employees/resume>` tab."
msgstr ""
"僱員完成線上學習課程後，該項培訓便會顯示於其僱員紀錄的 :ref:`履歷 <employees/"
"resume>` 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:99
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click the :guilabel:`Invite` button, and an *Invite Attendees"
" to (Course Name)* pop-up window loads. Copy the course link by clicking the"
" :icon:`fa-clipboard` :guilabel:`(Copy)` icon to copy the link and send it "
"to employees. Or, click the :guilabel:`Send Email` toggle to :ref:`email "
"employees <employees/invite>`."
msgstr ""
"或者，點擊:guilabel:`邀請`按鈕，系統會載入*邀請參加者加入（課程名稱）*彈出視"
"窗。點擊:icon:`fa-clipboard` :guilabel:`（複製）`圖示即可複製課程連結並傳送給"
"員工；或點擊:guilabel:`傳送電郵`切換按鈕，以:ref:`向員工發送電郵 <employees/"
"invite>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:104
msgid "The invitation email to send employees the course."
msgstr "向員工發送課程的邀請電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:110
msgid "Onsite"
msgstr "現場"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:112
msgid ""
"The **Employees** app can also track in-person training. These can take any "
"format, from lectures to interactive training. To create onsite training "
"courses, the **Events** app must be :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"**員工** 應用程式亦可追蹤實體培訓，形式不限，從講座到互動式培訓皆可。若要建立"
"現場培訓課程，必須 :ref:`安裝 <general/install>` **活動** 應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:116
msgid ""
"Onsite training can be created either through the **Employees** app *or* the"
" **Events** app. All courses created appear in both apps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:120
msgid "Once an onsite training is available, it is accessible from both apps."
msgstr "當現場培訓可供使用時，即可從兩個應用程式存取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:122
msgid ""
"To view all currently configured onsite courses navigate to "
":menuselection:`Employees app --> Learning --> Onsite`, and the "
":guilabel:`Onsite Courses` dashboard loads. All onsite courses appear in a "
"default Kanban view, organized by stage."
msgstr ""
"要檢視所有目前已設定的現場課程，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 學"
