"預設的看板檢視顯示，並按階段分類。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:126
msgid "Click on an onsite training card to view the details."
msgstr "點擊現場培訓卡片以查看詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:131
msgid "Create an onsite course"
msgstr "建立現場課程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:133
msgid ""
"To create a new onsite training, navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app "
"--> Learning --> Onsite`. Click the :guilabel:`New` button in the top-left "
"corner and a blank *Onsite Courses* event form loads."
msgstr ""
"如要建立新的現場培訓，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 學習 --> 現"
"場`。點擊左上角的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統便會載入空白的 *現場課程* 活動表"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:137
msgid ""
":ref:`Fill out the event form <events/event-form>` to configure the onsite "
"training course. When completed, the option to publish it to the website is "
"available, if desired. This option is only available if the **Website** app "
"is installed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`填寫活動表單 <events/event-form>`，以設定現場培訓課程。完成後，如有需要"
"，可選擇將課程發佈到網站。此選項僅在已安裝**網站**應用程式時可用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:146
msgid ""
"Once the onsite training is configured, the next step is to invite "
"employees. Navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app --> Learning --> "
"Onsite` and click on the course Kanban card. Click the :guilabel:`Invite` "
"button in the upper-left corner, and a blank mailing form loads."
msgstr ""
"設定好現場培訓後，下一步是邀請員工。前往:menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 學"
"習 --> 現場`，然後點擊課程的看板卡片。點擊左上角的:guilabel:`邀請`按鈕，系統"
"隨即會載入空白的郵件表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:150
msgid ""
"The form only allows for inviting employees via :guilabel:`Email`. The "
":guilabel:`Subject` is `Event: (Event Title)` by default, and can be changed"
" if desired."
msgstr ""
"此表格只允許透過 :guilabel:`電郵` 邀請員工。:guilabel:`主旨` 預設為 `活動："
"(活動標題)`，如有需要可自行更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:153
msgid ""
"Next, add the employees to the :ref:`Recipients "
"<email_marketing/recipients>` in the respective field, then create the "
":ref:`body of the email <email_marketing/mail_body>`."
msgstr ""
"接下來，在相應欄位中將員工加入至 :ref:`收件人 <email_marketing/recipients>`，"
"然後建立 :ref:`電郵內文 <email_marketing/mail_body>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/learning.rst:156
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send`, and a confirmation pop-up window loads. Click "
":guilabel:`Send to all` on the pop-up window and the invitations are sent."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`傳送`，系統會載入確認彈出視窗。在彈出視窗中按一下 "
":guilabel:`全部傳送`，即可傳送邀請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:5
msgid ""
"When a new employee is hired, the first step is to create a new employee "
"record. This record is a centralized place where all important information "
"about the employee is stored, including :ref:`general information "
"<employees/general-info>`, :ref:`job history and skills <employees/resume>`,"
" :ref:`various work information <employees/work-info-tab>`, :ref:`personal "
"details <employees/private-info>`, :ref:`payroll-related information "
"<employees/payroll>`, and various :ref:`settings <employees/hr-settings>` "
"that affect integrations with other apps in the database."
msgstr ""
"聘用新員工時，第一步是建立新的員工記錄。此記錄集中儲存員工的所有重要資料，包"
"括 :ref:`一般資料 <employees/general-info>`、:ref:`工作履歷與技能 <employees/"
"resume>`、:ref:`各項工作資料 <employees/work-info-tab>`、:ref:`個人詳細資料 "
"<employees/private-info>`、:ref:`薪酬相關資料 <employees/payroll>`，以及影響"
"與資料庫中其他應用程式整合的各項 :ref:`設定 <employees/hr-settings>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:13
msgid ""
"To begin, open the :menuselection:`Employees` app, then click the "
":guilabel:`New` button in the corner. Doing so reveals a blank employee "
"form."
msgstr ""
"首先，開啟 :menuselection:`員工` 應用程式，然後點擊角落的 :guilabel:`新增` 按"
"鈕，系統隨即會顯示空白的員工表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:16
msgid ""
"Proceed to fill out the required information, along with any additional "
"details."
msgstr "繼續填寫所需資料，以及任何其他詳細資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:19
msgid ""
"The employee form automatically saves as data is entered. However, the form "
"can be saved manually at any time by clicking the :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` "
":guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:23
msgid ""
"**All** employee records are considered :ref:`light users <access-"
"rights/roles>` and incur any corresponding fees. For more information, refer"
" to `Odoo's billing page <https://www.odoo.com/pricing>`_."
msgstr ""
"**所有** 員工記錄均會被視為 :ref:`輕量用戶 <access-rights/roles>`，並會產生相"
