#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:52
msgid ""
"Depending on the installed :doc:`payroll localization "
"<../payroll/payroll_localizations>`, the sections and fields in this tab may"
" vary considerably. Due to the specific nature of localizations and the "
"variety of information that may be requested in this tab, it is recommended "
"to check with the accounting department to fill out this section correctly."
msgstr ""
"視乎已安裝的:doc:`薪酬本地化 <../payroll/payroll_localizations>`，此分頁中的"
"部分及欄位可能會有所不同。由於本地化功能具特定要求，且此分頁可能需要填寫各類"
"資訊，建議向會計部門查詢以正確填寫此部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:57
msgid ""
"The *Contract overview* and *Schedule* sections are the **only** universal "
"sections for all payroll localizations. All other sections in the *Payroll* "
"tab are country-specific."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:61
msgid ":doc:`Payroll localizations <../payroll/payroll_localizations>`"
msgstr ":doc:`薪酬本地化 <../payroll/payroll_localizations>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:64
msgid "Contract overview"
msgstr "合約概覽"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:66
msgid ""
"This section contains all the various details from the employee contract. "
"Refer to the :doc:`contracts <../payroll/contracts>` document for detailed "
"information on creating and modifying employee contracts."
msgstr ""
"此部分包含員工合約的所有各項詳情。有關建立及修改員工合約的詳細資訊，請參閱 "
":doc:`合約 <../payroll/contracts>` 文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:73
msgid "Schedule"
msgstr "排程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:75
msgid ""
"This section defines when the employee is expected to work. Configure the "
"following fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours`: Select the hours the employee is expected to work"
" using the drop-down menu. By default, a :guilabel:`Standard 40 hours/week` "
"working schedule is selected. If the **Timesheets** app is installed, an "
":guilabel:`Appointment Resource Default Calendar` option is also available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作時間`：使用下拉式選單選取員工預計的工作時間。系統預設選"
"取:guilabel:`標準每週 40 小時`工作時間表。如果已安裝**工時表**應用程式，亦可"
"選用:guilabel:`預約資源預設行事曆`選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours` are related to a company's working schedules, and "
"an employee **cannot** have working hours that are outside of a company's "
"working schedule."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作時間`與公司的工作時間表相關，員工的工時**不可**超出公司的工作"
"時間表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:86
msgid ""
"Each individual working schedule is company-specific. For multi-company "
"databases, each company **must** have its own working hours set."
msgstr ""
"每個工作時間表均為個別公司專用。在多公司資料庫中，每間公司 **必須** 設定各自"
"的工作時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:89
msgid ""
"If an employee's working hours are not configured as a working schedule for "
"the company, new working schedules can be added, or existing working "
"schedules can be modified."
msgstr ""
"如果員工的工作時間未設定為公司的工作時間表，可以新增工作時間表，或修改現有的"
"工作時間表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:92
msgid ""
"Working hours can be modified in both the **Employees** and **Payroll** "
"apps, where they are referred to as :guilabel:`Working Schedules`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:95
msgid ""
"For more information on how to create or modify :guilabel:`Working "
"Schedules`, refer to the :doc:`working schedules "
"<../payroll/working_schedules>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"有關如何建立或修改:guilabel:`工作時間表`的更多資訊，請參閱:doc:`工作時間表 "
"<../payroll/working_schedules>`說明文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:98
msgid ""
"After the new working hours are created, or an existing one is modified, the"
" :guilabel:`Working Hours` can be selected on the employee form."
msgstr ""
"建立新的工作時間或修改現有工作時間後，便可在員工表單上選取 :guilabel:`工作時"
"間`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:102
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Working Hours` field is **required** and cannot be left "
"blank. For employees with no fixed schedule, :ref:`create a new fully-"
"flexible working schedule <payroll/new-working-schedule>`, then select it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:107
msgid ":doc:`Working hours <working_hours>`"
msgstr ":doc:`工作時間 <working_hours>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attendance Based`: Click this checkbox to have payslips created "
"using the employee's badge records when signing in and out of work in an "
":ref:`attendance kiosk <attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>`. If left unchecked, "
"Odoo uses the employee's selected :guilabel:`Working Hours` to create work "
"entries when processing payroll."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`按考勤計算`：勾選此方塊，即可使用員工在:ref:`考勤自助服務站 "
"<attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>`使用員工證簽到及簽退的紀錄來建立糧單。若未勾選"
"，Odoo 會在處理薪酬時，使用為員工選擇的:guilabel:`工作時間`來建立工作紀錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:115
msgid "Payslip adjustments tab"
msgstr "工資單調整分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:117
msgid ""
"This *Payslip Adjustments* tab houses **all** additional payslip "
"adjustments, including :doc:`salary adjustments "
"<../payroll/salary_attachments>`, child support, commissions, tips, bonuses,"
" expense reimbursements, and any other deduction taken out of the employee's"
" paycheck."
msgstr ""
"此 *糧單調整* 分頁包含 **所有** 額外糧單調整項目，包括 :doc:`薪金調整 <../"
"payroll/salary_attachments>`、子女撫養費、佣金、貼士、獎金、開支報銷，以及從"
"員工薪金中扣除的任何其他扣減項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:121
msgid ""
"Add each individual :ref:`payslip adjustment "
"<payroll/salary_attachments/create>` to this tab."
msgstr "將每項 :ref:`糧單調整 <payroll/salary_attachments/create>` 新增至此分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:126
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:220
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:355
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:76
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:102
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:79
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:67
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:148
msgid "Work tab"
msgstr "工作分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:128
msgid ""
"This tab is visible for all employees, and does not require any other apps "
"to be installed."
msgstr "所有員工皆可看到此分頁，無須安裝任何其他應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:131
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:206
msgid "Work"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company the new employee was hired by using "
"the drop-down menu. This field is required, but only appears when in a "
"multi-company database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：使用下拉式選單選擇聘用新員工的公司。此欄位為必填，但只會在"
"多公司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:135
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Department`: Select the employee's department from the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`部門`：從下拉式選單中選擇員工所屬的部門。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Position`: Select the employee's job position from the drop-"
"down menu. If using the **Recruitment** app, this list reflects configured "
"job positions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`職位`：從下拉式選單選擇員工的職位。如果使用 **招聘** 應用程式，此"
"清單會顯示已設定的職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:138
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Title`: This field is automatically populated with the "
"selection made in the :guilabel:`Job Position` field. Adjust the text, if "
"desired, to best reflect the employee's role."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:142
msgid ""
"Specific details can be added in the :guilabel:`Job Title` field, if "
"desired."
msgstr "如有需要，可在:guilabel:`職位名稱`欄位加入具體詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:144
msgid ""
"For example, a sales representative position configured as :guilabel:`Sales "
"Associate` in the **Recruitment** app can be selected for the :guilabel:`Job"
" Position` field."
msgstr ""
"例如，在 **招聘** 應用程式中設定為 :guilabel:`銷售助理` 的銷售代表職位，可於 "
":guilabel:`職位` 欄位中選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:147
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Job Title` field can be more specific, such as `Sales "
"Associate - Europe` if the employee is focused solely on European sales."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:150
msgid "Both job position fields entered but with different information."
msgstr "兩個職位欄位均已填寫，但資料不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manager`: Select the employee's manager using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`經理`：使用下拉式選單選擇該員工的經理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Next Appraisal Date`: If the **Appraisals** app is installed, "
"this field displays the next scheduled appraisal for the employee. This "
"field is set to six months from the employee's contract date, by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:159
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:517
msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:161
msgid ""
"This section states where the employee is expected to work on any given "
"workday."
msgstr "此部分說明員工在任何工作日預期工作的地點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:163
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select the typical place the employee works from "
"in the :guilabel:`Usual Work Location` field. The default options are "
":icon:`fa-home` :guilabel:`Home`, :icon:`fa-building` :guilabel:`Office`, or"
" :icon:`fa-map-marker` :guilabel:`Other`. This field is **required**."
msgstr ""
"請使用下拉式選單，在:guilabel:`常用工作地點`欄位中選擇員工通常工作的地點。預"
"設選項為 :icon:`fa-home` :guilabel:`家居`、:icon:`fa-building` :guilabel:`辦"
"公室`或 :icon:`fa-map-marker` :guilabel:`其他`。此欄位為 **必填**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:168
msgid ""
"To create a new location, type the location in the field, click "
":guilabel:`Create and edit`, and a *Create Usual Work Location* pop-up form "
"loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:171
msgid ""
"The entered name populates the :guilabel:`Work Location` field, but can be "
"modified. Select the :guilabel:`Work Address` using the drop-down menu. "
"Click the corresponding button to select the :guilabel:`Location Type`. In a"
" multi-company database, a :guilabel:`Company` field appears, and is "
"populated with the current company by default but can be modified if needed."
msgstr ""
"輸入的名稱會自動填入 :guilabel:`工作地點` 欄位，但可加以修改。使用下拉式選單"
"選擇 :guilabel:`工作地址`。按一下相應按鈕以選擇 :guilabel:`地點類型`。在多公"
"司資料庫中，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`公司` 欄位，並預設填入目前公司，如有需要亦"
"可修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:176
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Save` when the form is complete. The window closes, and the"
" newly configured location appears in the field."
msgstr ""
"填妥表單後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`。視窗隨即關閉，新配置的地點便會顯示在欄位中"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:179
msgid ""
"Below the :guilabel:`Usual Work Location` field is a list of the days of the"
" week. For each day of the work week, select where the employee works that "
"day using the drop-down menu. The selected location is reflected on the "
"employee's Kanban card, indicating their location that day."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`慣常工作地點`欄位下方是一星期各天的列表。請使用下拉式選單，為每"
"個工作日選擇員工當天的工作地點。所選地點會顯示在員工的看板卡片上，以標示其當"
"天的工作地點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:183
msgid ""
"Leave the field blank (:guilabel:`Unspecified`) for non-working days, such "
"as Saturday and Sunday."
msgstr "非工作日（例如星期六及星期日）請將此欄位留空（:guilabel:`未指定`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:185
msgid "A new work location form with all fields filled out."
msgstr "已填妥所有欄位的新工作地點表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:189
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:191
msgid "Enter any relevant notes in this field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:194
msgid "Organization chart"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:196
msgid ""
"The related departments appear in this section, illustrating where in the "
"company the employee works. The numbers to the right of each person listed "
"indicates how many direct or indirect reports each employee has."
msgstr ""
"此區段會顯示相關部門，說明員工在公司內的所屬架構位置。每位人員右側的數字代表"
"該員工擁有多少名直接或間接下屬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:201
msgid ""
"After a :guilabel:`Department` is selected, the department's configured "
"manager automatically populates the :guilabel:`Manager` field."
msgstr ""
"選擇 :guilabel:`部門` 後，該部門所設定的經理會自動填入 :guilabel:`經理` 欄位"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:204
msgid "The organizational chart including the employee's manager."
msgstr "包含該員工經理的組織架構圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:210
msgid "Resumé tab"
msgstr "履歷分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:213
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:35
msgid "Resumé"
msgstr "履歷"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:215
msgid ""
"Enter the employee's work history in the *Resumé* tab. Each resumé line must"
" be entered individually. When creating an entry for the first time, click "
"the :guilabel:`Create Resume Lines` button, and a *New Resumé Line* form "
"appears. After an entry is added, the :guilabel:`Create Resume Lines` button"
" is replaced with an :guilabel:`ADD` button. Enter the following information"
" for each entry:"
msgstr ""
"在 *履歷* 分頁輸入員工的工作經歷。每項履歷項目必須逐一輸入。首次建立項目時，"
"按一下 :guilabel:`建立履歷項目` 按鈕，系統會顯示 *新增履歷項目* 表單。新增項"
"目後，:guilabel:`建立履歷項目` 按鈕會變為 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕。請為每個項目"
"輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:221
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Click the corresponding button to reflect the *type* of "
"experience being added. The available options are :guilabel:`Other "
"Experience`, :guilabel:`Education`, :guilabel:`Training`, or "
":guilabel:`Internal Certification`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類型`：按一下相應按鈕以反映要新增的經驗 *類型*。可用選項包括 "
":guilabel:`其他經驗`、:guilabel:`學歷`、:guilabel:`培訓` 或 :guilabel:`內部認"
"證`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:224
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Title`: Type in the title from the previous work experience."
msgstr ":guilabel:`職稱`：輸入過往工作經驗的職稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration`: Enter the start and end dates for the work experience "
"using the calendar module in the corresponding fields."
msgstr ":guilabel:`期間`：在相應欄位中使用日曆模組輸入工作經驗的開始及結束日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:227
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate`: If there is a relevant certificate to attach, click"
" the :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`(Upload)` icon, select the desired file, "
"and click :guilabel:`Select`. The file name appears in the field, not an "
"image of the certificate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:230
msgid ":guilabel:`Description`: Enter any relevant details in this field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`說明`：在此欄位輸入任何相關詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:232
msgid ""
"Once all the information is entered, click the :guilabel:`Save & Close` "
"button if there is only one entry to add, or click the :guilabel:`Save & "
"New` button to save the current entry and create another resumé line."
msgstr ""
"輸入所有資料後，如果只需新增一個項目，請點擊 :guilabel:`儲存及關閉` 按鈕；或"
"點擊 :guilabel:`儲存及新增` 按鈕以儲存目前項目並建立另一行履歷資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:236
msgid "A resumé entry form with all the information populated."
msgstr "已填妥所有資料的履歷項目表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:240
msgid ""
"After the new employee form is saved, the current position and company is "
"automatically added to the *Resumé* tab, with the end date listed as "
"`Current`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:246
msgid "Skills & certifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:248
msgid ""
"An employee's skills and certifications can be entered in the *Resumé* tab "
"in the same manner that a resumé line is created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:251
msgid ""
"To add a skill to an employee record, the skill type must first be "
"configured. By default, Odoo comes with two :guilabel:`Skill Types` "
"preconfigured: *Languages* and *Soft Skills*. :ref:`Configure the rest of "
"the skill types <employees/skill-types>` before adding any skills to the "
"employee record."
msgstr ""
"要將技能新增至員工記錄，必須先設定技能類型。預設情況下，Odoo 已預先設定兩種 "
":guilabel:`技能類型`：*語言* 及 *軟技能*。將任何技能新增至員工記錄之前，請先 "
":ref:`設定其餘的技能類型 <employees/skill-types>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:256
msgid ""
"When adding the first skill to an employee record, a :guilabel:`Pick a skill"
" from the list` button appears in the *Skills* section of the *Resumé* tab. "
"Click the :guilabel:`Pick a skill from the list` button, and a blank *Update"
" Skills* pop-up window loads. Configure the following information for each "
"skill:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:261
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: Select a :ref:`skill type <employees/skill-types>` by "
"clicking it."
msgstr ":guilabel:`類別`：點擊以選擇 :ref:`技能類型 <employees/skill-types>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:262
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skill`: After selecting the :guilabel:`Category`, all "
"corresponding skills associated with that selected category appear in "
"individual buttons. For example, selecting :guilabel:`Languages` for the "
":guilabel:`Category` presents a variety of languages to select from in the "
":guilabel:`Skill` section. Click the appropriate skill from the list."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`技能`：選擇 :guilabel:`類別` 後，所有與該所選類別相關的技能均會以"
"獨立按鈕形式顯示。例如，選擇 :guilabel:`語言` 作為 :guilabel:`類別` 時，系統"
"會在 :guilabel:`技能` 區域顯示各種語言供你選擇。請從清單中點擊合適的技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:268
msgid ""
"If the desired skill does not appear in the list, it is **not** possible to "
"add the new skill from this window. New skills must be added from the "
":ref:`Skill Types <employees/skill-types>` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"如果列表中沒有所需的技能，您 **無法** 在此視窗中新增技能。新技能必須在 "
":ref:`技能類型 <employees/skill-types>` 儀表板中新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:272
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skill Level`: Pre-defined skill levels associated with the "
"selected :guilabel:`Category` appear. Click on a :guilabel:`Skill Level` to "
"select it. Skill levels can be created and modified from the :ref:`Skill "
"Types <employees/skill-types>` dashboard."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`技能等級`：系統會顯示與所選 :guilabel:`類別` 相關聯的預設技能等級"
"。按一下 :guilabel:`技能等級` 即可將其選取。你可在 :ref:`技能類型 <employees/"
"skill-types>` 儀表板中建立及修改技能等級。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:276
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Save & Close` button if there is only one skill to add,"
" or click the :guilabel:`Save & New` button to save the current entry and "
"immediately add another skill."
msgstr ""
"如只需新增一項技能，請點擊 :guilabel:`儲存並關閉` 按鈕；或點擊 :guilabel:`儲"
"存並新增` 按鈕以儲存目前項目並立即新增另一項技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:279
msgid ""
"At any point, a new line can be added by clicking the :guilabel:`Add` "
"button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:281
msgid "A skill form with the information filled out."
msgstr "已填妥資料的技能表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:285
msgid ""
"Only users with :guilabel:`Officer: Manage all employees` or "
":guilabel:`Administrator` rights for the **Employees** app can add or edit "
"skills."
msgstr ""
"只有具備 **職員** 應用程式的 :guilabel:`主任：管理所有員工` 或 :guilabel:`管"
"理員` 權限的使用者，才可新增或編輯技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:291
msgid "Skill types"
msgstr "技能類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:293
msgid ""
"To add a skill to an employee's form, the :guilabel:`Skill Types` must be "
"configured. Navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app --> Configuration --> "
"Skill Types` to view the currently configured skill types and create new "
"skill types."
msgstr ""
"要將技能新增至員工表單，必須先配置 :guilabel:`技能類型`。前往 "
":menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 配置 --> 技能類型`，即可查看目前已配置的技能"
"類型並建立新的技能類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:298
msgid ""
"The default skill of :guilabel:`Languages` is preconfigured with twenty-one "
"skills, and the default :guilabel:`Soft Skills` is preconfigured with "
"fifteen skills."
msgstr ""
"預設的 :guilabel:`語言` 技能已預先設定二十一項技能，而預設的 :guilabel:`軟技"
"能` 則已預先設定十五項技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:301
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button in the corner, and a new *Skill Type* form "
"loads. Fill out the following details for the new skill type. Repeat this "
"for all the needed skill types."
msgstr ""
"點擊角落的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統便會載入新的 *技能類型* 表單。填寫新技"
"能類型的以下詳細資料。為所有需要的技能類型重複此步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:304
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skill Type`: Enter a name for the type of skill. This acts as the"
" parent category for more specific skills and should be generic."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`技能類型`：輸入技能類型的名稱。此名稱用作較具體技能的父類別，應使"
"用較概括的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:308
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certification`: Click the toggle to indicate the skill is a "
"certification. The toggle turns green, indicating it is active and the skill"
" can be added to the :ref:`certifications <employees/certifications>` tab."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`認證`：點擊切換按鈕，表示該技能屬於認證。切換按鈕會轉為綠色，表示"
"已啟用，並可將該技能加入至 :ref:`認證 <employees/certifications>` 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:311
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skills`: Click :guilabel:`Add a line` and enter the "
":guilabel:`Name` for the new skill, then repeat for all other needed skills."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`技能`：點擊 :guilabel:`新增一行` 並輸入新技能的 :guilabel:`名稱`，"
"然後對所有其他所需技能重複此步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:313
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Levels`: Click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and enter a "
":guilabel:`Name` and :guilabel:`Progress` percentage (`0`-`100`) for each "
"level."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`級別`：按一下 :guilabel:`新增一行`，然後為每個級別輸入 "
":guilabel:`名稱` 及 :guilabel:`進度` 百分比（`0`-`100`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:316
msgid ""
"Set a :guilabel:`Default Level` by clicking the toggle on the desired line. "
"Only **one** level can be selected. The toggle turns green to indicate the "
"default level. Typically, the lowest level is chosen, but any level can be "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"點擊所需資料行上的切換按鈕，以設定 :guilabel:`預設級別`。系統只可選擇 **一"
"個** 級別。切換按鈕會變成綠色，表示該級別為預設級別。一般而言會選擇最低級別，"
"但亦可選擇任何級別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:321
msgid ""
"To add math skills in yellow, enter `Math` in the :guilabel:`Skill Type` "
"field, and click the colored circle next to :guilabel:`Color`, and select "
"yellow. Then, in the :guilabel:`Skills` field, enter `Algebra`, `Calculus`, "
"and `Trigonometry`. Next, in the :guilabel:`Levels` field, enter `Beginner`,"
" `Intermediate`, and `Expert`, with the :guilabel:`Progress` listed as `25`,"
" `50`, and `100`, respectively. Click :guilabel:`Set Default` on the "
"`Beginner` line to set this as the default skill level."
msgstr ""
"要新增黃色的數學技能，請在 :guilabel:`技能類型` 欄位輸入 `數學`，點擊 "
":guilabel:`顏色` 旁邊的彩色圓圈，然後選擇黃色。接著，在 :guilabel:`技能` 欄位"
"輸入 `代數`、`微積分` 及 `三角學`。然後，在 :guilabel:`級別` 欄位輸入 `初"
"級`、`中級` 及 `專家`，並在 :guilabel:`進度` 分別填寫 `25`、`50` 及 `100`。"
"在 `初級` 一行點擊 :guilabel:`設為預設`，將其設為預設技能級別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:328
msgid "A skill form for a Math skill type, with all the information entered."
msgstr "數學技能類型的技能表單，已填妥所有資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:332
msgid ""
"Once the form is completely filled out, click the :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` "
":guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon at the top of the screen, and the "
":guilabel:`Levels` rearrange in descending order, with the highest level at "
"the top, and the lowest at the bottom, regardless of the default level and "
"the order they were entered."
msgstr ""
"填妥表單後，點擊畫面頂部的 :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`（手動儲存）` "
"圖示，:guilabel:`級別`隨即會按降序重新排列，不論預設級別及輸入次序為何，最高"
"級別均會置於最頂，最低級別則置於最底。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:340
msgid "Certifications tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:342
msgid ""
"This tab houses all the employee's certifications, which can be important "
"for employees who are required to hold specific certifications to perform "
"their job, such as a :abbr:`CPA (Certified Public Accountant)` certification"
" for accountants, or a :abbr:`CSM (Certified Safety Manager)` certification "
"for a construction manager."
msgstr ""
"此分頁儲存員工的所有認證。對於必須持有特定認證才能履行職務的員工而言，此分頁"
"非常重要，例如會計師的 :abbr:`CPA（註冊會計師）` 認證，或建築經理的 "
":abbr:`CSM（註冊安全經理）` 認證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:347
msgid ""
"The tab lists each :guilabel:`Certification` in a line, and displays the "
"validity period in the :guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`To` fields."
msgstr ""
"此分頁會逐行列出每項 :guilabel:`證書`，並在 :guilabel:`由` 及 :guilabel:`至` "
"欄位顯示有效期限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:351
msgid ""
"This tab **only** appears if *at least one* :ref:`skill type "
"<employees/skill-types>` is configured as a *certification*. When adding "
"certifications, **only** skill types marked as a certification can be "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"**只有** 當 *至少一種* :ref:`技能類型 <employees/skill-types>` 設定為 *認證* "
"時，才會顯示此分頁。新增認證時，**只能** 選擇已標記為認證的技能類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:355
msgid ""
"To add a certification, click :guilabel:`Add a line` in the *Certifications*"
" tab and a blank *Create Certification* pop-up window loads. Enter the "
"following information on the form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:358
msgid ":guilabel:`Skill`: Click on the specific certification being added."
msgstr ":guilabel:`技能`：按一下要新增的特定認證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:359
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Validity`: Click into the two fields, and select the start and "
"end dates for the certification, using the calendar selector."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`有效期`：點擊該兩個欄位，並使用日曆選擇器選取認證的開始及結束日期"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:361
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate`: If a proof of certification document is available, "
"such as a course completion certificate, it can be added in this field. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`(Upload)` icon, navigate to the file,"
" and click :guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`證書`：如有認證證明文件（例如課程完成證書），可在此欄位加入。按一"
"下 :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`(上載)` 圖示，瀏覽至該檔案，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`選擇`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:365
msgid ""
"When the form is complete, click :guilabel:`Save & New` to add the "
"certification and add another, or :guilabel:`Save & Close` to add the "
"certification and close the pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"填妥表單後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存並新增` 以新增認證並繼續新增下一項，或點擊 "
":guilabel:`儲存並關閉` 以新增認證並關閉彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:368
msgid ""
"The certification pop-up with everything configured for a Fire Safety Course"
" certification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:374
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:228
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:366
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:82
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:51
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:112
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:129
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:85
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:73
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:157
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:133
msgid "Personal tab"
msgstr "個人分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:376
msgid ""
"No information in the *Personal* tab is required to create an employee. "
"However, some information in this section may be necessary for the company's"
" payroll department."
msgstr ""
"建立員工時，無須填寫 *個人* 分頁中的資料。不過，此部分的某些資料對公司的薪酬"
"部門而言可能是必需的。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:379
msgid ""
"To properly process payslips and ensure all deductions are accounted for, it"
" is recommended to check with the accounting department and payroll "
"department to ensure all required fields are populated. For example, to pay "
"employees with direct deposit, they **must** have a trusted account listed "
"in the :guilabel:`Bank Accounts` field."
msgstr ""
"為妥善處理薪資單並確保計入所有扣減項目，建議與會計部及薪酬部核對，確保所有必"
"填欄位均已填寫。例如，若要以直接轉賬方式向員工發薪，員工在 :guilabel:`銀行賬"
"戶` 欄位中**必須**列有一個受信任賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:384
msgid ""
"Enter the various information in the following sections and fields of the "
"*Personal* tab. Fields are entered either using a drop-down menu, clicking a"
" checkbox, or typing in the information."
msgstr ""
"在 *個人* 分頁的以下部分及欄位中輸入各項資料。輸入欄位的方式包括使用下拉式選"
"單、勾選複選框或直接輸入資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:388
msgid ""
"Depending on the localization setting, other fields or sections may be "
"present."
msgstr "視乎本地化設定而定，畫面上可能會顯示其他欄位或部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:393
msgid "Private contact"
msgstr "私人聯絡人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:395
msgid "Fill out the following fields in this section:"
msgstr "填寫此部分的以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:397
msgid ":guilabel:`Email`: Enter the employee's personal email address."
msgstr ":guilabel:`電郵`：輸入員工的個人電郵地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:398
msgid ":guilabel:`Phone`: Enter the employee's personal phone number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`電話`：輸入員工的個人電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:399
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank Accounts`: Enter the bank account number using the drop-down"
" menu. If the bank account does not exist, :ref:`create a new bank account "
"<employees/add-bank>` and select it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銀行賬戶`：使用下拉式選單輸入銀行賬戶號碼。如果該銀行賬戶尚未存在"
"，請:ref:`建立新銀行賬戶 <employees/add-bank>`並將其選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:405
msgid "Add a bank account"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:407
msgid ""
"When an employee is added to the database, their bank account must also be "
"added to pay them using the **Payroll** app. To add a new bank account, "
"click into the :guilabel:`Bank Accounts` field in the *Private Contact* "
"section, then click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"在資料庫新增員工時，亦必須新增其銀行賬戶，以便使用**薪酬**應用程式向其支薪。"
"要新增銀行賬戶，請在*私人聯絡資料*部分按一下:guilabel:`銀行賬戶`欄位，然後按"
"一下:guilabel:`建立`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:411
msgid ""
"A blank *Create Bank Accounts* pop-up window loads. Enter the following "
"information on the form:"
msgstr "系統會載入一個空白的 *建立銀行帳戶* 彈出式視窗。請在表格中輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:413
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:481
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Account Number`: Enter the bank account number in this field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:414
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Clearing Number`: The default name for this field is "
":guilabel:`Clearing Number` but may be different depending on the installed "
":doc:`payroll localization <../payroll/payroll_localizations>`. Using the "
"drop-down menu, select the country-specific name for this field. For "
"example, the United States displays :guilabel:`Routing Number` while the "
"United Kingdom displays :guilabel:`Sort Code`. Next, enter the corresponding"
" code in this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`清算編號`：此欄位的預設名稱為 :guilabel:`清算編號`，但可能會根據已"
"安裝的 :doc:`薪酬本地化 <../payroll/payroll_localizations>` 而有所不同。請使"
"用下拉式選單，選擇此欄位在該國家/地區的專屬名稱。例如，美國會顯示 "
":guilabel:`路由號碼`，而英國則會顯示 :guilabel:`分類代碼`。接著，在此欄位輸入"
"相應的代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:419
msgid ""
":guilabel:`BIC/SWIFT`: Enter the Bank Identifier Code in this field. This is"
" used for international wire transfers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`BIC/SWIFT`：在此欄位輸入銀行識別碼（Bank Identifier Code），用於國"
"際電匯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:421
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank Account Type`: Select the kind of account being added. The "
"options are :guilabel:`Checking` or :guilabel:`Savings`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:423
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Holder Name`: Enter the account holder's name in this field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`持有人姓名`：在此欄位輸入賬戶持有人姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:424
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Trust bank account`: Click the toggle so it appears green, "
"indicating it is a trusted bank account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`信任銀行賬戶`：點擊切換開關使其顯示為綠色，表示該銀行賬戶為受信任"
"賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:426
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: This field only appears in a multi-company environment."
" Select a company to restrict the bank account to be used **only** with the "
"selected company. Leaving this field blank makes this information visible to"
" all companies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：此欄位僅在多公司環境中顯示。選擇一間公司，即可限制此銀行帳"
"戶 **僅** 供所選公司使用。若將此欄位留空，所有公司均可檢視此資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:429
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: The employee record the bank account is being added to"
" automatically appears in this field and **cannot** be modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`員工`：正新增銀行賬戶的員工記錄會自動顯示於此欄位，且**無法**修改"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:431
msgid "*Note* tab: Enter any relevant notes in the *Note* tab."
msgstr "*備註* 分頁：在 *備註* 分頁輸入任何相關備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:432
msgid ""
"*Bank Information* tab: Enter the :guilabel:`Bank Name`, :guilabel:`Bank "
"Address`, and the :guilabel:`Intermediary SWIFT` code in the corresponding "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"*銀行資料* 分頁：在相應欄位中輸入 :guilabel:`銀行名稱`、:guilabel:`銀行地址` "
"及 :guilabel:`中介銀行 SWIFT` 代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:435
msgid "The Create Bank Account form with all the information filled out."
msgstr "已填寫所有資料的「建立銀行帳戶」表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:439
msgid ""
"To ensure payments are processed and sent to the bank account, mark the bank"
" account as :guilabel:`Trusted`. Having an untrusted bank account for an "
"employee causes an error in the **Payroll** application when processing "
"direct deposits."
msgstr ""
"為確保付款能順利處理並匯入銀行賬戶，請將該銀行賬戶標記為 :guilabel:`受信任`。"
"若僱員的銀行賬戶未受信任，在 **薪酬** 應用程式中處理直接存款時將會發生錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:443
msgid ""
"If issuing paper checks or paying via cash, the :guilabel:`Bank` field does "
"not need to be configured."
msgstr "如果以紙本支票或現金方式支付，則無須設定:guilabel:`銀行`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:447
msgid "Personal information"
msgstr "個人資料"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:449
msgid ""
"The *Personal Information* section houses some basic information used "
"primarily for payroll and tax purposes. Fill out the following fields in "
"this section:"
msgstr ""
"*個人資料*部分包含主要用於薪酬及稅務用途的基本資料。請填寫此部分中的以下欄位"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:452
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Legal Name`: Enter the employee's legal name in this field. By "
"default, the name entered in the :ref:`general information section "
"<employees/general-info>` populates this field. This is the name that "
"typically is used for filing taxes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:455
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Birthday`: Select the birthday of the employee using the calendar"
" selector."
msgstr ":guilabel:`出生日期`：使用日曆選擇器選擇員工的出生日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:456
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Place of Birth`: Enter both the city or town the employee was "
"born in the first field, and select the country in the second field using "
"the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`出生地點`：在第一個欄位輸入員工出生的城市或城鎮，並在第二個欄位使"
"用下拉式選單選擇國家或地區。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:458
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sex`: Select the employee's legal sex recognized by the state "
"from the drop-down menu. The default options are :guilabel:`Male` and "
":guilabel:`Female`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`性別`：從下拉式選單選擇該國法律認可的員工法定性別。預設選項為 "
":guilabel:`男` 及 :guilabel:`女`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:460
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Disabled`: Check this box if the employee is considered legally "
"disabled."
msgstr ":guilabel:`傷殘`：如果該員工在法律上被認定為傷殘，請勾選此方格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:461
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payslip Language`: Select the language used when printing the "
"employee's payslips. Each language must be :doc:`added to the database "
"<../../general/users/language>` to appear in the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`糧單語言`：選擇列印員工糧單時使用的語言。各種語言必須先 :doc:`新增"
"至資料庫 <../../general/users/language>`，才會出現在下拉式選單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:466
msgid "Citizenship"
msgstr "公民身份"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:468
msgid ""
"The *Citizenship* section outlines all the information relating to the "
"employee's citizenship. This section is primarily for employees who are "
"working in a different country than their citizenship. For employees working"
" outside of their home country, for example on a work visa, this information"
" may be required. Different fields may be visible, depending on the "
"localization installed. Fill out the following fields in this section:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:474
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Nationality (Country)`: Select the country the employee is from "
"using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:476
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Non-resident`: Click this checkbox if the employee is not a legal"
" resident of the country where they are employed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`非居民`：如果員工並非受僱國家的合法居民，請勾選此核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:478
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Identification No`: Enter the employee's national identification "
"number issued by the government in this field. Some examples are Aadhaar, "
":abbr:`SIN (Social Insurance Number)`, :abbr:`SSN (Social Security Number)`,"
" or :abbr:`NIN (National Identification Number)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`身份證號碼`：在此欄位輸入政府簽發的員工國家身份識別號碼，例如 "
"Aadhaar、:abbr:`SIN (社會保險號碼)`、:abbr:`SSN (社會安全號碼)` 或 "
":abbr:`NIN (國民識別號碼)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:481
msgid ":guilabel:`Passport No`: Enter the employee's passport number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`護照號碼`：輸入員工的護照號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:484
msgid ""
"Depending on the installed :doc:`payroll localization "
"<../payroll/payroll_localizations>`, additional fields may appear in this "
"section."
msgstr ""
"視乎已安裝的:doc:`薪酬本地化 <../payroll/payroll_localizations>`，此區段可能"
"會顯示額外欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:488
msgid "Visa & work permit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:490
msgid ""
"This section should be filled in if the employee is working on some type of "
"work permit or visa. This section may be left blank if they do not require "
"any work permits or visas for employment. Enter the applicable following "
"fields in this section:"
msgstr ""
"如員工須持有某類工作許可證或簽證方可工作，應填寫此部分。如受僱無須任何工作許"
"可證或簽證，則可留空。請在此部分填寫以下適用的欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:494
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Visa No`: Enter the employee's visa number. When entered, an "
":guilabel:`Expires on` field appears. Select the date the visa expires using"
" the calendar selector."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`簽證編號`：輸入員工的簽證編號。輸入後，會顯示 :guilabel:`到期日` "
"欄位。請使用日曆選擇器選擇簽證的到期日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:496
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Permit No`: Enter the employee's work permit number. When "
"entered, an :guilabel:`Expires on` field appears. Select the date the work "
"permit expires using the calendar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:498
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document`: click the :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`(Upload)` icon,"
" then navigate to the work permit or visa file in the file explorer, and "
"click :guilabel:`Select` to upload it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`文件`：點擊 :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`（上載）` 圖示，然後在檔"
"案瀏覽器中前往工作許可證或簽證檔案，再點擊:guilabel:`選擇`即可上載。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:502
msgid ""
"Typically, an employee needs either a visa *or* a work permit, not both. For"
" this reason, only one document can be added to the :guilabel:`Document` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"通常員工只需要簽證 *或* 工作許可證其中之一，而非兩者皆需。因此，:guilabel:`文"
"件` 欄位只能加入一份文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:506
msgid "Emergency contact"
msgstr "緊急聯絡人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:508
msgid ""
"This section details the person to contact in the event of an emergency. "
"Enter the following fields:"
msgstr "此部分詳列緊急聯絡人的資料。請輸入以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:510
msgid ":guilabel:`Contact`: Enter the emergency contact's name."
msgstr ":guilabel:`聯絡人`：輸入緊急聯絡人的姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:511
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Phone`: Enter the emergency contact's phone number. It is "
"recommended to enter a phone number that the person has the most access to, "
"typically a mobile phone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:519
msgid ""
"The *Location* section is visible for all employees, and does not require "
"any other apps to be installed for this section to be visible. Enter the "
"following information in this section:"
msgstr ""
"所有員工均可看到 *地點* 部分，毋須安裝任何其他應用程式。請在此部分輸入以下資"
"訊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:522
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Private Address`: Enter the employee's current home address in "
"this field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:523
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Home-Work Distance`: Enter the number of miles or kilometers the "
"employee commutes to work, in one direction. The unit of measure can be "
"changed from kilometers (:guilabel:`km`) to miles (:guilabel:`mi`) using the"
" drop-down menu. This field is **only** required if the employee is "
"receiving any type of commuter benefits or tax deductions based on commute "
"distances."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`通勤距離`：輸入員工單程通勤往返工作地點的英里數或公里數。您可使用"
"下拉式選單，將計量單位由公里（:guilabel:`km`）更改為英里（:guilabel:`mi`）"
"。**僅**在員工領取任何基於通勤距離的通勤津貼或稅務扣減時，才必須填寫此欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:529
msgid "Family"
msgstr "家庭"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:531
msgid ""
"The *Family* section is used for tax purposes and affects the **Payroll** "
"app. Enter the following information in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"*家庭* 部分用於稅務用途，並會影響 **薪酬管理** 應用程式。請在以下欄位輸入以下"
"資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:534
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Marital Status`: Select the marital status for the employee using"
" the drop-down menu. The default options are :guilabel:`Single`, "
":guilabel:`Married`, :guilabel:`Legal Cohabitant`, :guilabel:`Widower`, and "
":guilabel:`Divorced`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:538
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Married` or :guilabel:`Legal Cohabitant` is selected, two "
"additional fields appear: :guilabel:`Spouse Legal Name` and "
":guilabel:`Spouse Birthdate`. Enter these fields with the respective "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:541
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dependent Children`: Enter the number of dependent children. This"
" number is the same number used for calculating tax deductions, and should "
"follow all tax regulations regarding applicable dependents."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`受養子女`：輸入受養子女的人數。此人數與計算稅項扣減時所用的人數相"
"同，且須符合所有有關適用受養人的稅務法規。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:546
msgid "Education"
msgstr "教育"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:548
msgid ""
"The *Education* section allows for only one entry, and should be populated "
"with the highest degree the employee has earned. Configure the following "
"fields:"
msgstr ""
"*教育程度* 部分僅允許輸入一項資料，應填寫員工所獲得的最高學歷。請配置以下欄位"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:551
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate Level`: Select the highest degree the employee has "
"earned using the drop-down menu. The default options are: "
":guilabel:`Graduate`, :guilabel:`Bachelor`, :guilabel:`Master`, "
":guilabel:`Doctor`, and :guilabel:`Other`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`學歷程度`：使用下拉式選單選擇員工獲得的最高學位。預設選項包括"
"：:guilabel:`畢業生`、:guilabel:`學士`、:guilabel:`碩士`、:guilabel:`博士` "
"及 :guilabel:`其他`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:554
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Field of Study`: Type in the subject the employee studied, such "
"as `Business` or `Marketing and Communications`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`主修科目`：輸入員工修讀的學科，例如 `商業` 或 `市場推廣及傳訊`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:558
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:560
msgid ""
"The *Documents* section allows for uploading any relevant documents on the "
"employee form. Click the :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`(Upload)` icon next to"
" the corresponding document name, navigate to the file, then click "
":guilabel:`Select` to upload the file."
msgstr ""
"在員工表單的 *文件* 部分中，可上載任何相關文件。請點擊相應文件名稱旁的 "
":icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`（上載）` 圖示，瀏覽並選取檔案，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`選擇` 以上載檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:564
msgid "The documents that can be uploaded are:"
msgstr "可上載的文件包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:566
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ID Card Copy`: Upload any relevant IDs that may be required by "
"the payroll or HR department."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`身份證副本`：上載薪酬或人力資源部門可能需要的任何相關身份證明文件"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:568
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Driving License`: Upload the employee's driver's license. This "
"field may be necessary if the employee drives as part of their job, or is "
"given a company car to use."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`駕駛執照`：上載員工的駕駛執照。如果員工需要在工作期間駕駛，或獲配"
"公司車輛使用，便可能需要填寫此欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:570
msgid ""
":guilabel:`SIM Card Copy`: Upload a copy of the SIM card if the employee is "
"using a work-issued mobile phone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:572
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Internet Subscription Invoice`: If the employee is receiving "
"benefits or compensation for their internet service, upload their invoice in"
" this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`互聯網訂閱發票`：如果員工就其互聯網服務獲得福利或津貼，請在此欄位"
"上傳其發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:576
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Internet Subscription Invoice` field is for documentation "
"purposes only. Employees must use the :doc:`Expenses app "
"<../../finance/expenses>` to request reimbursement for expenses, or define "
"compensation in the *Payslip Adjustments* tab."
msgstr ""
"此 :guilabel:`互聯網訂閱發票` 欄位僅作存檔用途。員工必須使用 :doc:`開支應用程"
"式 <../../finance/expenses>` 申請開支報銷，或在 *糧單調整* 分頁中定義補償。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:581
msgid "Badges tab"
msgstr "徽章分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:583
msgid ""
"The *Badges* tab is where all earned and awarded :doc:`badges <badges>` are "
"housed."
msgstr "*徽章* 分頁集中顯示所有已獲取及獲頒發的 :doc:`徽章 <badges>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:588
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:51
msgid "Settings tab"
msgstr "設定分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:590
msgid ""
"The *Settings* tab provides various fields for different applications within"
" the database. Depending on the installed applications, different fields and"
" sections may appear in this tab."
msgstr ""
"*設定* 分頁為資料庫內的不同應用程式提供各種欄位。視乎已安裝的應用程式，此分頁"
"可能會顯示不同的欄位及區段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:594
msgid "User"
msgstr "用戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:596
msgid ""
":guilabel:`User`: If desired, select a user in the database to link to this "
"employee using the drop-down menu, or :ref:`create a new user "
"<employees/new-user>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`用戶`：如有需要，可使用下拉式選單選擇資料庫中的用戶以連結至此員工"
"，或:ref:`建立新用戶 <employees/new-user>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:598
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Timezone`: Select the timezone for the employee using the drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`時區`：使用下拉式選單，為員工選擇時區。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:603
msgid "Create a user"
msgstr "建立用戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:605
msgid ""
"If the new employee also needs access to the database, click into the drop-"
"down menu next to the :guilabel:`User` field. Click :icon:`fa-envelope-o` "
":guilabel:`Invite teammates via email` and an *Invite teammates* pop-up "
"window appears."
msgstr ""
"如果新員工亦需要存取資料庫，請點擊 :guilabel:`用戶` 欄位旁的下拉式選單。點擊 "
":icon:`fa-envelope-o` :guilabel:`透過電郵邀請團隊成員`，即會出現 *邀請團隊成"
"員* 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:609
msgid ""
"The employee name populates the :guilabel:`Name` field by default. The "
":guilabel:`Email Address`, :guilabel:`Phone`, :guilabel:`Company`, and "
":guilabel:`photo` fields are populated with the corresponding fields from "
"the :ref:`general information <employees/general-info>` section of form."
msgstr ""
"員工姓名預設會填入 :guilabel:`姓名` 欄位。:guilabel:`電郵地址`、:guilabel:`電"
"話`、:guilabel:`公司` 及 :guilabel:`相片` 欄位，會填入表單 :ref:`一般資訊 "
"<employees/general-info>` 部分的相應欄位資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:613
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Send Invitation` button, an email is sent, and a "
"notification briefly appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:615
msgid "Once the user is created, it populates the :guilabel:`User` field."
msgstr "建立用戶後，系統會自動將其填入 :guilabel:`用戶` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:618
msgid "Users can also be :doc:`created manually <../../general/users/>`."
msgstr "用戶亦可:doc:`手動建立 <../../general/users/>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:620
msgid "The invite a user pop-up window, configured."
msgstr "已設定的邀請用戶彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:628
msgid ""
"To view this section, the user must have :guilabel:`Administrator` rights "
"set for the **Employees** app. For the category to appear, the respective "
"app must be installed. For example, if the **Time Off** app is not "
"installed, the :guilabel:`Time Off` approvers field does not appear. Only "
"one selection can be made for each field."
msgstr ""
"用戶必須擁有**員工**應用程式的 :guilabel:`管理員` 權限，方可檢視此部分。系統"
"亦必須已安裝相應的應用程式，該類別才會顯示。例如，若未安裝**休假**應用程式"
"，:guilabel:`休假` 核准人欄位便不會顯示。每個欄位只可選取一個項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:634
msgid ""
"Only users with *Administrator* rights for the corresponding human resources"
" role appear in the drop-down menu."
msgstr "只有具備相應人力資源角色 *管理員* 權限的使用者，才會顯示在下拉式選單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:637
msgid ""
"To check these rights, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users & "
"Companies --> Users`, and click on a user. Scroll to the *Human Resources* "
"section in the *Access Rights* tab, and check the :guilabel:`Employees` "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"要檢查這些權限，請前往 :menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 用戶及公司 --> 用"
"戶`，然後點擊一位用戶。在 *存取權限* 分頁中捲動至 *人力資源* 部分，並查看 "
":guilabel:`員工` 設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:641
msgid ""
":guilabel:`HR Responsible`: Select the user responsible for validating the "
"employee's contracts using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`人力資源負責人`：使用下拉式選單選擇負責驗證員工合約的使用者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:643
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expense`: Select the user responsible for approving all expenses "
"for the employee using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:645
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Off`: Select the user responsible for approving all time off"
" requests from this employee using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`休假`：使用下拉式選單選取負責批准此員工所有休假申請的用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:647
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Timesheet`: Select the user responsible for approving all the "
"employee's timesheet entries using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工時表`：使用下拉式選單，選擇負責批准該員工所有工時表記錄的使用者"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:649
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attendance`: Select the user responsible for approving all "
"attendance entries for the employee using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:653
msgid ""
"If any approver field is left empty, the approval is done by an "
"Administrator or Approver."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:656
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:985
msgid "Planning"
msgstr "規劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:658
msgid ""
"This section is **only** visible if the **Planning** app is installed, as "
"this section affects what the employee can be assigned in the **Planning** "
"app."
msgstr ""
"此部分 **僅** 在已安裝 **計劃** 應用程式時才會顯示，因為此部分會影響員工在 "
"**計劃** 應用程式中可獲指派的項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:661
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Roles`: Select all the roles the employee can perform using the "
"drop-down menu. There are no preconfigured roles available, so all roles "
"must be :ref:`configured in the Planning app <planning/roles>`. There is no "
"limit to the number of roles assigned to an employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`角色`：使用下拉式選單選取該員工可擔任的所有角色。系統沒有預先設定"
"的角色，因此所有角色都必須:ref:`在「規劃」應用程式中設定 <planning/roles>`。"
"指派給員工的角色數量並無限制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:664
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Role`: Select the default role the employee will "
"typically perform using the drop-down menu. If the :guilabel:`Default Role` "
"is selected before the :guilabel:`Roles` field is configured, the selected "
"role is automatically added to the list of :guilabel:`Roles`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預設角色`：使用下拉式選單選取員工通常擔任的預設角色。如果在選"
"取:guilabel:`預設角色`時尚未設定:guilabel:`角色`欄位，所選角色會自動加"
"入:guilabel:`角色`清單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:669
msgid "Application settings"
msgstr "應用程式設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:671
msgid ""
"This section affects the **Manufacturing** app. Enter the following "
"information in this section."
msgstr "此部分會影響 **製造** 應用程式。請在此部分輸入以下資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:673
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hourly Cost`: Enter the hourly cost for the employee, in a "
"`##.##` format. This cost is factored in when the employee is working at a "
":doc:`work center "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/using_work_centers>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`每小時成本`：以 `##.##` 格式輸入員工的每小時成本。當員工在 "
":doc:`工作中心 <../../inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/"
"using_work_centers>` 工作時，系統會計入此成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:678
msgid ""
"Manufacturing costs are added to the costs for producing a product if the "
"value of the manufactured product is **not** a fixed amount. This cost does "
"**not** affect the **Payroll** application."
msgstr ""
"若製成品的價值 **並非** 固定金額，製造成本會計入生產產品的成本中。此成本 **不"
"會** 影響 **薪酬** 應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:685
msgid "Attendance/Point of Sale/Manufacturing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:687
msgid ""
"This section determines how employees sign in to the **Attendances**, "
"**Point Of Sale**, and **Manufacturing** apps, and only appears if any of "
"those apps are installed."
msgstr ""
"此部分決定員工如何登入 **考勤**、**POS 銷售點** 及 **製造** 應用程式，僅在已"
"安裝其中任何一個應用程式時顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:690
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PIN Code`: Enter the employee's PIN code in this field. This code"
" is used to sign in and out of **Attendances** app kiosks, the **Point Of "
"Sale** app, and the **Manufacturing** app's *Shop Floor* companion module."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`PIN 碼`：在此欄位輸入員工的 PIN 碼。此代碼用於登入及登出 **考勤** "
"應用程式自助終端機、**銷售點** 應用程式，以及 **製造** 應用程式的 *車間* 配套"
"模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:693
msgid ""
":guilabel:`RFID/Badge Number`: Click :guilabel:`Generate` at the end of the "
":guilabel:`RFID/Badge Number` line to create a unique number. Once "
"generated, the number populates the :guilabel:`RFID/Badge Number` field, and"
" the :guilabel:`Generate` option is hidden. Click :guilabel:`Print Badge` to"
" create a PDF file of the employee's badge. The badge can be printed and "
"used to log into a :abbr:`POS (point of sale)` system or :ref:`check in "
"<attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>` on an **Attendances** app kiosk."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`RFID/員工證編號`：點擊:guilabel:`產生`（位於:guilabel:`RFID/員工證"
"編號`一行的末端）以建立專屬編號。編號產生後，會自動填入:guilabel:`RFID/員工證"
"編號`欄位，而:guilabel:`產生`選項亦會隱藏。點擊:guilabel:`列印員工證`即可建立"
"員工證的 PDF 檔案。員工證可列印出來，用於登入:abbr:`POS（銷售點）`系統，或在 "
"**考勤** 應用程式自助終端機上:ref:`簽到 <attendances/kiosk-mode-entry>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:700
msgid ""
"If the employee uses an RFID token or already has an ID badge issued with a "
"barcode, click :guilabel:`Read a badge` and the system allows the barcode or"
" RFID token to be read. Once read, the number populates the "
":guilabel:`RFID/Badge Number` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:705
msgid ""
"To create a new :guilabel:`RFID/Badge Number`, delete the current number, "
"and the :guilabel:`Generate` option reappears. Click :guilabel:`Generate` "
"and a new number appears."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的 :guilabel:`RFID/員工證號碼`，請刪除現有號碼，:guilabel:`產生` 選項"
"便會重新顯示。按一下 :guilabel:`產生`，新的號碼即會出現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:708
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ZKTeco Employee ID`: If the :guilabel:`Attendances ZKTeco "
"BioTime` module is installed, this field appears. Enter the ZKTeco BioTime "
"employee ID in this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ZKTeco 員工編號`：如果已安裝 :guilabel:`出勤 ZKTeco BioTime` 模組"
"，便會顯示此欄位。請在此欄位輸入 ZKTeco BioTime 員工編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:712
msgid "Export"
msgstr "匯出"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:714
msgid ""
"This section is used when exporting data to a third party. Enter the "
"relevant code in the :guilabel:`External Code` field."
msgstr "此部分用於將資料匯出至第三方。請在 :guilabel:`外部代碼` 欄位中輸入相關代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:718
msgid "Invite the employee"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/new_employee.rst:720
msgid ""
"After the employee is created, click the :guilabel:`Invite` button in the "
"top corner of the employee record. An email is sent to the address entered "
"in the :icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`(Work Email)` field in the "
":ref:`General Information <employees/general-info>` section, and a "
"notification stating `Notification. A signup link was sent by email` briefly"
" appears."
msgstr ""
"建立僱員後，點擊僱員記錄上方角落的 :guilabel:`邀請` 按鈕。系統會將電郵發送至 "
":icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`（工作電郵）` 欄位（位於 :ref:`一般資料 "
"<employees/general-info>` 部分）中輸入的地址，並會短暫顯示 `通知。已透過電郵"
"發送註冊連結` 的通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:5
msgid ""
"When an employee leaves the company, it is important to have an "
":ref:`offboarding plan <employees/offboarding>` to ensure all necessary "
"steps are followed, such as returning equipment, revoking access to business"
" systems, filling out HR forms, having an exit interview, and more. "
"Depending on the company, there could be several different offboarding "
"plans, configured for specific departments or divisions, that have different"
" requirements and steps from the main offboarding plan."
msgstr ""
"當員工離職時，制定 :ref:`離職計劃 <employees/offboarding>` 至關重要，以確保所"
"有必要步驟均獲妥善執行，例如歸還設備、撤銷業務系統存取權限、填寫人力資源表格"
"、進行離職面談等。視乎公司情況，系統可為特定部門或分部設定多個不同的離職計劃"
"，當中包含與主要離職計劃不同的要求及步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:12
msgid ""
"In addition to an offboarding plan, the employee record must be "
":doc:`updated to reflect their departure <departures>`, log the reason why "
"they left, and close any open activities associated with the employee."
msgstr ""
"除了離職計劃外，亦必須將員工記錄:doc:`更新以反映其離職情況 <departures>`，記"
"錄其離職原因，並關閉所有與該員工相關的未完成活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:19
msgid "View offboarding plan"
msgstr "檢視離職計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:21
msgid ""
"Before offboarding can begin, it is recommended to check the default "
"offboarding plan that comes preconfigured with the **Employees** app. To "
"view the current default plan, navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app -->"
" Configuration --> Onboarding / Offboarding`. Click :guilabel:`Offboarding` "
"to view the detailed offboarding plan form."
msgstr ""
"在開始辦理離職前，建議先檢查 **員工** 應用程式預設配置好的離職計劃。要查看目"
"前的預設計劃，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 配置 --> 入職 / 離職`。"
"點擊 :guilabel:`離職` 以查看詳細的離職計劃表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:29
msgid "Offboarding plan steps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:31
msgid ""
"The default :guilabel:`Offboarding` plan is minimal, with two default steps "
"(three if the **Fleet** app is installed). All steps are *To-Do* activities,"
" and are scheduled for the day the offboarding plan is launched "
"(:guilabel:`0 days Before Plan Date`). The default steps are:"
msgstr ""
"預設的 :guilabel:`離職` 計劃非常精簡，僅有兩個預設步驟（如果已安裝 **車隊** "
"應用程式，則有三個）。所有步驟均為 *待辦事項* 活動，並安排在啟動離職計劃的當"
"天執行（:guilabel:`計劃日期前 0 天`）。預設步驟如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Organize knowledge transfer inside the team`: The manager must "
"ensure all knowledge the employee has relating to their job position is "
"either documented or shared with colleagues so there is no knowledge gap."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在團隊內組織知識轉移`：經理必須確保該員工與其職位相關的所有知識均"
"已記錄或與同事分享，以免出現知識斷層。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Take Back Fleet`: The fleet manager ensures any vehicles assigned"
" to the employee are either :ref:`unassigned (available for other employees)"
" or the next driver is assigned <fleet/new_vehicle/new-driver>`. This step "
"only appears if the **Fleet** app is installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`收回車隊車輛`：車隊管理員確保指派給該員工的任何車輛均已:ref:`取消"
"指派（可供其他員工使用）或指派下一位司機 <fleet/new_vehicle/new-driver>`。此"
"步驟僅在安裝了**車隊管理**應用程式時才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Take Back HR Materials`: The manager must obtain any documents "
"and materials the HR department requires. It is recommended to check with "
"the HR department to ensure everything required for this step is completed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`收回人力資源物資`：經理必須取回人力資源部門所需的任何文件及物資。"
"建議與人力資源部門確認，以確保完成此步驟所需的一切事項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:45
msgid "The three default steps in the Offboarding plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:49
msgid "Modify offboarding plan"
msgstr "修改離職計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:51
msgid ""
"The default offboarding plan is minimal, so that modifications can be made "
"to accommodate any company's offboarding needs. Every company has different "
"requirements, therefore it is necessary to add the required steps to the "
"offboarding plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:55
msgid ""
"If the offboarding plan is universal, add or modify the default offboarding "
"plan. If the offboarding plan needed is only for a specific department, then"
" :ref:`a new plan should be created <employees/new-offboarding>`, "
"specifically for that department."
msgstr ""
"如果離職計劃適用於所有部門，請新增或修改預設的離職計劃。如果所需的離職計劃僅"
"適用於特定部門，則:ref:`應建立新計劃 <employees/new-offboarding>`，專為該部門"
"而設。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:59
msgid ""
"To modify the default plan, first navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app "
"--> Configuration --> Onboarding / Offboarding`, then click on "
":guilabel:`Offboarding`."
msgstr ""
"要修改預設計劃，請先前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 配置 --> 入職 / 離"
"職`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`離職`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:62
msgid ""
"To modify a step, click on the step and an *Open: Activities* pop-up window "
"appears. Make any desired modifications to the step, then click "
":guilabel:`Save` to accept the changes and close the pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"如要修改步驟，請點擊該步驟，系統會顯示 *開啟：活動* 彈出式視窗。對步驟作出所"
"需修改後，點擊:guilabel:`儲存`以套用變更並關閉彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:66
msgid ""
"To add a new step, click :guilabel:`Add a line` at the bottom of the listed "
"activities in the :guilabel:`Activities To Create` tab, and a blank "
":guilabel:`Create Activities` pop-up window appears. Enter all the "
"information in the pop-up window, then click :guilabel:`Save & Close` if "
"there are no other steps to add, or click :guilabel:`Save & New` if more "
"steps are needed."
msgstr ""
"要新增步驟，請點擊:guilabel:`新增資料行`（位於:guilabel:`待建立活動`分頁中已"
"列出活動的底部），隨即會顯示空白的:guilabel:`建立活動`彈出視窗。在彈出視窗中"
"輸入所有資料後，如無其他步驟需要新增，請點擊:guilabel:`儲存及關閉`；如需新增"
"更多步驟，請點擊:guilabel:`儲存及新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:71
msgid "Configure all the desired steps for the offboarding plan."
msgstr "配置離職計劃的所有所需步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:76
msgid "Create offboarding plan"
msgstr "建立離職計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:78
msgid ""
"For some companies, specific offboarding plans may be necessary for some "
"departments. For these cases, a new department-specific offboarding plan may"
" be needed."
msgstr ""
"對部分公司而言，某些部門可能需要專屬的離職計劃。在這些情況下，可能需要建立全"
"新的部門專屬離職計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:81
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:124
msgid ""
"To create a new onboarding plan, navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app "
"--> Configuration --> Onboarding / Offboarding`. Click the :guilabel:`New` "
"button in the upper-left corner, and a blank *Employee Plans* form loads."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的入職計劃，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 配置 --> 入職 / "
"離職`。點擊左上角的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統便會載入空白的 *員工計劃* 表格"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:85
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:128
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Plan Name`, and select the :guilabel:`Department` using"
" the drop-down menu. This creates a plan *exclusively* for that department."
msgstr ""
"輸入:guilabel:`計劃名稱`，並透過下拉選單選擇:guilabel:`部門`。這樣便會建立一"
"個*專屬於*該部門的計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:88
msgid ""
"Add the various offboarding activities by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line` in"
" the *Activities To Create* tab, and :ref:`configure each activity "
"<employees/offb-plan-form>`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 *要建立的活動* 分頁中的 :guilabel:`新增一行`，以新增各項離職活動，並 "
":ref:`設定各項活動 <employees/offb-plan-form>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:93
msgid ":guilabel:`Plan Name`: The specific name for the plan."
msgstr ":guilabel:`計劃名稱`：該計劃的具體名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Model`: This field specifies where this plan can be used. In this"
" case, in the **Employees** app. This field is not able to be modified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Department`: If left blank (the default setting) the plan is "
"available for all departments. To make the plan department-specific, select "
"a department using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`部門`：若留空（預設設定），此計劃將適用於所有部門。如要將計劃設為"
"特定部門專用，請使用下拉式選單選擇部門。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:99
msgid ""
"Next, add the various steps for the plan by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line` "
"at the bottom of the listed activities in the *Activities To Create* tab, "
"and a blank *Create Activities* pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:103
msgid "Enter the following information in the pop-up window:"
msgstr "在彈出視窗中輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Activity Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select the specific "
"activity to be scheduled. The default options are :guilabel:`To-Do`, "
":guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Call`, :guilabel:`Meeting`, "
":guilabel:`Document`, or :guilabel:`Certifications`. If the **Sign** app is "
"installed, a :guilabel:`Signature` option is available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:109
msgid ":guilabel:`Summary`: Enter a short description for the step."
msgstr ":guilabel:`摘要`：輸入該步驟的簡短說明。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Assignment`: Using the drop-down menu, select the person assigned"
" to perform the activity. The default options are: :guilabel:`Ask at "
"launch`, :guilabel:`Default user`, :guilabel:`Coach`, :guilabel:`Manager`, "
"and :guilabel:`Employee`. If the **Fleet** app is installed, a "
":guilabel:`Fleet Manager` option is available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`指派`：使用下拉式選單選擇獲指派執行活動的人員。預設選項包括"
"：:guilabel:`啟動時詢問`、:guilabel:`預設用戶`、:guilabel:`指導"
"員`、:guilabel:`經理`及:guilabel:`員工`。若已安裝**車隊**應用程式，則會提"
"供:guilabel:`車隊經理`選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:116
msgid ""
"The selection for the :guilabel:`Assignment` role is in relation to the "
"employee. If :guilabel:`Coach` is selected, the employee's coach is assigned"
" to the activity."
msgstr ""
"選取 :guilabel:`指派` 角色時，是相對於該員工而言。如果選取 :guilabel:`教練`，"
"系統便會將該員工的教練指派至該活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:119
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Default user` is selected, an :guilabel:`Assigned to` field "
"appears. Using the drop-down menu, select the user who will always be "
"assigned this activity."
msgstr ""
"若選擇 :guilabel:`預設使用者`，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`指派給` 欄位。請使用下拉"
"式選單，選擇將固定獲指派此活動的使用者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Interval`: Configure the fields in this line to determine the due"
" date of the activity. Enter a number in the first field, then, using the "
"drop-down menus in the following two fields, configure when the due date "
"should be created; (`#`) of :guilabel:`days`, :guilabel:`weeks`, or "
":guilabel:`months`, either :guilabel:`Before Plan Date` or :guilabel:`After "
"Plan Date`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`間隔`：設定此行的欄位以決定活動的到期日。在第一個欄位輸入數字，然"
"後使用接下來兩個欄位的下拉式選單，設定到期日的建立時間；數量（`#`）為 "
":guilabel:`日`、:guilabel:`星期` 或 :guilabel:`個月`，時間為 :guilabel:`計劃"
"日期之前` 或 :guilabel:`計劃日期之後`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:127
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Create Activities` form is completed, click "
":guilabel:`Save & Close` if there are no other steps to add, or click "
":guilabel:`Save & New` to add more steps, as needed."
msgstr ""
"填妥:guilabel:`建立活動`表單後，如無其他步驟需要加入，請點擊:guilabel:`儲存並"
"關閉`；如需加入更多步驟，請點擊:guilabel:`儲存並新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:131
msgid ""
"A company specializing in after-school art programs has two separate "
"offboarding plans, one for the teachers working in the field, and one for "
"office workers."
msgstr ""
"一間專營課後藝術課程的公司有兩項獨立的離職計劃，一項針對外勤教師，另一項針對"
"辦公室員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:134
msgid ""
"The offboarding plan for the teachers is set for the :guilabel:`Art Program "
"Teachers` department, and includes specialized tasks relating to those jobs."
" These include ensuring all art supplies are catalogued and returned, all "
"student feedback forms are turned in, and all access badges and keys for the"
" various locations are returned."
msgstr ""
"教師的離職計劃針對:guilabel:`藝術課程教師`部門而設，當中包括與該等職位相關的"
"專門任務，例如確保所有美術用品均已編目及歸還、收集所有學生意見表，以及歸還各"
"地點的所有門禁證及鑰匙。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:139
msgid "An offboarding plan configured for art teachers."
msgstr "專為美術教師設定的離職計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:143
msgid "Launch offboarding plan"
msgstr "啟動離職計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:145
msgid ""
"After an employee has given notice (typically two weeks) or once the company"
" has decided to terminate the working relationship with the employee, the "
"offboarding plan should be launched. Navigate to the "
":menuselection:`Employees app` and click on the departing employee profile. "
"Click the :guilabel:`Launch Plan` button, and a blank *Launch Plan* pop-up "
"window loads."
msgstr ""
"當員工提出辭職通知（通常為兩星期），或公司決定終止與該員工的僱傭關係後，便應"
"啟動離職計劃。前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式`，然後點擊即將離職員工的個人"
"資料。點擊 :guilabel:`啟動計劃` 按鈕，系統隨即會載入一個空白的 *啟動計劃* 彈"
"出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:150
msgid "The Launch Plan button on the employee profile."
msgstr "員工個人檔案上的「啟動計劃」按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:153
msgid ""
"The top of the screen displays a button for each available plan, as well as "
"a button for the various available activities. Click the desired offboarding"
" plan to select it. Then, using the calendar selector, set a date in the "
":guilabel:`Due Date` field. This is typically the employee's last day, but "
"any date can be selected."
msgstr ""
"畫面上方會顯示每個可用計劃的按鈕，以及各項可用活動的按鈕。點擊所需的離職計劃"
"以選取它。然後使用日曆選擇器，在 :guilabel:`到期日` 欄位設定日期。這通常是員"
"工的最後工作日，但亦可選擇任何日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:158
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:162
msgid ""
"The *Plan Summary* section of the *Launch Plan* pop-up window displays all "
"the steps in the selected plan, along with the user icon for the person "
"assigned to each activity."
msgstr ""
"*啟動計劃* 彈出視窗中的 *計劃摘要* 部分會顯示所選計劃的所有步驟，以及指派予各"
"項活動的負責人用戶圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/offboarding.rst:161
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Schedule` button, and Odoo schedules everything in the "
"plan, according to their respective due dates."
msgstr "點按 :guilabel:`安排` 按鈕，Odoo 便會根據各自的到期日安排計劃中的所有項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:5
msgid ""
"When a new employee is hired, it is important to have an onboarding "
"procedure that can be followed. This ensures that information, equipment, "
"and training are provided to the employee and any other necessary steps for "
"the business are assigned to the correct individuals."
msgstr ""
"聘用新員工時，建立一套可遵循的入職流程非常重要。這可確保新員工獲得所需的資訊"
"、設備及培訓，並將業務所需的其他必要步驟指派給合適的負責人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:9
msgid ""
"Proper onboarding ensures that new employees are given all the information "
"and tools needed to be successful in their roles and have a smooth "
"transition to their new job."
msgstr ""
"妥善的入職培訓可確保新員工獲得在職位上取得成功所需的所有資訊及工具，並順利適"
"應新工作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:13
msgid ""
"Depending on the installed applications, additional steps may appear in the "
"onboarding plan."
msgstr "視乎已安裝的應用程式，入職計劃中可能會顯示額外步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:16
msgid "View onboarding plan"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:18
msgid ""
"Before onboarding can begin, it is recommended to check the default "
"onboarding plan that comes preconfigured with the **Employees** app. To view"
" the current default plan, navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app --> "
"Configuration --> Onboarding / Offboarding`, then click "
":guilabel:`Onboarding` to view the detailed onboarding plan form."
msgstr ""
"在開始入職流程之前，建議先檢查 **員工** 應用程式預先配置的預設入職計劃。要查"
"看目前的預設計劃，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 配置 --> 入職 / 離"
"職`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`入職` 以查看詳細的入職計劃表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:25
msgid "The plan form displays the following information:"
msgstr "計劃表單會顯示以下資訊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:27
msgid ":guilabel:`Plan Name`: The specific name for the onboarding plan."
msgstr ":guilabel:`計劃名稱`：入職計劃的特定名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Model`: Specifies where this plan can be used. In this case, in "
"the **Employees** app. This field cannot be modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`模型`：指定此計劃可使用的位置。在此情況下，即為 **員工** 應用程式"
"。此欄位無法修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Department`: If left blank (the default setting) this plan is "
"available for all departments. Limit the use of the plan to a specific "
"department by selecting the department using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`部門`：如留空（預設設定），此計劃將適用於所有部門。如要限制僅供特"
"定部門使用，請透過下拉式選單選擇該部門。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Activities To Create`: This tab lists all the onboarding steps. "
"Each row displays:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`待建立活動`：此分頁列出所有入職步驟。每一列顯示："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Activity Type`: The specific activity for the step. The default "
"options are :guilabel:`To-Do`, :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Call`, "
":guilabel:`Meeting`, :guilabel:`Document`, and :guilabel:`Certifications`. "
"If the **Sign** app is installed, a :guilabel:`Signature` option is "
"available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:39
msgid ":guilabel:`Summary`: A one line description of the step."
msgstr ":guilabel:`摘要`：以一行簡述該步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Assignment`: Chooses who completes the activity, relative to the "
"new hire:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ask at launch`: Choose the user in the :guilabel:`Assigned To` "
"field when :ref:`launching the onboarding plan <employees/launch-plan>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`啟動時詢問`：在 :guilabel:`指派給` 欄位選擇用戶，並在 :ref:`啟動入"
"職計劃 <employees/launch-plan>` 時指定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default user`: Choose a user who always handles this activity. "
"Defined in the :guilabel:`Assigned to` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預設用戶`：選擇固定處理此活動的用戶。此設定於 :guilabel:`指派給` "
"欄位中定義。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Coach`:  Assigns the employee's coach as defined on the employee "
"record."
msgstr ":guilabel:`導師`：指派員工記錄中所定義的員工導師。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manager`: Assigns the employee's manager as defined on the "
"employee record."
msgstr ":guilabel:`經理`：指派員工記錄中所定義的員工經理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:48
msgid ":guilabel:`Employee`: The new hire completes the activity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：由新入職員工完成此活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fleet Manager`: Assigns the designated **Fleet** app manager. "
"This option is only available if the **Fleet** app is installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`車隊管理員`：指派指定的 **車隊** 應用程式管理員。此選項僅在已安裝 "
"**車隊** 應用程式時提供。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Assigned to`: This field remains blank, unless :guilabel:`Default"
" user` is selected for the :guilabel:`Assignment` field. If "
":guilabel:`Default user` is selected, this field is populated with the "
"selected user."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`指派給`：此欄位會保持空白，除非將:guilabel:`預設用戶`選"
"為:guilabel:`指派`欄位的設定值。如果選擇了:guilabel:`預設用戶`，此欄位會填入"
"所選用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:55
msgid ":guilabel:`Interval`: The time when the activity is active."
msgstr ":guilabel:`時段`：活動處於啟用狀態的時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unit`: The set time interval, either :guilabel:`days`, "
":guilabel:`weeks`, or :guilabel:`months`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`單位`：已設定的時間間隔，可為:guilabel:`日`、:guilabel:`星"
"期`或:guilabel:`月`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Trigger`: How scheduling is determined for the activity. Options "
"are either :guilabel:`Before Plan Date` or :guilabel:`After Plan Date`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:62
msgid ""
"A laptop must be set up and registered to a new employee the day before they"
" start work. The person who performs this step should always be the IT "
"Manager, Abby Jones."
msgstr ""
"必須於新員工入職前一天為其設定及登記手提電腦。執行此步驟的人員應始終為 IT 經"
"理 Abby Jones。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:65
msgid ""
"To configure this activity with these parameters, the :guilabel:`Activity "
"Type` is set to :guilabel:`To-Do`, with a summary of :guilabel:`Assign "
"Laptop`. The :guilabel:`Assignment` field is set to :guilabel:`Default "
"user`, and the :guilabel:`Assigned to` field is set to :guilabel:`Abby "
"Jones`. The :guilabel:`Interval` is :guilabel:`1`, and the :guilabel:`Unit` "
"is set to :guilabel:`days`. The :guilabel:`Trigger` is :guilabel:`Before "
"Plan Date`."
msgstr ""
"要使用這些參數設定此活動，請將 :guilabel:`活動類型` 設為 :guilabel:`待辦事"
"項`，摘要設為 :guilabel:`分配手提電腦`。:guilabel:`指派` 欄位設為 "
":guilabel:`預設用戶`，而 :guilabel:`指派給` 欄位設為 :guilabel:`Abby "
"Jones`。:guilabel:`間隔` 為 :guilabel:`1`，:guilabel:`單位` 設為 "
":guilabel:`天`。:guilabel:`觸發條件` 為 :guilabel:`計劃日期前`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:71
msgid ""
"An activity configured to assign a laoptop the day before an employee starts"
" work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:75
msgid ""
"In a multi-company database, a :guilabel:`Company` field also appears. "
"Selecting a company for an onboarding plan restricts the plan to *only* that"
" company."
msgstr ""
"在多公司資料庫中，還會顯示 :guilabel:`公司` 欄位。為入職計劃選擇公司後，該計"
"劃將 *僅* 適用於該公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:79
msgid "Onboarding plan steps"
msgstr "入職計劃步驟"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:81
msgid ""
"The default :guilabel:`Onboarding` plan includes three default steps. All "
"steps are :guilabel:`To-Do` activities, and are scheduled for the day the "
"onboarding plan is launched (:guilabel:`0 days Before Plan Date`)."
msgstr ""
"預設的 :guilabel:`入職` 計劃包含三個預設步驟。所有步驟均為 :guilabel:`待辦事"
"項` 活動，並排定於啟動入職計劃當日執行（:guilabel:`計劃日期前 0 天`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Setup IT Materials`: The manager must gather and configure all IT"
" materials."
msgstr ":guilabel:`設定 IT 設備`：經理必須收集並設定所有 IT 設備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Plan Training`: The manager must plan the training for the new "
"employee."
msgstr ":guilabel:`規劃培訓`：經理必須為新員工規劃培訓。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Training`: The new employee must complete the training planned by"
" the manager."
msgstr ":guilabel:`培訓`：新員工必須完成經理安排的培訓。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:89
msgid "The three default steps in the Onboarding plan."
msgstr "入職計劃中的三個預設步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:95
msgid "Modify onboarding plan"
msgstr "修改入職計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:97
msgid ""
"A single onboarding plan works only if the flow works for the entire "
"company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:100
msgid ""
"If the onboarding plan is universal, add to or modify the default onboarding"
" plan. If department-specific onboarding plans are needed, :ref:`create a "
"new onboarding plan <employees/create-plan>` and limit the plan to a "
"department."
msgstr ""
"如入職計劃屬通用性質，可加入至預設入職計劃或將其修改。如需部門專用的入職計劃"
"，請 :ref:`建立新的入職計劃 <employees/create-plan>`，並將計劃限制至特定部門"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:104
msgid ""
"To modify the default plan, first navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app "
"--> Configuration --> Onboarding / Offboarding`, then click on "
":guilabel:`Onboarding`."
msgstr ""
"要修改預設計劃，請先前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 設定 --> 入職 / 離"
"職`，然後按一下 :guilabel:`入職`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:107
msgid ""
"To modify a step, click on it. In the *Open: Activities* pop-up window, make"
" any desired modifications to the step, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"如要修改步驟，請點擊該步驟。在 *開啟：活動* 彈出視窗中，對步驟作出所需修改，"
"然後點擊:guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:110
msgid ""
"To add a new step, click :guilabel:`Add a line` at the bottom of the listed "
"activities in the *Activities To Create* tab, and a blank *Create "
"Activities* pop-up window appears. Enter all the information in the pop-up "
"window, then click :guilabel:`Save & Close` if there are no other steps to "
"add, or click :guilabel:`Save & New` if more steps are needed."
msgstr ""
"如要新增步驟，請在*待建立活動*分頁中所列活動的底部點擊:guilabel:`新增一行`，"
"系統隨即會彈出空白的*建立活動*視窗。在彈出視窗中輸入所有資訊，如果沒有其他步"
"驟需要新增，請點擊:guilabel:`儲存並關閉`；如果需要新增更多步驟，請點"
"擊:guilabel:`儲存並新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:118
msgid "Create onboarding plan"
msgstr "建立入職計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:120
msgid ""
"Some companies require different onboarding plans, when there are "
"department-specific onboarding procedures that do not apply to the whole "
"company. For these cases, a new department-specific onboarding plan must be "
"created."
msgstr ""
"當某些部門有不適用於整間公司的專屬入職程序時，部分公司會需要不同的入職計劃。"
"在這些情況下，必須建立新的部門專屬入職計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:131
msgid ""
"Add the various onboarding activities by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line` in "
"the *Activities To Create* tab, and :ref:`configure each activity "
"<onboarding/plan-form>`."
msgstr ""
"在 *要建立的活動* 分頁中點按 :guilabel:`加入資料行`，即可新增各項入職活動，"
"並 :ref:`設定各項活動 <onboarding/plan-form>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:135
msgid ""
"A company specializing in the manufacturing and selling of outdoor metal "
"furniture may have a large factory that produces the products, and a "
"separate sales office. This company may have two separate onboarding plans, "
"one for factory workers, and one for office workers."
msgstr ""
"一間專門製造及銷售戶外金屬家具的公司，可能設有一間生產產品的大型工廠，以及一"
"個獨立的銷售辦事處。該公司可以設立兩個獨立的入職計劃，一個供工廠工人使用，另"
"一個供辦公室職員使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:139
msgid ""
"The onboarding plan for the factory workers is set for the "
":guilabel:`Manufacturing` department, and includes specialized tasks "
"relating to factory jobs. These include gathering the new employees uniform "
"and safety gear, assigning a safety course, emailing their team about the "
"new hire, going over benefits, and more."
msgstr ""
"工廠工人的入職計劃設於 :guilabel:`製造` 部門，並包含與工廠工作相關的專門任務"
"，包括為新員工準備制服及安全裝備、指派安全課程、向團隊發送電郵通知新員工入職"
"、講解福利等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:144
msgid "An onboarding plan configured for factory workers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:150
msgid "Launch onboarding plan"
msgstr "啟動入職計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:152
msgid ""
"After an employee has been hired and their employee profile :ref:`is created"
" <recruitment/offer_job_positions/new-employee>`, navigate to the desired "
"employee's profile by clicking on their Kanban card on the **Employees** app"
" dashboard, then click the :guilabel:`Launch Plan` button on their employee "
"profile, and a blank *Launch Plan* pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""
"僱員獲聘且其僱員檔案 :ref:`已建立 <recruitment/offer_job_positions/new-"
"employee>` 後，請在 **員工** 應用程式儀表板上點擊相關僱員的看板卡片，前往其僱"
"員檔案。接著，點擊僱員檔案上的 :guilabel:`啟動計劃` 按鈕，系統便會載入空白的 "
"*啟動計劃* 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:157
msgid ""
"The top of the screen displays a button for each available plan, as well as "
"a button for the various available activities. Click the desired onboarding "
"plan to select it. Then, using the calendar selector, set a date in the "
":guilabel:`Due Date` field. This is typically the employee's first day, but "
"any date can be selected."
msgstr ""
"畫面頂部會顯示每個可用計劃的按鈕，以及各項可用活動的按鈕。點擊所需的入職計劃"
"將其選取，然後使用日曆選擇器在 :guilabel:`到期日` 欄位中設定日期。此日期通常"
"為員工的入職首天，但亦可選擇任何日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:165
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Schedule` button, and Odoo schedules everything in the "
"plan according to their respective due dates."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`排程` 按鈕，Odoo 便會根據各自的到期日，為計劃中的所有項目進行"
"排程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:168
msgid ""
"All scheduled activities appear in the both chatter of the employee profile,"
" and in the chatter of the users with assignments relating to the plan."
msgstr ""
"所有已排程的活動均會同時顯示於員工檔案的溝通欄，以及獲指派該計劃相關任務之用"
"戶的溝通欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:172
msgid ""
"If any activity assignments were configured to :guilabel:`Ask at launch`, an"
" :guilabel:`Assigned to` field appears on the *Launch Plan* pop-up window. "
"Using the drop-down menu, select the user responsible for all the unassigned"
" activities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:176
msgid "All onboarding tasks scheduled in the chatter."
msgstr "所有已安排在通訊欄中的入職任務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/onboarding.rst:180
msgid ""
"Onboarding can only be launched for :doc:`users <../../general/users>` of "
"the database. If there is any missing information on the employee's profile,"
" a warning listing the information needed appears."
msgstr ""
"只可為資料庫的 :doc:`用戶 <../../general/users>` 啟動入職流程。如果員工個人資"
"料中有任何遺漏資訊，系統會顯示警告並列出所需資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Employees** app allows users with the correct :doc:`access rights "
"<../../general/users/access_rights>`, typically managers, to view current "
"employee skills. This report is helpful in determining which employee best "
"fits a specific task or role requiring certain skills."
msgstr ""
"**員工**應用程式讓擁有適當:doc:`存取權限 <../../general/users/access_rights>"
"`的使用者（通常是管理人員）查看現有員工技能。此報表有助判斷哪位員工最適合需要"
"特定技能的任務或職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:11
msgid "View skills inventory report"
msgstr "查看技能盤點報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:13
msgid ""
"To view the *Skills Inventory* report, navigate to :menuselection:`Employees"
" app --> Reporting --> Skills Inventory`. The report lists all skills, "
"grouped by :guilabel:`Skill Type`, then individual :guilabel:`Skill`. All "
"results are collapsed by default and must be expanded to view the "
":guilabel:`Skill Type`, :guilabel:`Skill`, and :guilabel:`Skill Level`."
msgstr ""
"要檢視 *技能清單* 報表，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 報表 --> 技能"
"清單`。該報表會列出所有技能，先按 :guilabel:`技能類型` 分組，再按個別 "
":guilabel:`技能` 列出。所有結果預設為摺疊狀態，必須展開才可檢視 :guilabel:`技"
"能類型`、:guilabel:`技能` 及 :guilabel:`技能等級`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:18
msgid ""
"Click on any :guilabel:`Skill Type` to expand the list and display the "
"individual :guilabel:`Skills`. Click on any individual :guilabel:`Skill` to "
"further expand the list and display all employees with that specific "
":guilabel:`Skill`, alphabetically."
msgstr ""
"點擊任何 :guilabel:`技能類型` 以展開清單並顯示各項 :guilabel:`技能`。點擊任何"
"個別 :guilabel:`技能` 即可進一步展開清單，並按字母順序顯示具備該特定 "
":guilabel:`技能` 的所有員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:22
msgid ""
"Both the :guilabel:`Skill Type` and :guilabel:`Skill` lines display a number"
" after each listed line. The number indicates how many employees have the "
"specific :guilabel:`Skill Type` or :guilabel:`Skill`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:26
msgid "When fully expanded, each line displays the following information:"
msgstr "完全展開後，每行會顯示以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:28
msgid ":guilabel:`Employee`: The name of the employee with the skill."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：擁有該技能的員工姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:29
msgid ":guilabel:`Skill Type`: The broader category of the skill."
msgstr ":guilabel:`技能類型`：技能的較大分類。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skill`: The specific skill nested within the :guilabel:`Skill "
"Type`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`技能`：隸屬於:guilabel:`技能類型`內的特定技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skill Level`: The current level the employee has achieved for the"
" skill."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Level Progress`: The percentage the employee has achieved, with "
"`100%` indicating the skill is mastered."
msgstr ":guilabel:`級別進度`：員工已達成的百分比，其中 `100%` 代表已精通該技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:36
msgid ""
"Only skills that have employees associated with them appear on the list. If "
"no employee has a specific skill, the skill is hidden by default."
msgstr "清單只會顯示與員工關聯的技能。如沒有員工擁有特定技能，該技能預設會隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:39
msgid ""
"The Skills Inventory report expanded to show employees with Python "
"programming skills."
msgstr "已展開的技能清單報表，顯示具備 Python 編程技能的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:43
msgid "Use case: Find Spanish-speaking employees"
msgstr "使用案例：尋找說西班牙語的員工"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:45
msgid ""
"An automobile company is experiencing issues with a subassembly manufactured"
" overseas. It is determined that a site visit to the factory is needed to "
"resolve the issue. Since the staff of the subassembly company primarily "
"speak Spanish, and the staff of the automobile company primarily speak "
"English, management wants to send an employee who speaks Spanish."
msgstr ""
"一間汽車公司在海外製造的組件出現問題，經評估後認為需要派員到工廠實地視察以解"
"決問題。由於該組件公司的員工主要操西班牙語，而汽車公司的員工主要操英語，管理"
"層希望派遣一位能操西班牙語的員工前往。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:50
msgid ""
"The *Skills Inventory* report allows for discovering which employee speaks "
"Spanish, and at what level, allowing management to make the best decision."
msgstr ""
"管理層可透過 *技能清單* 報表，了解哪些員工懂西班牙語及其熟練程度，從而作出最"
"佳決策。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:53
msgid ""
"To determine the most fluent Spanish speakers, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Employees app --> Reporting --> Skills Inventory`. Since the"
" manufacturing department is the most qualified to handle manufacturing "
"issues, someone from that department is desired. To only view employees from"
" that department, click into the search bar, and click :guilabel:`Custom "
"filter...` in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` column."
msgstr ""
"若要找出西班牙語最流利的員工，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 報"
"表 --> 技能清單`。由於製造部門最適合處理製造問題，因此需要該部門的員工。若要"
"僅查看該部門的員工，請點擊搜尋欄，並點擊 :guilabel:`自訂篩選條件...`（位於 "
":icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 欄中）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:59
msgid ""
"In the *Custom Filter* pop-up window, set the first field to "
":guilabel:`Department` and the last field to "
":guilabel:`Administration/Manufacturing`, then click :guilabel:`Search`."
msgstr ""
"在 *自訂篩選* 彈出式視窗中，將第一個欄位設為 :guilabel:`部門`，將最後一個欄位"
"設為 :guilabel:`行政/製造`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`搜尋`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:62
msgid ""
"The custom filter to only show employees in the manufacturing department."
msgstr "只顯示製造部門員工的自訂篩選器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:65
msgid ""
"Once the filter is active, expand :guilabel:`Languages` then expand "
":guilabel:`Spanish`. The resulting list only displays employees within the "
"manufacturing department, with Spanish language skills."
msgstr ""
"啟用篩選器後，展開 :guilabel:`語言`，然後展開 :guilabel:`西班牙語`。產生的清"
"單只會顯示製造部門內具備西班牙語技能的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:69
msgid ""
"In this example, it can be determined that both :guilabel:`Samantha Adams` "
"and :guilabel:`Carol McArthur` both speak Spanish fluently (a "
":guilabel:`Level Progress` of :guilabel:`100%`) and are good candidates for "
"the manufacturing trip to their subassembly manufacturer."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，可以確定 :guilabel:`Samantha Adams` 和 :guilabel:`Carol "
"McArthur` 均能流利說西班牙語（:guilabel:`等級進度` 達 :guilabel:`100%`），因"
"此是前往分裝件製造商進行生產考察的合適人選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/skills_inventory.rst:73
msgid ""
"The report displaying employees in the manufacturing department who speak "
"Spanish."
msgstr "顯示製造部門中懂西班牙語員工的報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:5
msgid ""
"Most companies require training for their employees. As a company grows, it "
"becomes important to ensure that employees have the specific training "
"required for their job. Odoo's **Employees** app has a *Training "
"Attendances* report that tracks completed employee training. Managers can "
"use this report to identify employees who have completed the required "
"training for a specific role or project."
msgstr ""
"大多數公司都要求員工接受培訓。隨著公司發展，確保員工具備其職位所需的特定培訓"
"變得相當重要。Odoo 的 **員工** 應用程式設有 *培訓出席記錄* 報表，用於追蹤員工"
"已完成的培訓。經理可使用此報表找出已完成特定職位或項目所需培訓的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:12
msgid ""
"Only managers and employees with the proper :doc:`access rights "
"<../../general/users/access_rights>` can access the *Training Attendances* "
"report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:16
msgid "View training attendances report"
msgstr "檢視培訓出席報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:18
msgid ""
"To view the *Training Attendances* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Employees app --> Learning --> Training Attendances`. The "
"report displays a list of all trainings for all employees, in descending "
"chronological order, with the most recent training at the top."
msgstr ""
"如要查看 *培訓出席紀錄* 報表，請前往 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 學"
"習 --> 培訓出席紀錄`。該報表會按時間降序排列顯示所有員工的全部培訓清單，最近"
"的培訓會顯示在最上方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:22
msgid "Each line of the report displays the following information:"
msgstr "報表的每一行均會顯示以下資訊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: The name of the employee who received the training."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：接受培訓的員工姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:25
msgid ":guilabel:`Training Title`: The title for the training course."
msgstr ":guilabel:`培訓標題`：培訓課程的標題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:26
msgid ":guilabel:`Date`: The date the training was completed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: The specific format the training was done in, either at "
"the company (:guilabel:`Onsite`), at a training facility "
"(:guilabel:`External`), or virtually through an online course "
"(:guilabel:`eLearning`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類型`：進行培訓的具體形式，可選擇在公司內進行（:guilabel:`現場`）"
"、在培訓機構進行（:guilabel:`外部`），或透過網上課程進行虛擬培訓"
"（:guilabel:`網上學習`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Resume Section`: Where the training appears on the employee "
"record."
msgstr ":guilabel:`履歷部分`：培訓在員工記錄中顯示的位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate`: The certificate earned from the training, if "
"available."
msgstr ":guilabel:`證書`：培訓所獲得的證書（如有）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:33
msgid ""
"The Training Attendances report, with all employee training in chronological"
" order."
msgstr "培訓出勤報表，按時間順序列出所有員工培訓記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:37
msgid "Add a training"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:39
msgid ""
"As employees complete training, it is important to add their training to "
"their employee record. This can be done from the :ref:`employee record "
"<employees/training_attendances/employee>` or from the :ref:`Training "
"Attendances report <employees/training_attendances/report>`."
msgstr ""
"當員工完成培訓後，務必將其培訓紀錄加入員工檔案。這可於 :ref:`員工檔案 "
"<employees/training_attendances/employee>` 或 :ref:`培訓出席紀錄報表 "
"<employees/training_attendances/report>` 中完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:46
msgid "From the employee record"
msgstr "從員工記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:48
msgid ""
"To add training from an employee record, open the **Employees** app, click "
"the employee's Kanban card, and click the *Resume* tab. On the *Resume* side"
" of the tab, click the :guilabel:`Add` button and a *New Resume Line* pop-up"
" window appears. Enter the following information for each entry:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:52
msgid ":guilabel:`Type`: Click :guilabel:`Training` if not already selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:53
msgid ":guilabel:`Title`: Type in the title for the training."
msgstr ":guilabel:`標題`：輸入培訓的標題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Course Type`: Select how the training was conducted. The options "
"are: :guilabel:`External` for any offsite training, including online classes"
" or in-person training, :guilabel:`Onsite` for in-person training at the "
"company (through the **Events** app), or :guilabel:`eLearning` for online "
"training courses taken through the **eLearning** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`External URL`: If :guilabel:`External` is selected for the "
":guilabel:`Course Type`, this field appears. Enter a relevant URL for the "
"training, such as the online course or a summary of the training."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`外部網址`：若選擇 :guilabel:`外部` 作為 :guilabel:`課程類型`，此欄"
"位便會顯示。請輸入與培訓相關的網址，例如網上課程或培訓摘要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Onsite Course`: If :guilabel:`Onsite` is selected for the "
":guilabel:`Course Type`, this field appears. Using the drop-down menu, "
"select the training event the employee attended through the **Events** app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`現場課程`：如果選擇 :guilabel:`現場` 作為 :guilabel:`課程類型`，便"
"會顯示此欄位。請透過下拉式選單，選擇員工經由**活動**應用程式參加的培訓活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`eLearning Course`: If :guilabel:`eLearning` is selected for the "
":guilabel:`Course Type`, this field appears. Using the drop-down menu, "
"select the **eLearning** class the employee took."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`線上學習課程`：如果選擇:guilabel:`線上學習`作為:guilabel:`課程類"
"型`，此欄位便會顯示。請使用下拉式選單，選擇員工修讀的**線上學習**課程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: The current date populates this field by default. Using "
"the calendar selector, select the date the training was completed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`日期`：此欄位預設會填入目前日期。請使用日曆選擇器，選取完成培訓的"
"日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:69
msgid ":guilabel:`Duration`: Enter the number of hours of the training."
msgstr ":guilabel:`時長`：輸入培訓的時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate`: If there is a relevant certificate to attach, click"
" the :guilabel:`Upload your file` button, select the desired file, and click"
" :guilabel:`Select`. The file name appears in the field, not an image of the"
" certificate."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`證書`：如有相關證書需要附加，請點擊:guilabel:`上載你的檔案`按鈕，"
"選取所需檔案，然後點擊:guilabel:`選取`。欄位只會顯示檔案名稱，而非證書圖像。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: Enter any relevant details for the training in this"
" field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`說明`：在此欄位輸入培訓的任何相關詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:75
msgid ""
"Once all the information is entered, click the :guilabel:`Save & Close` "
"button if there is only one training to add, or click the :guilabel:`Save & "
"New` button to save the current entry and create another training record."
msgstr ""
"輸入所有資料後，若只需新增一項培訓，請點擊 :guilabel:`儲存並關閉` 按鈕；若要"
"儲存目前項目並建立另一項培訓記錄，請點擊 :guilabel:`儲存並新增` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:80
msgid ""
"If the **eLearning** or **Events** apps are not installed, the corresponding"
" fields and options do not appear on the *New Resume Line* pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"如果未安裝 **線上學習** 或 **活動** 應用程式， *新增履歷項目* 彈出視窗中便不"
"會顯示相應的欄位及選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:83
msgid "A training entry form with all the information populated."
msgstr "已填妥所有資料的培訓項目表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:89
msgid "From the training attendances report"
msgstr "從培訓出席報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:91
msgid ""
"To add a training record from the *Training Attendances* report, navigate to"
" :menuselection:`Employees app --> Learning --> Training Attendances`. Click"
" the :guilabel:`New` button, and a blank line appears at the bottom of the "
"report. Configure the following fields on the line:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: Using the drop-down menu, select the employee who "
"completed the training."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：使用下拉選單，選擇已完成培訓的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:97
msgid ":guilabel:`Training Title`: Type in the name of the training taken."
msgstr ":guilabel:`培訓名稱`：輸入所參加培訓的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: Using the calendar selector, select the date the training "
"was completed. This field is populated with the current date by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select the format for the "
"training. The options are: :guilabel:`External` for any offsite training, "
"including online classes or in-person training, :guilabel:`Onsite` for in-"
"person training at the company (through the **Events** app), or "
":guilabel:`eLearning` for online training courses taken through the "
"**eLearning** app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類型`：使用下拉式選單選擇培訓形式。選項包括：:guilabel:`外部`（適"
"用於任何場外培訓，包括網上課程或親身培訓）、:guilabel:`現場`（適用於透過 **活"
"動** 應用程式在公司進行的親身培訓），或 :guilabel:`網上學習`（適用於透過 **網"
"上學習** 應用程式修讀的網上培訓課程）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:104
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Resume Section`: Select :guilabel:`Training` from the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`履歷章節`：從下拉式選單中選取:guilabel:`培訓`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate`: If a certificate was received or required as proof "
"of training, click :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`Upload your file`, "
"navigate to the desired file, and click :guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`證書`：如已收到證書或需要證書作為培訓證明，請點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"download` :guilabel:`上載你的檔案`，瀏覽並選取所需檔案，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`選擇`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:109
msgid ""
"As the information is entered, Odoo automatically saves the entry. Refresh "
"the page to reload the report. The entry is moved to the correct place on "
"the report, based on the date."
msgstr ""
"輸入資料時，Odoo 會自動儲存該項目。重新整理頁面以重新載入報表。該項目會根據日"
"期移動到報表上的正確位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:113
msgid ""
"Since adding training records from the *Training Attendances* report does "
"not allow for the selection of the corresponding training from the "
"**eLearning** and **Events** apps, it is best to add these training records "
":ref:`from the employee record <employees/training_attendances/employee>`."
msgstr ""
"由於從*培訓出席記錄*報表新增培訓記錄時，無法選擇**電子學習**及**活動**應用程"
"式中的相應培訓課程，因此建議:ref:`從員工記錄 <employees/training_attendances/"
"employee>`新增這些培訓記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/training_attendances.rst:118
msgid ""
"If a training record is added from the *Training Attendances* report, the "
"record can be updated from the employee record to add any missing "
"information, such as the **eLearning** course, training event from the "
"**Events** app, or a description."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Working hours define the schedule during which employees or equipment are "
"expected to work or be available for use, and are configured separately for "
"each company in a database."
msgstr ""
"工作時間定義員工預期工作或設備預期可供使用的時間表，並會在資料庫中為每間公司"
"單獨配置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:10
msgid ""
"In Odoo, *working hours* are the hours during which employees or equipment "
"are scheduled to work or be available for use."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中，*工作時間* 是指員工或設備獲編排工作或可供使用的時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:14
msgid ""
"Working hours may also be known as a *working schedule* in some Odoo "
"applications."
msgstr "在部分 Odoo 應用程式中，工作時數亦可能稱為 *工作時間表*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:16
msgid ""
"Working hours are company-specific; however, working hours can be applied to"
" all companies by leaving the :guilabel:`Company` field blank."
msgstr ""
"工作時數因公司而異；不過，將 :guilabel:`公司` 欄位留空即可將工作時數套用至所"
"有公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:19
msgid "Working hours appear in several apps, including:"
msgstr "工作時間會顯示在多個應用程式中，包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:21
msgid ":menuselection:`Employees --> Configuration --> Working Schedules`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`員工 --> 配置 --> 工作時間表`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:22
msgid ":menuselection:`Payroll --> Configuration --> Working Schedules`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:23
msgid ":menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Configuration --> Work Centers`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`製造 --> 設定 --> 工作中心`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:28
msgid "Working hours form"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:30
msgid "The following fields are available in all working hours forms:"
msgstr "所有工作時間表單均提供以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: Enter the name for the new working schedule. This should "
"be descriptive and clear to understand, such as `20 Hours/Week`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Calendar Type`: Select :guilabel:`Fixed` or :guilabel:`Variable`."
" :ref:`Fixed working hours <employees/working_hours/fixed-schedule>` are "
"good for schedules that require specific working hours. :ref:`Variable "
"working hours <employees/working_hours/variable-schedule>` work best for "
"businesses with split work schedules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days per Week`: The number of days per week that the schedule is "
"valid is displayed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`每週天數`：顯示該工作時間表每週適用的天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company that can use these new working hours"
" from the drop-down menu. Leaving this field blank indicates that it is "
"available for all companies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：從下拉式選單選擇可使用這些新工作時間的公司。如果將此欄位留"
"空，則表示適用於所有公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hours per Week`: The number of hours per week that the schedule "
"covers is displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:46
msgid "Fixed working hours"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:48
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`Fixed` option, the :guilabel:`Hours per Week` and "
":guilabel:`Days per Week` fields are automatic formula fields that update "
"based on the number of hours configured in the :guilabel:`Hours` column and "
"the number of days listed in the :guilabel:`Day of the Week` column."
msgstr ""
"對於 :guilabel:`固定` 選項，:guilabel:`每週時數` 及 :guilabel:`每週天數` 欄位"
"屬於自動計算公式欄位，會根據 :guilabel:`時數` 欄中設定的小時數，以及 "
":guilabel:`星期幾` 欄中所列的天數自動更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:52
msgid ""
"When the work week days and hours are configured, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "設定好每週工作日數及工時後，按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:54
msgid "The following columns are available in the form:"
msgstr "表單中提供以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Day of Week`: Select the day of the week that the schedule is "
"made for."
msgstr ":guilabel:`星期幾`：選擇此排程所適用的星期幾。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hours`: Specify how many hours the schedule is for on the "
"specified day."
msgstr ":guilabel:`時數`：指定該排班在指定日期的總時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work from`: Specify the time that the schedule starts, in 24-hour"
" format."
msgstr ":guilabel:`工作開始時間`：以 24 小時制指定更表的開始時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work to`: Specify the time that the schedule ends, in 24-hour "
"format."
msgstr ":guilabel:`工作結束時間`：以 24 小時制指定時間表的結束時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:61
msgid ""
"If a column is not displayed, click the :icon:`fa-sliders` "
":guilabel:`(Optional column toggle)` icon and select the checkbox for it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:65
msgid ""
"Working hours are company-specific and **cannot** be shared between "
"companies. Each company needs to have its own set of working hours."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:68
msgid ""
"To edit a day and its hours, click in the :guilabel:`Hours` column and enter"
" the number of working hours for that day. To remove the day, click the "
":guilabel:`Delete row` icon. At the bottom of the :guilabel:`Hours` column "
"is the calculated total of work hours for the work week."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:72
msgid "A 40-hour, 5-day schedule of the Fixed calendar type."
msgstr "固定日曆類型的每週 5 天、共 40 小時工作時間表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:78
msgid "Variable working hours"
msgstr "可變工時"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:80
msgid ""
"Variable calendar types are well-suited to businesses with split work "
"schedules. This option allows industries with variable demand, such as "
"hotels or businesses that rely heavily on tourism, to staff peak hours while"
" reducing labor costs during slow midday periods."
msgstr ""
"可變工時表類型非常適合採用分段式工作時間表的企業。此選項讓需求波動較大的行業"
"（例如酒店或高度依賴旅遊業的企業）能在繁忙時段安排人手，同時在午間淡靜時段降"
"低人力成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:84
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Variable` option is chosen, a calendar view displays. "
"Multiple time blocks can be selected per day. To add a time block, click in "
"the desired day column at the hour the work time starts. A time slot pop-up "
"window displays with the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"選擇 :guilabel:`可變` 選項時，系統會顯示日曆檢視畫面。每天可選擇多個時段。要"
"新增時段，請在所需日期欄中，於工作時間開始的小時處點擊。系統會顯示包含以下欄"
"位的時段彈出視窗："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration`: Specify the total number of hours of the configured "
"time slot."
msgstr ":guilabel:`持續時間`：指定所配置時段的總時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time`: Specify the start and end time of that time slot. Times "
"are displayed in UTC."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recurrency`: Enable to repeat the time slot to run every week. "
"When disabled, the time slot does not repeat."
msgstr ":guilabel:`週期性`：啟用後，時段會每週重複執行。停用時，時段不會重複。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Repeat every`: Configure the number of days or weeks between "
"occurrences, and optionally set an end date for the repetition. This field "
"only displays when :guilabel:`Recurrency` is enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`重複週期`：設定每次發生相隔的天數或週數，並可選擇設定重複的結束日"
"期。此欄位僅在啟用:guilabel:`重複發生`時顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:96
msgid ""
"The start and end times can be adjusted manually in the time slot window, "
"and the :guilabel:`Duration` field recalculates automatically based on these"
" changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:99
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Save` to confirm the time slot and add it to the calendar. "
"After all the time slots are configured for the variable working hours, "
"click :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)`."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`儲存` 以確認時段並將其加入日曆。為彈性工作時間配置所有時段"
"後，按一下 :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`（手動儲存）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/employees/working_hours.rst:103
msgid "A variable schedule with four 4-hour blocks per day."
msgstr "每日設有四個 4 小時時段的可變工作時間表。"

