#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet.rst:5
msgid "Fleet"
msgstr "車隊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:3
msgid "Accidents"
msgstr "意外事故"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:5
msgid ""
"When managing a fleet, accidents are inevitable. Tracking accidents is "
"crucial for understanding vehicle maintenance costs and identifying safe "
"drivers."
msgstr ""
"管理車隊時，意外事故在所難免。追蹤意外記錄對於了解車輛維修保養成本及識別安全"
"駕駛員至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:8
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Fleet** app offers multiple ways of tracking accidents. Below are "
"step-by-step instructions for one possible method to monitor accidents and "
"repair costs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:12
msgid "Structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:14
msgid ""
"For this use case, go to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Fleet --> Services`. "
"On the :ref:`service form <fleet/service-form>`, two :ref:`service types "
"<fleet/new-type>` are created: `Accident - Driver's Fault` and `Accident - "
"No Fault`."
msgstr ""
"在此使用案例中，請前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 車隊 --> 服務`。在 "
":ref:`服務表單 <fleet/service-form>` 上，系統已建立兩個 :ref:`服務類型 "
"<fleet/new-type>`：`意外 - 司機過失` 及 `意外 - 非司機過失`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:18
msgid ""
"This setup records repairs associated with accidents and organizes them by "
"fault."
msgstr "此設定會記錄與意外相關的維修，並按過失方分類整理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:20
msgid ""
"When an accident occurs, a service record is created. The specific repairs "
"needed for the accident are logged in the *Description* of the service "
"record, and the details about the accident are logged in the *Notes* "
"section."
msgstr ""
"發生意外時，系統會建立一筆服務記錄。意外所需的具體維修項目會記錄在服務記錄的 "
"*描述* 中，而意外的詳細資料則記錄在 *備註* 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:24
msgid ""
"With this organizational structure, it is possible to view all accidents "
"organized by fault, car, driver, or cost."
msgstr "透過這種組織架構，您可以按過失方、車輛、司機或費用查看所有意外記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:28
msgid "To manage accidents, the creation of service records is **required**."
msgstr "要管理意外事故，**必須** 建立服務紀錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:30
msgid ""
"Refer to the :doc:`service` documentation for detailed instructions on "
"creating service records in Odoo's **Fleet** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:34
msgid "Log accidents and repairs"
msgstr "記錄意外及維修"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:36
msgid ""
"To log an accident and initiate the repair process, the first step is to "
":ref:`create a service record <fleet/service-form>` detailing the specific "
"repairs needed."
msgstr ""
"要記錄意外事故並啟動維修流程，第一步是 :ref:`建立服務記錄 <fleet/service-"
"form>`，詳細說明所需的具體維修項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:40
msgid ""
"Some accidents require multiple repairs with several different vendors. For "
"these scenarios, a separate service record is needed for each vendor "
"performing repairs. To keep records organized, it is recommended to keep the"
" *Notes* field identical, and attach the same important documentation, such "
"as a police report."
msgstr ""
"部分意外事故可能需要由多個不同供應商進行多次維修。在這些情況下，每位負責維修"
"的供應商都需要建立獨立的服務紀錄。為確保紀錄井然有序，建議在 *備註* 欄位保留"
"相同內容，並附上相同的重要文件，例如警方報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:45
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Fleet --> Services` to view the "
"main :guilabel:`Services` dashboard. Click :guilabel:`New` in the top-left "
"corner, and a blank service form loads."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 車隊 --> 服務`，即可檢視主要的 "
":guilabel:`服務` 儀表板。按一下左上角的 :guilabel:`新增`，系統便會載入空白的"
"服務表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: enter the description of repairs needed to fully "
"repair the vehicle, such as `Bodywork`, `Windshield Replacement`, or "
"`Replacement Bumper, Tires, and Windows`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Service Type`: for this example, select either `Accident - "
"Driver's Fault` or `Accident - No Fault`, depending on the situation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`服務類型`：在此範例中，視乎情況選擇 `意外 - 司機過失` 或 `意外 - "
"無過失`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:55
msgid ""
"When entering either of these two :guilabel:`Service Types` for the first "
"time, type in the new service type, then click :guilabel:`Create (new "
"service type)`. A :guilabel:`Create Service Type` pop-up window appears, "
"with the new service type populating the :guilabel:`Name` field. In the "
":guilabel:`Category` field, select :guilabel:`Service` from the drop-down "
"menu, then click the :guilabel:`Save & Close` button."
msgstr ""
"首次輸入這兩種 :guilabel:`服務類型` 之一時，請輸入新的服務類型，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`建立（新服務類型）`。隨即會彈出 :guilabel:`建立服務類型` 視窗，而 "
":guilabel:`名稱` 欄位會自動填入該新服務類型。在 :guilabel:`類別` 欄位中，從下"
"拉式選單選擇 :guilabel:`服務`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`儲存並關閉` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:61
msgid ""
"Once an accident service type has been added to the database, it is "
"available to select from the drop-down menu in the :guilabel:`Service Type` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"將意外服務類型新增至資料庫後，即可在:guilabel:`服務類型`欄位的下拉選單中選取"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: using the calendar popover window, select the date the "
"accident occurred. Navigate to the desired month using the :icon:`fa-"
"chevron-left` :icon:`fa-chevron-right` :guilabel:`(arrow)` icons, then click"
" the date to select it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`日期`：在彈出的日曆視窗中，選擇意外發生的日期。使用 :icon:`fa-"
"chevron-left` :icon:`fa-chevron-right` :guilabel:`（箭頭）` 圖示瀏覽至所需月"
"份，然後點擊日期即可選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cost`: leave this field blank, as the repair cost is not yet "
"known."
msgstr ":guilabel:`成本`：由於尚未得知維修成本，請將此欄位留空。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor`: select the vendor performing the repairs using the drop-"
"down menu. If the vendor has not already been entered in the system, type in"
" the vendor name, and click either :guilabel:`Create` to add them, or "
":guilabel:`Create and edit...` to :ref:`add and configure the vendor "
"<fleet/new-vendor>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`供應商`：使用下拉式選單，選擇負責維修的供應商。如果系統尚未錄入該"
"供應商，請輸入供應商名稱，然後點擊 :guilabel:`建立` 以新增供應商，或點擊 "
":guilabel:`建立並編輯...` 以 :ref:`新增及配置供應商 <fleet/new-vendor>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vehicle`: select the vehicle that was in the accident from the "
"drop-down menu. When the vehicle is selected, the :guilabel:`Driver` field "
"is populated, and the unit of measure for the :guilabel:`Odometer Value` "
"field appears."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`車輛`：從下拉式選單中選擇涉及意外的車輛。選擇車輛後，系統會自動填"
"寫 :guilabel:`司機` 欄位，並顯示 :guilabel:`里程讀數` 欄位的計量單位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Driver`: the current driver listed for the selected vehicle "
"populates this field when the :guilabel:`Vehicle` is selected. If a "
"different driver was operating the vehicle when the accident occurred, "
"select the correct driver from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`司機`：選擇:guilabel:`車輛`後，此欄位會自動填入該所選車輛目前列出"
"的司機。如果發生意外時由其他司機駕駛車輛，請從下拉式選單中選擇正確的司機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Odometer Value`: enter the odometer reading when the accident "
"occurred. The units of measure are either in kilometers (:guilabel:`km`) or "
"miles (:guilabel:`mi`), depending on how the selected vehicle was "
"configured."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`里程表讀數`：輸入意外發生時的里程表讀數。計量單位為公里"
"（:guilabel:`km`）或英里（:guilabel:`mi`），視乎所選車輛的配置而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`NOTES`: enter the specific details of the accident at the bottom "
"of the service form, such as `Hit a deer` or `Rear-ended at an intersection "
"while stopped`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`備註`：在服務表單底部輸入事故的具體詳情，例如 `撞到鹿` 或 `在路口"
"停車時遭後方追撞`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:83
msgid ""
"Odoo provides the ability to attach any important paperwork, such as repair "
"estimates and police reports, to the service record. To do so, click the "
":icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`(paperclip)` icon, located in the *chatter* "
"of the form, and a file explorer pop-up window appears. Navigate to the "
"desired record, and click :guilabel:`Open` to upload the file."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 支援將重要文件（例如維修報價單及報案記錄）附加至維修服務記錄。若要附加文"
"件，請按一下表單*對話串*中的 :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`（萬字夾）` 圖示"
"，系統便會彈出檔案瀏覽視窗。前往所需記錄檔案的位置，然後按一下 :guilabel:`開"
"啟` 以上載檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:89
msgid ""
"Once a file is added to a service record, a :guilabel:`Files` section "
"appears in the *chatter*. To attach more records, click :icon:`fa-plus-"
"square` :guilabel:`Attach files` to add more documents."
msgstr ""
"將檔案新增至服務記錄後，*通訊欄*會顯示 :guilabel:`檔案` 部分。若要附加更多記"
"錄，請按一下 :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`附加檔案` 以新增更多文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:93
msgid "Enter the information for an accident repair."
msgstr "輸入意外維修的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:97
msgid "Service stages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:99
msgid "In Odoo's **Fleet** app, there are four default service stages:"
msgstr "在 Odoo 的**車隊**應用程式中，有四個預設服務階段："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:103
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:18
msgid "New"
msgstr "新增"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:105
msgid ""
"The default stage when a service record is created. The service has been "
"requested, but repairs have not begun. The :guilabel:`Cost` field for this "
"stage remains zero."
msgstr ""
"建立服務記錄時的預設階段。服務已提出要求，但維修尚未開始。此階段的 "
":guilabel:`成本` 欄位維持為零。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:108
msgid "Running"
msgstr "進行中"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:110
msgid ""
"The repair is in-process, but not yet complete. The estimate for repairs is "
"listed in the :guilabel:`Cost` field."
msgstr "維修正在進行中，但尚未完成。維修預算費用列於 :guilabel:`成本` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:113
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "已完成"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:115
msgid ""
"All repairs listed on the service form have been completed. The "
":guilabel:`Cost` field is updated to reflect the final total cost charged "
"for the repairs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:118
msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "已取消"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:120
msgid "The service request has been cancelled."
msgstr "服務請求已取消。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:122
msgid ""
"During the repair process, change the service status to reflect the "
"vehicle's current state in one of two ways: on the individual :ref:`service "
"record <fleet/service_record>`, or in the :ref:`Kanban service view "
"<fleet/Kanban>`."
msgstr ""
"在維修過程中，可透過兩種方式之一變更服務狀態，以反映車輛的目前狀態：在個別 "
":ref:`服務記錄 <fleet/service_record>` 頁面變更，或在 :ref:`看板服務檢視 "
"<fleet/Kanban>` 中變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:129
msgid "Service record"
msgstr "服務記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:131
msgid ""
"Open the main *Services* dashboard, by navigating to :menuselection:`Fleet "
"app --> Fleet --> Services`. Next, click on the individual service record to"
" open the detailed service form. Click the desired stage in the top-right "
"corner, above the service form, to change the status."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 車隊 --> 服務`，開啟主要的 *服務* 儀表"
"板。接著，按一下個別服務紀錄以開啟詳細的服務表單。按一下服務表單上方右上角的"
"所需階段，即可更改狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:135
msgid "The stages as seen from the service form."
msgstr "從服務表單所見的階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:143
msgid ""
"Open the main *Services* dashboard, by navigating to :menuselection:`Fleet "
"app --> Fleet --> Services`. First, click the :icon:`oi-view-kanban` "
":guilabel:`Kanban` icon in the top-right of the screen, which organizes all "
"repairs by vehicle."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`車隊管理應用程式 --> 車隊 --> 服務`，開啟主要的*服務*儀"
"表板。首先，點擊畫面右上角的 :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`看板` 圖示，以"
"按車輛整理所有維修項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:147
msgid ""
"Next, remove the default :guilabel:`Service Type` filter in the search bar. "
"Upon doing so, all services appear in a Kanban view, organized by their "
"respective :guilabel:`Status`."
msgstr ""
"接下來，移除搜尋欄中預設的 :guilabel:`服務類型` 篩選條件。完成後，所有服務都"
"會顯示在看板檢視中，並按各自的 :guilabel:`狀態` 排列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:150
msgid "Drag-and-drop the service record to the desired stage."
msgstr "將服務紀錄拖放至所需階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:152
msgid ""
"The Kanban view of stages, with a card being dragged and dropped to the "
"Running stage."
msgstr "各階段的看板檢視，其中一張卡片正被拖放至「進行中」階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:156
msgid "Accident reporting"
msgstr "意外報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:158
msgid ""
"One of the main reasons to track accidents using the method outlined in this"
" document is the ability to view the total accident cost, determine the "
"safest drivers, and calculate the actual total cost for specific vehicles."
msgstr ""
"使用本文件所述方法追蹤意外事故的主要原因之一，是可以檢視意外總成本、識別最安"
"全的司機，並計算特定車輛的實際總成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:162
msgid ""
"The main :ref:`Services dashboard <fleet/services_dashboard>` displays all "
"the various accident information, while the :ref:`Reporting dashboard "
"<fleet/reporting_dashboard>` displays the total cost for specific vehicles."
msgstr ""
"主要的:ref:`服務儀表板 <fleet/services_dashboard>`會顯示所有各類意外資訊，"
"而:ref:`報告儀表板 <fleet/reporting_dashboard>`則會顯示特定車輛的總費用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:169
msgid "Services dashboard"
msgstr "服務儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:171
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Fleet --> Services` to view the "
":guilabel:`Services` dashboard. All service records are displayed in a "
":icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(List)` view, grouped alphabetically, by "
":guilabel:`Service Type`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:175
msgid ""
"The two service types created for accident tracking appear in the list: "
":guilabel:`Accident - Driver Fault` and :guilabel:`Accident - No Fault`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:178
msgid ""
"Each grouping displays the number of records within each type, and lists the"
" individual records beneath each grouping title."
msgstr "每個分組都會顯示該類型中的記錄數量，並在每個分組標題下方列出各項個別記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:182
msgid ""
"In this example, there are three accidents where the driver was at fault, "
"and one accident that was not the driver's fault. This dashboard also "
"displays the estimated total :guilabel:`Cost` for all the accidents in each "
"group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:186
msgid ""
"An estimated `$3,284.00` dollars are costs from driver-caused accident "
"repairs. The no-fault accident has no cost associated with it, since the "
"repair has not been completed, and no estimate exists yet."
msgstr ""
"由司機導致的意外維修費用估計為 `$3,284.00` 元。無過失意外則沒有相關費用，因為"
"維修尚未完成，亦未有估算金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:190
msgid "Accident services, with the total costs highlighted."
msgstr "意外服務，其中總費用已標示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:194
msgid ""
"The total :guilabel:`Cost` calculates **all** costs on the repair form, "
"including estimated costs, as well as final repair costs. This number may "
"not be accurate, if there are any repairs in the *Running* stage, and the "
"final bill has not yet been calculated."
msgstr ""
"總 :guilabel:`成本` 會計算維修單上的 **所有** 成本，包括預計成本及最終維修成"
"本。如果仍有維修項目處於 *進行中* 階段，且尚未計算最終賬單，此數字可能並不準"
"確。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:201
msgid "Reporting dashboard"
msgstr "報告儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:203
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Reporting --> Costs` to view the "
":menuselection:`Cost Analysis` report. This report displays a  :icon:`fa-"
"bar-chart` :guilabel:`(Bar Chart)` of all :guilabel:`Contract` and "
":guilabel:`Service` costs for the current year, organized by month "
"(:guilabel:`Date : (year)`), by default. The :guilabel:`Sum`, represented by"
" a gray dotted line, is the combined total of both the :guilabel:`Contract` "
"and :guilabel:`Service` costs."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 報告 --> 成本`，以查看 "
":menuselection:`成本分析` 報告。預設情況下，此報告會顯示一個 :icon:`fa-bar-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(棒形圖)`，列出本年度所有 :guilabel:`合約` 及 :guilabel:`服"
"務` 成本，並按月份（:guilabel:`日期 : (年)`）分組。以灰色虛線表示的 "
":guilabel:`總和`，是 :guilabel:`合約` 及 :guilabel:`服務` 兩項成本的合計總額"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:209
msgid ""
"To view the total cost by vehicle, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`(Toggle Search Bar)` icon at the right of the search bar, "
"revealing a drop-down menu. Click :guilabel:`Vehicle` in the :icon:`oi-"
"group` :guilabel:`Group By` column, and the data is organized by vehicle."
msgstr ""
"若要按車輛檢視總成本，請按一下搜尋欄右側的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`（切換搜尋欄）` 圖示以展開下拉式選單。按一下 :guilabel:`車輛`（位"
"於 :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`分組依據` 欄中），資料便會按車輛整理顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:213
msgid ""
"This displays the true cost for each vehicle, including both the contract "
"cost (such as the monthly vehicle lease cost) and all service costs, "
"including all accidents. Hover over a column to reveal a data popover "
"window, which displays the vehicle name and the total cost. This allows for "
"a more complete view of the vehicle cost."
msgstr ""
"此處顯示每輛車的實際成本，包括合約成本（例如每月車輛租賃費用）及所有維修保養"
"成本（包括所有事故費用）。將滑鼠懸停在直條上會顯示資料彈出視窗，當中列出車輛"
"名稱及總成本，讓您更全面地掌握車輛成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:218
msgid "The Cost Analysis report, displaying total costs by vehicle."
msgstr "按車輛顯示總成本的成本分析報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:221
msgid ""
"To view the individual cost details for both contract costs and repairs, "
"click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon in the top-right "
"corner of the :guilabel:`Cost Analysis` dashboard. This displays each "
"vehicle on a separate line, and displays the :guilabel:`Contract` cost and "
":guilabel:`Service` cost, as well as the :guilabel:`Total` cost."
msgstr ""
"要查看合約與維修的個別成本明細，請點擊 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`（樞"
"紐分析表）` 圖示（位於:guilabel:`成本分析`儀表板右上角）。畫面會以獨立行顯示"
"每部車輛，並列出:guilabel:`合約`成本、:guilabel:`服務`成本，以及:guilabel:`總"
"計`成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:226
msgid ""
"The Cost Analysis report, displaying the contract and service costs separately, as well as\n"
"the total."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:231
msgid ""
"The :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` view organizes the data by "
"vehicle, by default, therefore grouping the data by :guilabel:`Vehicle` is "
"not required. If this filer is already activated, it does not affect the "
"presented data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:236
msgid "Manage accident repairs"
msgstr "管理意外維修"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:238
msgid ""
"For companies with multiple employees, who manage a large fleet of vehicles,"
" displaying only service records in the :guilabel:`New` and "
":guilabel:`Running` stages can be time-saving, if there are a large number "
"of records in the *Services* dashboard."
msgstr ""
"如公司擁有多名員工並管理龐大車隊，而 *服務* 儀表板中有大量記錄，則只顯示處於 "
":guilabel:`新增` 及 :guilabel:`進行中` 階段的服務記錄可節省時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:242
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Fleet --> Services`, where all "
"service requests are organized by :guilabel:`Service Type`. Next, click the "
":icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` icon at the right of"
" the search bar, revealing a drop-down menu. Click :guilabel:`Add Custom "
"Filter` in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` column, and a "
":guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 車隊 --> 服務`，所有服務請求均"
"按:guilabel:`服務類型`分類。接著，點擊搜尋列右側的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`（切換搜尋面板）` 圖示以展開下拉式選單。點擊:guilabel:`新增自訂篩"
"選條件`（在 :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選` 欄中），隨即會彈"
"出:guilabel:`新增自訂篩選條件`視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:248
msgid "Three drop-down fields need to be configured on the pop-up window."
msgstr "彈出式視窗上有三個下拉式欄位需要設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:250
msgid "In the first field, scroll down, and select :guilabel:`Stage`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:252
msgid "Leave the second field set to :guilabel:`=`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:254
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Running` from the drop-down menu in the last field."
msgstr "在最後一個欄位的下拉式選單中選取 :guilabel:`進行中`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:256
msgid ""
"Next, click the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon to the right of the "
"last field, and an identical rule appears beneath the current rule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:259
msgid ""
"Then, change :guilabel:`Running` to :guilabel:`New` in the third field of "
"the second rule, leaving the other fields as-is."
msgstr ""
"然後，在第二條規則的第三個欄位中，將 :guilabel:`執行中` 變更為 :guilabel:`新"
"增`，其餘欄位保持不變。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:262
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Add` button at the bottom to add the new custom filter."
msgstr "按一下底部的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，以加入新的自訂篩選器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:264
msgid ""
"The filter settings to be added to only display new and running services."
msgstr "要新增的篩選設定，以只顯示新建立及進行中的服務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:267
msgid ""
"This slight modification only presents services in the :guilabel:`New` and "
":guilabel:`Running` stages. This is a helpful report for a company managing "
"a high number of repairs at any given time."
msgstr ""
"這項微調只會顯示處於:guilabel:`新建`及:guilabel:`進行中`階段的服務。對於同時"
"需要管理大量維修項目的公司而言，這是一份非常實用的報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/accidents.rst:270
msgid ""
"To have this report appear as the default report when opening the "
":guilabel:`Services` dashboard, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` icon at the far-right of the search bar. "
"Next, click :guilabel:`Save current search`, beneath the :icon:`fa-star` "
":guilabel:`Favorites` column, which reveals another drop-down column beneath"
" it. Tick the checkbox beside :guilabel:`Default Filter`, then click "
":guilabel:`Save`. Then, this customized :guilabel:`Services` dashboard "
"appears, by default, any time the :guilabel:`Services` dashboard is "
"accessed."
msgstr ""
"如欲在開啟:guilabel:`服務`儀表板時將此報表顯示為預設報表，請點擊搜尋列最右方"
"的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`（切換搜尋面板）` 圖示。接著，點"
"擊:guilabel:`儲存目前搜尋`（位於 :icon:`fa-star` :guilabel:`我的最愛` 欄位下"
"方），其下方會展開另一個下拉式欄位。勾選:guilabel:`預設篩選條件`旁邊的核取方"
"塊，然後點擊:guilabel:`儲存`。完成後，這個自訂:guilabel:`服務`儀表板便會成為"
"預設畫面，之後每次開啟:guilabel:`服務`儀表板時都會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Cost analysis report"
msgstr "成本分析報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Fleet** app allows for analysis on :ref:`total vehicle costs "
"<fleet/total-costs>`, including both contract costs and service and repair "
"charges. Data can be adjusted to view total costs by :ref:`vehicle "
"<fleet/by-vehicle>` or :ref:`driver <fleet/by-driver>`. Additionally, costs "
"can be compared with the previous year, quarter, or month, to view changes "
"in fleet costs over time."
msgstr ""
"**車隊**應用程式可分析:ref:`車輛總成本 <fleet/total-costs>`，當中包括合約費用"
"以及保養與維修開支。你可調整數據，按:ref:`車輛 <fleet/by-vehicle>`或:ref:`司"
"機 <fleet/by-driver>`檢視總成本。此外，你亦可將成本與去年、上季或上月比較，以"
"查看車隊成本隨時間的變化。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:13
msgid "Total costs"
msgstr "總成本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:15
msgid ""
"To view the *Cost Analysis Report*, navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app "
"--> Reporting --> Costs`. The default report shows a bar chart of service "
"and contract costs for the current year, organized by month."
msgstr ""
"若要查看 *成本分析報告*，請前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 報告 --> 成"
"本`。預設報告會顯示本年度按月排列的服務及合約成本棒形圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:20
msgid ""
"In this report, it is possible to determine that June had the highest total "
"costs, with almost $14,000 dollars in contract and repair costs, while "
"January had the lowest costs, with less than $2,000 of contract costs and no"
" repairs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:24
msgid "The default cost analysis report showing contract and service costs."
msgstr "顯示合約及服務成本的預設成本分析報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:30
msgid "Cost by vehicle"
msgstr "按車輛劃分的成本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:32
msgid ""
"Some companies want to view costs not by month, but by vehicle. This allows "
"fleet managers to determine which vehicles cost the most to keep on the "
"road, aiding in decision making for future purchases and repairs."
msgstr ""
"部分公司希望按車輛而非按月份查看成本。這可讓車隊管理人員了解哪輛車的營運成本"
"最高，從而協助作出日後的採購和維修決策。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:36
msgid ""
"To view these metrics, open the default :ref:`cost analysis report "
"<fleet/total-costs>`. Next, click into the search bar, and click "
":guilabel:`Vehicle` under the :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Group By` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:41
msgid ""
"From this report, it can be determined the `Toyota Corolla` with the license"
" plate `STU-1718` cost the most, with almost $14,000 in costs for the year. "
"Additionally, the both `Nissan Micro` vehicles and the `Ford Focus` cost the"
" least, with under $5,000 in total costs each."
msgstr ""
"從此報表可見，車牌號碼為 `STU-1718` 的 `Toyota Corolla` 成本最高，全年費用接"
"近 $14,000。此外，兩輛 `Nissan Micro` 車輛及 `Ford Focus` 的成本最低，每輛總"
"費用均低於 $5,000。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:45
msgid "The cost analysis report showing annual costs by vehicle."
msgstr "按車輛顯示年度成本的成本分析報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:51
msgid "Cost by driver"
msgstr "按司機計算的成本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:53
msgid ""
"Another useful metric is to determine which drivers incur the most repair "
"costs, allowing fleet managers to determine which vehicles to assign which "
"drivers. To view this configuration, open the default :ref:`cost analysis "
"report <fleet/total-costs>`. Next, click into the search bar, and click "
":guilabel:`Driver` under the :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Group By` column. "
"Finally, click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon."
msgstr ""
"另一項有用的指標是找出哪位司機產生最多維修成本，讓車隊管理員決定將哪些車輛分"
"配給哪些司機。要查看此設定，請開啟預設的:ref:`成本分析報表 <fleet/total-"
"costs>`。接著，點擊搜尋欄，點擊:guilabel:`司機`（位於:icon:`oi-group` "
":guilabel:`分組依據`欄下）。最後，點擊:icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`（樞紐"
"分析表）`圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:59
msgid ""
"The report now shows the totals for both :guilabel:`Contract` and "
":guilabel:`Service` costs for each driver in the database. This allows fleet"
" managers to see which drivers incur the most repair costs."
msgstr ""
"報表現在會顯示資料庫中每位司機的 :guilabel:`合約` 及 :guilabel:`服務` 費用總"
"計。這讓車隊管理員能夠查看哪些司機產生的維修費用最多。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:63
msgid ""
"This report shows that `Sandra Elvis` had no service costs for the year, "
"while both `Doris Cole` and `David Armstrong` had almost $9,000 in repairs. "
"While this does not explain why those two drivers incurred the most costs, "
"it is possible for the fleet manager to :ref:`investigate the service "
"records <fleet/view-services>` for those two drivers, to determine why there"
" were such high costs for the year."
msgstr ""
"此報表顯示 `Sandra Elvis` 本年度沒有維修服務費用，而 `Doris Cole` 及 `David "
"Armstrong` 則各有近 $9,000 的維修費用。雖然這並未解釋為何這兩名司機產生的費用"
"最高，但車隊經理可以為這兩名司機 :ref:`查閱維修服務記錄 <fleet/view-services>"
"`，以了解為何本年度費用如此高昂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:69
msgid "The cost analysis report showing costs by driver in a pivot table."
msgstr "成本分析報表，以樞紐分析表按司機顯示成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:73
msgid "Detailed comparison"
msgstr "詳細比較"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:75
msgid ""
"All reports in the **Fleet** app are able to compare costs from previous "
"time periods, either year, quarter, or month. To view a detailed cost "
"comparison between the third and fourth quarter, open the default :ref:`cost"
" analysis report <fleet/total-costs>`, then click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` "
":guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon. Next, click into the search bar and click "
":guilabel:`Q4` in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` column, then "
":guilabel:`Date: Previous Period` in the :icon:`fa-adjust` "
":guilabel:`Comparison` column."
msgstr ""
"**車隊**應用程式中的所有報表均可比較過往時間段（按年、季度或月份）的成本。要"
"查看第三季與第四季之間的詳細成本比較，請開啟預設的:ref:`成本分析報表 <fleet/"
"total-costs>`，然後按一下 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`（樞紐分析表）` 圖"
"示。接著，按一下搜尋欄，點選 :guilabel:`Q4`（位於 :icon:`fa-filter` "
":guilabel:`篩選` 欄中），再點選 :guilabel:`日期：上一期間`（位於 :icon:`fa-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`比較` 欄中）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:82
msgid ""
"The report now shows detailed contract and service costs for each vehicle, "
"with a :guilabel:`Variation` column, showing increases or decreases in costs"
" from the third and fourth quarter of the current year."
msgstr ""
"報表現在會顯示每部車輛的詳細合約及服務成本，並附有 :guilabel:`變動` 欄，顯示"
"本年度第三季與第四季之間的成本增減。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:88
msgid ""
"In this example, it can be determined that the `Ford Focus` had the greatest"
" change in terms of lowered total costs, with a 75.25% reduction in costs. "
"Additionally, the `Nissan Micro` with the license plate of `DEF-456` was the"
" only vehicle with an overall increase in total costs, with an increase of "
"41.78%."
msgstr ""
"在此例子中，可看出 `Ford Focus` 的總成本降幅最大，成本減少了 75.25%。此外，車"
"牌為 `DEF-456` 的 `Nissan Micro` 是唯一總成本整體上升的車輛，升幅為 41.78%。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/cost_analysis.rst:93
msgid ""
"A pivot table with a detailed cost comparison between the current and "
"previous year."
msgstr "透視表，詳細比較今年與去年的成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:3
msgid "Models & manufacturers"
msgstr "型號及製造商"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Fleet** app categorizes each vehicle by *manufacturer* and *model* "
"(e.g. `BMW`, `X2`). Before a vehicle can be added to the Odoo database, its "
":ref:`manufacturer <fleet/manufacturers>` and :ref:`model <fleet/add-model>`"
" record must already exist in the database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:12
msgid "Manufacturers"
msgstr "製造商"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:14
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Fleet** app comes preconfigured with sixty-seven commonly used car "
"and bicycle manufacturers in the database, along with their logos. To view "
"the pre-loaded manufacturers, go to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> "
"Configuration --> Manufacturers`, and the :guilabel:`Manufacturers` "
"dashboard loads."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **車隊** 應用程式在資料庫中預先配置了 67 間常見汽車及單車製造商連同其"
"標誌。要查看預先載入的製造商，請前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 配"
"置 --> 製造商`，系統便會載入 :guilabel:`製造商` 儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:19
msgid ""
"The default filter, :guilabel:`With Models`, displays only manufacturers "
"that already have vehicle models. Remove the default filter to view *all* "
"manufacturers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:22
msgid ""
"Manufacturers are listed alphabetically, and each card shows how many "
"specific :ref:`models <fleet/models>` are configured for each particular "
"manufacturer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:25
msgid "Manufacturer card with the amount of models listed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:31
msgid "Add a manufacturer"
msgstr "新增製造商"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:33
msgid ""
"To add a new manufacturer to the database, click :guilabel:`New` in the "
"upper-left corner of the :guilabel:`Manufacturers` dashboard, and a blank "
"manufacturers form loads. Type the name of the manufacturer in the "
":guilabel:`Name` field, and select an image to upload for the "
":guilabel:`Logo`."
msgstr ""
"若要將新製造商新增至資料庫，請按一下 :guilabel:`新增`（位於 :guilabel:`製造"
"商` 儀表板左上角），系統隨即會載入空白的製造商表單。在 :guilabel:`名稱` 欄位"
"輸入製造商名稱，並選取要上傳作為 :guilabel:`標誌` 的圖片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:40
msgid "Models"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:42
msgid ""
"When adding a vehicle to the fleet, specify the vehicle model to maintain "
"updated records, which keeps track of specific details, like vehicle "
"capacity and parts compatibility."
msgstr ""
"將車輛新增至車隊時，請指定車輛型號以保持記錄最新，從而追蹤車輛載客量及零件相"
"容性等具體資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:45
msgid ""
"Unlike :ref:`manufacturers <fleet/manufacturers>`, models do **not** come "
"preconfigured in the **Fleet** app. When a new vehicle model joins the "
"fleet, the model (and, if necessary, the manufacturer) **must** be "
":ref:`added to the database <fleet/add-model>`."
msgstr ""
"與 :ref:`製造商 <fleet/manufacturers>` 不同，車型 **不會** 預先設定於 **車"
"隊** 應用程式中。當車隊加入新車型時，**必須** 將該車型（如有需要，亦包括製造"
"商） :ref:`新增至資料庫 <fleet/add-model>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:52
msgid "Add a model"
msgstr "新增模型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:54
msgid ""
"To add a new vehicle model, navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> "
"Configuration --> Models`. Click :guilabel:`New` in the upper-left corner, "
"and enter the following information on the new model form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:59
msgid ""
"Depending on the installed :doc:`localization "
"<../../finance/fiscal_localizations>`, some fields or sections may not "
"appear."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:62
msgid ":guilabel:`Model name`: Enter the model name in the field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`模型名稱`：在欄位中輸入模型名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturer`: Using the drop-down menu, select the manufacturer."
" If it is not configured, :ref:`add the manufacturer <fleet/add-"
"manufacturers>`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`製造商`：使用下拉式選單選擇製造商。如尚未設定，請:ref:`新增製造商 "
"<fleet/add-manufacturers>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vehicle Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select one of two "
"preconfigured vehicle types, either :guilabel:`Car` or :guilabel:`Bike`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`車輛類型`：使用下拉式選單，選擇兩種預設車輛類型之一：:guilabel:`汽"
"車` 或 :guilabel:`單車`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:69
msgid ""
"Additional vehicle types can **not** be added. **Fleet** keeps them fixed to"
" preserve its **Payroll** integration, where vehicles may count as employee "
"benefits."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: Using the drop-down menu, select a :ref:`category "
"<fleet/categories>` for the vehicle or :ref:`create a new one <fleet/new-"
"category>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類別`：使用下拉式選單為車輛選擇一個 :ref:`類別 <fleet/categories>"
"`，或 :ref:`建立新類別 <fleet/new-category>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:76
msgid ""
"No categories come preconfigured in Odoo's **Fleet** app. All categories "
"must be added to the database."
msgstr "Odoo 的 **車隊** 應用程式沒有預先配置的類別。所有類別都必須新增至資料庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:79
msgid ""
"A vehicle form with the name, manufacturer, type, and category filled in."
msgstr "已填寫名稱、製造商、類型及類別的車輛表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:83
msgid "Information tab"
msgstr "資訊分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:85
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Information` tab, specify details about the car model, "
"such as the car size, passenger capacity, and engine information."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`資料` 分頁中，填寫車型詳情，例如車身尺寸、載客量及引擎資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:89
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:91
msgid ":guilabel:`Model Year`: Enter the year the vehicle was manufactured."
msgstr ":guilabel:`型號年份`：輸入車輛的出廠年份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Seating Capacity`: Enter how many passengers the vehicle can "
"accommodate."
msgstr ":guilabel:`座位數目`：輸入車輛可容納的乘客人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Number of Doors`: Enter the number of doors the vehicle has."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:94
msgid ":guilabel:`Color`: Enter the color of the vehicle."
msgstr ":guilabel:`顏色`：輸入車輛的顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Trailer Hitch`: Tick this checkbox if the vehicle has a trailer "
"hitch installed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`拖車掛鉤`：如果車輛已安裝拖車掛鉤，請勾選此核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:98
msgid "Salary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:100
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Salary` section **only** appears if the company has their "
"localization setting set to Belgium. The cost values are all *monthly*, with"
" the exception of the :guilabel:`Catalog Value (VAT Incl.)`."
msgstr ""
"**只有** 當公司的本地化設定為比利時時，才會顯示 :guilabel:`薪金` 部分。除 "
":guilabel:`目錄價值（含增值稅）` 外，所有成本數值均以 *每月* 計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:104
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Can be requested`: Enable this checkbox if employees can request "
"this model vehicle, if a vehicle is part of their employee contract."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`可供申請`：如員工合約中包含配車，而員工可申請此車型，請勾選此核取"
"方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:106
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:235
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Catalog Value (VAT Incl.)`: Enter the :abbr:`MSRP (Manufacturer's"
" Suggested Retail Price)` for the vehicle at the time of purchase or lease."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`目錄價值（含增值稅）`：輸入購買或租賃車輛時的 :abbr:`MSRP (製造商"
"建議零售價)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`C02 fee`: Represents the carbon dioxide emission fee paid to the "
"Belgian government. This value is automatically calculated, based on Belgian"
" laws and regulations, and **cannot** be modified. The value is based on the"
" figure entered in the :guilabel:`CO2 Emissions` field (in the "
":guilabel:`Engine` section of the :guilabel:`Information` tab) on the "
"vehicle form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`CO2 費用`：代表支付予比利時政府的二氧化碳排放費。此數值根據比利時"
"法律及法規自動計算，**不可** 修改。此數值取決於 :guilabel:`CO2 排放量` 欄位所"
"輸入的數值（屬於 :guilabel:`引擎` 區段，位於車輛表單的 :guilabel:`資訊` 分頁"
"）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:114
msgid ""
"Modifying the :guilabel:`CO2 Emissions` field adjusts the value in the "
":guilabel:`CO2 fee` field."
msgstr "修改 :guilabel:`CO2 排放量` 欄位會調整 :guilabel:`CO2 費用` 欄位的數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:117
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cost (Depreciated)`: Enter the monthly vehicle cost, which "
"appears in the salary configurator for future employees. This value impacts "
"the gross and net salary of the employee assigned to the vehicle. This "
"figure is depreciated over time, according to local tax laws. The "
":guilabel:`Cost (Depreciated)` does **not** depreciate automatically on the "
"*vehicle model*, it only depreciates based on the *contract* linked to a "
"specific vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Cost (Depreciated)`: This value is the combination of the "
":guilabel:`Cost (Depreciated)` and the :guilabel:`C02 fee` fields. It also "
"depreciated over time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:126
msgid "Engine"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fuel Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select the type of fuel the"
" vehicle uses. The default options are :guilabel:`Diesel`, "
":guilabel:`Gasoline`, :guilabel:`Full Hybrid` :guilabel:`Plug-in Hybrid "
"Diesel`, :guilabel:`Plug-in Hybrid Gasoline`, :guilabel:`CNG`, "
":guilabel:`LPG`, :guilabel:`Hydrogen`, or :guilabel:`Electric`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`燃料類型`：透過下拉式選單，選擇車輛使用的燃料類型。預設選項包"
"括:guilabel:`柴油`、:guilabel:`汽油`、:guilabel:`全油電混合動"
"力`、:guilabel:`插電式柴油混合動力`、:guilabel:`插電式汽油混合動"
"力`、:guilabel:`壓縮天然氣 (CNG)`、:guilabel:`石油氣 (LPG)`、:guilabel:`氫"
"氣`或:guilabel:`電動`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Range`: Enter the distance the vehicle can travel on one tank of "
"gas, or one battery charge, in miles (:guilabel:`mi`) or kilometers "
"(:guilabel:`km`). To change the unit of distance, click the drop-down next "
"to the :guilabel:`km` or :guilabel:`mi` field, and select the desired unit "
"of distance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`CO2 Emissions`: Enter the average carbon dioxide emissions the "
"vehicle produces in grams per kilometer (:guilabel:`g/km`) or miles "
"(:guilabel:`g/mi`). This information is provided by the car manufacturer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`二氧化碳排放量`：輸入車輛產生的平均二氧化碳排放量，單位為每公里克"
"數（:guilabel:`g/km`）或每英里克數（:guilabel:`g/mi`）。汽車製造商會提供此資"
"料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Emission Standard`: Enter the regulatory test procedure or "
"guideline used to determine the :guilabel:`CO2 Emissions`, such as the "
":abbr:`EPA (Environmental Protection Agency)` or Euro 6."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`排放標準`：輸入用於測定 :guilabel:`二氧化碳排放量` 的法規測試程序"
"或指引，例如 :abbr:`EPA（環境保護局）` 或歐盟六期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:142
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transmission`: Using the drop-down menu, select the type of "
"transmission, either :guilabel:`Manual` or :guilabel:`Automatic`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`傳輸方式`：使用下拉式選單選擇傳輸類型，可選 :guilabel:`手動` 或 "
":guilabel:`自動`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:144
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Power Unit`: Using the drop-down menu, select how the vehicle's "
"power is measured, either in kilowatts or horsepower."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`功率單位`：使用下拉式選單，選擇車輛功率的計量單位，可選千瓦或馬力"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:146
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Power`: If the vehicle is electric or hybrid, enter the power the"
" vehicle uses in kilowatts (:guilabel:`kW`). This field only appears if "
":guilabel:`kW` is selected for the :guilabel:`Power` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`功率`：如果車輛為電動車或混合動力車，請輸入車輛使用的功率，單位為"
"千瓦（:guilabel:`kW`）。只有當 :guilabel:`kW` 被選為 :guilabel:`功率` 欄位的"
"值時，此欄位才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Horsepower`: Enter the vehicle's horsepower (hp) in this field. "
"This field only appears if :guilabel:`Horsepower` is selected for the "
":guilabel:`Power` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`馬力`：在此欄位輸入車輛的馬力 (hp)。只有選擇了:guilabel:`馬力`作"
"為:guilabel:`功率`欄位的值時，此欄位才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Horsepower Taxation`: Enter the amount of taxes incurred "
"according to the engine specifications. The number is dependent on the local"
" tax laws, therefore it is recommended to check with the accounting "
"department to ensure the correct taxation amount is entered. This field only"
" appears if the :guilabel:`Power` field is set to :guilabel:`Horsepower` "
"(which changes the :guilabel:`Power` field to :guilabel:`Range`) ."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`馬力稅`：根據引擎規格輸入應繳稅額。該數額取決於當地稅法，因此建議"
"向會計部門查詢，以確保輸入正確的稅額。此欄位僅在 :guilabel:`功率` 欄位設為 "
":guilabel:`馬力` 時才會顯示（這會將 :guilabel:`功率` 欄位變更為 :guilabel:`範"
"圍`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Deduction`: The percentage that can be deducted from taxes is"
" populated based on the localization, and **cannot** be modified. This field"
" only appears for certain localizations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:159
msgid ""
"A side-by-side comparison of the Engine section of a form, one gasoline, one"
" electric."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:163
msgid "Vendors tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:165
msgid ""
"Specify the vendors a vehicle can be purchased from in this tab. With proper"
" setup, :doc:`requests for quotations "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals/rfq>` for vehicles can be "
"created through Odoo's **Purchase** app."
msgstr ""
"在此分頁中指定可向其採購車輛的供應商。完成適當設定後，即可透過 Odoo 的 **採"
"購** 應用程式為車輛建立 :doc:`報價請求 <../../inventory_and_mrp/purchase/"
"manage_deals/rfq>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:169
msgid ""
"To add a vendor, click the :guilabel:`Add Vendors` block in the "
":guilabel:`Vendors` tab. This opens an :guilabel:`Add: Vendors` pop-up "
"window, with a list of all the vendors currently in the database. Add any "
"preexisting vendors by clicking the checkbox next to the vendor name, then "
"click :guilabel:`Select`. No limitations exist on the number of vendors that"
" can be added to this list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:174
msgid ""
"If a vendor is *not* already in the database, add a new vendor by clicking "
":guilabel:`New` in the bottom-left of the :guilabel:`Add: Vendors` pop-up "
"window. In the :guilabel:`Create Vendors` form that appears, :doc:`enter the"
" necessary information <../../essentials/contacts>`, then click "
":guilabel:`Save & Close` to add the vendor, or click :guilabel:`Save & New` "
"to add the current vendor and create another new vendor."
msgstr ""
"如果資料庫中*尚未*有該供應商，可點擊:guilabel:`新增`（位於:guilabel:`新增：供"
"應商`彈出視窗的左下角）以加入新供應商。在隨即出現的:guilabel:`建立供應商`表單"
"中，:doc:`輸入所需資料 <../../essentials/contacts>`，然後點擊:guilabel:`儲存"
"並關閉`以加入該供應商，或點擊:guilabel:`儲存並新增`以加入目前供應商並建立另一"
"位新供應商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:181
msgid "Vendors are stored in the **Contacts** application."
msgstr "供應商資料儲存在**聯絡人**應用程式中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:183
msgid "Vendor form to fill out when adding a new vendor."
msgstr "新增供應商時需要填寫的供應商表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:189
msgid "Model category"
msgstr "模型類別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:191
msgid ""
"To aid with fleet organization, it is recommended to have vehicle models "
"housed under a specific category. Model categories are set on the "
":ref:`vehicle model form <fleet/add-model>`."
msgstr ""
"為協助管理車隊分類，建議將車輛型號歸類於特定類別之下。型號類別可在 :ref:`車輛"
"型號表單 <fleet/add-model>` 上設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:194
msgid ""
"Odoo does **not** come with any categories preconfigured; all categories "
"**must** be added."
msgstr "Odoo **並無**預設任何類別；所有類別均**必須**新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:196
msgid ""
"To view any categories currently set up in the database, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Fleet app --> Configuration --> Categories`. All categories "
"are displayed in a list view."
msgstr ""
"要查看資料庫中目前設定的任何類別，請前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 配"
"置 --> 類別`。所有類別均會以列表檢視顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:202
msgid "Add a new model category"
msgstr "新增型號類別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:204
msgid ""
"To add a new category, click the :guilabel:`New` button in the top-left "
"corner of the :guilabel:`Categories` dashboard. A new entry line appears at "
"the bottom of the list. Type in the new category, then either click "
":guilabel:`Save`, or click anywhere on the screen, to save the entry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:209
msgid ""
"To reorganize how the categories appear in the list, click on the :icon:`oi-"
"draggable` :guilabel:`(draggable)` icon to the left of any desired category "
"name, and drag the line to the desired position."
msgstr ""
"如要重新排列類別在清單中的顯示順序，請點擊任何目標類別名稱左側的 :icon:`oi-"
"draggable` :guilabel:`（可拖曳）` 圖示，然後將該行拖曳至所需位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:213
msgid ""
"The order of the list does *not* affect the database in any way. However, it"
" may be preferable to view the vehicle categories in a specific order, for "
"example, by size, or the number of passengers the vehicle can carry."
msgstr ""
"清單的順序*不會*以任何方式影響資料庫。不過，按特定順序查看車輛類別可能會更方"
"便，例如按尺寸或車輛可載乘客人數排列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/models.rst:218
msgid ""
"When used with the **Inventory** app, the :guilabel:`Max Weight` and "
":guilabel:`Max Volume` fields track a vehicle's capacity. This helps manage "
"in-house deliveries by :doc:`showing how much space and weight remain for "
"loading products "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch>`."
msgstr ""
"配合 **庫存** 應用程式使用時，:guilabel:`最大重量` 及 :guilabel:`最大體積` 欄"
"位會追蹤車輛的負載容量。系統會 :doc:`顯示裝載產品時剩餘的空間及重量 <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch>"
"`，從而協助管理內部送貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:3
msgid "Adding vehicles"
msgstr "新增車輛"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Fleet** app manages all vehicles, and the accompanying "
"documentation that comes with vehicle maintenance and driver records."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **車隊** 應用程式可管理所有車輛，以及車輛保養與司機記錄所附帶的相關文"
"件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:8
msgid ""
"Upon opening the :menuselection:`Fleet` application, all vehicles are "
"organized within the :guilabel:`Vehicles` dashboard, which is the default "
"dashboard. Each vehicle is displayed in its corresponding Kanban stage, "
"based on its status. The default stages are :guilabel:`New Request`, "
":guilabel:`To Order`, :guilabel:`Registered`, and :guilabel:`Downgraded`."
msgstr ""
"開啟 :menuselection:`車隊管理` 應用程式後，所有車輛都會整理在預設儀表板 "
":guilabel:`車輛` 中。每輛車都會根據其狀態顯示在對應的看板階段。預設階段包括 "
":guilabel:`新請求`、:guilabel:`待訂購`、:guilabel:`已登記` 及 :guilabel:`已降"
"級`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:18
msgid ""
"Before registering any vehicles, review two **Fleet** settings that directly"
" affect day-to-day operations and employee benefits:"
msgstr ""
"在登記任何車輛之前，請先檢視兩項會直接影響日常營運及員工福利的 **車隊** 設定"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`End Date Contract Alert <fleet/end-contract>`: Emails the contract's "
"*Responsible* person a set number of days before the vehicle agreement "
"expires, so renewals or returns are not missed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`合約結束日期提醒 <fleet/end-contract>`：在車輛協議到期前指定天數，向合"
"約的*負責人*傳送電郵通知，以免遺漏續約或歸還事宜。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:23
msgid ""
":ref:`New Vehicle Request <fleet/request>`: (Only for the :doc:`Belgian "
"payroll localization <../payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium>`) Blocks "
"employees from requesting a new company car through the salary configurator,"
" once the available vehicles already exceed the defined limit, helping "
"control benefits costs."
msgstr ""
":ref:`新車輛申請 <fleet/request>`：（僅適用於 :doc:`比利時薪酬本地化 <../"
"payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium>`）當可用車輛已超出設定上限時，阻止員工"
"透過薪酬配置器申請新的公司車輛，從而協助控制福利成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:28
msgid ""
"To access the settings menu, go to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:33
msgid "End Date Contract Alert"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:35
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`End Date Contract Alert` field shows how many days before the"
" end of a vehicle contract an alert should be sent. The :ref:`responsible "
"parties <fleet/responsible>` receive an email informing them that a vehicle "
"contract is about to expire in the number of days defined in this field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:40
msgid "Settings available for the Fleet application."
msgstr "車隊應用程式的可用設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:46
msgid "Responsible parties"
msgstr "負責方"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:48
msgid ""
"To determine the responsible person for a contract, open an individual "
"contract. The person listed as :guilabel:`Responsible` under the "
":guilabel:`Contract Information` section of the contract receives the alert."
msgstr ""
"要確定合約的負責人，請開啟個別合約。在合約中列為 :guilabel:`負責人`（位於合約"
"的 :guilabel:`合約資料` 部分）的人員將會收到提示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:52
msgid ""
"To open a contract from a list of all contracts, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Fleet app --> Fleet --> Contracts`, and all contracts appear"
" in the list. Click on a :guilabel:`Contract` to open it. In the "
":guilabel:`Information` section of the contract, look under "
":guilabel:`Responsible` to see who receives expiration alerts."
msgstr ""
"要從所有合約的列表中開啟合約，請前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 車"
"隊 --> 合約`，列表中會顯示所有合約。點擊其中一份 :guilabel:`合約` 將其開啟。"
"在合約的 :guilabel:`資訊` 部分中，於 :guilabel:`負責人` 下方查看誰會收到到期"
"提示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:57
msgid ""
"An individual contract can also be opened from a specific vehicle by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Fleet --> Fleet` and clicking on"
" an individual vehicle. On the vehicle form, click the :icon:`fa-book` "
":guilabel:`Contracts` smart button at the top of the page. Only contracts "
"associated with the vehicle appear in the list. Click on an individual "
"contract to open it. The :guilabel:`Responsible` person is listed on the "
"contract."
msgstr ""
"您亦可從特定車輛開啟個別合約：前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 車隊 --> "
"車隊` ，並按一下個別車輛。在車輛表單上，按一下頁面頂部的 :icon:`fa-book` "
":guilabel:`合約` 智能按鈕。清單中只會顯示與該車輛關聯的合約。按一下個別合約即"
"可將其開啟。合約上會列出 :guilabel:`負責人` 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:66
msgid "New vehicle request"
msgstr "新車輛申請"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:68
msgid ""
"Enter the maximum fleet size that may be reached through the salary-"
"configurator flow. When the total number of available vehicles (vehicles "
"without an assigned driver) is equal to or below this limit, employees can "
"request a new company car. Once the available vehicles exceed the limit, the"
" request option is hidden."
msgstr ""
"輸入透過薪酬配置器流程可達到的最大車隊規模。當可用車輛總數（未指派駕駛者的車"
"輛）等於或低於此上限時，員工便可申請新的公司車輛。一旦可用車輛超過上限，申請"
"選項便會隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:74
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`New Vehicle Request` limit is set to 20 vehicles, and "
"there are 25 vehicles available, employees cannot request a new car and must"
" select from the 25 already available. If there are only 10 cars available, "
"then the employee would be able to request a new vehicle."
msgstr ""
"如果 :guilabel:`新車申請` 上限設為 20 輛，而現有 25 輛可用車輛，則員工無法申"
"請新車，必須從現有的 25 輛中選擇。如果只有 10 輛可用車輛，員工便可以申請新車"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:79
msgid ""
"This settings option **only** appears if the :guilabel:`Belgian-Payroll-"
"Fleet` module is installed for the Belgian localization."
msgstr ""
"此設定選項 **僅** 在為比利時本地化安裝了 :guilabel:`Belgian-Payroll-Fleet` 模"
"組時才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:83
msgid "Add a vehicle"
msgstr "新增車輛"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:85
msgid ""
"To add a new vehicle to the fleet from the :guilabel:`Vehicles` dashboard, "
"click the :guilabel:`New` button in the top-left corner, and a blank vehicle"
" form loads. Then, proceed to enter the vehicle information on the vehicle "
"form."
msgstr ""
"要從 :guilabel:`車輛` 儀表板將新車輛加入車隊，請點擊左上角的 :guilabel:`新"
"增` 按鈕，系統會載入空白的車輛表單。然後，在車輛表單上輸入車輛資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:92
msgid "Vehicle form fields"
msgstr "車輛表單欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Model`: Using the drop-down menu, select the vehicle's model. "
"Once a model is selected, additional fields may appear on the form. If the "
"model is not listed, type in the model name, and click either "
":guilabel:`Create \"model\"`, or :guilabel:`Create and edit...` to "
":ref:`create a new model and edit the model details <fleet/add-model>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`型號`：使用下拉式選單選擇車輛型號。選擇型號後，表單上可能會顯示其"
"他欄位。如果列表中沒有該型號，請輸入型號名稱，然後點擊:guilabel:`建立「型號"
"」`，或點擊:guilabel:`建立及編輯...`，以:ref:`建立新型號並編輯型號詳情 "
"<fleet/add-model>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`License Plate`: Enter the vehicle's license plate number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`車牌號碼`：輸入車輛的車牌號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Select any tags from the drop-down menu, or type in a new "
"tag. There is no limit on the amount of tags that can be selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:102
msgid "The new vehicle form, showing the model section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:106
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Model` is the *only* required field on the new vehicle form. "
"When a model is selected, other fields appear on the vehicle form, and "
"relevant information auto-populates the fields that apply to the model. If "
"some of the fields do not appear, this may indicate there is no model "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"在新增車輛表單上， :guilabel:`型號` 是 *唯一* 的必填欄位。選擇型號後，車輛表"
"單上會顯示其他欄位，並會自動填入適用於該型號的相關資料。如果部分欄位沒有顯示"
"，可能代表尚未選擇型號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:114
msgid "Driver"
msgstr "司機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:116
msgid ""
"This section of the vehicle form relates to the person who is currently "
"driving the car, as well as any plans for a change in the driver in the "
"future, and when."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Driver`: Using the drop-down menu, select the driver for the "
"vehicle. If the driver is not listed, :ref:`create the new driver and edit "
"the driver details <fleet/new_vehicle/add-driver>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:124
msgid ""
"A driver does *not* have to be an employee. When creating a new driver, the "
"driver is added to the **Fleet** app and the **Contacts** app (if "
"installed), *not* in the **Employees** app."
msgstr ""
"司機*不一定*要是員工。建立新司機時，該司機只會新增至**車隊**應用程式及**聯絡"
"人**應用程式（如已安裝），而*不會*新增至**員工**應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mobility Card`: If the selected driver has a mobility card (such "
"as a gas card) listed on their employee record in the **Employees** "
"application, the mobility card number automatically appears in this field. "
"If there is no mobility card listed, and one should be added, :ref:`edit the"
" employee record <employees/hr-settings>` in the **Employees** application."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`出行卡`：如果所選司機在 **員工** 應用程式的員工記錄中已列出出行卡"
"（例如油卡），出行卡號碼會自動顯示於此欄位。如果未有列出出行卡而需要新增，請"
"在 **員工** 應用程式中 :ref:`編輯員工記錄 <employees/hr-settings>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Future Driver`: If the next driver for the vehicle is known, "
"select the next driver from the drop-down menu. Or, type in the next driver "
"and click either :guilabel:`Create \"future driver\"` or :guilabel:`Create "
"and edit...` to :ref:`create a new future driver, and edit the driver "
"details <fleet/new_vehicle/add-driver>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`未來司機`：如已知車輛的下一任司機，可從下拉式選單中選擇該司機；或"
"輸入下一任司機的名稱，然後點擊 :guilabel:`建立「未來司機」` 或 :guilabel:`建"
"立並編輯...`，以:ref:`建立新的未來司機並編輯司機詳細資料 <fleet/new_vehicle/"
"add-driver>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:137
msgid ""
"If this field is populated, an :guilabel:`Apply New Driver` button appears "
"on the vehicle form. Click the :guilabel:`Apply New Driver` button to change"
" the driver information."
msgstr ""
"如果填寫了此欄位，車輛表單上會顯示 :guilabel:`套用新司機` 按鈕。點擊 "
":guilabel:`套用新司機` 按鈕即可更改司機資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Assignment Date`: Using the calendar selector, select when the "
"vehicle is available for another driver. If this field is left blank, that "
"indicates the vehicle is currently available, and can be assigned to another"
" driver. If it is populated, the vehicle is not available for another driver"
" until the selected date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:144
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company from the drop-down menu. This field "
"only appears in a multi-company database."
msgstr ":guilabel:`公司`：從下拉式選單中選擇公司。此欄位只會在多公司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:150
msgid "Create a new driver"
msgstr "建立新司機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:152
msgid ""
"If a driver is not already in the system, the new driver should first be "
"configured and added to the database. A new driver can be added either from "
"the :guilabel:`Driver` or :guilabel:`Future Driver` fields on the "
":ref:`vehicle form <fleet/new_vehicle/vehicle-form>`."
msgstr ""
"如果系統中尚未有該司機的資料，應先設定新司機並將其新增至資料庫。你可以透過 "
":guilabel:`司機` 或 :guilabel:`未來司機` 欄位新增司機，該兩個欄位均位於 "
":ref:`車輛表單 <fleet/new_vehicle/vehicle-form>` 中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:156
msgid ""
"First, type in the name of the new driver in either the :guilabel:`Driver` "
"or :guilabel:`Future Driver` field, then click :guilabel:`Create and "
"edit...`. A :guilabel:`Create Driver` or :guilabel:`Create Future Driver` "
"form appears, depending on which field initiated the form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:160
msgid ""
"Both the :guilabel:`Create Driver` and :guilabel:`Create Future Driver` "
"forms are identical, and are stored in the **Contacts** app. :doc:`Configure"
" the new contact <../../essentials/contacts>`, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:165
msgid ""
"Depending on the installed applications, different tabs or fields may be "
"visible on the :guilabel:`Create Driver` and :guilabel:`Create Future "
"Driver` forms."
msgstr ""
"視乎已安裝的應用程式，:guilabel:`建立司機` 及 :guilabel:`建立未來司機` 表單上"
"可能會顯示不同的分頁或欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:171
msgid "Vehicle"
msgstr "車輛"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:173
msgid ""
"This section captures key physical details of a vehicle. Selecting an "
"existing :guilabel:`Model` may auto-fill some fields."
msgstr ""
"此部分記錄車輛的主要物理規格詳情。選擇現有的 :guilabel:`型號` 可能會自動填寫"
"部分欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:176
msgid "Fill in the following fields on the form:"
msgstr "在表單上填寫以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: Using the drop-down menu, select the vehicle category "
"from the available options. If the **Inventory** app is installed, the "
"category affects any configured :doc:`dispatch management system "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類別`：使用下拉式選單，從可用選項中選取車輛類別。如果已安裝**庫"
"存**應用程式，該類別會影響任何已設定的:doc:`調度管理系統 <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:182
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Order Date`: Using the calendar selector, select the date the "
"vehicle was ordered. Keeping track of how long vehicles have been in the "
"fleet can help when making decisions on expensive repairs, or help decide "
"when to surrender a vehicle."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`訂購日期`：使用日曆選擇器選取車輛的訂購日期。追蹤車輛在車隊中的使"
"用時間，有助於在決定是否進行昂貴維修或決定何時退回車輛時作出判斷。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:185
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Registration Date`: Using the calendar selector, select the date "
"the vehicle was registered. Many regions require proper registration, so "
"keeping track of registration dates is important."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`登記日期`：使用日曆選擇器選擇車輛的登記日期。許多地區都規定須妥善"
"登記，因此記錄登記日期十分重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:188
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cancellation Date`: Using the calendar selector, select the date "
"the vehicle lease expires, or when the vehicle is no longer part of the "
"fleet (e.g., sold, plates surrendered)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`取消日期`：使用日曆選擇器，選取車輛租約到期或車輛不再屬於車隊的日"
"期（例如已售出、已交還車牌）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:190
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Chassis Number`: Enter the chassis number in the field. This is "
"known in some countries as the :abbr:`VIN (Vehicle Identification Number)` "
"number. Every vehicle has a unique number, so in the event of a theft or "
"accident, a vehicle can be identified with this unique number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`底盤編號`：在欄位中輸入底盤編號。在某些國家及地區，這稱為 "
":abbr:`VIN（車輛識別號碼）` 編號。每部車輛都有獨一無二的編號，因此在發生盜竊"
"或意外時，可透過此唯一編號識別車輛。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:193
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Last Odometer`: Enter the last known odometer reading in the "
"number field. Using the drop-down menu next to the number field, select "
"whether the odometer reading is in kilometers :guilabel:`(km)` or miles "
":guilabel:`(mi)`. Keeping track of a vehicle's mileage is crucial when "
"determining the value of the vehicle for both tax purposes and resale value."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`最後里程讀數`：在數字欄位輸入最後已知的里程讀數。使用數字欄位旁邊"
"的下拉式選單，選擇里程讀數單位為公里 :guilabel:`(km)` 或英里 :guilabel:`(mi)"
"`。記錄車輛的里程數對於評估車輛的稅務價值及轉售價值都非常重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:197
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fleet Manager`: Select the fleet manager from the drop-down menu,"
" or type in a new fleet manager, and click either :guilabel:`Create` or "
":guilabel:`Create and edit...`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`車隊管理員`：從下拉式選單選擇車隊管理員，或輸入新的車隊管理員，然"
"後點擊 :guilabel:`建立` 或 :guilabel:`建立並編輯...`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:199
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Location`: Type in the specific location where the vehicle is "
"typically located in this field. The entry should clearly explain where the "
"vehicle can be found, such as `Main Garage` or `Building 2 Parking Lot`. "
"This is crucial information for companies with many locations where vehicles"
" are stored."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`地點`：在此欄位輸入車輛通常停放的具體地點。輸入內容應清楚說明可在"
"何處找到車輛，例如 `主車庫` 或 `2 號大樓停車場`。對於擁有多個車輛停放地點的公"
"司而言，這是至關重要的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:203
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Make Vehicle Available`: Click the checkbox if the vehicle can be"
" selected when an employee fills out the :ref:`salary configurator "
"<recruitment/offer_job_positions/configure-package>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`提供車輛`：如員工填寫 :ref:`薪酬配置器 <recruitment/"
"offer_job_positions/configure-package>` 時可選用該車輛，請勾選此核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:207
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:245
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:260
msgid "The new vehicle form, showing the vehicle tax section."
msgstr "顯示車輛稅項部分的新車輛表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:211
msgid "Tax Info tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:213
msgid ""
"Depending on the localization setting for the database, and what additional "
"applications are installed, other fields may be present on the form."
msgstr "視乎資料庫的本地化設定及已安裝的其他應用程式，表單上可能會顯示其他欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:216
msgid ""
"The sections below are default and appear for all vehicles, regardless of "
"other installed applications or localization settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:220
msgid "Fiscality"
msgstr "稅務"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:222
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Horsepower Taxation`: Enter the amount that is taxed based on the"
" size of the vehicle's engine. This is determined by local taxes and "
"regulations, and varies depending on the location. It is recommended to "
"check with the accounting department to ensure this value is correct."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`馬力稅`：輸入根據車輛引擎排氣量徵收的稅額。此金額由當地稅務法規決"
"定，並因地區而異。建議向會計部門確認此數值是否正確。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Deductibility Rates`: Configure the dates and percentages of the "
"vehicle-related costs (fuel, maintenance, depreciation, etc.) that can be "
"deducted from the company's taxable income. The :guilabel:`Start Date` field"
" indicates *when* the deduction begins, and the :guilabel:`Deductibility "
"(%)` field indicates the percentage to be deducted."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`可扣減比率`：設定可從公司應課稅收入中扣減的車輛相關費用（燃油、保"
"養、折舊等）的日期及百分比。:guilabel:`開始日期` 欄位指示扣減*何時*開始，而 "
":guilabel:`可扣減比率 (%)` 欄位則指示扣減的百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:233
msgid ""
":guilabel:`First Contract Date`: Select the start date for the vehicle's "
"first contract using the calendar selector. Typically this is the day the "
"vehicle is purchased or leased."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`首份合約日期`：使用日曆選擇器選擇車輛首份合約的開始日期。這通常是"
"購買或租賃車輛的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Value`: Enter the purchase price or the original value "
"of the lease for the vehicle."
msgstr ":guilabel:`購入價值`：輸入車輛的購入價格或原始租賃價值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:239
msgid ":guilabel:`Residual Value`: Enter the current value of the vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:242
msgid ""
"The values listed above affect the accounting department. It is recommended "
"to check with the accounting department for more information and/or "
"assistance with these values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:249
msgid "Model tab"
msgstr "模型分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:251
msgid ""
"If the model for the new vehicle is already configured in the database, the "
":guilabel:`Model` and :guilabel:`Engine` sections are populated with the "
"corresponding information. If the model is *not* already in the database and"
" the :guilabel:`Model` tab needs to be configured, :ref:`configure the new "
"vehicle model <fleet/add-model>`."
msgstr ""
"如果新車輛的型號已在資料庫中設定，系統會自動在 :guilabel:`型號` 及 "
":guilabel:`引擎` 部分填入相應資料。如果資料庫中 *尚未* 有該型號，且需要設定 "
":guilabel:`型號` 分頁，請 :ref:`設定新車輛型號 <fleet/add-model>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:256
msgid ""
"Check the information in the :guilabel:`Model` tab to ensure it is accurate."
" For example, the color of the vehicle or whether a trailer hitch is "
"installed are examples of common information that may need updating."
msgstr ""
"檢查 :guilabel:`型號` 分頁中的資料，確保內容準確無誤。例如車輛顏色或是否安裝"
"了拖車掛鉤，都是常見可能需要更新的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:264
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:95
msgid "Note tab"
msgstr "「備註」分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:266
msgid "Enter any notes for the vehicle in this section."
msgstr "在此部分輸入車輛的任何備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:269
msgid ":doc:`../fleet/models`"
msgstr ":doc:`../fleet/models`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:270
msgid ":doc:`../fleet/service`"
msgstr ":doc:`../fleet/service`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/new_vehicle.rst:271
msgid ":doc:`../fleet/accidents`"
msgstr ":doc:`../fleet/accidents`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:3
msgid "Odometer analysis report"
msgstr "里程表分析報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Fleet** app allows for analysis of all odometer readings logged in the"
" system, which managers can use to determine the use, in terms of mileage, "
"of their vehicles."
msgstr ""
"**車隊**應用程式可分析系統中記錄的所有里數錶讀數，供管理人員根據行車里數評估"
"車輛的使用情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:8
msgid ""
"This information can aid in decision making when determining which vehicles "
"to add to the fleet, or which vehicles to retire. Additionally, this "
"information can assist when performing routine audits, ensuring vehicles "
"used adhere to company policy, and accurate records are being kept."
msgstr ""
"這些資料有助決定應將哪些車輛加入車隊，或淘汰哪些車輛。此外，這些資料亦可協助"
"進行例行審核，確保所使用的車輛符合公司政策，並保存準確的記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:12
msgid ""
"For the *Odometer Analysis* report to deliver reliable, meaningful insights,"
" ensure odometer readings are updated regularly for every vehicle. "
"Typically, odometer values are updated when a vehicle is :ref:`added to the "
"fleet <fleet/new_vehicle/general-info>`, and when any :ref:`services "
"<fleet/service-form>` are performed on a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"為確保 *里程錶分析* 報表能提供可靠且具參考價值的分析結果，請定期更新每輛車的"
"里程錶讀數。一般而言，里程錶數值會在車輛 :ref:`加入車隊 <fleet/new_vehicle/"
"general-info>` 時，以及為車輛進行任何 :ref:`保養服務 <fleet/service-form>` 時"
"更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:18
msgid ""
"Many companies follow internal policies for routine odometer updates. For "
"example, delivery trucks may require weekly odometer reporting, while "
"employee vehicles might only need to report mileage on a monthly basis."
msgstr ""
"許多公司會遵循內部政策進行例行里程錶更新。例如，送貨貨車可能需要每週匯報里程"
"錶讀數，而員工車輛則可能只需每月匯報一次里數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:25
msgid "Monthly odometer values"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:27
msgid ""
"To view the *Odometer Analysis* report, navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet "
"app --> Reporting --> Odometers`. The default report shows a line chart of "
"the odometer values, grouped by month, then vehicle category."
msgstr ""
"如要查看 *里程分析* 報表，請前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 報表 --> 里"
"程錶`。預設報表會顯示里程數值的折線圖，先按月份分組，再按車輛類別分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:31
msgid ""
"The mileage shown is the odometer value *per month*, not the :ref:`total "
"accumulated mileage <fleet/odometers/by-vehicle>` each month. This report "
"allows managers to see which vehicle categories are being driven the most on"
" a monthly basis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:35
msgid ""
"The data in this report may aid managers when performing audits, since the "
"data from this report can be compared to the expected mileage, such as round"
" trip distances for repairs or deliveries. This may help ensure vehicles are"
" not being used for non-work purposes. Additionally, the total mileage "
"driven for employee vehicles may be compared to the expected mileage "
"according to the :ref:`home-work distance <employees/location>` configured "
"on employee records."
msgstr ""
"此報表中的資料可協助管理人員進行審計，因為報表數據可與預期里程（例如維修或送"
"貨的來回距離）作比較，有助確保車輛沒有被用於非工作用途。此外，員工車輛的總行"
"駛里程亦可與員工記錄中所設定的 :ref:`往返住所與工作地點距離 <employees/"
"location>` 所計算的預期里程作比較。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:42
msgid ""
"In this report, it is possible to determine that the *Delivery Trucks* have "
"both the highest and most consistent mileage, month to month."
msgstr "從這份報表可看出，*送貨貨車* 每月的行車里數不僅最高，而且最為穩定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:45
msgid "The total odometer value per month for all vehicles."
msgstr "所有車輛每月里程錶總數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:51
msgid "Total odometer values"
msgstr "總里程數值"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:53
msgid ""
"To view the total odometer value for all vehicles in the fleet, open the "
"*Odometer Analysis* report by navigating to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> "
"Reporting --> Odometers`. Click on the :guilabel:`Measures` button, and "
"select :guilabel:`Odometer Value` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"要查看車隊中所有車輛的總里程數值，請開啟 *里程錶分析* 報表，導航路徑為 "
":menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 報告 --> 里程錶`。點擊 :guilabel:`計量` 按鈕"
"，然後從下拉式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`里程數值`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:57
msgid ""
"This presents all the odometer values, grouped by month and category. This "
"allows companies to learn which vehicle type logs the most miles, and is "
"therefore on the road or in use the most. This information may aid managers "
"in determining which vehicles add the most value and should be kept, and "
"which vehicles should be retired."
msgstr ""
"此處顯示按月份及類別分組的所有里程錶數值，讓公司了解哪種車輛類型錄得的里數最"
"多，從而得知哪些車輛在路面行駛或使用的時間最長。這些資訊可協助管理人員判斷哪"
"些車輛最具價值並應予保留，以及哪些車輛應該退役。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:63
msgid ""
"In this report, it can be determined that the *Delivery Trucks* (the blue "
"line in the graph) drive the most miles each month, more than double the "
"combined mileage of the other vehicles. The *Repair Vans* and *Employee "
"Cars* both drive a comparable amount of miles each month, with *Employee "
"Cars* logging slightly more miles, overall."
msgstr ""
"在此報表中，可以看出 *送貨貨車*（圖表中的藍線）每月的行駛里數最多，超過其他車"
"輛總行駛里數的兩倍。*維修客貨車* 與 *員工車輛* 每月的行駛里數相若，而整體而言"
"，*員工車輛* 記錄的里數略高。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/odometers.rst:68
msgid ""
"The odometer report showing total odometer values, by month and category."
msgstr "按月份及類別顯示總里程數值的里程錶報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:3
msgid "Services"
msgstr "服務"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:5
msgid ""
"To properly maintain a fleet of vehicles, regular maintenance as well as "
"periodic repairs are needed. Scheduling repairs and managing services for an"
" entire fleet is necessary to ensure all vehicles are in good working order "
"when they are needed."
msgstr ""
"要妥善保養車隊，定期保養和週期性維修皆不可缺少。為整個車隊安排維修及管理服務"
"是必要的，以確保所有車輛在需要使用時均處於良好運作狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:9
msgid ""
"Services, such as regular maintenance, like oil changes or tire rotations, "
"can be logged in advance. Other repairs are logged as they occur."
msgstr ""
"定期保養等服務（例如更換機油或輪胎換位）可以預先記錄。其他維修則可在發生時才"
"記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:13
msgid "Create service records"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:15
msgid ""
"Create a service record in one of two ways: :ref:`directly in the Fleet app "
"<fleet/service-form>`, or from a :ref:`vendor bill in the Accounting app "
"<fleet/link-bills>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:21
msgid "From the Fleet app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:23
msgid ""
"To log a service for a vehicle in the **Fleet** app, go to the main "
":guilabel:`Services` dashboard by navigating to :menuselection:`Fleet app "
"--> Fleet --> Services`. Open a new service form by clicking the "
":guilabel:`New` button in the top-left corner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:27
msgid ""
"Fill out the information on the form. The only two fields that are required "
"to be populated are :guilabel:`Service Type` and :guilabel:`Vehicle`."
msgstr "填寫表單上的資料。只有兩個必填欄位：:guilabel:`服務類型`及:guilabel:`車輛`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:30
msgid "The fields on the form are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: Enter a brief description of the service in this "
"field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`描述`：在此欄位輸入服務的簡短描述。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Service Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select the type of "
"service performed. If the desired service does not exist, enter a new type "
"of service, and click either :guilabel:`Create \"(service type)\"` or "
":guilabel:`Create and edit...` to :ref:`add the service type and configure "
"it <fleet/new-type>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`服務類型`：使用下拉式選單選擇所執行的服務類型。如果所需的服務不存"
"在，請輸入新的服務類型，然後按一下 :guilabel:`建立「（服務類型）」` 或 "
":guilabel:`建立並編輯...`，以 :ref:`新增服務類型並進行設定 <fleet/new-type>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:39
msgid ""
"Only one :guilabel:`Service Type` comes preconfigured in Odoo: "
":guilabel:`Vendor Bill`."
msgstr "Odoo 只預先設定了一種:guilabel:`服務類型`：:guilabel:`供應商賬單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: Using the calendar selector, select the date the service "
"was provided, or is scheduled to be performed. Navigate to the desired month"
" using the :icon:`oi-chevron-left` :icon:`oi-chevron-right` "
":guilabel:`(arrow)` icons, then click on the date to select it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cost`: Enter the estimated cost of the service, if available. If "
"the service is for a future repair, this field should be left blank. This "
"field is updated as estimates are received, and again, when the final repair"
" cost is known."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor`: Using the drop-down menu, select the vendor who is "
"performing the service. If the vendor has not already been entered in the "
"system, :ref:`add and configure the vendor <fleet/new-vendor>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`供應商`：使用下拉式選單，選擇執行該服務的供應商。如果尚未在系統中"
"輸入該供應商，請:ref:`新增並設定該供應商 <fleet/new-vendor>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vehicle`: Using the drop-down menu, select the vehicle that was "
"serviced. When the vehicle is selected, the :guilabel:`Driver` field is "
"populated, and the unit of measure for the :guilabel:`Odometer Value` field "
"appears."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`車輛`：使用下拉式選單選擇已維修保養的車輛。選擇車輛後，系統會自動"
"填入 :guilabel:`司機` 欄位，並顯示 :guilabel:`里程錶數值` 欄位的計量單位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:53
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Driver`: The vehicle's current driver automatically populates "
"this field when the :guilabel:`Vehicle` is selected. If the driver needs to "
"be changed, another driver can be selected using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Odometer Value`: Enter the odometer reading from when the service"
" was done. The units of measure are either in kilometers (:guilabel:`km`) or"
" miles (:guilabel:`mi`), depending on how the selected vehicle was "
"configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:61
msgid ""
"To change from kilometers to miles, or vice versa, click the :icon:`oi-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Internal Link)` icon to the right of the vehicle "
"selected in the :guilabel:`Vehicle` field."
msgstr ""
"如要將公里轉換為英里，或將英里轉換為公里，請點擊 :icon:`oi-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`(內部連結)` 圖示（位於 :guilabel:`車輛` 欄位中所選車輛的右側）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:65
msgid ""
"Change the unit of measure, then navigate back to the service form, via the "
"breadcrumb links. The unit of measure is then updated in the "
":guilabel:`Odometer Value` field."
msgstr ""
"更改計量單位，然後透過導覽路徑連結返回服務表單。計量單位隨後會在 "
":guilabel:`里程錶數值` 欄位中更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`NOTES`: Enter any notes for the repair at the bottom of the "
"service form. For example, this can include estimate details or parts being "
"replaced."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`備註`：在服務表單底部輸入任何維修備註，例如可包括估價詳情或需要更"
"換的零件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:71
msgid ""
"Enter the information for a new service. The required fields are Service "
"Type and Vehicle."
msgstr "輸入新服務的資料。必填欄位為「服務類型」及「車輛」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:77
msgid "From the Accounting app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:79
msgid ""
"Sometimes repairs are performed and billed *before* service records are "
"created. This is a common situation when repairs are unexpected, such as "
"towing broken down vehicles or performing emergency repairs on the side of "
"the road. In these circumstances, service records can be created directly "
"from a :doc:`vendor bill <../../finance/accounting/vendor_bills>` in the "
"**Accounting** app."
msgstr ""
"有時維修會在建立服務記錄*之前*完成並開立賬單。這種情況常見於突發維修，例如拖"
"吊故障車輛或在路邊進行緊急維修。在這些情況下，可直接從**會計**應用程式中"
"的:doc:`供應商賬單 <../../finance/accounting/vendor_bills>`建立服務記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:84
msgid ""
"To link a vendor bill to a service and create a service record, first open "
"the **Accounting** app and click :guilabel:`Purchases` on the dashboard. "
"Click the vendor bill for the repair to open the bill details."
msgstr ""
"若要將供應商賬單連結至服務並建立服務記錄，請先開啟**會計**應用程式，然後在儀"
"表板上點擊:guilabel:`採購`。點擊維修的供應商賬單以開啟賬單詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:88
msgid ""
"In the *Invoice Lines* tab, click the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` "
":guilabel:`(additional options)` icon to reveal a drop-down menu. Click the "
"checkbox next to :guilabel:`Vehicle`, then click away to close the drop-down"
" menu."
msgstr ""
"在 *發票明細行* 分頁中，點擊 :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`（其他選項"
"）` 圖示以顯示下拉式選單。點擊 :guilabel:`車輛` 旁的核取方塊，然後點擊其他位"
"置以關閉下拉式選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:92
msgid ""
"Click into the :guilabel:`Vehicle` field and select the vehicle the service "
"was done on."
msgstr "點選 :guilabel:`車輛` 欄位，然後選擇進行該項服務的車輛。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:95
msgid ""
"To add a vehicle to a bill, the :guilabel:`Status` of the bill on the "
"accounting dashboard must be :guilabel:`Draft`. If the bill has been "
"confirmed, click the :guilabel:`Reset to Draft` button on the bill, then add"
" the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"如要在賬單中加入車輛，會計儀表板上該賬單的 :guilabel:`狀態` 必須為 "
":guilabel:`草稿`。如賬單已經確認，請點擊賬單上的 :guilabel:`重設為草稿` 按鈕"
"，然後再加入車輛。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:99
msgid "A vendor bill with the vehicle selected on it."
msgstr "已選擇該車輛的供應商賬單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:102
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Vehicle` field is populated, open the *Services* "
"dashboard by navigating to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Fleet --> "
"Services`. The :guilabel:`Service Type` is listed as :guilabel:`Vendor "
"Bill`, by default. The record must be updated to keep accurate service "
"records."
msgstr ""
"填妥 :guilabel:`車輛` 欄位後，前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用程式 --> 車隊 --> "
"服務` 開啟 *服務* 儀表板。預設情況下，:guilabel:`服務類型` 會顯示為 "
":guilabel:`供應商賬單`。您必須更新此記錄，以保持服務記錄準確。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:106
msgid ""
"Click on the new :guilabel:`Vendor Bill` record to view the service details."
" Click the :guilabel:`Service Type` field to reveal a drop-down menu of all "
"available service types, and select the correct type of service. If "
"necessary, :ref:`create a new service type <fleet/new-type>`."
msgstr ""
"按一下新的 :guilabel:`供應商賬單` 記錄，以檢視服務詳情。按一下 :guilabel:`服"
"務類型` 欄位，開啟顯示所有可用服務類型的下拉式選單，然後選擇正確的服務類型。"
"如有需要，可 :ref:`建立新服務類型 <fleet/new-type>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:110
msgid ""
"On the service record, a :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Service's "
"Bill` smart button appears at the top. Click the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` "
":guilabel:`Service's Bill` smart button to view the corresponding vendor "
"bill."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:115
msgid ""
"The text color in the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Service's Bill` "
"smart button indicates the *status* of the bill. Green text indicates the "
"bill is confirmed or paid, orange text indicates it is still a draft."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:122
msgid "Create service type"
msgstr "建立服務類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:124
msgid ""
"The **only** method to create service types is from a :ref:`service form "
"<fleet/service-form>`."
msgstr "建立服務類型的 **唯一** 方法，是透過 :ref:`服務表單 <fleet/service-form>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:126
msgid ""
"On the :ref:`service form <fleet/service-form>`, type in the name of the new"
" :guilabel:`Service Type` in the corresponding field. Then, click "
":guilabel:`Create and edit...`, and a :guilabel:`Create Service Type` pop-up"
" form appears."
msgstr ""
"在:ref:`服務表單 <fleet/service-form>`上，於相應欄位輸入新:guilabel:`服務類"
"型`的名稱。然後點擊:guilabel:`建立及編輯...`，畫面隨即會顯示:guilabel:`建立服"
"務類型`彈出式表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:130
msgid ""
"The service type entered on the service form automatically populates the "
":guilabel:`Name` field, which can be modified, if desired."
msgstr ""
"在服務表單中輸入的服務類型會自動填入 :guilabel:`名稱` 欄位；如有需要，可作修"
"改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:133
msgid ""
"Then, select the :guilabel:`Category` for the new service type from the "
"drop-down menu in that field. The two default options to choose from are "
":guilabel:`Contract` or :guilabel:`Service`. Additional categories "
"**cannot** be created."
msgstr ""
"然後，在該欄位的下拉式選單中，為新服務類型選擇 :guilabel:`類別`。預設有兩個選"
"項可供選擇：:guilabel:`合約` 或 :guilabel:`服務`。**無法** 建立其他類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:137
msgid ""
"If the service applies to **only** contracts or services, select the "
"corresponding :guilabel:`Category`. If the service applies to **both** "
"contracts *and* services, leave this field blank."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:141
msgid "When done, click :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr "完成後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存及關閉`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:146
msgid "Create vendor"
msgstr "建立供應商"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:148
msgid ""
"When a service is performed for the first time, typically, the vendor's "
"record has not yet been added to the database. It is best practice to add "
"the full details for a vendor in the database, so that any necessary "
"information can be retrieved."
msgstr ""
"當首次執行某項服務時，系統資料庫通常尚未新增該供應商的紀錄。最佳做法是在資料"
"庫中填寫供應商的完整詳細資料，以便日後擷取所需資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:152
msgid ""
"Vendors are added with the **Contacts** app. Refer to the "
":doc:`documentation <../../essentials/contacts>` for more details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:156
msgid ""
"Different tabs or fields may be visible on the :guilabel:`Create Vendor` "
"form, depending on what other applications are installed."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`建立供應商` 表單上可能會顯示不同的分頁或欄位，具體視乎已安裝的"
"其他應用程式而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:162
msgid "View services"
msgstr "檢視服務"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:164
msgid ""
"To view all services logged in the database, including old and new requests,"
" navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Fleet --> Services`. All services"
" appear in a list view, including all the details for each service."
msgstr ""
"要查看資料庫內記錄的所有服務（包括新舊請求），請前往 :menuselection:`車隊應用"
"程式 --> 車隊 --> 服務`。所有服務都會以列表檢視顯示，並包含每項服務的詳細資料"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:168
msgid ""
"The service records are grouped by :ref:`service type <fleet/new-type>`. The"
" number of repairs for each service type appears in parentheses after the "
"name of the service type."
msgstr ""
"服務記錄會按 :ref:`服務類型 <fleet/new-type>` 分組。每種服務類型的維修次數會"
"顯示於服務類型名稱後的括號內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:171
msgid "Each service listed displays the following information:"
msgstr "列出的每項服務都會顯示以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:173
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: The date that the service, or repair, was performed (or "
"requested to be performed)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`日期`：執行（或要求執行）該項服務或維修的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:175
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: A short description of the specific type of "
"service, or repair, performed to clarify the specific service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:177
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Service Type`: The type of service, or repair, performed. This is"
" selected from a list of services that :ref:`must be configured <fleet/new-"
"type>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:179
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vehicle`: The specific vehicle the service was performed on."
msgstr ":guilabel:`車輛`：進行服務的特定車輛。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:180
msgid ":guilabel:`Driver`: The current driver for the vehicle."
msgstr ":guilabel:`司機`：車輛目前的司機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:181
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor`: The specific vendor who performed the service, or "
"repair."
msgstr ":guilabel:`供應商`：執行該服務或維修的特定供應商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:182
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Notes`: Any information associated with the service, or repair, "
"that is documented to add clarification."
msgstr ":guilabel:`備註`：任何與服務或維修相關並記錄下來以作補充說明的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:184
msgid ":guilabel:`Cost`: The total cost of the service, or repair."
msgstr ":guilabel:`成本`：服務或維修的總成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:185
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stage`: The status of the service, or repair. Options are "
":guilabel:`New`, :guilabel:`Running`, :guilabel:`Done`, or "
":guilabel:`Cancelled`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`階段`：服務或維修的狀態。選項包括 :guilabel:`新增`、:guilabel:`進"
"行中`、:guilabel:`已完成` 或 :guilabel:`已取消`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:188
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the :guilabel:`Cost` column, the total cost of all services"
" and repairs are listed."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`成本` 欄底部會列出所有服務及維修的總成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/fleet/service.rst:190
msgid "The full list of services in the Odoo database."
msgstr "Odoo 資料庫中的完整服務列表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:5
msgid "Frontdesk"
msgstr "前台"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Frontdesk** application provides a way for visitors to check in "
"to a building or location, and alert the person they are meeting about their"
" arrival."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **前台** 應用程式讓訪客在大樓或指定地點辦理登記，並通知會面對象他們已抵"
"達。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:10
msgid ""
"This application is ideal for businesses that do **not** have someone "
"working at a reception desk, or locations **without** a designated waiting "
"area available to guests and visitors."
msgstr ""
"此應用程式非常適合 **沒有** 接待處人員的企業，或 **沒有** 為來賓及訪客提供指"
"定等候區的地點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:16
msgid ""
"The only item to configure in the **Frontdesk** application is the "
"*station*."
msgstr "在**前台接待**應用程式中，唯一需要配置的項目是*接待站*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:21
msgid "Stations"
msgstr "站點"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:23
msgid ""
"In Odoo's **Frontdesk** application, a *station* can be thought of as any "
"location where someone can sign in and wait for an employee. This is "
"typically some form of waiting room, such as a lobby. Each station has a "
"kiosk where visitors check in."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 的**前台**應用程式中，*接待站*可理解為任何供訪客登記並等候員工的地方"
"，通常是某種等候室，例如大堂。每個接待站均設有自助登記機，供訪客辦理登記。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:27
msgid ""
"When setting up the **Frontdesk** application, a minimum of one station "
"**must** be configured, but there is no limit to how many stations can be "
"created and configured."
msgstr ""
"設定 **前台** 應用程式時，**必須** 至少配置一個服務站，但可建立及配置的服務站"
"數量並無限制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:30
msgid ""
"To create a station, navigate to :menuselection:`Frontdesk app --> "
"Stations`, and click :guilabel:`New`. When clicked, a blank station form "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`前台應用程式 --> 服務站` 並點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，即可建"
"立服務站。點擊後，系統會顯示空白的服務站表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Frontdesk Name`: Enter a name for the specific frontdesk "
"location. This should be short and identifiable, such as `Reception Desk` or"
" `Main Lobby`. This field is required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsibles`: Select the users who are notified in the "
"**Discuss** app every time a visitor checks in at the station. Multiple "
"users can be selected. This field is required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: The company the station belongs to. This field only "
"appears in multi-company databases."
msgstr ":guilabel:`公司`：站點所屬的公司。此欄位僅在多公司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Kiosk URL`: This field is automatically populated when the "
"station is saved. This URL is one way the station's kiosk is accessed. Click"
" the :icon:`assignment` :guilabel:`(Copy)` icon at the end of the URL to "
"copy it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kiosk 網址`：儲存工作站後，此欄位會自動填寫。此網址是存取該工作站 "
"Kiosk（自助終端）的途徑之一。點擊網址末端的 :icon:`assignment` :guilabel:`（"
"複製）` 圖示即可複製網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Image`: Hover over the image placeholder in the corner of the "
"form, and click the :icon:`edit_f` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon that appears. "
"Navigate to the desired image file, then click :guilabel:`Open` to select "
"it. The selected image is used as the kiosk background."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`圖片`：將滑鼠停留在表單角落的圖片預留位置上，然後按一下出現的 "
":icon:`edit_f` :guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示。瀏覽至所需的圖片檔案，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`開啟` 以選取它。所選圖片將用作自助終端機背景。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Host Selection`: Enable this option to allow the visitor to "
"select and notify the person they are visiting (the *host*). By default, all"
" the employees of the company can be selected. To restrict the list, select "
"the available employees in the :guilabel:`Select Hosts` field that appears "
"when this option is enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`選擇接待人`：啟用此選項，即可讓訪客選擇並通知其拜訪的對象（即*接待"
"人*）。預設情況下，可選擇公司內所有員工。如需限制名單，請在啟用此選項後出現"
"的:guilabel:`選擇接待人`欄位中選取可供選擇的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Self Check-In`: Enable this option to display a QR code on the "
"kiosk welcome screen, which allows guests to check in using their mobile "
"device. This option is recommended for a busy kiosk with multiple guests "
"checking in at any time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Guest Details`: Enable this option to request additional "
"information when a guest checks in. Click the checkbox next to "
":guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Phone`, or :guilabel:`Organization` to require"
" the corresponding information upon check-in. When this option is disabled, "
"guests only enter their name."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`訪客詳細資料`：啟用此選項，即可在訪客登記時要求提供額外資料。勾選 "
":guilabel:`電郵`、:guilabel:`電話` 或 :guilabel:`機構` 旁的核取方塊，以要求在"
"登記時填寫相應資料。停用此選項時，訪客只需輸入姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Host Notifications`: To notify hosts *in addition to* the default"
" **Discuss** app notification, click the checkbox next to one of the "
"following options:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`接待人通知`：如要在預設的 **討論** 應用程式通知 *以外* 額外通知接"
"待人，請剔選以下其中一個選項旁邊的方格："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Notify by email`: An email is sent to the host's work email, "
"using the template selected in the field that appears after enabling this "
"option. By default, :guilabel:`Frontdesk Email Template` is selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`透過電郵通知`：系統會向接待人的工作電郵發送電郵，並使用啟用此選項"
"後出現的欄位中所選的範本。系統預設選取 :guilabel:`前台電郵範本`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Notify by SMS`: An SMS is sent to the host's work phone, using "
"the template selected in the field that appears after enabling this option. "
"By default, :guilabel:`Frontdesk SMS Template` is selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`以短訊通知`：系統會使用啟用此選項後出現的欄位中所選範本，向受訪者"
"的工作電話發送短訊。預設會選取 :guilabel:`前台短訊範本`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Auto-Checkout`: Enter the duration after which checked-in "
"visitors are automatically checked out, in a `##h ##m` format. Set this "
"field to `0h` to disable automatic check-out."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`自動簽離`：輸入已登記訪客自動簽離的等候時長，格式為 `##h ##m`。將"
"此欄位設為 `0h` 可停用自動簽離。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Privacy Notice`: Enter a short summary of how visitors' personal "
"data is processed. This text is displayed at the bottom of the kiosk welcome"
" screen."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`私隱聲明`：輸入訪客個人資料處理方式的簡短摘要。此文字會顯示在自助"
"登記站歡迎畫面底部。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Privacy Notice Details`: Enter the full privacy notice, covering "
"data storage, rights, and contact information. Visitors can display this "
"text by clicking :guilabel:`Read more` on the kiosk."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`私隱聲明詳情`：輸入完整的私隱聲明，涵蓋資料儲存、權利及聯絡資訊。"
"訪客可在自助登記站點擊 :guilabel:`閱讀更多` 顯示此文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:85
msgid ""
"The host notification options are only useful if :ref:`Host Selection "
"<frontdesk/host>` is enabled. If no host is selected, only the station's "
":guilabel:`Responsibles` are notified."
msgstr ""
"只有在啟用 :ref:`接待人選擇 <frontdesk/host>` 後，接待人通知選項才會生效。如"
"未選擇任何接待人，系統只會通知該接待站的 :guilabel:`負責人`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:89
msgid "Side Message tab"
msgstr "側邊訊息分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:91
msgid ""
"Enter any desired text to appear on the station kiosk after a guest has "
"checked in, such as a welcome greeting or any necessary instructions. The "
"text appears on the confirmation page, on the right side of the screen, "
"after a guest has completed the check-in process."
msgstr ""
"輸入任何希望在訪客簽到後顯示於接待站自助終端的文字，例如歡迎辭或任何必要指示"
"。訪客完成簽到程序後，該文字會顯示於確認頁面螢幕右側。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:95
msgid "Frontdesk station form with all the information filled out."
msgstr "已填妥所有資料的前台工作站表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:101
msgid "Station dashboard"
msgstr "工作站儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:103
msgid ""
"The *Stations* dashboard displays all station cards along with some basic "
"information. To access the dashboard, navigate to :menuselection:`Frontdesk "
"app --> Stations`. Each station card displays the following information:"
msgstr ""
"*工作站*儀表板會顯示所有工作站卡片及部分基本資訊。如要存取儀表板，請前"
"往:menuselection:`前台應用程式 --> 工作站`。每張工作站卡片會顯示以下資訊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:107
msgid ""
":icon:`star` :guilabel:`(Add to Favorites)`: Click this icon to select the "
"station as a favorite, click it again to deselect it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:109
msgid ":guilabel:`Frontdesk Name`: The name of the station."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Open Desk`: A button to open the station's :ref:`kiosk "
"<frontdesk/kiosk>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`開啟服務台`：開啟該站點 :ref:`自助服務站 <frontdesk/kiosk>` 的按鈕"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`# On Site`: The number of visitors currently checked in at this "
"station, displayed only when at least one visitor is on site. Click to open "
"the visitors list."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在場人數`：目前在此站點已簽到的訪客人數，僅在至少有一名訪客在場時"
"顯示。按一下即可開啟訪客清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:113
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Last Check-In`: How long ago the last visitor still on site "
"checked in."
msgstr ":guilabel:`最後登記時間`：仍在場內的最後一位訪客於多久前完成登記。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsibles`: The avatars of the users responsible for the "
"station."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:116
msgid ""
"Click on a card to view a list of all the visitors to the station, including"
" past visitors."
msgstr "點擊卡片即可查看前往該站點的所有訪客清單，包括過往訪客。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:119
msgid ""
"To modify a station, click the :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`(Dropdown menu)`"
" icon on its card, then click :guilabel:`Configuration`, and the station "
"form loads."
msgstr ""
"要修改工作站，請按一下其卡片上的 :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`（下拉式選單"
"）` 圖示，再按一下 :guilabel:`配置`，工作站表單隨即載入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:122
msgid "The Stations dashboard, with a card for each station."
msgstr "工作站儀表板，每個工作站均設有一張卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:128
msgid "Kiosk setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:130
msgid ""
"Set up each kiosk for use after configuring the related station. It is "
"recommended to use a dedicated device for each frontdesk kiosk, such as a "
"tablet."
msgstr ""
"配置相關工作站後，請設定每個自助服務終端以供使用。建議為每個前台自助服務終端"
"使用專用裝置，例如平板電腦。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:133
msgid "Navigate to the kiosk in one of the following ways:"
msgstr "請透過以下其中一種方式前往自助終端（Kiosk）："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:135
msgid ""
"Navigate to the :ref:`Stations dashboard <frontdesk/dashboard>`, click the "
":guilabel:`Open Desk` button on the corresponding station card, and the "
"kiosk loads in the current browser tab."
msgstr ""
"前往 :ref:`工作站儀表板 <frontdesk/dashboard>`，按一下相應工作站卡片上的 "
":guilabel:`開啟接待處` 按鈕，自助服務終端機隨即會在目前的瀏覽器分頁中載入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:137
msgid ""
"Open the station form, and click the :guilabel:`Open Kiosk` button. A "
"*Frontdesk* pop-up window loads, displaying the kiosk URL to open on the "
"kiosk device, and an :guilabel:`Install App` button to install the kiosk as "
"an application on the device."
msgstr ""
"開啟服務站表單，然後點擊 :guilabel:`開啟自助服務站` 按鈕。系統會載入 *前台* "
"彈出視窗，顯示要在自助服務站裝置上開啟的自助服務站網址，以及用於將自助服務站"
"作為應用程式安裝到該裝置的 :guilabel:`安裝應用程式` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:140
msgid ""
"Copy the :guilabel:`Kiosk URL` from the station form, and paste it into a "
"browser on the kiosk device."
msgstr ""
"從考勤站表單複製 :guilabel:`自助考勤機網址`，然後貼上至自助考勤裝置的瀏覽器中"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:144
msgid ""
"Once a frontdesk kiosk is accessed, the user is *automatically signed out of"
" the database* on that specific device."
msgstr "一旦存取前台自助終端，使用者便會在該特定裝置上 *自動登出資料庫*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:147
msgid ""
"This is a security measure designed to prevent unauthorized access to the "
"database."
msgstr "這是一項安全措施，旨在防止未經授權存取資料庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:152
msgid "Visitor check-in"
msgstr "訪客登記"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:154
msgid ""
"When a visitor arrives, the *Your Information* section of the kiosk welcome "
"screen is filled out. All visitors are required to enter their "
":guilabel:`Name`, and depending on the :ref:`configuration "
"<frontdesk/settings-tab>`, an :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Phone`, and "
":guilabel:`Company` field may also appear."
msgstr ""
"當訪客到達時，須填寫自助登記螢幕歡迎畫面中的 *您的資料* 部分。所有訪客都必須"
"輸入其 :guilabel:`姓名`，而視乎 :ref:`設定 <frontdesk/settings-tab>`，亦可能"
"會顯示 :guilabel:`電郵`、:guilabel:`電話` 及 :guilabel:`公司` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:159
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Host Selection` option is enabled, the visitor clicks "
":icon:`stacks` :guilabel:`Browse All Hosts` in the *Select Host* section, "
"and a list of hosts appears. The visitor clicks the person they are "
"visiting, then clicks :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"如果啟用了 :guilabel:`接待人選擇` 選項，訪客可在 *選擇接待人* 區段按一下 "
":icon:`stacks` :guilabel:`瀏覽所有接待人`，系統隨即會顯示接待人清單。訪客按一"
"下要探訪的人員後，再按一下 :guilabel:`繼續`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:163
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Host Selection` option is disabled, the visitor clicks "
":guilabel:`Check In`."
msgstr "如果停用了 :guilabel:`選擇接待人` 選項，訪客只需點擊 :guilabel:`簽到`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:165
msgid ""
"The kiosk welcome screen, with the visitor information filled out and a host"
" selected."
msgstr "自助服務終端歡迎畫面，當中已填妥訪客資料並已選擇接待人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:168
msgid ""
"A confirmation screen appears, displaying the station's side message. The "
"visitor is recorded as checked in, and the station's responsibles and the "
"host are notified."
msgstr ""
"確認畫面隨即出現，並顯示該站點的側邊訊息。訪客會被記錄為已簽到，系統亦會通知"
"該站點的負責人及接待人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:172
msgid ""
"If the selected host is taking time off, the visitor is informed that their "
"host is unavailable via email or SMS, depending on how the :ref:`station is "
"configured <frontdesk/settings-tab>`."
msgstr ""
"如果所選接待人員正在休假，系統會透過電郵或短訊通知訪客接待人員目前不在，具體"
"方式視乎:ref:`接待站的設定方式 <frontdesk/settings-tab>`而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:176
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Self Check-In` is enabled, visitors can instead scan the QR "
"code displayed in the top-right corner of the welcome screen with their "
"mobile device, and fill out the same information on their phone, in the "
"language selected on the kiosk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:181
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:3
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:183
msgid ""
"To analyze visits, navigate to :menuselection:`Frontdesk app --> Visitors`, "
"remove the default filters, and click the :icon:`bar_chart` "
":guilabel:`(Graph)` or :icon:`oi_view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon in the"
" corner. By default, the graph displays the number of visitors by station."
msgstr ""
"要分析訪客記錄，請前往 :menuselection:`前台應用程式 --> 訪客`，移除預設篩選條"
"件，然後點擊角落的 :icon:`bar_chart` :guilabel:`（圖表）` 或 :icon:`oi_view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`（樞紐分析表）` 圖示。預設情況下，圖表會按接待站顯示訪客人"
"數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:188
msgid ""
"As with all reports in Odoo, the filters and groups can be modified to show "
"other metrics, as well."
msgstr "與 Odoo 中的所有報表一樣，你亦可修改篩選條件及分組，以顯示其他指標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk.rst:191
msgid ":doc:`frontdesk/visitors`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:3
msgid "Visitors"
msgstr "訪客"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:5
msgid ""
"In the Odoo **Frontdesk** application, a *visitor* refers to any non-"
"employee (e.g., repair person, job candidate, auditor, etc.). Visitor "
"arrivals and departures are typically logged for security purposes, ensuring"
" an accurate record of who is on the premises at any given time."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo **前台**應用程式中，*訪客*是指任何非員工人士（例如維修人員、求職者、"
"審計師等）。系統通常會基於保安原因記錄訪客的到達及離開時間，以確保隨時準確記"
"錄在場人員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:12
msgid "Visitor list"
msgstr "訪客清單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:14
msgid ""
"To access the list of all visitors for all stations, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Frontdesk app --> Visitors`. By default, the list only "
"displays visitors who are currently checked in (:guilabel:`Checked-In` and "
":guilabel:`Date: MMM DD` filters are active). Remove these filters in the "
"search bar to view all visitors."
msgstr ""
"要存取所有站點的所有訪客清單，請前往 :menuselection:`前台應用程式 --> 訪客`。"
"預設情況下，清單只顯示目前已簽到的訪客（已啟用 :guilabel:`已簽到` 及 "
":guilabel:`日期：MMM DD` 篩選條件）。在搜尋列移除這些篩選條件，即可查看所有訪"
"客。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:19
msgid "The list of checked-in visitors of the day."
msgstr "當日已簽到訪客的清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:22
msgid ""
"All visitors are presented in a default list view, with the following "
"details that were entered upon check in:"
msgstr "所有訪客均會以預設列表檢視顯示，並列出登記入場時輸入的以下詳情："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:25
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: The guest's name."
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`：訪客的姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:26
msgid ":guilabel:`Visitor Company`: The company the guest represents."
msgstr ":guilabel:`訪客公司`：訪客所代表的公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:27
msgid ":guilabel:`Phone`: The guest's phone number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`電話`：客人的電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:28
msgid ":guilabel:`Host`: The employee the guest is visiting."
msgstr ":guilabel:`接待人`：訪客探訪的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:29
msgid ":guilabel:`CheckIn`: The date and time the guest checked in."
msgstr ":guilabel:`簽到時間`：訪客簽到的日期和時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration`: The amount of time the guest has been checked in."
msgstr ":guilabel:`持續時間`：訪客已簽到的時間長度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:31
msgid ":guilabel:`Station`: The station the guest checked in at."
msgstr ":guilabel:`登記站`：客人辦理登記的站點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: The status of the guest. All guests in this list have a "
"status of :guilabel:`Checked-In`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`狀態`：訪客的狀態。此清單中的所有訪客狀態均為 :guilabel:`已入住`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:35
msgid ""
"When a guest leaves, click the :guilabel:`Check out` button at the end of "
"their line to log the date and time they left. To check out several guests "
"at once, click the checkbox next to each guest, click the :icon:`settings_f`"
" :guilabel:`Actions` button, then click :guilabel:`Check out`."
msgstr ""
"當訪客離開時，按一下該記錄行末端的 :guilabel:`簽出` 按鈕，以記錄其離開日期及"
"時間。若要一次過為多名訪客簽出，請勾選每位訪客旁的核取方塊，按一下 "
":icon:`settings_f` :guilabel:`操作` 按鈕，然後按一下 :guilabel:`簽出`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:39
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Auto-Checkout` feature is enabled on the :ref:`station "
"<frontdesk/settings-tab>`, guests are automatically checked out once the "
"configured duration has passed."
msgstr ""
"若已啟用 :guilabel:`自動簽出` 功能（於 :ref:`接待站 <frontdesk/settings-tab>"
"` 設定），訪客便會在超過所設定的時長後自動簽出。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:43
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Print Badge` button at the end of a checked-in guest's "
"line to download a PDF file of the visitor's badge. The badge displays the "
"date and time the visitor checked in, the visitor's name and company, who "
"they are visiting, and the logo of the company they are visiting."
msgstr ""
"點擊已登記訪客資料行末端的 :guilabel:`列印訪客證` 按鈕，即可下載訪客證的 PDF "
"檔案。訪客證上會顯示訪客的登記日期及時間、訪客姓名及所屬公司、探訪對象，以及"
"受訪公司的標誌。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:50
msgid "Register a visitor manually"
msgstr "手動登記訪客"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:52
msgid ""
"If a guest arrives and does not check in using a kiosk, they can be "
"registered from the backend. Navigate to :menuselection:`Frontdesk app --> "
"Visitors`, click :guilabel:`New`, and a blank visitor form loads. Enter the "
"guest's information on the visitor form, including their :guilabel:`Name`, "
":guilabel:`Phone`, :guilabel:`Email`, and :guilabel:`Visitor Company`, the "
":guilabel:`Station`, and the :guilabel:`Host Name`."
msgstr ""
"如有訪客抵達且未有使用自助終端機登記，可從後台為其登記。前往 "
":menuselection:`前台應用程式 --> 訪客`，點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，系統便會載入空"
"白的訪客表單。在訪客表單上輸入訪客資料，包括其 :guilabel:`姓"
"名`、:guilabel:`電話`、:guilabel:`電郵` 及 :guilabel:`訪客公司`，以及 "
":guilabel:`接待站` 和 :guilabel:`接待人姓名`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:58
msgid ""
"The guest is checked in as soon as the record is saved, and the station's "
"responsibles and the host are notified, as with a kiosk check-in."
msgstr ""
"儲存記錄後，訪客即完成簽到；登記站的負責人及接待人亦會收到通知，與透過自助終"
"端簽到一樣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:61
msgid "A visitor form, with the email sent to the host in the chatter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:64
msgid ""
"To check out a guest from their form, click the :guilabel:`Check out` button"
" in the upper-left corner. The notifications sent to the host are logged in "
"the chatter of the visitor form."
msgstr ""
"要從訪客的表格中為其登記離開，請按一下左上角的 :guilabel:`登記離開` 按鈕。發"
"送給接待人員的通知會記錄在訪客表格的對話欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:68
msgid "Visitor flow"
msgstr "訪客流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:70
msgid ""
"When a visitor arrives at a facility, they approach a :ref:`Frontdesk kiosk "
"<frontdesk/kiosk>`, and enter their information. If the station allows it, "
"they select the host they are visiting. See :ref:`frontdesk/visitor-flow` "
"for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:74
msgid "Once the visitor is checked in, the following people are notified:"
msgstr "訪客簽到後，系統會通知以下人員："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:76
msgid ""
"The station's :guilabel:`Responsibles` receive a message from OdooBot in the"
" **Discuss** app, such as `Frontdesk Check-In: John Smith ((644)-169-1353) "
"(Smith LLP) to meet Marc Demo`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:78
msgid ""
"The host, if they have a user account, receives a **Discuss** message "
"stating that the visitor just checked in."
msgstr "若接待人擁有用戶帳戶，會收到一則 **討論** 訊息，表示訪客剛剛已辦理登記。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:80
msgid ""
"The host receives an email and/or an SMS, depending on the station's "
":guilabel:`Host Notifications` settings."
msgstr "接待人會收到電郵及／或短訊，視乎接待處的:guilabel:`接待人通知`設定而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:84
msgid ""
"The **Discuss** app is installed by default when creating an Odoo database, "
"and does not count towards billing. As long as the **Discuss** application "
"is not intentionally uninstalled, the notifications work."
msgstr ""
"建立 Odoo 資料庫時，系統會預設安裝 **討論** 應用程式，且不會計入收費。只要沒"
"有刻意解除安裝 **討論** 應用程式，通知功能便會正常運作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:89
msgid ""
"Visitors do **not** check themselves out when they leave. It is important "
"for **Frontdesk** users to check out visitors for accurate record-keeping."
msgstr ""
"訪客離開時 **不會** 自行簽退。為確保記錄準確，**前台** 使用者務必為訪客辦理簽"
"退。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/frontdesk/visitors.rst:92
msgid ""
"Always have an accurate list of who is on the premises at any given time. "
"This is important for security purposes, and in the case of an emergency."
msgstr "隨時掌握現時身處場所的人員準確名單。這對保安及應對緊急情況至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:5
msgid "Lunch"
msgstr "午餐"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:7
msgid ""
"The **Lunch** application in Odoo allows users to conveniently order food "
"and pay for their meal directly from the database."
msgstr "Odoo 中的 **午餐** 應用程式讓用戶可以直接從資料庫方便地訂餐並付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:10
msgid ""
"Before employees can use the **Lunch** application, there are a number of "
"configurations that need to be made: :ref:`settings <lunch/settings>`, "
":doc:`vendors <lunch/vendors>`, :ref:`locations <lunch/locations>`, "
":doc:`products <lunch/products>`, and :ref:`product categories "
"<lunch/product-categories>`. Once these are created and configured, "
"employees can view offerings and order food."
msgstr ""
"在員工使用 **午餐** 應用程式前，需要先完成多項配置：:ref:`設定 <lunch/"
"settings>`、:doc:`供應商 <lunch/vendors>`、:ref:`地點 <lunch/locations>"
"`、:doc:`產品 <lunch/products>` 及 :ref:`產品類別 <lunch/product-categories>"
"`。建立並配置這些項目後，員工即可瀏覽餐點並訂購食物。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:21
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Settings` menu, only two items need to be configured: "
"overdraft settings and notifications. To access the settings, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Lunch app --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:25
msgid "Configure the following:"
msgstr "設定以下項目："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Lunch Overdraft`: Enter the maximum negative balance employees "
"can reach in the :guilabel:`Overdraft` field. The default value of `0.00` "
"means employees can only order what their :doc:`lunch account <lunch/user-"
"accounts>` balance covers. The currency is the company's currency."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`午餐透支`：在 :guilabel:`透支` 欄位輸入員工可達到的最大負結餘。預"
"設值 `0.00` 表示員工只可訂購其 :doc:`午餐帳戶 <lunch/user-accounts>` 結餘足以"
"支付的餐點。貨幣為公司的貨幣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reception notification`: Set the message users receive when a "
"**Lunch** manager :ref:`notifies them that their order has been delivered "
"<lunch/notify>`. The default message `Your lunch has been delivered. Enjoy "
"your meal!` populates this field, but can be modified, if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:35
msgid "Both settings are defined per company."
msgstr "這兩項設定均按公司分別設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:38
msgid ""
"If several languages are :doc:`installed <../general/users/language>` in the"
" database, the :guilabel:`Reception notification` message, as well as the "
"names and descriptions of products, the names of product categories, and the"
" names and messages of alerts, can be translated. Click the language code "
"(for example, :guilabel:`EN`) displayed next to the field to open the "
"translation pop-up window, enter the text for each language, then click "
":guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"如資料庫中 :doc:`已安裝 <../general/users/language>` 多種語言，即可翻譯 "
":guilabel:`接待通知` 訊息、產品名稱及描述、產品類別名稱，以及警報名稱及訊息。"
"點擊欄位旁邊顯示的語言代碼（例如：:guilabel:`EN`），開啟翻譯彈出視窗，輸入每"
"種語言的文字，然後點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:47
msgid "Locations"
msgstr "地點"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:49
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo creates an `HQ Office` location when the **Lunch** "
"application is installed. If a company has more than one location, they must"
" be configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:52
msgid ""
"To add a location, navigate to :menuselection:`Lunch app --> Configuration "
"--> Locations`. The currently configured locations appear in a list view. "
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button in the corner and a blank line appears "
"beneath the last location in the list."
msgstr ""
"要新增地點，請前往 :menuselection:`午餐應用程式 --> 設定 --> 地點`。目前設定"
"的地點會以清單檢視顯示。點擊角落的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，清單最後一個地點下"
"方即會出現一個空白行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:56
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the location in the :guilabel:`Location Name` field. Next,"
" click into the :guilabel:`Address` field and enter the location's specific "
"address. It is possible to enter multiple lines in the address field. In a "
"multi-company database, select the :guilabel:`Company` the location belongs "
"to."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`地點名稱` 欄位輸入地點的名稱。接著，按一下 :guilabel:`地址` 欄"
"位並輸入該地點的詳細地址。地址欄位支援輸入多行文字。在多公司資料庫中，請選取"
"該地點所屬的 :guilabel:`公司`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:61
msgid "Repeat this for all locations that need to be added."
msgstr "為所有需要新增的地點重複此步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:63
msgid ""
"The list of lunch locations, with their names, addresses, and companies."
msgstr "午餐地點列表，包含其名稱、地址及公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:69
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:3
msgid "Alerts"
msgstr "警示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:71
msgid ""
"It is possible to set up alerts that can either be displayed in the "
"**Lunch** app, or be sent to specific employees via the **Discuss** app."
msgstr ""
"您可以設定提示，選擇在 **午餐** 應用程式中顯示，或透過 **討論** 應用程式傳送"
"給特定員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:74
msgid ""
"To set up an alert, navigate to :menuselection:`Lunch app --> Configuration "
"--> Alerts`. Click the :guilabel:`New` button in the corner and a blank "
"lunch alert form loads. Enter the following information on the form:"
msgstr ""
"如要設定提示，請前往 :menuselection:`午餐應用程式 --> 配置 --> 提示`。按一下"
"角落的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統便會載入空白的午餐提示表單。請在表單中輸入"
"以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Alert Name`: Enter a name for the alert. This should be short and"
" descriptive, such as `New Lunch Vendor` or `Order by 11:30`. This field is "
"**required**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`提醒名稱`：輸入提醒名稱。名稱應簡短且具描述性，例如 `新午餐供應"
"商` 或 `11:30 前訂購`。此為**必填**欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:80
msgid ":guilabel:`Display`: Select how the alert is shown. The options are:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`顯示`：選擇警示的顯示方式。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Alert in app`: The alert is visible on the main **Lunch** app "
"dashboard, in an orange box, above the user's name on the dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Chat notification`: The alert is sent to users as a notification,"
" received in their **Discuss** inbox or by email, depending on their "
"notification preferences. If this option is selected, the following "
"additional field appears:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`聊天通知`：系統會將警示作為通知傳送給用戶，視乎其通知偏好設定，通"
"知會發送至其 **討論** 收件箱或電郵地址。如選擇此選項，將會顯示以下額外欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recipients`: Select who receives the chat alert. The options are:"
" :guilabel:`Everyone`, :guilabel:`Employee who ordered last week`, "
":guilabel:`Employee who ordered last month`, or :guilabel:`Employee who "
"ordered last year`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`收件人`：選擇接收聊天提示的對象。選項包括：:guilabel:`所有"
"人`、:guilabel:`上星期曾訂購的員工`、:guilabel:`上月曾訂購的員工`，"
"或:guilabel:`去年曾訂購的員工`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Location`: Select the locations the alert appears for using the "
"drop-down menu. Multiple locations can be selected. This field is "
"**required**. If the alert applies to all locations, select all the "
"locations from the drop-down menu. Chat notifications are only sent to users"
" whose last lunch location is one of the selected locations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`地點`：使用下拉式選單選擇顯示此提示的地點。可選擇多個地點。此欄位"
"為 **必填** 項目。如果提示適用於所有地點，請從下拉式選單中選取所有地點。即時"
"通訊通知只會傳送給最後一次午餐地點屬於所選地點之一的使用者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show Until`: If the alert should expire on a specific date, "
"select the date from the calendar picker."
msgstr ":guilabel:`顯示至`：若警示應於特定日期失效，請從日曆選擇器中選取日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Active`: This option is enabled (appears green) by default. To "
"turn off the alert, click the toggle so that it no longer appears green."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`啟用`：此選項預設為啟用狀態（顯示為綠色）。若要關閉提示，請按一下"
"切換按鈕，使其不再顯示為綠色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Message`: Enter the alert message in this field. This field is "
"**required**."
msgstr ":guilabel:`訊息`：在此欄位輸入提示訊息。此欄位為**必填**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:102
msgid ""
"Days of the week: Click the days of the week the alert is visible or sent. "
"By default, all seven days are ticked. If :guilabel:`Chat notification` is "
"selected for the :guilabel:`Display` option, a :guilabel:`Notification Time`"
" field appears beneath the days of the week. Enter the time the chat message"
" is sent, in the 24-hour `HH:MM` format (for example, `10:30`)."
msgstr ""
"星期幾：點擊顯示或發送提示的星期日子。預設會剔選全部七天。若選取 "
":guilabel:`聊天通知` 作為 :guilabel:`顯示` 選項，星期幾下方會顯示 "
":guilabel:`通知時間` 欄位。請以 24 小時制 `HH:MM` 格式（例如 `10:30`）輸入發"
"送聊天訊息的時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:107
msgid ""
"An alert form filled out for a chat notification sent at 10:30 on weekdays, asking\n"
"employees to order before 11:30."
msgstr ""
"已填妥的提示表單，用於在平日 10:30 發送聊天通知，提醒\n"
"員工於 11:30 前訂購。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch.rst:112
