#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:3
msgid "Lunch management"
msgstr "午餐管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo's **Lunch** application, it is required to have someone manage the "
"orders, vendors, and products. In addition, someone must be responsible for "
"the orders, and notifying employees when their orders have arrived. This can"
" be the same person."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 的 **午餐** 應用程式中，必須指派專人管理訂單、供應商及產品。此外，亦"
"須有人負責處理訂單，並在訂單送達時通知員工。以上職責可由同一人擔任。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:9
msgid ""
"Orders can be :ref:`cancelled <lunch/cancel>`, :ref:`sent to the vendor "
"<lunch/send-orders>`, :ref:`confirmed <lunch/confirm-orders>` upon arrival, "
"and :ref:`employees can be notified <lunch/notify>`, either from the "
":ref:`Today's Orders <lunch/todays-orders>` dashboard, or the :ref:`Control "
"Vendors <lunch/control_vendors>` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"訂單可以:ref:`取消 <lunch/cancel>`、:ref:`傳送至供應商 <lunch/send-orders>`、"
"在送達時:ref:`確認 <lunch/confirm-orders>`，並可:ref:`通知員工 <lunch/notify>"
"`；以上操作均可從:ref:`今日訂單 <lunch/todays-orders>`儀表板或:ref:`管理供應"
"商 <lunch/control_vendors>`儀表板執行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:14
msgid ""
"To manage the **Lunch** app, users need the :guilabel:`Administrator` access"
" rights for the **Lunch** app (the other level, :guilabel:`User : Order your"
" meal`, only allows users to order). These can be set by navigating to the "
":menuselection:`Settings app` and selecting :guilabel:`Manage Users`. Then, "
"click on the desired user to view their access rights."
msgstr ""
"如要管理 **午餐** 應用程式，用戶需要擁有 **午餐** 應用程式的 :guilabel:`管理"
"員` 存取權限（另一個權限級別 :guilabel:`用戶：訂購您的餐點` 僅允許用戶訂餐）"
"。您可前往 :menuselection:`設定應用程式` 並選擇 :guilabel:`管理用戶` 進行設定"
"，然後點擊目標用戶即可檢視其存取權限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:19
msgid ""
"For more information on access rights, refer to the :doc:`Access rights "
"<../../general/users/access_rights/>` documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:23
msgid ""
"Only users with administration rights are able to view the "
":guilabel:`Manager` and :guilabel:`Configuration` menus in the **Lunch** "
"application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:29
msgid "Today's Orders"
msgstr "今日訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:31
msgid ""
"To view and manage the orders for the day, navigate to :menuselection:`Lunch"
" app --> Manager --> Today's Orders`. All orders for the day are presented "
"in a list view on the :guilabel:`Today's Orders` dashboard, with a filter "
"for :guilabel:`Today`, and grouped by :guilabel:`Vendor`, by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:36
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:173
msgid "The following information appears in the list:"
msgstr "清單中會顯示以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:38
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:175
msgid ":guilabel:`Order Date`: the date the order was placed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`訂單日期`：下達訂單的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:39
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:176
msgid ":guilabel:`Vendor`: the vendor the product is being ordered from."
msgstr ":guilabel:`供應商`：訂購該產品的供應商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:40
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:177
msgid ":guilabel:`Product`: the specific product ordered."
msgstr ":guilabel:`產品`：所訂購的特定產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:41
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:178
msgid ":guilabel:`Extras`: any extras selected for the product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`額外項目`：為產品選取的任何額外項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:179
msgid ":guilabel:`Notes`: any information needed to be sent to the vendor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:43
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:180
msgid ":guilabel:`User`: the user who ordered the product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`用戶`：訂購該產品的用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:44
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:181
msgid ":guilabel:`Lunch Location`: where the product is set to be delivered."
msgstr ":guilabel:`午餐地點`：設定送遞產品的地點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:45
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:182
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Price`: the total price for the product, including all extras."
msgstr ":guilabel:`價格`：產品的總價格，包括所有額外項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:46
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:183
msgid ":guilabel:`Status`: the current status of the product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`狀態`：產品的目前狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:47
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:184
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: the company under which the order was placed. This only"
" appears in a multi-company database."
msgstr ":guilabel:`公司`：下達訂單所屬的公司。此欄位只會在多公司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:50
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Status` of each product is one of the following: "
":guilabel:`To Order` (orange, the product was added to the user's cart but "
"not ordered yet), :guilabel:`Ordered` (red), :guilabel:`Sent` (blue), "
":guilabel:`Received` (green), or :guilabel:`Cancelled` (gray)."
msgstr ""
"每項產品的 :guilabel:`狀態` 為以下其中一項：:guilabel:`待訂購`（橙色，表示產"
"品已加入用戶購物車但尚未下單）、:guilabel:`已訂購`（紅色）、:guilabel:`已發"
"送`（藍色）、:guilabel:`已接收`（綠色）或 :guilabel:`已取消`（灰色）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:54
msgid ""
"The Today's Orders list, grouped by vendor, with the Send Orders button and ordered\n"
"products."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:61
msgid "Cancel orders"
msgstr "取消訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:63
msgid ""
"Users can cancel their own orders from the :ref:`Order Your Lunch "
"<lunch/cancel-one>` dashboard, as long as the orders have not been sent to "
"the vendor. **Lunch** managers can cancel any order that has not been "
"received yet."
msgstr ""
"只要訂單尚未發送給供應商，用戶便可於:ref:`訂購午餐 <lunch/cancel-one>`儀表板"
"取消自己的訂單。**午餐**管理員則可取消任何尚未收到的訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:67
msgid ""
"To cancel an order from a vendor, individual products **must** be cancelled "
"one at a time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:69
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Today's Orders` dashboard, a :icon:`close` "
":guilabel:`Cancel` button is shown at the far-right of each product line "
"that can be cancelled (products with a :guilabel:`To Order`, "
":guilabel:`Ordered`, or :guilabel:`Sent` status). Click the :icon:`close` "
":guilabel:`Cancel` button to cancel the order for that individual product. "
"The amount paid for the product is credited back to the user's lunch "
"account."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`今日訂單` 儀表板上，每個可取消的產品資料行最右側都會顯示 "
":icon:`close` :guilabel:`取消` 按鈕（即狀態為 :guilabel:`待訂"
"購`、:guilabel:`已訂購` 或 :guilabel:`已傳送` 的產品）。點擊 :icon:`close` "
":guilabel:`取消` 按鈕，即可取消該個別產品的訂單。該產品的已付金額將會退回至用"
"戶的午餐賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:75
msgid ""
"To restore a cancelled order, click the :icon:`undo` :guilabel:`Reset` "
"button at the end of its line. The product status changes back to "
":guilabel:`Ordered`."
msgstr ""
"要還原已取消的訂單，請按一下該項目末端的 :icon:`undo` :guilabel:`重設` 按鈕。"
"產品狀態會變回 :guilabel:`已訂購`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:81
msgid "Send orders"
msgstr "傳送訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:83
msgid ""
"The first step in managing the **Lunch** app is to send the orders to the "
"vendors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:85
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Send Orders` button appears next to the vendor's name and "
"phone number when the vendor has products with an :guilabel:`Ordered` status"
" for the current day. Products with a :guilabel:`To Order` status have not "
"been paid for by the user, and are not sent."
msgstr ""
"在供應商的名稱和電話號碼旁邊會顯示:guilabel:`發送訂單`按鈕，前提是該供應商當"
"日有狀態為:guilabel:`已訂購`的產品。至於狀態為:guilabel:`待訂購`的產品，由於"
"用戶尚未付款，因此不會發送。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:89
msgid ""
"How orders reach the vendor depends on the vendor's :ref:`Send Order By "
"<lunch/orders>` setting:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Phone`: The manager responsible for sending orders **must** send "
"the orders to the vendor, outside of the database (call, online order, "
"etc.). Once orders have been placed with the vendor, click the "
":guilabel:`Send Orders` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email`: The day's orders are automatically emailed to the vendor "
"at the configured :guilabel:`Order Time`. To email them without waiting for "
"the :guilabel:`Order Time`, click the :guilabel:`Send Orders` button."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`電郵`：當天的訂單會在已設定的 :guilabel:`下單時間` 自動以電郵傳送"
"給供應商。如欲在未到 :guilabel:`下單時間` 前以電郵傳送，請點擊 :guilabel:`傳"
"送訂單` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:98
msgid ""
"Once sent, the :guilabel:`Send Orders` button changes to a "
":guilabel:`Confirm Orders` button, and the :guilabel:`Status` column is "
"updated from red :guilabel:`Ordered` tags to blue :guilabel:`Sent` tags, "
"indicating the order has been sent to the vendor. Users who have placed "
"orders in the **Lunch** app rely on the :guilabel:`Status` tags to track "
"their orders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:106
msgid "Confirm orders"
msgstr "確認訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:108
msgid ""
"After orders have been sent to the vendor, the next step is to confirm the "
"orders after they have been delivered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:111
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Today's Orders` dashboard, click the :guilabel:`Confirm "
"Orders` button that appears next to the vendor's name and phone number."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`今日訂單` 儀表板上，點擊供應商名稱及電話號碼旁邊的 "
":guilabel:`確認訂單` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:114
msgid ""
"Once confirmed, the :guilabel:`Confirm Orders` button disappears, and the "
":guilabel:`Status` column is updated from blue :guilabel:`Sent` tags to "
"green :guilabel:`Received` tags, indicating the vendor has delivered the "
"orders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:118
msgid ""
"In addition, the :icon:`close` :guilabel:`Cancel` button at the end of each "
"product line changes to a :icon:`mail_f` :guilabel:`Send Notification` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"此外，每個產品資料行末端的 :icon:`close` :guilabel:`取消` 按鈕會變更為 "
":icon:`mail_f` :guilabel:`發送通知` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:121
msgid ""
"If needed, instead of confirming all of the individual products from a "
"vendor, individual products can be confirmed one at a time. To confirm an "
"individual product, click the :icon:`check` :guilabel:`Confirm` button at "
"the end of the individual product line. When confirming individual products "
"with this method, the :guilabel:`Confirm Orders` button remains on the "
"vendor line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:126
msgid ""
"It is also possible to tick the checkbox of several product lines, and click"
" the :guilabel:`Receive` button that appears at the top of the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:129
msgid ""
"The Today's Orders list after sending the orders, with the Confirm Orders button, a\n"
"received product, and sent products."
msgstr ""
"傳送訂單後的「今日訂單」清單，當中顯示「確認訂單」按鈕、已收到的\n"
"產品及已傳送的產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:134
msgid ""
"A vendor receives an order for three pizzas, and an order of garlic knots. "
"When the delivery is made to the company, the **Lunch** manager notices the "
"garlic knots are missing."
msgstr ""
"某供應商收到一張包含三個薄餅及一份蒜蓉包的訂單。送貨至公司時，**午餐** 管理員"
"發現漏了蒜蓉包。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:137
msgid ""
"The manager first marks the three pizzas as received, by individually "
"confirming the products with the :icon:`check` :guilabel:`Confirm`  button "
"at the end of each product line."
msgstr ""
"經理首先將這三個薄餅標記為已收貨，方法是逐一使用每個產品資料行末端的 "
":icon:`check` :guilabel:`確認` 按鈕來確認產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:140
msgid ""
"Later, when the vendor delivers the garlic knots, the manager can either "
"click the :icon:`check` :guilabel:`Confirm`  button at the end of the line "
"for the garlic knots, or click the :guilabel:`Confirm Orders` button that "
"appears next to the vendor's name and phone number."
msgstr ""
"其後，當供應商送來蒜香麵包結時，經理可點擊蒜香麵包結資料行末端的 "
":icon:`check` :guilabel:`確認` 按鈕，或點擊供應商名稱及電話號碼旁邊的 "
":guilabel:`確認訂單` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:148
msgid "Notify employees"
msgstr "通知員工"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:150
msgid ""
"After products are received, and the orders are confirmed, the employees "
"**must** be informed that their orders have been delivered, and are ready to"
" be picked up."
msgstr "收到產品並確認訂單後，**必須**通知員工其訂單已送達並可供領取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:153
msgid ""
"Unlike sending and confirming orders, notifications must be sent "
"individually, and cannot be sent in a batch."
msgstr "與傳送及確認訂單不同，通知必須逐一傳送，無法批量發送。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:156
msgid ""
"To notify the user their product has arrived, click the :icon:`mail_f` "
":guilabel:`Send Notification` button at the end of each product line. The "
"user receives the :ref:`Reception notification <lunch/settings>` message "
"configured in the settings, in their **Discuss** inbox or by email, "
"depending on their notification preferences. Once the notification is sent, "
"the button disappears from the line."
msgstr ""
"要通知用戶其產品已送達，請按一下每個產品資料行末端的 :icon:`mail_f` "
":guilabel:`傳送通知` 按鈕。用戶會收到在設定中配置的 :ref:`接收通知 <lunch/"
"settings>` 訊息（根據其通知偏好，於 **討論** 收件箱或透過電郵接收）。通知一經"
"發出，該按鈕便會從資料行上消失。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:165
msgid "Control Vendors"
msgstr "控制供應商"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:167
msgid ""
"All orders for all vendors, both past and present, can be found in the "
"*Control Vendors* dashboard. To access these records, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Lunch app --> Manager --> Control Vendors`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:170
msgid ""
"All orders appear in a list view, grouped alphabetically by "
":guilabel:`Vendor`. The list loads with all vendors expanded to show all "
"order lines for every vendor, by default."
msgstr ""
"所有訂單均以清單檢視顯示，並按:guilabel:`供應商`的字母順序分組。系統預設在載"
"入清單時展開所有供應商，顯示每位供應商的所有訂單資料行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:187
msgid ""
"Orders can be :ref:`cancelled <lunch/cancel>`, :ref:`sent to the vendor "
"<lunch/send-orders>`, :ref:`confirmed <lunch/confirm-orders>` upon arrival, "
"and :ref:`employees can be notified <lunch/notify>` using the same method as"
" on the :ref:`Today's Orders <lunch/todays-orders>` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"訂單可以 :ref:`取消 <lunch/cancel>`、:ref:`傳送至供應商 <lunch/send-orders>"
"`、在送達時 :ref:`確認 <lunch/confirm-orders>`，以及 :ref:`通知員工 <lunch/"
"notify>`，操作方式與在 :ref:`今日訂單 <lunch/todays-orders>` 儀表板上相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:192
msgid ""
"The Control Vendors list, with the orders of every vendor grouped by vendor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:196
msgid ""
"The difference between the :ref:`Today's Orders <lunch/todays-orders>` "
"dashboard and the :ref:`Control Vendors <lunch/control_vendors>` dashboard "
"is that the *Today's Orders* dashboard **only** displays orders for the "
"current day, while the :guilabel:`Control Vendors` dashboard displays "
"**all** orders made in the **Lunch** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:202
msgid ":doc:`../lunch`"
msgstr ":doc:`../lunch`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/management.rst:203
msgid ":doc:`user-accounts`"
msgstr ":doc:`user-accounts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:5
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:82
msgid "Orders"
msgstr "訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:7
msgid ""
"The **Lunch** app lets employees place lunch orders, see what is available "
"each day, and check their account balance, all from one place."
msgstr ""
"員工可在 **午餐** 應用程式中一站式訂購午餐、查看每日供應餐點，以及查閱帳戶結"
"餘。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:10
msgid ""
"When the **Lunch** app is opened, the *Order Your Lunch* dashboard loads. "
"This view is also accessible by navigating to :menuselection:`Lunch app --> "
"My Lunch --> New Order`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:13
msgid ""
"The *Order Your Lunch* dashboard provides a summary of lunch offerings, the "
"user's account information, and their upcoming orders, along with their "
"statuses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:17
msgid "Order Your Lunch"
msgstr "訂購午餐"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:19
msgid ""
"On the main *Order Your Lunch* dashboard, all the necessary information "
"needed to place an order is visible."
msgstr "在主 *訂購您的午餐* 儀表板上，所有下訂單所需的必要資訊均會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:22
msgid ""
"One side of the dashboard displays the various :icon:`restaurant` "
":guilabel:`Categories` of products available, along with the :icon:`local-"
"shipping` :guilabel:`Vendors` supplying the products. At the end of each "
"line is a number, indicating how many products are associated with that "
"category or vendor."
msgstr ""
"儀表板一側會顯示可用產品的各個 :icon:`restaurant` :guilabel:`類別`，以及供應"
"產品的 :icon:`local-shipping` :guilabel:`供應商`。每行末端都有一個數字，顯示"
"與該類別或供應商關聯的產品數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:27
msgid ""
"To filter the products by categories or vendors, click the checkbox next to "
"the desired category or vendor to view only items within those selections. "
"Multiple selections can be made in each section."
msgstr ""
"要按類別或供應商篩選產品，請勾選所需類別或供應商旁邊的複選框，以僅檢視所選範"
"圍內的項目。每個部分均可進行多項選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:31
msgid ""
"If selections are made in both sections, **only** products that match both "
"the selected categories **and** vendors are shown."
msgstr "如果兩個部分都有選擇項目，**只會**顯示同時符合所選類別**及**供應商的產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:34
msgid ""
"The middle section displays the products of the vendors available for the "
"selected :ref:`location <lunch/select-location>`, in a default Kanban view. "
"Each product card displays the name, price, vendor, photo, and description "
"of the product. If the product is configured as new, it also displays a "
"green :guilabel:`New` tag. Click the :icon:`star` :guilabel:`(Add to "
"Favorites)` icon on a product card to mark it as a favorite."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:40
msgid ""
"The other side of the dashboard, which serves as an account hub, displays "
"any :ref:`alert <lunch/alerts>` configured for the user's location, the "
"user, their location, the selected date, their :guilabel:`Passed orders`, "
"their account balance (in the :icon:`payments` :guilabel:`Available Balance`"
" field), and the details of their current order, if any products have been "
"added."
msgstr ""
"儀表板的另一側作為帳戶中心，會顯示為用戶地點設定的任何 :ref:`提示 <lunch/"
"alerts>`、用戶名稱、所在地點、已選日期、:guilabel:`已下訂單`、帳戶餘額（在 "
":icon:`payments` :guilabel:`可用餘額` 欄位中），以及現有訂單的詳細資料（如已"
"加入任何產品）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:45
msgid ""
"The Lunch app dashboard, with the product cards and the user's current "
"order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:49
msgid ""
"Anywhere a vendor's name is listed in the **Lunch** app, such as on Kanban "
"product cards, their phone number is listed, as well."
msgstr ""
"在 **午餐** 應用程式中任何列出供應商名稱的地方（例如看板產品卡片上），均會同"
"時列出其電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:53
msgid "**Lunch** managers can place orders on behalf of another user."
msgstr "**午餐**管理員可以代表其他用戶下單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:55
msgid ""
"Click the user's name at the top of the account hub, and select the user "
"from the drop-down menu. The account hub then displays that user's balance "
"and orders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:59
msgid "Place an order"
msgstr "下訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:61
msgid ""
"To place a lunch order, navigate to the main *Order Your Lunch* dashboard by"
" either opening the **Lunch** app or by navigating to :menuselection:`Lunch "
"app --> My Lunch --> New Order`."
msgstr ""
"要訂購午餐，請開啟 **午餐** 應用程式，或前往 :menuselection:`午餐應用程"
"式 --> 我的午餐 --> 新訂單`，以進入主要的 *訂購午餐* 儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:67
msgid "Select the location"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:69
msgid ""
"Ensure the location set in the account hub on the side of the *Order Your "
"Lunch* dashboard is correct. Click the :guilabel:`Location` drop-down menu "
"to view all **Lunch** app locations, and select the location the user wants "
"their lunch delivered to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:74
msgid ""
"The user's work schedule, which indicates where they work each day, is "
"**not** reflected in the :guilabel:`Location` field. Every available "
"location must be configured in the **Lunch** app, and all locations are "
"available to all users in the database, regardless of work location. This "
"way, users can order lunch and have it delivered to the location where they "
"*will be* during lunchtime."
msgstr ""
"顯示用戶每日工作地點的工作時間表，**不會**反映在 :guilabel:`地點` 欄位中。所"
"有可用地點都必須在 **午餐** 應用程式中配置，而且無論員工的工作地點在哪裡，資"
"料庫中的所有用戶都可使用所有地點。這樣一來，用戶便可訂購午餐並將其送達自己午"
"飯時間*所在*的地點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:80
msgid ""
"For example, an employee works in the factory and has a lunch meeting with "
"their supervisor at the main office, two blocks away. The employee selects "
"the main office as their location in the **Lunch** app, and their order is "
"delivered to the main office rather than the factory."
msgstr ""
"例如，一名員工在工廠工作，並需與上司在兩個街口外的總公司舉行午餐會議。該員工"
"在 **午餐** 應用程式中選擇總公司作為其地點，其訂單便會送達總公司而非工廠。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:85
msgid "Select the date"
msgstr "選擇日期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:87
msgid ""
"The **Lunch** app allows for placing orders not only for the current day, "
"but also for ordering future meals. This feature allows users to plan meals "
"in advance, without having to place daily orders."
msgstr ""
"**午餐** 應用程式不僅支援當日訂餐，亦可預訂未來的餐點。此功能讓用戶能提前規劃"
"膳食，無需每日下單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:91
msgid ""
"Click the date on the side of the *Order Your Lunch* dashboard to open a "
"calendar pop-up window. Click on the desired date to select it. Any products"
" added are for delivery on the selected date."
msgstr ""
"點擊 *訂購午餐* 儀表板側邊的日期，以開啟日曆彈出式視窗。點擊所需日期即可選擇"
"該日期。之後新增的任何產品，都會於所選日期送達。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:95
msgid ""
"When a date is selected, a filter for the corresponding day of the week (for"
" example, :guilabel:`Monday`) is added to the search bar, and only the "
"products of the vendors :ref:`available on that day <lunch/availability>` "
"are displayed."
msgstr ""
"選擇日期後，搜尋列會加入對應星期幾的篩選條件（例如：:guilabel:`星期一`），並"
"只會顯示 :ref:`當日有提供服務 <lunch/availability>` 的供應商產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:100
msgid ""
"Multiple products with multiple delivery dates can be ordered at once; each "
"day does not need to be processed separately."
msgstr "可一次過訂購多項具備不同交貨日期的產品，無須逐日分開處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:104
msgid "Add products to an order"
msgstr "將產品加入訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:106
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Order Your Lunch` dashboard, click on the desired "
"product to add it to an order, and a *Configure Your Order* pop-up window "
"loads."
msgstr ""
"從 :guilabel:`訂購午餐` 儀表板中，點擊所需產品將其加入訂單，系統隨即會載入 "
"*設定您的訂單* 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:109
msgid ""
"At the top of the pop-up window is the product image, name, and price. "
"Beneath that, there are potential :guilabel:`Extras` fields that showcase "
"any :ref:`extra items or options <lunch/extras>`, such as toppings or "
"drinks. Click the checkbox next to any desired extras present in the "
":guilabel:`Extras` fields to add them to the order."
msgstr ""
"彈出視窗頂部顯示產品圖片、名稱及價格。下方可能會出現 :guilabel:`額外項目` 欄"
"位，展示各種 :ref:`額外項目或選項 <lunch/extras>`，例如配料或飲品。點擊 "
":guilabel:`額外項目` 欄位中任何所需額外項目旁邊的核取方塊，即可將其加入訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:114
msgid ""
"Each extra option is organized by a category, complete with its name and "
"price. As extras are selected, the displayed price at the top of the pop-up "
"window updates to reflect all current selections."
msgstr ""
"每個額外選項均按類別整理，並附有其名稱及價格。選擇額外選項時，彈出視窗頂部顯"
"示的價格會即時更新，以反映目前所選的所有項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:118
msgid ""
"Beneath the :guilabel:`Extras` field is the :guilabel:`Description` of the "
"product, followed by a :guilabel:`Notes` field. The :guilabel:`Notes` field "
"is used to enter vital information that is then sent to the vendor regarding"
" the order, such as any special requests or food allergies."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`額外項目` 欄位下方是產品的 :guilabel:`說明`，其後是 "
":guilabel:`備註` 欄位。:guilabel:`備註` 欄位用於輸入與訂單相關的重要資訊並傳"
"送給供應商，例如任何特別要求或食物過敏情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:122
msgid ""
"When all selections for the product have been made, click the :guilabel:`Add"
" To Cart` button, or click the :guilabel:`Discard` button to cancel the item"
" and close the pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"完成產品的所有選項後，請點擊 :guilabel:`加入購物車` 按鈕，或點擊 "
":guilabel:`放棄` 按鈕以取消該項目並關閉彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:125
msgid ""
"The Configure Your Order pop-up window for a personal pizza, with toppings and a free\n"
"beverage selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:132
msgid ""
"There can be several reasons why an order cannot be placed: a :ref:`lack of "
"funds <lunch/insufficient-funds>`, an :ref:`incomplete order "
"<lunch/incomplete>`, or being outside the vendors :ref:`operating hours "
"<lunch/outside-hours>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:139
msgid "Insufficient funds"
msgstr "資金不足"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:141
msgid ""
"If the price for the item in the *Configure Your Order* pop-up window "
"exceeds the :guilabel:`Available Balance` for the user, the following error "
"appears:"
msgstr ""
"當 *設定您的訂單* 彈出式視窗中的項目價格超過該用戶的 :guilabel:`可用餘額` 時"
"，系統會顯示以下錯誤："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:144
msgid ""
"`Your wallet does not contain enough money to order that. To add some money "
"to your wallet, please contact your lunch manager.`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:147
msgid ""
"Additionally, the :guilabel:`Add To Cart` button is hidden, and only the "
":guilabel:`Discard` button appears. The :ref:`overdraft <lunch/settings>` "
"configured in the settings is taken into account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:150
msgid ""
"If this error appears, the user must :doc:`add funds to their lunch account "
"<user-accounts>` through a **Lunch** app administrator before placing the "
"order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:153
msgid ""
"The error that appears when attempting to order an item with insufficient "
"funds."
msgstr "嘗試在資金不足時訂購項目所顯示的錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:159
msgid "Incomplete orders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:161
msgid ""
"Depending on how the various :ref:`extras <lunch/configure-extras>` are "
"configured for a vendor, it is possible to receive an error when attempting "
"to add products to the cart."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:164
msgid ""
"An error occurs when a configured product **requires** the user to select an"
" option in the :guilabel:`Extras` field, but the user neglects to make one."
msgstr ""
"當已配置的產品 **要求** 用戶在 :guilabel:`額外項目` 欄位中選擇一個選項，而用"
"戶未有選擇時，系統便會出現錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:167
msgid ""
"When this occurs, a *Validation Error* pop-up window appears. The error is "
"briefly explained in the pop-up window. Click :guilabel:`Close` to close the"
" window, and make all necessary changes to the *Configure Your Order* pop-up"
" window."
msgstr ""
"發生此情況時，系統會顯示 *驗證錯誤* 彈出視窗，並在視窗中簡要說明錯誤。按一下 "
":guilabel:`關閉` 以關閉視窗，然後在 *配置您的訂單* 彈出視窗中作出所有必要更改"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:172
msgid ""
"The vendor, Sushi Shop, provides a free beverage with any entree. Their "
"extras are configured so that **exactly one** beverage must be selected "
"*before* adding one of their products to the cart."
msgstr ""
"供應商 Sushi Shop 會為任何主菜免費提供一款飲品。其附加選項已設定為必須在將產"
"品加入購物車 *之前* 選擇 **正好一款** 飲品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:176
msgid ""
"If a selection is **not** made, an error occurs. The message that appears "
"is: `You have to order one and only one Free Beverage with Entree`."
msgstr ""
"如**未有**作出選擇，系統便會發生錯誤，並顯示以下訊息：`必須連同主菜點選一項（"
"且僅限一項）免費飲品`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:179
msgid ""
"The *Validation Error* pop-up window with the specific error for the free beverage\n"
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"顯示免費飲品特定錯誤的 *驗證錯誤*\n"
"彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:186
msgid "Outside vendor hours"
msgstr "非供應商營業時間"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:188
msgid ""
"Each vendor in the **Lunch** app has their :ref:`availability "
"<lunch/availability>` configured, with both the days they are open, and, for"
" vendors receiving orders by email, the :ref:`time at which orders are sent "
"<lunch/orders>`."
msgstr ""
"**午餐**應用程式中的每個供應商均已設定其:ref:`供應時間 <lunch/availability>"
"`，包括營業日期，以及（對於透過電郵接收訂單的供應商）:ref:`發送訂單的時間 "
"<lunch/orders>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:192
msgid ""
"If a user clicks on a product for the current day from a vendor who is "
"either closed today, or whose orders have already been emailed, the "
"following message appears on the *Configure Your Order* pop-up window: `The "
"orders for this vendor have already been sent.` The :guilabel:`Add To Cart` "
"button is hidden."
msgstr ""
"如果使用者按一下當日產品，而該供應商今日休息或已透過電郵發送訂單，*設定您的訂"
"單* 彈出視窗會顯示以下訊息：`此供應商的訂單已發送。` 而 :guilabel:`加入購物"
"車` 按鈕會被隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:197
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Discard` button, and make a selection from another "
"vendor."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`捨棄` 按鈕，並從另一供應商中選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:200
msgid "Order summary"
msgstr "訂單摘要"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:202
msgid ""
"When items are added to an order, the items appear in the :guilabel:`Your "
"Order` summary, located to the side of the *Order Your Lunch* dashboard."
msgstr ""
"將項目加入訂單後，項目會顯示在 *訂購午餐* 儀表板側邊的 :guilabel:`您的訂單` "
"摘要中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:205
msgid ""
"Each product is listed in its own card, with the product name, a status tag,"
" any notes, the delivery location and date, any extras added, the quantity, "
"and the total amount. The section lists all the user's orders for the "
"current day and the following days, regardless of the date selected in the "
"account hub."
msgstr ""
"每個產品均會以獨立卡片形式列出，顯示產品名稱、狀態標籤、備註、送貨地點及日期"
"、任何附加項目、數量以及總金額。此部分會列出用戶當日及隨後數日的所有訂單，而"
"不受帳戶中心所選日期的影響。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:210
msgid ""
"The available tags that can be displayed for each item in the "
":guilabel:`Your Order` section are:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`您的訂單` 部分中，每個項目可顯示的可用標籤包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Order`: The product has been added to the cart, but has not "
"been purchased by the user yet. This tag appears in gray."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ordered`: The product has been purchased by the user and is "
"waiting to be sent to the vendor by a **Lunch** app manager. This tag "
"appears in purple."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已訂購`：用戶已購買該產品，並正等待 **午餐** 應用程式管理員傳送給"
"供應商。此標籤會以紫色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:217
msgid ""
"Product quantities can be adjusted by clicking the :icon:`add` "
":guilabel:`(Increase quantity)` or :icon:`remove` :guilabel:`(Decrease "
"quantity)` icons on the product card. The product price adjusts in real-time"
" to reflect the cost for the currently selected quantity of the product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:221
msgid ""
"Beneath the :guilabel:`Your Order` section is a summary of the purchasing "
"information, including the following:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`您的訂單` 部分下方是購買資訊摘要，包括以下各項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:224
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total`: This field displays the total amount of all the listed "
"orders, including both paid and pending ones."
msgstr ":guilabel:`總計`：此欄位顯示所有列出訂單的總金額，包括已付款及待處理的訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:226
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Already Paid`: This field indicates how much of the "
":guilabel:`Total` amount has already been paid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:228
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Pay`: This field displays the amount that must be paid in "
"order to place the currently configured order (items with a tag of "
":guilabel:`To Order`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:231
msgid ""
"The account hub with the Your Order section, listing a product to order and an ordered\n"
"product, and the order totals."
msgstr ""
"帳戶中心及「您的訂單」部分，列出可供訂購的產品、已訂購的\n"
"產品及訂單總計。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:236
msgid ""
"Users can place multiple orders throughout the day, and are not restricted "
"to a single lunch order per day. Multiple orders might need to be placed, "
"due to users forgetting to add items to an order, or because there are "
"multiple meals available for purchase for the office (not just lunch), and "
"so on."
msgstr ""
"使用者可於同一天內提交多張訂單，而不限於每日只可訂購一次午餐。需要提交多張訂"
"單的情況，可能包括使用者忘記將項目加入訂單、辦公室提供多款餐點可供訂購（不僅"
"限於午餐）等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:241
msgid ""
"Depending on the various vendors, and how the vendors and products are "
"configured, it is possible to order breakfast, lunch, dinner, coffee, and "
"snacks."
msgstr ""
"視乎不同供應商，以及供應商與產品的設定方式，用戶可訂購早餐、午餐、晚餐、咖啡"
"及小食。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:245
msgid "Cancel an order"
msgstr "取消訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:247
msgid ""
"Orders can be cancelled at any time, as long as the orders have **not** been"
" sent to the vendor. All orders that appear in the :guilabel:`Your Order` "
"section can be cancelled, and the amount already paid is credited back to "
"the user's account."
msgstr ""
"只要訂單 **尚未** 傳送給供應商，即可隨時取消訂單。顯示在 :guilabel:`您的訂"
"單` 區域中的所有訂單均可取消，而已支付的金額將會退回至使用者的賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:251
msgid ""
"Orders can be cancelled in two ways, :ref:`individually <lunch/cancel-one>`,"
" or :ref:`in bulk <lunch/cancel-all>`."
msgstr ""
"訂單可透過兩種方式取消：:ref:`逐一取消 <lunch/cancel-one>` 或 :ref:`批量取消 "
"<lunch/cancel-all>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:255
msgid ""
"All orders that have been sent appear in the :guilabel:`Passed orders` "
"section, and are ineligible for cancellation."
msgstr "所有已傳送的訂單都會顯示在 :guilabel:`已傳送訂單` 部分，且不可取消。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:261
msgid "Cancel an individual item"
msgstr "取消個別項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:263
msgid ""
"On the *Order Your Lunch* dashboard, click the :icon:`remove` "
":guilabel:`(Decrease quantity)` icon on the desired product in the "
":guilabel:`Your Order` section, until the quantity is zero. The order is "
"cancelled, and the product disappears from the :guilabel:`Your Order` "
"section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:270
msgid "Cancel all items"
msgstr "取消所有項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:272
msgid ""
"All items in the :guilabel:`Your Order` section of the *Order Your Lunch* "
"dashboard can be cancelled at one time. Click the :guilabel:`Clear Order` "
"button at the bottom of the dashboard, and all products are canceled and "
"removed from the order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:277
msgid "Submit an order"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:279
msgid ""
"To place the order, click the :guilabel:`Order Now` button at the bottom of "
"the order summary section on the far side of the *Order Your Lunch* "
"dashboard. The user is charged the amount displayed in the :guilabel:`To "
"Pay` field, and the cost is deducted from their **Lunch** account balance. "
"The :guilabel:`Order Now` button only appears when the order contains "
"products with a :guilabel:`To Order` tag."
msgstr ""
"如要下單，請點擊*訂購午餐*儀表板最遠一側的訂單摘要部分底部的 :guilabel:`立即"
"訂購` 按鈕。系統會向用戶收取 :guilabel:`應付金額` 欄位顯示的金額，並從其**午"
"餐**帳戶餘額中扣除費用。:guilabel:`立即訂購` 按鈕只會在訂單包含帶有 "
":guilabel:`待訂購` 標籤的產品時出現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:285
msgid ""
"Once the order is placed, the tags for the purchased items in the "
":guilabel:`Your Order` section change from gray :guilabel:`To Order` tags to"
" purple :guilabel:`Ordered` tags."
msgstr ""
"下單後，:guilabel:`您的訂單` 部分中已購買項目的標籤會從灰色的 :guilabel:`待訂"
"購` 標籤變為紫色的 :guilabel:`已訂購` 標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:289
msgid "Track an order"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:291
msgid ""
"When orders have been sent to the vendors, the products move to the "
":guilabel:`Passed orders` section, located above the :icon:`payments` "
":guilabel:`Available Balance` on the far side of the *Order Your Lunch* "
"dashboard. The number next to :guilabel:`Passed orders` indicates how many "
"products it contains. All :guilabel:`Passed orders` are collapsed, by "
"default. Click :guilabel:`Passed orders` to expand the section, and all past"
" orders appear in their own card."
msgstr ""
"訂單傳送給供應商後，產品會移至:guilabel:`已下訂單`部分，該部分位於 *訂購午"
"餐* 儀表板另一側的:icon:`payments` :guilabel:`可用餘額`上方。:guilabel:`已下"
"訂單`旁邊的數字顯示其包含的產品數量。預設情況下，所有:guilabel:`已下訂單`均為"
"摺疊狀態。點擊:guilabel:`已下訂單`即可展開該部分，所有過往訂單均會顯示於各自"
"的卡片中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:297
msgid ""
"Each card displays the quantity, product name, cost, delivery location, and "
"date for the product."
msgstr "每張卡片都會顯示產品的數量、產品名稱、成本、送貨地點及日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:299
msgid "Additionally, each card has one of the following status tags:"
msgstr "此外，每張卡片均帶有以下其中一個狀態標籤："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:301
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sent`: This tag appears in blue and indicates the order was sent "
"to the vendor, but has not been received yet."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已發送`：此標籤會以藍色顯示，表示訂單已發送給供應商，但尚未收到。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:303
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Received`: This tag appears in green, and indicates that the "
"order has arrived at the location, and has been verified by the **Lunch** "
"app administrator."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已收到`：此標籤會顯示為綠色，表示訂單已送達地點，並已由 **午餐** "
"應用程式管理員確認。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:307
msgid "Receive an order"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:309
msgid ""
"When orders are received at the delivery location, the **Lunch** app manager"
" :ref:`confirms them <lunch/confirm-orders>`, then :ref:`notifies "
"<lunch/notify>` the employee who ordered the food."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:313
msgid "My Orders"
msgstr "我的訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:315
msgid ""
"To view a full list of all orders placed in the **Lunch** app for the "
"currently signed-in user, navigate to :menuselection:`Lunch app --> My Lunch"
" --> My Order History`. This navigates to the :guilabel:`My Orders` "
"dashboard. The data is filtered by :guilabel:`My Orders` and grouped by "
":guilabel:`Order Date: Day`, by default."
msgstr ""
"如要查看目前登入用戶在 **午餐** 應用程式中提交的所有訂單完整清單，請前往 "
":menuselection:`午餐應用程式 --> 我的午餐 --> 我的訂單紀錄`。系統會前往 "
":guilabel:`我的訂單` 儀表板。預設情況下，資料會按 :guilabel:`我的訂單` 篩選，"
"並按 :guilabel:`訂單日期：日` 分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:320
msgid ""
"All products appear in a list view, organized by date. The list displays the"
" :guilabel:`Order Date`, :guilabel:`Vendor`, :guilabel:`Product`, "
":guilabel:`Extras`, :guilabel:`Notes`, :guilabel:`User`, :guilabel:`Lunch "
"Location`, :guilabel:`Price`, and :guilabel:`Status` information. If in a "
"multi-company database, a :guilabel:`Company` column also appears."
msgstr ""
"所有產品均以清單檢視顯示，並按日期排列。清單會顯示 :guilabel:`訂單日"
"期`、:guilabel:`供應商`、:guilabel:`產品`、:guilabel:`額外項"
"目`、:guilabel:`備註`、:guilabel:`使用者`、:guilabel:`午餐地"
"點`、:guilabel:`價格` 及 :guilabel:`狀態` 資料。如果使用多公司資料庫，亦會顯"
"示 :guilabel:`公司` 欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:325
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Status` of each product is one of the following: "
":guilabel:`To Order` (orange), :guilabel:`Ordered` (red), :guilabel:`Sent` "
"(blue), :guilabel:`Received` (green), or :guilabel:`Cancelled` (gray)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:329
msgid ""
"The total cost for each day's orders is displayed on the top line containing"
" the order date. At the bottom of the list, beneath all the lines, the "
"overall total amount paid for all the orders appears, under the "
":guilabel:`Price` column."
msgstr ""
"每日訂單的總費用會顯示在包含訂單日期的頂部行上。在清單底部所有明細行的下方"
"，:guilabel:`價格` 欄會顯示所有訂單的總付款金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:333
msgid ""
"At the end of each product line with a status of :guilabel:`Received`, a "
":icon:`history` :guilabel:`Re-order` button appears, provided the vendor is "
"available on the current day and the user's balance is sufficient. Click "
":icon:`history` :guilabel:`Re-order` to instantly reorder that same product,"
" with the same extras, if applicable. The new order appears in the list, "
"under the current date, and the product is paid for, with money deducted "
"from the user's account."
msgstr ""
"只要供應商當日有營業且用戶餘額充足，在每項狀態為 :guilabel:`已收到` 的產品明"
"細行末端，都會顯示 :icon:`history` :guilabel:`重新訂購` 按鈕。按一下 "
":icon:`history` :guilabel:`重新訂購`，即可即時重新訂購同一產品及相同額外配料"
"（如適用）。新訂單會顯示在清單的當日日期下方，系統亦會完成付款，並從用戶帳戶"
"扣除款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:340
msgid ""
"For users with *Administrator* rights on the **Lunch** app, the list also "
"displays the buttons used to :doc:`manage orders <management>`: "
":icon:`close` :guilabel:`Cancel`, :icon:`check` :guilabel:`Confirm`, "
":icon:`undo` :guilabel:`Reset` (to restore a cancelled order to the "
":guilabel:`Ordered` status), and :icon:`mail_f` :guilabel:`Send "
"Notification`. When an order is cancelled, the money paid for that product "
"is refunded to the user's account."
msgstr ""
"對於擁有 **午餐** 應用程式 *管理員* 權限的使用者，清單亦會顯示用於 :doc:`管理"
"訂單 <management>` 的按鈕：:icon:`close` :guilabel:`取消`、:icon:`check` "
":guilabel:`確認`、:icon:`undo` :guilabel:`重設`（將已取消的訂單還原至 "
":guilabel:`已訂購` 狀態），以及 :icon:`mail_f` :guilabel:`發送通知`。當訂單被"
"取消時，該產品已支付的金額將會退回至使用者的帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:346
msgid ""
"The My Orders list, grouped by order date, with the status of each ordered "
"product."
msgstr "按訂單日期分組的「我的訂單」清單，當中顯示每項已訂購產品的狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:350
msgid "My Account"
msgstr "我的帳戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:352
msgid ""
"To view a summary of all transactions in the user's account, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Lunch app --> My Lunch --> My Account History`. Doing so "
"reveals the *My Account* dashboard."
msgstr ""
"若要檢視用戶帳戶中所有交易的摘要，請前往 :menuselection:`午餐應用程式 --> 我"
"的午餐 --> 我的帳戶記錄`。此操作會顯示 *我的帳戶* 儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:355
msgid ""
"The default presentation of the *My Account* dashboard displays all entries,"
" from newest to oldest. The :guilabel:`Date`, :guilabel:`Description`, and "
":guilabel:`Amount` are the only fields displayed in the list."
msgstr ""
"*我的賬戶* 儀表板預設會按從新到舊的順序顯示所有項目。清單中只會顯示 "
":guilabel:`日期`、:guilabel:`說明` 及 :guilabel:`金額` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:359
msgid ""
"Entries with a negative figure listed in the :guilabel:`Amount` column "
"represent products purchased in the **Lunch** app. These appear in a "
"`$-XX.XX` format."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`金額`欄中顯示負數的項目，代表於 **午餐** 應用程式中購買的產品，"
"並以 `$-XX.XX` 格式顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:362
msgid ""
"Entries with a positive figure represent funds added to the user's lunch "
"account. These appear in a `$XX.XX` format. Canceled orders do not appear in"
" this list, as their amount is no longer deducted from the balance."
msgstr ""
"數值為正數的項目代表已存入用戶午餐帳戶的款項。這些項目會以 `$XX.XX` 格式顯示"
"。已取消的訂單不會顯示在此清單中，因為相關金額已不再從餘額中扣除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/orders.rst:366
msgid ""
"The My Account list, with lunch orders and funds added to the user's lunch "
"account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:3
msgid "Products"
msgstr "產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Lunch** app does *not* come with any products preconfigured. The "
"individual products being offered must first be configured before orders can"
" be placed."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的**午餐**應用程式並*沒有*預先設定任何產品。必須先設定所提供的個別產品，"
"然後才能下訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:9
msgid ""
"It is recommended to first :doc:`configure the vendors <vendors>`, as all "
"products **must** be linked to a vendor."
msgstr "建議先 :doc:`設定供應商 <vendors>`，因為所有產品都 **必須** 連結至供應商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:12
msgid ""
"To add and configure products for the **Lunch** app, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Lunch app --> Configuration --> Products`. Next, click the "
":guilabel:`New` button in the corner, and a blank product form loads."
msgstr ""
"要為**午餐**應用程式新增及設定產品，請前往:menuselection:`午餐應用程式 --> 設"
"定 --> 產品`。接著，點擊角落的:guilabel:`新增`按鈕，系統便會載入空白的產品表"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:18
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Name`: Enter the name for the product. This field is "
"**required**."
msgstr ":guilabel:`產品名稱`：輸入產品名稱。此欄位為 **必填**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:19
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Category`: Using the drop-down menu, select the "
":ref:`category <lunch/product-categories>` this product falls under. This "
"field is **required**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`產品類別`：使用下拉式選單，選擇此產品所屬的:ref:`類別 <lunch/"
"product-categories>`。此欄位為 **必填**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:21
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor`: Using the drop-down menu, select the :doc:`vendor "
"<vendors>` that supplies this product. This field is **required**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`供應商`：使用下拉選單選擇提供此產品的 :doc:`供應商 <vendors>`。此"
"欄位為 **必填**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Price`: Enter the price for the product. The currency is "
"determined by the company's localization. This field is **required**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`價格`：輸入產品價格。貨幣由公司的本地化設定決定。此欄位為 **必"
"填**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`New Until`: Using the calendar popover, select the date until "
"which the product is labeled as new. Until this date, a green "
":guilabel:`New` tag appears on the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`新品有效期至`：使用彈出式日曆選擇產品標示為新品的截止日期。在此日"
"期前，產品上會顯示綠色的 :guilabel:`新品` 標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company the product is available to using "
"the drop-down menu. This field **only** appears in a multi-company database."
" If this field is left blank, the product is available to **all** companies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：使用下拉式選單，選擇可使用此產品的公司。此欄位 **僅會** 在"
"多公司資料庫中顯示。若此欄位留空，此產品將適用於 **所有** 公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: Enter a description of the product in this field. "
"This description appears on the product card when users are viewing the "
"available options."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`描述`：在此欄位輸入產品描述。當用戶檢視可用選項時，此描述會顯示在"
"產品卡上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Image**: Hover over the image box in the corner of the form, and click the"
" :icon:`edit_f` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon that appears. A file explorer pop-up"
" window appears. Navigate to the image, then click :guilabel:`Select`. If no"
" image is set, the image of the product category is displayed."
msgstr ""
"**圖片**：將滑鼠游標移至表單角落的圖片框上，然後點擊顯示的:icon:`edit_f` "
":guilabel:`（編輯）`圖示。系統會彈出檔案瀏覽器視窗。瀏覽並選取圖片，然後點"
"擊:guilabel:`選擇`。如未設定任何圖片，系統會顯示該產品類別的圖片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:37
msgid "A product form filled out for a personal pepperoni pizza."
msgstr "已填妥的個人辣肉腸薄餅產品表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:43
msgid "Product categories"
msgstr "產品類別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:45
msgid ""
"Product categories organize the offerings in the **Lunch** app, and allows "
"users to filter offerings when reviewing the menu for the day."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:48
msgid ""
"To add or modify categories, navigate to :menuselection:`Lunch app --> "
"Configuration --> Product Categories`. The available categories appear in a "
"list view. Four default categories come preconfigured: :guilabel:`Sandwich`,"
" :guilabel:`Pizza`, :guilabel:`Burger`, and :guilabel:`Drinks`."
msgstr ""
"要新增或修改類別，請前往 :menuselection:`午餐應用程式 --> 配置 --> 產品類"
"別`。可用的類別會以列表檢視顯示。系統已預先配置四個預設類別：:guilabel:`三文"
"治`、:guilabel:`薄餅`、:guilabel:`漢堡包` 及 :guilabel:`飲品`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:52
msgid ""
"To add a new category, click the :guilabel:`New` button in the corner, and a"
" blank category form loads."
msgstr ""
"如要新增類別，請點擊角落的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統便會載入空白的類別表單"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:55
msgid ""
"Enter a name in the :guilabel:`Product Category` field. If the category is "
"company-specific and should only appear for a certain company, select the "
":guilabel:`Company` from the drop-down menu. This field **only** appears in "
"a multi-company database. If this field is left blank, the category is "
"visible to all companies."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`產品類別` 欄位中輸入名稱。若該類別為特定公司專用且只應在該公司"
"顯示，請從下拉式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`公司`。此欄位 **僅** 會出現在多公司資料"
"庫中。若留空此欄位，所有公司均可檢視該類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:60
msgid ""
"If desired, add a photo for the category. Hover over the image box in the "
"corner and click the :icon:`edit_f` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon that appears. "
"This opens a file explorer pop-up window. Navigate to the image, then click "
":guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可為該類別新增相片。將滑鼠游標停留在角落的圖片方塊上，然後按一下顯"
"示的 :icon:`edit_f` :guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示。此操作會開啟檔案總管彈出式視窗"
"。瀏覽至該圖片，然後按一下 :guilabel:`選取`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/products.rst:64
msgid "The category form, with the fields filled out for a Soup category."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:3
msgid "Manage user accounts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo's **Lunch** application, users pay for products directly from their "
"**Lunch** app account. For funds to appear in their account, a **Lunch** app"
" manager must transfer funds into each user's account."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 的 **午餐** 應用程式中，使用者可直接從其 **午餐** 應用程式帳戶支付產"
"品費用。要使帳戶內有可用資金，**午餐** 應用程式管理員必須將資金轉帳至每位使用"
"者的帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:10
msgid ""
"To add funds and manage user accounts, the user must have *Administrator* "
":doc:`access rights <../../general/users/access_rights/>` for the **Lunch** "
"application. Access rights can be managed by navigating to the "
":menuselection:`Settings app` and clicking :icon:`east` :guilabel:`Manage "
"Users`. Click on a user to view their individual access rights."
msgstr ""
"要充值及管理用戶帳戶，用戶必須擁有 **午餐** 應用程式的 *管理員* :doc:`存取權"
"限 <../../general/users/access_rights/>`。若要管理存取權限，請前往 "
":menuselection:`設定應用程式`，再按一下 :icon:`east` :guilabel:`管理用戶`。按"
"一下個別用戶即可查看其存取權限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:15
msgid ""
"The **Lunch** application does **not** directly interface in any way with "
"software or products linked to any monetary accounts or billing. Money "
"**cannot** be transferred from users' bank accounts, nor can users' credit "
"cards be charged."
msgstr ""
"**午餐** 應用程式 **不會** 以任何方式直接連接至任何與金錢賬戶或賬單相關的軟件"
"或產品。系統 **無法** 從使用者的銀行賬戶轉賬，亦無法向使用者的信用卡扣款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:19
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Lunch** application **only** allows for manual entries of cash "
"exchanges that are handled by the **Lunch** app manager. It is up to each "
"individual company to create the method with which lunch accounts are "
"replenished."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **午餐** 應用程式 **只** 允許由 **午餐** 應用程式管理員手動輸入現金交"
"易紀錄。各公司須自行制定為午餐帳戶增值的方法。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:24
msgid ""
"Some examples of how lunch money can be organized and transferred within a "
"company:"
msgstr "以下為公司內部安排及轉撥午餐費的一些例子："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:26
msgid ""
"Cash is handed to the **Lunch** app manager, who then updates the user's "
"account."
msgstr "現金會交予 **午餐** 應用程式管理員，然後由管理員更新使用者的帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:27
msgid ""
"Money is deducted from the user's payslips, then the **Lunch** app manager "
"updates the account when payslips are issued. This requires creating a "
":doc:`payslip adjustment <../payroll/salary_attachments>` for the employee "
"in the **Payroll** app. The **Lunch** app does **not** create this deduction"
" automatically."
msgstr ""
"款項會從使用者的薪資單中扣除，然後由 **午餐** 應用程式管理員在發放薪資單時更"
"新帳戶。這需要在 **薪資** 應用程式中為該員工建立:doc:`薪資單調整 <../payroll/"
"salary_attachments>`。**午餐** 應用程式**不會**自動建立此扣減項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:31
msgid ""
"Companies can sell \"lunch tickets\" at a set price (for example, one ticket"
" costs $5.00). Users can purchase tickets from a **Lunch** app manager, who "
"then updates the user's account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:37
msgid "Cash Moves"
msgstr "現金流動"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:39
msgid ""
"To add funds to user accounts, each cash move must be individually logged. "
"To view all cash move records, or create a new cash move, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Lunch app --> Manager --> Cash Moves`. Doing so reveals the "
"*Cash Moves* dashboard."
msgstr ""
"若要為用戶帳戶增值，必須逐筆記錄每項現金變動。要查看所有現金變動記錄或建立新"
"的現金變動，請前往 :menuselection:`午餐應用程式 --> 管理員 --> 現金變動`。此"
"操作會顯示 *現金變動* 儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:43
msgid ""
"On the *Cash Moves* dashboard, all cash moves are presented in a default "
"list view, displaying each record's :guilabel:`Date`, :guilabel:`User`, "
":guilabel:`Description`, and :guilabel:`Amount`. The total of all the cash "
"moves is displayed at the bottom of the :guilabel:`Amount` column."
msgstr ""
"在 *現金流動* 儀表板上，所有現金流動均會以預設清單檢視顯示，並展示每項記錄的 "
":guilabel:`日期`、:guilabel:`用戶`、:guilabel:`描述`及 :guilabel:`金額`。所有"
"現金流動的總額會顯示在 :guilabel:`金額` 欄位的底部。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:48
msgid ""
"The Cash Moves list, with the funds added to the users' lunch accounts."
msgstr "現金異動列表，當中顯示已加至用戶午餐帳戶的款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:52
msgid "Add funds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:54
msgid ""
"To add funds to a lunch account, click the :guilabel:`New` button, located "
"in the upper corner of the :guilabel:`Cash Moves` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"如要為午餐帳戶增值，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕（位於 :guilabel:`現金變動` "
"儀表板上方角落）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:57
msgid ""
"A blank *Lunch Cashmove* form loads. Enter the following information on the "
"form:"
msgstr "系統會載入空白的 *午餐現金異動* 表單。請在表單中輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`User`: Select the user depositing cash into their account from "
"the drop-down menu. The signed-in user populates this field by default. This"
" field is **required**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`使用者`：從下拉式選單中選取將現金存入其帳戶的使用者。此欄位預設會"
"自動填入已登入的使用者。此欄位為 **必填**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: Select the date the transaction occurred using the "
"calendar popover. The current date populates this field by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount`: Enter the amount being added to the lunch account. A "
"negative amount can be entered to withdraw money from the account."
msgstr ":guilabel:`金額`：輸入要存入午餐帳戶的金額。可輸入負數金額以從帳戶提取款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:65
msgid ":guilabel:`Description`: Enter a brief description of the transaction."
msgstr ":guilabel:`描述`：輸入交易的簡短描述。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:67
msgid ""
"The cash move form filled out for a payment of $50.00 for ten lunch tickets."
msgstr "為購買十張午餐券而支付 $50.00 時所填寫的現金轉移表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:71
msgid "Control Accounts"
msgstr "統制帳戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:73
msgid ""
"The main *Control Accounts* dashboard provides an overview of every "
"transaction in the **Lunch** app, including all cash deposits and purchases."
" To access this dashboard, navigate to :menuselection:`Lunch app --> Manager"
" --> Control Accounts.`"
msgstr ""
"主 *控制帳戶* 儀表板會概覽 **午餐** 應用程式中的所有交易，包括所有現金存款及"
"購買記錄。要前往此儀表板，請前往 :menuselection:`午餐應用程式 --> 經理 --> 控"
"制帳戶。`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:77
msgid ""
"Transactions are grouped :guilabel:`By Employee`, and listed alphabetically "
"by the user's first name. Their available balance is displayed in the "
":guilabel:`Amount` column. This takes into account all deposits and the "
"orders with an :guilabel:`Ordered`, :guilabel:`Sent`, or "
":guilabel:`Received` status."
msgstr ""
"交易會 :guilabel:`按員工` 分組，並按用戶名字的字母順序列出。其可用餘額會顯示"
"在 :guilabel:`金額` 欄中。計算會計入所有儲值金額，以及狀態為 :guilabel:`已訂"
"購`、:guilabel:`已傳送` 或 :guilabel:`已收到` 的訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:82
msgid ""
"Individual transactions are hidden in the default view. To view all "
"transactions for a specific user, click the :icon:`arrow_right` "
":guilabel:`(right arrow)` icon next to their name to expand the full list of"
" transactions associated with their lunch account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:86
msgid ""
"Each line includes the transaction :guilabel:`Date`, :guilabel:`User`, "
":guilabel:`Description`, and :guilabel:`Amount`."
msgstr ""
"每行均包含交易的 :guilabel:`日期`、:guilabel:`用戶`、:guilabel:`描述` 及 "
":guilabel:`金額`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:89
msgid ""
"The Control Accounts list grouped by user, with the transactions of one user"
" expanded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:93
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Control Accounts` dashboard is a view-only list of "
"transactions within the **Lunch** app, and does **not** allow modifications "
"to be made to any records listed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:96
msgid ""
"Cash moves can be modified through the :ref:`Cash Moves <lunch/cash-moves>` "
"dashboard, only."
msgstr "現金變動僅可透過 :ref:`現金變動 <lunch/cash-moves>` 儀表板進行修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/user-accounts.rst:98
msgid "Product-related records **cannot** be modified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:3
msgid "Vendors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:5
msgid ""
"Before :doc:`products can be added <products>` to the **Lunch** app, the "
"restaurants, referred to in Odoo as *vendors*, that provide the food need to"
" be configured."
msgstr ""
"在向 **午餐** 應用程式 :doc:`新增產品 <products>` 前，須先設定提供食物的餐廳"
"（在 Odoo 中稱為 *供應商*）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:8
msgid ""
"To add a new vendor, first navigate to :menuselection:`Lunch app --> "
"Configuration --> Vendors`. Here, all currently configured vendors for the "
"**Lunch** app appear in a default Kanban view."
msgstr ""
"要新增供應商，請先前往:menuselection:`午餐應用程式 --> 配置 --> 供應商`。在此"
"處，**午餐** 應用程式目前已設定的所有供應商會以預設的看板檢視顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:12
msgid ""
"A placeholder vendor named :guilabel:`Lunch Supplier` is created when the "
"**Lunch** app is installed, but is not completely configured and has no "
"information other than the placeholder name. The actual vendors **must** be "
"added to the database before the **Lunch** app can be used."
msgstr ""
"安裝 **午餐** 應用程式時，系統會建立一個名為 :guilabel:`午餐供應商` 的佔位供"
"應商，但該記錄尚未完成設定，除了佔位名稱外並無其他資料。使用 **午餐** 應用程"
"式前，**必須** 先在資料庫中加入實際供應商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:16
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Lunch Supplier` card to configure it, and fill in the "
"following sections of the vendor form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:19
msgid ":ref:`Vendor information <lunch/vendor-info>`"
msgstr ":ref:`供應商資料 <lunch/vendor-info>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:20
msgid ":ref:`Availability <lunch/availability>`"
msgstr ":ref:`供應情況 <lunch/availability>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:21
msgid ":ref:`Orders <lunch/orders>`"
msgstr ":ref:`訂單 <lunch/orders>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:22
msgid ":ref:`Extras <lunch/extras>`"
msgstr ":ref:`額外項目 <lunch/extras>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:24
msgid ""
"After the first vendor is configured, add more vendors by clicking the "
":guilabel:`New` button in the corner, and configure the new lunch supplier "
"form. Repeat for all needed vendors."
msgstr ""
"設定好第一位供應商後，點擊角落的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，並設定新的午餐供應商"
"表單，即可新增更多供應商。請為所有需要的供應商重複此步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:30
msgid "Vendor information"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:32
msgid ""
"The vendor information section houses the vendor's various contact "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor`: Enter a name for the vendor in this field (for example, "
"`The Pizza Palace`)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`供應商`：在此欄位輸入供應商名稱（例如 `The Pizza Palace`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor` (beneath the line for vendor name): Using the drop-down "
"menu, select the corresponding vendor in the **Contacts** app. If the vendor"
" has not already been created, type in the vendor name, and click "
":guilabel:`Create \"new vendor name\"` to add them. Alternatively, click "
":guilabel:`Create and edit...` to create the vendor and edit the vendor "
"contact form. The vendor contact form allows for more details to be entered,"
" such as contact information."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`供應商`（位於供應商名稱橫線下方）：使用下拉式選單，在 **聯絡人** "
"應用程式中選擇對應的供應商。若尚未建立該供應商，請輸入供應商名稱，並點擊 "
":guilabel:`建立「新供應商名稱」` 以作新增。或者，點擊 :guilabel:`建立並編"
"輯...` 建立供應商並編輯供應商聯絡人表單。該表單可讓你輸入更多詳細資料，例如聯"
"絡資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:42
msgid ""
"If a selection is made to the drop-down :guilabel:`Vendor` field, the "
":guilabel:`Vendor` text field (above, for the vendor's name) updates with "
"the name of the vendor chosen from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"如果在下拉式:guilabel:`供應商`欄位中作出選擇，上方的:guilabel:`供應商`文字欄"
"位（用於填寫供應商名稱）便會自動更新為從下拉式選單中選取的供應商名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:46
msgid ""
"The list of vendors that is presented in the drop-down menu is pulled from "
"the **Contacts** application."
msgstr "下拉式選單中顯示的供應商清單是從 **聯絡人** 應用程式擷取的。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:49
msgid ":guilabel:`Address`: Enter the vendor's address in the various fields."
msgstr ":guilabel:`地址`：在各個欄位中輸入供應商的地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email`: Enter the vendor's email in this field. This field is "
"**required** if orders are sent by :guilabel:`Email` (see the :ref:`Orders "
"<lunch/orders>` section)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`電郵`：在此欄位輸入供應商的電郵地址。若訂單透過:guilabel:`電郵`傳"
"送（請參閱:ref:`訂單 <lunch/orders>`部分），此欄位為**必填**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Phone`: Enter the vendor's phone number in this field. This field"
" is **required** if orders are placed by :guilabel:`Phone`. The phone number"
" is displayed next to the vendor's name throughout the **Lunch** app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`電話`：在此欄位輸入供應商的電話號碼。如果透過 :guilabel:`電話` 落"
"單，此欄位為 **必填** 項目。電話號碼會顯示在整個 **午餐** 應用程式中供應商名"
"稱的旁邊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: If this vendor is only available to a specific company,"
" select the company from the drop-down menu. If this field is left blank, "
"the vendor's items are available to **all** companies. This field **only** "
"appears in a multi-company database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：如這名供應商只適用於特定公司，請從下拉式選單選擇該公司。如"
"留空此欄位，該供應商的項目將適用於 **所有** 公司。此欄位 **只** 會在多公司資"
"料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:60
msgid ""
"The vendor's name and contact details are stored on the vendor's record in "
"the **Contacts** app. Modifying information on the vendor form also updates "
"the contact in the **Contacts** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:63
msgid ""
"The top portion of a vendor form, with the vendor's address, email, and "
"phone number."
msgstr "供應商表格的頂部，包含供應商的地址、電郵及電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:69
msgid "Availability"
msgstr "可用性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:71
msgid ""
"The *Availability* section presents a table with two rows. The days of the "
"week populate the top row, and the bottom row has checkboxes. Click the "
"corresponding checkbox for each day of the week the vendor is available."
msgstr ""
"*可用時間*部分會顯示一個包含兩列的表格。頂列列出星期一至日，底列則設有核取方"
"塊。請為供應商可用的每一天點選相應的核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:75
msgid "By default, Monday through Friday are ticked."
msgstr "預設情況下，星期一至星期五會被剔選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:77
msgid ""
"Products from a vendor can only be ordered for the days the vendor is "
"available."
msgstr "只可在供應商可供貨的日子訂購該供應商的產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:84
msgid ""
"The *Orders* section of the vendor form details which locations the vendor "
"is available for, in addition to how and when orders are placed and "
"received."
msgstr ""
"供應商表單的 *訂單* 部分會詳細列出該供應商適用的地點，以及下單及收貨的方式及"
"時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery`: Using the drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`Delivery` "
"if the vendor delivers to the office, or select :guilabel:`No Delivery` (the"
" default option) if orders must be picked up."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`送貨`：使用下拉式選單，如果供應商會送貨至辦公室，請選擇 "
":guilabel:`送貨`；如果必須自行領取訂單，請選擇 :guilabel:`不送貨`（預設選項）"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Location`: Select which :ref:`locations <lunch/locations>` can "
"place orders from this vendor. Multiple locations can be selected. If this "
"field is left blank, **all** locations can order from the vendor. On the "
":doc:`Order Your Lunch <orders>` dashboard, users only see the products of "
"the vendors available for their selected location."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`地點`：選擇哪些 :ref:`地點 <lunch/locations>` 可向此供應商訂餐。可"
"同時選擇多個地點。如留空此欄位，則 **所有** 地點均可向該供應商訂餐。在 "
":doc:`訂購午餐 <orders>` 儀表板上，用戶只會看到其所選地點適用的供應商產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send Order By`: Click the radio button to select how orders are "
"sent to the vendor. The available options are :guilabel:`Phone` or "
":guilabel:`Email`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`訂單發送方式`：按一下選項按鈕，選擇向供應商發送訂單的方式。可用選"
"項包括 :guilabel:`電話` 或 :guilabel:`電郵`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Order Time`: This field **only** appears if :guilabel:`Email` is "
"selected in the :guilabel:`Send Order By` field. Enter the time, in the "
"24-hour `HH:MM` format (for example, `11:30`), at which the day's orders are"
" emailed to the vendor. After this time, users can no longer order from this"
" vendor for the current day."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`訂購時間`：此欄位**僅**於選取 :guilabel:`電郵` 作為 :guilabel:`發"
"送訂單方式` 欄位選項時顯示。請以 24 小時制 `HH:MM` 格式（例如：`11:30`）輸入"
"系統每日向供應商發送訂單電郵的時間。超過此時間後，用戶當日將無法再向該供應商"
"下單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:102
msgid ""
"When orders are placed by :guilabel:`Phone`, the **Lunch** manager calls the"
" vendor, then :ref:`marks the orders as sent <lunch/send-orders>` in the "
"**Lunch** app."
msgstr ""
"當透過 :guilabel:`電話` 落單時，**午餐** 管理員會致電供應商，然後在 **午餐** "
"應用程式中 :ref:`將訂單標記為已傳送 <lunch/send-orders>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:105
msgid ""
"The Availability and Orders sections of a vendor form, with orders sent by "
"email at 11:30."
msgstr "供應商表單中的「可用性」和「訂單」部分，訂單於 11:30 以電郵發送。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:111
msgid "Extras"
msgstr "附加項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:113
msgid ""
"When ordering an item in the **Lunch** app, optional extra items, sometimes "
"referred to as *add-ons*, can be shown. These can be configured in any "
"manner that suits the products being offered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:117
msgid ""
"Odoo allows for three types of extra items, which can be thought of as "
"*categories*. By default, the first type (or *category*) of add-ons is "
"labeled `Extras`, the second is labeled `Beverages`, and the third is "
"labeled `Extra Label 3`. Any extra category without any configured items is "
"**not** displayed when ordering."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 支援三種額外項目類型，可視為不同的 *類別*。預設情況下，第一種附加項目類"
"型（或 *類別*）標記為 `額外項目`，第二種標記為 `飲品`，第三種則標記為 `額外標"
"籤 3`。任何未設定項目的額外類別，在下單時 **不會** 顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:123
msgid ""
"When configuring the extras, it is important to keep in mind that all the "
"extras configured appear for **every item** offered by the vendor. Only "
"items that apply to **all** products from the vendor should be added."
msgstr ""
"設定額外項目時，請務必留意，所有已設定的額外項目都會顯示於該供應商提供的**每"
"個項目**中。因此，只應加入適用於該供應商**所有**產品的項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:130
msgid "Configure extras"
msgstr "配置額外項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:132
msgid ""
"Enter the following information for each of the three available extra "
"sections:"
msgstr "為三個可用的額外部分分別輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:134
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra (#) Label`: Enter a name for the type of extra, such as "
"`Toppings`. This can be thought of as a *category*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`額外項目 (#) 標籤`：輸入額外項目類型的名稱，例如 `配料`。這可視為"
"一個*類別*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra (#) Quantity`: Select how the extras are selected. The "
"options are:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`額外項目 (#) 數量`：選擇額外項目的選擇方式。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:138
msgid ""
":guilabel:`None or More`: Select this option if the user is not required to "
"make a selection."
msgstr ":guilabel:`零個或多個`：如不要求用戶作出選擇，請選取此選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`One or More`: Select this option to **require** the user to make "
"**at least one** selection."
msgstr ":guilabel:`一個或以上`：選擇此選項以**要求**用戶**最少選擇一項**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:141
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Only One`: Select this option to **require** the user to make "
"**only one** selection."
msgstr ":guilabel:`只選一項`：選取此選項以 **規定** 用戶 **只能作出單一** 選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:144
msgid "Add extras"
msgstr "新增額外項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:146
msgid ""
"After the labels and quantities have been configured for an extra category, "
"the individual extra items must be added for each category."
msgstr "為額外類別設定標籤及數量後，必須為每個類別新增個別額外項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:149
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` at the bottom of the list that appears on the "
"side of the extra category. Enter the :guilabel:`Name` and :guilabel:`Price`"
" for each item being added. If the extra is free, leave the price at "
"`$0.00`. This is common for items like disposable silverware, condiments, or"
" straws."
msgstr ""
"在額外項目類別旁邊顯示的清單底部，點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`。為每個要新增的"
"項目輸入 :guilabel:`名稱` 及 :guilabel:`價格`。如果該額外項目免費，請將價格保"
"留為 `$0.00`。這常見於即棄餐具、調味料或飲管等物品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:155
msgid ""
"A pizzeria only offers personal pizzas, and customers select their toppings."
" Their extras are configured as follows:"
msgstr "一間薄餅店只提供個人裝薄餅，並由顧客自選配料。其額外配料設定如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:158
msgid ""
"The first extra is configured for the various toppings they offer. The "
":guilabel:`Extra 1 Label` is set to `Toppings`, and the :guilabel:`Extra 1 "
"Quantity` is set to :guilabel:`None or More`. The various toppings are then "
"added, with their corresponding costs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:162
msgid ""
"The pizzeria also offers a free beverage with any purchase. To set this up, "
"the :guilabel:`Extra 2 Label` is set to `Free Beverage with Purchase`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Extra 2 Quantity` is set to :guilabel:`Only One`. The various"
" beverage choices are added, and the cost for each remains zero."
msgstr ""
"這間薄餅店亦提供任何消費即送免費飲品的優惠。要進行相關設定，請將 "
":guilabel:`額外項目 2 標籤` 設為 `消費即送免費飲品`，並將 :guilabel:`額外項"
"目 2 數量` 設為 :guilabel:`僅限一項`。加入各種飲品選項後，每項費用均維持為零"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/lunch/vendors.rst:166
msgid ""
"The extras of a pizzeria, with paid toppings and a free beverage with "
"purchase."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:5
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:121
msgid "Payroll"
msgstr "薪酬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Payroll** app is used to calculate employees' worked time in "
"conjunction with other Odoo apps, such as **Employees**, **Time Off**, "
"**Attendances**, and **Planning**, and create corresponding payslips."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **薪酬** 應用程式會配合 **員工**、**休假**、**出勤** 及 **規劃** 等其他 "
"Odoo 應用程式，計算員工的工作時間，並建立相應的糧單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:11
msgid ""
"When an employee is hired, they must sign a :doc:`contract "
"<payroll/contracts>`. The contract outlines how the employee is compensated,"
" including the salary structure and rules their pay is calculated from, when"
" they work (their `working schedule`), and what benefits they receive."
msgstr ""
"聘用員工時，員工必須簽署:doc:`合約 <payroll/contracts>`。合約列明了員工的薪酬"
"方式，包括薪資結構及計算薪酬的規則、工作時間（即其 `工作時間表`），以及可享有"
"的福利。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:16
msgid ""
"It is critical to install the correct :doc:`country-specific localization "
"<payroll/payroll_localizations>`, as this configures all local and national "
"rules, regulations, and applicable taxes for the selected country."
msgstr ""
"務必安裝正確的:doc:`特定國家/地區的本地化設定 <payroll/payroll_localizations>"
"`，因為這會為所選國家/地區設定所有地方及國家規則、法規和適用稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:20
msgid ""
"In addition to the employee contract, any :doc:`salary attachments "
"<payroll/salary_attachments>` must be configured before running payroll."
msgstr ""
"除員工合約外，在執行薪酬計算前，還必須先設定所有 :doc:`薪金扣押 <payroll/"
"salary_attachments>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:23
msgid ""
"When it is time to run payroll according to the business's schedule "
"(monthly, weekly, bi-weekly, etc.), :doc:`payslips <payroll/payslips>` can "
"be created individually or in :doc:`groups <payroll/pay_runs>`. Odoo "
"calculates when the employees worked based on their :doc:`work entries "
"<payroll/work_entries>`. Work entries are created according to their "
":doc:`contracts <payroll/contracts>`, based on information from the "
"**Attendances**, **Planning**, or **Timesheets** apps. Any errors with work "
"entries **must** be resolved *before* continuing to process payroll."
msgstr ""
"按照公司的發薪週期（每月、每週、每兩週等）計算薪酬時，可個別建立:doc:`薪酬單 "
"<payroll/payslips>`，或以:doc:`群組 <payroll/pay_runs>`形式建立。Odoo 會根據"
"員工的:doc:`工作記錄 <payroll/work_entries>`計算其工作時數。工作記錄則會按員"
"工的:doc:`合約 <payroll/contracts>`，並根據 **出勤**、**排班** 或 **工時表** "
"應用程式的資料建立。在繼續處理薪酬 *之前*，**必須** 先解決工作記錄中的所有錯"
"誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:30
msgid ""
"After all issues or conflicts are resolved, payslips are :ref:`processed "
"<payroll/payslips/process>`, and then :ref:`employees are paid "
"<payroll/payslips/pay-employee>`, either with a wire transfer or a physical "
"check."
msgstr ""
"解決所有問題或衝突後，會先 :ref:`處理糧單 <payroll/payslips/process>`，然後透"
"過電匯或實體支票 :ref:`向員工發薪 <payroll/payslips/pay-employee>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:35
msgid ""
"It is possible to pay employees with cash, but this is not recommended."
msgstr "雖然可以現金向員工支薪，但並不建議這樣做。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:40
msgid ""
"Before running payroll, various settings for the **Payroll** app **must** be"
" configured. Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. The various settings for :ref:`accounting <payroll-accounting>`, "
":ref:`localizations <payroll-localizations>`, :ref:`time off <payroll-time-"
"off>`, and :ref:`general payroll settings <payroll-payroll-settings>` are "
"specified here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:49
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:269
msgid "Accounting"
msgstr "會計"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:51
msgid ""
"Configure the following in the accounting section of the configuration menu:"
msgstr "在配置選單的會計部分進行以下設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:53
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payroll Entries`: Enable this option to post payroll slips in the"
" **Accounting** app, in a `Salaries` box on the main dashboard."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`薪資分錄`：啟用此選項後，系統會在 **會計** 應用程式主儀表板的 `薪"
"資` 方塊中過賬薪資單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payroll SEPA`: Enable this option to create :abbr:`SEPA (Single "
"Euro Payments Area)` payments."
msgstr ":guilabel:`薪酬 SEPA`：啟用此選項以建立 :abbr:`SEPA（單一歐元支付區）` 付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Batch Account Move Lines`: Enable this option to have a single "
"account move line created from all the accounting entries of the same "
"period. This anonymizes accounting entries and disables the creation of "
"individual payments."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`批次會計分錄明細`：啟用此選項，即可將同一期間的所有會計分錄合併建"
"立為單一會計分錄明細。此舉會匿名化會計分錄，並停用建立個別付款的功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:64
msgid "Localizations"
msgstr "本地化"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:66
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:7
msgid ""
"*Localizations* are country-specific settings preconfigured in Odoo at the "
"creation of the database, which account for all taxes, fees, and allowances "
"for that particular country."
msgstr ""
"*本地化設定* 是在建立資料庫時於 Odoo 預先設定的國家/地區專屬配置，涵蓋該國家"
"或地區的所有稅項、費用及津貼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:69
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Localization` section of the **Payroll** app "
":guilabel:`Settings` page includes specific settings that need to be "
"configured for the specific country."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:72
msgid ""
"The settings and options shown in this section vary, depending on the "
":doc:`localization enabled <payroll/payroll_localizations>` for the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"此部分顯示的設定及選項，會視乎數據庫:doc:`已啟用的本地化設定 <payroll/"
"payroll_localizations>`而有所不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:76
msgid ""
"It is **not** recommended to alter the localization settings, unless "
"specifically required due to special circumstances. For example, a new law "
"is passed that changes basic salary rules, or a company is exempt from "
"specific taxes."
msgstr ""
"除非因特殊情況而明確需要，否則 **不** 建議更改本地化設定。例如，通過了改變基"
"本薪資規則的新法例，或公司獲豁免特定稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:81
msgid ""
"Odoo can handle multi-company configurations. This is generally done when "
"there is a main company or office location, such as a headquarters, with "
"other offices or branches located either in the country or internationally, "
"that fall under that main company or headquarters. In Odoo, each company, "
"including the headquarters, **must** be set up as its own company or branch "
"using the multi-company method."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 支援多公司配置。這通常適用於設有總公司或總辦事處，並在本地或海外設有其他"
"隸屬該總公司或總辦事處的辦事處或分公司的情況。在 Odoo 中，包括總公司在內的每"
"間公司，都 **必須** 使用多公司模式設定為獨立的公司或分公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:87
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:231
msgid ""
"Each company can have a different localization setting, since locations can "
"vary worldwide, where rules and laws differ."
msgstr "每間公司均可擁有不同的本地化設定，因為世界各地的地點及相關法規各有不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:90
msgid ""
"For more information on companies, refer to the :doc:`companies "
"<../general/companies>` documentation, or the :doc:`multi-company "
"<../general/companies/multi_company>` documentation, which covers how to set"
" up multiple companies."
msgstr ""
"有關公司的更多資訊，請參閱 :doc:`公司 <../general/companies>` 文件，或參閱介"
"紹如何設定多間公司的 :doc:`多公司 <../general/companies/multi_company>` 文件"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:95
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:153
msgid ":doc:`payroll/payroll_localizations`"
msgstr ":doc:`payroll/payroll_localizations`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:100
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2580
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:5
msgid "Time off"
msgstr "休假"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Deferred Time Off`: If time off is taken *after* payslips are "
"validated, the time off must be applied to the following pay period to avoid"
" cancelling then reprocessing payslips. Select the person responsible for "
"these specific time off situations using the drop-down menu in the "
":guilabel:`Responsible` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`遞延休假`：如果休假是在支薪單驗證*之後*才申請，則必須將該休假套用"
"至下一個支薪週期，以避免取消並重新處理支薪單。請使用 :guilabel:`負責人` 欄位"
"的下拉式選單，選取負責處理此類特定休假情況的人員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:108
msgid ""
"An employee is paid on the 15th of the month and the last day of the month. "
"Payslips are typically processed one day before."
msgstr "員工於每月 15 日及月底獲發薪金。糧單通常會提前一天處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:111
msgid ""
"An employee's payslip is approved and processed on the 30th, but that same "
"employee took an unexpected sick day on the 31st."
msgstr "一名員工的薪酬單於 30 日獲批並已處理，但該名員工在 31 日突發請了一天病假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:114
msgid ""
"Since the employee was already paid for a regular workday on the 31st, to "
"keep the time off balances correct, the sick day is applied to the 1st of "
"the next month (during the next pay period)."
msgstr ""
"由於員工在 31 日已獲發正常工作日薪金，為確保休假結餘準確，該病假會計入下月 1 "
"日（即下一個支薪期）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:123
msgid ""
"The payroll section allows for the installation of a :doc:`payroll "
"localization <payroll/payroll_localizations>`. Click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`Choose a Payroll Localization` and a Kanban view of all available"
" payroll localizations loads. Click :guilabel:`Install` on the desired "
"localization to install it. If a localization has been installed, only a "
":guilabel:`Module Info` button appears for that specific localization."
msgstr ""
"薪酬部分可用於安裝 :doc:`薪酬本地化 <payroll/payroll_localizations>`。點擊 "
":icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`選擇薪酬本地化`，系統便會載入所有可用薪酬本"
"地化的看板檢視。在所需的本地化上點擊 :guilabel:`安裝` 即可進行安裝。如果該本"
"地化已經安裝，則只會顯示 :guilabel:`模組資訊` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:129
msgid ""
"Once a localization has been installed, configure the following fields:"
msgstr "安裝本地化套件後，請配置以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Expiration Notice Period`: Enter the number of "
":guilabel:`Days` before a contract expires, when Odoo notifies the "
"responsible person about the upcoming expiration."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`合約到期通知期`：輸入合約到期前的 :guilabel:`天數`，以便 Odoo 在合"
"約即將到期時通知負責人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payslip PDF Display`: Enable this option to show the payslip's "
"PDF when the state is validated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`薪酬單 PDF 顯示`：啟用此選項，即可在狀態驗證後顯示薪酬單的 PDF。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:135
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Permit Expiration Notice Period`: Enter the number of "
":guilabel:`Days` before a work permit expires, when Odoo notifies the "
"responsible person about the upcoming expiration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`YTD Reset Date`: Enter the date when the :abbr:`YTD (Year To "
"Date)` is reset to. By default, this field is set to January 1st."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:141
msgid ":doc:`payroll/contracts`"
msgstr ":doc:`payroll/contracts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:142
msgid ":doc:`payroll/salaries`"
msgstr ":doc:`payroll/salaries`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:143
msgid ":doc:`payroll/salary_rules`"
msgstr ":doc:`payroll/salary_rules`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:144
msgid ":doc:`payroll/work_entries`"
msgstr ":doc:`payroll/work_entries`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll.rst:145
msgid ":doc:`payroll/working_schedules`"
msgstr ":doc:`payroll/working_schedules`"

