#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:4
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:419
msgid "Commissions"
msgstr "佣金"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:6
msgid ""
"Commissions are payments made to employees that are earned as part of their "
"salary. The payments are awarded after a sale has been made, and the amount "
"depends on how much the sale was. Typically the amount is either a "
"percentage of the sale, or a set commission based on a structure created by "
"the company."
msgstr ""
"佣金是作為員工薪金一部分發放的款項。該筆款項會在達成銷售後發放，金額取決於銷"
"售額。通常，佣金金額會是銷售額的某個百分比，或是根據公司制定的架構而設定的固"
"定佣金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:11
msgid ""
"To pay an employee a commission they earned, a separate commission paycheck "
"must be issued to the employee. In Odoo, a commission payslip is referred to"
" as a *warrant payslip*."
msgstr ""
"要向員工支付其賺取的佣金，必須另外向該員工發出佣金薪資單。在 Odoo 中，佣金薪"
"資單稱為 *認股權證薪資單*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:15
msgid "Create warrant payslips"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:17
msgid ""
"Warrant payslips are generated directly from the :guilabel:`Payslips "
"Batches` dashboard, which is accessed by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Payslips --> Batches`."
msgstr ""
"認股權證糧單會直接從 :guilabel:`糧單批次` 儀表板生成，您可以前往 "
":menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 糧單 --> 批次` 存取該儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:20
msgid ""
"First, click the :guilabel:`Generate Warrant Payslips` button in the top-"
"left corner. Doing so reveals a :guilabel:`Generate Warrant Payslips` pop-up"
" window, in which the necessary information **must** be filled out."
msgstr ""
"首先，點擊左上角的 :guilabel:`產生認股權證糧單` 按鈕。此時會顯示 "
":guilabel:`產生認股權證糧單` 彈出式視窗，您 **必須** 在其中填寫所需資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:24
msgid ""
"Set the time frame the commission was earned, in the two fields next to "
":guilabel:`Period`. Click into each field, and a calendar pop-up window "
"loads. Navigate to the desired date and click on it to select it."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`期間`旁的兩個欄位，設定賺取佣金的時間範圍。點擊每個欄位，系統便"
"會載入日曆彈出視窗。前往所需日期並點擊選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:28
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select the :guilabel:`Department` in the "
"corresponding field. When a department is selected, the employees listed for"
" that department appear in the :guilabel:`Employee` section, below."
msgstr ""
"使用下拉式選單，在相應欄位中選擇 :guilabel:`部門`。選擇部門後，該部門的員工便"
"會顯示於下方的 :guilabel:`員工` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:32
msgid ""
"If a file is needed for the record, upload a file to the :guilabel:`Import "
"File` field, such as a sales invoice, using the :guilabel:`Upload your file`"
" button. Any file type is accepted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:35
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Employee` section, enter the individual "
":guilabel:`Commission Amount` for each employee in the far-right column. To "
"remove an employee, click the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(trash)` icon to"
" remove the line."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`員工` 部分下，於最右側欄為每位員工輸入各自的 :guilabel:`佣金金"
"額`。要移除員工，請按一下 :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`（垃圾桶）` 圖示以移"
"除該行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:39
msgid ""
"Add a new commission by clicking :guilabel:`Add a Line`, and entering the "
":guilabel:`Employee` and the appropriate :guilabel:`Commission Amount`."
msgstr ""
"要新增佣金，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`，並輸入:guilabel:`員工`及適當"
"的:guilabel:`佣金金額`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:42
msgid ""
"Once all the commissions are properly entered, click the :guilabel:`Generate"
" Payslips` button to create the warrant payslips in a group, which is "
"reffered to as a *pay run* in Odoo, or click :guilabel:`Export` to export a "
"CSV file of the commissions."
msgstr ""
"妥善輸入所有佣金後，點擊 :guilabel:`產生糧單` 按鈕，即可成批建立認股權證糧單"
"（在 Odoo 中稱為*支薪批次*），或點擊 :guilabel:`匯出` 以匯出佣金的 CSV 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:46
msgid ""
":ref:`Process the pay run <payroll/pay-run-process>` in the same way as a "
"typical batch to complete the payment process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:49
msgid "Enter the commission details."
msgstr "輸入佣金詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/commissions.rst:53
msgid ":doc:`Commissions <../../sales/sales/commissions>`"
msgstr ":doc:`佣金 <../../sales/sales/commissions>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:52
msgid "Contracts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:5
msgid ""
"Every employee in Odoo is required to have a running contract in order to be"
" paid. A contract outlines the terms of an employee's position, "
"compensation, working hours, and any other relevant terms."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，每位員工都必須擁有有效合約才可獲發薪酬。合約會列明員工職位、薪酬"
"、工作時數及任何其他相關條款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:9
msgid ""
"Contracts are created and managed in the *Payroll* tab of an :ref:`employee "
"record <employees/payroll>`. Employee records can be found by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Employees --> Employees`, or on the main "
"dashboard of the **Employees** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:14
msgid ""
"Contract documents (PDFs) are uploaded and organized using the **Documents**"
" application, and are signed using the **Sign** application. Ensure these "
"applications are installed to send and sign contracts. Please refer to the "
":doc:`../../productivity/documents` and :doc:`../../productivity/sign` "
"documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"合約文件（PDF）是透過 **文件** 應用程式上傳及整理，並透過 **簽署** 應用程式進"
"行簽署。請確保已安裝這些應用程式，以便傳送及簽署合約。欲了解更多資訊，請參閱 "
":doc:`../../productivity/documents` 及 :doc:`../../productivity/sign` 的說明"
"文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:22
msgid "Create a contract"
msgstr "建立合約"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:24
msgid ""
"Contracts are created by uploading a :ref:`contract template "
"<payroll/contract-template>` and making any necessary modifications for the "
"specific employee. Contract templates eliminate the need to configure new "
"contracts every time an employee is hired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:28
msgid ""
"Contract templates are created through the configuration menu of the "
"**Payroll** or **Employees** apps and stored in the **Documents** app. If no"
" contract templates exist, or if a new contract template is needed, "
":ref:`create a new template <payroll/contract-template>`."
msgstr ""
"合約範本可透過 **薪酬** 或 **員工** 應用程式的配置選單建立，並儲存在 **文"
"件** 應用程式中。如果沒有合約範本，或需要新的合約範本，請 :ref:`建立新範本 "
"<payroll/contract-template>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:32
msgid ""
"Having multiple contract templates allows for faster contract creation for "
"commonly filled employment positions, such as full time, part time, "
"seasonal, etc."
msgstr ""
"擁有多個合約範本，可為常見的聘用職位（例如全職、兼職、季節性員工等）更快建立"
"合約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:35
msgid ""
"To create a new contract from a template, open the employee record and click"
" into the *Payroll* tab. Click :guilabel:`Load a Template`, and a *Contract "
"Template Load* pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"要從範本建立新合約，請開啟員工記錄，並點擊 *薪酬* 分頁。點擊 :guilabel:`載入"
"範本`，便會顯示 *載入合約範本* 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:38
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select the contract template for the employee, "
"then click :guilabel:`Load`. The various fields from the template populate "
"the corresponding fields in the *Payroll* tab, and the updates are recorded "
"in the chatter. Additional sections may appear, depending on the contract "
"template. Then, make any required modifications to the fields in the various"
" sections of the *Payroll* tab."
msgstr ""
"使用下拉式選單為員工選擇合約範本，然後點擊 :guilabel:`載入`。範本中的各項欄位"
"會自動填入 *薪酬* 分頁的相應欄位，而更新紀錄亦會記於通訊欄中。視乎合約範本而"
"定，系統可能會顯示額外部分。完成後，請按需要修改 *薪酬* 分頁各部分中的欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:45
msgid ""
"To access contract templates, the **Salary Configurator** "
"(`hr_contract_salary`) module **must** be :ref:`installed "
"<general/install>`. Depending on the installed :doc:`payroll localization "
"<payroll_localizations>`, different sections and fields may appear in the "
"*Payroll* tab."
msgstr ""
"要存取合約範本，**必須** :ref:`安裝 <general/install>` **薪酬配置"
"器**（`hr_contract_salary`）模組。視乎已安裝的 :doc:`薪酬本地化 "
"<payroll_localizations>`，*薪酬* 分頁中可能會顯示不同的區塊和欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:52
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:92
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:253
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:400
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:109
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:141
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:107
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:88
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:177
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:77
msgid "Contract overview section"
msgstr "合約概覽部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:54
msgid ""
"The only field *not* modified after loading a :ref:`contract template "
"<payroll/contract-template>` is the :guilabel:`Contract` field. This field "
"specifies the start date of the contract."
msgstr ""
"載入 :ref:`合約範本 <payroll/contract-template>` 後，唯一 *不會* 被修改的欄位"
"是 :guilabel:`合約` 欄位。此欄位指定合約的開始日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:57
msgid ""
"Click into the :guilabel:`Contract` field to reveal a calendar selector. "
"Click the start date for the contract. Once a date is selected, a "
":guilabel:`to` field appears next to the start date. By default, "
":guilabel:`Indefinite` is displayed in gray, indicating the contract does "
"not expire. If there is a set end date for the contract, click into the "
":guilabel:`Indefinite` field, and click on the contract end date to select "
"it."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`合約` 欄位以顯示日曆選擇器，然後點擊合約的開始日期。選擇日期"
"後，開始日期旁邊會出現 :guilabel:`至` 欄位。預設情況下，該欄位會以灰色顯示 "
":guilabel:`無限期`，表示合約不會到期。如果合約設有結束日期，請點擊 "
":guilabel:`無限期` 欄位，然後點擊合約結束日期以作選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:64
msgid ""
"This field may remain blank if a start date is not known. Once the contract "
"is signed, that date is set as the :guilabel:`Start Date`."
msgstr ""
"如尚未確定開始日期，此欄位可留空。合約簽署後，該日期將設為 :guilabel:`開始日"
"期`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:70
msgid "Create contract templates"
msgstr "建立合約範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:72
msgid ""
"To create a new contract template, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app "
"--> Configuration --> Templates`, or :menuselection:`Employees app --> "
"Configuration --> Contract Templates`. Both methods open the *Contract "
"Templates* dashboard."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的合約範本，請前往 :menuselection:`薪資應用程式 --> 配置 --> 範本`，"
"或 :menuselection:`員工應用程式 --> 配置 --> 合約範本`。兩種方法都會開啟 *合"
"約範本* 儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:76
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button, and a blank contract template form loads. "
"Configure the following fields in the various sections of the form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Template Name`: Enter a brief descriptive name for the template. "
"This should be clear and easily understood, as this name appears in the "
"**Recruitment** application, as well."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`範本名稱`：輸入範本的簡短描述性名稱。名稱應清晰易明，因為它亦會顯"
"示於 **招募** 應用程式中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job`: Select the :doc:`job position <../recruitment/new_job>` the"
" contract template applies to from the drop-down menu. If blank, the "
"template applies to all job positions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`職位`：從下拉選單中選擇合約範本適用的 :doc:`職位 <../recruitment/"
"new_job>`。如留空，該範本將適用於所有職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Department`: Select the department the contract template applies "
"to from the drop-down menu. If blank, the template applies to all "
"departments."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`部門`：在下拉式選單中選擇合約範本適用的部門。若留空，範本將適用於"
"所有部門。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`HR Responsible`: Select the employee responsible for validating "
"contracts, using this template, using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`人力資源負責人`：使用下拉式選單，選取負責驗證使用此範本合約的員工"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wage Type`: Select either :guilabel:`Fixed Wage` or "
":guilabel:`Hourly Wage` from the drop-down menu. Select :guilabel:`Fixed "
"Wage` for salaried employees, and select :guilabel:`Hourly Wage` for "
"employees who are paid based on their logged work hours."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`薪酬類型`：從下拉選單中選擇 :guilabel:`固定薪酬` 或 :guilabel:`時"
"薪`。受薪員工請選擇 :guilabel:`固定薪酬`，而根據已記錄工作時數支薪的員工則選"
"擇 :guilabel:`時薪`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Schedule`: Using the drop-down menu, select how often the "
"employee is paid. The default options are: :guilabel:`year`, "
":guilabel:`half-year`, :guilabel:`quarter`, :guilabel:`2 months`, "
":guilabel:`month`, :guilabel:`half-month`, :guilabel:`2 weeks`, "
":guilabel:`week`, or :guilabel:`day`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`支薪時間表`：使用下拉式選單選擇向員工支薪的頻率。預設選項包括"
"：:guilabel:`每年`、:guilabel:`每半年`、:guilabel:`每季`、:guilabel:`每 2 個"
"月`、:guilabel:`每月`、:guilabel:`每半月`、:guilabel:`每 2 週`、:guilabel:`每"
"週` 或 :guilabel:`每日`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wage`: Enter the gross wage. The time period presented in this "
"field  reflects what is selected for the :guilabel:`Pay Schedule` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工資`：輸入總工資。此欄位顯示的時間週期，會反映:guilabel:`支薪週"
"期`欄位所選的設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:105
msgid ""
"It is recommended to populate the :guilabel:`Yearly Cost (Real)` field "
"*first*, since that value is used to automatically calculate the "
":guilabel:`Wage`. If the :guilabel:`Yearly Cost (Real)` is updated, the "
":guilabel:`Wage` field updates as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select one of the 18 "
"default types of contracts. This list is the same as the *employment type*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`合約類型`：使用下拉式選單，從 18 種預設合約類型中選擇一種。此清單"
"與 *僱傭類型* 相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Category`: Select one of the default pay categories using the"
" drop-down menu. The default pay categories are :guilabel:`Employee` or "
":guilabel:`Worker`, which are pulled from the configured *salary structures*"
" in the **Payroll** app. A :ref:`new pay category <payroll/salaries/new-"
"structure-type>` can be created, if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`薪酬類別`：使用下拉式選單選擇其中一個預設薪酬類別。預設的薪酬類別"
"為 :guilabel:`僱員` 或 :guilabel:`工人`，這些類別是從 **薪酬** 應用程式中已配"
"置的 *薪酬結構* 提取。如有需要，可建立:ref:`新的薪酬類別 <payroll/salaries/"
"new-structure-type>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:117
msgid ""
"In previous versions of Odoo, the :guilabel:`Pay category` was called "
":guilabel:`Salary Structure Types`."
msgstr "在舊版 Odoo 中，:guilabel:`薪酬類別`稱為:guilabel:`薪資結構類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:120
msgid ""
"To view, modify, or add pay categories, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll "
"app --> Configuration --> Structure Types`."
msgstr ""
"如要檢視、修改或新增薪資類別，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 配"
"置 --> 結構類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:123
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pay Category` drop-down menu displays all the available "
"working schedules. To modify or add to this list, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Working Schedules`. Click "
":guilabel:`New`, and create a new working schedule, or click on an existing "
"working schedule and make edits."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`薪酬類別` 下拉式選單會顯示所有可用的工作時間表。如需修改或新增"
"此清單，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 配置 --> 工作時間表`。點擊 "
":guilabel:`新增` 以建立新的工作時間表，或點擊現有的工作時間表進行編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:129
msgid "Employer costs section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/contracts.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Yearly Cost`: Enter the total yearly cost the employee costs the "
"employer. When this value is entered, the :guilabel:`Monthly Cost` and "
":guilabel:`Wage` fields are automatically updated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`年度成本`：輸入僱主為該員工承擔的年度總成本。輸入此數值後"
