#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:3
msgid "Pay runs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:5
msgid ""
"*Pay runs* are used to generate multiple :doc:`payslips <payslips>` at once "
"and process them in a group, rather than create and process individual "
"payslips. This method not only helps the payroll department pay employees in"
" less time, but it also helps keep payslips organized."
msgstr ""
"*支薪批次* 用於一次過產生多張 :doc:`薪資單 <payslips>` 並以群組方式處理，而無"
"需逐一建立及處理個別薪資單。這種方法不但能協助薪酬部門在更短時間內向員工支薪"
"，亦有助井然有序地管理薪資單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:9
msgid ""
"Typically, a company's payroll department :ref:`creates a new pay run "
"<payroll/new-pay-run>` for each salary structure, for every pay period "
"(usually weekly, bi-weekly, or monthly). If desired, pay runs can be further"
" organized by department, job position, etc."
msgstr ""
"一般而言，公司的薪酬部門會在每個支薪週期（通常為每週、每兩週或每月）為每個薪"
"資結構:ref:`建立新的發薪批次 <payroll/new-pay-run>`。如有需要，亦可按部門、職"
"位等進一步整理發薪批次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:13
msgid ""
"Once a pay run is made, :ref:`payslips are added to the pay run "
"<payroll/add-payslips>`, then the pay run is processed, and employees are "
"paid."
msgstr ""
"建立發薪批次後，系統會 :ref:`將工資單加入發薪批次 <payroll/add-payslips>`，接"
"著處理發薪批次，並向員工發放薪金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:17
msgid "View pay runs"
msgstr "檢視支薪批次"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:19
msgid ""
"To view all the pay runs in the database, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Payslips --> Pay Runs` to display all "
"payslip pay runs that have been created. These payslip pay runs are "
"displayed in a list view, grouped by :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Status` "
"(either :guilabel:`Ready`, :guilabel:`Done`, or :guilabel:`Paid`), by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"要檢視資料庫中的所有發薪批次，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 糧"
"單 --> 發薪批次`，以顯示所有已建立的糧單發薪批次。預設情況下，這些糧單發薪批"
"次會以清單檢視顯示，並按 :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`狀態`（:guilabel:`就"
"緒`、:guilabel:`完成` 或 :guilabel:`已支付`）分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:24
msgid ""
