"pay-run>`, :ref:`Employee Payslips <payroll/payslips-pay-run>`, or :ref:`Pay"
" Runs <payroll/pay-runs-pay-run>` dashboards."
msgstr ""
"可從 :ref:`工作項目 <payroll/work-entry-pay-run>`、:ref:`員工薪資單 <payroll/"
"payslips-pay-run>` 或 :ref:`發薪批次 <payroll/pay-runs-pay-run>` 儀表板建立新"
"的發薪批次。"

