#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:68
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Pay Run` button and a :guilabel:`New Pay Run` pop-up "
"window loads. Select the :guilabel:`Salary Structure` using the drop-down "
"menu. If no :guilabel:`Salary Structure` is selected, the pay run applies to"
" *all* salary structures. Next, select the :guilabel:`Pay Schedule`, which "
"is *how often* employees are paid. The default options are :guilabel:`year`,"
" :guilabel:`half-year`, :guilabel:`quarter`, :guilabel:`2 months`, "
":guilabel:`month`, :guilabel:`half-month`, :guilabel:`2 weeks`, "
":guilabel:`week`, or :guilabel:`day`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`發薪批次` 按鈕，系統會載入 :guilabel:`新增發薪批次` 彈出視窗"
"。使用下拉式選單選擇 :guilabel:`薪酬架構`。如果沒有選擇任何 :guilabel:`薪酬架"
"構`，該發薪批次將套用至*所有*薪酬架構。接下來，選擇 :guilabel:`發薪週期`，即"
"員工獲發薪酬的*頻率*。預設選項包括 :guilabel:`年`、:guilabel:`半"
"年`、:guilabel:`季`、:guilabel:`2 個月`、:guilabel:`月`、:guilabel:`半個"
"月`、:guilabel:`2 週`、:guilabel:`週` 或 :guilabel:`日`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:75
msgid ""
"Last, using the calendar selector, set the first day the pay run covers in "
"the first blank :guilabel:`Period` field. The second field is automatically "
"populated based on the selection in the :guilabel:`Pay Schedule` field."
msgstr ""
"最後，使用日曆選擇器，在第一個空白的:guilabel:`期間`欄位中設定發薪批次涵蓋的"
"第一天。第二個欄位會根據:guilabel:`發薪週期`欄位的選擇自動填入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:80
msgid ""
"A company pays its employees every month. To configure the pay run for "
"November, the :guilabel:`Pay Schedule` is set to :guilabel:`month`, and the "
"first :guilabel:`Period` field is set to `Nov 1`. Once entered, the second "
"field is automatically populated with `Nov 30`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:84
msgid "A monthly pay run configured for November."
msgstr "為 11 月設定的每月支薪批次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:87
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`New Pay Run` pop-up window is configured, click "
":guilabel:`Continue`, and the pop-up window changes to a :guilabel:`Select "
"Employees` window. All employees who match the parameters set in the "
":guilabel:`New Pay Run` pop-up window appear in the list. Select the desired"
" employees to add to the pay run, or click the box next to "
":guilabel:`Employees` to select *all* employees in the list."
msgstr ""
"設定好:guilabel:`新增發薪批次`彈出視窗後，按一下:guilabel:`繼續`，彈出視窗便"
"會切換為:guilabel:`選擇員工`視窗。所有符合:guilabel:`新增發薪批次`彈出視窗中"
"所設參數的員工都會顯示在清單中。選擇要加入該發薪批次的員工，或勾"
"選:guilabel:`員工`旁邊的方格以選擇清單中的*所有*員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:93
msgid "The pay run employee selection pop-up window."
msgstr "支薪批次員工選擇彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:96
msgid ""
"Once all desired employees are selected, click :guilabel:`Select`. The pop-"
"up window closes, and the pay run appears on the screen."
msgstr ""
"選取所有所需員工後，點擊 :guilabel:`選擇`。彈出視窗隨即關閉，畫面上會顯示該薪"
"資批次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:102
msgid "Pay runs dashboard"
msgstr "薪酬批次儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:104
msgid ""
"To create a pay run from the pay runs dashboard, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Payslips --> Pay Runs`. Click the "
":guilabel:`New` button and a :guilabel:`New Pay Run` pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""
"要從薪資批次儀表板建立薪資批次，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 薪資"
"單 --> 薪資批次`。點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，隨即會載入一個 :guilabel:`新增"
"薪資批次` 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:108
msgid ""
"Follow the same directions as if creating a :ref:`pay run form the payslips "
"dashboard <payroll/new-pay-run-pop-up>`."
msgstr ""
"請按照與 :ref:`從薪資單儀表板建立支薪批次 <payroll/new-pay-run-pop-up>` 相同"
"的指示操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:114
msgid "Add a payslips to a pay run"
msgstr "將糧單加入支薪週期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:116
msgid ""
"Once a :ref:`pay run has been created <payroll/new-pay-run>`, payslips are "
"added as part of the pay run creation. If needed, additional payslips can be"
" created individually, and added to a pay run after it has been created."
msgstr ""
"一旦 :ref:`已建立發薪批次 <payroll/new-pay-run>`，系統便會在建立過程中加入糧"
"單。如有需要，亦可個別建立額外糧單，並在發薪批次建立後將其加入該批次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:120
msgid ""
"To add a new payslip, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Payslips "
"--> Payslips`. Click the :guilabel:`New Off-Cycle` button and a blank "
":guilabel:`Employee Payslips` form loads. :ref:`Configure the payslip form "
"<payroll/payslips/new-payslip>`, and ensure the :guilabel:`Pay Run` field is"
" populated."
msgstr ""
"如要新增糧單，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 糧單 --> 糧單`。按一下 "
":guilabel:`新增週期外` 按鈕，隨即會載入空白的 :guilabel:`員工糧單` 表單。 "
":ref:`設定糧單表單 <payroll/payslips/new-payslip>`，並確保已填寫 "
":guilabel:`發薪批次` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:125
msgid ""
"Once the form is configured, click :guilabel:`Compute Sheet` to calculate "
"the payslip and add it to the selected pay run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:131
msgid "Process a pay run"
msgstr "處理發薪作業"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:133
msgid ""
"After a :ref:`pay run has been created <payroll/new-pay-run>`, and :ref:`all"
" required payslips have been added <payroll/add-payslips>`, the pay run must"
" then be processed, and employees paid."
msgstr ""
"在:ref:`建立發薪批次 <payroll/new-pay-run>`並:ref:`加入所有所需薪資單 "
"<payroll/add-payslips>`後，便須處理該發薪批次，並向員工發薪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:136
msgid ""
"Open the desired pay run by navigating to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Payslips --> Pay Runs`, and clicking on the desired pay run."
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 糧單 --> 薪酬發放批次`，然後按一下所需的"
"薪酬發放批次以開啟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:139
msgid ""
"For a pay run to be processed, it must have a status of :guilabel:`Ready`. "
"That means the pay run has been created and payslips have been added, but "
"the payslips have *not* been processed."
msgstr ""
"支薪批次必須處於 :guilabel:`就緒` 狀態，才可進行處理。這表示支薪批次已建立並"
"已加入糧單，但糧單 *尚未* 處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:142
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Create Draft Entry` button, then click :guilabel:`OK` "
"in the :guilabel:`Confirmation` pop-up window to confirm and create a draft "
"of all the individual payslips in the pay run. After this occurs, the pay "
"run status changes to :guilabel:`Done`, and moves to the corresponding "
"grouping on the :guilabel:`Pay Runs` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`建立草稿記項` 按鈕，然後在彈出視窗點擊 :guilabel:`確"
"定`（:guilabel:`確認`），以確認並建立該支薪批次中所有個別薪資單的草稿。完成後"
"，支薪批次狀態會變更為 :guilabel:`已完成`，並移動至 :guilabel:`支薪批次` 儀表"
"板上的對應分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:148
msgid ""
"At any time, the pay run needs to be reverted back to a status of "
":guilabel:`Ready`, click the :guilabel:`Revert` button. This action does "
"**not** remove any payslips that have already been added to the pay run, "
"instead, the status changes back to :guilabel:`Ready`."
msgstr ""
"如在任何時候需要將薪資發放批次的狀態還原至 :guilabel:`準備就緒`，請按一下 "
":guilabel:`還原` 按鈕。此操作 **不會** 移除任何已加入該薪資發放批次的糧單，只"
"會將狀態還原為 :guilabel:`準備就緒`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:152
msgid ""
"After any desired changes have been made, click :guilabel:`Create Draft "
"Entry` and the pay run status changes to :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
"完成任何所需變更後，點擊 :guilabel:`建立草稿記項`，支薪批次狀態即會變更為 "
":guilabel:`已完成`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:155
msgid ""
"It is important to note, that if any payslips in the pay run have a status "
"of :guilabel:`Paid`, the pay run **cannot** revert to a status of "
":guilabel:`Ready`."
msgstr ""
"請注意，如果薪酬發放批次中有任何糧單的狀態為 :guilabel:`已付款`，該薪酬發放批"
"次便**無法**恢復為 :guilabel:`準備就緒` 狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:158
msgid ""
"Once the status has changed to :guilabel:`Done`, the payments must be logged"
" in the database. Click the :guilabel:`Payment Report` button, and a pop-up "
"window loads, where the payment report details are entered."
msgstr ""
"當狀態變更為 :guilabel:`完成` 後，必須在資料庫中記錄付款。點擊 :guilabel:`付"
"款報表` 按鈕，系統會載入彈出式視窗，供輸入付款報表詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:162
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select the :guilabel:`Export Format` for the "
"payment report. The universal option is :guilabel:`CSV`, while all other "
"available options depend on the installed :doc:`payroll localization "
"<payroll_localizations>`."
msgstr ""
"使用下拉式選單，為付款報表選取 :guilabel:`匯出格式`。通用選項為 "
":guilabel:`CSV`，其餘可用選項則視乎已安裝的 :doc:`薪酬本地化模組 "
"<payroll_localizations>` 而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:166
msgid ""
"Next, select the :guilabel:`Payment Date` using the calendar selector. This "
"is the date the paychecks are issued."
msgstr "接著，使用日曆選擇器選擇 :guilabel:`付款日期`。此為簽發薪金支票的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:169
msgid ""
"Some :doc:`payroll localizations <payroll_localizations>` cause a "
":guilabel:`Bank Journal` field to also appear. If visible, select the "
"journal the payslips are logged on, using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"部分:doc:`薪酬本地化 <payroll_localizations>`會同時顯示:guilabel:`銀行日記"
"賬`欄位。如該欄位可見，請使用下拉式選單選擇記錄薪資單的日記賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:172
msgid ""
"Once the pop-up window is configured, click the :guilabel:`Generate` button."
" The :guilabel:`Payment Report` button changes to a :icon:`fa-download` "
":guilabel:`Download (filetype)` button. To save a copy of the payment "
"report, click the :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`Download (filetype)` "
"button, select the location for the file, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"設定好彈出式視窗後，點擊 :guilabel:`生成` 按鈕。:guilabel:`付款報表` 按鈕會變"
"為 :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`下載（檔案類型）` 按鈕。如要儲存付款報表的"
"複本，請點擊 :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`下載（檔案類型）` 按鈕，選擇檔案"
"儲存位置，然後點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:178
msgid ""
"If the screen is enlarged beyond a certain amount, the :icon:`fa-download` "
":guilabel:`Download (filetype)` button is hidden from view. In this "
"scenario, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` "
"icon to view and select the :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`Download "
"(filetype)` option."
msgstr ""
"如果畫面放大超過一定比例，:icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`下載 (檔案類型)` 按"
"鈕便會隱藏。在這種情況下，請點擊 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(垂直省略"
"號)` 圖示，以查看並選擇 :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`下載 (檔案類型)` 選項"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:183
msgid ""
"After the report is created, click the :guilabel:`Mark as paid` button to "
"mark the payslips as paid in the database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:187
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically creates the name of the pay run according to the various "
"selections made when creating the pay run (salary structure, pay schedule, "
"etc). In some situations, a company may want to rename the pay runs, for "
"better organization and a clearer understanding of what pay slips are part "
"of each pay run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:192
msgid ""
"For example, a company pays its employees monthly, for both hourly and "
"salaried employees."
msgstr "例如，某公司為時薪及月薪員工均按月發放薪酬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:194
msgid "The names for their four August 2025 pay runs are:"
msgstr "其 2025 年 8 月四個支薪批次的名稱為："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:196
msgid "`Aug 1-14 2025 - Hourly`"
msgstr "`2025 年 8 月 1 日至 14 日 - 時薪`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:197
msgid "`Aug 1-14 2025 - Salary`"
msgstr "`2025年8月1至14日 - 薪酬`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:198
msgid "`Aug 15-31 2025 - Hourly`"
msgstr "`2025年8月15至31日 - 時薪`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/pay_runs.rst:199
msgid "`Aug 15-31 2025 - Salary`"
msgstr "`2025 年 8 月 15-31 日 - 工資`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:5
msgid "Payroll localizations"
msgstr "薪酬本地化"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:10
msgid ""
"*Payroll localizations* refer to the specific process of adapting payroll "
"systems, policies, and compliance measures to align with the specific labor "
"laws, tax regulations, and social security requirements of a particular "
"country or region."
msgstr ""
"*薪酬本地化* 是指調整薪酬系統、政策及合規措施的具體流程，以符合特定國家或地區"
"的相關勞工法例、稅務法規及社會保障規定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:14
msgid ""
"This ensures that employee salaries, benefits, deductions, and contributions"
" are processed accurately and in full compliance with local legal and "
"financial obligations."
msgstr ""
"這可確保員工的薪金、福利、扣減及供款均獲得準確處理，並完全符合當地的法律及財"
"務規定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:17
msgid ""
"Localization also includes integrating country-specific payroll elements "
"such as benefits, holidays, termination rules, and reporting requirements, "
"helping businesses avoid legal risks while ensuring employees receive their "
"correct compensation."
msgstr ""
"本地化亦包括整合特定國家／地區的薪酬元素，例如福利、假期、離職規則及申報規定"
"，協助企業避免法律風險，同時確保員工獲得準確薪酬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:24
msgid "List of countries"
msgstr "國家列表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:26
msgid ""
"Payroll localization modules are available for the countries listed below."
msgstr "下列國家/地區提供薪酬本地化模組。"

