#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:212
msgid ""
"A country-specific localization module :ref:`must be installed "
"<general/install>` to configure and process payroll properly. To install the"
" required module, first open the **Apps** app. Clear out the default "
":icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Apps` filter, then type the name of the desired"
" country into the search bar. All available modules for that country are "
"presented."
msgstr ""
"如要正確配置及處理薪酬，您 :ref:`必須安裝 <general/install>` 特定國家的本地化"
"模組。如要安裝所需模組，請先開啟 **應用程式** 應用程式。清除預設的 :icon:`fa-"
"filter` :guilabel:`應用程式` 篩選條件，然後在搜尋欄輸入所需國家的名稱。系統隨"
"即會顯示該國家的所有可用模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:217
msgid ""
"Some countries only have one localization module, while others have multiple"
" modules. This is typically when other software is needed to process "
"payroll, and importing and exporting data is required. For example, when "
"searching for **Payroll** modules for `Egypt`, the following modules appear "
"in the search, and must be installed: `Egypt - Payroll` and `Egypt - Payroll"
" with Accounting`."
msgstr ""
"部分國家只有一個本地化模組，而其他國家則有多個模組。這種情況通常發生在需要其"
"他軟件來處理薪酬，並需要匯入及匯出資料時。例如，搜尋`埃及`的**薪酬**模組時，"
"搜尋結果會顯示以下模組，且必須全部安裝：`埃及 - 薪酬`及`埃及 - 薪酬及會計`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:223
msgid ""
"Refer to the :ref:`country-specific documentation "
"<payroll_localizations/countries-list>` for a complete list of the related "
"**Payroll** modules required for each specific country."
msgstr ""
"有關各個國家或地區所需的相關**薪酬**模組完整清單，請參閱:ref:`國家/地區專屬文"
"件 <payroll_localizations/countries-list>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:226
msgid ""
"Odoo can handle a multi-company configuration. This is generally done when "
"there is a main company or office location, such as a headquarters, and "
"other offices/branches around the country or the globe that fall under that "
"main company or headquarters. In Odoo, each company, including the "
"headquarters, must be set up as its own company/branch using the multi-"
"company method."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 支援多公司配置。這種做法通常適用於設有一間總公司或主要辦公地點（例如總部"
"），並在全國或全球各地設有多間隸屬於該總公司或總部的辦事處或分公司的情況。在 "
"Odoo 中，每間公司（包括總部）都必須透過多公司方式，獨立設定為各自的公司或分公"
"司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:234
msgid ""
"For more information on companies, refer to the :doc:`Companies "
"<../../general/companies>` documentation, which covers how to set up "
"companies."
msgstr ""
"有關公司的更多資訊，請參閱 :doc:`公司 <../../general/companies>` 說明文件，當"
"中涵蓋如何設定公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations.rst:238
msgid ""
"To see if any localization modules have been installed on the database, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Settings` page, if a localization module was installed, a "
":guilabel:`(Country) Localization` section appears."
msgstr ""
"如要查看資料庫是否已安裝任何本地化模組，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程"
"式 --> 配置 --> 設定`。在:guilabel:`設定`頁面中，如果已安裝本地化模組，便會顯"
"示:guilabel:`（國家／地區）本地化`部分。"

