msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`: Complete the full address, including the "
":guilabel:`City`, :guilabel:`State`, :guilabel:`Zip Code`, and "
":guilabel:`Country`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`地址`：填寫完整地址，包括:guilabel:`城市`、:guilabel:`州／"
"省`、:guilabel:`郵政編號`及:guilabel:`國家／地區`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Trading Name`: If the business has an unregistered alias "
"(businesses could use these informally in Australia before May 2012), enter "
"it here."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`營業名稱`：若企業有未註冊的別名（澳洲企業在 2012 年 5 月之前可非正"
"式使用），請在此輸入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:90
msgid ""
"In May 2012, the :abbr:`ASIC (Australian Securities and Investments "
"Commission)` required businesses to register all names. From November 1, "
"2025 on, all unregistered trading names are retired from the :abbr:`ABR "
"(Australian Business Register)`, and businesses are required to register "
"their trading name as a business name."
msgstr ""
"2012 年 5 月，:abbr:`ASIC (澳洲證券及投資事務監察委員會)` 要求企業註冊所有名"
"稱。自 2025 年 11 月 1 日起，所有未註冊的商業名稱將從 :abbr:`ABR (澳洲商業登"
"記冊)` 撤銷，企業必須將其商業名稱註冊為企業名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ABN`: Enter the company's eleven-digit :abbr:`ABN (Australian "
"Business Number)` in this field. After this is entered, click "
":guilabel:`Verify ABN`, to ensure the number is correct."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ABN`：在此欄位輸入公司的 11 位數字:abbr:`ABN (澳洲商業編號)`。輸入"
"後，按一下:guilabel:`驗證 ABN`以確保編號正確無誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`GST registered`: Select this checkbox if the company is "
"registered for Australian :abbr:`GST (Goods and Services Tax)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已登記 GST`：如果公司已登記澳洲 :abbr:`GST（商品及服務稅）`，請勾"
"選此複選框。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ACN`: Enter the company's nine-digit :abbr:`ACN (Australian "
"Company Number)`. This number is issued by the :abbr:`ASIC (Australian "
"Securities and Investments Commission)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ACN`：輸入公司的九位數字:abbr:`ACN（澳洲公司編號）`。此編號"
"由:abbr:`ASIC（澳洲證券及投資事務監察委員會）`簽發。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: By default, :abbr:`AUD (Australian Dollars)` is "
"selected. If not, select :guilabel:`AUD` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`貨幣`：系統預設會選取 :abbr:`AUD (澳元)`。如未選取，請從下拉式選單"
"中選擇 :guilabel:`AUD`。"

