#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:115
msgid ""
"In addition to configuring the company, some **Payroll** app settings must "
"be configured. Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration -->"
" Settings`, and scroll to the :guilabel:`Australian Localization` section."
msgstr ""
"除了配置公司外，還必須配置部分 **薪酬** 應用程式設定。請前往 "
":menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`，然後捲動至 :guilabel:`澳洲本"
"地化` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:120
msgid "Company Information"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:122
msgid "Configure the following fields in the *Company Information* section:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:124
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Branch Code`: Enter the six-digit :abbr:`BSB (Bank State Branch)`"
" code. This identifies the specific bank and branch for payroll "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`分行代碼`：輸入六位數的 :abbr:`BSB（銀行州份分行）` 代碼。這用於識"
"別支薪交易的特定銀行及分行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:128
msgid ""
"The *Branch Code* can be found in the |ATO| portal. In Odoo, only the "
"numeric value is relevant. For example, `Activity statement 002` would "
"translate in Odoo as 2 (002 = 2)."
msgstr ""
"*分行代碼* 可在 |ATO| 門戶網站中找到。在 Odoo 中，只有數值部分適用。例如"
"，`Activity statement 002` 在 Odoo 中會對應為 2（002 = 2）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withholding Payer Number`: If available, enter the eight or nine-"
"digit :abbr:`WPN (Withholding Payer Number)` issued by the |ATO|. This is "
"for companies *not* entitled to an :abbr:`ABN (Australian Business Number)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:134
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Registered for Working Holiday Maker`: Select this checkbox if "
"the company is registered for the :abbr:`WHM (Working Holiday Maker)` "
"program. This indicates the company is registered with the |ATO| to withhold"
" the correct taxes for employees working in Australia with an eligible visa,"
" for a period of less than 12 months."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已登記工作假期計劃`：如果公司已註冊 :abbr:`WHM（工作假期計劃）` 計"
"劃，請剔選此核取方塊。這表示公司已在 |ATO| 登記，為持有合資格簽證並在澳洲工作"
"少於 12 個月的員工預扣正確稅款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:140
msgid ""
"`Employer registration for working holiday makers website "
"<https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-organisations/starting-registering-"
"or-closing-a-business/registration-obligations-for-businesses/work-out-"
"which-registrations-you-need/taxation-registrations/employer-registration-"
"for-working-holiday-makers>`_"
msgstr ""
"`工作假期人士僱主登記網站 <https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-"
"organisations/starting-registering-or-closing-a-business/registration-"
"obligations-for-businesses/work-out-which-registrations-you-need/taxation-"
"registrations/employer-registration-for-working-holiday-makers>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:143
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Registered for PALM Scheme`: Select this checkbox if the company "
"is registered for the :abbr:`PALM (Pacific Australia Labour Mobility)` "
"scheme, which allows the company to hire employees from ten different "
"Pacific island nations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已註冊 PALM 計劃`：如果公司已註冊 :abbr:`PALM（太平洋澳洲勞工流動"
"）` 計劃，請剔選此複選框。該計劃讓公司可從十個不同的太平洋島國聘用員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:148
msgid ""
"`PALM (Pacific Australia Labour Mobility Scheme) website "
"<https://www.palmscheme.gov.au/>`_"
msgstr "`PALM（太平洋澳洲勞工流動計劃）網站 <https://www.palmscheme.gov.au/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:151
msgid "SuperStream and Single Touch Payroll"
msgstr "SuperStream 及 Single Touch Payroll"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:153
msgid ""
"Configure the following fields in the *SuperStream and Single Touch Payroll*"
" section:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:155
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payroll Mode`: Using the drop-down menu, select whether "
"SuperStream and :abbr:`STP (Single Touch Payroll)` are in "
":guilabel:`Testing` mode, or :guilabel:`Production` (live) mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:157
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Registration Status`: This field is unable to be modified, as it "
"displays the current registration status for the SuperStream and :abbr:`STP "
"(Single Touch Payroll)` payroll."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:161
msgid ""
"Odoo is compliant with :guilabel:`SuperStream and Single Touch Payroll` "
"Phase 2. Before registering in Production mode, we recommend consulting with"
" Odoo's sales or support teams to ensure it aligns with your company’s "
"specific payroll requirements."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 符合 :guilabel:`SuperStream 及 Single Touch Payroll` 第 2 階段的合規要求"
"。在正式環境（Production）模式下註冊前，建議先聯絡 Odoo 銷售或支援團隊，確保"
"其符合貴公司的特定薪酬管理要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:165
msgid ""
"To complete the registration process, click :guilabel:`Start Payroll "
"Onboarding`, and a :guilabel:`Payroll Onboarding` pop-up window loads. "
"Select the :guilabel:`Payroll Responsible` user using the drop-down menu. "
"Once selected, the :guilabel:`Work Email` and :guilabel:`Work Phone` fields "
"are autopopulated with the user's contact information, and cannot be "
"changed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:171
msgid ""
"Only users of the database can be selected for the :guilabel:`Payroll "
"Responsible`."
msgstr "只有資料庫用戶才可選為:guilabel:`薪酬負責人`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:173
msgid "The first page of the onboarding pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:176
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Next Step`, and the status changes to "
":guilabel:`Authorised`, and displays the question :guilabel:`Are you "
"authorised to register for this service on behalf of your employer?` Click "
":guilabel:`Yes` to confirm, then click :guilabel:`Next Step`."
msgstr ""
"接著點擊 :guilabel:`下一步`，狀態會變更為 :guilabel:`已授權`，並顯示問題 "
":guilabel:`您是否獲授權代表僱主註冊此服務？` 點擊 :guilabel:`是` 確認，然後點"
"擊 :guilabel:`下一步`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:180
msgid ""
"The status changes to :guilabel:`Employer Details`, and displays the contact"
" information for both the company and the selected payroll responsible. "
"Ensure the :guilabel:`Employer Details` and :guilabel:`Employee Contact` are"
" correct on the form."
msgstr ""
"狀態會變更為:guilabel:`僱主資料`，並顯示公司及所選薪酬負責人的聯絡資料。請確"
"保表單上的:guilabel:`僱主資料`及:guilabel:`員工聯絡資料`正確無誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:184
msgid ""
"If any information needs to be updated, exit the form and update the company"
" or employee information in the **Settings** app or **Employees** app, then "
"return to the **Payroll** settings page. Click the :guilabel:`Start Payroll "
"Onboarding` button, and the pop-up window loads to the :guilabel:`Employer "
"Details` again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:189
msgid "The employer and responsible page of the onboarding pop-up window."
msgstr "入職彈出視窗中的僱主及負責人頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:192
msgid ""
"When the displayed information is correct, click :guilabel:`Next Step` and "
"the status changes to :guilabel:`Bank Details`. Using the drop-down menu, "
"select the :guilabel:`Bank Journal` for payroll. After a journal is "
"selected, the :guilabel:`Bank Name`, :guilabel:`Account Name`, "
":guilabel:`Bank Account Number`, and :guilabel:`BSB` fields are populated "
"with the selected bank journal's details, and **cannot** be modified. If any"
" changes are needed, exit the form and update the information for the "
"journal in the **Accounting** app."
msgstr ""
"當顯示的資料無誤時，點擊:guilabel:`下一步`，狀態便會變更為:guilabel:`銀行詳"
"情`。使用下拉式選單選擇用於發薪的:guilabel:`銀行日記賬`。選取日記賬後"
"，:guilabel:`銀行名稱`、:guilabel:`賬戶名稱`、:guilabel:`銀行賬戶號碼` 及 "
":guilabel:`BSB` 欄位會自動填入所選銀行日記賬的詳情，且 **不可** 修改。如需作"
"出任何更改，請退出表單，並在 **會計** 應用程式中更新該日記賬的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:199
msgid "The bank info page of the onboarding pop-up window."
msgstr "入職彈出視窗的銀行資料頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:202
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Bank Details` are correctly filled out, click "
":guilabel:`Next Step`, and the status changes to :guilabel:`Signature`. Two "
"PDFs appear, :guilabel:`Odoo Terms & Conditions`, and :guilabel:`SuperChoice"
" FSG PDS DDA`. Download and read the two PDFs, then select the two "
"checkboxes next to the :guilabel:`I have read and signed (PDF name)` lines."
msgstr ""
"正確填寫 :guilabel:`銀行詳情` 後，按一下 :guilabel:`下一步`，狀態便會變為 "
":guilabel:`簽署`。畫面上會顯示兩個 PDF 檔案：:guilabel:`Odoo 條款及細則` 及 "
":guilabel:`SuperChoice FSG PDS DDA`。下載並細閱這兩個 PDF 檔案，然後勾選 "
":guilabel:`本人已閱讀並簽署（PDF 名稱）` 兩行旁邊的核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:207
msgid "Finally, click :guilabel:`Register` to complete the registration."
msgstr "最後，按一下:guilabel:`登記`以完成登記。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:212
msgid ""
"Every employee being paid must have their employee profiles configured for "
"the Australia payroll localization. Additional fields are present after "
"configuring the database for Australia."
msgstr ""
"每名獲發薪金的員工，均須設定澳洲薪酬本地化的員工個人資料。為資料庫設定澳洲本"
"地化後，系統會顯示額外欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:215
msgid ""
"To update an employee form, open the :menuselection:`Employees` app and "
"click on the desired employee record. Ensure a :guilabel:`Work Email` and "
":guilabel:`Work Phone` are configured on the employee form, and configure "
"the required fields in the related tabs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:222
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Department`, :guilabel:`Job Position`, and "
":guilabel:`Job Title`, in the *Work* section."
msgstr "在 *工作* 部分輸入 :guilabel:`部門`、:guilabel:`職位` 及 :guilabel:`職稱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:225
msgid ""
"Enter a :guilabel:`Work Address` for the employee in the *Location* section."
msgstr "在 *地點* 部分為員工輸入 :guilabel:`工作地址`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:230
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:131
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:135
msgid ""
"Ensure the employee has a minimum of one :ref:`trusted bank account "
"<employees/private-contact>` listed in the :guilabel:`Bank Accounts` field "
"in the *Private Contact* section."
msgstr ""
"確保員工有至少一個:ref:`受信任銀行賬戶 <employees/private-contact>`，列於 *私"
"人聯絡資料* 部分的:guilabel:`銀行賬戶`欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:233
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:87
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:117
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:78
msgid ""
"These accounts are used to pay the employee. Payroll **cannot** be processed"
" for employees without a *trusted* :ref:`bank account <employees/private-"
"contact>`. If no trusted bank account is set, a warning appears on the "
"**Payroll** dashboard and an error occurs when attempting to run payroll."
msgstr ""
"此等賬戶用於向員工發薪。如果員工沒有 *受信任的* :ref:`銀行賬戶 <employees/"
"private-contact>`，系統 **無法** 為其處理薪酬計算。若未設定受信任的銀行賬戶"
"，**薪酬** 儀表板上會顯示警告，嘗試執行薪酬計算時亦會出現錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:237
msgid ""
"Ensure the following fields are configured: :guilabel:`Email`, "
":guilabel:`Phone`, :guilabel:`Legal Name`, :guilabel:`Other Given Names`, "
":guilabel:`Birthday`, :guilabel:`Gender`, :guilabel:`Private Address`, "
":guilabel:`Marital status`, and :guilabel:`Dependent Children`."
msgstr ""
"請確保已設定以下欄位：:guilabel:`電郵`、:guilabel:`電話`、:guilabel:`法定姓"
"名`、:guilabel:`其他名字`、:guilabel:`出生日期`、:guilabel:`性"
"別`、:guilabel:`私人地址`、:guilabel:`婚姻狀況` 及 :guilabel:`受養子女`。"

