#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:249
msgid ""
"Fill out all the information regarding employees' contracts, residency "
"status, tax treatments, deductions, etc. in the sections below."
msgstr "請在以下各節填寫所有有關員工合約、居留身份、稅務處理、扣減項目等的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:255
msgid "This section holds information that drives salary calculations."
msgstr "此部分包含用於計算薪金的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:257
msgid ""
"Keep the :guilabel:`Salary Structure Type` set to :guilabel:`Australian "
"Employee` and :guilabel:`Working hours` set to :guilabel:`AU Standard 38 "
"hours/week`. This structure covers all of the |ATO|'s tax schedules."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`薪酬結構類型` 保持設為 :guilabel:`澳洲員工`，並將 :guilabel:`工"
"作時數` 設為 :guilabel:`澳洲標準每週 38 小時`。此結構涵蓋 |ATO| 的所有稅表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:261
msgid ""
"If using the **Attendances** or **Planning** app, select the :guilabel:`Work"
" Entry Source` to define how working hours and days are accounted for on the"
" employee's payslip."
msgstr ""
"如使用 **出勤** 或 **規劃** 應用程式，請選擇 :guilabel:`工作項目來源`，以定義"
"員工薪資單如何計算工作時數及天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:264
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Schedule`: Work entries are automatically generated based"
" on the employee's working schedule, starting from the contract's start "
"date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作時間表`：工作記錄會根據員工的工作時間表，從合約開始日期起自動"
"產生。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:268
msgid ""
"An employee works 38 hours a week, their contract begins on 01/01, today's "
"date is 16/01, and the user generates a pay run from 14/01 to 20/01. The "
"working hours on the payslip will be automatically calculated to be 38 hours"
" (5 * 7.36 hours) if no unpaid leave is taken."
msgstr ""
"假設一名員工每週工作 38 小時，其合約於 01/01 開始，今天日期為 16/01，而用戶產"
"生 14/01 至 20/01 的薪酬計算批次。如該員工沒有放取無薪假，糧單上的工作時數將"
"會自動計算為 38 小時（5 * 7.36 小時）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:272
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attendances`: Work entries are only generated after clocking in "
"and out of the **Attendances** app. Note that attendances can be imported."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`考勤`：必須在 **考勤** 應用程式中打卡上班及下班，系統才會產生工作"
"記錄。請注意，考勤記錄可匯入系統。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:274
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Planning`: Work entries are generated from planning shifts in the"
" **Planning** app."
msgstr ":guilabel:`規劃`：工作項目是根據**規劃**應用程式中的排班時段生成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:277
msgid ""
"Timesheets do not impact work entries in Odoo. If timesheets need to be "
"imported in Odoo, import them by navigating to :menuselection:`Payroll app "
"--> Work Entries --> Work Entries` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:280
msgid "Ensure the following fields are configured:"
msgstr "確保已設定以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:282
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Fixed Wage` for full-time and part-time employees."
msgstr "請為全職及兼職僱員選擇 :guilabel:`固定薪金`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:283
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Hourly Wage` for casual workers. This allows for adding a "
"`Casual Loading` percentage."
msgstr "臨時工請選擇 :guilabel:`時薪`。這可讓您加入 `臨時工津貼` 百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:287
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:123
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:155
