#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:101
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:191
msgid ""
"Set a default :guilabel:`Wage Type` in the salary :ref:`Structure Type "
"<payroll/salaries/structure-types>` to configure employees in bulk. If "
"needed, the default can be overridden on individual employee records."
msgstr ""
"將預設的 :guilabel:`工資類型` 設定於薪酬 :ref:`結構類型 <payroll/salaries/"
"structure-types>` 中，以批量配置員工。如有需要，可在個別員工記錄中覆蓋此預設"
"值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:291
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wage`: Enter the wage, and select the corresponding time period. "
"The following options are the **only** pay run frequencies accepted by "
"Australia: :guilabel:`Daily`, :guilabel:`Weekly`, :guilabel:`Fortnightly` "
"(bi-weekly), :guilabel:`Monthly`, and :guilabel:`Quarterly`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`薪金`：輸入薪金並選擇相應的時間週期。以下選項為澳洲**唯一**接受的"
"發薪頻率：:guilabel:`每日`、:guilabel:`每週`、:guilabel:`每兩週`（雙週）"
"、:guilabel:`每月`及:guilabel:`每季`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:294
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wage / Period`: Assign a wage to the contract according to the "
"pay frequency. On payslips, the corresponding annual and hourly rates will "
"be computed automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:296
msgid ":guilabel:`Employee Type`: Select the *type* of employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:297
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Type`: Determines how the employee is paid and "
"classified, such as :guilabel:`Permanent`, :guilabel:`Temporary`, "
":guilabel:`Apprenticeship`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`合約類型`：決定員工的支薪方式及分類，例如:guilabel:`長"
"期`、:guilabel:`臨時`、:guilabel:`學徒`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:299
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Category`: Select :guilabel:`Australia: Employee` for this "
"field. This defines when the employee is paid, their default working "
"schedule, and the work entry type it applies to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`薪酬類別`：此欄位請選擇 :guilabel:`澳洲：員工`。此選項定義員工的支"
"薪時間、預設工作時間表，以及適用的工作記錄類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:305
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:138
