"period. The options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作項目來源`：定義在指定發薪週期內如何為薪酬計算產生:doc:`工作項"
"目 <../work_entries>`。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:308
