msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attendances`: Based on :doc:`approved checked-in hours "
"<../../attendances/management>` in the **Attendances** app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`考勤`：根據 **考勤** 應用程式中的 :doc:`已批核的打卡時數 <../../"
"attendances/management>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:312
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:145
