":guilabel:`規劃`：根據 **規劃** 應用程式中的 :ref:`已排班次 <planning/shifts>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:315
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours`: Using the drop-down menu, select the default work"
" schedule. This is particularly important for employees available to receive"
" overtime pay (typically hourly employees, not salaried). The common "
"selection is :guilabel:`AU Standard 38 hours/week`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作時間`：使用下拉式選單選擇預設工作時間表。這對於可領取加班費的"
"員工（通常為時薪員工，而非受薪員工）尤其重要。常見選項為:guilabel:`澳洲標準每"
"週 38 小時`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:320
msgid "General section"
msgstr "一般部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:322
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Regular Pay Day`: Day of a week to process the payments if "
"relevant."
msgstr ""

