"lodging-and-paying/business-activity-statements-bas/pay-as-you-go-payg-"
"withholding>`_ for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:329
msgid "Personal information section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:331
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Non-resident`: Check this box if the employee is not a legal "
"resident of Australia."
msgstr ":guilabel:`非居民`：如員工並非澳洲合法居民，請勾選此方格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:332
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax-free Threshold`: Check this box if the employee is claiming "
"tax-free threshold."
msgstr ":guilabel:`免稅額門檻`：如員工申請免稅額門檻，請勾選此方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:333
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TFN Status`: Using the drop-down menu, select the employee's "
"declaration."
msgstr ":guilabel:`TFN 狀態`：使用下拉選單選擇員工的申報狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:334
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax File Number`: Enter the employee's tax file number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`稅務檔案編號`：輸入員工的稅務檔案編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:335
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Previous Payroll ID`: This is only available in Debug Mode. This "
"should be used if the employee has payroll records in a previous system and "
"you want to maintain payslip continuity in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`過往薪酬 ID`：此選項僅在除錯模式（Debug Mode）下提供。如果員工在過"
"往系統中已有薪酬記錄，而你希望在 Odoo 中保持糧單記錄的連續性，便應使用此欄位"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:340
msgid "Tax and contributions sections"
msgstr "稅項及供款部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:342
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employment Type`: Select the kind of employment the employee has."
" This affects tax calculations. Options are :guilabel:`Full time`, "
":guilabel:`Part time`, :guilabel:`Casual`, :guilabel:`Labour hire`, "
":guilabel:`Voluntary agreement`, :guilabel:`Death beneficiary`, or "
":guilabel:`Non-employee.`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`僱傭類型`：選擇員工的僱傭類型，此設定會影響稅項計算。選項包括 "
":guilabel:`全職`、:guilabel:`兼職`、:guilabel:`臨時工`、:guilabel:`勞務派"
"遣`、:guilabel:`自願協議`、:guilabel:`身故受益人` 或 :guilabel:`非僱員。`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:346
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Income Stream Type`: Select where the employee is receiving their"
" pay from. The typical employee is :guilabel:`Salary and wages`, however "
"some other circumstances may require a different selection."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`收入來源類型`：選擇員工領取薪酬的來源。一般員工會選擇 "
":guilabel:`薪金及工資`，但在其他特定情況下，可能需要選擇其他項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:349
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Treatment Category`: The |STP| Phase 2 report includes a "
"6-character tax treatment code for each employee. The tax treatment code is "
"an abbreviated way of explaining the factors that can influence the amount "
"withheld from employees. The |STP| solution automates the reporting of these"
" codes and ensure that the tax treatment code reported is valid. Even though"
" the creation of this code is automated, it is still part of the |STP| "
"report, and it is important to understand what it means. For more details, "
"check the |ATO| website on `how to report employment and tax information "
"through STP Phase 2 <https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-"
"organisations/hiring-and-paying-your-workers/single-touch-payroll/in-"
"detail/single-touch-payroll-phase-2-employer-reporting-guidelines/how-to-"
"report-employment-and-tax-information-through-stp-phase-2>`_."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`稅務處理類別`：|STP| 第 2 階段報告為每位員工提供一個 6 位字元的稅"
"務處理代碼。稅務處理代碼以簡稱形式說明可影響員工預扣稅金額的因素。|STP| 解決"
"方案會自動申報這些代碼，並確保所申報的稅務處理代碼有效。即使此代碼為自動建立"
"，它仍是 |STP| 報告的一部分，因此了解其含義十分重要。有關詳情，請瀏覽 |ATO| "
"網站上的 `如何透過 STP 第 2 階段申報就業及稅務資訊 <https://www.ato.gov.au/"
"businesses-and-organisations/hiring-and-paying-your-workers/single-touch-"
"payroll/in-detail/single-touch-payroll-phase-2-employer-reporting-guidelines/"
"how-to-report-employment-and-tax-information-through-stp-phase-2>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:357
msgid ""
":guilabel:`HELP / STSL`: Click this checkbox if the employee is a "
":abbr:`HELP (Higher Education Loan Program)` loan or :abbr:`STSL (Study "
"Training Support Loan)` recipient."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`HELP / STSL`：如員工為 :abbr:`HELP (高等教育貸款計劃)` 貸款或 "
":abbr:`STSL (學習培訓支援貸款)` 的受助人，請勾選此核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:359
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medicare Variation Form` and :guilabel:`Medicare levy surcharge`:"
" Click :guilabel:`Upload your file` to upload the filled form and select the"
" appropriate surcharge if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`醫療保險變更表格` 及 :guilabel:`醫療保險徵費附加費`：點擊 "
":guilabel:`上載你的檔案` 以上載已填妥的表格，並在適用時選擇相應的附加費。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:364
msgid "Deductions, offsets, and withholding section"
msgstr "扣減、抵銷及預扣稅部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:366
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Child Support Deduction`: The amount that has to be deducted "
"every pay period, subject to :abbr:`PEA (Protected Earnings Amount)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:368
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Child Support Garnishee Amount %`: The percentage of pay that is "
"legally withheld and paid towards child support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:370
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withhold for Extra Pay`: An amount that has to be deducted every "
"pay period, subject to :abbr:`PEA (Protected Earnings Amount)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:372
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withholding Variation`: A formal adjustment to the standard tax "
"withholding rate based on specific circumstances (e.g. financial hardship or"
" |ATO| approval)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預扣稅率調整`：根據特定情況（例如經濟困難或獲 |ATO| 批准）對標準預"
"扣稅率作出的正式調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:374
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Additional Withholding Amount`: Additional amount will be "
"withheld from the employee's salary after PAYG withholding (Schedule 14)5."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`額外預扣金額`：根據 PAYG 預扣稅（附表 14）5 扣除後，將從員工薪金中"
"預扣額外金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:378
msgid "Leave loading / workplace giving section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:380
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Eligible for Leave Loading`: Check if the employee is eligible "
"for leave loading."
msgstr ":guilabel:`符合假期津貼資格`：若員工符合領取假期津貼的資格，請勾選此項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:381
msgid ":guilabel:`Workplace Giving Employee`: Set the amount to be deducted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:382
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Sacrificed Workplace Giving`: Set the amount to be salary "
"sacrificed (e.g., receiving a benefit instead of a deduction)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`以薪金扣減作職場捐贈`：設定要扣薪作捐贈的金額（例如：獲得福利而非"
"扣款）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:386
msgid "Super contributions section"
msgstr "退休金（Super）供款部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:388
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Negotiated Super %`: Set the additional percentage amount "
"to be contributed on top of the super guarantee."
msgstr ":guilabel:`額外協商退休金 %`：設定在強制退休金保障之上額外供款的百分比金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:390
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Compulsory Super %`: Set the additional percentage amount "
"to be contributed as per industrial agreements or awards obligations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:394
msgid "Salary sacrifice section"
msgstr "薪酬犧牲部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:396
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Sacrifice Superannuation`: Allows employees to sacrifice "
"part of their salary in favour of :abbr:`RESC (Reportable Employer "
"Superannuation Contributions)` account, which is an Australian retirement "
"account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`薪金犧牲退休金`：允許員工放棄部分薪金，轉入 :abbr:`RESC (須申報僱"
"主退休金供款)` 帳戶（澳洲退休帳戶）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:399
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Sacrifice Other Benefits`: Allows employees to sacrifice "
"part of their salary towards some other form of benefit. Refer to the `ATO's"
" web page on Salary sacrificing for employees "
"<https://www.ato.gov.au/individuals-and-families/jobs-and-employment-"
"types/working-as-an-employee/salary-sacrificing-for-employees>`_ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:406
msgid ""
"Salary sacrificing for other benefits does not affect :abbr:`FBT (Fringe "
"Benefits Tax)` reporting."
msgstr "以薪金換取其他福利不會影響 :abbr:`FBT（附帶福利稅）` 申報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:410
msgid "Super accounts tab"
msgstr "退休金帳戶分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:412
msgid ""
"A super account is the term for an Australian retirement savings account. "
"This tab houses the employee's various retirement accounts, or *super "
"funds*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:416
msgid ""
"If an employee has an *Extra Negotiated Super*, *Extra Compulsory Super*, or"
" *Salary Sacrifice Superannuation,* these configuration can be found under "
"the :ref:`Payroll tab <payroll/payroll_localizations/payroll_tab>`, in the "
"*Super Contributions* section."
msgstr ""
"若員工設有 *額外協商退休金*、*額外強制性退休金* 或 *薪金犧牲退休金*，可在 "
":ref:`薪酬分頁 <payroll/payroll_localizations/payroll_tab>` 下的 *退休金供"
"款* 部分找到相關設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:420
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line`. In the *Create Super Accounts* pop-up window, "
"enter the following information:"
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`加入一行`。在 *建立退休金帳戶* 彈出視窗中，輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:423
msgid ":guilabel:`Employee`: Ensure the employee is selected in this field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：請確保此欄位已選取該員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:424
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TFN`: The :abbr:`TFN (Tax Filing Number)` entered in the "
"*Payroll* tab of the employee form populates this field, and **cannot** be "
"modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`TFN`：此欄位會自動填入員工表單 *薪酬* 分頁中輸入的 :abbr:`TFN (稅"
"務申報編號)`，且 **不可** 修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:426
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Member Since`: By default, the current date populates this field."
" Select the date the employee created the super fund."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`會員加入日期`：預設情況下，此欄位會填入目前日期。請選擇員工建立退"
"休金基金的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:428
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Active`: Enable this option if the account is active (this is the"
" likely scenario)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`啟用`：如該帳戶為使用中狀態，請啟用此選項（通常為此情況）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:429
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Proportion`: Enter the percentage amount being added to the "
"account. By default, the field displays `100`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:433
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Proportion` field if an employee's contributions should "
"be sent to multiple funds at a time."
msgstr "如果員工的供款須同時存入多個基金，請使用 :guilabel:`比例` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:436
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Super Fund`: In the drop-down menu, select the type of account "
"associated with the super fund."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:438
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fund ABN`: This field is autopopulated with the selected "
":guilabel:`Super Fund` :abbr:`ABN (Australian Business Number)`, and "
"**cannot** be modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`基金 ABN`：此欄位會自動填入所選 :guilabel:`退休金基金` 的 "
":abbr:`ABN（澳洲商業編號）`，且 **不可** 修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:440
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Member Number`: After selecting a :guilabel:`Super Fund`, this "
"field appears. Enter the member number for the employee's super fund "
"account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`成員編號`：選擇:guilabel:`退休金基金`後，此欄位便會顯示。輸入員工"
"退休金基金帳戶的成員編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:443
msgid "A Create Super Accounts form all filled out."
msgstr "一份已填妥的「建立超級帳戶」表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:447
msgid ""
"Odoo comes with pre-installed and updated Super funds, but self-managed "
"super funds (SMSF) can be added by navigating to :menuselection:`Payroll -->"
" Configuration --> Super Funds`. Manage all super accounts by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Payroll --> Configuration --> Super Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 已預先安裝並更新退休金基金，但您亦可前往 :menuselection:`薪酬管理 --> 配"
"置 --> 退休金基金` 新增自管退休金基金（SMSF）。前往 :menuselection:`薪酬管"
"理 --> 配置 --> 退休金賬戶` 即可管理所有退休金賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:452
msgid "Salary adjustments tab"
msgstr "薪酬調整分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:454
msgid ""
"If the employee has pay allowances (e.g., laundry allowance, travel "
"allowance, cents per km allowance, transport allowance), :ref:`configure "
"them in the Salary Adjustment tab <payroll/salary_attachments/create>`."
msgstr ""
"如員工享有薪酬津貼（例如洗衣津貼、差旅津貼、每公里津貼、交通津貼），請 "
":ref:`在「薪酬調整」分頁中設定 <payroll/salary_attachments/create>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:461
msgid "STP Responsible Employee"
msgstr "STP 負責僱員"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:463
msgid ""
"One employee responsible for |STP| **must** be nominated. Navigate to the "
"**Employees** app, and select the desired employee. Ensure the following "
"fields are configured on their :ref:`employee profile <employees/general-"
"info>`: :guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`Work phone`, :guilabel:`Work email`, "
"and :guilabel:`Job Title`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:471
msgid "Bank account and bank journal"
msgstr "銀行賬戶及銀行日記賬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:473
msgid ""
"The bank account that direct debit payments are drafted from via the "
"clearing house **must** be configured."
msgstr "透過結算所提取直接扣賬付款的銀行帳戶 **必須** 進行設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:476
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Contacts app --> Configuration --> Bank "
"Accounts`. Click :guilabel:`New` to add a bank account, and a *Bank "
"Accounts* form loads."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`聯絡人應用程式 --> 配置 --> 銀行帳戶`。點擊 "
":guilabel:`新增` 以新增銀行帳戶，系統隨即會載入 *銀行帳戶* 表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:479
msgid "Configure the form, ensuring the following fields are populated:"
msgstr "設定表單，確保已填妥以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:482
msgid ":guilabel:`Clearing Number`: Enter the clearing number in this field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`結算編號`：在此欄位輸入結算編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:483
msgid ":guilabel:`BSB`: Enter the Bank State Branch code in this field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`BSB`：在此欄位輸入銀行州分行（Bank State Branch）代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:484
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Account Holder`: Using the drop-down menu, select the "
"corresponding **Contact** app record for the account holder, typically the "
"company."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`賬戶持有人`：使用下拉式選單，在**聯絡人**應用程式中選取對應賬戶持"
"有人（通常為公司）的記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:486
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Account Holder Name`: The selected :guilabel:`Account Holder` "
"populates this field by default. Make any necessary modifications."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`帳戶持有人姓名`：系統會預設填入所選的:guilabel:`帳戶持有人`。如有"
"需要，請作出修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:488
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank`: Using the drop-down menu, select the bank the account is "
"under. Once selected, a *Bank Information* tab appears, containing the "
"various bank information. Make any desired edits to this tab."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銀行`：使用下拉式選單選擇該賬戶所屬的銀行。選擇後，系統會顯示 *銀"
"行資料* 分頁，當中載有各項銀行資料。請在此分頁進行任何所需編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:491
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send Money`: Ensure this toggle is set to :guilabel:`Trusted`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`匯款`：請確保此開關設為 :guilabel:`受信任`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:492
msgid ":guilabel:`Currency`: Set this field to :guilabel:`AUD`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:494
msgid "The bank account infomration configured for the company."
msgstr "為公司設定的銀行帳戶資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:497
msgid ""
"Then, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> "
"Journals`, and select the corresponding bank journal. Ensure the "
":guilabel:`Bank Account` number in the *Journal Entries* tab is the same as "
"the bank account configured above."
msgstr ""
"然後，前往 :menuselection:`會計應用程式 --> 配置 --> 日記賬`，並選擇相應的銀"
"行日記賬。確保 *日記賬分錄* 分頁中的 :guilabel:`銀行賬戶` 號碼與上述設定的銀"
"行賬戶相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:502
msgid ""
"Odoo takes direct debits from this account to pay employee's superannuation."
msgstr ""

