#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:423
msgid ""
"This documentation explains how the employee departure process works in the "
"application, focusing on the notice period calculation and severance pay "
"when the employee does not serve their notice period."
msgstr ""
"本文件說明應用程式中員工離職流程的運作方式，重點介紹員工未有履行通知期時的通"
"知期計算方法及遣散費安排。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:430
