#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1142
msgid "Batch declaration"
msgstr "批次申報"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1147
msgid ""
"Batch declarations require technical knowledge, including SSH keys, SFTP "
"servers, and electronic signatures. Employers should refer to the `official "
"batch documentation "
"<https://www.socialsecurity.be/site_fr/employer/applics/dmfa/batch/home.htm>`_"
" and `process overview "
"<https://www.socialsecurity.be/site_fr/employer/applics/dmfa/batch/outline.htm>`_."
msgstr ""
"批量申報需要相關技術知識，包括 SSH 金鑰、SFTP 伺服器及電子簽署。僱主應參閱 "
"`官方批量申報文件 <https://www.socialsecurity.be/site_fr/employer/applics/"
"dmfa/batch/home.htm>`_ 及 `流程概覽 <https://www.socialsecurity.be/site_fr/"
"employer/applics/dmfa/batch/outline.htm>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1152
msgid "A batch submission generates three files:"
msgstr "批次提交會產生三個檔案："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1154
msgid "**Declaration file** (e.g., FI.DMFA.112768.20250109.00014.R.1.1)"
msgstr "**申報檔案**（例如：FI.DMFA.112768.20250109.00014.R.1.1）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1155
msgid "**Launch file** (e.g., GO.DMFA.112768.20250109.00014.R.1)"
msgstr "**啟動檔案**（例如：GO.DMFA.112768.20250109.00014.R.1）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1156
msgid ""
"**Electronic signature file** (e.g., FS.DMFA.112768.20250109.00014.R.1.1) "
"(only for real declarations, not tests)"
msgstr ""
"**電子簽署檔案**（例如：FS.DMFA.112768.20250109.00014.R.1.1）（僅適用於正式申"
"報，不適用於測試）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1159
msgid ""
"The full process includes creating, sending, validating, and potentially "
"correcting declarations. Rejections and anomalies must be addressed before "
"final acceptance."
msgstr ""
"完整流程包括建立、傳送、驗證，以及在需要時更正申報表。在最終接納前，必須先處"
"理被拒及異常情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1165
msgid "**Creation of the Declaration**"
msgstr "**建立申報表**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1167
msgid ""
"Create an XML document containing employee benefit data, remuneration, and "
"contributions for the company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1169
msgid ""
"More information on XML files can be found in the *Specifications* page."
msgstr "有關 XML 檔案的更多資訊，請參閱 *規格* 頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1171
msgid "**Sending the Declaration**"
msgstr "**提交申報表**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1173
msgid ""
"Use FTP or SFTP for sending the file. Access requires prior authorization "
"for secure zone access by a local manager."
msgstr "使用 FTP 或 SFTP 傳送檔案。存取前須先獲當地經理授權存取安全區域。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1175
msgid ""
"Detailed instructions are available on the `Introduce and Modify (via batch)"
" <https://www.socialsecurity.be>`_."
msgstr "詳細說明可於 `提交及修改（透過批次） <https://www.socialsecurity.be>`_ 查閱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1178
msgid "**File Acknowledgment Receipt**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1180
msgid ""
"**Positive Receipt**: Indicates the file can be processed. However, this "
"does not guarantee acceptance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1182
msgid ""
"**Negative Receipt**: Indicates issues with the file structure or access "
"rights."
msgstr "**負面回執**：表示檔案結構或存取權限出現問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1184
msgid "**Notification and Ticket Number for the Declaration**"
msgstr "**申報通知及憑證編號**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1186
msgid "A positive notification is sent for each accepted declaration."
msgstr "系統會為每份獲接納的申報發送正面通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1187
msgid "Negative notification: Provides information on encountered anomalies."
msgstr "負面通知：提供有關所遇到異常情況的資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1189
msgid "**Sending PID**"
msgstr "**發送 PID**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1191
msgid ""
"Employers and SSA will receive PID and version numbers via batch for "
"declarations."
msgstr "僱主及 SSA 將透過批次處理接收申報的 PID 及版本編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1193
msgid "**Modification Notification with System Corrections**"
msgstr "**附帶系統更正的修改通知**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1195
msgid ""
"If corrections are made, a modification notification is sent with corrected "
"values."
msgstr "如有作出更正，系統會發送附帶更正數值的修改通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1200
msgid "Double holiday pay"
msgstr "雙倍假日薪酬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1202
msgid ""
"Double holiday pay is an additional bonus paid to employees and workers "
"during their annual leave. The amount depends on the employee's or worker's "
"salary."
msgstr ""
"雙倍假期薪金是員工及工人在放取年假期間獲發的額外獎金，金額視乎員工或工人的薪"
"酬而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1206
msgid "How is double holiday pay calculated?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1208
msgid ""
"For employees, double holiday pay amounts to 92% of their gross salary for "
"the month when they take their main annual leave. This amount is calculated "
"based on the number of months worked or considered equivalent in the "
"previous year."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1213
msgid "Impact of additional or European leave"
msgstr "額外假期或歐洲假期的影響"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1215
msgid ""
"If you take additional or European leave, your employer will pay you regular"
" holiday pay for that leave. However, the following year, this amount will "
"be deducted from your double holiday pay. This is because additional leave "
"is considered an advance on the next year's legal leave."
msgstr ""
"如果您休取額外假期或歐洲假期，僱主會就該假期向您支付常規假期薪酬。但到了翌年"
"，這筆金額會從您的雙倍假期薪酬中扣除。這是因為額外假期被視為來年法定假期的預"
"支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1220
msgid "Factors affecting the calculation"
msgstr "影響計算的因素"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1222
msgid ""
"**Months Worked**: The calculation is based on the number of months you "
"worked in the previous year."
msgstr "**工作月數**：根據你上一年度工作的月數計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1224
msgid ""
"**Absences**: If you had unpaid absences, they may reduce your double "
"holiday pay."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1225
msgid ""
"**Variable Revenues**: Bonuses and commissions earned in the previous year "
"can impact the total amount of double holiday pay."
msgstr "**浮動收入**：上一年度賺取的獎金及佣金，可能會影響雙倍假期薪酬的總額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1227
msgid ""
"**Withholding Taxes**: The double holiday pay is subject to income tax "
"deductions, which depend on your annual earnings and family situation."
msgstr ""
"**預扣稅**：雙倍假期工資須扣除所得稅，具體金額視乎您的年度收入及家庭狀況而定"
"。"

