#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1409
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1730
msgid ""
"You can now check the different payslips before validation. Once validated, "
"the PDF files are generated and posted on employee portals as for classic "
"payslips."
msgstr ""
"你現在可以在驗證前檢查不同的糧單。一經驗證，系統便會產生 PDF 檔案並發佈至員工"
"門戶網站，與傳統糧單的處理方式相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1412
msgid "Double Holiday PDF."
msgstr "雙倍假期 PDF。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1418
msgid ""
"Double holiday pay is a significant benefit that rewards employees for their"
" work in the previous year. Understanding how it is calculated helps in "
"better financial planning for the holiday period."
msgstr ""
"雙倍假期工資是一項重要福利，旨在獎勵員工過去一年的工作表現。了解其計算方式有"
"助於為假期期間作出更佳的財務規劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1424
msgid "Eco vouchers"
msgstr "環保券"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1429
msgid ""
"Eco vouchers are a tax-free employee benefit designed to support the "
"purchase of environmentally-friendly products and services. These vouchers "
"are ordered via external providers and are exempt from social security "
"contributions."
msgstr ""
"環保券是一種免稅員工福利，旨在支援購買環保產品及服務。這些券透過外部供應商訂"
"購，並獲豁免繳納社會保障供款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1434
msgid "Eligibility & allocation"
msgstr "資格及分配"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1436
msgid ""
"Employees who have worked during the **reference period (01/06/N-1 - "
"31/05/N)** are eligible for up to **250€** in eco vouchers, which are "
"granted at the beginning of **July**."
msgstr ""
"在 **參考期間（01/06/N-1 - 31/05/N）** 內曾工作的員工，可獲最多 **250€** 的環"
"保代金券，並於 **7 月** 初發放。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1440
msgid ""
"For 2025, employees must have worked between **01/06/2024 and 31/05/2025** "
"to qualify."
msgstr ""
"就 2025 年而言，員工必須於 **01/06/2024 至 31/05/2025** 期間曾工作，方符合資"
"格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1442
msgid ""
"For employees who join during the reference period, the voucher amount is "
"prorated based on their worked days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1446
msgid ""
"An employee hired on **06/01**, having worked **6 out of 12 months**, would "
"receive:"
msgstr "於 **06/01** 受聘、並在 **12 個月中已工作 6 個月** 的員工將獲得："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1448
msgid "250\\text{€} \\times (6/12) = 125\\text{€}"
msgstr "250\\text{€} \\times (6/12) = 125\\text{€}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1453
