#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1739
msgid "Holiday pay recovery"
msgstr "假期薪酬追回"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1741
msgid ""
"This document explains how Odoo calculates the recovery of holiday pay (both"
" simple and double) for employees in Belgium who have changed employers. "
"When an employee moves from one company to another, their previous employer "
"may have already paid their holiday pay for the previous year. This amount "
"needs to be recovered by the new employer, and this guide outlines how this "
"is managed in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"本文件說明 Odoo 如何為曾轉職的比利時員工計算假期薪酬扣回（包括單倍及雙倍假期"
"薪酬）。當員工由一間公司轉至另一間公司時，其前僱主可能已支付上一年度的假期薪"
"酬。新僱主需要扣回該筆款項，本指南將概述如何在 Odoo 中管理此流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1747
msgid "Understanding holiday pay in Belgium"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1749
msgid ""
"In Belgium, employees are entitled to annual leave and corresponding holiday"
" pay, which consists of:"
msgstr "在比利時，員工享有年假及相應的假期薪酬，包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1751
msgid ""
"**Simple holiday pay**: Regular salary payments for the days of leave taken."
msgstr "**簡單假期薪酬**：按所放取的休假日數發放正常薪酬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1752
msgid ""
"**Double holiday pay**: An additional payment, typically equal to "
"approximately 92% of the gross monthly salary, given when employees take "
"their annual leave."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1755
msgid ""
"When an employee changes jobs, their previous employer may have already paid"
" these amounts. To avoid double payment, the new employer needs to recover "
"the amounts already paid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1759
msgid "Recovery of simple holiday pay"
msgstr "追回基本假日薪酬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1761
msgid ""
"The recovery of simple holiday pay in Odoo is based on the following "
"criteria:"
msgstr "在 Odoo 中，基本假期薪酬的扣回是基於以下準則："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1763
msgid ""
"The recovery applies if the employee has taken leave in the current year and"
" their previous employer already paid the holiday pay."
msgstr "如員工於本年度已休假，且其前僱主已支付假期薪金，則適用此扣回。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1765
msgid ""
"The calculation considers the number of leave days taken and the hours "
"worked per week."
msgstr "計算時會考慮已休假的日數及每週工作時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1766
msgid "The recovery process is split into:"
msgstr "復原程序分為以下部分："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1768
msgid "**Year N**: The current year's holiday pay recovery."
msgstr "**第 N 年**：本年度的假期薪酬追回。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1769
msgid "**Year N-1**: The recovery of holiday pay from the previous year."
msgstr "**N-1 年度**：收回上一年度的假期薪酬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1771
msgid "The system checks:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1773
msgid ""
"If the employee's first contract date with the company was in the previous "
"year."
msgstr "如果員工與公司的首份合約日期是在上一年。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1774
msgid "If the employee has a pending holiday pay recovery amount."
msgstr "若員工有待追回的假期薪酬金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1775
msgid "If the recovery has not already been processed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1776
msgid "If the employee has taken annual leave."
msgstr "如果員工已放取年假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1778
msgid ""
"If all conditions are met, Odoo calculates the amount to be deducted from "
"the payroll to account for the holiday pay already received from the "
"previous employer."
msgstr ""
"如果符合所有條件，Odoo 會計算須從薪酬中扣除的金額，以抵銷僱員已從前僱主收取的"
"假期薪金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1782
msgid "Recovery of double holiday pay"
msgstr "收回雙倍假期薪酬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1784
msgid "The recovery of double holiday pay follows these steps:"
msgstr "扣回雙倍假期薪酬的步驟如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1786
msgid ""
"The system verifies the employee's contract and determines their employment "
"duration."
msgstr "系統會驗證員工的合約並確定其受僱年期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1787
msgid "The gross salary is calculated based on the employee's contract."
msgstr "總薪金會根據員工的合約計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1788
msgid "The number of months worked in the previous year is identified."
msgstr "系統會識別上一年度的工作月數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1789
msgid "A threshold amount is computed as follows:"
msgstr "門檻金額計算方式如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1791
msgid ""
"\\text{Threshold} = \\text{Current monthly salary} \\times \\text{Months worked in previous year}\n"
"\\times \\text{Occupation rate} \\times 7.67%"
msgstr ""
"\\text{門檻} = \\text{現時月薪} \\times \\text{去年工作月數}\n"
"\\times \\text{工作比率} \\times 7.67%"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1797
msgid ""
"If the amount on the holiday certificate from the previous employer is lower"
" than this threshold, no limit applies."
msgstr "如果前僱主發出的假期證明上的金額低於此門檻，則不設上限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1800
msgid "The system recovers the lower of:"
msgstr "系統會收回以下兩者中的較低者："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1802
msgid "The calculated threshold."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1803
msgid "The actual amount paid by the previous employer."
msgstr "前任僱主實際支付的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1805
msgid ""
"If the employee has worked for more than 12 months in the current company, "
"no double holiday pay needs to be recovered."
msgstr "如果員工已在現職公司工作超過 12 個月，則無需追回雙倍假期薪金。"

