msgstr "要扣回雙倍假期薪酬，必須**為每位僱主的假期證明輸入一行資料**。每一行應包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1828
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`# Months` (number of months) the employee worked for that "
"employer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1829
msgid "The :guilabel:`Amount` provided to the employee"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1830
msgid "The :guilabel:`Occupational Rate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1832
msgid ""
"Odoo uses this data to compute a **recovery limit**. If the employee now has"
