msgstr ""
"Odoo 會使用此資料計算 **追回上限**。若該員工現時的薪金較低，則無法追回全數金"
"額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1836
msgid ""
