#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2032
msgid "Intellectual property and 273 sheets"
msgstr "知識產權及 273 張"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2037
msgid ""
"The 273S declaration is used for the **Prepayment on Mobile Income (Pr.M)**,"
" which concerns the taxation of **Author's Rights** and **Neighboring "
"Rights** (also known as **Revenus Mobilier**). These are specific types of "
"income that are subject to particular tax treatment in certain "
"jurisdictions."
msgstr ""
"273S 申報表用於申報 **動產預扣稅（Pr.M）**，涉及 **著作權** 及 **鄰接權**（又"
"稱 **Revenus Mobilier**）的稅務。這些屬於特定類型的收入，在部分司法管轄區須接"
"受特定稅務處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2042
msgid ""
"This document provides users with essential information about how the 273S "
"declaration functions within Odoo for reporting income derived from these "
"rights, including applicable tax rates and conditions."
msgstr ""
"本文件為用戶提供有關 273S 申報表如何在 Odoo 中運作的重要資訊，用於申報源自這"
"些權利的收入，包括適用的稅率及條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2047
msgid "Tax rates and calculation"
msgstr "稅率與計算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2049
msgid ""
"The net income from Author's Rights and Neighboring Rights is taxable at a "
"specific rate of **15%**. However, the effective tax rate can vary based on "
"the application of flat-rate deductions. These flat rates reduce the taxable"
" amount, leading to a lower effective tax rate for lower incomes."
msgstr ""
"來自著作權及鄰接權的淨收入須按 **15%** 的特定稅率課稅。不過，實際稅率可能會因"
"套用定額扣減而有所不同。這些定額扣減會減少應課稅金額，從而令較低收入人士享有"
"較低的實際稅率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2053
msgid "Key points of taxation:"
msgstr "稅務要點："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2055
msgid "**Effective tax rate**:"
msgstr "**實際稅率**："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2057
msgid ""
"For incomes below the first flat-rate threshold, the effective tax rate can "
"be as low as **7.5%**."
msgstr "對於低於首個固定稅率門檻的收入，實際稅率可低至 **7.5%**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2059
msgid ""
"For incomes reaching the flat-rate ceiling of **37,500 EUR** (indexed "
"annually), the rate can increase to **12%**."
msgstr ""
"對於達到 **37,500 歐元** 定額上限（每年按指數調整）的收入，比率可提高至 "
"**12%**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2062
msgid ""
"**Additional taxes**: Income from Author's Rights and Neighboring Rights "
"must be declared in the personal income tax declaration. As a result, "
"municipal surcharges may also apply to the tax due."
msgstr ""
"**額外稅項**：來自著作權及鄰接權的收入必須在個人入息稅申報中申報。因此，應繳"
"稅款亦可能須繳納市政附加費。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2065
msgid ""
"The **prepayment** of the tax is handled via a withholding tax on the "
"income. The debtor of the income (e.g., the employer or company paying the "
"royalties) must submit the 273S declaration to the tax authorities. This "
"withholding tax rate is generally **15%**, but for incomes exceeding the "
"indexed ceiling of **37,500 EUR**, the rate increases to **30%**."
msgstr ""
"稅款的**預繳**是透過對收入徵收預扣稅來處理。收入支付方（例如支付特許權使用費"
"的僱主或公司）必須向稅務局提交 273S 申報表。此預扣稅稅率一般為 **15%**，但若"
"收入超過 **37,500 歐元** 的指數調整上限，稅率則會提高至 **30%**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2071
msgid "Benefits of Author's Rights in employment contracts"
msgstr "僱傭合約中著作權的優勢"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2073
msgid ""
"Companies can offer tax-advantageous remuneration to their directors or "
"employees by granting **Author's Rights**. These rights are subject to a "
"**15% withholding tax**, but there are flat-rate deductions that make this "
"tax treatment very favorable, especially when incomes are lower."
msgstr ""
"公司可透過授予 **著作權**，為董事或員工提供具稅務優勢的薪酬。這些權利須繳納 "
"**15% 預扣稅**，但設有定額扣減，使此稅務待遇極為優惠，在收入較低時尤其明顯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2077
msgid "Important considerations:"
msgstr "重要注意事項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2079
msgid ""
"**Creative works**: To qualify for Author's Rights protection, the work must"
" be creative, original, and fixed in a tangible form. Simple ideas or "
"concepts are not eligible."
msgstr ""
"**創意作品**：作品必須具備創意、原創性，並以具體形式固定下來，方合資格受著作"
"權保護。單純的想法或概念不符合資格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2081
msgid ""
"**Exploitation requirement**: From January 1, 2023, a new regulation "
"mandates that transferred or licensed protected works must be exploited, "
"meaning they must be used for public communication, execution, "
"representation, or reproduction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2084
msgid ""
"**Eligibility for tax benefits**: To benefit from the favorable tax regime, "
"the rights holder must meet specific criteria, such as:"
msgstr "**稅務優惠資格**：要享有優惠稅制，權利持有人必須符合特定條件，例如："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2087
msgid "Holding an \"Artistic Work Certificate.\""
msgstr "持有「藝術工作證明」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2088
msgid ""
"Licensing or transferring rights to a third party for public communication "
"or reproduction."
msgstr "向第三方授出或轉讓公開傳播或複製的權利。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2090
msgid ""
"**Income ratio restrictions**: The proportion of income from Author's Rights"
" in relation to regular salary will be capped at **30%**, with **70%** of "
"the total income being subject to regular income tax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2093
msgid ""
"**Income cap**: The absolute ceiling for qualifying income under this regime"
" remains **37,500 EUR** (indexed at **70,220 EUR** for the 2024 income "
"year)."
msgstr ""
"**收入上限**：此制度下合資格收入的絕對上限仍為 **37,500 歐元**（2024 收入年度"
"按指數調整為 **70,220 歐元**）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2096
msgid ""
"If your average income from the last four years exceeds this ceiling, you "
"will no longer be eligible for the advantageous tax regime."
msgstr "如果您過去四年的平均收入超過此上限，將不再符合資格享有優惠稅制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2099
msgid ""
"**Ruling Request**: For greater clarity on the scope and remuneration of the"
" transfer of Author's Rights, an advanced agreement with the tax authorities"
" (referred to as a **ruling**) can be requested."
msgstr ""
"**裁定申請**：為更明確界定著作權轉讓的範圍及報酬，可向稅務機關申請預先協議（"
"稱為 **裁定**）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2104
msgid "Tax treatment of Author's Rights income"
msgstr "著作權收入的稅務處理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2106
msgid ""
"Since 2008, income from the transfer or licensing of Author's Rights has "
"benefited from a favorable tax treatment. Specifically, the income is "
"subject to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2109
msgid ""
"**15% Withholding Tax** up to an indexed ceiling of **70,220 EUR** (2023 "
"income year)."
msgstr "**15% 預扣稅**，按指數調整上限為 **70,220 歐元**（2023 收入年度）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2110
msgid "**Flat-Rate Deductions**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2112
msgid ""
"**50% flat-rate deduction** applies to the first **18,720 EUR** of income."
msgstr "首 **18,720 歐元** 收入適用 **50% 定額扣減**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2113
msgid ""
"**25% flat-rate deduction** applies to the next **18,730 EUR** (from "
"**18,720 EUR to 37,450 EUR**)."
msgstr ""
"**25% 定額扣減**適用於接下來的 **18,730 歐元**（由 **18,720 歐元至 37,450 歐"
"元**）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2116
msgid "Example of tax impact:"
msgstr "稅務影響範例："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2118
msgid ""
"For example, if a company director receives **10,000 EUR** in Author's "
"Rights income, they will pay **750 EUR** in tax (15% of the income after the"
" flat-rate deductions), leaving them with a net income of **9,250 EUR**. "
"This results in an effective tax rate of **7.5%** on the Author's Rights "
"income."
msgstr ""
"舉例來說，如果公司董事收取 **10,000 EUR** 的著作權收入，需繳納 **750 EUR** 的"
"稅款（定額扣除後收入的 15%），淨收入為 **9,250 EUR**。這相當於該筆著作權收入"
"的實際稅率為 **7.5%**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2124
msgid "Odoo integration for Declaration 273S"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2126
msgid ""
"Odoo users can efficiently manage the submission of the **273S Declaration**"
" for Author's Rights and Neighboring Rights income via the **Odoo Payroll** "
"module. Here's a quick overview of how this can be done:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo 用戶可透過 **Odoo 薪酬** 模組，高效管理著作權及鄰接權收入的 **273S 申"
"報** 提交事宜。以下為操作簡介："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2131
msgid "Set up Author's Rights in Odoo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2133
msgid ""
"On the employees form view, make sure the :guilabel:`Intellectual Property` "
"checkbox is enabled, and the allocated salary percentage is specified as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"在員工表單檢視中，請確保已啟用 :guilabel:`知識產權` 核取方塊，並同時指定所分"
"配的薪酬百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2136
msgid ""
"Once a payslip is generated, the :abbr:`IP (intellectual property)` part is "
"computed based on the intellectual property percentage and the gross salary."
" The tax is computed accordingly based on the revenue amount."
msgstr ""
"產生糧單後，:abbr:`IP（知識產權）`部分會根據知識產權百分比及總薪金計算。稅項"
"亦會根據相應的收入金額計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2140
msgid "Intellectual Property Payslip 1."
msgstr "知識產權薪資單 1。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2143
msgid "Intellectual Property Payslip 2."
msgstr "知識產權工資單 2。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2147
msgid "Generate the 273S form"
msgstr "產生 273S 表格"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2149
msgid ""
"Odoo can generate the 273S form automatically based on the income data "
"entered into the system. Ensure that all required details, including the "
"amount of income subject to the tax, are accurately entered."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 可根據輸入系統的收入資料自動生成 273S 表格。請確保準確輸入所有必要詳情，"
"包括應課稅收入金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2153
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting --> Belgium --> 273S "
"Sheet` to create a :guilabel:`New` record."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`薪酬管理應用程式 --> 報告 --> 比利時 --> 273S 申報表`，"
"以建立:guilabel:`新增`記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2156
msgid ""
"Select the reference :guilabel:`Year` and :guilabel:`Month`, then click "
":guilabel:`Export XML file` to generate the declaration. Click "
":guilabel:`Export PDF File` to generate the printed details."
msgstr ""
"選擇參考 :guilabel:`年份` 及 :guilabel:`月份`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`匯出 XML "
"檔案` 以產生申報表。點擊 :guilabel:`匯出 PDF 檔案` 以產生列印詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2159
msgid "273S Wizard File Generation."
msgstr "產生 273S 精靈檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2162
msgid ""
"On the first PDF section, the company information and the global declaration"
" is listed."
msgstr "PDF 第一部分會列出公司資料及整體聲明。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2164
msgid "273S PDF Company Info."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2167
msgid "On the second section, the employees specific information is listed."
msgstr "第二部分會列出員工的特定資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2169
msgid "273S PDF Employee Info."
msgstr "273S PDF 員工資料"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2173
msgid "File the 273S Declaration"
msgstr "提交 273S 申報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2175
msgid ""
"After generating the XML file, the company or the debtor of the income can "
"submit it to the tax authorities directly from MyMinfin. Keep track of the "
"filing and payment deadlines to ensure timely submission and compliance."
msgstr ""
"生成 XML 檔案後，公司或收入債務人可直接透過 MyMinfin 向稅務機關提交該檔案。請"
"留意申報及繳稅截止日期，以確保按時提交並符合法規要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2182
msgid ""
"The **273S Declaration** is an essential tool for companies and individuals "
"benefiting from the favorable tax regime on Author's Rights and Neighboring "
"Rights. By leveraging Odoo's tax management features, users can ensure "
"compliance while optimizing their tax liabilities."
msgstr ""
"**273S 申報表** 是公司及個人享用版權及鄰接權優惠稅制的重要工具。善用 Odoo 的"
"稅務管理功能，用戶既可確保合規，同時亦可優化稅務負擔。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2186
msgid "For further assistance, please consult a tax professional."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2191
msgid "Representation fees"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2196
msgid ""
"Representation fees must be **allocated on the payslip** between **serious "
"and non-serious representation costs**. By default, the threshold is set at "
"**€283.73**, but it can be adjusted based on what the company can **legally "
"justify**."
msgstr ""
"代表費用必須 **在薪酬單上分配**，區分為 **實質及非實質代表費用**。預設門檻設"
"為 **€283.73**，但可根據公司能夠 **合法證明** 的金額作調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2200
msgid ""
"The representation fees is configured on the employee's contract form in the"
" :guilabel:`Expense Fees` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2203
msgid ""
"On the payslip, two or one line are displayed in the case the representation"
" fees amount exceeds the threshold or not."
msgstr "在薪資單上，系統會視乎交際費金額是否超出上限，顯示兩行或一行項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2207
msgid "Breakdown of the threshold"
msgstr "門檻明細"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2209
msgid ""
"Only part of the representation costs are pro-rated because certain costs "
"are **fully covered** by the company. These fixed costs include:"
msgstr ""
"只有部分交際應酬費用會按比例計算，因為部分費用由公司**全額承擔**。這些固定費"
"用包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2212
msgid ""
"\\text{€}283.73\\text{ Total} = \\begin{cases}\n"
"+ \\text{ €148.73 (Tax, since 2021 - coronavirus)} \\\\\n"
"+ \\text{ €30 (Internet)} \\\\\n"
"+ \\text{ €25 (Phone)} \\\\\n"
"+ \\text{ €80 (Car management fees)} \\\\\n"
"\\end{cases}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{€}283.73\\text{ 總計} = \\begin{cases}\n"
"+ \\text{ €148.73 (稅項，自 2021 年起 - 冠狀病毒)} \\\\\n"
"+ \\text{ €30 (互聯網)} \\\\\n"
"+ \\text{ €25 (電話)} \\\\\n"
"+ \\text{ €80 (車輛管理費)} \\\\\n"
"\\end{cases}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2222
msgid ""
"The **serious portion** of the representation costs is **not prorated**, "
"while the **non-serious portion** is prorated based on working time."
msgstr ""
"業務招待費中的 **嚴重部分** **不會按比例計算**，而 **非嚴重部分** 則會按工作"
"時間比例計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2225
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Salary --> "
"Rule Parameters`, and search for the `CP200: Representation Fees Threshold` "
"record. Then, adapt the current value or introduce a new one from a given "
"date."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`薪酬管理應用程式 --> 配置 --> 薪酬 --> 規則參數`，並搜"
"尋 `CP200: Representation Fees Threshold` 記錄。然後，調整目前數值，或由指定"
"日期起引入新數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2229
msgid "Representation Fees Threshold."
msgstr "交際費門檻。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2233
msgid ""
"It is possible to define, based on job position, which jobs are eligible to "
"certain criteria in the :guilabel:`Payroll` tab."
msgstr "你可在:guilabel:`薪酬`分頁中，根據職位定義哪些職位符合特定條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2236
msgid "Representation Fees Job Position."
msgstr "代表費用職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2240
msgid "Calculation of representation fees"
msgstr "計算代表費"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2243
msgid "Conditions for payment"
msgstr "付款條件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2245
msgid "Representation fees are only granted if:"
msgstr "只有在以下情況下，才會發放業務代表津貼："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2247
msgid "The employee **receives a basic salary**, and"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2248
msgid ""
"The employee has **worked at least part of the time**, unless a **salary "
"simulation** is in progress."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2251
msgid ""
"If the employee is on **full leave** (without any working days), they are "
"**not eligible** for representation fees."
msgstr ""
"如果員工正放取 **全期休假**（沒有任何工作日），則 **不符合資格** 領取業務招待"
"費。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2255
msgid "Determining the work time rate"
msgstr "釐定工作時間比率"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2257
msgid ""
"The number of **working days per week** is extracted from the employee's "
"contract."
msgstr "**每週工作天數**是從員工的合約中擷取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2258
msgid ""
"If the employee has periods of **incapacity for work** (e.g., illness), the "
"calculation adjusts the **work time rate** accordingly:"
msgstr ""
"如果員工有**喪失工作能力**的期間（例如生病），計算會相應調整**工作時間比"
"率**："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2261
msgid "The total **incapacity hours** are determined."
msgstr "系統會釐定總 **喪失工作能力時數**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2262
msgid ""
"If the company follows a **biweekly schedule**, the incapacity hours are "
"divided by **two**."
msgstr "如果公司採用**雙週制**，喪失工作能力時數會除以**二**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2263
msgid "The incapacity **rate** is calculated as:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2265
msgid ""
"\\text{incapacity rate} = 1 - \\frac{\\text{incapacity hours}}{\\text{total "
"weekly hours}}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{喪失工作能力比率} = 1 - \\frac{\\text{喪失工作能力時數}}{\\text{每週總"
"工時}}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2270
msgid ""
"The **final work time rate** is then adjusted by multiplying it with the "
"incapacity rate."
msgstr "接著，系統會將 **最終工時比率** 乘以喪失工作能力比率以作調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2273
msgid "Applying the threshold and pro-rating rules"
msgstr "套用門檻及按比例計算規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2275
msgid ""
"The **default threshold (€283.73)** is applied unless adjusted by the "
"company."
msgstr "除非公司另行調整，否則系統會套用 **預設門檻（€283.73）**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2276
msgid ""
"If the employee has **worked a full-time schedule**, they receive the **full"
" representation fees** without reduction."
msgstr "如果員工**按全職更表工作**，即可獲得**全額交際津貼**，不作扣減。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2278
msgid ""
"If the employee works **part-time** (contractual or due to time credit), "
"only the **non-serious portion** of the fees is prorated."
msgstr ""
"若員工為**兼職**（合約規定或因工時信貸安排），則僅會按比例計算費用的**非重大"
"部分**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2281
msgid "The prorated formula for non-serious expenses is:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2283
msgid ""
"\\text{adjusted amount} = \\text{threshold} + (\\text{total fees} - \\text{threshold}) \\times\n"
"\\frac{\\text{work time rate}}{100}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{調整後金額} = \\text{門檻金額} + (\\text{總費用} - \\text{門檻金額}) "
"\\times\n"
"\\frac{\\text{工作時間比率}}{100}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2289
msgid ""
"If the employee has **missing workdays**, the final amount is further "
"adjusted:"
msgstr "如果員工有 **缺勤工作日**，最終金額將會進一步調整："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2291
msgid "First calculate the **daily reduction**:"
msgstr "首先計算 **每日扣減額**："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2293
msgid ""
"\\text{daily reduction} = \\frac{(\\text{total amount} - \\text{threshold}) "
"\\times 3}{13 \\times \\text{days per week}}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{每日扣減額} = \\frac{(\\text{總金額} - \\text{門檻}) \\times 3}{13 \\t"
"imes \\text{每週日數}}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2298
msgid "Then calculate the **final amount**:"
msgstr "然後計算 **最終金額**："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2300
msgid ""
"\\text{final amount} = max(0, \\text{total amount} - \\text{daily reduction} \\times\n"
"\\text{missing days})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2307
msgid "Final calculation"
msgstr "最終計算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2309
msgid ""
"If the employee meets all conditions, the final representation fees amount "
"is **rounded to two decimal places** for payroll purposes."
msgstr ""
"如員工符合所有條件，最終的業務代表津貼金額會 **四捨五入至小數點後兩位**，以作"
"發薪計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2311
msgid ""
"Employees working a full schedule receive **full reimbursement**, while "
"those working **reduced hours** have the **non-serious portion prorated** "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2317
msgid ""
"This calculation ensures **fair allocation** of representation fees by "
"distinguishing between **fixed serious costs** and **prorated non-serious "
"costs**. The company can adjust the **threshold (€283.73 by default)** based"
" on **justifiable business expenses**."
msgstr ""
"此計算方式透過區分 **固定重大開支** 與 **按比例計算的非重大開支**，確保交際費"
"能 **公平分配**。公司可根據 **合理業務開支** 調整 **門檻金額（預設為 €283.73"
"）**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2321
msgid ""
"Employees working **full-time** receive their full representation fees, "
"while those working **part-time or with absences** only receive a **pro-"
"rated portion** of the non-serious fees."
msgstr ""
"**全職** 工作的員工可獲得全額代表津貼，而 **兼職或缺勤** 的員工則只會獲得非主"
"要費用的 **按比例部分**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2327
msgid "Sick time off and relapse"
msgstr "病假及復發"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2329
msgid "In Belgium, sick leave is managed according to two main regimes:"
msgstr "在比利時，病假主要按兩種制度管理："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2331
msgid ""
"**With guaranteed salary**: The employer continues to pay the worker's "
"salary for a specified period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2333
msgid ""
"**Without guaranteed salary**: The worker receives benefits from the mutual "
"insurance company after the guaranteed salary period."
msgstr "**無保證薪金**：在保證薪金期結束後，員工會從互助保險公司領取津貼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2337
msgid "Sick leave with guaranteed salary"
msgstr "保證支薪病假"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2339
msgid ""
"The guaranteed salary is a period during which the employer continues to pay"
" the salary of the worker who is unable to work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2342
msgid ""
"**Employees**: The employer pays 100% of the salary during the first full "
"month of incapacity. After this period, if the incapacity continues, the "
"worker falls under the mutual insurance regime."
msgstr ""
"**員工**：僱主須於僱員喪失工作能力的首個完整月份內支付 100% 薪金。在此期間後"
"，若僱員仍未恢復工作能力，則轉由互助保險制度承保。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2346
msgid "Sick leave without guaranteed salary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2348
msgid ""
"After the guaranteed salary period, the ONEM (National Employment Office) or"
" the mutual insurance company takes over."
msgstr "在保證薪酬期結束後，將由 ONEM（國家就業辦公室）或互助保險公司接手。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2351
msgid ""
"**Long-term illness**: An incapacity lasting more than 30 days leads to "
"benefits from the mutual insurance company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2353
msgid ""
"**Relapse**: If a worker returns to work and then becomes ill again for the "
"same reason within 14 days, this may be considered a relapse, and the rules "
"for guaranteed salary may be adjusted."
msgstr ""
"**復發**：如果員工復工後在 14 天內因同一原因再次患病，這可能被視為復發，而保"
"證薪資的規則亦可能會作相應調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2357
msgid "Management in Odoo"
msgstr "在 Odoo 中管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2359
msgid ""
"In Odoo, sick leave is automatically managed if the absences are related to "
"the *Sick Time Off* work entry type."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中，如果缺勤與 *病假* 工作記錄類型相關，系統會自動管理病假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2362
msgid ""
"**Recording time off**: The employee records their absence through the "
"**Time Off** module."
msgstr "**記錄休假**：員工透過 **休假** 模組記錄其缺勤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2363
msgid ""
"**Automation of work entries**: If the request is approved, Odoo "
"automatically generates the corresponding Work Entries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2365
msgid ""
"**Impact on payroll**: The guaranteed salary is automatically calculated "
"according to the rules configured based on the worker's status (employee)."
msgstr "**對薪酬計算的影響**：保證薪金會根據依工作者身份（員工）設定的規則自動計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2367
msgid ""
"**Compensation after the guaranteed salary**: Once the guaranteed salary "
"period has expired, Odoo adjusts the Work Entries to reflect the transition "
"to the mutual insurance company."
msgstr ""
"**保證薪酬期後的補償**：保證薪酬期屆滿後，Odoo 會調整工作記錄，以反映轉由互助"
"保險公司負責的情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2370
msgid ""
"Thus, Odoo ensures a smooth and compliant management of sick leave according"
" to Belgian regulations."
msgstr "因此，Odoo 能確保按照比利時法規，順暢且合規地管理病假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2375
msgid "Social Balance Sheet"
msgstr "社會資產負債表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2380
msgid ""
"The *Social Balance Sheet* was introduced by the law of December 22, 1995, "
"as part of measures for the implementation of the multi-year employment "
"plan. Companies required to file annual accounts (including some that are "
"not obligated to publish such accounts - see the `National Bank of Belgium "
"website <https://www.nbb.be>`_ for details) must also prepare and submit a "
"Social Balance Sheet to the National Bank of Belgium."
msgstr ""
"*社會資產負債表* 由 1995 年 12 月 22 日的法律引入，作為實施多年期就業計劃的措"
"施之一。須提交年度賬目的公司（包括部分毋須公開該等賬目的公司，詳情請參閱 `比"
"利時國家銀行網站 <https://www.nbb.be>`_）亦必須編製並向比利時國家銀行提交社會"
"資產負債表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2386
msgid ""
"The Royal Decree of August 4, 1996, incorporates the Social Balance Sheet "
"into the annual accounts, specifically as an annex. This makes it an "
"integral part of a company's financial statements."
msgstr ""
"1996 年 8 月 4 日頒布的皇家法令將《社會資產負債表》納入年度賬目中，並作為專屬"
"附件，使其成為公司財務報表不可或缺的一部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2390
msgid "Contents of the Social Balance Sheet"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2392
msgid ""
"The content of the Social Balance Sheet is determined by the Royal Decree of"
" January 30, 2001, implementing the Company Code. The Social Balance Sheet "
"consists of several sections:"
msgstr ""
"社會資產負債表的內容由 2001 年 1 月 30 日實施《公司法典》的皇家法令規定。社會"
"資產負債表包含以下數個部分："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2395
msgid ""
"Sections I and II: Information on employed persons and personnel movements "
"during the fiscal year."
msgstr "第一及第二部分：財政年度內的受僱人員及人事變動資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2396
msgid "Section III: Initiatives related to training."
msgstr "第 III 部分：培訓相關措施。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2398
msgid ""
"Since the Social Balance Sheet is part of a company's annual accounts, the "
"works council receives this information as part of its mission regarding "
"economic and financial information."
msgstr ""
"由於社會資產負債表屬於公司年度財務報表的一部分，勞資委員會會根據其在經濟及財"
"務資訊方面的職責接收此資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2401
msgid ""
"Additionally, the works council receives data on employment-related benefits"
" along with annual employment-related information (Trillium). These details "
"were fully integrated into the Social Balance Sheet until 2008."
msgstr ""
"此外，職工委員會會收到有關僱傭相關福利的資料，連同年度僱傭相關資訊（Trillium"
"）。這些詳細資料直至 2008 年一直完全整合於社會資產負債表中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2406
msgid "Scope of the Social Balance Sheet"
msgstr "社會平衡表的適用範圍"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2408
msgid ""
"The Social Balance Sheet contains specific data related to workforce "
"composition, staff turnover, and training programs. Some organizations not "
"required to publish annual accounts must still file a separate Social "
"Balance Sheet. This applies primarily to certain hospitals and private legal"
" entities employing at least 20 full-time equivalents (FTEs)."
msgstr ""
"社會資產負債表包含與員工結構、人員流動率及培訓計劃相關的特定數據。部分無須公"
"佈年度賬目的機構，仍須單獨提交社會資產負債表。這主要適用於特定醫院及僱用至少 "
"20 名全職等值員工（FTE）的私人法人實體。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2413
msgid ""
"Any company, association, or foundation with at least 20 workers on an "
"annual average (in FTE) must complete and submit the Social Balance Sheet."
msgstr ""
"任何年平均僱員人數（以全職等值計算）達 20 名或以上的公司、協會或基金會，均須"
"填寫並提交社會資產負債表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2416
msgid "The Social Balance Sheet is part of:"
msgstr "社會資產負債表屬於以下項目的一部分："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2418
msgid ""
"\"Other documents to be filed under the Company and Associations Code\" (for"
" companies);"
msgstr "「根據《公司及協會法典》須存檔的其他文件」（適用於公司）；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2419
msgid "\"Explanatory Notes\" (for associations and foundations)."
msgstr "「說明附註」（適用於協會及基金會）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2422
msgid "Obligations by entity type"
msgstr "按實體類型劃分的責任"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2425
msgid ""
"Companies, associations, and foundations required to publish a Social "
"Balance Sheet"
msgstr "須發佈社會資產負債表的公司、協會及基金會"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2427
msgid "For Belgian companies employing at least one FTE:"
msgstr "對於僱用至少一名全職等值員工（FTE）的比利時公司："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2429
msgid ""
"**Standardized model**: This schema includes a \"Social Balance Sheet\" "
"section, which must be completed."
msgstr "**標準化模式**：此架構包含「社會資產負債表」部分，必須填寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2431
msgid ""
"**Specific model**: If the model used does not include a Social Balance "
"Sheet, it must be provided separately."
msgstr "**特定模型**：若所使用的模型未包含社會資產負債表，則必須另行提供。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2434
msgid "For Belgian associations and foundations employing at least 20 FTEs:"
msgstr "對於僱用至少 20 名全職等值員工（FTE）的比利時協會及基金會："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2436
msgid ""
"**Standard model**: Includes a \"Social Balance Sheet\" section that must be"
" completed."
msgstr "**標準模型**：包含必須填寫的「社會資產負債表」部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2437
msgid ""
"**Specific model**: A separate Social Balance Sheet must be submitted if the"
" chosen model does not include one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2440
msgid ""
"Associations and foundations with fewer than 20 FTEs may voluntarily "
"complete the Social Balance Sheet but are not legally required to do so."
msgstr ""
"全職等值員工少於 20 名的協會及基金會可自願填寫社會平衡表，但法律上並無規定必"
"須填寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2443
msgid ""
"For foreign companies, such as branches of foreign corporations and foreign "
"non-profit organizations (ASBL) with activities in Belgium, the Social "
"Balance Sheet applies only to their Belgian operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2447
msgid ""
"The Social Balance Sheet is made publicly available by the Central Balance "
"Sheet Office as part of the financial statements submission."
msgstr "「社會資產負債表」作為財務報表提交的一部分，由中央資產負債表辦公室公開發佈。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2451
msgid "Entities required to file a separate Social Balance Sheet"
msgstr "須提交獨立社會資產負債表的實體"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2453
msgid ""
"Certain organizations that do not need to publish annual accounts must still"
" submit a Social Balance Sheet to the Central Balance Sheet Office. This "
"data is used exclusively for statistical purposes and is not made publicly "
"available. Submission in these cases is free of charge."
msgstr ""
"某些無需公佈年度賬目的機構，仍須向中央資產負債表辦公室提交社會資產負債表。該"
"等資料僅作統計用途，不會對外公開。在此情況下提交無需收費。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2457
msgid "This exception applies to:"
msgstr "此例外情況適用於："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2459
msgid ""
"**Hospitals**, unless they are structured as limited liability companies or "
"large ASBLs, which must submit full financial statements, including the "
"integrated Social Balance Sheet."
msgstr ""
"**醫院**，除非其架構為有限公司或大型非牟利組織（ASBL），在此情況下必須提交完"
"整財務報表，當中包括綜合社會資產負債表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2461
msgid ""
"**Private legal entities** that are not required to submit annual accounts "
"but have at least 20 employees."
msgstr "無須提交年度賬目但至少僱有 20 名員工的 **私營法律實體**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2464
msgid "The required model depends on the entity type:"
msgstr "所需模型取決於實體類型："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2466
msgid ""
"**Hospitals** must use the full or abridged Social Balance Sheet model based"
" on their size."
msgstr "**醫院**必須根據其規模，使用完整版或簡略版的社會資產負債表模型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2467
msgid ""
"**Foreign entities** must use the full or abridged Social Balance Sheet "
"model, based on the size of their Belgian establishments."
msgstr ""
"**外國實體** 必須根據其比利時機構的規模，使用完整版或簡略版社會資產負債表範本"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2469
msgid ""
"**Private legal entities** with at least 50 employees must use the full "
"model, while those with 20-49 employees may use the abridged model."
msgstr ""
"僱用至少 50 名員工的 **私營法律實體** 必須使用完整模式，而僱用 20 至 49 名員"
"工的則可使用簡化模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2473
msgid "Social Balance Sheet models"
msgstr "社會資產負債表模型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2475
msgid ""
"The latest versions of the Social Balance Sheet models can be found at the "
"following links:"
msgstr "最新版本的社會資產負債表範本可於以下連結瀏覽："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2477
msgid "**Full Model**"
msgstr "**完整模型**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2479
msgid ""
"PDF: `Full Social Balance Sheet PDF "
"<https://www.nbb.be/doc/ba/models/social%20balance/release_2021_fr_bilan_social_c_20121201.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
"PDF：`完整社會資產負債表 PDF <https://www.nbb.be/doc/ba/models/"
"social%20balance/release_2021_fr_bilan_social_c_20121201.pdf>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2480
msgid ""
"Word: `Full Social Balance Sheet Word "
"<https://www.nbb.be/doc/ba/models/social%20balance/release_2021_fr_bilan_social_c_20121201.docx>`_"
msgstr ""
"Word：`完整社會資產負債表 Word 文件 <https://www.nbb.be/doc/ba/models/"
"social%20balance/release_2021_fr_bilan_social_c_20121201.docx>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2482
msgid "**Abridged Model**"
msgstr "**簡化模型**"

