#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2585
msgid "Legal time off"
msgstr "法定休假"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2587
msgid ""
"This guide provides an overview of the basic rules governing legal holiday "
"entitlements in Belgium for employers using Odoo."
msgstr "本指南為使用 Odoo 的僱主概述比利時法定假期權益的基本規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2591
msgid "Holiday entitlement calculation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2593
msgid ""
"Your holiday entitlement for the current year (N) is determined by the "
"number of months worked in Belgium during the previous year (N-1)."
msgstr "您於本年度（N）的假期配額，取決於上一年度（N-1）在比利時工作的月數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2596
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2627
msgid "**Calculation details:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2598
msgid ""
"Employees earn **2 days of leave per month** based on a 6-day work week."
msgstr "按每週工作 6 天計算，僱員每月可獲得 **2 天假期**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2599
msgid ""
"The entitlement is adjusted for a 5-day work week: :math:`(\\text{Total "
"Days} \\div 6) \\times 5`."
msgstr ""
"可享日數會按每週 5 天工作制調整：:math:`(\\text{Total Days} \\div 6) \\times "
"5`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2602
msgid "If an employee worked **7 months** in the previous year (N-1):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2604
msgid "**6-day work week:** :math:`7 \\times 2 = 14 \\text{ days}`"
msgstr "**6 天工作週：** :math:`7 \\times 2 = 14 \\text{ days}`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2605
msgid "**5-day work week:** :math:`14 \\div 6 \\times 5 = 11.67 \\text{ days}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2607
msgid "**Partial Month Calculation:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2609
msgid "Worked **1st to 10th**: Full month counted."
msgstr "工作 **1 日至 10 日**：按整月計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2610
msgid "Worked **11th to 19th**: Half month counted."
msgstr "於 **11 日至 19 日** 工作：按半個月計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2611
msgid "Worked **20th onwards**: Month not counted."
msgstr "於 **20 日起**工作：該月不予計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2613
msgid "**Rounding Rules:**"
msgstr "**捨入規則：**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2615
msgid "Less than **0.35**: Round to **0**."
msgstr "少於 **0.35**：捨入至 **0**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2616
msgid "Between **0.35 - 0.74**: Round to **0.5**."
msgstr "介乎 **0.35 - 0.74**：約整至 **0.5**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2617
msgid "**0.75 and above**: Round to **1**."
msgstr "**0.75 及以上**：四捨五入至 **1**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2619
msgid ""
"For a full-time employee, this typically results in **11.5 days of legal "
"holiday** entitlement."
msgstr "對全職員工而言，這通常相當於 **11.5 天法定假期** 的權益。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2622
msgid "Maximum holiday entitlement"
msgstr "最高假期配額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2624
msgid ""
"Employees are entitled to a maximum of **4 weeks** of holiday based on their"
" working schedule. If an employee switches between full-time and part-time "
"work, their entitlement is adjusted accordingly."
msgstr ""
"員工根據其工作時間表，最多可享有 **4 星期** 的假期。如果員工在全職和兼職工作"
"之間切換，其假期權益將作相應調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2629
msgid "**5-day work week**: :math:`4 \\times 5 = 20 \\text{ days}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2630
msgid "**4-day work week**: :math:`4 \\times 4 = 16 \\text{ days}`"
msgstr "**4 天工作週**：:math:`4 \\times 4 = 16 \\text{ days}`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2631
msgid "**3-day work week**: :math:`4 \\times 3 = 12 \\text{ days}`"
msgstr "**3 天工作週**：:math:`4 \\times 3 = 12 \\text{ days}`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2634
msgid ""
"If an employee joined **Odoo on January 1, 2024**, and plans to switch to a "
"**3-day work week from April 1, 2024**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2637
msgid "**Step 1: Calculate holiday entitlement for 2024**"
msgstr "**步驟 1：計算 2024 年的假期配額**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2639
msgid "The employee worked **9 months in 2023**."
msgstr "該僱員在 **2023 年工作了 9 個月**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2640
msgid "**6-day work week basis**: :math:`9 \\times 2 = 18 \\text{ days}`"
msgstr "**每星期 6 天工作制**：:math:`9 \\times 2 = 18 \\text{ days}`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2641
msgid ""
"Adjusted for **5-day work week**: :math:`18 \\div 6 \\times 5 = 15 \\text{ "
"days}`"
msgstr "按 **5 天工作週** 調整： :math:`18 \\div 6 \\times 5 = 15 \\text{ days}`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2643
msgid "**Step 2: Verify maximum holiday entitlement**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2645
msgid "For a **5-day work week**, the maximum entitlement is **20 days**."
msgstr "如屬 **5 天工作週**，最高配額為 **20 天**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2646
msgid ""
"Since the employee is entitled to **15 days**, they remain within the limit."
msgstr "由於員工享有 **15 天**假期，因此仍在上限之內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2648
msgid "**Step 3: Adjust entitlement for the new work schedule**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2650
msgid "From April 1, 2024, the employee moves to a **3-day work week**."
msgstr "自 2024 年 4 月 1 日起，該員工轉為 **3 天工作週**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2651
msgid ""
"Maximum entitlement for a **3-day work week**: :math:`3 \\times 4 = 12 "
"\\text{ days}`."
msgstr "**3 天工作週**的最高假期額度：:math:`3 \\times 4 = 12 \\text{ days}`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2652
msgid ""
"If no leave is taken before April 1, the employee may take up to **12 days**"
" from their 15-day entitlement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2654
msgid "The **remaining 3 days** will be settled at the end of the year."
msgstr "**餘下的 3 天** 將於年底結算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2656
msgid ""
"This ensures compliance with Belgian legal leave regulations and allows "
"employers to manage holiday entitlements effectively within Odoo."
msgstr "這可確保符合比利時的法定休假規定，並讓僱主在 Odoo 內有效管理假期配額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2660
msgid "Legal time off allocation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2662
msgid ""
"This is possible to generate the legal time off for all your employees at "
"the beginning of a new year using the wizard in :menuselection:`Payroll app "
"--> Reporting --> Belgium --> Paid Time Off Allocation`."
msgstr ""
"您可以在新年伊始，使用位於:menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 報表 --> 比利"
"時 --> 有薪休假分配`的精靈工具，為所有員工產生法定休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2666
msgid ""
"Based on your employees occupation over last year, the number of available "
"time off is pre-computed for each employee."
msgstr "系統會根據員工去年的在職情況，預先計算每位員工的可用休假配額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2669
msgid "Paid Time Off Allocation Wizard."
msgstr "有薪休假分配精靈。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2672
msgid ""
"Once validated, a draft allocation is generated for each single employee, "
"waiting a manual confirmation that can be done in batch."
msgstr "驗證後，系統會為每位員工產生一份分配草稿，等待手動確認（可批次處理）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2675
msgid "Paid Time Off Allocations."
msgstr "有薪休假分配。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2681
msgid "European time off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2684
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2916
msgid "How does it work?"
msgstr "如何運作？"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2686
msgid ""
"If you were not subject to Belgian ONSS contributions before joining our "
"company and do not have entitlement to legal holidays, or if your "
"entitlement is incomplete, you can apply for European leave."
msgstr ""
"如果您在加入本公司前無須繳納比利時 ONSS 供款，且未享有法定假期或假期權益不完"
"整，您可以申請歐洲假期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2690
msgid ""
"To qualify for European leave in a given year, you must work for at least 3 "
"months during that year, whether with us or another employer. Once you have "
"met this requirement, you will earn 5 days of European leave. Subsequently, "
"you will accumulate additional days of vacation each month as follows:"
msgstr ""
"要在特定年份符合資格享有歐洲假期，你必須在該年工作至少 3 個月（不論是在本公司"
"或其他僱主處工作）。達到此要求後，你將獲得 5 天歐洲假期。其後，你每月可累積的"
"額外假期天數如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2694
msgid "After 3 months: 5 days"
msgstr "滿 3 個月後：5 天"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2695
msgid "After 4 months: 7 days"
msgstr "4 個月後：7 天"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2696
msgid "After 5 months: 9 days"
msgstr "5 個月後：9 日"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2697
msgid "After 6 months: 10 days"
msgstr "6 個月後：10 天"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2698
msgid "After 7 months: 12 days"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2699
msgid "After 8 months: 14 days"
msgstr "8 個月後：14 天"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2700
msgid "After 9 months: 15 days"
msgstr "9 個月後：15 日"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2701
msgid "After 10 months: 17 days"
msgstr "10 個月後：17 天"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2702
msgid "After 11 months: 19 days"
msgstr "11 個月後：19 天"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2705
msgid ""
"The total of legal leave and European leave cannot exceed 20 days per year. "
"You must use all your legal holidays before taking European leave."
msgstr ""
"法定假期與歐洲假期的總日數每年不可超過 20 天。放取歐洲假期前，必須先用完所有"
"法定假期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2708
msgid ""
"European leave entitlement expires on December 31st of the year it is earned"
" and cannot be carried over to the following year. To qualify for European "
"leave in a new year, you must complete another 3 months of work."
msgstr ""
"歐洲假期配額於獲得該年 12 月 31 日到期，不可結轉至下一年。要在新一年獲得歐洲"
"假期資格，必須再完成 3 個月的工作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2713
msgid "How are these days paid?"
msgstr "這些天數如何支薪？"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2715
msgid ""
"European leaves are paid holidays taken in advance of your \"Double Holiday "
"Pay\" (the June extra pay) for the following year. Essentially, the more "
"European leave days you take in a given year, the less you will receive as "
"June extra pay in the following year."
msgstr ""
"歐洲假期是預支來年「雙倍假期工資」（6 月額外薪金）的有薪假期。簡單來說，您在"
"某一年所放取的歐洲假期日數越多，來年 6 月收到的額外薪金便會越少。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2722
msgid "Working schedule change"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2724
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to modify an employee's working time schedule in the"
" Belgian payroll module of Odoo. Changing an employee's working hours "
"affects their wage calculation, time-off allocation, and contract terms."
msgstr ""
"本指南說明如何在 Odoo 的比利時薪酬模組中修改僱員的工作時間表。變更僱員的工作"
"時數會影響其工資計算、休假配額及合約條款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2729
msgid "Steps to change an employee's working schedule"
msgstr "更改員工工作時間表的步驟"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2731
msgid ""
"Navigate to the employee's contract (:menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Contracts`), and select the contract of the employee whose working schedule "
"you want to modify."
msgstr ""
"前往員工的合約（:menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 合約`），並選擇您要修改工作"
"時間表的員工合約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2733
msgid ""
"Click on :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Action)` and select :guilabel:`Working "
"Schedule Change`. The wizard displays the current contract details and "
"allows you to set new working time parameters."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（操作）` 並選擇 :guilabel:`更改工作時間表`。"
"精靈會顯示目前的合約詳情，並讓你設定新的工作時間參數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2735
msgid "Set the new working schedule:"
msgstr "設定新的工作時間表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2737
msgid ""
"Choose the new :guilabel:`Working Schedule` from the available resource "
"calendars."
msgstr "從可用的資源行事曆中選擇新的 :guilabel:`工作時間表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2738
msgid "Define the :guilabel:`Start Date` for the change (mandatory)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2739
msgid "If applicable, specify an :guilabel:`End Date`."
msgstr "如適用，請指定 :guilabel:`結束日期`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2740
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Part Time` checkbox is selected, any difference between "
"the reference calendar and the employee's new calendar will be covered using"
" the *Absence Work Entry Type*. This ensures that the employee's monthly "
"salary remains the same, regardless of the number of absence days in a given"
" month. This setup is required for configuring *Time Credit*, *Parental "
"Leave*, or *Medical Half-Time* correctly."
msgstr ""
"如果已勾選 :guilabel:`兼職` 核取方塊，參考行事曆與員工新行事曆之間的任何差異"
"，都會使用 *缺勤工作項目類型* 填補。這可確保無論某個月內的缺勤日數有多少，員"
"工的月薪都能保持不變。此設定是正確配置 *時間抵免*、*育嬰假* 或 *醫療半職假* "
"的必要條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2746
msgid "Adjust the employee's wage:"
msgstr "調整員工工資："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2748
msgid ""
"The wizard automatically computes the full-time equivalent wage based on the"
" new working schedule."
msgstr "精靈會根據新的工作時間表自動計算全職等值工資。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2750
msgid "You can review and modify the new wage if necessary."
msgstr "如有需要，您可以檢視及修改新工資。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2752
msgid "Manage time off allocation:"
msgstr "管理休假配額："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2754
msgid "Select the relevant :guilabel:`Time Off Type`."
msgstr "選取相關的 :guilabel:`休假類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2755
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically adjusts the employee's time-off entitlement based on the "
"new working schedule using the following formula:"
msgstr "Odoo 會根據新的工作時間表，使用以下公式自動調整員工的休假配額："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2758
msgid ""
"\\text{New Time Off Allocation} = \\max(\\min(\\text{ Computed Allocation},\n"
"\\text{ Max Allocation}) + \\text{ Leaves Taken}, \\text{ Leaves Taken})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2764
msgid ""
"**Computed Allocation** is the expected leave allocation based on the new "
"schedule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2765
msgid ""
"**Max Allocation** is the maximum number of days allowed under the new "
"working time."
msgstr "**配額上限**是在新工作時間下允許的最大天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2766
msgid ""
"**Leaves Taken** ensures the employee does not receive fewer days than "
"already used."
msgstr "**已休假期** 可確保員工獲得的天數不少於已使用的天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2768
msgid "Decide on a follow-up contract"
msgstr "決定後續合約"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2770
msgid ""
"If the working time change is temporary, you can enable :guilabel:`Post "
"Change Contract Creation` to automatically create a contract that resumes "
"the previous working schedule after the specified end date."
msgstr ""
"如工作時間變更屬暫時性質，你可啟用 :guilabel:`變更後建立合約`，以在指定結束日"
"期後自動建立恢復原有工作時間表的合約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2774
msgid "Validate the changes"
msgstr "驗證變更"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2776
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Validate` to apply the new working schedule."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`驗證` 以套用新的工作時間表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2777
msgid ""
"If the new schedule is the same as the current one, an error will be "
"displayed."
msgstr "如果新時間表與目前時間表相同，系統將會顯示錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2778
msgid ""
"The system will create a new contract with the updated working time and "
"wage."
msgstr "系統將會建立一份包含已更新工作時間及工資的新合約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2779
msgid ""
"If a previous contract existed, it will be closed with an end date before "
"the new contract begins."
msgstr "如先前已有合約，該合約將會結束，其結束日期會早於新合約的開始日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2783
msgid "Result"
msgstr "結果"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2785
msgid "The employee's new working schedule is recorded."
msgstr "僱員的新工作時間表已記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2786
msgid "Wage and time-off entitlements are adjusted accordingly."
msgstr "薪酬及休假權益會相應調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2787
msgid "A follow-up contract is created if applicable."
msgstr "如適用，系統會建立後續合約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2789
msgid "Working Schedule Change New Contracts."
msgstr "更改工作時間表的新合約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2795
msgid "Work entries exports"
msgstr "工時記錄匯出"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2798
msgid "What are work entries?"
msgstr "什麼是工作紀錄？"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2800
msgid ""
"In the context of payroll, *work entries* typically refer to records or "
"documentation related to an employee's work hours and earnings for a "
"specific pay period. These entries are crucial for accurately calculating "
"and processing employee compensation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2804
msgid ""
"Work entries in the context of payroll are essential for both employees and "
"employers. They provide a transparent and accurate record of an employee's "
"compensation and deductions, ensuring that employees are paid correctly and "
"that tax and legal requirements are met. Payroll software and systems are "
"commonly used to manage and automate these work entries, making the payroll "
"process more efficient and accurate."
msgstr ""
"在薪酬管理中，工作記錄對員工和僱主均至關重要。它們能透明且準確地記錄員工的薪"
"酬與扣款項目，確保員工獲得正確薪資，並符合稅務及法律要求。企業通常會使用薪酬"
"軟件和系統來管理及自動化處理這些工作記錄，令支薪流程更有效率及更準確。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2811
msgid "Main concepts"
msgstr "主要概念"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2814
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2816
msgid ""
"In Odoo, work entries mainly refer to *time entries* (attendance tracking), "
"these are work entries that consist of time records, which include the "
"number of hours worked by an employee during a given pay period. These "
"entries may specify regular working hours, overtime hours, and any other "
"relevant time-related information, such as breaks, paid time off, unpaid "
"time off, parental leave, credit-time, etc."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，工作記錄主要是指 *工時記錄*（考勤追蹤）。這些工作記錄由時間紀錄組"
"成，當中包含員工在指定支薪期內的工作時數。這些記錄可列明正常工時、加班時數，"
"以及任何其他相關的工時資訊，例如休息時間、有薪休假、無薪休假、育兒假、工時信"
"貸等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2822
msgid ""
"Work entries serve a dual role in payroll management. First, they enable "
"organizations to independently compute employee payslips. Second, they "
"facilitate the transmission of pertinent data to external payroll service "
"providers, who then use this information to calculate and generate the "
"payslips."
msgstr ""
"工作項目在薪酬管理中發揮雙重作用。首先，企業可透過工作項目自行計算員工糧單。"
"其次，工作項目有助將相關資料傳送至外部薪酬服務供應商，讓對方使用該等資料計算"
"並製作糧單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2830
msgid ""
"They have a Name: used to identify the type of entry (e.g., Attendance, Paid"
" Time Off, etc.)."
msgstr "這類記錄設有名稱：用於識別記項類型（例如：出勤、有薪休假等）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2831
msgid "They have a Payroll Code: used in Odoo's salary rules computations"
msgstr "它們設有薪酬代碼：用於 Odoo 薪資規則的計算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2832
msgid ""
"They have an External Code: used to provide the correct Work Entry code to "
"an external payroll service provider."
msgstr "它們設有外部代碼：用於向外部薪酬服務供應商提供正確的工作記錄代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2834
msgid ""
"They are generated based on the configuration of the contract and the time "
"off types"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2835
msgid ""
"They have a duration, a start and end date, a state and are always linked to"
" an employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2838
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:219
msgid "Work entry types"
msgstr "工作項目類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2840
msgid ""
"They are the main source of configuration for your work entries. Thanks to "
"your different types of work entries, you'll be able to differentiate the "
"time records of your employees."
msgstr ""
"它們是配置工作項目的主要來源。透過不同類型的工作項目，你便能區分員工的工時紀"
"錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2842
msgid "They have a name."
msgstr "它們設有名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2843
msgid ""
"They contain a code, external code, payroll code and a color for visual "
"tracking."
msgstr "它們包含代碼、外部代碼、薪酬代碼，以及用於視覺追蹤的顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2844
msgid ""
"They allow other types of configurations such as how they are displayed in "
"payslips, decide whether this type of work entry should be considered as "
"paid or unpaid (eg. unpaid leave), decide whether this type of work entry "
"has a link with time off, is valid for some advantages or how it should be "
"reflected in your reporting."
msgstr ""
"這類設定支援其他進階配置，例如決定工作記錄在薪酬單上的顯示方式、將該類工作記"
"錄界定為有薪或無薪（例如無薪假）、設定是否與休假關聯、是否適用於特定福利，以"
"及應如何在報表中反映。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2850
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:13
msgid "Time off types"
msgstr "休假類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2852
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, since work entry types can be linked to a time off type,"
" you are also able to define the work entry type for each time-off type. On "
"the time off type you have a many2one relation with the work entry type."
msgstr ""
"如上所述，由於工作記錄類型可連結至休假類型，您亦可為每種休假類型定義工作記錄"
"類型。在休假類型中，設有與工作記錄類型的多對一（many2one）關聯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2857
msgid "Steps to generate the work entries of your staff"
msgstr "為員工產生工作記錄的步驟"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2859
msgid "Create all the employees"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2860
msgid ""
"Create a contract and set its status to :guilabel:`Running` for each "
"employee."
msgstr "為每位員工建立合約，並將其狀態設為 :guilabel:`進行中`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2862
msgid ""
"In the contract, choose the :guilabel:`Work Entry Source`. It tells the "
"system how work entries for an employee should be generated. It can be based"
" on:"
msgstr ""
"在合約中，選擇 :guilabel:`工作記錄來源`。此設定告知系統應如何為員工產生工作記"
"錄，可基於："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2865
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Schedule`: Odoo uses the predefined working hours and "
"days set in the employee's working schedule to generate work entries. This "
"is useful for regular, predictable shifts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作時間表`：Odoo 會使用員工工作時間表中預設的工作時數和工作日數來"
"產生工作記錄。這適用於固定且可預測的班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2868
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attendances`: Work entries are generated from the employee's "
"attendance records (i.e., when they check-in and check-out)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`考勤`：工作記項會根據員工的考勤記錄（即簽到及簽退時間）生成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2870
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Planning`: Work entries are created based on the validated shifts"
" or slots allocated to the employee in the **Planning** app (often used for "
"scheduling roles like retail shifts, restaurants, etc.)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`規劃`：工作條目會根據員工在 **規劃** 應用程式中獲分配並已驗證的更"
"次或時段而建立（通常用於零售更次、餐廳等排班角色）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2874
msgid "Generate the work entries each month"
msgstr "每月產生工作記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2876
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically creates the work entries in the **Payroll** app based on "
"the work entry source of the contract and the different time-offs taken. You"
" can edit the work entries manually. You can always decide to regenerate "
"work entries manually but be careful if you already made some manual "
"changes, Odoo will regenerate the work entries based on what it knows (e.g.,"
" your working schedule and time off)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會根據合約的工作項目來源及已申請的各類休假，自動在 **薪酬** 應用程式建立"
"工作項目。你可以手動編輯這些工作項目。你亦可隨時手動重新產生工作項目，但請注"
"意：如果你曾作出任何手動修改，Odoo 將會根據系統已知資料（例如你的工作時間表及"
"休假記錄）重新產生工作項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2881
msgid "Managing conflicts"
msgstr "管理衝突"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2883
msgid ""
"Conflicts are pointing to entries that can't be validated without your "
"intervention. This means you'll have to qualify the entry and decide which "
"is the correct entry to be defined for the time period if you want to be "
"able to generate the payslip or validate the entries. Conflicts arise when "
"there are overlapping entries or when Odoo detects that there is a time off "
"request still pending for validation. For instance, if an employee is marked"
" as attending work and at the same time there's a paid leave request to be "
"validated for the same period, that's a conflict."
msgstr ""
"衝突指向未經您介入便無法驗證的項目。這表示如果您想生成糧單或驗證項目，就必須"
"審核該項目，並決定該時段應定義哪個為正確項目。當出現重疊項目，或 Odoo 偵測到"
"仍有休假申請尚待驗證時，便會產生衝突。例如，若員工在同一時段既被標記為出勤工"
"作，同時又有待驗證的有薪假期申請，這便構成衝突。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2890
msgid ""
"Conflicts can be managed by filtering on the conflicting entries and "
"resolving the discrepancy. Since **Odoo 16.4**, Odoo filters by default on "
"conflicting entries. For prior versions, you can still filter manually on "
"conflicting entries or use the conflicting menu item."
msgstr ""
"你可透過篩選衝突記錄並解決差異來管理衝突。自 **Odoo 16.4** 起，Odoo 預設會篩"
"選衝突記錄。至於較早版本，你仍可手動篩選衝突記錄，或使用衝突選單項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2893
msgid ""
"Once the conflict is resolved you can either proceed to generate the "
"payslips for your employees or export your work entries to the right entity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2897
msgid "Export work entries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2900
msgid ""
"This section is about exporting work entries to SD Worx, but the "
"configuration and behavior is similar for other exports to Partena, Group S "
"and UCM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2906
msgid ""
"This sheet is here to help you learn how Odoo's **SD Worx** "
"(`l10n_be_hr_payroll_sd_worx`) module simplifies payroll by enabling easy "
"export of work entries. This guide provides quick steps to generate "
":file:`.txt` files for direct import into SD Worx calendars, saving time and"
" ensuring accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2911
msgid ""
"First and foremost, it's important to understand there is no direct "
"integration between Odoo and SD Worx. There is no automatic exchange of "
"information, either way. Odoo does not communicate directly with SD Worx, "
"and the reverse is also true."
msgstr ""
"首先，請務必了解 Odoo 與 SD Worx 之間並沒有直接整合。雙方之間不會以任何方式自"
"動交換資訊；Odoo 不會直接與 SD Worx 通訊，反之亦然。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2918
msgid ""
"In reality, Odoo provides a standardized export in .txt format for "
"employees' work entries, allowing the generation of a file that conforms to "
"a specific format for inputting these entries into the SD Worx software."
msgstr ""
"事實上，Odoo 為員工的工作記錄提供標準化的 .txt 格式匯出功能，可產生符合特定格"
"式的檔案，以便將這些記錄輸入 SD Worx 軟件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2923
msgid "What does it mean in terms of data management?"
msgstr "這在數據管理方面意味著甚麼？"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2925
msgid ""
"Since there is no direct integration between both systems, it implies that "
"certain data will need to be manually entered into both systems. For "
"instance, when you create a new employee in Odoo, you'll also need to "
"manually create the employee in SD Worx (and vice versa). This manual data "
"entry requirement extends to various aspects such as contracts, work "
"schedules, salary details, and personal information about employees."
msgstr ""
"由於兩個系統之間沒有直接整合，某些資料需要分別手動輸入至兩個系統。例如，當您"
"在 Odoo 中建立新員工時，亦需要在 SD Worx 中手動建立該員工（反之亦然）。此手動"
"輸入資料的要求涵蓋多方面，例如合約、工作時間表、薪資詳情及員工個人資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2931
msgid ""
"Essentially, all the information necessary for SD Worx to calculate salaries"
" and generate payslips must be manually inputted into both systems."
msgstr ""
"簡而言之，SD Worx 計算薪酬及產生糧單所需的所有資料，都必須手動輸入至兩個系統"
"中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2935
msgid "What's the advantage of exporting to SD worx?"
msgstr "匯出至 SD worx 有什麼優勢？"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2937
msgid ""
"Odoo is an integrated software that can comprehensively handle all variable "
"payroll elements, including employee personal information, contract details,"
" various time-off types, and other work entry categories. Through Odoo's "
"integration capabilities, you can access all this crucial data in one "
"centralized location, making it easily accessible for your HR team and "
"employees."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 是一套整合式軟件，能全面處理所有浮動薪酬項目，包括員工個人資料、合約詳情"
"、各類休假類型，以及其他工作記錄類別。透過 Odoo 的整合功能，你可以於同一集中"
"位置存取所有重要數據，讓人力資源團隊及員工輕鬆查閱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2942
msgid ""
"This integration not only ensures data accuracy but also maintains "
"consistency, reducing the likelihood of errors when transmitting work entry "
"information to your external payroll provider. With the module in place, a "
"single click generates a :file:`.txt` file that's ready for direct import "
"into SD Worx, streamlining the entire data transmission process."
msgstr ""
"此整合不但能確保數據準確，亦能保持一致性，從而減低將工作紀錄資料傳送至外部薪"
"酬供應商時出錯的機會。安裝此模組後，只需按一下即可產生 :file:`.txt` 檔案，可"
"直接匯入至 SD Worx，簡化整個資料傳送流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2948
msgid "Steps to set up the SD Worx module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2951
msgid ""
"You must be logged into a Belgian company for the following steps to work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2953
msgid ""
":ref:`install <general/install>` the **Belgium - Payroll - Export to SD "
"Worx** (`l10n_be_hr_payroll_sd_worx`) module."
msgstr ""
":ref:`安裝 <general/install>` **比利時 - 薪酬管理 - 匯出至 SD "
"Worx**（`l10n_be_hr_payroll_sd_worx`）模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2955
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Settings` to fill in"
" the :guilabel:`SD Worx code` field. This is the company's SD Worx code, you"
" get it directly from the SD worx software. When you create a company, it "
"has a unique identifier which you need to set in the field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2959
msgid ""
"For each employee, under the :guilabel:`Settings` tab, fill in the "
":guilabel:`SDWorx code` field."
msgstr "對於每位員工，在:guilabel:`設定`分頁下，填寫:guilabel:`SDWorx 代碼`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2960
msgid ""
"For work entry types, under the :guilabel:`Settings` tab, fill in the "
":guilabel:`SDWorx code` field as well."
msgstr ""
"工作紀錄類型方面，亦請在 :guilabel:`設定` 分頁下填寫 :guilabel:`SDWorx 代碼` "
"欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2963
msgid ""
"You can now export your work entries in the SD Worx :file:`.txt` format by "
"opening the wizard under :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting --> "
"Belgium --> Export Work Entries to SDWorx`."
msgstr ""
"你現在可以 SD Worx :file:`.txt` 格式匯出工時紀錄。只需開啟 :menuselection:`薪"
"資應用程式 --> 報告 --> 比利時 --> 匯出工時紀錄至 SDWorx` 中的精靈即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2966
msgid ""
"The file contains a series of lines such as the following line of text: "
"`1111110000024K2023042370100360`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2969
msgid ""
"Each line represents a work entry, and the structure is outlined below:"
msgstr "每一行代表一項工作紀錄，其結構如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2971
msgid "`111111` -> Company SD Worx code"
msgstr "`111111` -> 公司 SD Worx 代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2972
msgid "`0000024` -> Employee SD Worx code"
msgstr "`0000024` -> 員工 SD Worx 代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2973
msgid "`K` -> Delimiter"
msgstr "`K` -> 分隔符號"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2974
msgid "`20230423` -> Date"
msgstr "`20230423` -> 日期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2975
msgid "`7010` -> SD Worx work entry code"
msgstr "`7010` -> SD Worx 工作記錄代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2976
msgid "`0360` -> Duration (edited)"
msgstr "`0360` -> 時長（已編輯）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2978
msgid ""
"Once the :file:`.txt` file is exported, it can be directly imported in this "
"format into the SD Worx software. Doing so updates the calendars of each "
"collaborator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2984
msgid "274.XX sheets"
msgstr "274.XX 表格"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2986
msgid ""
"This section provides an overview of Declaration 274, its components, and "
"how it is handled within Odoo."
msgstr "本節概述 274 號申報表、其組成部分，以及如何在 Odoo 中處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2990
msgid "Declaration 274.10"
msgstr "申報表 274.10"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2992
msgid ""
"Withholding tax is an advance payment on professional income tax. It is "
"calculated based on guidelines established by the tax administration. While "
"reducing withholding tax is generally not allowed, employees may request to "
"pay more in order to better match their final tax liability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2996
msgid ""
"Withholding tax must be deducted from both employees' and company directors'"
" income. If the withholding tax is insufficient, advance tax payments must "
"be made to avoid additional tax penalties."
msgstr ""
"預扣稅必須從員工及公司董事的收入中扣除。如預扣稅款不足，則必須預繳稅款，以免"
"產生額外稅務罰款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3000
msgid ""
"In practice, some employees do not inform their employer of personal changes"
" (e.g., having a child), which can affect tax calculations."
msgstr ""
"在實際情況下，部分員工未必會就個人狀況變動（例如生育子女）通知僱主，而這可能"
"會影響稅務計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3003
msgid ""
"Withholding tax must be declared and paid either quarterly or monthly using "
"form 274. These declarations must be submitted via the FINPROF application "
"by the 15th of the month following the reporting period."
msgstr ""
"預扣稅必須使用表格 274 按季或按月申報及繳納。這些申報表必須於申報期結束後下一"
"個月的 15 日前，透過 FINPROF 應用程式提交。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3007
msgid ""
"Taxable income and corresponding withholding tax must be recorded in fiscal "
"remuneration forms 281.x and summary statements 325x. Employers failing to "
"report these correctly may be subject to a 309% penalty on undisclosed "
"amounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3011
msgid ""
"The tax administration compares the declared amounts in form 274 with the "
"amounts reported in the fiscal forms. If withholding tax payments are "
"insufficient, the company may be charged the difference. If a 274 form is "
"submitted without corresponding tax payment, additional tax penalties will "
"apply."
msgstr ""
"稅務機關會將 274 表格中申報的金額與財務報表中呈報的金額作比較。若預扣稅款不足"
"，公司可能會被追收差額。若提交了 274 表格但未繳納相應稅款，將會被處以額外稅務"
"罰款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3016
msgid ""
"It is crucial to adhere to all administrative guidelines to avoid unexpected"
" tax charges."
msgstr "務必遵守所有行政指引，以免產生意外的稅項費用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3019
msgid "Declarations 274.32, 274.33, 274.34"
msgstr "申報表 274.32、274.33、274.34"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3022
msgid "Withholding tax exemptions for research employees"
msgstr "研究人員的預扣稅豁免"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3024
msgid ""
"Companies employing scientific researchers may qualify for withholding tax "
"reductions under specific conditions:"
msgstr "僱用科學研究人員的公司在特定條件下，可能符合預扣稅減免資格："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3027
msgid "**Form 281.32** applies to civil engineers and PhD holders."
msgstr "**表格 281.32** 適用於土木工程師及博士學位持有人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3028
msgid "**Form 281.33** applies to employees holding a master's degree."
msgstr "**281.33 表格** 適用於持有碩士學位的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3029
msgid "**Form 281.34** applies to employees holding a bachelor's degree."
msgstr "**表格 281.34** 適用於持有學士學位的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3031
msgid ""
"Employers engaged in scientific research may be eligible for an exemption "
"from withholding tax payments. To qualify, they must register their R&D "
"projects with Belspo. From August 1, 2023, this registration must occur "
"before the project begins."
msgstr ""
"從事科學研究的僱主或符合資格豁免繳納預扣稅。要取得資格，他們必須向 Belspo 登"
"記其研發項目。自 2023 年 8 月 1 日起，此項登記必須在項目開始前完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3036
msgid "Tax exemption details"
msgstr "免稅詳情"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3038
msgid ""
"This tax incentive allows companies to retain 80% of the withholding tax "
"deducted from researchers' salaries. However, the exemption rate differs for"
" researchers based on their qualifications:"
msgstr ""
"此稅務優惠容許公司保留從研究人員薪酬中扣除的預扣稅之 80%。然而，不同資歷的研"
"究人員享有不同的豁免比率："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3041
msgid "PhD and master's degree holders: Full 80% exemption."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3042
msgid "Bachelor's degree holders: 50% of the full exemption amount."
msgstr "學士學位持有人：全額豁免金額的 50%。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3043
msgid "For non-SME companies, this limit is further reduced to 25%."
msgstr "對於非中小企公司，此上限進一步降至 25%。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3045
msgid ""
"The exemption applies only to the portion of working time dedicated to "
"scientific research, covering fundamental research, industrial research, or "
"experimental development."
msgstr ""
"此豁免僅適用於專門用於科學研究的工作時間部分，涵蓋基礎研究、工業研究或實驗開"
"發。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3048
msgid "This exemption does not affect the net salary of employees."
msgstr "此項豁免不會影響員工的淨薪酬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3051
msgid "Capping rules"
msgstr "上限規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3053
msgid ""
"The total exemption granted to researchers with a bachelor's degree is "
"limited to 25% of the exemption granted to PhD and master's degree holders. "
"For small companies (as defined in Article 15 §§ 1-6 of the Companies Code),"
" this limit is doubled. These rules have remained unchanged since January 1,"
" 2020."
msgstr ""
"擁有學士學位的研究人員可獲的總豁免額，上限為博士及碩士學位持有人豁免額的 "
"25%。對於小型企業（按《公司法典》第 15 條第 1 至 6 款界定），此上限將加倍。有"
"關規則自 2020 年 1 月 1 日起一直維持不變。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3059
msgid "How it works in Odoo"
msgstr "在 Odoo 中的運作方式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3061
msgid ""
"Odoo automates the calculation and declaration of withholding tax exemptions"
" using predefined payroll structures. Below is an explanation of how the "
"system processes these exemptions."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會使用預先定義的薪酬結構，自動計算及申報預扣稅豁免。以下說明系統如何處理"
"這些豁免。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3064
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting --> 274.XX Sheets` to "
"create a new declaration."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 報表 --> 274.XX 表格` 以建立新申報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3067
msgid ""
"Select the reference :guilabel:`Year` and :guilabel:`Month`, and the "
"different amounts are computed accordingly."
msgstr "選擇參考:guilabel:`年份`及:guilabel:`月份`，系統便會相應計算各項金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3070
msgid "**Payroll calculation**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3072
msgid "Odoo calculates gross salary and total withholding tax."
msgstr "Odoo 會計算總薪金及預扣稅總額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3073
msgid ""
"It accounts for specific payroll components, including December double "
"bonuses."
msgstr "它會計入特定的薪酬組成部分，包括 12 月雙倍獎金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3075
msgid "**Filtering eligible payslips**"
msgstr "**篩選合資格薪資單**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3077
msgid "Payslips linked to research-related contracts are considered."
msgstr "連結至研究相關合約的糧單會納入計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3078
msgid ""
"Employees are categorized based on their qualifications (PhD, master's, or "
"bachelor's degrees)."
msgstr "員工會根據其學歷（博士、碩士或學士學位）進行分類。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3080
msgid "**Exemption calculation**"
msgstr "**豁免計算**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3082
msgid ""
"The withholding tax exemption is calculated at 80% of the withheld amount."
msgstr "預扣稅豁免額按預扣金額的 80% 計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3083
msgid ""
"Exemptions for bachelor's degree holders are capped according to "
"regulations."
msgstr "根據法規，學士學位持有人的豁免額設有上限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3085
msgid "**Final adjustments**"
msgstr "**最終調整**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3087
msgid "The system ensures compliance with legal capping rules."
msgstr "系統確保符合法定的上限規定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3088
msgid ""
"If necessary, adjustments are made based on the total exemption granted."
msgstr "如有需要，系統會根據已批出的總豁免額作出調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3090
msgid ""
"Click on :guilabel:`Export XML file` to generate the file to post on FINPROF"
" portal and the structured communication to link to your payment."
msgstr ""
"點擊:guilabel:`匯出 XML 檔案`，即可產生上載至 FINPROF 入口網站的檔案，以及用"
"於關聯付款的結構化通訊編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3093
msgid "274.XX XML file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3096
msgid ""
"Click on :guilabel:`Create 274.XX Sheets` to generate the :file:`.pdf` files"
" of those declarations."
msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`建立 274.XX 報表` 以產生該等申報表的 :file:`.pdf` 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3099
msgid ""
"In order to for the exemption to work properly, the *Certificate Level* "
"should be correctly configured on the employee's form."
msgstr "為使豁免正常運作，應在員工表單上正確設定 *證書級別*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3102
msgid ""
"The *Time Percentage R&D* rate should be specified on the employee's "
"contract form as well."
msgstr "員工合約表單上亦應指定 *研發時間百分比* 比率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3104
msgid ""
"If the accounting application is installed and running properly, you can "
"also post directly the different amounts in your accounting entries with the"
" :guilabel:`Post Journal Entries` button."
msgstr ""
"如會計應用程式已安裝並正常運作，你亦可點按:guilabel:`過賬日記賬分錄`按鈕，直"
"接將各項金額過賬至會計分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3108
msgid ""
"If the *Post Journal Entries* is not present on the wizard, you need to "
"configure the journal and the different accounts for each amount type from "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"如果精靈上沒有顯示*過賬日記賬分錄*，你需要前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程"
"式 --> 配置 --> 設定`，為每種金額類型配置日記賬及各個會計科目。"

