#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:38
msgid ""
"To check if the user already has a contract, navigate to the **Employees** "
"app, then click on the employee's Kanban card. The :icon:`fa-book` "
":guilabel:`Contracts` smart button displays a red zero when no contract "
"exists. Otherwise, it displays :guilabel:`In contract since (contract start "
"date)` in green."
msgstr ""
"要檢查用戶是否已有合約，請前往 **員工** 應用程式，然後點擊該員工的看板卡片"
"。:icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`合約` 智能按鈕在沒有合約時會顯示紅色的「0」；否"
"則，會以綠色顯示 :guilabel:`自（合約開始日期）起合約生效`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:44
msgid ""
"Contracts can also be found by navigating to :menuselection:`Employees app "
"--> Employees --> Contracts`. All contracts appear in a list view, grouped "
