#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Social Insurance Reference Amount`: Used as the base amount for "
"calculating the :ref:`social insurance employee and employer portions "
"<payroll/payroll_localizations/social-insurance>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`社會保險參考金額`：用作計算 :ref:`社會保險的僱員及僱主供款部分 "
"<payroll/payroll_localizations/social-insurance>` 的基準金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:53
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Number of Leave Days`: Used for calculating the :ref:`provision "
"amount for the annual leave for the employee "
"<payroll/payroll_localizations/provisions>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Provision Number of Days`: Corresponds with the number of days "
"used in the calculation of the :ref:`provision value of the end of service "
"for the employee <payroll/payroll_localizations/provisions>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`撥備日數`：對應計算 :ref:`員工離職補償撥備價值 <payroll/"
"payroll_localizations/provisions>` 時所使用的日數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Number of Days`: Refers to the number of days used to "
"calculate the :ref:`end-of-service benefit paid to the employee when their "
"employment with the company ends <payroll/payroll_localizations/end-of-"
"service>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`總日數`：指用於計算:ref:`僱員與公司終止僱傭關係時獲發的服務終止福"
"利 <payroll/payroll_localizations/end-of-service>`的日數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:65
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:216
msgid "Social insurance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:67
msgid ""
"Social insurance rules calculate the contribution amounts that are to be "
"paid by the employer and employee to the :abbr:`NOSI (National Organization "
"for Social Insurance)`. This is only available for Egyptian employees."
msgstr ""
"社會保險規則會計算僱主及僱員須向:abbr:`NOSI (國家社會保險組織)`繳納的供款金額"
"。此功能僅適用於埃及僱員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:71
msgid ""
"The employer contributes 18.75% of the social insurance reference amount for"
" the employee. On the other hand, the employee contributes 11% of their "
"insurance reference amount, and that amount gets deducted from the payslip "
"amount."
msgstr ""
"僱主為僱員供款社會保險參考金額的 18.75%。另一方面，僱員供款其保險參考金額的 "
"11%，該金額會從薪資單金額中扣除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:76
msgid ""
"The social insurance reference amount is set per employee in their "
"contracts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:79
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:190
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:202
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:387
msgid "Leaves"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:81
msgid ""
"The following leave types are available to employees working in Egypt: "
":ref:`Annual leave <payroll/payroll_localizations/annual>`, :ref:`Sick leave"
" <payroll/payroll_localizations/sick>`, :ref:`Unpaid leave "
"<payroll/payroll_localizations/unpaid>`, and :ref:`Other leave types "
"<payroll/payroll_localizations/other>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:91
msgid ""
"Employees are eligible for 21 days of annual leave, and if the employee "
"requires more days, they have to be :ref:`requested from HR managers "
"<time_off/request-allocation>` accordingly."
msgstr ""
"員工享有 21 天年假；如果員工需要更多假期，則必須相應地 :ref:`向人力資源經理申"
"請 <time_off/request-allocation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:95
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:198
msgid ""
"Since the annual leave is fully paid, it is not connected to a salary rule, "
"but it will appear on the worked days on the payslip form and on the PDF "
"printout."
msgstr ""
"由於年假為全薪假期，因此不會連結至薪酬規則，但會顯示在薪資單表單的工作日數以"
"及 PDF 列印本上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:101
msgid "Sick leave"
msgstr "病假"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:103
msgid ""
"Three cases exist for sick leaves in terms of the amount to be deducted from"
" the employee:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fully paid`: first 30 calendar days each year (affects only "
"working entries; no payroll deduction)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`全薪`：每年首 30 個日曆日（僅影響工作記錄，不扣減薪資）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:108
msgid "**Payroll computation** =(Daily Wage)"
msgstr "**薪酬計算** =（日薪）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`75% paid`: next 60 days; payroll rule deducts 25% of an "
"employee's salary."
msgstr ":guilabel:`75% 有薪`：其後 60 日；薪酬規則會扣除員工 25% 的薪金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:112
msgid "**Payroll computation** =(Daily Wage * 0.25)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`0% paid`: after 90 days; payroll rule deducts 100% of an "
"employee's salary."
msgstr ":guilabel:`0% 支薪`：90 天後；薪酬規則會扣除員工 100% 薪金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:116
msgid "**Payroll computation** =(Daily Wage * 0.00)"
msgstr "**薪酬計算** =(日薪 * 0.00)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:121
msgid "Unpaid leave"
msgstr "無薪假"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:123
msgid ""
"Deductions are applied on the employee's salary based on the number of "
"unpaid leave days taken, and it is calculated by dividing the monthly salary"
" for the employee by 30 to get the daily salary and then multiplying it by "
"the number of unpaid leave days taken."
msgstr ""
"系統會根據員工已休的無薪假天數從其薪酬中扣減，計算方法是將員工的月薪除以 30 "
"以得出日薪，再乘以已休的無薪假天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:130
