#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:234
msgid ""
"Provisions are the amounts computed by the employer to account for the "
"payments made to the employee for :abbr:`EOS (end-of-service)` benefits or "
"annual leave. And it is computed on a monthly basis."
msgstr ""
"撥備是僱主計算的金額，用於計入向員工支付的 :abbr:`EOS (服務終止)` 福利或年假"
"款項，並按月計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:238
msgid "End of service benefit provision"
msgstr "服務終止福利撥備"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:240
msgid ""
"It is computed by dividing the end of service Provision Number of Days by 12"
" and multiplying the result by the daily salary for the employee."
msgstr "其計算方式為將服務終止準備金天數除以 12，再乘以該員工的日薪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:243
msgid ""
"\\text{Payroll computation} = \\frac{\\text{Provision Number of Days}}{12} "
"\\times \\frac{\\text{Wage} + \\text{Allowances}}{30}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:249
msgid "Annual leave provision"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:251
msgid ""
"It is computed by dividing the number of leave days by 12 and multiplying "
"the result by the daily salary for the employee."
msgstr "計算方式為將休假日數除以 12，然後將結果乘以員工的日薪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:254
msgid ""
"\\text{Payroll computation} = \\frac{\\text{Number of Leave Days}}{12} "
"\\times \\frac{\\text{Wage} + \\text{Allowances}}{30}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{薪酬計算} = \\frac{\\text{休假天數}}{12} \\times \\frac{\\text{工資} "
"+ \\text{津貼}}{30}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:262
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:550
msgid "End of service"
msgstr "服務終止"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:264
msgid ""
"At the end of the service slip that is generated for the employee, there are"
" the following points that are unique only to the payslip:"
msgstr "在為員工產生的服務單據末端，包含以下僅適用於薪資單的獨特項目："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:268
msgid "Unused leaves compensation"
msgstr "未休假期補償"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:270
msgid ""
"The number of available annual leaves is shown on the employee's record. It "
"is based on the annual leave type defined in the Payroll settings. It is "
"calculated as the total remaining allocations for that specific leave type "
"assigned to the employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:274
msgid ""
"That number is then multiplied by the daily rate for the employee and added "
"as an allowance on their payslip."
msgstr "然後將該數字乘以員工的日薪，並作為津貼加至其薪金單上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:278
msgid "End of service benefit"
msgstr "服務終止福利"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:280
msgid ""
"It is calculated by multiplying the daily wage of the employee by the number"
" of days for the end of service that is set in the employee's contract."
msgstr "其計算方式是將員工的日薪，乘以員工合約中設定的服務終止日數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:283
msgid ""
"\\text{Payroll computation} = \\frac{\\text{Wage + Allowances}}{30} \\times "
"\\text{End of Service Number of Days}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{薪資計算} = \\frac{\\text{工資 + 津貼}}{30} \\times \\text{服務結束天"
"數}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:289
msgid "Out of contract"
msgstr "合約期外"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:291
msgid ""
"Out-of-contract days are the days that fall within the payslip period but "
"are not included in the employee's contract period. The corresponding amount"
" is added as a deduction on the payslip and is calculated by multiplying the"
" number of out-of-contract days by the employee's daily wage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:295
msgid ""
"\\text{Payroll computation} = \\frac{\\text Wage + Allowances}{\\text{Days "
"in the Month}} \\times \\text{Out of Contract Days}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{薪酬計算} = \\frac{\\text 工資 + 津貼}{\\text{該月日數}} \\times \\t"
"ext{合約外日數}"

