":doc:`payroll <../../payroll>` documentation. It covers foundational "
"information applicable to all localizations, including universal settings, "
"salary structures, and global payroll fields."
msgstr ""
"在設定香港本地化功能前，請先參閱一般 :doc:`薪酬 <../../payroll>` 說明文件。當"
"中涵蓋適用於所有本地化地區的基礎資料，包括通用設定、薪資結構及全球薪酬欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:27
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the following modules to get all the "
