#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:473
msgid ""
"Odoo's Rental System is designed to align with the `Inland Revenue "
"Department (IRD) guidelines <https://www.ird.gov.hk/eng/tax/ere_house.htm>`_"
" regarding the taxation of a place of residence provided to an employee. "
"This updated rental system automates the calculation of taxable income based"
" on whether the employer provides a reimbursement, direct payment, or "
"allowance."
