msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`: Complete the full address, including the City, State, "
"Zip Code, and Country."
msgstr ":guilabel:`地址`：填寫完整地址，包括城市、州/省、郵遞區號及國家/地區。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:52
msgid ""
"The state selected in the company's address is associated as the work "
"address by default for the employee, and the one used to calculate payroll "
"taxes."
msgstr "公司地址中所選的州份會預設關聯為員工的工作地址，並用於計算薪資稅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`GSTIN`: Enter a 15-digit tax identification number required for "
"GST-registered businesses in India."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`GSTIN`：輸入印度商品及服務稅（GST）註冊企業所需的 15 位稅務識別編"
"號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PAN`: Enter a 10-character alphanumeric ID issued by the Income "
"Tax Department for tax reporting."
msgstr ":guilabel:`PAN`：輸入由所得稅部門簽發的 10 位英數字元識別碼，用於報稅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:59
msgid ":guilabel:`Company ID`: Enter the business's state ID number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`公司編號`：輸入企業的州別識別編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: By default, INR is selected. If not, select INR from "
"the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`貨幣`：預設已選擇 INR。如未選擇，請從下拉式選單中選擇 INR。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`UPI Id`: Enter a virtual payment address used for receiving "
"digital payments through India's UPI system."
msgstr ":guilabel:`UPI ID`：輸入用於透過印度 UPI 系統接收數碼付款的虛擬付款地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:66
msgid ""
"Next, configure the payroll settings for the Indian payroll localization. "
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and"
" enable the following options that apply to the company:"
msgstr ""
"接下來，為印度薪酬本地化設定薪酬選項。前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> "
"配置 --> 設定`，並啟用適用於該公司的以下選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:70
msgid ""
":ref:`Employee Provident Fund <payroll/epf>`: Enter your :abbr:`EPF "
"(Employee Provident Fund)` Employer ID (alphanumeric code issued by the "
":abbr:`EPFO (Employees' Provident Fund Organisation)`) to enable automatic "
":abbr:`PF (Provident Fund)` deductions and contributions. Enabling this will"
" activate the **Provident Fund (PF) contribution** section in employee "
"payroll setting and contract template."
msgstr ""
":ref:`僱員公積金 <payroll/epf>`：輸入您的 :abbr:`EPF（僱員公積金）` 僱主編號"
"（由 :abbr:`EPFO（僱員公積金組織）` 發出的英數字代碼），以啟用自動計算 "
":abbr:`PF（公積金）` 扣款及供款。啟用後，系統會在員工薪酬設定及合約範本中啟"
"用 **公積金（PF）供款** 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:74
msgid ""
":ref:`Professional Tax <payroll/pt>`: Enter your state-issued :abbr:`PT "
"(Professional Tax)` registration number (usually numeric/alphanumeric) to "
"allow salary-based professional tax deduction. Enabling this will activate "
"the **Professional Tax slab** field under the **Tax Deductions** section in "
"employee payroll setting and contract template."
msgstr ""
":ref:`專業稅 <payroll/pt>`：輸入由州政府發出的 :abbr:`PT（專業稅）` 登記號碼"
"（通常為數字或英數字母），以允許按薪金扣除專業稅。啟用此選項後，系統會在員工"
"薪酬設定及合約範本中的 **稅項扣除** 部分，啟用 **專業稅階** 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:78
msgid ""
":ref:`Employee State Insurance <payroll/esic>`: Enter your :abbr:`ESIC "
"(Employee State Insurance)` Employer Code/IP Number (10-digit numeric ID "
"provided by ESIC) to process mandatory medical insurance contributions. "
"Enabling this will activate the **ESIC (Employee State Insurance)** section "
"in employee payroll setting and contract template."
msgstr ""
":ref:`員工國家保險 <payroll/esic>`：輸入您的 :abbr:`ESIC（員工國家保險）` 僱"
"主編號 / IP 編號（由 ESIC 提供的 10 位數字識別碼），以處理強制性醫療保險供款"
"。啟用此選項後，員工薪酬設定及合約範本中將會啟用 **ESIC（員工國家保險）** 部"
"分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:82
msgid ""
":ref:`Labour Welfare Fund <payroll/lwf>`: Enter your :abbr:`LWF (Labour "
"Welfare Fund)` Establishment/Identification Number (state-issued "
"numeric/alphanumeric ID) to deduct and remit statutory welfare fund "
"contributions. Enabling this will activate the **Labour Welfare Fund (LWF)**"
" section in employee payroll setting and contract template."
msgstr ""
":ref:`勞工福利基金 <payroll/lwf>`：輸入你的 :abbr:`LWF（勞工福利基金）` 機構"
"／識別編號（由邦政府簽發的數字／英數字 ID），以扣除並匯繳法定福利基金供款。啟"
"用此項目後，員工薪酬設定及合約範本中的 **勞工福利基金 (LWF)** 部分將會啟用。"

