"the employee's wage, accrued monthly as part of end-of-service benefits."
msgstr ""
"離職酬金是法定的僱主供款，按員工工資的百分比計算，每月累計並作為離職福利的一"
"部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:226
msgid "Other deduction section"
msgstr "其他扣減部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:230
msgid "Configure salary from contract template"
msgstr "從合約範本設定薪酬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:232
msgid ""
"Configure the Employee Salary page to automatically load and display details"
" based on the default contract template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:235
msgid ""
"When creating a new employee, load the default contract template in the "
":guilabel:`Employee Payroll` tab to configure a predefined salary package "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"建立新員工時，在 :guilabel:`員工薪酬` 分頁載入預設合約範本，即可自動設定預先"
"定義的薪酬方案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:238
msgid "Load Indian Contract Template"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:241
msgid ""
"The contract template defines the salary structure and includes all "
"applicable salary components, statutory compliances, and benefits."
msgstr "合約範本定義了薪金結構，並包含所有適用的薪金組成部分、法定合規項目及福利。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:244
msgid ""
"To configure the contract template go to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Configuration --> Contract Templates`, create or open an existing contract "
"template, then In the contract template, configure the salary package for "
"the applicant/employee, including the **Salary components**, **Statutory "
"compliances**, **Benefits** and **Insurance Benefits** described above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:249
msgid "Indian Contract Template"
msgstr "印度合約範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:253
msgid "Time off Configuration"
msgstr "休假設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:255
msgid ""
"The Indian Localization for Time Off includes specific leave management "
"features designed for Indian organizations, such as :ref:`Sandwich Leave "
"<payroll/in_sandwich>` and :ref:`Optional Holidays <payroll/in_optional>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:259
msgid ""
"Install the :guilabel:`India - Time Off` application to enable these "
"policies."
msgstr "安裝 :guilabel:`印度 - 休假` 應用程式，即可啟用這些政策。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:262
msgid ":doc:`About Time Off <../../time_off>`"
msgstr ":doc:`關於休假 <../../time_off>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:267
msgid "Sandwich leave"
msgstr "夾心假期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:269
msgid ""
"A *sandwich Leave* is a time off policy where weekends and public holidays "
"falling between two applied leave days are also counted as time off. To "
"enable this on a :doc:`time off type <../../time_off/time_off_types>` "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> Configuration --> Time Off "
"Types`, and click the desired time off type to enable this feature on. Tick "
"the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Sandwich Leave` in the "
":guilabel:`Configuration` section of the :guilabel:`Time Off Type` form."
msgstr ""
"*夾心假* 是一項休假政策，若兩天已申請的休假之間夾著週末及公眾假期，該等日子亦"
"會計入休假。如要為某個 :doc:`休假類型 <../../time_off/time_off_types>` 啟用此"
"功能，請前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 配置 --> 休假類型`，然後點擊要"
"啟用此功能的休假類型。請剔選 :guilabel:`夾心假` 旁的核取方塊（位於 "
":guilabel:`配置` 區段內，屬於 :guilabel:`休假類型` 表單）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:277
msgid ""
"An employee applies for leave on Friday November 28th and Monday December "
"1st. Both Saturday November 29th and Sunday November 30th (the weekend) are "
"also counted as time off, making the total time off requested **four** days "
"*not* **two** days."
msgstr ""
"一名員工申請在 11 月 28 日（星期五）及 12 月 1 日（星期一）休假。11 月 29 日"
"（星期六）及 11 月 30 日（星期日）（即週末）亦會計作休假時間，因此申請的總休"
"假日數為 **四** 日，*而非* **兩** 日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:284
msgid "Optional holidays"
msgstr "自選假期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:286
msgid ""
"Optional Holidays, also called *Flexible Holidays* are special holidays "
"assigned to specific calendar dates, such as regional or religious holidays."
" Employees may apply for leave only on these defined dates."
msgstr ""
"自選假期（亦稱*彈性假期*）是指分配予特定日曆日期的特別假期，例如地區或宗教假"
"期。員工只可於這些指定日期申請休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:290
msgid ""
"If an employee attempts to request leave on any other date, a validation "
"error will be raised."
msgstr "如果員工嘗試在任何其他日期申請休假，系統將觸發驗證錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:293
msgid ""
"To enable this on a :doc:`time off type <../../time_off/time_off_types>` "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> Configuration --> Time Off "
"Types`, and create a new time off type or open an existing one, Tick the "
"checkbox next to :guilabel:`Limited to Optional Holiday` in the "
":guilabel:`Configuration` section of the :guilabel:`Time Off Type` form. "
"Then, go to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> Configuration --> Optional "
"Holidays`. Create new optional holidays by assigning them to specific "
"calendar dates The optional holiday can be seen on the dashboard"
msgstr ""
"如要為 :doc:`休假類型 <../../time_off/time_off_types>` 啟用此功能，請前往 "
":menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 配置 --> 休假類型`，建立新的休假類型或開啟現"
"有類型，並勾選 :guilabel:`僅限自選假日` 旁的核取方塊，該選項位於 "
":guilabel:`配置` 區段（即 :guilabel:`休假類型` 表單內）。接著，前往 "
":menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 配置 --> 自選假日`。將自選假日指派至特定日曆"
"日期以建立新項目，完成後即可在儀表板上看到該自選假日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:301
msgid ""
"Employees can request these leave types, but only on the configured optional"
" (flexible) holiday dates."
msgstr "員工可以申請這些休假類型，但僅限於已設定的彈性（自選）假日日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:306
msgid ""
"When the **l10n_in_hr_payroll** module is :ref:`installed "
"<payroll/indian_apps>`, a new salary structure for India is added: "
":guilabel:`India: Regular Pay` under the :guilabel:`India: Employee Pay` "
"structure type."
msgstr ""
"**l10n_in_hr_payroll** 模組:ref:`安裝 <payroll/indian_apps>`後，系統會新增一"
"項印度的薪資結構：:guilabel:`印度：常規薪酬`，隸屬於:guilabel:`印度：員工薪"
"酬`結構類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:310
msgid ""
"The salary structure contains all salary rules needed to calculate wages, "
"statutory salary structure, allowances, deductions, and compliance rules."
msgstr ""
"薪酬結構包含計算工資、法定薪酬架構、津貼、扣減項目及合規規則所需的所有薪酬規"
"則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:316
msgid ""
"The salary rules control how each allowance, deduction, benefit, and "
"statutory compliances is calculated."
msgstr "薪酬規則控制各項津貼、扣款、福利及法定合規項目的計算方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:318
msgid ""
"To view the salary rules, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Configuration --> Structures`. Click on :guilabel:`India: Employee Pay` to "
"expand it, and then click :guilabel:`India: Regular Pay`."
msgstr ""
"如要檢視薪資規則，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 配置 --> 薪資結"
"構`。點擊 :guilabel:`印度：員工薪酬` 以展開，然後點擊 :guilabel:`印度：常規薪"
"酬`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:321
msgid "Indian Regular Pay"
msgstr "印度常規薪酬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:327
msgid ""
"Certain payroll calculations require specific rates or wage caps, and Rule "
"Parameters provide values either as percentages or fixed amounts that can be"
" referenced in salary rules."
msgstr ""
"部分薪酬計算需要特定的比率或工資上限；規則參數會以百分比或固定金額形式提供數"
"值，供薪金規則引用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:330
msgid ""
"Rule parameters can be accessed via :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Configuration --> Rule Parameters`. All the Rule parameters will be listed "
"here with the associated salary rules."
msgstr ""
"可透過 :menuselection:`薪酬管理應用程式 --> 配置 --> 規則參數` 存取規則參數。"
"此處會列出所有規則參數及其關聯的薪酬規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:333
msgid ""
"Rule parameters are used by salary rules for statutory calculations, "
"ensuring that payslips stay compliant with national and state-level "
"regulations."
msgstr "規則參數會由薪酬規則用於法定計算，確保糧單符合國家及州級法規。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:337
msgid ""
"Odoo updates rule parameters as needed. It is recommended **not to modify** "
"rule parameters unless there is an official change in national or state "
"regulations."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會按需要更新規則參數。除非國家或州法規有正式變更，否則建議 **不要修改** "
"規則參數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:342
msgid "Run India Payroll"
msgstr "執行印度薪酬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:344
msgid ""
"Before running payroll, the payroll officer must validate employee "
":doc:`work entries <../work_entries>` to confirm pay accuracy and catch any "
"errors. This includes ensuring that all time off is approved, any overtime "
"is appropriate."
msgstr ""
"在執行薪酬計算前，薪酬專員必須驗證員工的:doc:`工作紀錄 <../work_entries>`，以"
"確保薪酬準確並及早發現任何錯誤。這包括確保所有休假均已獲批准，以及所有加班均"
"屬合理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:348
msgid ""
"Work entries are synchronized based on the employee's :doc:`contract "
"<../contracts>` configuration. Odoo pulls from the assigned working "
"schedule, attendance records, planning schedule, and approved time off."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:355
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:402
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:426
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:297
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:349
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:487
msgid ""
"Once everything is correct, draft payslips can be :ref:`created individually"
" <payroll/payslips/process>` or in :doc:`groups <../pay_runs>`, referred to "
"in the **Payroll** app as *Pay Runs*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:363
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:410
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:434
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:305
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:357
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:495
msgid ""
"To cut down on the payroll officer's time, it is typical to process payslips"
" in batches, either by wage type (fixed salary vs hourly), pay schedule "
"(weekly, bi-weekly, monthly, etc.), department (direct cost vs. "
"administration), or any other grouping that best suits the company."
msgstr ""
"為了節省薪酬專員的時間，通常會批量處理糧單，可按工資類型（固定月薪或時薪）、"
"發薪週期（每週、雙週、每月等）、部門（直接成本或行政部門），或任何最適合公司"
"的分組方式進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:367
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:414
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:361
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:499
msgid ""
"The process of running payroll includes different actions that need to be "
"executed to ensure that the amount withheld from payroll taxes is correct, "
"the amount that the employee receives as their net salary is correct, and "
"the computation of hours worked reflects the employee's actual hours worked,"
" among others."
msgstr ""
"處理薪資的流程包含多項必須執行的操作，以確保預扣的薪俸稅金額正確、員工實領的"
"淨薪金準確無誤，以及工時計算能反映員工的實際工作時數等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:372
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:419
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:443
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:314
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:366
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:504
msgid ""
"When running a payroll batch, check that the period, company, and employees "
"included are correct *before* starting to analyze or validate the data."
msgstr ""
"執行薪酬批次時，請在開始分析或驗證資料 *之前*，檢查所包含的期間、公司及員工是"
"否正確。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:375
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:422
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:317
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:369
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:507
msgid ""
"Once the payslips are drafted, review them for accuracy. Check the "
":guilabel:`Worked Days & Inputs` tab, and ensure the listed worked time is "
"correct, as well as any other inputs. Add any missing inputs, such as "
"commissions, tips, reimbursements, that are missing."
msgstr ""
"草擬工資單後，請檢查其準確性。請檢查 :guilabel:`工作天數及輸入項目` 分頁，確"
"保所列的工作時間及其他輸入項目均準確無誤。如有任何遺漏項目（例如佣金、小費或"
"報銷款項），請一併補上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:379
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:426
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:373
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:511
msgid ""
"Next, check the various totals (gross pay, employee taxes, benefits, "
"employer taxes, net salaries), then click :guilabel:`Compute Sheet` to "
"update the salary calculations, if there were edits. If everything is "
"correct, click :guilabel:`Validate`."
msgstr ""
"接著，檢查各項總計（總薪酬、僱員稅項、福利、僱主稅項、淨薪金）。如有修改，請"
"點擊:guilabel:`計算薪資表`以更新薪酬計算。如一切正確，請點擊:guilabel:`驗"
"證`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:383
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:430
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:455
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:325
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:377
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:515
msgid "The worked days tab of a payslip."
msgstr "糧單的已工作天數分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:389
msgid ""
"The accounting process when running payroll has two components: "
":ref:`creating journal entries <payroll/in-journal>`, and :ref:`registering "
"payments <payroll/in-register>`."
msgstr ""
"執行薪酬計算時的會計流程包含兩個部分：:ref:`建立日記賬分錄 <payroll/in-"
"journal>`及:ref:`登記付款 <payroll/in-register>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:397
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:444
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:469
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:388
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:391
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:536
msgid ""
"After payslips are confirmed and validated, journal entries are posted "
"either individually, or in a batch. The journal entry is created first as a "
"draft."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:401
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:448
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:473
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:392
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:395
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:540
msgid ""
"It must be decided if journal entries are done individually or in batches "
"*before* running payroll."
msgstr "在執行計糧 *前*，必須決定日記賬記項是逐筆處理還是批量處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:404
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:451
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:476
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:395
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:398
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:543
msgid "All payslips in a draft state."
msgstr "所有處於草稿狀態的糧單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:407
msgid ""
"Six accounts from the India :abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` are included "
"with the India payroll localization:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:410
msgid ""
"`210100 Salary Expense`: Records the gross salary expense for employees, "
"including the basic pay and any earnings not allocated to specific allowance"
" accounts. This account captures the main salary cost for financial "
"reporting."
msgstr ""
"`210100 薪酬開支`：記錄員工的總薪酬開支，包括基本薪金及未分配至特定津貼帳戶的"
"任何收入。此帳戶用於在財務報告中記錄主要薪酬成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:413
msgid ""
"`300001 House Rent Allowance Expense`: Records the portion of salary paid as"
" House Rent Allowance. Used to track HRA separately for statutory reporting "
"and tax computation purposes."
msgstr ""
"`300001 House Rent Allowance Expense`：記錄以房屋租金津貼（HRA）形式支付的薪"
"資部分。用於單獨追蹤 HRA，以便進行法定申報及稅項計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:415
msgid ""
"`300002 Standard Allowance Expense`: Records recurring allowances that are "
"part of the salary package but do not fall under special categories like HRA"
" or performance bonus. Examples include transport or utility allowances."
msgstr ""
"`300002 Standard Allowance Expense`：記錄屬於薪酬組合一部分的定期津貼，但不屬"
"於房屋租金津貼（HRA）或績效獎金等特殊類別，例如交通津貼或水電津貼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:418
msgid ""
"`300005 Performance Bonus`: Records discretionary or performance-linked "
"bonuses paid to employees. This account helps separate one-time or variable "
"incentive costs from regular salary expenses."
msgstr ""
"`300005 績效獎金`：記錄支付給員工的酌情獎金或與績效掛鈎的獎金。此會計科目有助"
"將一次性或浮動獎勵成本與常規薪金開支分開。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:421
msgid ""
"`300011 Leave Travel Allowance Expense`: Tracks Leave Travel Allowance paid "
"to employees. LTA is often partially tax-exempt under Indian Income Tax "
"rules, so tracking it separately is important for compliance."
msgstr ""
"`300011 休假旅遊津貼開支`：追蹤支付給員工的休假旅遊津貼（LTA）。根據印度所得"
"稅法規，休假旅遊津貼通常部分免稅，因此分開追蹤對合規至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:424
msgid ""
"`300004 Fixed Allowance Expense`: Records fixed, recurring allowances paid "
"to employees such as meal allowances, special duty allowances, or any other "
"structured component of the salary."
msgstr ""
"`300004 固定津貼開支`：記錄支付予員工的固定及定期津貼，例如膳食津貼、特別職務"
"津貼或任何其他結構化薪酬組成部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:428
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` configuration is set up by default when "
"a company is located in India. The account codes and names can be customized"
" to match the company's salary structure and reporting requirements. If a "
"salary rule (used in a salary structure) does not have an associated "
":abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` account, Odoo will use the default account "
"`Salary Expense` to create the journal entry, regardless of the type of "
"move."
msgstr ""
"若公司位於印度，系統會預設建立 :abbr:`CoA (會計科目表)` 的設定。您可以自訂會"
"計科目編號及名稱，以配合公司的薪資結構及申報要求。如果（薪資結構中使用的）薪"
"資規則沒有關聯的 :abbr:`CoA (會計科目表)` 科目，無論分錄類型為何，Odoo 都會使"
"用預設科目 `Salary Expense` 建立日記賬分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:434
msgid ""
"Once the journal entry draft appears correct, post the journal entries."
msgstr "確認日記賬分錄草稿無誤後，即可過賬該等日記賬分錄。"

