#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:486
msgid "Salary Register"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:488
msgid ""
"The Register report provides a detailed month-wise record of salaries paid "
"to employees. This includes allowances, tax compliance, deductions, and "
"benefits for each employee. Employers can use this report to track payroll "
"expenditures and employee earnings."
msgstr ""
"薪酬登記冊報告提供每月向員工支付薪金的詳細記錄，當中包括每位員工的津貼、稅務"
"合規項目、扣減項目及福利。僱主可使用此報告追蹤薪酬開支及員工收入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:492
msgid ""
"To generate the report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Reporting --> Salary Register`. A :guilabel:`Salary Register` pop-up window "
"will appear. Set the :guilabel:`Start Date` and :guilabel:`End Date`, select"
" a specific :guilabel:`Salary Structure` to filter them by the Salary "
"Structure (otherwise all employees are included), and choose the desired "
":guilabel:`Payslip Status` (:guilabel:`Paid`, :guilabel:`Done`, or both) to "
"filter the payslips. Once the filters are set, click :guilabel:`Export XLSX`"
" to download the salary register report."
msgstr ""
"要產生報告，請前往 :menuselection:`薪資應用程式 --> 報告 --> 薪資總表`。系統"
"會彈出 :guilabel:`薪資總表` 視窗。設定 :guilabel:`開始日期` 及 :guilabel:`結"
"束日期`，選擇特定的 :guilabel:`薪資結構` 以按薪資結構篩選（否則會包含所有員工"
"），並選擇所需的 :guilabel:`薪資單狀態`（:guilabel:`已付款`、:guilabel:`已完"
"成` 或兩者）以篩選薪資單。設定篩選條件後，按一下 :guilabel:`匯出 XLSX` 即可下"
"載薪資總表報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:499
msgid "Salary Register Report"
msgstr "薪酬登記冊報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:505
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:517
msgid "EPF Report"
msgstr "EPF 報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:507
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`EPF (Employee Provident Fund)` report lists the contributions "
"made by both employer and employee toward the Provident Fund. It includes "
"the employee's EPF number, contribution amounts, and employer matching "
"contributions, ensuring compliance with the Employees' Provident Funds and "
"Miscellaneous Provisions Act, 1952."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:513
msgid ""
"To generate the report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Reporting --> EPF Report`. Click on :guilabel:`New`, set desired "
":guilabel:`Year` and :guilabel:`Month` and click on :guilabel:`Export XLSX "
"File`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:523
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:535
msgid "ESI Report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:525
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`ESI (Employee State Insurance)` report details the contributions "
"made toward the ESI scheme. It provides both employer and employee "
"contribution amounts, along with the employee's ESI number, which is "
"required for statutory filing with the Employee State Insurance Corporation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:531
msgid ""
"To generate the report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Reporting --> ESI Report`. Click on :guilabel:`New`, set desired "
":guilabel:`Year` and :guilabel:`Month`, Select the Report type as per the "
"need and click on :guilabel:`Export XLSX File`."
msgstr ""
"要產生報表，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬管理應用程式 --> 報表 --> ESI 報表`。"
"點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，設定所需的 :guilabel:`年份` 及 :guilabel:`月份`，根據"
"需要選擇報表類型，然後點擊 :guilabel:`匯出 XLSX 檔案`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:541
msgid "Labour Welfare Fund (LWF) Report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:543
msgid ""
"This report covers the contributions made toward the Labour Welfare Fund "
"(LWF) by both employer and employee. It tracks the deduction amounts and "
"helps ensure compliance with state-level welfare fund requirements."
msgstr ""
"此報表涵蓋僱主及僱員雙方為勞工福利基金（LWF）所作的供款，用以追蹤扣款金額並協"
"助確保符合州級福利基金的規定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:547
msgid ""
"To generate the report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Reporting --> Labour Welfare Fund Report`. A :guilabel:`Labour Welfare Fund "
"Report` pop-up window will appear. Set the :guilabel:`Start Date` and "
":guilabel:`End Date`, select a specific :guilabel:`Department` to filter "
"them by Department (otherwise all employees are included), click "
":guilabel:`Export XLSX` to download the Labour Welfare Fund Report report."
msgstr ""
"要產生報告，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 報告 --> 勞工福利基金報"
"告`。系統會彈出一個 :guilabel:`勞工福利基金報告` 視窗。設定 :guilabel:`開始日"
"期` 及 :guilabel:`結束日期`，選擇特定 :guilabel:`部門` 以按部門篩選（否則將包"
"括所有員工），然後點擊 :guilabel:`匯出 XLSX` 以下載勞工福利基金報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:553
msgid "Labour Welfare Fund Report"
msgstr "勞工福利基金報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:559
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:569
msgid "Salary Statement Report"
msgstr "薪酬結算報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:561
msgid ""
"The salary statement report is used to provide employees with their current "
"salary and cumulative salary, along with all salary components, for the "
"selected year."
msgstr ""
"薪酬結算單報表用於向員工提供所選年度的當前薪酬、累計薪酬以及所有薪酬組成部分"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:564
msgid ""
"To generate the report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Reporting --> Salary Statement Report`. Click on :guilabel:`New`, set "
"desired :guilabel:`Year` and :guilabel:`Month`, set the "
":guilabel:`description` for pdf name. Then Click on :guilabel:`Populate` to "
"create a pdf for each employee, which can be accessed through the smart "
"button which appears after populating."
msgstr ""
"若要產生報告，請前往:menuselection:`薪資應用程式 --> 報告 --> 薪資結算報告`。"
"點擊:guilabel:`新增`，設定所需的:guilabel:`年份`和:guilabel:`月份`，並為 PDF "
"檔案名稱設定:guilabel:`描述`。然後點擊:guilabel:`填入`，為每位員工建立 PDF 檔"
"案。填入資料後，可透過隨即顯示的智能按鈕存取這些檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:575
msgid "Yearly Salary by Employee"
msgstr "按員工劃分的年薪"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:577
msgid ""
"The Yearly Salary by Employee report provides month-wise salary details for "
"the selected year, including salary components and the applicable salary "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"「按員工劃分的年度薪金」報表提供所選年份的逐月薪金詳情，包括薪金組成部分及適"
"用的薪金結構。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:580
msgid ""
"To generate the report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Reporting --> Yearly Salary by Employee`. A :guilabel:`Labour Welfare Fund "
"Report` pop-up window will appear. Set the :guilabel:`Year`, set "
":guilabel:`Department` or :guilabel:`Job Position` to filter out the "
"employees. Click on :guilabel:`Print` to download Yearly Salary by Employee "
"Report."
msgstr ""
"如要產生報表，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 報表 --> 按員工劃分的年"
"度薪酬`。系統會顯示 :guilabel:`勞工福利基金報表` 彈出視窗。設定 :guilabel:`年"
"份`，並設定 :guilabel:`部門` 或 :guilabel:`職位` 以篩選員工。點擊 "
":guilabel:`列印` 以下載按員工劃分的年度薪酬報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:585
msgid "Yearly Salary by Employee Report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Jordan **Payroll** localization offers a comprehensive solution for "
"managing payroll in compliance with Jordanian labor laws. It supports income"
" tax calculations using progressive tax brackets, social security "
"contributions from both employees and employers and basic salary "
"calculations, including allowances such as housing and transportation."
msgstr ""
"約旦 **薪酬管理** 本地化套件提供全面的解決方案，協助您按照約旦勞動法例管理薪"
"酬。該套件支援按累進稅階計算所得稅、計算僱員及僱主的社會保障供款，以及計算基"
"本薪金（包括房屋及交通等津貼）。"

