#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Annual Leave Time-off Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select the"
" time type used for annual leave. The time type is used to compute the "
"remaining unused annual leave balance when the employee leaves the company."
