msgstr ""
":guilabel:`WPS 支薪銀行賬戶`：使用下拉式選單選擇用於支付員工薪酬的銀行賬戶，"
"或建立新賬戶。該賬戶 **必須** 屬於所選的 :guilabel:`支薪方`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:101
msgid ""
"If creating a new bank account for the :guilabel:`WPS Disbursement Bank "
