#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:119
msgid ""
"Every employee being paid must have their employee profiles configured for "
"the Oman payroll localization. Additional fields are present after "
"configuring the database for Oman."
msgstr ""
"每位獲發薪金的員工都必須設定適用於阿曼薪酬本地化的員工檔案。將資料庫設定為阿"
"曼後，系統會顯示額外欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:122
msgid ""
"To update an employee form, open the **Employees** app and click on the "
"desired employee record. Ensure a :guilabel:`Work Email` and :guilabel:`Work"
" Phone` are configured on the employee form, and configure the required "
"fields in the related tabs."
msgstr ""
"如要更新僱員表單，請開啟 **僱員** 應用程式，並點擊所需的僱員紀錄。確保僱員表"
"單上已設定 :guilabel:`工作電郵` 及 :guilabel:`工作電話`，並在相關分頁中設定所"
"需欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:134
msgid ""
"These accounts are used to pay the employee. Payroll **cannot** be processed"
" for employees without a *trusted* :ref:`bank account <employees/private-"
"contact>`. If no trusted bank account is set, a warning appears on the "
"**Payroll** dashboard and an error occurs when attempting to generate the "
"|WPS| payment report."
msgstr ""
"這些帳戶用於向員工支薪。若員工沒有*受信任*的:ref:`銀行帳戶 <employees/"
"private-contact>`，便**無法**處理其薪酬。如果未設定受信任的銀行帳戶，**薪"
"酬**儀表板上會顯示警告，並在嘗試產生 |WPS| 付款報告時發生錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:139
msgid ""
"In the *Citizenship* section, use the drop-down menu in the "
":guilabel:`Nationality (Country)` field to select the employee's "
"nationality. This is used when determining the level of coverage under the "
"Social Protection Fund. Next, select what kind of :guilabel:`Identification "
"Type` the employee has using the drop-down menu. The default options are "
":guilabel:`Passport` and :guilabel:`Civil Status Card`. This is used when "
"extracting the |WPS| file."
msgstr ""
"在*公民身份*部分，使用:guilabel:`國籍（國家/地區）`欄位的下拉式選單選擇員工的"
"國籍。這將用於釐定社會保障基金（Social Protection Fund）的保障級別。接着，使"
"用下拉式選單選擇員工持有的:guilabel:`證件類型`。預設選項為:guilabel:`護"
"照`及:guilabel:`公民身份卡`。這會在擷取 |WPS| 檔案時使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:150
msgid ""
"Fill out all the information regarding employees' contracts, residency "
"status, tax treatments, deductions, etc. in this tab."
msgstr "在此分頁填寫所有與員工合約、居留身份、稅務處理、扣減項目等相關的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:153
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Pay Category` to :guilabel:`Oman: Employee` in the "
"*Contract Overview* section, and set the :guilabel:`Working hours` to "
":guilabel:`Oman Working Schedule 40h/Week` in the *Schedule* section."
msgstr ""
"在 *合約概覽* 部分，將 :guilabel:`薪酬類別` 設為 :guilabel:`阿曼：員工`；並"
"在 *時間表* 部分，將 :guilabel:`工作時間` 設為 :guilabel:`阿曼每週 40 小時工"
"作時間表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:157
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Is Eligible` checkbox in the *End of Service "
"Benefit* section is unchecked, indicating the employee is **not** eligible "
"for end of service benefits. If the employee **is** eligible, ensure the box"
" is checked."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，*服務終止福利* 部分中的:guilabel:`符合資格`核取方塊為未勾選狀態，"
"表示員工**不**符合資格領取服務終止福利。如員工**確實**符合資格，請確保已勾選"
"此方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:161
msgid ""
"Additionally, the contributions percentages in the *SPF* section are "
"preconfigured for each insurance category for both the *Employer "
