"access the **Payroll** app settings required for Saudi Arabia."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:207
msgid ""
"First, the company bank account must be configured to pay employees, per WPS"
" regulations. Click into the drop-down space beneath the "
":guilabel:`Establishment Bank Account` field, and click "
":guilabel:`Create...`. This opens a :guilabel:`Create Establishment's Bank "
"Account` pop-up window. :ref:`Configure the company's bank account  "
"<employees/private-contact>`, and ensure it is marked as *trusted*. Click "
":guilabel:`Save` to save the information and close the window."
msgstr ""
"首先，根據 WPS 法規，必須設定公司銀行賬戶以向員工支薪。點擊 :guilabel:`機構銀"
"行賬戶` 欄位下方的下拉式選單，然後點擊 :guilabel:`建立...`。系統會開啟 "
":guilabel:`建立機構銀行賬戶` 彈出視窗。:ref:`設定公司的銀行賬戶  <employees/"
"private-contact>`，並確保將其標記為 *已信任*。點擊 :guilabel:`儲存` 以儲存資"
"料並關閉視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:213
msgid ""
"Next, enter the company's :guilabel:`MoL Establishment ID`. This ID number "
"is provided by Saudi Arabia's Ministry of Labor."
msgstr "接下來，輸入公司的 :guilabel:`MoL 機構編號`。此編號由沙特阿拉伯勞工部提供。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:216
msgid ""
"Finally, select the :doc:`time off type <../../time_off/time_off_types>` "
"that is used to calculate Finally, select the :doc:`time off type "
"<../../time_off/time_off_types>` that is used to calculate the "
":guilabel:`Annual Leave Balance` set in the :ref:`employee's profile "
"<payroll/saudi_payroll_info>`."
msgstr ""
"最後，選擇用於計算的:doc:`休假類型 <../../time_off/time_off_types>` 最後，選"
"擇:doc:`休假類型 <../../time_off/time_off_types>`，用於計算:guilabel:`年假結"
"餘`（設定於:ref:`員工個人資料 <payroll/saudi_payroll_info>`中）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:224
msgid ""
"When the **l10n_sa_hr_payroll** module is :ref:`installed "
"<payroll/saudi_apps>`, a new :guilabel:`Salary Structure` gets installed, "
":guilabel:`KSA Employee`. This structure includes two :guilabel:`Structure "
"Types`, :guilabel:`Saudi Arabia: Monthly Pay`, and :guilabel:`SA Salary "
