msgstr ""
":ref:`安裝 <general/install>` 以下模組，以取得 **阿拉伯聯合酋長國** **薪酬** "
"本地化套件的所有功能："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:23
