":guilabel:`識別編號`：用於提取 :ref:`WPS 報表 <payroll/l10n_ae/wps-reports>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank Account`: Used to extract the :ref:`WPS report "
"<payroll/l10n_ae/wps-reports>` and generate payments for those employees."
