":guilabel:`銀行賬戶`：用於擷取 :ref:`WPS 報表 <payroll/l10n_ae/wps-reports>` "
"並為該等員工產生付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:48
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Nationality (Country)` field needs to be set even if the "
"employee is a |UAE| national since there is a different type of handling if "
"they are citizens of a |GCC| country."
msgstr ""
"必須設定 :guilabel:`國籍（國家）` 欄位，即使該員工為 |UAE| 國民亦然，因為若"
"為 |GCC| 國家公民，系統會有不同的處理方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:54
msgid ""
"Once the employee form has been created, ensure the :doc:`contract "
"<../contracts>` is enabled by clicking on the :icon:`fa-book` "
":guilabel:`Contracts` smart button, or going to :menuselection:`Employees "
"--> Contracts`."
msgstr ""
"建立員工表單後，請確保已啟用:doc:`合約 <../contracts>`，方法是點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`合約` 智能按鈕，或前往 :menuselection:`員工 --> 合約`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:58
msgid ""
"The following contractual information related to employees working in the "
"United Arab Emirates are found under the *Salary Information* tab:"
msgstr "與在阿拉伯聯合酋長國工作的員工相關的以下合約資訊，位於*薪酬資訊*分頁內："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wage Type`: select :guilabel:`Fixed Wage` for Full-time or Part-"
"time employees, or :guilabel:`Hourly Wage` for employees who are paid "
"hourly."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`薪酬類型`：全職或兼職員工請選取 :guilabel:`固定薪酬`，按時薪支薪的"
"員工則選取 :guilabel:`時薪`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:63
msgid ":guilabel:`Scheduled Pay`: the frequency of payslip issuance."
msgstr ":guilabel:`發薪週期`：發放糧單的頻率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wage`: :guilabel:`Monthly` or :guilabel:`Hourly` depending on the"
" :guilabel:`Wage Type`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工資`：:guilabel:`每月` 或 :guilabel:`每小時`，視乎 :guilabel:`工"
"資類型` 而定。"

