#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:71
msgid ""
"The allowance values set on the contract are used on the payslip lines as "
"allowances."
msgstr "合約上設定的津貼金額會用作糧單明細行上的津貼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Number of Leave Days`: Used to specify the number of annual leave"
" days that an employee deserves in a particular year. Regardless of the "
"actual number of leaves that the employee gets (extra leave days for some "
"internal company reasons), the final calculation of the end of service and "
"unpaid leaves is dependent on the number set on this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`休假天數`：用於指定員工在特定年份應享有的年假天數。無論員工實際獲"
"得多少休假（因公司內部原因而獲發的額外休假天數），離職結算及無薪假的最終計算"
"均取決於此欄位設定的數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:79
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Number of Leave Days` affects the calculation for unpaid "
"leave provisions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is DEWS Applied`: DIFC Employee Workplace Savings (DEWS), if the "
"employee is a |UAE| national and has |DEWS| applied, tick this checkbox."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`是否已套用 DEWS`：DIFC 僱員職場儲蓄計劃（DEWS）。若僱員為 |UAE| 國"
"民且已套用 |DEWS|，請剔選此核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Computed Based On Daily Salary`: Defines the way that the end of "
"service is calculated:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:85
msgid ""
"Do not tick this checkbox if the standard calculation is to be used. This "
"computes the compensation amount by dividing the monthly salary by **30** "
"and then multiplying it by **21**."
msgstr ""
"如要使用標準計算方式，請勿勾選此核取方塊。此計算方式會將月薪除以 **30**，再乘"
"以 **21** 來計算補償金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:87
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:89
msgid ""
"Tick this checkbox and directly set the actual :guilabel:`Daily Salary` so "
"that it is used in the end of service calculation."
msgstr "勾選此方格並直接設定實際的 :guilabel:`日薪`，以便用於服務終止計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:93
msgid "Salary structures and salary rules"
msgstr "薪酬結構與薪酬規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:96
msgid "Other input rules"
msgstr "其他輸入規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:98
msgid ""
"The following are the different allowances that can be defined directly on "
"the :doc:`payslip form <../payslips>` to allow for the values that are set "
"against these inputs to affect the |WPS| calculations as monthly variable "
"salaries for the specific employee that they are linked to."
msgstr ""
"以下列出可直接於:doc:`薪資單表單 <../payslips>`定義的各項津貼。針對這些輸入項"
"目設定的數值，會作為所連結特定員工的每月浮動薪金，影響 |WPS| 的計算結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:102
msgid ""
"Rules that are related to the |WPS| setup, are linked to other input types, "
"and whenever they are used, their values are reflected on the |WPS| as a "
"monthly variable salary for that specific employee."
msgstr ""
"與 |WPS| 設定相關的規則會連結至其他輸入類型。每當使用這些規則時，其數值都會反"
"映在 |WPS| 中，作為該名員工的每月浮動薪資。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:107
