#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:125
msgid "End of service (EOS)"
msgstr "服務終止（EOS）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:127
msgid ""
"End of service (EOS) provides the calculation for the allowance that the "
"employee gets at the end of their service. It is triggered when the "
"employee's departure reason is set by archiving the employee's record."
msgstr ""
"服務終止（EOS）功能可計算員工於離職時獲得的津貼。當透過封存員工記錄設定員工的"
"離職原因時，便會觸發此計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:131
msgid "There are several different calculations depending on the scenario:"
msgstr "視乎不同情況，會有數種不同的計算方式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:133
msgid ""
"*The Employee spent less than a year in the company*: The employee does not "
"get any |EOS| allowance since they are not eligible for it (they are "
"eligible once they complete their first year in the company)."
msgstr ""
"*員工在公司任職未滿一年*：由於員工未符合資格，因此不會獲得任何 |EOS| 津貼（員"
"工在公司服務滿第一年後即可符合資格）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:136
msgid ""
"*The Employee spent more than a year and less than 5 years in the company*: "
"The employee is eligible for an equivalent of **21** days of salary for each"
" year they spent on the company."
msgstr ""
"*員工在公司服務超過一年但少於五年*：該員工每在公司服務滿一年，即可獲得相當於 "
"**21** 天薪資的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:140
msgid ""
"There are two ways for calculating the daily wage that gets paid for the "
"employee against the 21 days of the |EOS|: Either by the default way of "
"dividing the monthly basic wage by 30. Or, it can be manually input on the "
"contract of the employee under the *Daily Salary* field."
msgstr ""
"計算員工就 21 天|EOS|應獲支付的日薪有兩種方法：可以使用預設方法，即將每月基本"
"薪金除以 30；或者在員工合約的 *每日薪金* 欄位中手動輸入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:144
msgid ""
"*The Employee spent more than 5 years in the company*: The employee is "
"eligible for an equivalent of **30** days of salary for each year they spent"
" on the company. In this case, if the default method is used, then the "
"employee gets paid an equivalent of 1 month of salary, and the set *Daily "
"Salary* field, they will get the amount for the day multiplied by 30."
msgstr ""
"*員工在公司任職超過 5 年*：員工在公司每任職一年，便有資格獲得相當於 **30** 天"
"薪金的金額。在此情況下，如果使用預設方式，員工將獲發相當於 1 個月薪金的款項；"
"而在已設定 *每日薪金* 欄位的情況下，他們將獲得每日金額乘以 30 的款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:150
msgid ""
"There are two payslips printout formats, one for normal salaries and one for"
" end of service payslips, it is based on the employee being archived and "
"having a departure reason or not."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:154
msgid "End of service provision (EOS Provision)"
msgstr "終止服務撥備（EOS 撥備）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:156
msgid ""
"The |EOS| provision provides the calculation for the end-of-service "
"provision amount that the company puts aside every month to count for the "
"|EOS| that will be paid to them as an |EOS| allowance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:160
msgid ""
"Unlike the |EOS|, the provision is part of the employee's payslip from the "
"start of their contract."
msgstr "與 |EOS| 不同，此準備金自員工合約開始之日起便會包含在其糧單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:162
msgid ""
"Just like the |EOS|, the provision has two calculations depending on the "
"period spent by the employee in the company:"
msgstr "與 |EOS| 一樣，該撥備會視乎員工在公司的任職年期而有兩種計算方式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:165
msgid ""
"Less than 5 years: :math:`\\frac{\\text{Monthly "
"Wage}}{30}\\times{\\frac{21}{12}}`"
msgstr "少於 5 年：:math:`\\frac{\\text{Monthly Wage}}{30}\\times{\\frac{21}{12}}`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:166
msgid ""
"More than 5 years: :math:`\\frac{\\text{Monthly "
"Wage}}{30}\\times{\\frac{30}{12}}`"
msgstr "超過 5 年：:math:`\\frac{\\text{Monthly Wage}}{30}\\times{\\frac{30}{12}}`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:169
msgid ""
"This rule is not shown to the employee on the payslip printout and it does "
"not affect their net payable, it is only for internal use by the company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:173
msgid "Annual leave provisions"
msgstr "年假撥備"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:175
msgid ""
"Annual leave provisions are used for calculating the annual leave provision "
"accumulated each month, just like the |EOS| provision, it does not affect "
"the total amount paid to the employee, it is for internal use by the "
"company."
msgstr ""
"年假準備金用於計算每月累積的年假準備金。與 |EOS| 準備金一樣，它不會影響支付給"
"員工的總金額，僅供公司內部使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:179
msgid ""
"It is calculated by dividing the employee's total salary (Total Salary = "
"Wage + Allowances) by **30** to get the daily salary. The daily salary is "
"then multiplied by the eligible leave days and divided by **12** to "
"determine the monthly provision amount."
msgstr ""
"計算方式是將僱員的總薪金（總薪金 = 基本工資 + 津貼）除以 **30** 以得出日薪，"
"然後將日薪乘以合資格休假天數並除以 **12**，從而計算出每月撥備金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:183
msgid ""
"\\text{Monthly Leave Provision} = \\frac{\\text{Total Salary} \\times \\text{Number of Leave Days}}{30}\n"
"\\div 12"
msgstr ""
"\\text{每月假期撥備} = \\frac{\\text{總薪金} \\times \\text{假期日數}}{30}\n"
"\\div 12"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:190
msgid "Plane ticket allowance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:192
msgid ""
"Employees can receive an airfare allowance based on the number of air "
"tickets provided by the company per year. The allowance value per ticket is "
"defined on the employee's contract under the *Payroll* tab, where the "
"configuration is maintained for each employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:196
msgid ""
"During payroll processing, the payroll officer can apply this allowance by "
"opening the relevant payslip and specifying the number of air tickets under "
"the *Salary Inputs* tab. The system then uses the defined per-ticket value "
"from the employee profile to compute the total airfare allowance and include"
" it in the payslip accordingly."
msgstr ""
"在處理薪酬期間，薪酬管理員可開啟相關糧單，並在 *薪資輸入* 分頁下指定機票數量"
"，以套用此津貼。系統隨後會使用員工資料中定義的每張機票金額，計算總機票津貼並"
"相應納入糧單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:202
msgid "Social insurance contributions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:204
msgid ""
"Social insurance contributions calculate the *social insurance*, which is "
"only available to |UAE| nationals."
msgstr "社會保險供款會計算*社會保險*，此項目僅適用於|UAE|國民。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:207
msgid ""
"The company contributes **15%** of the total monthly salary for the employee"
" if the company is in **Abu Dhabi** and **12.5%** if the company is in "
"**another Emirate**."
msgstr ""
"如果公司位於 **阿布扎比**，公司須為員工供款月薪總額的 **15%**；如果公司位於 "
"**其他酋長國**，則供款 **12.5%**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:211
msgid ""
"The total monthly salary for the employee = [basic + all allowances set on "
"the contract]."
msgstr "員工的每月總薪金 = [基本薪金 + 合約中設定的所有津貼]。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:213
msgid ""
"On the other hand, the employee contributes **5%** of their total monthly "
"salary and that amount gets deducted from the payslip amount."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:217
msgid "Remaining leave balance rules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:219
msgid ""
"Annual remaining leave balance rules are used for calculating the amount to "
"be paid to or taken from the employee at the end of their service in the "
"company, based on the eligibility of the employee of leave days during the "
"current year."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:223
msgid ""
"The annual leave :doc:`time off type <../../time_off/time_off_types>` is "
"specified using the :guilabel:`Is Annual Leave` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"年假 :doc:`休假類型 <../../time_off/time_off_types>` 是透過 :guilabel:`是否為"
"年假` 核取方塊指定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:226
msgid ""
"When the employee departs, the rule calculates the amount of leave days "
"earned by the employee up to the current date, and subtracts the number of "
"annual leave days taken. If the result is positive, this means the employee "
"should be compensated for remaining amount, and if negative, this means the "
"employee is liable to the company for the difference."
msgstr ""
"當員工離職時，規則會計算該員工截至目前為止已累積的假期日數，並減去已放取的年"
"假日數。如果結果為正數，表示公司應就剩餘假期向員工發放補償；如果結果為負數，"
"則表示員工須向公司賠償有關差額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:232
msgid "Sick leave rules"
msgstr "病假規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:234
msgid ""
"Sick leave rules provide the calculation for cases where the employee is on "
"sick leave and decides how the payslip should be affected."
msgstr "病假規則用於計算員工放取病假時的情況，並決定糧單應如何受影響。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:237
msgid "There are **3 cases** for the employee to have:"
msgstr "員工可能會遇到以下 **3 種情況**："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:239
msgid ""
"**Fully paid sick leave:** The employee can upload a sick leave certificate "
"(SLI). Employees are eligible for **15 days** of this type of leave per "
"calendar year."
msgstr ""
"**全薪病假：** 員工可上載病假證明書 (SLI)。每個曆年，員工可享有 **15 天** 此"
"類假期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:243
msgid ""
"The SLI is not mandatory in Odoo but can be done from the setup of the "
":doc:`time off types <../../time_off/time_off_types>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 並不強制要求設定 SLI，但您可於 :doc:`休假類型 <../../time_off/"
"time_off_types>` 設定中完成此配置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:246
msgid ""
"**50% paid sick leave:** Same as the fully paid one, but the employees are "
"eligible for **30 days** from this leave type. These 30 days are counted "
"after the first **15** fully paid days."
msgstr ""
"**50% 支薪病假：** 與全薪病假相同，但員工在此假期類型下可享有 **30 天** 假期"
"。此 30 天會在首 **15** 天全薪病假之後計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:248
msgid ""
"**0% paid sick leave:** Same as the fully paid one, but the employees are "
"eligible for **45 days** from this leave type. These **45 days** are counted"
" after the first **15/30** fully/half-paid days."
msgstr ""
"**0% 支薪病假：**與全薪病假相同，但員工可享有 **45 天** 此類病假。這 **45 "
"天** 會在首 **15/30** 天的全薪／半薪病假之後計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:253
msgid ""
"As per the labor law of the United Arab Emirates, the 15, 30, 45 days are "
"not specified as working days or calendar days so this point will rely on "
"the company policy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:256
msgid ""
"There is a single sick leave time-off type: Sick Time Off. The system "
"automatically tracks the number of sick leave days taken by the employee and"
" applies the corresponding percentage based on the accumulated balance."
msgstr ""
"系統僅設有一種病假休假類型：病假。系統會自動追蹤員工已請的病假天數，並根據累"
"積餘額套用相應的百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:260
msgid ""
"The amount paid for the employee per sick leave day is counted as follows:"
msgstr "員工每日病假獲發放的金額計算如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:262
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\text{Number of Leave Days} \\times \\text{Gross Per Month}}{30} "
"\\times \\text{Percentage}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:267
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:301
msgid ""
"Where the gross per month is the basic + all other allowances set on the "
"employee's contract."
msgstr "其中，每月總薪金為基本薪金 + 員工合約上設定的所有其他津貼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:270
msgid "Daman investments end of service programme (DEWS)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:272
msgid ""
"|DEWS| allows for calculating the |DEWS| amounts for the employees who are "
"eligible for it and would like it to be registered under their current "
"contract with the company."
msgstr "|DEWS| 可為符合資格且希望將其登記於現有公司合約下的員工計算 |DEWS| 金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:275
msgid ""
"If the employee is registered, the employer is required to contribute based "
"on the number of years the employee spent in the company as follows:"
msgstr "如員工已登記，僱主須按員工於公司服務的年資作出供款，詳情如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:278
msgid ""
"**Less than 5 years:** 5.83% is deducted from the employee's **BASIC** "
"salary towards the |DEWS|."
msgstr "**少於 5 年：**從員工的 **基本** 薪金中扣除 5.83%，撥入 |DEWS|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:279
msgid ""
"**More than 5 years:** 8.33% of The employee's **BASIC** is deducted from "
"the total payable for that employee."
msgstr "**超過 5 年：**從該員工的應付總額中扣除其 **BASIC** 的 8.33%。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:282
msgid ""
"The employee may choose to contribute up to 10% of their basic salary as a "
"voluntary contribution, which is deducted directly from their monthly "
"salary. This contribution is configured in the :guilabel:`Employee "
"Contribution` field of the |DEWS| Benefits section, found in the *Payroll* "
"tab of the employee record."
msgstr ""
"員工可選擇將基本薪金的最多 10% 作為自願性供款，該款項會直接從其每月薪金中扣除"
"。此供款可在 :guilabel:`員工供款` 欄位中設定，該欄位位於員工記錄 *薪酬* 分頁"
"的 |DEWS| 福利部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:287
msgid ""
"This field is only visible when :guilabel:`Is DEWS Applied` is set to "
":guilabel:`True`, and is used to enable and manage voluntary employee "
"contributions within the |DEWS| setup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:291
msgid "Unpaid leaves"
msgstr "無薪假"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:293
msgid ""
"Unpaid leaves allow for calculating the amount to be deducted when an "
"employee takes an unpaid leave. It is calculated by the following equation:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:296
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\text{Total Number of Unpaid Leave Days} \\times \\text{Gross Per "
"Month}}{30}"
msgstr "\\frac{\\text{總無薪假天數} \\times \\text{每月總薪酬}}{30}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:304
msgid "Out of contract days"
msgstr "合約期外日數"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:306
msgid ""
"The out of contract days rule provides a calculation for the days "
"before/after the contract period that overlaps with the contract of days on "
"the employee's payslips."
msgstr "合約期外天數規則會計算合約期前後，與員工糧單上合約天數重疊的天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:310
msgid ""
"Payslips are generated for the period of 1st-30th of September but the "
"contract expires on the 21st, in this case, there are 7 days flagged as out "
"of contract."
msgstr ""
"系統為 9 月 1 日至 30 日期間產生糧單，但合約於 21 日到期，在此情況下，會有 7 "
"天被標記為合約期外。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:313
msgid "It is calculated by the following equation:"
msgstr "其計算公式如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:315
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\text{Total Number of Unpaid Leave Days} \\times \\text{Gross Per "
"Month}}{\\text{Number of Days in Current Month}}"
msgstr "\\frac{\\text{無薪假總日數} \\times \\text{每月總薪金}}{\\text{當月總日數}}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:321
msgid "Manual deductions"
msgstr "手動扣減"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:323
msgid ""
"Manual deductions allows the user to add manual deductions to be applied to "
"employees per payslip."
msgstr "手動扣款可讓用戶為僱員的每張糧單加入手動扣款項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:325
msgid ""
"The amount to be deducted and the description of the deduction is to be set "
"directly on the payslip manually as other inputs."
msgstr "須扣除的金額及扣減說明，需直接在工資單上以其他輸入項目手動設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:331
msgid ""
"Other than the employee's salary, there are additional employer costs that "
"need to be accounted for. These include medical insurance, work permits, and"
" employment visas for expatriate employees."
msgstr ""
"除員工薪金外，還須計算其他僱主成本，包括醫療保險、工作許可證及外籍員工的工作"
"簽證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:334
msgid ""
"These costs are defined as yearly values on the employee's record under the "
"*Payroll* tab and are recognized on a monthly basis as other employer "
"expenses.They are computed on the employee's payslip, but do not affect the "
"net payable to the employee and do not appear on the payslip PDF shared with"
" the employee."
msgstr ""
"這些費用在員工記錄的 *薪酬* 分頁中定義為年度數值，並按月確認為其他僱主開支。"
"這些費用會在員工糧單上計算，但不會影響應付給員工的淨薪金，亦不會顯示在與員工"
"分享的糧單 PDF 上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:340
msgid "Net salary"
msgstr "淨薪金"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:342
msgid ""
"Net salary showcases the net amount that the employee will get based on the "
"payslip."
msgstr "淨工資顯示員工根據糧單可獲得的淨額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:344
msgid ""
"It is calculated by adding basic to all allowances and deducting all "
"deductions from it."
msgstr "計算方法為將基本薪金加上所有津貼，再減去所有扣減項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:347
msgid ""
"The approach taken for the rules above is to first get the full amounts for "
"all static amounts that are set on the contract and then deduct the amounts "
"that should be deducted such as unpaid leaves, sick leaves, manual "
"deductions, commission, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:354
msgid ""
"The employee net cost allows payroll officers to track the total employee "
"cost beyond the employee's net salary. The employee's net cost is computed "
"automatically upon each generated payslip and includes both direct and "
"indirect costs."
msgstr ""
"員工淨成本讓薪酬管理人員能夠追蹤除員工淨薪金以外的總員工成本。系統會在每次生"
"成糧單時自動計算員工淨成本，當中包括直接成本和間接成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:358
msgid ""
"Direct costs represent the total amount payable to the employee, while "
"indirect costs include additional employer expenses, such as DEWS and social"
" insurance. Although these amounts are calculated and available in the "
"system for internal reporting and analysis, they do not appear on the "
"payslip PDF generated for the employee."
msgstr ""
"直接成本代表應付予員工的總金額，而間接成本則包括額外的僱主開支，例如 DEWS 及"
"社會保險。雖然這些金額會在系統中計算並供內部報告及分析之用，但不會顯示在為員"
"工產生的薪資單 PDF 上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:364
msgid ""
"If an employee has a net payable salary of 20,000 AED, and the following "
"indirect costs:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:366
msgid "Medical insurance of 3,000 AED a year (250 AED a month)."
msgstr "每年 3,000 AED 的醫療保險（每月 250 AED）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:367
msgid "Social Insurance Company Contribution of 3,000 AED."
msgstr "社會保險公司供款為 3,000 AED。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:368
msgid "Social Insurance Employee Contribution 2,200 AED."
msgstr "社會保險員工供款 2,200 AED。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:370
msgid "The employee's Net Cost is: 20,000 + 250 + 3,000 + 2,200 = 23,250 AED"
msgstr "員工的淨成本為：20,000 + 250 + 3,000 + 2,200 = 23,250 AED"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:373
msgid "Generating accounting entries from payslips"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:375
msgid ""
"The accounts are linked to each payroll rule as a debit or credit so that "
"when a draft entry is generated from a payslip, the amounts are reflected on"
" the accounts accordingly."
msgstr ""
"會計科目會作為借方或貸方連結至每項薪酬規則，以便從糧單產生草稿分錄時，相關金"
"額能相應反映於各會計科目中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:378
msgid ""
"The accounts need to be set in a way that would make the end-result entry "
"balanced, otherwise a warning is raised if it is not balanced and it will "
"not generate the entry."
msgstr ""
"必須以能使最終分錄達到平衡的方式設定會計科目；否則，若分錄未平衡，系統便會發"
"出警告，且不會產生該分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:381
msgid ""
"After reviewing the payslips and making sure that all the amounts are "
"correct, generate a draft entry, either one entry for all employees or an "
"entry per employee depending on the setup done on the settings."
msgstr ""
"覆核薪資單並確認所有金額無誤後，即可生成草稿分錄。系統會根據設定，為所有員工"
"生成單一分錄，或為每位員工分別生成分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:386
msgid "Debit and credit accounts set up for the basic and allowance rules."
msgstr "為基本薪資及津貼規則設定的借方及貸方賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:388
msgid "Accounting setup for the rules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:392
msgid "Pay employees"
msgstr "向員工支薪"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:394
msgid ""
"After a batch or a payslip's journal entry has been posted, the company can "
"proceed to pay their employees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:397
msgid ""
"In the batch itself or on the payslip, by clicking on the pay button, a "
"payment is created and linked to the posted entry for the payslip. The same "
"can be done for batch payslips if one payment is done from a single/multiple"
" payment bank/cash journal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:402
msgid ""
"Once the payslip is generated, the employee will be able to access the slips"
" from their portal users. They will automatically receive an email "
"mentioning that the payslips are now available to be viewed on their portal "
"view."
msgstr ""
"生成工資單後，員工即可透過其門戶用戶帳戶查閱工資單。系統會自動向他們發送電郵"
"，通知他們現可在門戶檢視頁面查看工資單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:407
msgid "Payslip printouts"
msgstr "糧單列印本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:409
msgid ""
"Two printout formats can be extracted from the payslip depending on the "
"*type* of payslip, either a *Monthly* payslip or an *End of Service* "
"Payslip. It is triggered if the employee the payslip is generated for was "
"archived during that month."
msgstr ""
"系統可根據薪酬單的 *類型* 匯出兩種列印格式，分別為 *每月* 薪酬單及 *離職結"
"算* 薪酬單。若獲發薪酬單的員工於該月內被封存，便會觸發此格式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:414
msgid "Instant Pay structure"
msgstr "即時支薪結構"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:416
msgid ""
"This structure is used when off-cycle payslips are required to make payments"
" to employees for special situations, such as one-time or advance salaries. "
"Examples of one-time payments include:"
msgstr ""
"當需要為特殊情況（例如一次性薪金或預支薪金）發出週期外糧單以向員工支薪時，會"
"使用此結構。一次性付款的例子包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:420
msgid "Bonuses"
msgstr "獎金"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:421
msgid "Allowances"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:424
msgid "Salary Advances"
msgstr "預支薪金"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:426
msgid ""
"Employees may request a portion of their salary before the end of the pay "
"cycle. In such cases, the payroll officer can issue a salary advance using "
"the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"員工可在發薪週期結束前申請預支部分薪金。在這種情況下，薪酬專員可按照以下步驟"
"發放預支薪金："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:429
msgid ""
"Create an off-cycle payslip using the United Arab Emirates: Instant Pay "
"structure."
msgstr "使用「阿拉伯聯合酋長國：即時支薪」結構建立週期外薪資單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:431
msgid ""
"Add another input of type Salary Advance and specify the amount to be paid "
"to the employee."
msgstr "新增另一個「預支薪金」類型的輸入項目，並指定須支付予員工的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:433
msgid "Confirm the payslip and process the payment."
msgstr "確認糧單並處理付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:435
msgid ""
"In the next cycle, when a payslip is generated for the employee using the "
"`United Arab Emirates: Regular Pay` structure, another input type, `Advance "
"Recovery`, is automatically added for the same amount that was previously "
"paid."
msgstr ""
"在下一個週期，當系統使用 `阿拉伯聯合酋長國：常規支薪` 架構為該僱員建立工資單"
"時，系統會自動新增另一個輸入類型 `預支扣回` ，金額與先前已支付的金額相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:440
msgid ""
"If the employee and payroll officer agree to recover the advance over two "
"consecutive cycles, the payroll officer can adjust the Advance Recovery "
"amount on the first payslip. The remaining balance is automatically added to"
" the following cycle."
msgstr ""
"若員工與薪酬主任同意分兩個連續週期扣回預支款項，薪酬主任可在第一張糧單上調整"
"預支扣回金額。餘額將自動加至下一個週期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:445
msgid "Emiratisation compliance report"
msgstr "阿聯酋本土化合規報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:447
msgid ""
"The *Emiratisation Compliance Report* provides the ability to track the "
"growth in the number of Emirati employees within the company to monitor "
"Emiratisation compliance."
msgstr ""
"*阿聯酋本地化合規報告* 可追蹤公司內阿聯酋籍員工人數的增長，從而監察阿聯酋本地"
"化合規情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:450
msgid ""
"The percentage is calculated based on Emirati employees who meet the skill "
"level criteria defined by the Ministry of Human Resources and Emiratisation "
"(MoHRE), determined by the employee's job position and its associated skill "
"level. Emirati employees with a skill level of 5 or below are included in "
"the calculation, while those with a skill level of 6 and above are excluded."
msgstr ""
"此百分比根據符合人力資源及阿聯酋化部（MoHRE）所界定技能等級準則的阿聯酋籍員工"
"計算，並取決於員工的職位及其相關技能等級。技能等級為 5 級或以下的阿聯酋籍員工"
"會納入計算，而技能等級為 6 級或以上的員工則會排除在外。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:455
msgid "For accurate results, the following steps must be followed:"
msgstr "為確保結果準確，必須依循以下步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:457
msgid ""
"Ensure all Emirati employees have their nationality set to: United Arab "
"Emirates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:458
msgid "Ensure the job position is correctly set for all Emirati employees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:459
msgid ""
"Ensure the :abbr:`MoHRE (Ministry of Human Resources & Emiratisation)` skill"
" level is correctly configured on all job positions."
msgstr "請確保所有職位均已正確設定 :abbr:`MoHRE（人力資源與酋長國化部）` 技能級別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:461
msgid ""
"Generate the Emiratisation Compliance Report by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Employees app --> Reports --> Emiratisation Compliance "
"Report`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:467
msgid "Wages protection system (WPS) reports"
msgstr "工資保障系統（WPS）報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:469
msgid ""
"The |WPS| is a report that needs to be submitted by the company to prove "
"that they paid their employees the right amounts on the right dates. It can "
"either be generated per payslip or batch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:472
msgid "The following steps need to be followed before generating the report:"
msgstr "產生報告前，請依照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:474
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Payroll --> Configuration --> Settings` and under the "
":guilabel:`Emirati Localization` section, configure the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:477
