"When setting the :guilabel:`Salaries Bank Account` make sure to complete the"
" following:"
msgstr "設定:guilabel:`支薪銀行賬戶`時，請確保完成以下事項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:485
msgid ":guilabel:`Account Holder`: set as the company."
msgstr ":guilabel:`帳戶持有人`：設為公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:486
msgid ":guilabel:`Account Number`: has to be a valid IBAN."
msgstr ":guilabel:`賬戶號碼`：必須為有效的 IBAN。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:487
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank`: has to have the :guilabel:`Routing Code Agent` set and "
