#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:489
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send Money`: should be enabled and set to :guilabel:`Trusted`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`匯款`：應啟用並設為:guilabel:`受信任`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:491
msgid ""
"Set the unique identifier on all of the employees who are a part of the "
"target of the batch/payslip."
msgstr "為屬於該批次或糧單目標的所有員工設定唯一識別碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:494
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Identification No` field can be found on the employee's page "
"under the *Personal* tab."
msgstr "可在員工頁面的 *個人* 分頁中找到 :guilabel:`身份證號碼` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:497
msgid ""
"Once the initial setup is done, the |WPS| can be generated either for one "
"payslip or for a batch as follows:"
msgstr "完成初始設定後，可按以下方式為單張薪資單或整批薪資單產生 |WPS|："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:500
msgid "Generate the payslip one by one or as a batch."
msgstr "逐一或批量產生糧單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:501
msgid "Post the draft entity related to the payslips."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:502
msgid ""
"Create the payment report and set the :guilabel:`Export Format` to "
":guilabel:`UAE WPS`."
msgstr "建立付款報表，並將:guilabel:`匯出格式`設為:guilabel:`UAE WPS`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:505
msgid ""
"The Report can either be exported in a .sif format or a .xslx, as they both "
"have the same format."
msgstr "報告可匯出為 .sif 格式或 .xslx 格式，兩者具有相同格式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:509
msgid ""
"**Employee Detail Record** (**EDR**): includes details of the employees on "
"the batch. There should be one :abbr:`EDR (Employee Detail Record)` record "
"per employee."
msgstr ""
"**員工詳細紀錄**（**EDR**）：包含該批次中員工的詳細資料。每位員工應有一筆 "
":abbr:`EDR (員工詳細紀錄)` 紀錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:511
msgid ""
"**Employee Variable Pay** (**EVP**): includes the details of the variable "
"salary the employee got on that payslip. If the employee has any. The "
"variable amounts are calculated from when other inputs are used that are "
"linked to the salary rules (:menuselection:`Payroll --> Configuration --> "
"Rules`)."
msgstr ""
"**員工浮動薪酬**（**EVP**）：包含員工在該薪酬單上獲得的浮動薪金詳情（如有）。"
"浮動金額會在使用連結至薪酬規則的其他輸入項目時計算（:menuselection:`薪酬 --> "
"設定 --> 規則`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:515
msgid ""
"**Salary Control Record** (**SCR**): There should only be one :abbr:`SCR "
"(Salary Control Record)` per |WPS| file as it indicates the employer details"
" and the totals for the payslips."
msgstr ""
"**薪酬控制記錄**（**SCR**）：由於 :abbr:`SCR (薪酬控制記錄)` 用於顯示僱主詳情"
"及薪資單總額，因此每個 |WPS| 檔案只應有一個該記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:519
msgid ""
"The exported format is based on MoHRE guidelines and is aligned with the "
"formats used by most WPS agents in the United Arab Emirates, including "
"Emirates NBD, Emirates Islamic Bank, First Abu Dhabi Bank (FAB), and Dubai "
"Islamic Bank (DIB), among others."
msgstr ""
"匯出的格式是根據 MoHRE 指引制定，並與阿拉伯聯合酋長國大多數 WPS 代理機構（包"
"括 Emirates NBD、Emirates Islamic Bank、First Abu Dhabi Bank (FAB) 及 Dubai "
"Islamic Bank (DIB) 等）所使用的格式一致。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:5
msgid ""
"The U.S. payroll localization covers salary computations for employees, "
"including both employee and employer payroll taxes. It accounts for federal "
"and state regulations."
msgstr ""
"美國薪酬本地化方案涵蓋員工的薪酬計算，包括員工及僱主的薪酬稅項，並同時符合聯"
"邦及州政府法規。"

