"包含烏茲別克斯坦的薪酬結構及規則、工作記錄（休假）類型、離職原因、遣散費、剩"
"餘假期補償及年假撥備，並符合《烏茲別克斯坦勞動法》。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Uzbekistan - Payroll with Accounting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`烏茲別克 - 薪酬管理與會計`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:37
