#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:41
msgid ""
"Links the Uzbekistan salary rules to the accounts of the Uzbekistan chart of"
" accounts, so validated payslips generate journal entries."
msgstr ""
"將烏茲別克薪酬規則連結至烏茲別克會計科目表的科目，使已驗證的糧單能產生日記賬"
"分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:45
msgid ""
":doc:`Configure the Uzbekistan fiscal localization "
"<../../../finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`設定烏茲別克財務本地化 <../../../finance/fiscal_localizations/"
"uzbekistan>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:58
msgid ":guilabel:`TIN`: Enter the company's :abbr:`TIN (Tax ID Number)`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`TIN`：輸入公司的 :abbr:`TIN (稅務識別號碼)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: By default, :abbr:`UZS (Uzbekistani som)` is selected."
" If not, select :guilabel:`UZS` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`貨幣`：預設已選擇 :abbr:`UZS（烏茲別克索姆）`。如未選擇，請從下拉"
"式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`UZS`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:67
msgid ""
"Every employee being paid must have their employee profiles configured for "
"the Uzbekistan payroll localization. Additional fields are present after "
"configuring the database for Uzbekistan."
msgstr ""
"每位受薪員工的員工檔案都必須針對烏茲別克薪資本地化進行設定。將資料庫設定為烏"
"茲別克後，系統會顯示額外欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:70
msgid ""
"To update an employee form, open the **Employees** app and click on the "
"desired employee record. On the employee form, configure the required fields"
" in the related tabs."
msgstr ""
"如要更新員工表單，請開啟 **員工** 應用程式並點擊所需的員工記錄。在員工表單上"
"，於相關分頁中設定所需欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract`: Ensure a running :doc:`contract <../contracts>` exists"
" for the employee."
msgstr ":guilabel:`合約`：確保該員工設有生效中的 :doc:`合約 <../contracts>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Category`: Ensure :guilabel:`Uzbekistan: Employee` is "
"selected for this field. This defines when the employee is paid, their "
"default working schedule, and the work entry type it applies to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:94
msgid "Uzbekistan payroll section"
msgstr "烏茲別克斯坦薪酬區段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Eligible Leaves`: Enter the number of days of annual leave the "
"employee is entitled to, for one year of service. The default value is "
"`21.00` days (annual basic minimum leave). This is used to compute the "
":guilabel:`Remaining Leave Days Compensation` and the :guilabel:`Annual "
"Leave Provision`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`合資格假期`：輸入員工服務滿一年可享有的年假天數。預設值為 `21.00` "
"天（每年基本最低假期）。此數值用於計算 :guilabel:`剩餘假期補償` 及 "
":guilabel:`年假撥備`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:102
msgid ""
"Employees entitled to an extended annual leave (27 or 30 calendar days, "
"depending on the extended leave category) are not handled automatically. "
"After the allocation is provided to the employee, the :guilabel:`Eligible "
"Leaves` value must be changed manually on the employee record."
msgstr ""
"有權享有延長年假（視乎延長休假類別而定，為 27 或 30 個曆日）的員工不會獲系統"
"自動處理。將休假配額分配予員工後，必須在員工記錄中手動更改 :guilabel:`符合資"
"格的休假` 數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:107
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Initial Average Monthly Wage`: Enter the average monthly wage "
"carried over from before the employee's first payslip in Odoo, so that "
"historical payroll data does not need to be re-entered. This is used for the"
" average wage computation of the first payslips. Click :icon:`edit` "
":guilabel:`Edit` to modify this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`初始平均月薪`：輸入從員工在 Odoo 的首張薪資單之前結轉的平均月薪，"
"這樣便無需重新輸入歷史薪酬資料。此數值用於計算首幾張薪資單的平均工資。按一下 "
":icon:`edit` :guilabel:`編輯` 即可修改此欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:113
msgid ""
"If validated payslips for the employee exist from the last 12 months, this "
"field is unable to be modified, and an *Invalid Operation* pop-up window "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"如果該員工在過去 12 個月內已有已驗證的糧單，則無法修改此欄位，並會彈出 *無效"
"操作* 視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours`: Using the drop-down menu, select the default work"
" schedule. This is particularly important for employees available to receive"
" overtime pay (typically hourly employees, not salaried). The default is "
":guilabel:`Uzbekistan Working Schedule 40h/Week`, which is 8 hours per day, "
"from Monday to Friday, with Saturdays and Sundays being non-working days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:125
msgid "Inputs section"
msgstr "輸入項目區段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Seniority Supplement`: Enter the percentage added to the basic "
"wage, if applicable. This depends on the employee's seniority and has "
"nothing to do with performance."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`年資津貼`：如適用，請輸入基本工資額外加給的百分比。此金額視乎員工"
"的年資而定，與工作表現無關。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:129
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other Allowance`: Enter the fixed monthly amount paid on top of "
"the basic wage, if applicable."
msgstr ":guilabel:`其他津貼`：如適用，請輸入在基本工資以外每月支付的固定金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:138
msgid ""
"Payroll **cannot** be processed for employees without a *trusted* bank "
"account. If no trusted bank account is set, a warning appears on the "
"**Payroll** dashboard and an error occurs when attempting to run payroll."
msgstr ""
"如果員工沒有*受信任*的銀行帳戶，便**無法**處理薪酬。如未設定受信任的銀行帳戶"
"，**薪酬管理**儀表板會顯示警告，且在嘗試執行發薪時會發生錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:145
msgid ""
"Several sections within the **Payroll** app install a salary structure, "
"structure type, and rules that are specific to Uzbekistan."
msgstr ""
"**薪酬管理**應用程式中的多個部分會安裝專用於烏茲別克的薪酬結構、結構類型及規"
"則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:151
msgid ""
"A couple fields in the **Payroll** app settings must be configred for the "
"Uzbekistan localization. Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
