#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:389
msgid ""
"The following time off types are available to employees working in "
"Uzbekistan. They are configured as work entry types of the country and are "
"available in the **Time Off** app."
msgstr ""
"以下休假類型適用於在烏茲別克工作的員工。這些類型已設定為該國的工作記錄類型，"
"並可在 **休假** 應用程式中使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:392
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Annual labor leave`: Annual labor leave is requested and counted "
"in calendar days, and requires an allocation. The basic minimum leave is 21 "
"calendar days per year (the default for the :guilabel:`Eligible Leaves` "
"field)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`年度勞工假期`：年度勞工假期以日曆日申請及計算，並且需要預先分配配"
"額。基本最低假期為每年 21 個日曆日（亦即 :guilabel:`合資格假期` 欄位的預設值"
"）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:396
msgid ""
"Sundays are not paid. When an annual leave request includes one or more "
"Sundays, those days are automatically tracked with the *Annual Labor Leave "
"(Sunday)* time off type, which is unpaid, and **only** the remaining days "
"are paid. For example, a five day leave that includes one Sunday has four "
"paid days."
msgstr ""
"星期日不計薪。當一個年假申請包含一個或多個星期日時，這些星期日會自動以 *年度"
"勞工假期（星期日）* 休假類型記錄（該類型為無薪假期），系統 **僅** 會為其餘天"
"數支薪。例如，為期五天且包含一個星期日的休假，只有四天為有薪假期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:401
msgid ""
"The daily value of an annual leave day is always based on 25.3 days per "
"month, regardless of the actual number of working days in the month (see the"
" Annual leave pay section)."
msgstr ""
"無論當月實際工作日數為何，每天年假的每日價值一律以每月 25.3 天計算（請參閱「"
"年假薪酬」部分）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:404
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Social leave` `(Labor Code of the Republic of Uzbekistan (Law No."
" ZRU-798 of 28 October 2022, in force since 30 April 2023), "
"<https://lex.uz/en/docs/6257291>`_  Art. 236-239): Fully paid. It does not "
"require an allocation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:407
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Partially paid leave`: Paid at the rate defined on the time off "
"type. The ratio that is paid is set by the rate of the time off type (it is "
"0% by default; change it on the type or duplicate the type to define another"
" ratio)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`部分支薪休假`：按休假類型所定義的比率支薪。支薪比例由休假類型的比"
"率決定（預設為 0%；請在該類型上更改，或複製該類型以定義另一比例）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:410
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpaid leave` *(Leave without pay)*: Unpaid. It is a duplicate of"
" the partially paid leave with a rate of 0%."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`無薪假` *（無薪休假）*：無薪。此項目為部分有薪假的複製項目，比率"
"為 0%。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:412
msgid ":guilabel:`Study leave`: Unpaid."
msgstr ":guilabel:`進修假`：無薪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:413
msgid ":guilabel:`Child support leave`: Fully paid."
msgstr ":guilabel:`子女撫養假`：全薪。"

