#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:490
msgid ""
"Annual leave pay, severance pay, and the compensation of remaining leave "
"days are not based on the wage of the current month, but on the employee's "
"average wage. The same computation is used everywhere:"
msgstr ""
"年假薪酬、遣散費及剩餘假期日數補償並非按當月工資計算，而是按員工的平均工資計"
"算。各項均採用相同的計算方式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:494
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Average monthly wage`: The Gross of the past 12 months is added "
"up and divided by 12. If the employee has worked for less than 12 months in "
"the company, only the months worked are taken into account, and the total is"
" divided by the number of months worked."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`平均月薪`：將過去 12 個月的總薪資相加後除以 12。如果員工在公司的任"
"職時間少於 12 個月，則只計算實際工作的月份，並將總額除以實際工作的月數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:497
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Average daily wage`: The average monthly wage is divided by 25.3."
msgstr ":guilabel:`平均日薪`：將平均月薪除以 25.3。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:499
msgid "\\text{Average daily wage} = \\frac{\\text{Average monthly wage}}{25.3}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:503
msgid ""
"Two cases are covered when the employee has no payslip history in Odoo:"
msgstr "若員工在 Odoo 中沒有任何糧單紀錄，系統會處理以下兩種情況："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:505
msgid ""
"If the company has just started using Odoo and has its own historical data, "
"the :guilabel:`Initial Average Monthly Wage` can be entered on the employee "
"profile and is used for the first payslips."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:507
msgid ""
"If the employee has no historical data at all (for example, hired and "
"resigned in the same month), the basic wage and the bonuses of the current "
"month are used for the computation."
msgstr ""
"如果員工完全沒有過往數據（例如在同一月份入職並離職），系統會使用當月的基本工"
"資及獎金進行計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:511
msgid "Annual leave pay"
msgstr "年假薪酬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:513
msgid ""
"Annual labor leave is paid according to the following steps `Labor Code "
"(2023), Art. 216-235, Art. 233 and Art. 257) "
"<https://lex.uz/en/docs/6257291>`_:"
msgstr ""
"年假薪酬會按照以下步驟計算 `（《勞動法》（2023 年）第 216-235 條、第 233 條及"
"第 257 條） <https://lex.uz/en/docs/6257291>`_："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:516
msgid ""
"Compute the average monthly wage and the average daily wage, as explained in"
" the previous section."
msgstr "按照上一節所述，計算平均月薪及平均日薪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:518
msgid ""
"Count the **paid** days of leave of the month. Sundays that fall during the "
"leave are unpaid and are excluded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:520
msgid "Multiply the average daily wage by the number of paid leave days."
msgstr "將平均日薪乘以有薪假期日數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:522
msgid ""
"\\text{Annual leave pay} = \\frac{\\text{Average monthly wage}}{25.3}\n"
"\\times \\text{Number of paid leave days}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:527
msgid ""
"Annual leave is fully paid, so it is not connected to a dedicated salary "
"rule: it is part of the :guilabel:`Basic Salary` rule and appears in the "
":guilabel:`Worked Days` of the payslip and on the PDF printout."
msgstr ""
"年假屬於全薪假期，因此不會關聯至專用的薪酬規則：它是 :guilabel:`基本薪金` 規"
"則的一部分，並會顯示在薪資單的 :guilabel:`工作天數` 及 PDF 列印本上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:532
msgid ""
"An employee earns a wage of 18,000,000 UZS per month and takes a leave of "
"seven calendar days in October 2027, from Monday to Sunday, so the leave "
"includes one Sunday."
msgstr ""
"一名員工的月薪為 18,000,000 UZS，並於 2027 年 10 月休假七個曆日（由星期一至星"
"期日），因此該假期包含一個星期日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:535
msgid "Average daily wage:"
msgstr "平均日薪："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:537
msgid "\\frac{18,000,000}{25.3} = 711,462.45 \\text{UZS}"
msgstr "\\frac{18,000,000}{25.3} = 711,462.45 \\text{UZS}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:541
msgid ""
"Paid leave days: 7 - 1 Sunday = 6 days (the Sunday is tracked as Annual "
"Labor Leave (Sunday) and paid 0)."
msgstr ""
"有薪休假日數：7 - 1 個星期日 = 6 日（星期日會記錄為「年度勞工假（星期日）」，"
"薪金為 0）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:543
msgid "Annual leave pay:"
msgstr "年假薪酬："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:545
msgid "6 \\times 711,462.45 = 4,268,774.70 \\text{UZS}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:552
msgid ""
"When an employee leaves the company, the payslip generated for the period of"
" the departure automatically includes the two following rules, in addition "
"to the regular rules:"
msgstr ""
"當員工離職時，為離職期間產生的薪資單除了一般規則外，還會自動包含以下兩項規則"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:555
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Severance Payment`: if the departure reason entitles the employee"
" to it."
msgstr ":guilabel:`遣散費`：如離職原因使員工符合領取資格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:556
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Remaining Leave Days Compensation`: for the annual leave that the"
" employee has earned but not taken."
msgstr ":guilabel:`剩餘休假日數補償`：用於補償員工已累積但尚未放取的年假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:560
msgid "Departure reasons"
msgstr "離職原因"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:562
msgid ""
"Each departure reason has a :guilabel:`Severance Paid` checkbox `(Labor Code"
" (2023), Art. 168, points 1, 2, 6 and 9) <https://lex.uz/en/docs/6257291>`_ "
". It decides whether the employee receives severance pay or not. The "
"following departure reasons are available for Uzbekistan:"
msgstr ""
"每個離職原因均設有 :guilabel:`已支付遣散費` 核取方塊 `（《勞動法典》（2023 年"
"）第 168 條第 1、2、6 及 9 點） <https://lex.uz/en/docs/6257291>`_ 。該選項決"
"定員工是否獲得遣散費。烏茲別克斯坦適用以下離職原因："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:570
msgid "Departure reason"
msgstr "離職原因"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:571
msgid "Severance Paid"
msgstr "已付遣散費"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:572
msgid "No-fault business reasons (employer-initiated)"
msgstr "無過失業務原因（僱主提出）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:574
msgid "Circumstances beyond either party's control"
msgstr "超出任何一方控制範圍的情況"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:576
msgid "Employee declines a change the employer initiated"
msgstr "員工拒絕僱主提出的更改"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:578
msgid "Employee's own fault"
msgstr "員工自身過失"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:580
msgid "Employer-side incapacity"
msgstr "僱主方喪失能力"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:588
msgid ""
"The severance pay is an allowance (categories *Allowance* and *Tax Base*) "
"equal to a percentage of the employee's average monthly wage, computed as "
"for the labor leaves. The percentage depends on the employee's length of "
"service on the departure date:"
msgstr ""
"遣散費屬於津貼（類別為 *津貼* 及 *稅基*），金額相當於員工平均月薪的指定百分比"
"，計算方式與勞工假期相同。該百分比取決於員工在離職日期的服務年資："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:596
msgid "Length of service (X)"
msgstr "服務年資 (X)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:597
msgid "Severance pay"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:598
msgid "X < 3 years"
msgstr "X < 3 年"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:599
msgid "50% of the average monthly wage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:600
msgid "3 years ≤ X < 5 years"
msgstr "3 年 ≤ X < 5 年"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:601
msgid "75% of the average monthly wage"
msgstr "平均月薪的 75%"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:602
msgid "5 years ≤ X < 10 years"
msgstr "5 年 ≤ X < 10 年"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:603
msgid "100% of the average monthly wage"
msgstr "平均月薪的 100%"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:604
msgid "10 years ≤ X < 15 years"
msgstr "10 年 ≤ X < 15 年"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:605
msgid "150% of the average monthly wage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:606
msgid "15 years ≤ X"
msgstr "15 年 ≤ X"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:607
msgid "200% of the average monthly wage"
msgstr "平均月薪的 200%"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:609
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{Severance\\ Payment} = \\text{Average monthly wage}\n"
"\\times \\text{Severance rate (according to length of service)}"
msgstr ""
"\\mathbf{遣散費} = \\text{平均月薪}\n"
"\\times \\text{遣散費率（按服務年資計算）}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:614
msgid ""
"The rates are stored in the :guilabel:`Severance Rates by Years of Service` "
"rule parameter. If the departure reason is not flagged as *Severance Paid*, "
"the rule is **not** applied and the employee receives **no** severance pay."
msgstr ""
"有關比率儲存在 :guilabel:`按服務年資計算的遣散費比率` 規則參數中。如離職原因"
"未標記為 *支付遣散費*，該規則將 **不會** 套用，且員工 **不會** 獲得任何遣散費"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:621
msgid ""
"The compensation of the leave days that were not taken is computed according"
" to Article 224 of the Labor Code (Labor Code (2023)), by comparing the "
"leave days the employee has **earned** with the leave days the employee has "
"**taken** since the last anniversary of the joining date:"
msgstr ""
"未放取休假日的補償根據《勞動法》（2023 年《勞動法》）第 224 條計算，方法是比"
"較員工自上次入職週年日以來 **已賺取** 的休假日數與 **已放取** 的休假日數："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:625
msgid ""
"**Earned days** = Eligible Leaves / 12 x number of months since the "
"anniversary of the employee's joining date."
msgstr "**已賺取天數** = 合資格休假 / 12 x 自員工入職週年日起計的月數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:627
msgid ""
"**Taken days** = Number of annual leave days taken since the most recent "
"anniversary of the employee's joining date, that is, since the start of the "
"current work year. The days are identified with the time off type selected "
"in the Annual Leave Type setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:631
msgid ""
"\\text{Remaining Leave Days Compensation} =\n"
"\\text{Average daily wage}\n"
"\\times \\max(0, \\text{Earned days} - \\text{Taken days})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:637
msgid ""
"Only the positive difference is paid. If the employee has taken more leave "
"than earned, no compensation is paid and nothing is deducted from the final "
"payslip. Any amount the employee owes for leave taken in advance has to be "
"recovered outside the payroll computation. The average daily wage is the one"
" used for the labor leaves (see the Average wage computation section)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:643
msgid ""
"An employee with 21 eligible leave days, whose joining anniversary was 6 "
"months before their departure, has earned 21 / 12 x 6 = 10.5 days. If the "
"employee has taken 4 days since the anniversary, 6.5 days are compensated. "
"With an average daily wage of 711,462.45 UZS, the compensation is 6.5 x "
"711,462.45 = 4,624,505.93 UZS."
msgstr ""
"若員工享有 21 日合資格假期，且其入職週年日為離職前 6 個月，則該員工已累積 "
"21 / 12 x 6 = 10.5 日假期。若員工自週年日起已放取 4 日假期，則有 6.5 日可獲補"
"償。假設平均日薪為 711,462.45 UZS，補償金額即為 6.5 x 711,462.45 = "
"4,624,505.93 UZS。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:651
msgid ""
"Provisions are the amounts computed by the employer to account for the "
"payments that will be made to the employee for the remaining annual leave "
"days. They are computed on every payslip under the :guilabel:`Company "
"Contribution` category, do not appear on the payslip, and do not affect the "
"employee's net wage."
msgstr ""
"撥備是指僱主為支付員工剩餘年假而計算的預留金額。該金額會在每張糧單的 "
":guilabel:`公司供款` 類別下計算，不會在糧單上顯示，亦不會影響員工的淨工資。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:656
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Annual leave provision`: This is computed by dividing the "
"eligible leave days by 12, and multiplying the result by the average daily "
"wage of the employee (the average monthly wage divided by 25.3)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:660
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{Annual\\ Leave\\ Provision} =\n"
"\\frac{\\text{Eligible Leaves}}{12}\n"
"\\times\n"
"\\frac{\\text{Average monthly wage}}{25.3}"
msgstr ""
"\\mathbf{Annual\\ Leave\\ Provision} =\n"
"\\frac{\\text{Eligible Leaves}}{12}\n"
"\\times\n"
"\\frac{\\text{Average monthly wage}}{25.3}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:668
msgid ""
"With 21 eligible leave days and an average monthly wage of 18,000,000 UZS: "
"21 / 12 x (18,000,000 / 25.3) = 1.75 x 711,462.45 = 1,245,059.29 UZS per "
"month."
msgstr ""
"以 21 日合資格假期及每月平均工資 18,000,000 UZS 計算：21 / 12 x "
"(18,000,000 / 25.3) = 1.75 x 711,462.45 = 每月 1,245,059.29 UZS。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:672
msgid "It is not enabled and does not have any account linked."
msgstr "此項目尚未啟用，亦未連結任何賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:675
msgid "Run Uzbekistan payroll"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:677
msgid ""
"Before running paypoll, the payroll officer must validate employee's time "
"offs and attendances, to confirm pay accuracy and catch errors. Once "
"everything is correct, draft payslips can be :ref:`created individually "
"<payroll/payslips/process>` or in :doc:`groups <../pay_runs>`, referred to "
"in the **Payroll** app as *Pay Runs*."
msgstr ""
"在執行薪酬計算前，薪酬專員必須驗證員工的休假及考勤記錄，以確認薪金準確並及早"
"發現錯誤。一切確認無誤後，草稿糧單可 :ref:`逐一建立 <payroll/payslips/"
"process>`，或以 :doc:`群組 <../pay_runs>` 形式建立（在 **薪酬** 應用程式中稱"
"為 *發薪批次* ）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:683
msgid ""
"To cut down on the payroll officer's time, it is typical to process pay runs"
" instead of one payslip at a time."
msgstr "為節省薪酬專員的時間，通常會以支薪批次處理，而非逐張糧單處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:686
msgid ""
"When running a pay run, check that the period, company and employees "
"included are correct before starting to analyze or validate the data. Once "
"the payslips are drafted, review them for accuracy:"
msgstr ""
"執行薪酬批次時，在開始分析或驗證資料前，請先檢查所選期間、公司及包含的員工是"
"否正確。糧單草稿建立後，請覆核內容是否準確："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:689
msgid ""
"In the *Worked Days* tab, ensure that the listed worked time and time off "
"are correct. Annual labor leave Sundays are listed on a separate line with "
"an amount of `0`."
msgstr ""
"在*工作天數*分頁中，請確保列出的工作時間及休假時間正確無誤。年度勞工假的星期"
"日會另行獨立列出一行，金額為 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:691
msgid ""
"In the *Salary Inputs* tab, add any missing inputs: :guilabel:`Bonus` and "
":guilabel:`Expense Reimbursement`."
msgstr ""
"在 *薪資輸入* 分頁中，新增任何遺漏的輸入項目：:guilabel:`獎金` 及 "
":guilabel:`開支報銷`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:693
msgid ""
"Check the various totals: Gross (Total Wage), personal income tax, pension "
"fund, employer social tax, severance pay and remaining leave days "
"compensation on departure payslips, and the net salary."
msgstr ""
"檢查各項總計：總薪酬（工資總額）、個人入息稅、退休金、僱主社會稅、離職糧單上"
"的遣散費及剩餘假期日數補償，以及淨薪金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:696
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Compute` to update the salary calculations if there were "
"edits. If everything is correct, click :guilabel:`Validate`."
msgstr ""
"如有任何修改，請點選 :guilabel:`計算` 以更新薪酬計算結果。如資料無誤，請點選 "
":guilabel:`驗證`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:700
