#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:201
msgid ":guilabel:`result_qty`: float, quantity, which defaults to 1"
msgstr ":guilabel:`result_qty`：浮點數，數量，預設為 1"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:202
msgid ""
":guilabel:`result_name`: string, name of the line. This defaults to the name"
" field of the salary rule (useful if the name depends or should depend on "
"something computed in the rule)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`result_name`：字串，資料行的名稱。此項預設為薪酬規則的名稱欄位（如"
"名稱取決於或應取決於規則中計算的某些內容，這會非常有用）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:206
msgid "Company contribution"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:208
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select the eventual third party involved in the "
"salary payment to the employees."
msgstr "使用下拉式選單，選擇向員工支付薪酬時可能涉及的第三方機構。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:212
msgid "Display tab"
msgstr "顯示分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:214
msgid ""
"This section determines the appearance of the rule on the payslip PDF "
"available to the employee, and defines the rule aesthetics."
msgstr "此部分決定規則在員工可用的薪資單 PDF 上的外觀，並定義規則的視覺樣式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:217
msgid ""
"First, select a :guilabel:`Color` for the rule using the color picker. Next,"
" enable the :guilabel:`Title` checkbox to **only** display the salary rule's"
" *title* and *description*, and hide any numerical values."
msgstr ""
"首先，使用顏色選擇器為規則選擇 :guilabel:`顏色`。接著，啟用 :guilabel:`標題` "
"核取方塊，即可 **只** 顯示薪酬規則的 *標題* 及 *描述*，並隱藏所有數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:221
msgid ""
"Activate the :guilabel:`Indented`, :guilabel:`Space Above`, "
":guilabel:`Bold`, :guilabel:`Underline`, and :guilabel:`Italic` checkboxes "
"to activate the respective options."
msgstr ""
"勾選 :guilabel:`縮排`、:guilabel:`上方間距`、:guilabel:`粗體`、:guilabel:`底"
"線` 及 :guilabel:`斜體` 核取方塊，即可啟用相應選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:224
msgid ""
"Finally, enter a :guilabel:`Description` for the rule, which is displayed "
"below the rule name."
msgstr "最後，為規則輸入 :guilabel:`描述`，該描述會顯示在規則名稱下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:227
msgid "Accounting tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:229
msgid ""
"This section determines how the rule affects the various accounting journals"
" and how the Net salary is calculated for employees. Configure the following"
" fields in this section:"
msgstr ""
"此部分決定該規則如何影響各個會計日記賬，以及如何計算員工的淨薪酬。請在此部分"
"設定以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:232
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Debit Account`: Using the drop-down menu, select the debit "
"account for the rule."
msgstr ":guilabel:`借方帳戶`：使用下拉式選單，為該規則選擇借方帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:233
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Credit Account`: Using the drop-down menu, select the credit "
"account for the rule."
msgstr ":guilabel:`貸方帳戶`：使用下拉式選單，為規則選擇貸方帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:234
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Split on names`: Enable this option to split the accounting "
"entries for this rule according to the payslip line name. Splitting the "
"entries provides more visibility for deductions and reimbursements, or for "
"salary adjustments."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`按名稱拆分`：啟用此選項，即可根據薪資單明細名稱拆分此規則的會計分"
"錄。拆分分錄可讓扣款、報銷或薪酬調整項目更清晰明確。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Excluded from Net`: Check this checkbox to exclude the rule's "
"calculations from the net salary rule in journal entries. A specific debit "
"and credit account should be set to independently classify it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`從淨薪資中排除`：勾選此核取方塊，即可在日記帳分錄中將此規則的計算"
"結果排除於淨薪資規則之外。你應設定特定的借方及貸方帳戶，以獨立將其分類。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:240
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Set employee on account line`: Check this checkbox to have the "
"employee's name visible on the journal items."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在帳戶資料行設定員工`：勾選此核取方塊，即可在日記帳項目中顯示員工"
"姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:244
msgid "This tab is **only** available if the **Accounting** app is installed."
msgstr "此分頁 **僅** 在已安裝 **會計** 應用程式時才會提供。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:251
msgid ""
"Rule parameters inform Odoo how to calculate each line of a payslip. To view"
" the configured rule parameters, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app -->"
" Configuration --> Rule Parameters`."
msgstr ""
"規則參數會指示 Odoo 如何計算糧單的每一項明細。如要檢視已設定的規則參數，請前"
"往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 配置 --> 規則參數`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:254
msgid ""
"All rule parameters are displayed. Click on an individual rule parameter to "
"view the details."
msgstr "所有規則參數均會顯示。按一下個別規則參數即可檢視詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:256
msgid ""
"Each rule parameter displays the name of the rule, the code, when the rule "
"is active, and the parameter value."
msgstr "每個規則參數都會顯示規則名稱、代碼、規則生效時間及參數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:262
msgid "Rule categories"
msgstr "規則類別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:264
msgid ""
"Every rule is associated with a rule category. To view the various "
"categories, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> "
"Rule Categories`."
msgstr ""
"每項規則均與一個規則類別關聯。要檢視各個類別，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用"
"程式 --> 配置 --> 規則類別`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:267
msgid ""
"All rule categories appear in a list view, and display the category "
":guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`Code`, and :guilabel:`Country`."
msgstr ""
"所有規則類別都會在列表檢視中顯示，並列出類別的:guilabel:`名稱`、:guilabel:`代"
"碼`及:guilabel:`國家/地區`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:270
msgid ""
"To create a new rule category, click the :guilabel:`New` button. Enter a "
":guilabel:`Name` and :guilabel:`Code` for the category in the corresponding "
"fields. If the category is housed beneath a :guilabel:`Parent` category, "
"select the parent category using the drop-down menu. If the category is "
"country-specific, select the :guilabel:`Country` using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"如要建立新規則類別，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，並在相應欄位中輸入類別的 "
":guilabel:`名稱` 及 :guilabel:`代碼`。如果該類別屬於某個 :guilabel:`上層` 類"
"別之下，請使用下拉式選單選擇上層類別。如果該類別適用於特定國家/地區，請使用下"
"拉式選單選擇 :guilabel:`國家/地區`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:3
msgid "Time off to report"
msgstr "需申報的休假"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:5
msgid ""
"Payroll is often processed a few days before the end of a pay period, so "
"that employees can be paid in a timely manner. When work schedules are "
"predictable, this method often works. However, sometimes employees take time"
" off unexpectedly, especially sick time. When this occurs, there can be "
"discrepancies in payroll that must be addressed."
msgstr ""
"薪酬通常會在計薪期結束前數天處理，以確保員工能準時獲發薪金。當工作時間表可預"
"測時，這種做法通常可行。然而，員工有時會突發請假，尤其是病假。出現這種情況時"
"，薪酬計算便可能出現差異，必須予以處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:11
msgid ""
"The payroll department for a medium-sized company processes paychecks every "
"two weeks, on Wednesdays. Each employee is paid on the Friday after."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:14
msgid ""
"One employee is sick on the last Thursday and Friday of the two-week pay "
"period. Since they have automatically generated work entries based on their "
"working schedule, and payroll is processed on Wednesdays, the paycheck they "
"receive incorrectly states that they were paid for a regular work day for "
"all ten days of the two-week pay period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:19
msgid ""
"Instead of cancelling the paycheck and reissuing it, causing delays for the "
"employee and more work for the payroll department, Odoo allows for the "
"deferral of the time off taken, to the following pay period."
msgstr ""
"為免取消支薪支票再重新簽發（這會導致員工延遲收薪及增加薪酬部門的工作量），"
"Odoo 允許將已休的假期順延至下一個支薪期處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:23
msgid ""
"This ensures all time off balances are correct, and the employee is properly"
" compensated for their time."
msgstr "這可確保所有休假結餘正確無誤，並讓員工就其工時獲得適當補償。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:29
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:178
msgid "Time off dashboard"
msgstr "休假儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:31
msgid ""
"When time off requests are submitted for a time period that was already "
"processed on a payslip, the time off requests appear in the *Time Off* page "
"of the **Payroll** app. To access this, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll "
"app --> Work Entries --> Time Off to Report`."
msgstr ""
"當為已在糧單處理的時段提交休假申請時，該休假申請會顯示在**薪酬**應用程式的*休"
"假*頁面中。要前往此頁面，請導覽至:menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 工作記"
"錄 --> 需申報的休假`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:35
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Time Off` page default filter is :guilabel:`To Defer`, and "
"displays all requests with a :guilabel:`Payslip State` of :guilabel:`To "
"defer to next payslip`. This is because the employee was *already paid* for "
"that time as worked time, and it was logged as regular time spent at work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:39
msgid ""
"A list of all time off requests that were not approved before payslips were "
"generated."
msgstr "在產生薪酬單前尚未獲批的所有休假申請清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:43
msgid "Defer multiple time off entries"
msgstr "遞延多個休假項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:45
msgid ""
"In order to keep the employee's time off balances correct, the time off "
"request **must** be applied to the following pay period. This not only "
"ensures time off request balances are current, it also eliminates the need "
"to redo work entries, cancel paychecks, and reissue paychecks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:49
msgid ""
"To select the work entries to defer, tick the box to the left of the work "
"entry line on the :ref:`Time Off page <payroll/time-off-dashboard>`. To "
"select all work entries in the list, tick the box to the left of the "
":guilabel:`Employee` column title, at the top of the list."
msgstr ""
"在:ref:`休假頁面 <payroll/time-off-dashboard>`中，勾選工作項目行左側的方格，"
"即可選擇要延後的工作項目。若要選擇清單中的所有工作項目，請勾選清單頂"
"部:guilabel:`員工`欄標題左側的方格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:53
msgid ""
"Once any work entry is selected, two buttons appear at the top of the "
"report: a :guilabel:`(#) selected` button, and an :icon:`fa-gear` "
":guilabel:`Actions` button. The :guilabel:`(#) selected` button indicates "
"how many entries are currently selected."
msgstr ""
"選取任何工作記錄後，報表頂部會出現兩個按鈕：:guilabel:`已選取 (#) 項` 按鈕，"
"以及 :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`操作` 按鈕。:guilabel:`已選取 (#) 項` 按鈕會"
"顯示目前已選取的記錄數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:57
msgid ""
"When all the desired work entries are selected, click the :icon:`fa-gear` "
":guilabel:`Actions` button, and a menu appears with several choices. Click "
":guilabel:`Defer to Next Month` in the list, and all selected entries are "
"deferred to the following month."
msgstr ""
"選取所有所需的工作紀錄後，點擊 :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`操作` 按鈕，隨即會"
"顯示包含多個選項的選單。點擊列表中的 :guilabel:`延至下月`，所有已選取的紀錄便"
"會順延至下一個月。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:62
msgid "Defer individual time off entries"
msgstr "遞延個別休假記項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:64
msgid ""
"Time off requests appearing on the :ref:`Time Off page <payroll/time-off-"
"dashboard>` can be deferred individually. Click on an individual time off "
"request, and the details for that request load."
msgstr ""
"出現在 :ref:`休假頁面 <payroll/time-off-dashboard>` 上的休假申請可以單獨延後"
"處理。點擊個別休假申請，系統便會載入該申請的詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:67
msgid ""
"The specific details for the time off request appear on the left-hand side, "
"and all of the employee's submitted time off requests appear on the right-"
"hand side (including the request in the details on the left-hand side)."
msgstr ""
"休假申請的具體詳情會顯示在左側，而該名員工所有已提交的休假申請（包括左側詳情"
"中的申請）則會顯示在右側。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:71
msgid ""
"To defer the time off request to the next payslip, click the "
":guilabel:`Report to Next Month` button in the upper-left corner. Once "
"processed, the :guilabel:`Report to Next Month` button disappears, and the "
":guilabel:`Payslip State` changes from :guilabel:`To defer to next payslip` "
"to :guilabel:`Computed in Current Payslip`."
msgstr ""
"要將休假申請延至下一張薪資單，請按一下左上角的:guilabel:`延報至下個月`按鈕。"
"處理完成後，:guilabel:`延報至下個月`按鈕便會消失，而:guilabel:`薪資單狀態`亦"
"會由:guilabel:`延至下一張薪資單`變更為:guilabel:`已於目前薪資單計算`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/time_off_to_report.rst:76
msgid ""
"The time off details for an individual request that needs to be deferred."
msgstr "需要延後處理的個別申請的休假詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:5
msgid ""
"A *work entry* is an individual record on an employee's timesheet. Work "
"entries can be configured to account for all types of work and time off, "
"such as :guilabel:`Attendance`, :guilabel:`Sick Time Off`, "
":guilabel:`Training`, or :guilabel:`Public Holiday`."
msgstr ""
"*工作記項* 是員工工時表上的個別記錄。工作記項可配置為涵蓋各種類型的工作及休假"
"，例如 :guilabel:`出勤`、:guilabel:`病假`、:guilabel:`培訓` 或 :guilabel:`公"
"眾假期`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:9
msgid ""
"The **Payroll** app automatically creates work entries based on the "
"employee's :ref:`salary structure type <payroll/salaries/structure-types>`, "
"and from the **Planning**, **Attendances**, and **Time Off** applications. "
"When needed, work entries can also be :ref:`created manually <payroll/new-"
"work-entry>`."
msgstr ""
"**薪酬** 應用程式會根據員工的 :ref:`薪酬結構類型 <payroll/salaries/structure-"
"types>`，以及透過 **規劃**、**出勤** 及 **休假** 應用程式自動建立工作記錄。如"
"有需要，工作記錄亦可 :ref:`手動建立 <payroll/new-work-entry>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:14
msgid ""
"Work entries provide the **Payroll** app with the worked hours used to "
"compute employee paychecks, if the employee's salary is based on work "
"entries, as opposed to a salaried position."
msgstr ""
"若員工的薪酬是根據工作記錄計算（而非固定月薪職位），工作記錄會為 **薪酬** 應"
"用程式提供已工作時數，以計算員工薪金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:18
msgid ""
"Odoo configures several work entry types by default, but :ref:`additional "
"work entry types can be created <payroll/work-entry-types>`, when necessary."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 預設已設定多種工作項目類型，如有需要，亦 :ref:`可建立其他工作項目類型 "
"<payroll/work-entry-types>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:26
msgid ""
"The *Work Entries* dashboard of the **Payroll** app provides a visual "
"overview of the individual work entries for every employee."
msgstr "**薪酬**應用程式的*工作記錄*儀表板提供每位員工個別工作記錄的視覺化概覽。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:29
msgid ""
"To open the dashboard, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Work "
"Entries --> Work Entries`."
msgstr ""
"要開啟儀表板，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬管理應用程式 --> 工作條目 --> 工作條"
"目`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:31
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Work Entry` dashboard, work entries appear in alphabetical"
" order, based on the first name of the employees. The entire month is "
"displayed, with the current day highlighted in pale yellow."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`工作記錄` 儀表板上，工作記錄會按員工名字的字母順序排列。畫面會"
"顯示整個月份，而當日會以淡黃色反白顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:35
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Work Entry` dashboard has a default :guilabel:`Conflicting` "
"filter, which displays only work entries with :ref:`conflicts "
"<payroll/conflicts>` to be resolved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:38
msgid ""
"Conflicts dashboard view showing all employee's conflicts in work entries."
msgstr "衝突儀表板檢視，顯示所有員工的工作記錄衝突。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:42
msgid ""
"Remove the default :guilabel:`Conflicting` filter from the search bar to "
"view *all* work entries."
msgstr "從搜尋欄移除預設的 :guilabel:`衝突` 篩選條件，即可查看 *所有* 工作記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:47
msgid "Add a new work entry"
msgstr "新增工作紀錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:49
msgid ""
"If a work entry is missing, such as sick time, or if an employee forgot to "
"clock in and out for a shift, a new work entry must be created for the "
"missing shift."
msgstr ""
"如果缺少工作項目（例如病假），或員工忘記為某個班次打卡上下班，則必須為該遺漏"
"的班次建立新的工作項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:52
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` on the :ref:`work entry dashboard <payroll/work-entry-"
"dashboard>`, and a blank :guilabel:`Create` work entry pop-up form appears. "
"Enter the following information on the form:"
msgstr ""
"點擊:guilabel:`新增`按鈕（位於:ref:`工作記錄儀表板 <payroll/work-entry-"
"dashboard>`上），系統便會顯示空白的:guilabel:`建立`工作記錄彈出式表單。請在表"
"單中輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: Enter a short description for the work entry, such "
"as `Sick Time`. The default entry is `Attendance: (Employee)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`說明`：輸入工作記錄的簡短說明，例如 `病假時間`。預設記錄為 `考勤："
"(員工)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: Select the employee the work entry is for, using the "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：使用下拉式選單，選擇此工作紀錄所屬的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Entry Type`: Select the :guilabel:`Work Entry Type` using "
"the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`工作記項類型`：使用下拉式選單選擇 :guilabel:`工作記項類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`To`: Enter the start (:guilabel:`From`) and "
"end (:guilabel:`To`) dates and times for the work entry."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`由` 及 :guilabel:`至`：輸入工作記錄的開始（:guilabel:`由`）及結束"
"（:guilabel:`至`）日期和時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:62
msgid ""
"First, click on either the :guilabel:`From` or :guilabel:`To` line to reveal"
" a calendar pop-up window. Select the date by navigating to the correct "
"month, then click on the specific day to select it."
msgstr ""
"首先，按一下 :guilabel:`由` 或 :guilabel:`至` 資料行，以顯示日曆彈出式視窗。"
"瀏覽至正確的月份，然後按一下特定日期即可選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:66
msgid ""
"Next, select the time, by clicking on either the hour or minute fields at "
"the bottom of the calendar, and set the desired time."
msgstr "接著選擇時間：按一下日曆底部的小時或分鐘欄位，並設定所需時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:69
msgid ""
"When the date and time for the entry are correct, click the "
":guilabel:`Apply` button."
msgstr "當記錄的日期及時間正確無誤後，按一下 :guilabel:`套用` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration`: This field displays the hours based on the "
":guilabel:`To` and :guilabel:`From` entries. Modifying this field modifies "
"the :guilabel:`To` field (the :guilabel:`From` field does not change)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`時長`：此欄位會根據:guilabel:`至`及:guilabel:`由`的輸入內容顯示時"
"數。修改此欄位會同時更改:guilabel:`至`欄位（:guilabel:`由`欄位不會變更）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:74
msgid ""
"Once the desired information is entered, click :guilabel:`Save & Close` to "
"save the entry, and close the pop-up form."
msgstr "輸入所需資料後，點擊:guilabel:`儲存並關閉`以儲存記錄並關閉彈出式表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:77
msgid "Filling in the work entry Create form in Odoo."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中填寫工作記錄的「建立」表格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:83
msgid "Conflicts"
msgstr "衝突"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:85
msgid ""
"A conflict occurs when a request has not been approved, such as sick time or"
" vacation, or if there are any errors on the work entry. Conflicts that span"
" the current pay period being processed **must** be resolved before payslips"
" can be generated."
msgstr ""
"當申請（例如病假或年假）尚未獲批，或工作記錄出現任何錯誤時，便會發生衝突。跨"
"越目前正在處理之發薪週期的衝突，**必須** 先行解決，才可產生薪資單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:89
msgid ""
"Any work entry that has a conflict to be resolved is indicated on the main "
":guilabel:`Work Entry` dashboard, which can be accessed by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Work Entries --> Work Entries`. Only "
"conflicts needing resolution are shown by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:93
msgid ""
"Conflicts are indicated with an orange triangle in the top-left corner of "
"each individual work entry. Click on an individual work entry to see the "
"date and time for the specific work entry, then click :guilabel:`Edit` to "
"view the conflict details in a pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"每個工作紀錄左上角的橙色三角形代表存在衝突。點擊個別工作紀錄即可查看該工作紀"
"錄的日期和時間，然後點擊 :guilabel:`編輯`，即可在彈出式視窗中查看衝突詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:97
msgid "A row of conflicts, with one entry showing details for the conflict."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:100
msgid ""
"The conflict is briefly explained in an orange text box in the "
":guilabel:`Open` pop-up window that appears."
msgstr "在隨即出現的 :guilabel:`開啟` 彈出視窗中，橙色文字框會簡要說明該衝突。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:103
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Description`, :guilabel:`Employee`, and :guilabel:`Work Entry"
" Type` are listed on the left side of the pop-up window. The "
":guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`To` date and time range, as well as the "
"total time (in hours) in the :guilabel:`Duration` field, appears on the "
"right side."
msgstr ""
"彈出式視窗左側列出了 :guilabel:`描述`、:guilabel:`員工` 及 :guilabel:`工作項"
"目類型`。右側則顯示日期及時間範圍的 :guilabel:`由` 及 :guilabel:`至`，以及 "
":guilabel:`持續時間` 欄位中的總時間（以小時計算）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:108
msgid "Time off conflicts"
msgstr "休假衝突"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:110
msgid ""
"The most common work entry conflicts are for time off requests. Odoo "
"automatically generates work entries for specific time periods. When time "
"off is requested after these work entries are generated, it results in "
"duplicate work entries for that employee (one for time off and another for "
"regular work)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:115
msgid ""
"If there is a conflict because a time off request is in the system for the "
"same time that a regular work entry already exists, the time off request is "
"entered in a :guilabel:`Time Off` field."
msgstr ""
"如果系統中在同一時間已有正常出勤記錄而與休假申請發生衝突，該休假申請會記"
"入:guilabel:`休假`欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:118
msgid ""
"Conflicts can be resolved either directly on the work entry or in the "
"detailed time off request form."
msgstr "衝突可直接在工作紀錄上解決，或在詳細的休假申請表單中處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:124
msgid "Resolve on work entry"
msgstr "於工作記錄中解決"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:126
msgid ""
"If no additional details are needed to determine if a time off request "
"should be approved or refused, the time off conflict can be resolved "
"directly from the work entry pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"如無需額外詳情即可決定是否批准或拒絕休假申請，可直接於工作紀錄的彈出視窗中解"
"決休假衝突。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:129
msgid ""
"Click either the :guilabel:`Refuse Time Off` or :guilabel:`Approve Time Off`"
" buttons to refuse or approve the time off request, then the two buttons "
"disappear. Click the :guilabel:`Save & Close` button to close the pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`拒絕休假` 或 :guilabel:`批准休假` 按鈕，即可拒絕或批准休假申"
"請，隨後這兩個按鈕便會消失。點擊 :guilabel:`儲存並關閉` 按鈕以關閉彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:133
msgid ""
"The conflict disappears from the :guilabel:`Work Entry` dashboard, since the"
" conflict is now resolved."
msgstr "由於衝突現已解決，該衝突會從:guilabel:`工作記錄`儀表板中消失。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:136
msgid ""
"The detailed conflict pop-up window that appears when the Edit button is "
"clicked."
msgstr "按一下「編輯」按鈕時顯示的詳細衝突彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:140
msgid ""
"If the time off is approved, the status of the work entry conflict changes "
"to :guilabel:`Cancelled`. If the time off is refused, the status changes to "
":guilabel:`Draft`."
msgstr ""
"如果休假獲得批准，工作記錄衝突的狀態會變更為 :guilabel:`已取消`。如果休假被拒"
"絕，狀態則會變更為 :guilabel:`草稿`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:146
msgid "Resolve on time off request"
msgstr "處理休假申請"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:148
msgid ""
"If more details are needed to make a decision about the time off request, "
"hover over the entry in the :guilabel:`Time Off` field, and click the "
":icon:`fa-external-link` :guilabel:`(Internal Link)` icon that appears at "
"the end of the line. This causes an :guilabel:`Open: Time Off` pop-up window"
" to load, with all the time off request details. Click either the "
":guilabel:`Approve` or :guilabel:`Refuse` buttons to approve or refuse the "
"request."
msgstr ""
"如需要更多詳情以決定是否批核休假申請，請將滑鼠游標停留在 :guilabel:`休假` 欄"
"位的項目上，然後點擊該行末端顯示的 :icon:`fa-external-link` :guilabel:`（內部"
"連結）` 圖示。系統隨即會載入 :guilabel:`開啟：休假` 彈出式視窗，顯示所有休假"
"申請詳情。點擊 :guilabel:`批准` 或 :guilabel:`拒絕` 按鈕，即可批准或拒絕該申"
"請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:154
msgid ""
"To resolve the time off conflict on the detailed time off request pop-up "
"window, click the :guilabel:`Internal Link` button at the end of the "
":guilabel:`Time Off` entry line, and the time off request details appear in "
"a new pop-up window. The request can be modified, if needed."
msgstr ""
"要在詳細的休假申請彈出式視窗中解決休假衝突，請點擊 :guilabel:`內部連結` 按鈕"
"（位於 :guilabel:`休假` 項目行末端），休假申請詳情便會在新的彈出式視窗中顯示"
"。如有需要，可修改該申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:158
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Approve` button to approve the request, then click the "
":guilabel:`Save & Close` button to save the changes, and go back to the work"
" entry conflict pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"點擊:guilabel:`批准`按鈕以批准申請，然後點擊:guilabel:`儲存並關閉`按鈕儲存變"
"更，並返回工作記錄衝突彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:161
msgid "The detailed time off request information."
msgstr "休假申請的詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:164
msgid ""
"Now, the :guilabel:`Approve Time Off` button is hidden, only the "
":guilabel:`Refuse Time Off` button is visible."
msgstr "現在，:guilabel:`批准休假` 按鈕已隱藏，只顯示 :guilabel:`拒絕休假` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:167
msgid ""
"If the approval was a mistake, the request can be refused here, by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Refuse Time Off` button."
msgstr "如屬錯誤批核，可在此點按:guilabel:`拒絕休假`按鈕拒絕該申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:170
msgid ""
"Since the time off was approved in the time off window, click the "
":guilabel:`X` in the top-right corner to close the window. The conflict "
"disappears from the :guilabel:`Work Entry` dashboard, since it has been "
"resolved."
msgstr ""
"由於休假已在休假視窗中獲批，請按一下右上角的 :guilabel:`X` 關閉視窗。衝突解決"
"後，便會從:guilabel:`工作記錄`儀表板中消失。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:177
msgid "Regenerate work entries"
msgstr "重新產生工作記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:179
msgid ""
"After conflicts are resolved, the affected work entries must be regenerated."
" This recreates the specified work entries, and overwrites the previously "
"conflicting work entries."
msgstr ""
"解決衝突後，必須重新產生受影響的工作項目。此操作會重新建立指定的工作項目，並"
"覆寫先前發生衝突的工作項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:182
msgid ""
"While :ref:`conflicts <payroll/conflicts>` *can* be resolved individually, "
"if the conflicts are caused by another application, such as **Planning** or "
"**Attendances**, it is best practice to correct the record in the "
"application causing the conflict. The reason this method is recommended is "
"because, if the issue in the related application is **not** resolved, when "
"work entries are regenerated, the conflicts reappear."
msgstr ""
"雖然 :ref:`衝突 <payroll/conflicts>` *可以* 逐一解決，但如果衝突是由其他應用"
"程式（例如 **規劃** 或 **考勤**）引起，最佳做法是在引發衝突的應用程式中更正記"
"錄。建議採用此方法的原因是，如果相關應用程式中的問題 **未** 獲解決，當重新產"
"生工作記錄時，衝突便會再次出現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:188
msgid ""
"First, ensure the issues are resolved in the specific applications that "
"caused the work entry conflicts. Once the conflicts have been resolved in "
"the corresponding apps, open the work entry dashboard by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Work Entries --> Work Entries`."
msgstr ""
"首先，請確保在導致工作記錄衝突的特定應用程式中解決相關問題。在相應應用程式解"
"決衝突後，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 工作記錄 --> 工作記錄`，以"
"開啟工作記錄儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:192
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Regenerate Work Entries` button at the top of the "
":guilabel:`Work Entries` dashboard, and a :guilabel:`Work Entry "
"Regeneration` pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`重新產生工作項目` 按鈕（位於 :guilabel:`工作項目` 儀表板頂部"
"），隨即會顯示 :guilabel:`重新產生工作項目` 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:195
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Employees` to regenerate work entries for, using the "
"drop-down menu. Adjust the :guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`To` fields, so "
"the correct date range is displayed."
msgstr ""
"使用下拉選單選擇要重新生成工作記錄的 :guilabel:`員工`。調整 :guilabel:`由` "
"及 :guilabel:`至` 欄位，以顯示正確的日期範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:198
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Regenerate Work Entries` button, and the work entries "
"are recreated. Once finished, the pop-up window closes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:201
msgid "Regenerate a work entry for a particular employee."
msgstr "為特定員工重新產生工作記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:205
msgid ""
"An employee has incorrect work entries generated from the **Planning** app "
"because they were incorrectly assigned to two work stations simultaneously. "
"This should be fixed in the **Planning** app, instead of the **Payroll** "
"app."
msgstr ""
"一名員工從 **規劃** 應用程式產生的工作項目不正確，原因是該員工被錯誤地同時指"
"派至兩個工作崗位。此問題應在 **規劃** 應用程式中修正，而非在 **薪酬** 應用程"
"式中處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:209
msgid ""
"To correct this issue, modify the employee's schedule in the **Planning** "
"app, so they are correctly assigned to only one work station. Then, in the "
"**Payroll** app, regenerate work entries for that employee, for that "
"specific time period."
msgstr ""
"如要修正此問題，請在 **規劃** 應用程式中修改員工的排班表，確保他們只正確獲指"
"派至一個工作站。然後，在 **薪酬** 應用程式中，為該員工在該特定時段重新產生工"
"作記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:213
msgid ""
"The **Payroll** app then pulls the new, corrected data form the **Planning**"
" app, and recreates the correct work entries for that employee. All "
"conflicts for that employee are now resolved."
msgstr ""
"隨後，**薪酬管理** 應用程式會從 **規劃** 應用程式擷取已修正的新資料，並為該員"
"工重新建立正確的工作項目。該員工的所有衝突現已解決。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:221
msgid ""
"When :ref:`creating a work entry <payroll/new-work-entry>` in the "
"**Payroll** application, or when a new time off type is created in the "
"**Time Off** application, a work entry *type* needs to be selected."
msgstr ""
"在 **薪酬** 應用程式中 :ref:`建立工作條目 <payroll/new-work-entry>`，或在 "
"**休假** 應用程式中建立新的休假類型時，都需要選擇工作條目 *類型*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:225
msgid ""
"The **Payroll** app comes with nine preconfigured work entry types, and "
"depending on the installed :doc:`payroll localization "
"<payroll_localizations>`, additional country-specific work entries may be "
"configured. If there is a need for additional work entry types, they can be "
":ref:`created <payroll/new-work-entry-type>`."
msgstr ""
"**薪酬管理** 應用程式預先配置了九種工作紀錄類型；視乎已安裝的 :doc:`薪酬管理"
"本地化套件 <payroll_localizations>`，系統亦可能設有適用於特定國家或地區的額外"
"工作紀錄。如有需要，您亦可 :ref:`建立 <payroll/new-work-entry-type>` 額外的工"
"作紀錄類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:230
msgid ""
"To view the current work entry types available, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Work Entries --> Work "
"Entry Types`."
msgstr ""
"若要查看目前可用的工作記錄類型，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬管理應用程式 --> "
"配置 --> 工作記錄 --> 工作記錄類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:233
msgid ""
"Each work entry type has a code to aid in the creation of payslips, and to "
"ensure all taxes and fees are correctly entered."
msgstr ""
"每種工作記錄類型都有一個代碼，用於協助建立工資單，並確保正確輸入所有稅項及費"
"用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:237
msgid ""
"Depending on the installed localization, other sections and fields may "
"appear on the form."
msgstr "視乎已安裝的本地化模組，表單上可能會顯示其他部分及欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:239
msgid ""
"List of all work entry types currently available for use, with the payroll "
"code and color."
msgstr "列出目前可供使用的所有工作紀錄類型，以及其薪酬代碼和顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:245
msgid "New work entry type"
msgstr "新增工作紀錄類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:247
msgid ""
"To create a new work entry type, go to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Configuration --> Work Entries --> Work Entry Types` and click "
":guilabel:`New`. Then, enter the information for the following sections on "
"the form."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的工作記項類型，請前往 :menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 配置 --> 工作"
"記項 --> 工作記項類型`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。接著，在表單的以下部分輸入"
"資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:254
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Entry Type Name`: Enter a name for the work entry type. It "
"should be short and descriptive, such as `Sick Time` or `Training`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作紀錄類型名稱`：輸入工作紀錄類型的名稱。名稱應簡短且具描述性，"
"例如 `病假時間` 或 `培訓`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:256
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payroll Code`: Enter a code for the work entry type. This code "
"appears with the work entry type on timesheets and payslips. Since the code "
"is used in conjunction with the **Accounting** application, it is advised to"
" check with the accounting department for a code to use."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`薪酬代碼`：輸入工作項目類型的代碼。此代碼會與工作項目類型一同顯示"
"於工時表及糧單上。由於此代碼會與 **會計** 應用程式配合使用，建議先向會計部門"
"查詢應使用的代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:260
msgid ""
":guilabel:`External Code`: Enter a code to use for exporting data to a "
"third-party payroll service. Check with the third-party being used to "
"determine the :guilabel:`External Code` to enter for the new work entry "
"type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`外部代碼`：輸入用於將資料匯出至第三方薪酬服務的代碼。請向所使用的"
"第三方查詢，以確定須為新工作紀錄類型輸入的 :guilabel:`外部代碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:263
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Color`: Select a color for the particular work entry type. This "
"color appears on the work entry dashboard to aid in identifying work entry "
"types."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`顏色`：為特定的工時項目類型選擇一種顏色。該顏色會顯示於工時項目儀"
"表板上，以協助識別不同的工時項目類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:267
msgid ""
"The **only** required fields for a work entry type is the :guilabel:`Work "
"Entry Type Name` and the :guilabel:`Payroll Code`."
msgstr ""
"工作項目類型 **唯一** 的必填欄位為:guilabel:`工作項目類型名稱`及:guilabel:`薪"
"酬代碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:271
msgid "Display in payslip section"
msgstr "在糧單區段顯示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:273
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rounding`: Select how the time entered for the work entry should "
"be rounded. The rounding method selected determines how the worked time on "
"timesheet entries are calculated. The options are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:277
msgid ":guilabel:`No Rounding`: Work entries are not modified."
msgstr ":guilabel:`不捨入`：不會修改工作記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:278
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Half Day`: Work entries are rounded to the closest half day "
"amount."
msgstr ":guilabel:`半天`：工作項目會四捨五入至最接近的半天數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:279
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Day`: Work entries are rounded to the closest full day amount."
msgstr ":guilabel:`日`：工作記錄會四捨五入至最接近的整日數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:281
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rounding Type`: If either :guilabel:`Half Day` or :guilabel:`Day`"
" is selected in the :guilabel:`Rounding` field, this field appears. Select "
"either :guilabel:`Up` or :guilabel:`Down` to determine how the rounding is "
"handled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`捨入類型`：如選擇:guilabel:`半天`或:guilabel:`天`作為:guilabel:`捨"
"入`欄位的設定，便會顯示此欄位。請選擇:guilabel:`向上`或:guilabel:`向下`以決定"
"捨入處理方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:286
msgid ""
"The working time is set to an 8-hour work day (a 40-hour work week). An "
"employee enters a time of 5.5 hours on a work entry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:289
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Rounding` is set to :guilabel:`No Rounding`, the work "
"entry remains at 5.5 hours."
msgstr "如果將 :guilabel:`捨入` 設為 :guilabel:`不捨入`，工作條目會維持為 5.5 小時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:292
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Rounding` is set to :guilabel:`Half Day`, and the "
":guilabel:`Rounding Type` is set to :guilabel:`Down`, the work entry is "
"changed to 4 hours. If the :guilabel:`Rounding Type` is set to "
":guilabel:`Up`, the work entry is changed to 8 hours."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:296
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Rounding` is set to :guilabel:`Day`, and the "
":guilabel:`Rounding Type` is set to :guilabel:`Down`, the work entry is "
"changed to zero hours. If the :guilabel:`Rounding Type` is set to "
":guilabel:`Up`, the work entry is changed to 8 hours."
msgstr ""
"若將:guilabel:`捨入`設為:guilabel:`日`，並將:guilabel:`捨入類型`設"
"為:guilabel:`向下`，工時記錄會變更為零小時。若將:guilabel:`捨入類型`設"
"為:guilabel:`向上`，工時記錄則會變更為 8 小時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:301
msgid "Unpaid section"
msgstr "無薪部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:303
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpaid in Structures Types`: If the work entry type is for work "
"that is *not paid*, specify which pay structure the unpaid work entry type "
"applies to, using the drop-down menu. Some situations where work is logged "
"on a payslip, but no compensation is given, such as unpaid internships, "
"unpaid training, or volunteer work."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`架構類型中的無薪項目`：如果工作項目類型屬於 *無薪* 工作，請使用下"
"拉式選單指定該無薪工作項目類型適用的薪資架構。部分情況下工作會記錄在薪資單上"
"但不發放薪酬，例如無薪實習、無薪培訓或義務工作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:309
msgid "Time off options section"
msgstr "休假選項部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:311
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Off`: Tick this box if the work entry type can be selected "
"for a time off request or time off entry, in the **Time Off** application."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`休假`：如果此工作紀錄類型可在 **休假** 應用程式中用於選擇休假申請"
"或休假紀錄，請勾選此方格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:314
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Time Off` is active, a :guilabel:`Time Off Type` field "
"appears. This field has a drop-down menu to select the specific types of "
"time off, such as `Paid Time Off`, `Sick Time Off`, or `Extra Hours`. Select"
" the :guilabel:`Time Off Type` associated with the work entry type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:318
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Keep Time Off Right`: Tick this checkbox if the work entry type "
"associated with the selected time off type allows for rolling over unused "
"time off to the following year."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`保留休假權利`：如與所選休假類型關聯的工作項目類型允許將未使用的休"
"假結轉至下一年，請勾選此複選框。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:322
msgid "Reporting section"
msgstr "報表部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:324
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unforeseen Absence`: Tick this box if the work entry type should "
"be visible on the unforeseen absences report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:327
msgid "New work entry type form with all fields to be filled in."
msgstr "新增工作項目類型表單，當中包含所有須填寫的欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:331
msgid ":doc:`payslips`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entries.rst:333
msgid ":doc:`pay_runs`"
msgstr ":doc:`pay_runs`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Work entry analysis"
msgstr "工作紀錄分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"The default *Work Entries Analysis* report provides an overview of the "
"validated work entries for the current month. To view this report, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting --> Work Entry Analysis`."
msgstr ""
"預設的 *工作紀錄分析* 報告提供本月已驗證工作紀錄的概覽。要查看此報告，請前往 "
":menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 報告 --> 工作紀錄分析`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:9
msgid ""
"The work entries appear in a pivot table, with the default filters of "
":guilabel:`Current month: (Month)(Year)` and :guilabel:`Validated`. The "
"various types of :doc:`work_entries` populate the rows, while the "
":guilabel:`Total` values populate the only visible column."
msgstr ""
"工作條目會顯示於樞紐分析表中，預設篩選條件為 :guilabel:`本月：(月)(年)` 及 "
":guilabel:`已驗證`。各種 :doc:`work_entries` 類型會填入列中，而 :guilabel:`總"
"計` 數值則會填入唯一可見的欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:13
msgid ""
"To change the displayed information, click :icon:`fa-plus-square` "
":guilabel:`Total` above the main column, revealing a drop-down menu of "
"available metrics. Click on one of the available groupings, and the data is "
"further organized by that selected metric. The default options are "
":guilabel:`Work Entry Type`, :guilabel:`Employee`, and "
":guilabel:`Department`. If in a multi-company database, a "
":guilabel:`Company` option also appears."
msgstr ""
"如要更改顯示的資料，請按一下主欄上方的 :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`總"
"計`，以顯示可用指標的下拉式選單。按一下其中一個可用分組，資料便會按所選指標進"
"一步整理。預設選項為 :guilabel:`工作項目類型`、:guilabel:`員工` 及 "
":guilabel:`部門`。如使用多公司資料庫，亦會顯示 :guilabel:`公司` 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:20
msgid "Work entry analysis comparison"
msgstr "工作記錄分析比較"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:22
msgid ""
"It is possible to compare the work entries from one time period to a "
"previous time period. To view this comparison, first navigate to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting --> Work Entry Analysis`."
msgstr ""
"您可以將某個時段的工作記錄與上一個時段進行比較。要檢視此比較結果，請先前"
"往:menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 報表 --> 工作記錄分析`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:26
msgid ""
"Next, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` icon in the "
"search bar, revealing a drop-down menu. Under the :icon:`fa-adjust` "
":guilabel:`Comparison` section, click on either :guilabel:`Current Month: "
"Previous Period` or :guilabel:`Current Month: Previous Year`."
msgstr ""
"接下來，點擊搜尋列中的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`（向下箭頭）` 圖示，"
"隨即會顯示下拉式選單。在 :icon:`fa-adjust` :guilabel:`比較` 部分下，點擊 "
":guilabel:`本月：上期` 或 :guilabel:`本月：去年同期`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:30
msgid ""
"The report updates and displays the data for the current time period, data "
"for the selected previous time period, as well as the :guilabel:`Variation` "
"between the two, in a percentage."
msgstr ""
"報表會更新並顯示當前時間段及所選上一時間段的數據，以及兩者之間以百分比顯示"
"的:guilabel:`變動`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:33
msgid ""
"A pivot table comparing the work entries of the current month and the "
"previous month."
msgstr "比較本月與上月工作記錄的樞紐分析表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:37
msgid ""
"If no work entries for a specific :ref:`work entry type <payroll/work-entry-"
"types>` are logged for the time period, it does **not** appear on the "
"report. That does **not** mean the work entry type does not exist, or is not"
" configured."
msgstr ""
"如果某段時間內沒有記錄特定 :ref:`工作記錄類型 <payroll/work-entry-types>` 的"
"工作記錄，該類型 **不會** 顯示在報表上。這 **並不** 代表該工作記錄類型不存在"
"或未有設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:41
msgid ""
"Additionally, if the default :guilabel:`Current month: (Month)(Year)` filter"
" is removed from the search bar, the :guilabel:`Comparison` column does "
"**not** appear; there must be a time-frame selected to view the "
":guilabel:`Comparison` column."
msgstr ""
"此外，如果從搜尋欄移除預設的 :guilabel:`本月：(月)(年)` 篩選條件"
"，:guilabel:`比較` 欄便 **不會** 顯示；必須選擇一個時間範圍，方可查看 "
":guilabel:`比較` 欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:46
msgid "Use case: overtime report comparison"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:48
msgid ""
"It is possible to alter the *Work Entries Analysis* report to show a "
"comparison of only overtime work entries, grouped by employee, for a "
"specific time period. To view this data, first navigate to the default *Work"
" entry analysis* report by going to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Reporting --> Work Entry Analysis`."
msgstr ""
"你可以修改 *工作紀錄分析* 報表，只顯示特定時段內按員工分組的加班工作紀錄比較"
"。要查看此數據，請先前往 :menuselection:`薪資應用程式 --> 報表 --> 工作紀錄分"
"析`，開啟預設的 *工作紀錄分析* 報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:53
msgid ""
"Next, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` icon in the "
"search bar, revealing a drop-down menu. Under the :icon:`fa-filter` "
":guilabel:`Filters` column, click :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter`, and a "
":guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:57
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`Work Entry Type` for the first "
"field, leave the middle field as-is (with :guilabel:`is in` populating the "
"field), and select :guilabel:`Overtime Hours` for the last field. Click "
":guilabel:`Add`, and all other work entry types disappear, and "
":guilabel:`Overtime Hours` appear in the sole row."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:62
msgid ""
"To compare overtime from the current month to the previous month, to see "
"which month had more overtime logged, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`(down arrow)` icon again in the search bar. Under the :icon:`fa-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`Comparison` section, click :guilabel:`Current Month: "
"Previous Period`. Click away from the drop-down menu to close it."
msgstr ""
"要比較本月與上月的加班時數，查看哪個月份記錄了較多加班時間，請再次點擊搜尋欄"
"中的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`（向下箭頭）` 圖示。在 :icon:`fa-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`比較` 部分下，點擊 :guilabel:`本月：上一期間`。點擊下拉式"
"選單以外的位置以關閉選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:67
msgid ""
"Now, the report displays the :guilabel:`Overtime Hours` for the current "
"month and the previous month, along with the :guilabel:`Variation`, in a "
"percentage."
msgstr ""
"現在，報表會顯示本月與上月的 :guilabel:`加班時數`，以及以百分比表示的 "
":guilabel:`變動`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:70
msgid ""
"To view which employees received the most overtime, click :icon:`fa-plus-"
"square` :guilabel:`Overtime Hours`, revealing a drop-down menu of options. "
"Click :guilabel:`Employee`, and all employees with overtime work entries for"
" either the current or previous month appears."
msgstr ""
"若要查看哪些員工的加班時數最多，請按一下 :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`加"
"班時數` 以開啟選項下拉式選單。按一下 :guilabel:`員工`，即可顯示本月或上月有加"
"班工作記錄的所有員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:74
msgid ""
"In this example, it can be determined that :guilabel:`Marc Demo` worked the "
"most overtime in :guilabel:`August 2024`, whereas :guilabel:`Beth Evans` "
"worked the most overtime hours in :guilabel:`September 2024`. Additionally, "
":guilabel:`Mitchell Admin` had the largest variation change, with a "
":guilabel:`-100%` change from :guilabel:`August 2024` to "
":guilabel:`September 2024`."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，可以看出 :guilabel:`Marc Demo` 在 :guilabel:`2024年8月` 的加班時"
"數最多，而 :guilabel:`Beth Evans` 則在 :guilabel:`2024年9月` 的加班時數最多。"
"此外，:guilabel:`Mitchell Admin` 的變動幅度最大，錄得 :guilabel:`-100%` 的變"
"化（由 :guilabel:`2024年8月` 至 :guilabel:`2024年9月`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/work_entry_analysis.rst:79
msgid ""
"A pivot table comparing the overtime from September 2024 with August 2024."
msgstr "比較 2024 年 9 月與 2024 年 8 月加班時數的樞紐分析表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:3
msgid "Working schedules"
msgstr "工作時間表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo, *working schedules* determine the hours employees are expected to "
"work, according to their :doc:`contract <contracts>`, and informs the "
"**Payroll** app how to compute work entries, ultimately affecting salaries "
"and payslips. It is necessary to ensure all working schedules for employees "
"are configured in the database."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，*工作時間表* 會根據員工的 :doc:`合約 <contracts>` 決定其預期工作"
"時數，並告知 **薪酬** 應用程式如何計算工時記錄，最終影響薪金及糧單。你必須確"
"保資料庫已設定所有員工的工作時間表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:10
msgid ""
"To view the currently configured working schedules, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Working Schedules`, and "
"the *Working Schedules* dashboard loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:13
msgid ""
"All working schedules available to use currently set up in the database for "
"the company."
msgstr "目前在資料庫中為公司設定並可供使用的所有工作時間表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:17
msgid ""
"In Odoo's **Payroll** app, *working schedules* are referred to as *working "
"hours* in :ref:`salary structures <payroll/salaries/structure-types>`."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 的 **薪酬** 應用程式中，*工作時間表* 在 :ref:`薪酬結構 <payroll/"
"salaries/structure-types>` 中稱為 *工作時間*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:23
msgid "New working schedule"
msgstr "新工作時間表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:25
msgid ""
"To create a new working schedule, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app "
"--> Configuration --> Working Schedules`, click :guilabel:`New`, and a blank"
" *Working Schedules* form loads. The form has two sections, a general "
"information section and a *Working Hours* tab listing out all the individual"
" working hours by day and time."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的工作時間表，請前往:menuselection:`薪酬應用程式 --> 配置 --> 工作時"
"間表`，點擊:guilabel:`新增`，系統便會載入空白的 *工作時間表* 表單。該表單包含"
"兩個部分：一般資料部分，以及按日及時間列出所有個別工作時數的 *工作時間* 分頁"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:30
msgid "Fill out the following information on the top-half of the form:"
msgstr "在表格上半部分填寫以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: Type in the name for the new default working schedule. "
"This should be descriptive and clear to understand, such as `Standard 20 "
"Hours/Week`. The placeholder name `Working Hours of (Company)` populates "
"this field by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`名稱`：輸入新預設工作時間表的名稱。名稱應具描述性且清晰易明，例如 "
"`標準每週 20 小時`。此欄位預設會填入佔位名稱 `（公司）的工作時間`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Schedule Type`: Click the radio button next to "
":guilabel:`Flexible` indicating a flexible schedule, or :guilabel:`Fully "
"Fixed` for a set schedule with specific working hours. If "
":guilabel:`Flexible` is selected, the *Working Hours* tab is hidden."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`時間表類型`：按一下:guilabel:`彈性`旁邊的選項按鈕以表示彈性時間表"
"，或按一下:guilabel:`完全固定`以設定具有特定工作時間的固定時間表。若選"
"擇:guilabel:`彈性`，*工作時間*分頁將會隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Define Amount of Hours per day`: Enable this option to have "
"specific start and end working times."
msgstr ":guilabel:`定義每日工作時數`：啟用此選項以設定特定的開始及結束工作時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Full Time Equivalent`: The amount of hours an employee must work "
"each week to be considered a full time employee. This field **cannot** be "
"modified, and is determined by the country the company is located in."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`全職當量`：員工每週必須工作以被視為全職員工的時數。此欄位 **不"
"可** 修改，並由公司所在國家／地區決定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Time Rate`: The percentage of hours compared to the full "
"time schedule. The percentage is auto-generated based on the :guilabel:`Full"
" Time Equivalent` and the working hours configured in the *Working Hours* "
"tab. This number should be between `0.00%` and `100%`, so if the percentage "
"is above `100%`, it is an indication that the working times may need "
"adjustment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company that can use these new default "
"working hours from the drop-down menu. A blank field indicates it is "
"available for all companies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：從下拉式選單中選擇可使用此新預設工作時數的公司。如留空，則"
"表示適用於所有公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`2 Week's Calendar`: Enable this option to switch from a one-week "
"calendar to a two-week calendar. When enabled, two tabs appear: *Week 1 "
"Working Hours* and *Week 2 Working Hours*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`雙週行事曆`：啟用此選項，即可從單週行事曆切換至雙週行事曆。啟用後"
"，系統會顯示兩個分頁：*第 1 週工作時間* 及 *第 2 週工作時間*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:52
msgid ""
"Next, configure the individual hours in the *Working Hours* tab. This tab "
"lists the specific working hours for each day, including breaks."
msgstr ""
"接著，在 *工作時數* 分頁中設定個別工時。此分頁列出每日的具體工作時間，包括休"
"息時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:55
msgid ""
"The default presented working hours are for a 40-hour work week, with each "
"day divided into three timed sections. Every day has morning (8:00-12:00), "
"lunch (12:00-13:00), and evening (13:00-17:00) hours configured."
msgstr ""
"預設顯示的工作時間為每週 40 小時工作制，每天分為三個時段。每天均已配置上午（"
"8:00-12:00）、午膳（12:00-13:00）及下午（13:00-17:00）時段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:60
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Work from` and :guilabel:`Work to` times **must** be in a "
"24-hour format. For example, `2:00 PM` is entered as `14:00`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:63
msgid ""
"Update the :guilabel:`Name` of each shift, if desired. Modify the "
":guilabel:`Day of Week`, :guilabel:`Day Period`, and :guilabel:`Work Entry "
"Type` selections by clicking into the drop-down menus in each column and "
"making the desired selection. The :guilabel:`Work from`, and :guilabel:`Work"
" to` columns are modified by typing in the time."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，請更新每個更次的 :guilabel:`名稱`。點擊每欄中的下拉式選單並作出所需"
"選擇，以修改 :guilabel:`星期幾`、:guilabel:`時段` 及 :guilabel:`工作紀錄類"
"型` 選項。至於 :guilabel:`工作開始時間` 及 :guilabel:`工作結束時間` 欄位，則"
"透過輸入時間來修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:68
msgid "New working schedule form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:72
msgid ""
"If the working hours are not consistent each week, and the hours are on a "
"bi-weekly schedule instead, enable the :guilabel:`Switch to 2 week calendar`"
" checkbox on the new *Working Schedules* form. This changes the single "
"*Working Hours* tab to two tabs, a *Week 1 Working Hours* and a *Week 2 "
"Working Hours* tab, where the working times can be adjusted."
msgstr ""
"若每週的工作時數並不一致，而是採用雙週排班表，請在新 *工作時間表* 表單上啟用 "
":guilabel:`切換至 2 週曆` 核取方塊。這會將單一的 *工作時數* 分頁改為兩個分頁"
"，即 *第 1 週工作時數* 及 *第 2 週工作時數* 分頁，方便調整工作時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/working_schedules.rst:77
msgid "A working schedule set to a two week schedule."
msgstr "設定為雙週制的工作時間表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:5
msgid "Recruitment"
msgstr "招聘"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo keeps all job applicants organized with a preconfigured series of steps"
" and stages that each applicant goes through. Each stage has specific steps "
"that should be performed. These range from scheduling a phone call, "
"conducting an interview, or sending a job offer, for example. This process "
"is referred to as the *applicant flow.*"
msgstr ""
"Odoo 透過預設的一系列步驟和階段，有條理地管理所有求職者，每位求職者均須經歷這"
"些階段。每個階段都有應執行的特定步驟，例如安排電話通話、進行面試或發出錄取通"
"知。此流程稱為 *求職者流程。*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:12
msgid ""
"When an applicant applies for a job position, an *applicant card* is "
"automatically created in Odoo's **Recruitment** app for that specific job "
"position. As the applicant progresses through the recruitment pipeline, the "
"recruitment team moves their card from one stage to the next."
msgstr ""
"當求職者申請職位時，系統會自動在 Odoo 的**招聘**應用程式中為該職位建立一張*求"
"職者卡片*。隨着求職者在招聘流程中推進，招聘團隊會將其卡片從一個階段移至下一個"
"階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:16
msgid ""
":ref:`Stages can be configured <recruitment/modify-stages>` so that an email"
" is automatically sent out using a set, preconfigured template as soon as an"
" applicant's card enters a stage. These automated emails are defined on each"
" stage in the applicant flow."
msgstr ""
":ref:`可設定各個階段 <recruitment/modify-stages>`，讓應徵者卡片一進入某個階段"
"，系統便會自動使用預先設定的範本發送電郵。這些自動發送的電郵是在應徵流程的每"
"個階段中定義。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:20
msgid ""
"The flow described in this document is Odoo's default configuration, but it "
"can be customized to suit any recruitment process."
msgstr "本文件所述的流程為 Odoo 的預設配置，但可自訂以配合任何招聘流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:24
msgid ""
"Stages apply to all job positions unless :ref:`marked as job-specific "
"<recruitment/customize-stages>`. Changes to stages (e.g., additions, "
"deletions) affect all positions unless explicitly scoped."
msgstr ""
"除非 :ref:`標記為職位專屬 <recruitment/customize-stages>` ，否則階段適用於所"
"有職位。對階段作出的變更（例如新增、刪除）會影響所有職位，除非明確指定適用範"
"圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:33
msgid ""
"Before creating a job position in Odoo, configure the necessary settings for"
" the **Recruitment** app. To view and edit the settings, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Configuration --> Settings`. After any "
"changes are made, click the :guilabel:`Save` button in the corner."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 建立職位前，請先為 **招聘** 應用程式進行必要設定。要檢視及編輯設定，"
"請前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`。作出任何變更後，點擊"
"角落的 :guilabel:`儲存` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:38
msgid "Job posting"
msgstr "職位發佈"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:40
msgid ""
"The *Job Posting* section of the settings page specifies where job positions"
" can be posted. To post job positions on the website, enable the "
":guilabel:`Online Posting` option. There is also an option to post to "
":ref:`job boards <recruitment/post-job/boards>`."
msgstr ""
"設定頁面的 *職位發佈* 部分指定可發佈職位的位置。如要在網站上發佈職位，請啟用 "
":guilabel:`網上發佈` 選項。此外，亦可選擇發佈至 :ref:`招聘網站 <recruitment/"
"post-job/boards>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:45
msgid "Process"
msgstr "處理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:47
msgid ""
"The *Process* section of the settings page specifies what the database can "
"and cannot do during recruitment."
msgstr "設定頁面的 *流程* 部分指定了資料庫在招聘過程中可以及不可以執行的操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:51
msgid "Send interview survey"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:53
msgid ""
"Odoo is capable of having a survey sent to an applicant to gather more "
"information about them. Surveys can be thought of as exams, or "
"questionnaires, and can be customized in various ways to provide the "
"recruitment team with valuable insights into the applicant."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 支援向應徵者發送問卷調查，以收集更多相關資訊。問卷調查可視為測驗或問卷，"
"並可透過多種方式自訂，為招聘團隊提供有關應徵者的寶貴參考資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:57
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Send Interview Survey` option to send surveys to "
"applicants. Once enabled, an :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Interview "
"Survey` internal link appears. Click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`Interview Survey` link to navigate to a list of all created "
"surveys."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`發送面試問卷` 選項，即可向應徵者發送問卷調查。啟用後，系統會"
"顯示 :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`面試問卷` 內部連結。點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`面試問卷` 連結，即可前往所有已建立問卷的清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:62
msgid ""
"This list includes all surveys that were created in the database, not only "
"surveys used in the **Recruitment** app. If no surveys have been created, "
"the surveys list displays a :guilabel:`No Survey Found` message and presents"
" options to create a survey from several preconfigured survey templates."
msgstr ""
"此清單包含資料庫中建立的所有問卷，而不僅限於 **招聘** 應用程式中使用的問卷。"
"如尚未建立任何問卷，問卷清單會顯示 :guilabel:`找不到問卷` 訊息，並提供選項讓"
"您從多個預先配置的問卷範本建立問卷。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:68
msgid ":doc:`create and edit surveys <../marketing/surveys/create>`"
msgstr ":doc:`建立及編輯問卷調查 <../marketing/surveys/create>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:71
msgid ""
"Enabling the :guilabel:`Send Interview Survey` option will install the "
"**Surveys** application once the settings are saved, if not already "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`傳送面試問卷` 選項後，若尚未安裝 **問卷調查** 應用程式，系統"
"會在儲存設定後自動安裝。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:75
msgid "Salary package configurator"
msgstr "薪酬方案配置器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:77
msgid ""
"When sending an offer to an applicant, an expiration date can be set on the "
"offer. Enter the number of days an offer is valid for in the "
":guilabel:`days` field. After the set amount of days has passed, if the "
"applicant has not accepted the offer, the offer is no longer available."
msgstr ""
"向應徵者發出聘書時，可為聘書設定到期日。請在 :guilabel:`天` 欄位輸入聘書的有"
"效天數。如超過所設定的天數後應徵者仍未接受聘書，該聘書便會失效。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:82
msgid "In-app purchases"
msgstr "應用程式內購買"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:84
msgid ""
"The *In-App Purchases* section of the settings page covers items that "
"require credits to use, such as :abbr:`SMS (Short Message Service)` text "
"messages, and digitizing résumés."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:88
msgid ""
":doc:`SMS pricing and FAQs <../marketing/sms_marketing/pricing_and_faq>`"
msgstr ":doc:`短訊價格及常見問題 <../marketing/sms_marketing/pricing_and_faq>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:91
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:83
msgid "Send SMS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:93
msgid ""
"It is possible to send text messages to applicants directly through the "
"**Recruitment** app. This feature requires credits to use. Click the "
":icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Manage Service & Buy Credits` internal "
"link, and follow the steps to :doc:`purchase credits "
"<../marketing/sms_marketing/pricing_and_faq>`."
msgstr ""
"您可以直接透過 **招聘** 應用程式向應徵者發送短訊。此功能需要使用點數。請按一"
"下 :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`管理服務及購買點數` 內部連結，並按照步"
"驟 :doc:`購買點數 <../marketing/sms_marketing/pricing_and_faq>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:101
msgid "Résumé digitization (OCR)"
msgstr "履歷數碼化（OCR）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:103
msgid ""
"When an application is submitted using any of the available methods, such as"
" an online application submission, emailing a resume to the job position "
"alias, or creating an applicant record directly from the database, it is "
"possible to have Odoo extract the applicant's name, phone number, and email "
"address from the résumé and populate the applicant's form. To do so, enable "
"the :guilabel:`Résumé Digitization (OCR)` option."
msgstr ""
"當透過任何可用方式提交應徵申請時（例如網上提交申請、將履歷電郵至職位別名，或"
"直接在資料庫建立應徵者記錄），Odoo 可從履歷中擷取應徵者的姓名、電話號碼及電郵"
"地址，並自動填寫應徵者表單。要啟用此功能，請開啟 :guilabel:`履歷數碼化 (OCR)"
"` 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:109
msgid ""
"When enabled, additional options appear. Click on the corresponding radio "
"button to select one of the following options:"
msgstr "啟用後，系統會顯示額外選項。點擊相應的單選按鈕，以選擇以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Do not digitize`: This option turns off résumé digitization."
msgstr ":guilabel:`不要數碼化`：此選項會關閉履歷數碼化功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:113
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Digitize on demand only`: This option only digitizes résumés when"
" requested. A :guilabel:`Digitize document` button appears on applicant "
"cards. When clicked, the résumé is scanned, and the applicant's card is "
"updated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`僅按要求數碼化`：此選項只會在收到要求時才將履歷數碼化。申請人卡片"
"上會顯示 :guilabel:`數碼化文件` 按鈕。點擊該按鈕後，系統便會掃描履歷，並更新"
"申請人卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Digitize automatically`: This option automatically digitizes all "
"résumés when they are submitted."
msgstr ":guilabel:`自動數碼化`：此選項會在提交履歷時自動將所有履歷數碼化。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:119
msgid ""
"Beneath these options are two additional links. Click the :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Manage Service & Buy Credits` internal link to purchase "
"credits for résumé digitization. Click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`View My Services` internal link to view a list of all current "
"services, and their remaining credit balances."
msgstr ""
"這些選項下方還有兩個連結。點擊 :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`管理服務及購"
"買點數` 內部連結，即可購買用於履歷數碼化的點數。點擊 :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`查看我的服務` 內部連結，即可查看目前所有服務的清單及其剩餘點數餘額"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:124
msgid ""
"For more information on document digitization and :abbr:`IAP's (in-app "
"purchases)`, refer to the :doc:`In-app purchase (IAP) "
"<../essentials/in_app_purchase>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"有關文件數碼化及:abbr:`IAP（應用程式內購買）`的更多資訊，請參閱:doc:`應用程式"
"內購買（IAP） <../essentials/in_app_purchase>`文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:128
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Do not digitize` option may appear redundant but serves a "
"distinct purpose. Disabling the :guilabel:`Résumé Digitization (OCR)` option"
" uninstalls the module, while :guilabel:`Do not digitize` keeps the module "
"installed but inactive—allowing the user to re-enable digitization later "
"without reinstalling the module."
msgstr ""
"「:guilabel:`不數碼化`」選項看似多餘，但其實另有用途。停用「:guilabel:`履歷數"
"碼化 (OCR)`」選項會解除安裝該模組，而「:guilabel:`不數碼化`」則會保留已安裝的"
"模組但使其處於非使用中狀態，讓用戶日後可重新啟用數碼化功能，而無需重新安裝模"
"組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:134
msgid "View job positions"
msgstr "檢視職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:136
msgid ""
"To access the Kanban view for a job position, navigate to the main "
":menuselection:`Recruitment` app dashboard, which is the default view when "
"opening the application. All job positions appear on the main dashboard. "
"Click a job position card to navigate to the Kanban view for all applicants "
"for that particular job position."
msgstr ""
"要存取職位的看板視圖，請前往 :menuselection:`招聘` 應用程式的主儀表板，這亦是"
"開啟應用程式時的預設視圖。所有職位均會顯示在主儀表板上。按一下職位卡片，即可"
"前往該特定職位所有應徵者的看板視圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:141
msgid "Main dashboard view of all job positions."
msgstr "所有職位的主儀表板檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:144
msgid ""
"Inside the job application, the Kanban stages appear, with all the "
"applicants populated in their respective columns, indicating what stage they"
" are currently in. In Odoo, six default stages are configured:"
msgstr ""
"在職位申請頁面內會顯示看板階段，所有應徵者均會列於各自的欄位中，以標示其目前"
"所處的階段。在 Odoo 中，系統已預設設定六個階段："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:148
msgid ":ref:`New <recruitment/recruitment_flow/new>`"
msgstr ":ref:`新增 <recruitment/recruitment_flow/new>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:149
msgid ":ref:`Qualification <recruitment/recruitment_flow/qualification>`"
msgstr ":ref:`資格審核 <recruitment/recruitment_flow/qualification>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:150
msgid ":ref:`First Interview <recruitment/recruitment_flow/first-interview>`"
msgstr ":ref:`初次面試 <recruitment/recruitment_flow/first-interview>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:151
msgid ""
":ref:`Second Interview <recruitment/recruitment_flow/second-interview>`"
msgstr ":ref:`第二次面試 <recruitment/recruitment_flow/second-interview>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:152
msgid ":doc:`Contract Proposal <recruitment/offer_job_positions>`"
msgstr ":doc:`合約建議書 <recruitment/offer_job_positions>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:153
msgid ""
":ref:`Contract Signed <recruitment/offer_job_positions/contract-signed>`"
msgstr ":ref:`已簽署合約 <recruitment/offer_job_positions/contract-signed>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:155
msgid ""
"The last column, :guilabel:`Contract Signed`, is folded by default. Folded "
"columns appear gray, and the applicants in it are hidden from view. To "
"expand the folded stage and view the applicant cards for that column, click "
"anywhere on the thin gray column that says the stage name and the column "
"expands, revealing the applicants."
msgstr ""
"最後一欄 :guilabel:`已簽署合約` 預設為摺疊狀態。摺疊的欄位會顯示為灰色，當中"
"的求職者亦會隱藏。要展開已摺疊的階段並查看該欄的求職者卡片，請按一下顯示階段"
"名稱的灰色幼欄任何位置，該欄便會展開並顯示求職者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:160
msgid "Expand a folded column by clicking on it in the Kanban view."
msgstr "在看板檢視中點擊已摺疊的欄，即可將其展開。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:163
msgid ""
"Each stage has a color-coded bar beneath the stage name, providing status "
"information for the applicants in that specific stage. The status colors "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"每個階段名稱下方都有一條彩色狀態列，顯示該階段中應徵者的狀態資訊。各種狀態顏"
"色的含義如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gray`: The applicant is still in progress at the current stage "
"and is neither ready nor blocked from the next stage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`灰色`：應徵者目前仍在當前階段進行中，既未準備好進入下一階段，亦未"
"受阻。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:168
msgid ":guilabel:`Green`: The applicant is ready to move to the next stage."
msgstr ":guilabel:`綠色`：應徵者已準備好進入下一階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:169
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Yellow`: The applicant is waiting for something before a decision"
" can be made."
msgstr ":guilabel:`黃色`：應徵者正等待某些事項處理，然後才可作出決定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:170
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Red`: The applicant is blocked from moving to the next stage."
msgstr ":guilabel:`紅色`：應徵者被禁止進入下一階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:172
msgid ""
"The status for each card is set manually. To set the status, click on the "
"small circle in the corner of the applicant card. A status pop-up window "
"appears. Click on the desired status for the applicant."
msgstr ""
"每張卡片的狀態均需手動設定。如要設定狀態，請點擊應徵者卡片角落的小圓圈，此時"
"會彈出狀態視窗。點擊該應徵者的所需狀態即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:176
msgid "The applicant card statuses, and status bar."
msgstr "應徵者卡片狀態及狀態列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:180
msgid ""
"The names for the four status colors (`In Progress`, `Ready for Next Stage`,"
" `Waiting`,and `Blocked`) :ref:`can be modified <recruitment/modify-"
"stages>`, if desired."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，四種狀態顏色（`進行中`、`準備進入下一階段`、`等待中`及`已封鎖`）的"
"名稱均:ref:`可予修改 <recruitment/modify-stages>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:186
msgid "Customize stages"
msgstr "自訂階段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:188
msgid ""
"Stages can be modified, added, or deleted to match the particular hiring "
"steps of a business."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:191
msgid "New stage"
msgstr "新階段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:193
msgid ""
"To create a new stage, hover to the right of the :guilabel:`Contract Signed`"
" stage, revealing an :guilabel:`Add Stage` option. Click :guilabel:`Add "
"Stage` and a new column appears. Enter the title for the new stage in the "
"blank box at the top of the new stage, then click the :icon:`fa-check` "
"button. The new column appears, and another new stage appears. If no new "
"stages are needed, click the :icon:`fa-multiply` button in the new stage to "
"close the new stage. Once the stage is created, click and drag the stage to "
"move it to the desired position in the workflow."
msgstr ""
"要建立新階段，請將滑鼠游標停留在 :guilabel:`已簽署合約` 階段的右側，系統會顯"
"示 :guilabel:`新增階段` 選項。按一下 :guilabel:`新增階段`，畫面上會出現新欄。"
"在新階段頂部的空白方框中輸入新階段標題，然後按一下 :icon:`fa-check` 按鈕。新"
"欄隨即出現，同時會顯示另一個新階段。如果不需要更多新階段，請按一下新階段中的 "
":icon:`fa-multiply` 按鈕以關閉新階段。建立階段後，按住並拖曳該階段，即可將其"
"移至工作流程中的所需位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:200
msgid "A new stage added, along with a second stage ready to be named."
msgstr "已新增一個階段，同時第二個階段亦已準備好供命名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:206
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:184
msgid "Modify stage"
msgstr "修改階段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:208
msgid ""
"To modify the settings of a stage, hover over the name of the stage, and a "
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Settings)` icon appears in the upper corner. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Settings)` icon, then click :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`Edit` from the resulting drop-down menu. An *Edit: "
"(Stage)* pop-up window appears. Make any desired modifications in the pop-up"
" window, then click :guilabel:`Save` when done."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:214
msgid ""
"The gear icon that appears when a column name is moused over, and the drop-down menu it\n"
"displays when clicked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:221
msgid "Edit stage"
msgstr "編輯階段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:223
msgid ""
"The *Edit: (Stage)* form is where the stage's settings are configured. The "
"only required field is the :guilabel:`Stage Name`. modify the stage as "
"desired, then click :guilabel:`Save` to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"*編輯：（階段）* 表單用於配置階段的設定。唯一的必填欄位是 :guilabel:`階段名"
"稱`。請按需要修改階段，然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存` 以儲存變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:227
msgid "The fields to be populated or modified are:"
msgstr "需要填寫或修改的欄位如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:229
msgid ":guilabel:`Stage Name`: Type in a name for the stage."
msgstr ":guilabel:`階段名稱`：輸入階段的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:230
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email Template`: Select an :ref:`email template "
"<recruitment/templates>` to be used from the drop-down menu. If a template "
"is selected, when the applicant card enters the stage, an email is "
"automatically sent to the applicant using the selected template."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`電郵範本`：從下拉式選單中選擇要使用的 :ref:`電郵範本 <recruitment/"
"templates>`。如果已選擇範本，當應徵者卡片進入該階段時，系統便會自動使用所選範"
"本向應徵者發送電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:233
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Folded in Kanban`: Check the box to have the stage appear folded "
"(hidden) at all times in the default view."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在看板中折疊`：勾選此方格，即可讓該階段在預設檢視中一直顯示為折疊"
"（隱藏）狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:235
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hired Stage`: Check the box if this stage indicates that the "
"applicant is hired. When an applicant's card enters this stage, the card "
"displays a :guilabel:`Hired` banner in the upper right corner. If this box "
"is checked, this stage is used to determine the hire date of an applicant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:239
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Specific`: If the stage only applies to specific job "
"positions, select the job positions from the drop-down menu. Multiple job "
"positions can be selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`特定職位`：如該階段僅適用於特定職位，請從下拉式選單中選擇職位。可"
"選擇多個職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:241
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show in Referrals`: Check the box if this stage should be seen in"
" the **Referrals** application, and allow the referrer to accrue points when"
" a referral of theirs reaches this stage. The **Referrals** app must be "
"installed to use this option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在推薦中顯示`：如希望此階段在**推薦**應用程式中顯示，並讓推薦人在"
"其推薦人選到達此階段時累積積分，請勾選此方格。必須安裝**推薦**應用程式方可使"
"用此選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:244
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Points`: If :guilabel:`Show in Referrals` is enabled, this field "
"appears. Enter the number of points the employee earns when an applicant "
"moves to this stage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`積分`：如已啟用 :guilabel:`在推薦中顯示`，此欄位便會顯示。請輸入當"
"應徵者進入此階段時，員工可獲得的積分數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:246
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to rot`: Enter the number of days that pass before the "
"applicant is considered stale. Enter `0` to disable this."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`過期天數`：輸入應徵者被視為過期前經過的天數。輸入 `0` 即可停用此功"
"能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:248
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tooltips` section: There are four preconfigured status labels "
"(colored circles) for each applicant's card, indicating its status. These "
"colors are displayed at the top of each stage to reflect the statuses of the"
" applicants in the stage. The *names* for the label can be modified, but the"
" label itself (the color) cannot. The default names and labels are: "
":guilabel:`In Progress` (gray), :guilabel:`Blocked` (red), "
":guilabel:`Waiting` (yellow),  and :guilabel:`Ready for Next Stage` (green)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工具提示` 部分：每張申請人卡片均有四個預先設定的狀態標籤（彩色圓點"
"），用以表示其狀態。這些顏色會顯示在每個階段的頂部，以反映該階段內申請人的狀"
"態。標籤的 *名稱* 可以修改，但標籤本身（顏色）則不可更改。預設名稱及標籤為"
"：:guilabel:`進行中`（灰色）、:guilabel:`已封鎖`（紅色）、:guilabel:`等待"
"中`（黃色）及 :guilabel:`準備進入下一階段`（綠色）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:254
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Requirements` section: Enter any internal notes for this stage "
"explaining any requirements of the stage."
msgstr ":guilabel:`要求` 部分：輸入此階段的任何內部備註，說明該階段的任何要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:258
msgid "Delete stage"
msgstr "刪除階段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:260
msgid ""
"If a stage is no longer needed, the stage can be deleted. To delete a stage,"
" hover over the name of the stage, and click the :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`(Settings)` icon that appears. Click :icon:`fa-trash` "
":guilabel:`Delete` and a *Confirmation* pop-up warning appears, asking "
":guilabel:`Are you sure you want to delete this column?` Click "
":guilabel:`Delete` to delete the stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:267
msgid ""
"If there are applicants currently in the stage being deleted, an error pops "
"up when attempting to delete that stage. The records in that stage must be "
"deleted, archived, or moved to a different stage before the stage can be "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"如果正在刪除的階段中目前有申請人，嘗試刪除該階段時會彈出錯誤訊息。必須先刪除"
"、封存該階段中的記錄，或將其移至其他階段，然後才能刪除該階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:274
msgid "Email templates"
msgstr "電郵範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:276
msgid ""
"To communicate with the applicant, Odoo has several preconfigured email "
"templates that can be used. The preconfigured email templates and when to "
"use them are as follows:"
msgstr ""
"為與應徵者溝通，Odoo 提供了多個預先配置的電郵範本可供使用。各預先配置電郵範本"
"及其適用時機如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:279
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recruitment: Applicant Acknowledgement`: This template is used to"
" let the applicant know their application was received. This email is "
"automatically sent out once the applicant is in the :guilabel:`New` stage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`招聘：申請人確認通知`：此範本用於通知申請人已收到其申請。一旦申請"
"人進入 :guilabel:`新建` 階段，系統會自動發送此電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:282
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recruitment: Interest`: This template is used to let the "
"applicant know that their application caught the recruiter's attention, and "
"they have been shortlisted for either a phone call or an interview."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`招聘：表示感興趣`：此範本用於通知應徵者，其申請已獲招聘人員垂青，"
"並已入圍電話訪談或面試名單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:285
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recruitment: Not interested anymore`: This template is used when "
"an applicant communicates that they are no longer interested in the "
"position, and thanks them for their time and consideration."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`招聘：不再感興趣`：當應徵者表示不再對該職位感興趣時，會使用此範本"
"，並感謝對方的時間及考慮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:288
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recruitment: Refuse`: This template is used when an applicant is "
"no longer being considered for the position."
msgstr ":guilabel:`招聘：拒絕`：當申請人不再被考慮擔任該職位時，會使用此範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:290
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recruitment: Schedule Interview`: This template is used to let "
"the applicant know that they have passed the :guilabel:`Initial "
"Qualification` stage, and they will soon be contacted to set up an interview"
" with the recruiter. This email is automatically sent out once the applicant"
" is in the :guilabel:`Initial Qualification` stage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`招聘：安排面試`：此範本用於通知申請人已通過 :guilabel:`初步資格審"
"核` 階段，招聘人員將會盡快聯絡他們安排面試。當申請人處於 :guilabel:`初步資格"
"審核` 階段時，系統會自動發送此電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:296
msgid ""
"Email templates can be created, modified, and deleted to suit the needs of a"
" business. For more information on email templates, refer to the "
":doc:`../general/companies/email_template` document."
msgstr ""
"你可根據業務需要建立、修改及刪除電郵範本。有關電郵範本的詳細資料，請參閱 "
":doc:`../general/companies/email_template` 文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:299
msgid ""
"To manually send an email, click :guilabel:`Send message` in the chatter. A "
"text box appears, as well as the applicant's email address. Enter the "
"message in the text box."
msgstr ""
"若要手動傳送電郵，請在對話欄中點擊 :guilabel:`傳送訊息`。系統隨即會顯示文字方"
"塊以及應徵者的電郵地址。請在文字方塊中輸入訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:302
msgid "Send an email from the chatter."
msgstr "從訊息記錄傳送電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:305
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`(Open Full composer)` icon in the "
"bottom corner of the *Send Message* tab in the chatter. A *Compose Email* "
"pop-up window loads, with the :guilabel:`To` and :guilabel:`Subject` fields "
"pre-populated. The applicant's email address is entered in the "
":guilabel:`To` field, and the :guilabel:`Subject` is `(Applicant's Name)`."
msgstr ""
"點擊通訊欄中 *傳送訊息* 分頁底部角落的 :icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`（開啟完"
"整編輯器）` 圖示。隨即會載入一個 *撰寫電郵* 彈出視窗，其中已預先填寫 "
":guilabel:`收件人` 及 :guilabel:`主旨` 欄位。應徵者的電郵地址會填入 "
":guilabel:`收件人` 欄位，而 :guilabel:`主旨` 則為 `（應徵者姓名）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:310
msgid ""
"To use a preconfigured email template, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
":guilabel:`(Templates)` icon in the bottom of the window. Select the email "
"template to use from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"如要使用預先設定的電郵範本，請點擊視窗底部的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
":guilabel:`（範本）` 圖示，然後從下拉式選單選擇要使用的電郵範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:313
msgid ""
"Preconfigured email templates may contain dynamic placeholders so unique "
"information can be populated in the email for a more personalized message to"
" the applicant. Several preconfigured email templates are available to "
"choose from. Depending on the template selected, the email subject or body "
"may change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:319
msgid ""
"Only the email templates that are configured for the model load. Other email"
" templates come preconfigured in Odoo, but if they are not configured for "
"the recruitment application, they do not appear in the list of available "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"系統只會載入為該模型配置的電郵範本。Odoo 雖已預先配置其他電郵範本，但如果未有"
"為招聘應用程式配置這些範本，它們便不會出現在可用範本清單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:323
msgid ""
"If any attachments need to be added, click the :icon:`fa-paperclip` "
":guilabel:`(Add Attachment)` button at the bottom of the window. Navigate to"
" the file to be attached, then click :guilabel:`Open` to attach it. To "
"delete an attachment, click the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(Delete)` icon "
"at the end of the attachment."
msgstr ""
"如果需要新增任何附件，請點擊視窗底部的 :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`（新增"
"附件）` 按鈕。瀏覽並選取要附加的檔案，然後點擊:guilabel:`開啟`以附加檔案。若"
"要刪除附件，請點擊附件末端的 :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`（刪除）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:328
msgid ""
"If any changes need to be made to the email, edit the body of the email. If "
"the edits should be saved to be used in the future, the email can be saved "
"as a new template. Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(Templates)` "
"button in the bottom of the window, and select :guilabel:`Save as Template`."
" Options are presented to either overwrite an existing template, or save a "
"new template. Click on an existing template name to overwrite that template,"
" or click :guilabel:`Save as Template` to save a new template. A *Create a "
"Mail Template* pop-up window loads. Enter a name for the template in the "
":guilabel:`Template Name` field, then click :guilabel:`Save Template`."
msgstr ""
"如須對電郵作出任何更改，請編輯電郵內文。若想儲存修改內容以便日後使用，可將該"
"電郵儲存為新範本。按一下視窗底部的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（範本"
"）` 按鈕，然後選擇 :guilabel:`儲存為範本`。系統會提供覆寫現有範本或儲存為新範"
"本的選項。按一下現有範本名稱即可覆寫該範本，或按一下 :guilabel:`儲存為範本` "
"以儲存新範本。此時會載入 *建立電郵範本* 彈出式視窗。請在 :guilabel:`範本名"
"稱` 欄位中輸入範本名稱，然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存範本`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:337
msgid ""
"To send the email, click :guilabel:`Send`. The email is sent to the "
"applicant and the email appears in the chatter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment.rst:340
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:115
msgid ""
"Send a custom survey, also referred to as an interview form, to an applicant using a\n"
"preconfigured template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:3
msgid "Add applicants"
msgstr "新增應徵者"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once an applicant submits an application, either using the online "
"application, or emailing a job position alias, an applicant card is "
"automatically created in the **Recruitment** app."
msgstr ""
"應徵者透過網上申請表提交申請，或發送電郵至職位別名後，**招聘** 應用程式便會自"
"動建立應徵者卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:8
msgid ""
"However, in some instances, applicants may need to be created manually in "
"the database. This could be necessary if, for example, a company accepts "
"paper applications in the mail, or is meeting prospective applicants at an "
"in-person job fair."
msgstr ""
"不過，在某些情況下，可能需要在資料庫中手動建立應徵者資料。例如，當公司接受郵"
"寄的紙本申請，或在實體招聘會上與潛在應徵者會面時，便可能需要這樣做。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:12
msgid ""
"To view current applicants, navigate to the :menuselection:`Recruitment` "
"app, then click the desired job position card. Doing so reveals the "
"*Applications* page, which displays all applicants for that specific role, "
"in a default Kanban view, organized by stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:16
msgid ""
"Add applicants from a job position's *Applications* page by using either the"
" :icon:`fa-plus` :ref:`(quick add) <recruitment/add_applicants/quick-add-"
"applicant>` button, or the :ref:`New <recruitment/add_applicants/create-new-"
"applicant>` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:23
msgid "Quick add"
msgstr "快速新增"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:25
msgid ""
"On the job position's *Applications* page, click the :icon:`fa-plus` "
":guilabel:`(Quick add)` button in the corner of the desired stage, and a new"
" applicant card loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:28
msgid "Enter the following information on the card:"
msgstr "在卡片上輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Applicant's Name`: Enter the applicant's name in this field. This"
" is displayed as the card title in the Kanban view of the *Applications* "
"page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`申請人姓名`：在此欄位輸入申請人姓名。該姓名會顯示為*申請*頁面看板"
"檢視中的卡片標題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Position`: The current job position populates this field. To "
"change it, select a different job position from the drop-down menu. The "
"newly-created card then appears on the *Applications* page for that selected"
" job position."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`職位`：此欄位會自動填入目前的職位。如需更改，請從下拉式選單中選擇"
"其他職位。新建的卡片隨後會顯示在所選職位的 *求職申請* 頁面上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:36
msgid ""
"After the information is entered, click :guilabel:`Add`. This adds the "
"applicant card to the stage, and a new blank applicant card appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:39
msgid ""
"If preferred, after entering the :guilabel:`Applicant's Name` in the Kanban "
"card, click :guilabel:`Edit`, and a detailed applicant form loads. "
":ref:`Enter the information <recruitment/add_applicants/create-new-"
"applicant>` on the new applicant form."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，在看板卡片輸入 :guilabel:`應徵者姓名` 後，可點擊 :guilabel:`編輯`，"
"系統便會載入詳細的應徵者表單。請在新應徵者表單上 :ref:`輸入資料 <recruitment/"
"add_applicants/create-new-applicant>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:43
msgid ""
"All the fields for a new applicant form entered when using the Quick Add "
"option."
msgstr "使用快速新增選項時所輸入的新申請人表單的所有欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:49
msgid "New applicant form"
msgstr "新應徵者表單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:51
msgid ""
"On the *Applications* page, click the :guilabel:`New` button in the corner, "
"and a blank *Applications* form loads."
msgstr ""
"在 *應徵申請* 頁面上，點擊角落的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統隨即載入空白的 "
"*應徵申請* 表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:54
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Job Position` and :guilabel:`Recruiter` fields "
"are populated according to the :ref:`job position configurations "
"<recruitment/new_job/create-job-position>`. Additionally, the "
":guilabel:`Department` and :guilabel:`Company` fields in the *Details* tab "
"may also be populated, if those details are configured on the job position."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，:guilabel:`職位`及:guilabel:`招聘人員`欄位會根據:ref:`職位配置 "
"<recruitment/new_job/create-job-position>`自動填入。此外，若職位已配置相關詳"
"情，*詳細資料*分頁中的:guilabel:`部門`及:guilabel:`公司`欄位亦可能會自動填入"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:59
msgid ""
"Complete the fields in the following sections on the new applicant form."
msgstr "在新申請人表單上，填寫以下各部分的欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:62
msgid ""
"Depending on installed applications and configurations, some fields may not "
"be displayed."
msgstr "視乎已安裝的應用程式及配置，部分欄位可能不會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:67
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:116
msgid "Applicant section"
msgstr "應徵者部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Applicant`: Enter the applicant's name. This field is displayed "
"as the card title in the Kanban view of the *Applications* page. This is the"
" **only** required field on the form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:71
msgid ":guilabel:`Email`: Enter the applicant's email address."
msgstr ":guilabel:`電郵`：輸入申請人的電郵地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:72
msgid ":guilabel:`Phone`: Enter the applicant's phone number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`電話`：輸入申請人的電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`LinkedIn Profile`: Enter the web address for the applicant's "
"personal profile on LinkedIn."
msgstr ":guilabel:`LinkedIn 個人檔案`：輸入應徵者在 LinkedIn 上的個人檔案網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Evaluation`: Represents a rating for the applicant: one star "
"(:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star-o` :icon:`fa-star-o`) is :guilabel:`Good`, "
"two stars (:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star-o`) is "
":guilabel:`Very Good`, and three stars (:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star` "
":icon:`fa-star`) is :guilabel:`Excellent`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`評估`：代表對申請人的評分：一星（:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star-"
"o` :icon:`fa-star-o`）為 :guilabel:`良好`，兩星（:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-"
"star` :icon:`fa-star-o`）為 :guilabel:`非常好`，三星（:icon:`fa-star` "
":icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star`）為 :guilabel:`優秀`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Position`: Select the job position the applicant is applying "
"for. This field is populated by default but can be changed if necessary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`職位`：選擇應徵者申請的職位。此欄位會預設填入，但如有需要可作出更"
"改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recruiter`: Select the user responsible for the entire "
"recruitment process for the job position. This field is populated by default"
" but can be changed if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Interviewers`: Using the drop-down menu, select the people to "
"conduct the interviews. The selected people **must** have either *recruiter*"
" or *officer* :doc:`access rights <../../general/users/access_rights>` "
"configured for the **Recruitment** app to appear in the drop-down list."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`面試官`：使用下拉式選單選擇負責進行面試的人員。所選人員 **必須** "
"已為 **招聘** 應用程式設定 *招聘人員* 或 *專員* :doc:`存取權限 <../../"
"general/users/access_rights>`，才會在下拉式清單中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Select as many tags as desired from the drop-down menu. To"
" add a tag that does not exist, type in the tag name, then click "
":guilabel:`Create \"new tag\"` from the resulting drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`標籤`：從下拉式選單中選取所需數量的標籤。如要新增不存在的標籤，請"
"輸入標籤名稱，然後在隨即出現的下拉式選單中點按:guilabel:`建立「新標籤」`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:91
msgid ""
"All the fields of the applicant section for a new applicant form entered."
msgstr "已填寫新申請人表格中申請人部分的所有欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:97
msgid ""
"Enter any notes regarding the applicant in this tab. These notes are only "
"visible internally to users who have the proper access rights."
msgstr ""
"在此分頁輸入有關申請人的任何備註。這些備註僅供擁有適當存取權限的內部使用者查"
"閱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:101
msgid ""
"A recruiter met an applicant at a job fair and had a discussion regarding "
"the job position as well as the applicant's prior history. They also had a "
"furniture assembly display, with different pieces to be assembled. This "
"allowed the recruiters to view the applicant's skills in real time. The "
"recruiter uses the *Note* tab to enter the following information:"
msgstr ""
"招聘人員在招聘會上與求職者會面，並討論了職位及求職者的過往履歷。現場亦設有傢"
"俬組裝展示區，提供不同組件供組裝，讓招聘人員即時觀察求職者的技能。招聘人員使"
"用 *備註* 分頁輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:106
msgid ""
"`Met the applicant at a job fair. They have previously worked in furniture "
"assembly for Furniture R Us. They demonstrated their skills at our assembly "
"display, and finished assembling a chair in under 3 minutes - which was the "
"fastest among all participants today.`"
msgstr ""
"`在招聘會上認識了該名申請人。他們曾於 Furniture R Us 從事傢俬組裝工作，並在我"
"們的組裝示範中展示技能，於 3 分鐘內完成組裝一張椅子——是今天所有參與者中最快的"
"一位。`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:111
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:58
msgid "Details tab"
msgstr "詳情分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:113
msgid ""
"The *Details* tab houses various information regarding the applicant and the"
" job position."
msgstr "*詳細資料* 分頁載有申請人及職位的各項資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:118
msgid "Enter the following information in the respective fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Degree`: Select the applicant's highest level of education from "
"the drop-down menu. Options are: :guilabel:`Graduate`, :guilabel:`Bachelor "
"Degree`, :guilabel:`Master Degree`, or :guilabel:`Doctoral Degree`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`學位`：從下拉式選單中選取應徵者的最高學歷。選項包括：:guilabel:`大"
"學畢業`、:guilabel:`學士學位`、:guilabel:`碩士學位` 或 :guilabel:`博士學位`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:125
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Graduate` option indicates the applicant graduated at the "
"highest level of school before a Bachelor's degree, such as a high school or"
" secondary school diploma, depending on the country."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:129
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Availability`: Select the available start date for the applicant."
" To select a date, click on the field to reveal a calendar. Navigate to the "
"date the applicant can start, and click to select it. Leaving this field "
"blank indicates the applicant can start immediately."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`可入職日期`：選擇申請人可開始工作的日期。點擊欄位即可顯示日曆，前"
"往申請人可入職的日期並點擊選取。若將此欄位留空，表示申請人可即時上班。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:134
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:88
msgid "Job section"
msgstr "職位部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:136
msgid ""
"The following fields are preconfigured when creating a new applicant, as "
"long as these fields are specified on the job position form. Editing the "
"fields is possible, if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Department`: Select the job position's department using the drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`部門`：使用下拉式選單選擇職位的部門。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the job position's company using the drop-down "
"menu. This field **only** appears in a multi-company database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：使用下拉式選單選取該職位所屬的公司。此欄位 **僅** 會於多公"
"司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:144
msgid "Salary package section"
msgstr "薪酬方案區段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:146
msgid ""
"Configure both the expected and proposed salary and benefits in this "
"section. Fill out the following fields:"
msgstr "在此部分配置預期及建議的薪酬與福利。請填寫以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected`: Enter the applicant's requested salary amount in this "
"field. The number should be in a `XX,XXX.XX` format. The currency is "
"determined by the localization setting for the company. If any benefits are "
"requested by the applicant, enter them in the blank :guilabel:`Other "
"Benefits` text field next to the :guilabel:`Expected` salary field. The "
"benefits should be short and descriptive, such as `4 Weeks Vacation` or "
"`Dental Plan`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`期望薪金`：在此欄位輸入應徵者要求的薪金額。數字應採用 `XX,XXX.XX` "
"格式，貨幣由公司的本地化設定決定。如果應徵者要求任何福利，請在空白的 "
":guilabel:`其他福利` 文字欄位中輸入，該欄位位於 :guilabel:`期望薪金` 薪金欄位"
"旁。福利內容應簡短且具描述性，例如 `4 週年假` 或 `牙科計劃`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Proposed`: Enter the salary amount offered to the applicant in "
"this field. The number should be in a `XX,XXX.XX` format. If any benefits "
"are offered to the applicant, enter them in the :guilabel:`Other Benefits` "
"text field next to the :guilabel:`Proposed` field. The benefits should be "
"short and descriptive, such as `Unlimited Sick Time` or `Health Insurance`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`建議`：在此欄位輸入提供予應徵者的薪金金額。數字應採用 `XX,XXX.XX` "
"格式。如向應徵者提供任何福利，請將其輸入至 :guilabel:`其他福利` 文字欄位（位"
"於 :guilabel:`建議` 欄位旁邊）。福利項目應簡短且具描述性，例如 `無上限病假` "
"或 `醫療保險`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:160
msgid "Sourcing section"
msgstr "來源部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:162
msgid ""
"This section houses the details regarding the way the applicant applied for "
"the job position. This information is necessary for :doc:`employee referrals"
" <../referrals>`, and allows for :doc:`reporting on the channels with the "
"highest applicant generation <source_analysis>`."
msgstr ""
"此部分記錄應徵者申請該職位的方式詳情。這些資訊對於 :doc:`員工推薦 <../"
"referrals>` 至關重要，並可用於 :doc:`報告產生最多應徵者的渠道 "
"<source_analysis>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Referred By User`: If referral points are to be earned for this "
"job position in the **Referrals** application, select the user who referred "
"the applicant from the drop-down menu. The **Referrals** application "
"**must** be installed for this field to appear."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`推薦人`：如要在 **推薦** 應用程式中為此職位賺取推薦積分，請從下拉"
"式選單中選擇推薦該應徵者的用戶。**必須** 安裝 **推薦** 應用程式，才會顯示此欄"
"位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:169
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: Using the drop-down menu, select where the applicant "
"learned about the job position. The following options come preconfigured in "
"Odoo: :guilabel:`Search engine`, :guilabel:`Lead Recall`, "
":guilabel:`Newsletter`, :guilabel:`Facebook`, :guilabel:`X`, "
":guilabel:`LinkedIn`, :guilabel:`Monster`, :guilabel:`Glassdoor`, "
":guilabel:`Craigslist`, and :guilabel:`Referral`. To add a new "
":guilabel:`Source`, type in the source, then click :guilabel:`Create \"(new "
"source)\"`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`來源`：使用下拉式選單選擇應徵者得知該職位的途徑。Odoo 已預先配置以"
"下選項：:guilabel:`搜尋引擎`、:guilabel:`潛在客戶召回`、:guilabel:`電子"
"報`、:guilabel:`Facebook`、:guilabel:`X`、:guilabel:`LinkedIn`、:guilabel:`Monster`、:guilabel:`Glassdoor`、:guilabel:`Craigslist` "
"及 :guilabel:`推薦`。如要新增:guilabel:`來源`，請輸入來源名稱，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`建立「（新來源）」`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:175
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: Using the drop-down menu, specify how the job listing "
"was found. The preconfigured options are: :guilabel:`Banner`, "
":guilabel:`Direct`, :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Facebook`, "
":guilabel:`Google Adwords`, :guilabel:`LinkedIn`, :guilabel:`Phone`, "
":guilabel:`SMS`, :guilabel:`Television`, :guilabel:`Website`, :guilabel:`X`,"
" or :guilabel:`[Push Notifications] (website name)`. To add a new "
":guilabel:`Medium`, type in the medium, then click :guilabel:`Create \"(new "
"medium)\"`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`媒介`：使用下拉式選單，指定求職者是如何找到該職位空缺。預先設定的"
"選項包括：:guilabel:`橫幅廣告`、:guilabel:`直接`、:guilabel:`電"
"郵`、:guilabel:`Facebook`、:guilabel:`Google "
"Adwords`、:guilabel:`LinkedIn`、:guilabel:`電話`、:guilabel:`短"
"訊`、:guilabel:`電視`、:guilabel:`網站`、:guilabel:`X` 或 :guilabel:`[推送通"
"知] (網站名稱)`。如要新增 :guilabel:`媒介`，請輸入媒介名稱，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`建立 \"(新媒介)\"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:181
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: Using the drop-down menu, select the campaign used for"
" the job position."
msgstr ":guilabel:`推廣活動`：使用下拉式選單，選擇此職位所使用的推廣活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:183
msgid "All the fields of the Details tab for a new applicant form entered."
msgstr "已填寫新應徵者表單中「詳細資料」分頁的所有欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:187
msgid "Skills tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:189
msgid ""
"The *Skills* tab houses all the applicant's skills. As :ref:`skills are "
"added <employees/skills>`, Odoo compares the :ref:`expected skills "
"<recruitment/new_job/job-posting>` configured for the job position with the "
"applicant's skills."
msgstr ""
"*技能* 分頁存放應徵者的所有技能。當 :ref:`新增技能 <employees/skills>` 時，"
"Odoo 會將為該職位設定的 :ref:`預期技能 <recruitment/new_job/job-posting>` 與"
"應徵者的技能作比較。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:193
msgid ""
"Additionally, the :guilabel:`Job Position Matching` scale updates in real "
"time, showing the percentage of the job skills the applicant has. This aids "
"recruiters when assessing an applicant."
msgstr ""
"此外，:guilabel:`職位配對` 量表會即時更新，顯示應徵者所具備職位技能的百分比。"
"這有助招聘人員評估應徵者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:197
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Job Position Matching` scale displays the graphic in purple. "
"If the applicant matches 100% of the required skills, the graphic appears "
"green."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`職位配對` 量表中，圖表會顯示為紫色。如果申請人符合 100% 所需技"
"能，圖表便會顯示為綠色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:200
msgid "The applicant's skills as compared to the job requirements."
msgstr "應徵者技能與職位要求的對比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Application analysis"
msgstr "申請分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Application Analysis* report allows recruiting departments to see the "
"total number of applications submitted for the past 365 days. Along with the"
" total, the number of hired applicants, refused applicants, and those still "
"in the pipeline are displayed."
msgstr ""
"透過 *申請分析* 報告，招聘部門可查看過去 365 天提交的申請總數。除了總數外，系"
"統亦會顯示已聘用的應徵者、已拒絕的應徵者，以及仍在招聘流程中的人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:9
msgid ""
"This information can help the recruiting team see how the various rates "
"align with their hiring goals and pivot their strategies to acquire more "
"desirable candidates."
msgstr ""
"這些資料可協助招聘團隊了解各項比率是否符合其招聘目標，並調整策略以吸引更理想"
"的候選人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:13
msgid "Application Analysis report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:15
msgid ""
"To view the *Application Analysis* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Reporting --> Application Analysis`. "
"This presents a line chart of all applicants for the last 365 days."
msgstr ""
"要查看*求職申請分析*報告，請前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 報告 --> 求"
"職申請分析`。這會以折線圖顯示過去 365 天內的所有求職者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:18
msgid ""
"Three separate color-coded metrics are presented: :guilabel:`In Progress` "
"appears in blue, :guilabel:`Hired` appears in red, and :guilabel:`Refused` "
"appears in green."
msgstr ""
"系統會顯示三項不同顏色的指標：:guilabel:`進行中` 為藍色，:guilabel:`已聘用` "
"為紅色，而 :guilabel:`已拒絕` 為綠色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:21
msgid ""
"Hover the cursor over a month of the chart, and an *Applications* pop-up "
"window appears, displaying the specific numbers for that month."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:24
msgid "The default Application Analysis report."
msgstr "預設的求職申請分析報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:30
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:31
msgid "Pivot table view"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:32
msgid ""
"For a more detailed view of the information in the *Application Analysis* "
"report, click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon in the "
"corner. This displays all the information in a pivot table."
msgstr ""
"如要更詳細查看 *應徵分析* 報表中的資訊，請點擊角落的 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` "
":guilabel:`(樞紐分析表)` 圖示。這會以樞紐分析表顯示所有資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:36
msgid ""
"In this default view, the months are displayed in the rows, with each job "
"position nested beneath them. The columns display the various stages of the "
"recruitment pipeline, further divided by how many applicants were hired, "
"refused, or still in process while in that stage. The displayed information "
"can be modified, if desired."
msgstr ""
"在此預設檢視中，各月份顯示於資料列中，每個職位則巢狀顯示於其下方。資料欄顯示"
"招聘流程的各個階段，並進一步細分為在該階段獲聘、被拒或仍在處理中的應徵者人數"
"。如有需要，可修改所顯示的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:41
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:48
msgid "The detailed pivot table view."
msgstr "詳細的樞紐分析表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:45
msgid ""
"To only view the total number of applicants in each stage, click :icon:`fa-"
"minus-square-o` :guilabel:`Total` in the top row. All the stages collapse, "
"displaying only the total number of applications that are :guilabel:`In "
"Progress`, :guilabel:`Hired`, and :guilabel:`Refused`, along with the totals"
" for all three in the :guilabel:`Applications` column. These numbers are "
"organized by month, then job position."
msgstr ""
"如要只檢視每個階段的申請人總數，請點擊頂端一列的 :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` "
":guilabel:`總計`。所有階段會隨之收合，僅顯示處於 :guilabel:`進行"
"中`、:guilabel:`已錄用` 及 :guilabel:`已拒絕` 狀態的申請總數，並在 "
":guilabel:`申請` 欄中顯示三者的總和。這些數字會先按月份整理，再按職位排列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:51
msgid ""
"In this example, of the fourteen newly hired employees, the "
":guilabel:`Furniture Assembler` position had the most new hires, with a "
"total of four."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，在 14 名新入職員工當中，:guilabel:`傢俬裝配員`職位的新入職人數最"
"多，共有 4 人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:54
msgid "The pivot table showing only the totals in the columns."
msgstr "僅在欄中顯示總計的透視表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:58
msgid "Use case: applicants with referrals"
msgstr "應用案例：獲推薦的應徵者"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:60
msgid ""
"To get a better understanding of how effective the company's :doc:`referral "
"program <../referrals>` is, the *Application Analysis* report can be "
"modified to show how many applicants were referred by current employees."
msgstr ""
"要更深入了解公司 :doc:`推薦計劃 <../referrals>` 的成效，可修改 *申請分析* 報"
"表，以顯示有多少應徵者由現職員工推薦。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:64
msgid ""
"From the :ref:`pivot table view <recruitment/application_analysis/pivot>` of"
" the *Application Analysis* report, first click the :guilabel:`Measures` "
":icon:`fa-caret-down` button to reveal a drop-down menu of options."
msgstr ""
"在 *申請分析* 報表的 :ref:`樞紐分析表檢視 <recruitment/application_analysis/"
"pivot>` 中，首先按一下 :guilabel:`計量` :icon:`fa-caret-down` 按鈕，以顯示選"
"項下拉式選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:68
msgid ""
"Click both :guilabel:`Has Referrer` and :guilabel:`Count` to activate those "
"two measures. Then, click :guilabel:`Applications`, :guilabel:`Hired`, "
":guilabel:`In Progress`, and :guilabel:`Refused` to deactivate those default"
" measures. Click away from the drop-down window to close it. Then click "
":icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`Total` above the columns to condense "
"all the displayed values."
msgstr ""
"同時點擊:guilabel:`有推薦人`及:guilabel:`數量`以啟用這兩個指標。然後點"
"擊:guilabel:`申請`、:guilabel:`已聘用`、:guilabel:`進行中`及:guilabel:`已拒"
"絕`以停用這些預設指標。點擊下拉式視窗以外的地方以關閉視窗。接著點擊各欄上方"
"的:icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`總計`，將所有顯示的數值摺疊合併。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:73
msgid ""
"Now, the columns display the number of applicants that came from a referral "
"in the :guilabel:`Has Referrer` column, and the total number of applicants "
"in the :guilabel:`Count` column."
msgstr ""
"現在，各欄會在:guilabel:`有推薦人`欄中顯示來自推薦的應徵者人數，並"
"在:guilabel:`數量`欄中顯示應徵者總數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:76
msgid ""
"In this example, the :guilabel:`Furniture Assembler` job position has the "
"most referrals, and almost 25% of all applications were submitted through a "
"referral."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，:guilabel:`傢俬裝配員`職位的推薦人數最多，且將近 25% 的應徵申請均"
"透過推薦提交。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:79
msgid ""
"The detailed pivot table view displaying the number of referrals and the "
"total applicants."
msgstr "顯示推薦人數及應徵者總數的詳細樞紐分析表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:83
msgid "Hired through referrals"
msgstr "透過推薦入職"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:85
msgid ""
"It is possible to modify this report even further to see how many referred "
"applicants end up being hired."
msgstr "此報表更可進一步修改，以查看最終獲聘的被推薦應徵者人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:88
msgid ""
"To view this data, click on a :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`(job "
"position)` row, which reveals a drop-down menu. Then, click "
":guilabel:`State` to show the various states applicants are currently in."
msgstr ""
"要檢視此資料，請點擊 :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`（職位）` 列，以展開下"
"拉式選單。然後點擊 :guilabel:`狀態`，以顯示應徵者目前所處的各種狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:92
msgid ""
"To expand the other rows and display the various states, click on the "
":icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`(job position)` button."
msgstr ""
"如要展開其他資料列並顯示各種狀態，請按一下 :icon:`fa-plus-square` "
":guilabel:`（職位）` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:96
msgid ""
"Only states that have applicants in them are shown for each job position. If"
" a state does **not** have any applicants, it does not appear in the list."
msgstr ""
"每個職位只會顯示包含申請人的狀態。如果某個狀態 **沒有** 任何申請人，則不會在"
"清單中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:3
msgid "Hiring velocity"
msgstr "招聘速度"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Hiring Velocity* report provides information on how long applicants "
"stay in each stage of the recruitment process. This is important, as every "
"job position has specific :ref:`hiring process details "
"<recruitment/new_job/hiring-process>` that state the length of time "
"applicants should expect to wait between specific stages."
msgstr ""
"*招聘速度*報表提供申請人在招聘流程每個階段停留時間的資訊。這一點十分重要，因"
"為每個職位都有特定的 :ref:`招聘流程詳情 <recruitment/new_job/hiring-process>"
"`，說明申請人在特定階段之間預期需等候的時間長度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:10
msgid ""
"Knowing how long applicants remain in each stage can help highlight possible"
" bottlenecks. Analyzing this data allows the recruitment team to assess each"
" stage, identify any issues, and pivot their strategies to move applicants "
"through each stage, within the expected time interval."
msgstr ""
"了解求職者在每個階段停留的時間，有助於找出潛在的流程瓶頸。分析這些數據能讓招"
"聘團隊評估各個階段、識別任何問題，並及時調整策略，確保求職者在預期時間內順利"
"推進至下一階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:15
msgid "Hiring velocity report"
msgstr "招聘速度報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:17
msgid ""
"To access the *Hiring Velocity* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Reporting --> Hiring Velocity`. The "
"report displays data for all job positions, with the stages populating the "
"x-axis, and the number of days populating the y-axis, in a default "
":icon:`fa-line-chart` :guilabel:`(Line Chart)`."
msgstr ""
"要存取 *招聘速度* 報表，請前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 報表 --> 招聘"
"速度`。該報表會以預設的 :icon:`fa-line-chart` :guilabel:`（折線圖）` 顯示所有"
"職位的數據，當中 X 軸為各個階段，Y 軸為天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:22
msgid ""
"The default filter is :guilabel:`Last 365 Days Applicant`, showing "
"information for the last 365 days."
msgstr "預設篩選條件為 :guilabel:`最近 365 日的申請人`，顯示過去 365 天的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:25
msgid ""
"Hover over a stage in the line chart to reveal a popover window listing all "
"the job positions within it, and the average number of days each job "
"position sat in each stage."
msgstr ""
"將滑鼠指標懸停在折線圖的某個階段上，即可顯示彈出式資訊視窗，當中列出該階段內"
"的所有職位，以及各職位在每個階段停留的平均日數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:28
msgid ""
"For a more visually digestible view of the information in the *Hiring "
"Velocity* report, click the :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(Bar Chart)` "
"icon in the corner. This displays all the information in a bar chart."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:32
msgid ""
"In this view, it is easier to visualize the differences between the job "
"positions, regarding how long applicants stay in each stage. From this view,"
" recruiters can determine which job positions have delays or bottlenecks at "
"certain stages."
msgstr ""
"在此檢視中，你可以更輕鬆地直觀比較不同職位的應徵者在各階段停留的時間長短。招"
"聘人員可透過此檢視，找出哪些職位在特定階段出現延誤或瓶頸。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:36
msgid "A bar chart view of the hiring velocity report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:40
msgid "Use case: comparing times by month"
msgstr "使用案例：按月比較時間"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:42
msgid ""
"With the *Hiring Velocity* report, it is possible to see if there are "
"certain months where applicants take longer to be moved through the "
"pipeline. To view this data, switch to the pivot table view by clicking the "
":icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon in the corner."
msgstr ""
"透過 *招聘速度* 報告，您可以查看申請人在某些月份是否需要更長時間才能在招聘流"
"程中推進。如要查看此資料，請按一下角落的 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(數"
"據透視表)` 圖示，切換至數據透視表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:46
msgid ""
"This presents the data in a detailed pivot table, with the rows representing"
" the different job positions, and the columns representing the stages. The "
":guilabel:`Average Days in Stage` populates the various boxes."
msgstr ""
"這會以詳細的樞紐分析表呈現數據，其中橫列代表不同職位，直欄代表各個階段。各個"
"方格會填入 :guilabel:`階段平均日數`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:51
msgid ""
"If a field is empty, it indicates no applicant has been in that stage. "
"Instead, all applicants moved from a previous stage without being placed in "
"the stage with an empty field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:54
msgid "The pivot table view of the Velocity Analysis report."
msgstr "速度分析報表的樞紐分析表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:57
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`Total` above the job position "
"rows to collapse the information. Next, click :icon:`fa-plus-square` "
":guilabel:`Total` again, revealing a drop-down menu. Click :guilabel:`Custom"
" Group` :icon:`fa-caret-down` at the bottom of the list, revealing further "
"grouping options. Click :guilabel:`Start Date` from the expanded list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:62
msgid ""
"After doing so, the data presented is grouped with the various months from "
"the previous 365 days for the rows, leaving the :guilabel:`Average Days in "
"Stage` as the columns."
msgstr ""
"完成後，顯示的資料會按過去 365 天的各個月份分組作為列，並將 :guilabel:`階段平"
"均天數` 作為欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:65
msgid "The pivot table showing the months averages for times in stage."
msgstr "顯示各階段每月平均停留時間的樞紐分析表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:68
msgid ""
"In this example, :guilabel:`July 2026` had the longest time that applicants "
"spent in each stage, on average. In addition, the :guilabel:`Second "
"Interview` stage had the longest wait time in July, with an average of "
":guilabel:`29.04` days in that stage."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，:guilabel:`2026 年 7 月` 是應徵者在各階段平均停留時間最長的月份。"
"此外，:guilabel:`第二次面試` 階段在 7 月的等候時間最長，應徵者在該階段平均停"
"留 :guilabel:`29.04` 天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:72
msgid ""
"While this report does not display the reasons applicants stayed in the "
"various stages for these lengths of time, it can be helpful to know when "
"delays occur."
msgstr "雖然此報表不會顯示申請人在各階段停留該段時間的原因，但有助掌握何時出現延誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/hiring_velocity.rst:76
msgid ":doc:`Essentials reporting documentation <../../essentials/reporting>`"
msgstr ":doc:`基本報告文件 <../../essentials/reporting>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:3
msgid "Job positions"
msgstr "職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo's **Recruitment** application, all job positions are shown on the "
"default *Job Positions* dashboard, which includes both active and inactive "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 的 **招聘** 應用程式中，所有職位都會顯示在預設的 *職位* 儀表板上，當"
"中包括啟用及停用的職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:8
msgid ""
"Each job position is shown in an individual Kanban card. If the job position"
" is active, and candidates can apply, a green :guilabel:`Published` banner "
"appears in the top-right corner of the card."
msgstr ""
"每個職位均會顯示於獨立的看板卡片中。如果該職位處於啟用狀態且應徵者可以申請，"
"卡片右上角會顯示綠色的:guilabel:`已發佈`橫幅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:12
msgid ""
"View submitted applications by clicking anywhere on a job position card, "
"except the :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Activities)` icon, the "
":guilabel:`Job Page` button, or the :guilabel:`Configure` button."
msgstr ""
"點擊職位卡片上的任意位置即可查看已提交的求職申請，但 :icon:`fa-clock-o` "
":guilabel:`(活動)` 圖示、:guilabel:`職位頁面` 按鈕或 :guilabel:`配置` 按鈕除"
"外。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:16
msgid "Main dashboard view of Recruitment app showing all job positions."
msgstr "招聘應用程式的主儀表板檢視，顯示所有職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:22
msgid "Create a job position"
msgstr "建立職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:24
msgid ""
"To create a job position from the main dashboard in the **Recruitment** app,"
" click the :guilabel:`New` button in the top-left corner, and a *Create a "
"Job Position* pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"要在 **招聘** 應用程式的主儀表板上建立職位，請點擊左上角的 :guilabel:`新增` "
"按鈕，隨即會出現 *建立職位* 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:27
msgid ""
"First, enter the name of the :guilabel:`Job Position` (such as `Sales "
"Manager`, `Mechanical Engineer`, etc.) in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"首先，在相應欄位中輸入 :guilabel:`職位` 名稱（例如 `銷售經理`、`機械工程師` "
"等）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:30
msgid ""
"Next, enter an :guilabel:`Application email` by typing in the first half of "
"the email address in the first field, then select the second half of the "
"email using the drop-down menu in the second field. Applicants can send a "
"resumé to this specific email address, and Odoo creates an application for "
"them automatically."
msgstr ""
"接下來，輸入 :guilabel:`申請電郵`：在第一個欄位輸入電郵地址的前半部分，然後在"
"第二個欄位中使用下拉式選單選擇電郵的後半部分。應徵者可將履歷表發送至此指定電"
"郵地址，Odoo 便會自動為他們建立職位申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:35
msgid ""
"When complete, click the :guilabel:`Create` button to save the entry, or the"
" :guilabel:`Discard` button to delete it."
msgstr ""
"完成後，點擊 :guilabel:`建立` 按鈕以儲存項目，或點擊 :guilabel:`捨棄` 按鈕將"
"其刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:38
msgid "Create a new job position."
msgstr "建立新職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:42
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Create` button is clicked, the *Applications* dashboard "
"for the newly created job loads. The *Applications* dashboard is empty, as "
"there are no applicants. Click the :guilabel:`Job Positions` breadcrumb to "
"return to the main **Recruitment** app dashboard."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`建立` 按鈕後，系統便會載入新建立職位的 *應徵申請* 儀表板。"
"由於目前未有應徵者，*應徵申請* 儀表板為空。按一下 :guilabel:`職位` 導覽路徑，"
"即可返回 **招聘** 應用程式的主儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:49
msgid "Configure a job position"
msgstr "設定職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:51
msgid ""
"Once the job position has been :ref:`created <recruitment/new_job/create-"
"job-position>`, the details must be configured. On the main **Recruitment** "
"app dashboard, click the :guilabel:`Configure` button at the end of the "
"Kanban card, and the detailed job position form loads."
msgstr ""
"職位 :ref:`建立 <recruitment/new_job/create-job-position>` 後，必須配置詳細資"
"料。在主 **招聘** 應用程式儀表板上，點擊看板卡片末端的 :guilabel:`配置` 按鈕"
"，即可載入詳細的職位表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:55
msgid ""
"Configure the *Details*, *Summary*, *Application Info*, and *Trackers* tabs,"
" as described below."
msgstr "按照以下說明，設定 *詳細資料*、*摘要*、*申請資訊* 及 *追蹤器* 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:60
msgid ""
"All the basic details about the job position are housed in the *Details* "
"tab."
msgstr "職位的所有基本資料均位於 *詳細資料* 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:62
msgid ""
"None of the fields are required, but it is important to configure and "
"populate the :guilabel:`Department`, :guilabel:`Job Location`, and "
":guilabel:`Employment Type` fields, as they are all visible to prospective "
"applicants on the website."
msgstr ""
"所有欄位均非必填，但建議配置並填寫:guilabel:`部門`、:guilabel:`工作地"
"點`及:guilabel:`僱用類型`欄位，因為這些資訊全部都會在網站上向潛在應徵者顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:67
msgid ""
"Some fields listed below may not appear depending on the installed apps and "
"database configuration."
msgstr "視乎已安裝的應用程式及資料庫配置，以下列出的部分欄位可能不會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:70
msgid "Enter the information in the following sections."
msgstr "在以下部分輸入資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:75
msgid "Hiring process section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recruiter`: Select the person responsible for recruiting this "
"role."
msgstr ":guilabel:`招募人員`：選擇負責招募此職位的人員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Interviewers`: Select who should perform the interviews. Multiple"
" people can be selected."
msgstr ":guilabel:`面試官`：選擇負責進行面試的人員。可選擇多位人員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Interview Form`: Select an interview form that applicants fill "
"out prior to their interview."
msgstr ":guilabel:`面試表單`：選擇申請人在面試前填寫的面試表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email Alias`: Enter an email address to which applicants can send"
" a resumé. Once emailed, Odoo automatically creates an application for them."
" If an email was entered when creating the job position, this field is "
"populated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`電郵別名`：輸入供申請人寄送履歷表的電郵地址。申請人發送電郵後，"
"Odoo 會自動為其建立職位申請。如建立職位時已輸入電郵地址，此欄位會自動填上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:85
msgid ":guilabel:`Website`: Select the website the job is published on."
msgstr ":guilabel:`網站`：選擇發佈該職位空缺的網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company the job is for. This field only "
"appears if using a multi-company database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Department`: Select the relevant department for the job position."
" This is visible on the website."
msgstr ":guilabel:`部門`：選取該職位的相關部門。此資訊會在網站上顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Location`: Select the physical address for the job. If the "
"job position is remote, leave this field blank. This is visible on the "
"website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:100
msgid "Job posting section"
msgstr "職位發佈部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Published`: When the job position is ready to be published on the"
" website, click the :guilabel:`Published` toggle to publish the job "
"position. The toggle changes to green, indicating the listing is live on the"
" website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已發佈`：當職位準備好在網站上發佈時，點擊 :guilabel:`已發佈` 切換"
"按鈕以發佈該職位。切換按鈕會變為綠色，表示職位資訊已在網站上線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Target`: Enter the number of employees to be hired for this "
"position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Skills`: Select all the desired skills for the job "
"position in this field. To add a skill, click the :icon:`fa-plus` "
":guilabel:`(plus sign)` icon, and select the *Category*, *Skill*, and *Skill"
" Level* for each skill added. The skills presented are :ref:`configured in "
"the Employees app <employees/skills>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預期技能`：在此欄位中選取該職位所需的所有技能。要新增技能，請點擊 "
":icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`（加號）` 圖示，並為每個新增的技能選取 *類別*、*技"
"能* 及 *技能等級*。所顯示的技能可在 :ref:`員工應用程式中設定 <employees/"
"skills>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Degree`: Select the level of education desired, using "
"the drop-down menu. The default options are: :guilabel:`Graduate`, "
":guilabel:`Bachelor Degree`, :guilabel:`Master Degree`, and "
":guilabel:`Doctoral Degree`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預期學歷`：使用下拉式選單選擇所需的教育程度。預設選項包括"
"：:guilabel:`畢業生`、:guilabel:`學士學位`、:guilabel:`碩士學位` 及 "
":guilabel:`博士學位`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:113
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Range`: Enter both the minimum and maximum salaries "
"offered for the position in the two fields. Then, set the last field to the "
"time-frame for the salary range. The default options are :guilabel:`Hour`, "
":guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Bi-Week`, :guilabel:`Month`, "
"and :guilabel:`Year`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:119
msgid "Contract section"
msgstr "合約部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:121
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employment Type`: Select what type of position the job is, using "
"the drop-down menu. The default options are :guilabel:`Permanent`, "
":guilabel:`Temporary`, :guilabel:`Interim`, :guilabel:`Seasonal`, "
":guilabel:`Full-Time`, :guilabel:`Part-Time`, :guilabel:`Intern`, "
":guilabel:`Student`, :guilabel:`Apprenticeship`, :guilabel:`Thesis`, "
":guilabel:`Statutory`, and :guilabel:`Employee`. Depending on the installed "
"localization, other options may be available. This is visible on the "
"website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`僱傭類型`：使用下拉式選單選取該職位的類型。預設選項包括 "
":guilabel:`長期`、:guilabel:`臨時`、:guilabel:`暫代`、:guilabel:`季節"
"性`、:guilabel:`全職`、:guilabel:`兼職`、:guilabel:`實習生`、:guilabel:`學"
"生`、:guilabel:`學徒`、:guilabel:`論文研究`、:guilabel:`法定` 及 "
":guilabel:`僱員`。視乎已安裝的本地化模組，系統可能會提供其他選項。此項目會顯"
"示在網站上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Schedule`: Select the working schedule for the job "
"position. Odoo provides one working schedule by default, :guilabel:`Standard"
" 40 hours/week`, but all working schedules in the database are available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Template`: Select a contract template to be used when "
"offering the job to a candidate."
msgstr ":guilabel:`合約範本`：選擇向求職者發出聘書時所使用的合約範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:133
msgid "The job information details in the Recruitment tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:137
msgid "Summary tab"
msgstr "摘要分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:139
msgid ""
"Enter the complete job description in the *Summary* tab. This description is"
" visible on the website, and should convey any relevant information for the "
"position that is **not** covered or explained in the *Details* tab. This may"
" include information such as specific tasks the job requires, any required "
"past experience, or uncommon benefits or compensation."
msgstr ""
"在*摘要*分頁輸入完整的職位描述。此描述會顯示於網站上，應傳達*詳細資料*分頁"
"中**未有**涵蓋或說明的所有相關職位資訊。這可包括職位所需的特定工作內容、任何"
"所需的過往經驗，以及特別的福利或薪酬待遇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:144
msgid "The summary of the position in the Job Summary tab."
msgstr "「職位摘要」分頁中的職位摘要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:150
msgid "Application info tab"
msgstr "申請資料分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:152
msgid ""
"The *Process Details* section of the *Application Info* tab contains "
"information that is displayed online for the job position. This informs the "
"applicants of the timeline and steps for the recruitment process, so they "
"know when to expect a reply."
msgstr ""
"*申請資訊* 分頁中的 *流程詳情* 部分載有會在網上為該職位顯示的資訊，藉此通知應"
"徵者招聘流程的時間表及步驟，讓他們知道何時會收到回覆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:156
msgid ""
"The following fields are populated by default, but can be modified to suit "
"the recruitment timeline of the business:"
msgstr "以下欄位會按預設值填入，但可根據企業的招聘時間表進行修改："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:159
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time to Answer`: The number of days before the applicant is "
"contacted. :guilabel:`2 open days` populates this field by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`回覆時間`：聯絡申請人前的天數。此欄位預設填入 :guilabel:`2 個工作"
"天`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:161
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Process`: The various stages the candidate goes through during "
"the recruitment process. By default, two process steps are visible: "
":guilabel:`1 Phone Call` and :guilabel:`1 Onsite Interview`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:164
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to get an Offer`: The number of days before the applicant "
"should expect an offer after the recruitment process has ended. The default "
"is :guilabel:`4 Days after Interview`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`收到錄取通知天數`：招聘流程結束後，申請人預計收到聘書前的天數。預"
"設為:guilabel:`面試後 4 天`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:167
msgid "Enter job information details in the recruitment tab."
msgstr "在招聘分頁中輸入職位詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:171
msgid ""
"The *Process Details* section of the *Application Info* tab is a text field."
" All answers are typed in rather than selected from a drop-down menu. The "
"text is displayed on the website exactly as it appears in this tab."
msgstr ""
"*申請資訊* 分頁中的 *流程詳情* 部分是一個文字欄位。所有答案都需手動輸入，而非"
"從下拉式選單中選擇。網站上顯示的文字會與此分頁中的內容完全一致。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:176
msgid "Trackers tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:178
msgid ""
"When reaching potential applicants, recruiters often share the job position "
"across multiple websites, including social media sites, job board sites, and"
" third-party hosting sites. The *Trackers* tab provides a centralized place "
"for recruiters to keep a record of all the places a tracking link has been "
"shared. This allows recruiters to determine which sites were the most "
"successful in terms of receiving applications from them."
msgstr ""
"接觸潛在應徵者時，招聘人員通常會在多個網站分享職位空缺，包括社交媒體網站、求"
"職網站及第三方託管網站。*追蹤器*分頁提供一個集中位置，讓招聘人員記錄所有曾分"
"享追蹤連結的地方。這有助招聘人員判斷哪些網站最能成功吸引應徵者申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:185
msgid ""
"Before creating trackers, first :ref:`publish <recruitment/post-"
"job/website>` the job on the company website."
msgstr ""
"建立追蹤器前，請先在公司網站上 :ref:`發佈 <recruitment/post-job/website>` 該"
"職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:188
msgid ""
"To add a tracking link, click on the *Trackers* tab, click :guilabel:`Add a "
"line`, and a blank line appears at the top of the list. Configure the "
"following fields for each tracker:"
msgstr ""
"若要新增追蹤連結，請點擊 *追蹤器* 分頁，再點擊:guilabel:`新增資料行`，清單頂"
"部隨即會出現空白行。請為每個追蹤器設定以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:191
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: Select the :ref:`campaign <marketing/social-"
"campaigns/new-campaign>` the job position falls under using the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`推廣活動`：使用下拉選單選擇該職位所屬的 :ref:`推廣活動 <marketing/"
"social-campaigns/new-campaign>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:193
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: Select where the tracker was used using the drop-down "
"menu. There are ten default options, such as :guilabel:`Search engine`, "
":guilabel:`Newsletter`, and :guilabel:`LinkedIn`, but more may be available "
"depending on the installed applications and created events."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:197
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: Select the method used to share the tracker from a list "
"of ten default options, such as :guilabel:`Banner`, :guilabel:`Email`, and "
":guilabel:`Google Adwords`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`媒介`：從十個預設選項中選擇用於分享追蹤連結的方法，例"
"如:guilabel:`橫幅廣告`、:guilabel:`電郵`及:guilabel:`Google Adwords`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:199
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tracker URL`: Once the :guilabel:`Campaign`, :guilabel:`Source`, "
"and :guilabel:`Medium` are defined, Odoo automatically creates the "
"corresponding tracking link. Click :guilabel:`URL` :icon:`fa-clipboard` to "
"copy the link to the clipboard, then share the link where appropriate."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`追蹤器網址`：定義:guilabel:`推廣活動`、:guilabel:`來"
"源`及:guilabel:`媒介`後，Odoo 會自動建立相應的追蹤連結。點擊:guilabel:`網址` "
":icon:`fa-clipboard`即可將連結複製到剪貼簿，然後在合適的地方分享連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:202
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email`: Once the :guilabel:`Campaign`, :guilabel:`Source`, and "
":guilabel:`Medium` are defined, Odoo automatically creates the corresponding"
" email. Click :guilabel:`Email` :icon:`fa-clipboard` to copy the email "
"address to the clipboard, then share the email where appropriate."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`電郵`：只要定義了:guilabel:`推廣活動`、:guilabel:`來"
"源`及:guilabel:`媒介`，Odoo 便會自動建立相應電郵。按一下:guilabel:`電郵` "
":icon:`fa-clipboard` 即可將電郵地址複製到剪貼簿，然後於適當位置分享該電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:207
msgid "The list of all tracked links for the job position."
msgstr "該職位的所有追蹤連結清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:211
msgid "Job boards tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:213
msgid ""
"The *Job Boards* tab is automatically populated as the job position is "
":ref:`shared on a job board <recruitment/post-job/boards>`. As each listing "
"is created, the information appears in this tab."
msgstr ""
"當職位:ref:`分享至招聘平台 <recruitment/post-job/boards>`時，*招聘平台*分頁會"
"自動填入資料。每建立一則招聘啟事，相關資訊就會顯示在此分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:217
msgid ":doc:`post_job`"
msgstr ":doc:`post_job`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Offer analysis"
msgstr "聘書分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Offer Analysis* report provides a high-level summary of job offers, "
"grouped by job position and status. This allows recruiters to view offer "
"activity across different job positions and track how many offers are in "
"each stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_analysis.rst:9
msgid ""
"Using the *Offer Analysis* report, recruiters can compare the number of open"
" positions with the number of offers made, identify positions with limited "
"offer activity, and monitor the progress of recruitment efforts. For "
"example, positions with fewer offers may indicate a need to adjust "
"recruitment strategies to attract more qualified applicants. By reviewing "
"offer data across positions and statuses, recruiters can identify potential "
"gaps in the hiring process and make more informed decisions to support "
"recruitment goals."
msgstr ""
"透過 *錄取通知分析* 報表，招聘人員可比較空缺職位數目與已發出的錄取通知數目、"
"識別錄取進度較少的職位，並監察招聘工作的進展。舉例而言，錄取通知較少的職位可"
"能表示需要調整招聘策略，以吸引更多合資格的應徵者。透過檢視不同職位及狀態的錄"
"取數據，招聘人員能識別招聘流程中的潛在缺口，並作出更明智的決策以支援招聘目標"
"。"

