#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_analysis.rst:54
msgid ""
"A large, growing company with hundreds of employees is constantly "
"recruiting. Due to the large number of roles they are continuously filling, "
"it can be difficult to keep track of all the job offers and where each offer"
" stands."
msgstr ""
"一間擁有數百名員工且不斷擴展的大型企業需要持續進行招聘。由於公司不斷填補大量"
"職位空缺，要追蹤所有工作錄取通知及其各自的最新進度可能會相當困難。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_analysis.rst:58
msgid ""
"To aid the team, the *Offer Analysis* report can be modified to show all "
"offers by state, instead of by job position. To view offers by state, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Reporting --> Offer "
"Analysis`. Click into the search bar and select the :guilabel:`Offer State` "
"option in the :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Group By` column. This provides a "
"high-level overview of where all offers stand."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_analysis.rst:64
msgid ""
"Click on a column to open a list view of all the offers in that particular "
"state. This is helpful when trying to finalize all open offers, or see how "
"many were refused or completed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_analysis.rst:67
msgid "All offers grouped by state."
msgstr "所有聘書按狀態分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:3
msgid "Offer job positions"
msgstr "提供職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:5
msgid ""
"After an applicant has successfully passed the various interview stages, the"
" recruitment team is ready to send an offer for employment. The first step "
"in this process is to :ref:`send the applicant a contract "
"<recruitment/offer_job_positions/contract-proposal>`. Once the contract is "
":ref:`fully signed <recruitment/offer_job_positions/contract-signed>`, the "
":ref:`new employee record is created <recruitment/offer_job_positions/new-"
"employee>`."
msgstr ""
"應徵者順利通過各個面試階段後，招聘團隊即可準備發出聘用通知。此流程的第一步"
"是:ref:`向應徵者發送合約 <recruitment/offer_job_positions/contract-proposal>"
"`。合約:ref:`完成簽署 <recruitment/offer_job_positions/contract-signed>`後，"
"系統便會:ref:`建立新員工記錄 <recruitment/offer_job_positions/new-employee>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:12
msgid ""
"The *Salary Configurator* module **must** be :ref:`installed "
"<general/install>` to send an offer using the :guilabel:`Generate Offer` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"您 **必須** :ref:`安裝 <general/install>` *薪酬設定工具* 模組，才可使用 "
":guilabel:`產生聘用方案` 按鈕發送聘用方案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:18
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:190
msgid "Contract proposal"
msgstr "合約提案"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:20
msgid ""
"When an offer is ready to be sent, first move the applicant to the "
":guilabel:`Contract Proposal` stage."
msgstr "準備好發送錄取通知時，請先將應徵者移至 :guilabel:`合約提案` 階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:23
msgid ""
"Navigate to the **Recruitment** app, click on the job position Kanban card, "
"then click the desired applicant card. Click the :guilabel:`Contract "
"Proposal` stage in the status bar at the top of the applicant's record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:27
msgid ""
"Next, send an offer to the applicant by clicking the :guilabel:`Generate "
"Offer` button. This loads the *Offer for (applicant)* page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:30
msgid ""
"Most fields are pre-populated with information from the job position. Update"
" or add any relevant information in the corresponding fields."
msgstr "大多數欄位已預先填入來自職位的資訊。請在相應欄位中更新或新增任何相關資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:34
msgid ""
"Depending on the localization setting for the company and which applications"
" are installed, some fields may differ or not appear on the *Offer for "
"(applicant)* page."
msgstr ""
"視乎公司的本地化設定及已安裝的應用程式，*為（申請人）提供的錄取通知* 頁面上的"
"部分欄位可能會有所不同或不予顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:38
msgid "Contract fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:40
msgid ""
"The following fields appear in the *Offer for (applicant)* page regardless "
"of the localization."
msgstr "無論採用何種本地化設定，以下欄位均會顯示於 *（申請人）錄用通知* 頁面中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Title`: The name for the contract appears in a default `Offer for"
" (applicant)` format."
msgstr ":guilabel:`標題`：合約名稱會以預設的 `Offer for (applicant)` 格式顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Template`: The template currently being used to populate"
" the *Offer for (applicant)* page. Use the drop-down menu to select a "
"different :guilabel:`Contract Template`, if desired."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`合約範本`：目前用於填寫 *給（應徵者）的聘書* 頁面的範本。如有需要"
"，可使用下拉式選單選擇其他 :guilabel:`合約範本`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:48
msgid ""
"To modify the template, hover over the current template name, click the "
":icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` icon that appears to the "
"right of the field, and make any desired changes."
msgstr ""
"若要修改範本，請將滑鼠游標移至目前範本名稱上方，點擊欄位右側顯示的 :icon:`fa-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`（內部連結）`圖示，然後進行所需更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PDF Template`: The PDF document the applicant must sign to accept"
" the offer."
msgstr ":guilabel:`PDF 範本`：求職者接受錄用時必須簽署的 PDF 文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:53
msgid ":guilabel:`Salary`: The salary being offered to the applicant."
msgstr ":guilabel:`薪金`：提供予應徵者的薪金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Title`: The selected :guilabel:`Employee Job` populates this "
"field by default. The title can be modified to suit the specific applicant's"
" position and provide more details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:58
msgid ""
"An applicant is offered a marketing manager job at a shoe company, "
"specifically for the children's line."
msgstr "一名應徵者獲一間鞋履公司聘任為市場推廣經理，專門負責童裝系列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:61
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Employee Job` selected from the drop-down menu is `Marketing "
"Manager`, and the :guilabel:`Job Title` is modified for their specific "
"responsibilities, `Marketing Manager: Children's Shoes`."
msgstr ""
"從下拉式選單選取的 :guilabel:`員工職位` 為 `市場經理`，而 :guilabel:`職稱` 則"
"根據其具體職責修改為 `市場經理：童鞋`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee Job`: The name of the :guilabel:`Job Title` being "
"offered to the applicant. The selections available in the drop-down menu "
"correspond to the configured :doc:`job positions <new_job>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`僱員職位`：提供予應徵者的:guilabel:`職稱`名稱。下拉式選單中可供選"
"擇的項目對應已配置的:doc:`職位 <new_job>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Department`: The department the job position falls under."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Date`: The date the proposed contract takes effect. The "
"default date is the current date. To modify the date, click on the displayed"
" date to reveal a calendar popover window. Navigate to the desired month, "
"then click the day to select it. If the contract has a specific end date, "
"enter the end date in the second field, next to the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
"icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Offer Create Date`: The day the offer is created. The current "
"date populates this field by default and **cannot** be modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`錄取通知建立日期`：建立錄取通知的日期。系統預設會自動填入當前日期"
"，且**不可**修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Offer Expiration`: The last day the offer is valid. After this "
"date the contract cannot be signed. Click into the field to reveal a "
"calendar popover window. Navigate to the desired date, and click on it to "
"select it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`聘書到期日`：聘書有效的最後一天。此日期過後便無法簽署合約。按一下"
"欄位即可顯示日曆彈出視窗。前往所需日期，然後按一下以選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Applicant`: The name of the applicant appears in this field and "
"**cannot** be modified. Click the name to view the detailed applicant form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: The name of the company offering the job position "
"appears in this field and **cannot** be modified. This only appears in a "
"multi-company database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：提供該職位的公司名稱會顯示在此欄位，且 **不可** 修改。此欄"
"位只會在多公司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Simulation Preview`: The various costs for the contract "
"appear in this box, including the :guilabel:`Gross`, :guilabel:`Net`, and "
":guilabel:`Benefits`, along with the total :guilabel:`Company Cost`. These "
"numbers are estimates and should be used for reference only."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`薪酬模擬預覽`：合約的各項成本會顯示於此方框內，包括 :guilabel:`總"
"薪金`、:guilabel:`淨薪金` 及 :guilabel:`福利`，以及總 :guilabel:`公司成本`。"
"這些數字僅為估算，只供參考。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:86
msgid "A contract with all the fields entered for a sales associate position."
msgstr "已填寫銷售專員職位所有欄位的合約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:90
msgid "Send offer"
msgstr "發送錄取通知"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:92
msgid ""
"Once all desired modifications have been made to the *Offer for (applicant)*"
" page, click the :guilabel:`Send By Email` button to reveal an email pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""
"在 *給（申請人）的錄用通知* 頁面上完成所有所需修改後，點擊 :guilabel:`以電郵"
"發送` 按鈕，即可顯示電郵彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:95
msgid ""
"The default `Recruitment: Your Salary Package` email template is used, and "
"the :guilabel:`To`, :guilabel:`Subject`, and email body are pre-populated "
"based on the email template."
msgstr ""
"系統會使用預設的 `招聘：您的薪酬方案` 電郵範本，而 :guilabel:`收件"
"人`、:guilabel:`主旨` 及電郵內文會根據該電郵範本預先填寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:98
msgid ""
"If any attachments need to be added, click the :icon:`fa-paperclip` "
":guilabel:`(Add Attachment)` button, and a file explorer window appears. "
"Navigate to the desired file, then click :guilabel:`Open` to attach it to "
"the email. The attachment loads and is listed at the bottom of the email "
"body."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:103
msgid ""
"Once the email is ready, click :guilabel:`Send`, and then the email pop-up "
"window closes. Return to the applicant's card, and an :icon:`fa-handshake-o`"
" :guilabel:`Offers` smart button appears at the top."
msgstr ""
"電郵準備就緒後，點擊:guilabel:`傳送`，電郵彈出視窗隨即關閉。返回申請人卡片時"
"，頂部會顯示:icon:`fa-handshake-o` :guilabel:`聘書`智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:108
msgid ""
"The **Sign** application must be installed for the applicant to digitally "
"sign the contract in Odoo. The applicant does **not** need any software "
"installed to sign the offer."
msgstr ""
"必須安裝 **簽署** 應用程式，應徵者才能在 Odoo 中數碼簽署合約。應徵者 **無"
"須** 安裝任何軟件即可簽署錄用通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:111
msgid "Send an email to the applicant with a link to the offered salary."
msgstr "向應徵者發送電郵，並附上薪酬待遇連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:117
msgid "Configure your package"
msgstr "設定您的方案"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:119
msgid ""
"If applicable, the applicant can modify their salary package. This option is"
" not available for all localizations. Depending on where the company is "
"located, this option may not be available."
msgstr ""
"如適用，申請人可修改其薪酬方案。此選項並非適用於所有本地化版本。視乎公司所在"
"地，此選項可能無法使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:122
msgid ""
"The email template includes a :guilabel:`Configure your package` button. "
"This link takes the applicant to a webpage where they can modify the "
"proposed salary package."
msgstr ""
"電郵範本包含 :guilabel:`配置您的薪酬方案` 按鈕。該連結會將應徵者帶往一個網頁"
"，讓他們修改建議的薪酬方案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:126
msgid "Applicant signature"
msgstr "申請人簽名"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:128
msgid ""
"On the offer page, which is linked in the offer email, the applicant enters "
"their contact information along with any personal information requested on "
"the form. The information entered is transferred to the employee's record "
"once created."
msgstr ""
"在錄取通知電郵所連結的錄取通知頁面上，應徵者需輸入其聯絡資料及表單要求的所有"
"個人資料。員工記錄建立後，已輸入的資料便會轉移至該員工記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:132
msgid ""
"The applicant clicks the :guilabel:`Review Contract & Sign` button to accept"
" the offer, and the contract loads. Click :guilabel:`Click to start` to "
"begin signing the document. All fields are populated according to the "
"applicant's information, but can be modified if necessary."
msgstr ""
"應徵者點擊 :guilabel:`檢視合約及簽署` 按鈕接受錄用通知後，合約便會載入。點擊 "
":guilabel:`點擊開始` 即可開始簽署文件。所有欄位均已根據應徵者的資料預先填入，"
"如有需要亦可修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:136
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Next` to navigate to the subsequent fields of the contract."
" Once all fields are configured, click :guilabel:`Sign it`, and an *Adopt "
"Your Signature* pop-up window loads. Modify the default signature if "
"desired, then click :guilabel:`Sign all` to apply the signature. Click "
":guilabel:`Next` once more to enter the :guilabel:`Date` in the "
"corresponding field. When done, click the :guilabel:`Validate & Send "
"Completed Document` button, and the contract is signed."
msgstr ""
"點按:guilabel:`下一步`以導航至合約的後續欄位。配置好所有欄位後，點"
"按:guilabel:`簽署`，隨即會載入*採用您的簽名*彈出視窗。如有需要，可修改預設簽"
"名，然後點按:guilabel:`全部簽署`以套用簽名。再次點按:guilabel:`下一步`，並在"
"相應欄位中輸入:guilabel:`日期`。完成後，點按:guilabel:`驗證並傳送已完成文"
"件`按鈕，合約即告簽署完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:143
msgid "Management signatures"
msgstr "管理層簽署"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:145
msgid ""
"Once the applicant has signed the contract, the next step is for the person "
"responsible within the company (the :guilabel:`HR Responsible`) must then "
"sign the contract."
msgstr ""
"申請人簽署合約後，下一步須由公司內的負責人（即 :guilabel:`人力資源負責人`）簽"
"署合約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:148
msgid ""
"The person responsible for signing the contract receives an activity alert "
"that their signature is requested of them in the **Sign** app."
msgstr "負責簽署合約的人員會在**電子簽署**應用程式中收到活動提示，通知其需要簽署。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:154
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:200
msgid "Contract signed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:156
msgid ""
"Once all parties have fully signed the contract, the applicant is "
"automatically moved to the :guilabel:`Contract Signed` stage, and a green "
":guilabel:`Hired` banner appears in the corner of both the applicant's card "
"and form."
msgstr ""
"所有相關方均已簽署合約後，應徵者會自動移至 :guilabel:`已簽署合約` 階段，且應"
"徵者的卡片及表單角落皆會顯示綠色的 :guilabel:`已聘用` 橫幅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:160
msgid "Hired banner in the corner of applicant card."
msgstr "應徵者卡片角落的「已錄用」橫額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:166
msgid "Create employee"
msgstr "建立員工"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:168
msgid ""
"Once the applicant has been hired, the next step is to create their employee"
" record. Click the :guilabel:`Create Employee` button in the corner of the "
"hired applicant's form."
msgstr ""
"聘用申請人後，下一步是建立其員工記錄。點擊已聘用申請人表單角落的 "
":guilabel:`建立員工` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:171
msgid ""
"An employee form loads with information pulled from the applicant's card and"
" the employee contract."
msgstr "員工表單載入時，會從應徵者卡片及員工合約擷取資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:173
msgid ""
"Fill out the rest of the employee form. For detailed information on the "
"fields, refer to the :doc:`../employees/new_employee` documentation."
msgstr ""
"填寫員工表單的其餘部分。有關欄位的詳細資料，請參閱 :doc:`../employees/"
"new_employee` 文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:176
msgid "Once completed, the employee record is saved in the **Employees** app."
msgstr "完成後，員工記錄會儲存在 **員工** 應用程式中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:3
msgid "Post job positions"
msgstr "發佈職位空缺"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:5
msgid ""
"After a job position has been :doc:`created and configured <new_job>`, the "
"next step is to share it so that prospective applicants can apply."
msgstr ""
"職位 :doc:`建立並設定 <new_job>` 後，下一步是將其分享，讓潛在應徵者可以提出申"
"請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:8
msgid ""
"Job positions can be shared on the :ref:`company website <recruitment/post-"
"job/website>` or on :ref:`job boards <recruitment/post-job/boards>`."
msgstr ""
"職位空缺可發佈於 :ref:`公司網站 <recruitment/post-job/website>` 或 :ref:`招聘"
"網站 <recruitment/post-job/boards>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:14
msgid "Publish to website"
msgstr "發佈至網站"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:16
msgid ""
"To publish a job listing on the company's website, first a setting must be "
"enabled in the **Recruitment** app. Navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and enable the :guilabel:`Online "
"Posting` option. Click the :guilabel:`Save` button after making any changes."
msgstr ""
"要在公司網站發佈職位空缺，必須先在 **招聘** 應用程式中啟用一項設定。前往 "
":menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並啟用 :guilabel:`網上發佈` "
"選項。作出任何更改後，請按一下 :guilabel:`儲存` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:22
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Online Posting` option is only available if the :doc:`Website"
" <../../websites/website>` application is also installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:25
msgid ""
"Once the setting has been enabled, open the main **Recruitment** dashboard "
"by navigating to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> By Job"
" Positions`. Next, click the :guilabel:`Job Page` button, then click the "
":guilabel:`Unpublished` toggle in the upper-right corner. The toggle becomes"
" green and displays :guilabel:`Published`. Return to the main dashboard by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> By Job "
"Positions`."
msgstr ""
"啟用此設定後，前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 應徵申請 --> 按職位` 以開"
"啟主 **招聘** 儀表板。接著，點擊 :guilabel:`職位頁面` 按鈕，然後點擊右上角的 "
":guilabel:`未發佈` 切換開關。該開關會變為綠色並顯示 :guilabel:`已發佈`。最後"
"，前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 應徵申請 --> 按職位` 以返回主儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:31
msgid ""
"When a job position is published, a green :guilabel:`Published` banner "
"appears in the top-right corner of the job position card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:35
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click the :guilabel:`Configure` button on a job position "
"card, then click the :guilabel:`Published` toggle in the *Job Posting* "
"section of the *Details* tab."
msgstr ""
"或者，按一下職位卡片上的 :guilabel:`設定` 按鈕，然後按一下 *詳細資料* 分頁 "
"*職位發佈* 部分的 :guilabel:`已發佈` 切換開關。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:41
msgid "Post on job boards"
msgstr "發佈至招聘網站"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:43
msgid ""
"Posting a job on a job board is an effective way to reach a wider audience "
"and attract more candidates."
msgstr "在招聘網站發佈職位空缺，是接觸更多求職者並吸引更多應徵者的有效方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:47
msgid ""
"Currently, Odoo only supports directly posting to Monster.com. Check back "
"frequently for more updates, as more job boards are added."
msgstr ""
"目前，Odoo 僅支援直接發佈至 Monster.com。請經常回來查看最新消息，我們將會陸續"
"加入更多招聘網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:51
msgid "Job board credentials"
msgstr "招聘平台憑證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:53
msgid ""
"To publish a job listing onto a job board outside of Odoo, the job board "
"credentials must be configured first. Navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the "
"*Monster Credentials* section, enter the :guilabel:`Username` and "
":guilabel:`Password` for Monster in the corresponding fields, then click the"
" :guilabel:`Save` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:59
msgid ""
"When installing the **Recruitment** app, the following modules are "
"automatically installed: *Job Board - Monster.com*, *Job Board - Monster.com"
" (Skills)*, and *Job Board - Monster.com (Website)*. If any of these modules"
" are *not* installed, :doc:`install them <../../general/apps_modules>` from "
"the main **Apps** app."
msgstr ""
"安裝 **招聘** 應用程式時，系統會自動安裝以下模組：*求職網站 - "
"Monster.com*、*求職網站 - Monster.com（技能）* 及 *求職網站 - Monster.com（網"
"站）*。如果其中任何模組 *未* 安裝，請從主要的 **應用程式** 中 :doc:`將其安裝 "
"<../../general/apps_modules>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:65
msgid "Publish on job board"
msgstr "發佈至招聘網站"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:67
msgid ""
"Once the credentials have been configured for the job board, it is possible "
"to post a job position."
msgstr "為求職平台配置憑證後，即可發佈職位空缺。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:69
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> Job Boards "
"Posts`, click :guilabel:`Publish on Jobs Board`, and a *Publish on a Job "
"Board* pop-up window loads. Fill out the following information in the pop-up"
" window:"
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 應徵申請 --> 招聘網站帖文` ，點擊 "
":guilabel:`在招聘網站發佈` ，隨即載入 *在招聘網站發佈* 彈出視窗。請在彈出視窗"
"中填寫以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job`: Select the job position being shared using the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`職位`：使用下拉式選單選擇要分享的職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Industry`: Select the relevant industry the job position falls "
"under with the drop-down menu. This field corresponds to industries on the "
"job board, and can aid applicants searching for positions within a specific "
"industry."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`行業`：在下拉式選單中選擇該職位所屬的相關行業。此欄位對應求職版上"
"的行業分類，可協助求職者搜尋特定行業的職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Board`: Select the job board being posted to with the drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`招聘平台`：使用下拉式選單選擇要發佈職位的招聘平台。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Apply Method`: Click the desired radio button to determine how "
"applicants apply for the position. The two options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`應徵方式`：點擊所需的單選按鈕，以決定應徵者如何申請該職位。兩個選"
"項分別為："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send an Email`: Select this for applicants to apply for the job "
"via email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Redirect to company's website`: Select this for applicants to "
"apply for the job via the company website."
msgstr ":guilabel:`重新導向至公司網站`：選擇此項可讓求職者透過公司網站應徵職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email` or :guilabel:`Job url`: The selected :guilabel:`Apply "
"Method` determines which field appears. The field is populated with the "
"information from the job card, if available. Make any desired modifications "
"to this field, for example, enter a tracking URL for the job board listing."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`電郵` 或 :guilabel:`職位網址`：顯示哪一個欄位取決於所選的 "
":guilabel:`應徵方式`。如職位卡中有相關資料，系統會自動填入此欄位。如有需要，"
"可修改此欄位內容，例如為招聘網站的職位發佈輸入追蹤網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`to`: Using the calendar selector, select the"
" date the job is posted to the job board in the :guilabel:`From` field. The "
":guilabel:`to` field says :guilabel:`No Limit` by default. If the job "
"position should be removed from the job board on a specific date, enter it "
"in the second field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`由` 及 :guilabel:`至`：使用日曆選擇器，在 :guilabel:`由` 欄位中選"
"擇職位發佈至招聘看板的日期。:guilabel:`至` 欄位預設顯示 :guilabel:`無限制`。"
"如須於特定日期將該職位從招聘看板移除，請在第二個欄位中輸入該日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mission Dates`: If there is a set start date for the job "
"position, select the date using the calendar selector. When configured, if "
"the applicant is hired for the job position, their availability on the job "
"board is updated to reflect they are no longer available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`任務日期`：如果職位已設定開始日期，請使用日曆選擇器選取該日期。設"
"定後，若應徵者獲聘該職位，其在職位看板上的可用狀態將會更新，顯示其已不再可用"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description` tab: The description from the job card populates "
"this tab by default. Make any desired changes to it in this section. This is"
" what appears on the job board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:100
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Generate Description` (:icon:`fa-magic` :guilabel:`AI`)"
" to use AI to edit or create the job description."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`生成描述`（:icon:`fa-magic` :guilabel:`AI`），即可使用 AI 編"
"輯或建立職位描述。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:103
msgid ""
"Once the listing is ready, click the :guilabel:`Post` button. After the post"
" has been published to a job board, the *Job Boards Posts* page reloads, and"
" the new post appears in a Kanban card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:106
msgid "A job board listing form filled out."
msgstr "已填妥的招聘網站刊登表格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:110
msgid "Job board emails"
msgstr "招聘網站電郵"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:112
msgid ""
"When posting job positions on a job board, like Indeed or LinkedIn, the job "
"board posts the job position, and typically allows the website visitor to "
"apply to the job directly from the job board."
msgstr ""
"在 Indeed 或 LinkedIn 等求職平台發佈職位空缺時，該求職平台會刊登該職位，並通"
"常允許網站訪客直接從該求職平台申請該職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:115
msgid ""
"When someone applies to a job directly from a job board, an email is sent to"
" Odoo from a specific email address, such as `jobs-listings@linkedin.com`. "
"The email uses regular expression (regex) rules, which are instructions to "
"match text in the email and map it to specific fields in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"當有人直接從招聘網站應徵職位時，系統會從特定電郵地址（例如 `jobs-"
"listings@linkedin.com`）向 Odoo 發送電郵。該電郵會使用正規表達式（regex）規則"
"，這些規則是用於配對電郵中的文字並將其對應至 Odoo 中特定欄位的指示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:119
msgid ""
"When Odoo receives an email from the job board's corresponding email "
"address, it runs the regex rule and pulls applicant information from the "
"email when creating an applicant record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:123
msgid ""
"The regex rule for :guilabel:`LinkedIn` (emails received from: `jobs-"
"listings@linkedin.com`) is :guilabel:`New application:.*from (.*)`. This "
"rule tells Odoo to capture everything after the word `from` when creating "
"the applicant record."
msgstr ""
"針對 :guilabel:`LinkedIn`（收件自 `jobs-listings@linkedin.com` 的電郵）的正規"
"表達式規則為 :guilabel:`New application:.*from (.*)`。此規則會指示 Odoo 在建"
"立應徵者記錄時，擷取 `from` 一詞之後的所有內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:127
msgid ""
"An email subject of `New application: Job ID 123 from John Doe` will capture"
" `John Doe` and create an applicant record for `John Doe`."
msgstr ""
"如果電郵主旨為 `New application: Job ID 123 from John Doe`，系統會擷取 `John "
"Doe`，並為 `John Doe` 建立應徵者記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:130
msgid ""
"To view the currently configured job board emails, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Configuration --> Emails`. Three emails "
"come preconfigured in the database: :guilabel:`LinkedIn`, "
":guilabel:`Jobsdb`, and :guilabel:`Indeed`."
msgstr ""
"要查看目前已設定的招聘網站電郵地址，請前往:menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 配"
"置 --> 電郵`。資料庫已預先設定三個電郵地址"
"：:guilabel:`LinkedIn`、:guilabel:`Jobsdb`及:guilabel:`Indeed`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:135
msgid "Create job board emails"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:137
msgid ""
"To create a new job board email, navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment app"
" --> Configuration --> Emails`. Click the :guilabel:`New` button, and a "
"blank *Emails* form loads."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的招聘網站電郵，請前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 設定 --> 電"
"郵`。點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系統隨即載入空白的 *電郵* 表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:140
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Name` for the platform, such as `Glassdoor`, in the "
"corresponding field. Next, enter the email address the applications come "
"from in the :guilabel:`Email` field. Last, enter the :guilabel:`regex` rules"
" in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"在相應欄位中輸入平台的 :guilabel:`名稱`，例如 `Glassdoor`。接著，在 "
":guilabel:`電郵` 欄位中輸入應徵申請來源的電郵地址。最後，在相應欄位中輸入 "
":guilabel:`正則表達式` 規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:145
msgid "View job board listings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:147
msgid ""
"To view all the job positions that have been posted to a job board, navigate"
" to :menuselection:`Recruitment --> Applications --> Job Boards Posts`. This"
" presents the :guilabel:`Job Boards Posts` dashboard and all job board "
"postings."
msgstr ""
"若要檢視所有已發佈至招聘平台的職位，請前往 :menuselection:`招聘 --> 申請 --> "
"招聘平台帖文`。系統隨即會顯示 :guilabel:`招聘平台帖文` 儀表板及所有招聘平台發"
"佈的帖文。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:151
msgid ""
"Each listing is displayed in an individual Kanban card, with the following "
"information:"
msgstr "每個項目均會顯示於獨立的看板卡片中，並包含以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Board Icon`: The icon for the job board where the listing is "
"posted."
msgstr ":guilabel:`招聘網站圖示`：發佈職位空缺的招聘網站圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Board Listing Title`: The job position title and job board "
"name."
msgstr ":guilabel:`招聘平台職位標題`：職位名稱及招聘平台名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:155
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status Dot`: The status of the post. A green dot indicates the "
"post is live, a blue dot indicates it is scheduled to be published in the "
"future, and a red dot indicates there is an issue with the post and the "
"posting failed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`狀態圓點`：帖文的狀態。綠點表示帖文已發佈；藍點表示已排程於日後發"
"佈；紅點表示帖文出現問題，發佈失敗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:158
msgid ":guilabel:`From`: The date the listing was published."
msgstr ":guilabel:`由`：項目發佈的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:159
msgid ":guilabel:`To`: The date the listing is removed from the job board."
msgstr ":guilabel:`至`：職位發佈從招聘網站下架的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:160
msgid ":guilabel:`User Icon`: The icon of the user who posted the listing."
msgstr ":guilabel:`用戶圖示`：發佈該列表的用戶圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:162
msgid ""
"Click on any Kanban card to view the details for the specific job board "
"listing."
msgstr "點擊任何看板卡片，即可查看該職位招聘啟事的詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:164
msgid "All job positions posted to a job board."
msgstr "所有發佈至招聘網站的職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:3
msgid "Recruitment flow"
msgstr "招聘流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:5
msgid ""
"When a prospective employee applies for a job in Odoo, there is a "
"preconfigured process from the :ref:`initial inquiry "
"<recruitment/recruitment_flow/new>` to the :ref:`creation of a new employee "
"<recruitment/offer_job_positions/new-employee>` once hired. The following "
"outlines the default recruitment process for Odoo's **Recruitment** "
"application."
msgstr ""
"當準員工在 Odoo 中申請職位時，系統已預先配置一套流程，涵蓋由 :ref:`初步查詢 "
"<recruitment/recruitment_flow/new>` 至獲聘後 :ref:`建立新員工 <recruitment/"
"offer_job_positions/new-employee>` 的各個步驟。以下概述 Odoo **招聘** 應用程"
"式的預設招聘流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:11
msgid ""
"The following is based on Odoo's *default* recruitment pipeline. Be advised "
"that if :ref:`modifications are made <recruitment/customize-stages>` to the "
"pipeline, the process differs."
msgstr ""
"以下內容基於 Odoo 的 *預設* 招聘流程。請注意，如對該流程 :ref:`作出修改 "
"<recruitment/customize-stages>`，程序將會有所不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:20
msgid ""
"At the start of the process, all applicants appear in the :guilabel:`New` "
"stage on the *Applications* page, whether they submitted through the company"
" website, emailed a resumé to the email alias, or were :doc:`manually added "
"by a recruiter <add_applicants>`."
msgstr ""
"在流程開始時，所有應徵者都會顯示於*申請*頁面的:guilabel:`新增`階段，無論他們"
"是透過公司網站遞交申請、將履歷電郵至電郵別名，還是:doc:`由招聘人員手動新增 "
"<add_applicants>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:24
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Applicant`, :guilabel:`Email`, and :guilabel:`Phone` number "
"on the applicant's card are filled as soon as it is created. By default, "
"these details are required for every job position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:28
msgid ""
"If the website application form is modified, different fields may be "
"populated, based on what information is required on the website."
msgstr "如果網站申請表單有所修改，系統可能會根據網站所需的資料，填入不同的欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:31
msgid ""
"Anything typed in the *Short Introduction* section appears in the "
"applicant's chatter as a note from :guilabel:`OdooBot`, labeled *Other "
"Information*."
msgstr ""
"在 *簡短介紹* 部分輸入的任何內容，都會在申請人的動態記錄中顯示為來自 "
":guilabel:`OdooBot` 的備註，並標示為 *其他資料*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:37
msgid ""
"If a resumé was attached to the online application, it appears in the "
"*Files* section of the chatter, and is also stored in the **Documents** "
"application."
msgstr ""
"如網上申請表附有履歷表，該履歷表會顯示於通訊欄的 *檔案* 區段，並同時儲存於 "
"**文件** 應用程式中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:40
msgid ""
"To find the recruitment documents, navigate to the main "
":menuselection:`Documents` app dashboard, and click the "
":guilabel:`Recruitment` folder on the side. All recruitment documents are "
"stored within that folder."
msgstr ""
"要尋找招聘文件，請前往 :menuselection:`文件` 應用程式主儀表板，然後按一下側邊"
"的 :guilabel:`招聘` 資料夾。所有招聘文件均儲存在該資料夾內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:45
msgid ""
"Depending on the browser zoom level, or size of the browser screen, the "
"resumé may appear below the main applicant card information as a PDF link, "
"or on the right side as an image."
msgstr ""
"視乎瀏覽器的縮放比例或螢幕大小，履歷可能會以 PDF 連結形式顯示在主要應徵者卡片"
"資料下方，或以圖片形式顯示在右側。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:49
msgid "Send interview"
msgstr "發送面試"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:51
msgid ""
"At any point in the hiring process, an interview can be sent to the "
"applicant to obtain more information. These interviews are custom-made, and "
"can be formatted in a variety of ways."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:54
msgid ""
"The **Surveys** application is required to send interviews to an applicant, "
"so it **must** be installed."
msgstr ""
"向應徵者發送面試問卷需要使用 **問卷調查** 應用程式，因此 **必須** 安裝該應用"
"程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:57
msgid ""
"Odoo uses the term *interview*, but these can be thought of as "
"questionnaires, surveys, tests, certifications, etc. :doc:`Custom interviews"
" <new_job>` can be formatted to suit each individual job position's needs."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 使用 *面試* 一詞，但這些項目亦可視為問卷、調查、測試、認證等。:doc:`自訂"
"面試 <new_job>` 可根據每個職位的需求調整格式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:62
msgid ""
"A job position for a computer programmer could have an interview in the form"
" of a programming quiz to determine the skill level of the applicant. A job "
"position for a restaurant server could have a questionnaire inquiring about "
"the applicant's availability, if the desired applicant needs to be available"
" on weekend evenings."
msgstr ""
"電腦程式員職位可採用編程測驗形式的面試，以評估申請人的技能水平。至於餐廳侍應"
"職位，若要求申請人於週末晚上當值，則可設有問卷查詢其可上班時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:67
msgid ""
"To send an interview to an applicant, first open the applicant's card from "
"the *Applications* page to view the detailed applicant information. In the "
"top corner of the applicant's card, click the :guilabel:`Send Interview` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"如要向應徵者發送面試邀請，請先從 *應徵申請* 頁面開啟該應徵者的卡片，以檢視詳"
"細的應徵者資料。在應徵者卡片的頂部角落，按一下 :guilabel:`發送面試` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:71
msgid ""
"If the applicant's card has an email address on file, a *Send an interview* "
"pop-up window appears, with the :guilabel:`Recipients`, :guilabel:`Subject`,"
" and email body populated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:75
msgid ""
"To send an email to an applicant, there **must** be an :guilabel:`Email` "
"address on the applicant's card."
msgstr "要向應徵者發送電郵，應徵者卡片上**必須**設有:guilabel:`電郵`地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:78
msgid ""
"If an email address is missing on the applicant's card, when the "
":guilabel:`Send Interview` button is clicked and the *Send an interview* "
"pop-up window loads, a second pop-up window appears under the "
":guilabel:`Recipients` field. This pop-up window displays `What's the email "
"address of (applicant name)?` along with a field to enter the email address."
" Once entered, click :guilabel:`Set Email`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:84
msgid ""
"The email address entered is only used to send the interview, and does "
"**not** appear on the applicant's card."
msgstr "所輸入的電郵地址僅用於發送面試邀請，**不會** 顯示在應徵者的卡片上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:87
msgid ""
"Sometimes, preconfigured :doc:`email templates "
"<../../general/companies/email_template>` in Odoo use dynamic placeholders, "
"which are automatically filled with specific data when the email is sent. "
"For example, if a placeholder for the applicant's name is used, it is "
"replaced with the actual name of the applicant in the email."
msgstr ""
"有時，Odoo 中預先設定的 :doc:`電郵範本 <../../general/companies/"
"email_template>` 會使用動態預留位置，並在發送電郵時自動填入特定資料。例如，如"
"使用了申請人姓名的預留位置，電郵發送時便會將其替換為申請人的實際姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:92
msgid ""
"Add the email addresses of any additional recipients for the survey in the "
":guilabel:`Additional emails` field, if more people should receive the "
"email. If an email address is in the database as a contact, add that contact"
" in the :guilabel:`Recipients` field. If an email should be sent to someone "
"who is *not* in the database, and they should *not* be added as a contact, "
"add their email address in the :guilabel:`Additional emails` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:98
msgid ""
"If any attachments need to be added, click the :icon:`fa-paperclip` "
":guilabel:`Attachments` button, and a file explorer window appears. Navigate"
" to the desired file, and click :guilabel:`Open` to attach it to the email. "
"The attachment loads, and is listed above the :icon:`fa-paperclip` "
":guilabel:`Attachments` button."
msgstr ""
"如需新增任何附件，請按一下 :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`附件` 按鈕，系統隨"
"即會顯示檔案總管視窗。瀏覽並選擇所需檔案，然後按一下 :guilabel:`開啟` 將其附"
"加至電子郵件。附件載入後，便會顯示在 :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`附件` 按"
"鈕上方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:103
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Answer deadline` field specifies when the interview form must"
" be completed by, and is populated with a date and time two weeks in the "
"future. To modify this, click on the displayed date and time, navigate to "
"the desired date and click the date to select it. Next, select the time the "
"interview is due by clicking into the displayed time, and clicking the "
"desired new deadline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:108
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Mail Template` field is pre-populated based on the "
"configuration for the interview. A different template can be chosen from the"
" drop-down menu, if desired. If a new template is selected, the new email "
"template loads in the email body."
msgstr ""
"系統會根據面試設定預先填寫 :guilabel:`電郵範本` 欄位。如有需要，可從下拉式選"
"單選擇其他範本。若選取新範本，電郵內文會載入該新電郵範本的內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:112
msgid ""
"To send the email with the interview link to the applicant, click "
":guilabel:`Send` at the bottom of the *Send an interview* pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"若要將附有面試連結的電郵傳送給應徵者，請按一下*傳送面試*彈出視窗底部"
"的:guilabel:`傳送`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:122
msgid "Qualification"
msgstr "資歷"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:124
msgid ""
"If an applicant is determined to be a good potential candidate, they are "
"moved to the :guilabel:`Qualification` stage."
msgstr "如果應徵者被認定為具潛力的合適人選，便會移至 :guilabel:`資格審查` 階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:127
msgid ""
"This stage exists to sort candidates that have potential from those that do "
"not meet the requirements. No automatic actions, such as emails, are set for"
" this stage. This stage informs the recruitment team to potentially set up a"
" phone call or an interview with the candidate."
msgstr ""
"此階段旨在將具潛力的應徵者與不符合要求的應徵者區分開來。此階段未設定任何自動"
"操作（例如發送電郵）。此階段會通知招聘團隊，考慮安排與應徵者進行電話溝通或面"
"試。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:132
msgid ""
"In order to move an applicant's card from one stage to another, the "
"applicant's card can either be dragged and dropped in the Kanban view of the"
" *Applications* page to the desired stage, or the stage can be modified on "
"the applicant's card."
msgstr ""
"要將應徵者卡片從一個階段移至另一個階段，你可以在 *申請* 頁面的看板檢視中將應"
"徵者卡片拖放至目標階段，或直接在應徵者卡片上修改階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:136
msgid ""
"To change the stage on the applicant's card, first click the desired "
"applicant's card from the *Applications* page. The current stage for the "
"card is highlighted at the top on a status bar, above the card."
msgstr ""
"如要更改應徵者卡片上的階段，請先在 *應徵申請* 頁面中點擊所需的應徵者卡片。卡"
"片目前的階段會於卡片上方的狀態列中反白顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:140
msgid ""
"Click the desired stage for the card, and the stage changes. A log note "
"indicating the stage change appears in the chatter, as well."
msgstr ""
"點擊卡片所需的階段，階段便會隨之變更。通訊欄中亦會出現一則註明階段變更的記錄"
"備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:143
msgid ""
"Change the stage of an applicant by clicking on the desired stage at the top of the\n"
"applicant's card."
msgstr ""
"按一下應徵者卡片頂部的所需階段，即可更改\n"
"應徵者的階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:150
msgid "First interview"
msgstr "首次面試"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:152
msgid ""
"After an applicant has passed the :guilabel:`Qualification` stage, they can "
"be manually moved to the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage on the "
"*Applications* page, while in Kanban view."
msgstr ""
"應徵者通過 :guilabel:`資格審查` 階段後，你可在看板檢視的 *應徵申請* 頁面中，"
"手動將其移至 :guilabel:`首次面試` 階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:155
msgid ""
"To move the applicant to the next stage, drag and drop the applicant's card "
"to the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage."
msgstr "要將應徵者移至下一階段，請將應徵者卡片拖放至 :guilabel:`第一次面試` 階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:158
msgid ""
"Alternatively, open the desired applicant's card from the *Applications* "
"page, and click the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage on the status bar at "
"the top of the individual applicant's card."
msgstr ""
"或者，在 *申請* 頁面打開所需應徵者的資料卡，然後點擊個別應徵者資料卡頂部狀態"
"列上的 :guilabel:`初次面試` 階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:162
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`First Interview` stage can be modified, so when the "
"applicant's card moves to the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage, an email "
"can be automatically sent to the applicant, stating an interview is "
"requested. In this preconfigured email template, a link to the recruiting "
"team's calendar appears, allowing the applicant to schedule their interview."
msgstr ""
"可以修改:guilabel:`首次面試`階段，當應徵者卡片移至:guilabel:`首次面試`階段時"
"，系統便會自動向應徵者發送電郵要求進行面試。這份預先設定的電郵範本會顯示招聘"
"團隊日曆的連結，讓應徵者自行預約面試。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:167
msgid ""
":ref:`Edit <recruitment/edit-stage>` the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage, "
"and select the :guilabel:`Recruitment: Schedule Interview` option in the "
":guilabel:`Email Template` field to automate this action."
msgstr ""
":ref:`編輯 <recruitment/edit-stage>` :guilabel:`首次面試` 階段，並選擇 "
":guilabel:`招聘：安排面試` 作為 :guilabel:`電郵範本` 欄位的選項，即可自動執行"
"此操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:174
msgid "Second interview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:176
msgid ""
"After an applicant has passed the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage, they "
"can be moved to the :guilabel:`Second Interview` stage. To move the "
"applicant to the next stage, drag and drop the applicant's card to the "
":guilabel:`Second Interview` stage from the Kanban view of the "
"*Applications* page, or click on the :guilabel:`Second Interview` stage at "
"the top of the individual applicant's card."
msgstr ""
"應徵者通過 :guilabel:`第一次面試` 階段後，可移至 :guilabel:`第二次面試` 階段"
"。要將應徵者移至下一階段，可在 *申請* 頁面的看板檢視中將應徵者卡片拖放至 "
":guilabel:`第二次面試` 階段，或在個別應徵者卡片頂部點擊 :guilabel:`第二次面"
"試` 階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:182
msgid ""
"When the applicant's card moves to the :guilabel:`Second Interview` stage, "
"there are no automatic activities or emails configured for this stage, by "
"default. The recruiter can now :ref:`schedule a second interview "
"<recruitment/schedule_interviews/recruitment-scheduled>` with the applicant,"
" following the same process as the first interview."
msgstr ""
"當應徵者的卡片移至 :guilabel:`第二輪面試` 階段時，此階段預設未配置任何自動活"
"動或電郵。招聘人員現在可按照與第一次面試相同的流程，為應徵者 :ref:`安排第二次"
"面試 <recruitment/schedule_interviews/recruitment-scheduled>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:192
msgid ""
"After the applicant has completed the various interview processes, the next "
"step is to :doc:`send the job offer <offer_job_positions>`."
msgstr ""
"應徵者完成各項面試流程後，下一步便是:doc:`發出錄用通知 <offer_job_positions>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:195
msgid ""
"Once the offer has been sent, drag and drop the applicant's card to the "
":guilabel:`Contract Proposal` stage from the Kanban view of the "
"*Applications* page, or click on the :guilabel:`Contract Proposal` stage at "
"the top of the individual applicant's card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:202
msgid ""
"Once the contract has been fully signed by all parties, and the applicant "
"has been hired, the applicant's card moves to the :guilabel:`Contract "
"Signed` stage."
msgstr ""
"當合約由各方正式簽署並錄用應徵者後，應徵者的卡片便會移至 :guilabel:`已簽署合"
"約` 階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:205
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Contract Signed` is folded by default on the *Applications* "
"page, and must be expanded before the applicant's card can be manually "
"moved. Click the :icon:`fa-caret-left` :icon:`fa-caret-right` "
":guilabel:`(Unfold)` icon above the :guilabel:`Contract Signed` stage, and "
"the stage expands. Next, drag and drop the applicant's card to the "
":guilabel:`Contract Signed` stage from the Kanban view, or click the "
":guilabel:`Contract Signed` stage at the top of the individual applicant's "
"card."
msgstr ""
"在 *應徵申請* 頁面上，:guilabel:`已簽署合約` 預設為摺疊，必須先展開才可手動移"
"動應徵者卡片。點擊 :icon:`fa-caret-left` :icon:`fa-caret-right` :guilabel:`（"
"展開）` 圖示（位於 :guilabel:`已簽署合約` 階段上方），即可展開該階段。接著，"
"在看板檢視中將應徵者卡片拖放至 :guilabel:`已簽署合約` 階段，或在個別應徵者卡"
"片頂部點擊 :guilabel:`已簽署合約` 階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:215
msgid ""
"At any point in the recruitment process, a candidate can be :doc:`refused "
"<refuse_applicant>`."
msgstr "在招聘流程的任何階段，都可以 :doc:`拒絕 <refuse_applicant>` 候選人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:3
msgid "Refuse applicants"
msgstr "拒絕申請人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:5
msgid ""
"At any point in the recruitment process, an applicant can be refused for a "
"job position."
msgstr "在招聘流程的任何階段，均可拒絕應徵者申請該職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:7
msgid ""
"To refuse an applicant, start by navigating to the applicant's card in the "
"**Recruitment** app. This is done in one of two ways:"
msgstr ""
"如要拒絕申請人，請先前往**招聘**應用程式中的申請人卡片。您可透過以下兩種方式"
"之一操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:10
msgid ""
"Open the main *Job Positions* dashboard by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> By Job Positions`. "
"Next, click on the desired job position card, then click on the individual "
"applicant card from the *Applications* page."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 應徵申請 --> 按職位`，以開啟主 *職位* "
"儀表板。接著，點擊所需的職位卡片，然後在 *應徵申請* 頁面點擊個別應徵者卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:13
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> All "
"Applications`. In the :guilabel:`Applications` list, click anywhere on the "
"desired applicant's line to open that specific applicant's card."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`招募應用程式 --> 申請 --> 所有申請`。在 :guilabel:`申"
"請` 清單中，按一下所需應徵者資料列的任何位置，即可開啟該應徵者的卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:17
msgid ""
"At the top of the applicant's card, there are several buttons. Click the one"
" labeled :guilabel:`Refuse`."
msgstr "求職者卡片頂部有多個按鈕，請按一下標示為:guilabel:`拒絕`的按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:23
msgid "Refuse reasons"
msgstr "拒絕原因"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:25
msgid ""
"*Refuse reasons* allow recruiters to document why an applicant was not a "
"good fit, and send specific refusal reason email templates to the applicant."
msgstr ""
"*拒絕原因* 讓招聘人員記錄應徵者不合適的原因，並向應徵者發送相應的拒絕原因電郵"
"範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:28
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Refuse` on an applicant's form makes the *Refuse Reason*"
" pop-up window appear."
msgstr "在申請人表單上點擊 :guilabel:`拒絕`，會顯示 *拒絕原因* 彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:30
msgid ""
"The default refuse reasons in Odoo, and their corresponding :ref:`refusal "
"email <recruitment/refuse_applicant/send-refusal-email>` templates, are:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo 中的預設拒絕原因及其對應的 :ref:`拒絕電郵 <recruitment/refuse_applicant/"
"send-refusal-email>` 範本如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:37
msgid "Email Template"
msgstr "電郵範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:38
msgid "Refusal Reason"
msgstr "拒絕原因"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:39
msgid ":guilabel:`Recruitment: Refuse`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`招聘：拒絕`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Does not fit the job requirements`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`不符合職位要求`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Job already fulfilled`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`職位已填補`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Duplicate`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`複製`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Spam`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`垃圾郵件`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:44
msgid ":guilabel:`Recruitment: Not interested anymore`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`招聘：不再感興趣`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Refused by applicant: job fit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`申請人拒絕：職位匹配度`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Refused by applicant: salary`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`應徵者拒絕：薪酬`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:48
msgid ""
"Additional refusal reasons :ref:`can be created, and existing ones can be "
"modified (or deleted) <recruitment/refuse_applicant/new-refuse>`."
msgstr ""
"額外的拒絕原因 :ref:`可以建立，現有原因亦可修改（或刪除） <recruitment/"
"refuse_applicant/new-refuse>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:54
msgid "Create or modify refuse reasons"
msgstr "建立或修改拒絕原因"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:56
msgid ""
"To view and configure refuse reasons, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Configuration --> Refuse Reasons`. Doing"
" so reveals the *Refuse Reasons* page, where all the existing refusal "
"reasons are listed."
msgstr ""
"要查看及配置拒絕原因，請前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 配置 --> 拒絕原"
"因`。這會開啟 *拒絕原因* 頁面，當中列出所有現有的拒絕原因。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:60
msgid ""
"To create a new refuse reason from the *Refuse Reasons* page, click the "
":guilabel:`New` button. A blank line appears at the bottom of the list, with"
" an empty field present in the :guilabel:`Description` column."
msgstr ""
"如要在 *拒絕原因* 頁面建立新的拒絕原因，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕。清單底"
"部隨即會出現一列空白行，當中 :guilabel:`描述` 欄會顯示空白欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:64
msgid ""
"Type in the new refuse reason in the field. It is recommended to enter a "
"reason that is short and concise, such as `Offer expired` or `Withdrew "
"application`."
msgstr ""
"在欄位中輸入新的拒絕原因。建議輸入簡短清晰的原因，例如 `錄用通知已過期` 或 "
"`撤回申請`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:67
msgid ""
"Then, click in the :guilabel:`Email Template` field to reveal a drop-down "
"menu. Select the desired email template from the list to be used when the "
"new refuse reason is selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:70
msgid ""
"If a new email template is desired, type in the name for the new template in"
" the field. Then, click :guilabel:`Create and edit...`, and a *Create Email "
"Template* pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"如需建立新電郵範本，請在欄位中輸入新範本名稱。然後按一下 :guilabel:`建立並編"
"輯...`，隨即會出現 *建立電郵範本* 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:73
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Template Name` field is populated with the name entered in "
"the :guilabel:`Email Template` column by default, but can be modified if "
"desired. Enter the email :guilabel:`Subject` in the corresponding field, and"
" add the email content in the *Body* tab. To include attachments, click the "
"*Options* tab, and add the attachment using the :icon:`fa-paperclip` "
":guilabel:`Attachments` button. To assign an :guilabel:`Owner` for the "
"template, select a user in the drop-down menu. Enter a :guilabel:`Template "
"Description` in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，:guilabel:`範本名稱` 欄位會自動填入在 :guilabel:`電郵範本` 欄輸入"
"的名稱，但如有需要亦可修改。在相應欄位輸入電郵 :guilabel:`主旨`，並在 *內文* "
"分頁新增電郵內容。若要加入附件，請按一下 *選項* 分頁，然後使用 :icon:`fa-"
"paperclip` :guilabel:`附件` 按鈕新增附件。若要為範本指派 :guilabel:`擁有者`，"
"請在下拉式選單中選擇使用者。在相應欄位輸入 :guilabel:`範本描述`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:80
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save`, and Odoo returns to the *Refuse Reasons* list."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`，Odoo 便會返回 *拒絕原因* 清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:82
msgid ""
"The new template appears in the new refuse reason :guilabel:`Email Template`"
" field."
msgstr "新範本會顯示在新的拒絕原因 :guilabel:`電郵範本` 欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:85
msgid ""
"Pre-configured recruitment refusal email templates in Odoo use dynamic "
"placeholders, which are personalized placeholders that populate data from "
"the applicant's record in the email body."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 預先配置的招聘拒絕電郵範本會使用動態預留位置；這些個人化預留位置會將申請"
"人記錄中的資料自動填入電郵內文。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:88
msgid ""
"For example, if the applicant's name is used in a dynamic placeholder, the "
"applicant's name appears anytime that dynamic placeholder appears on the "
"email template."
msgstr ""
"例如，若在動態佔位符中使用申請人姓名，每當該動態佔位符出現在電郵範本中時，便"
"會顯示申請人的姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:91
msgid ""
"For more detailed information on email templates, refer to the "
":doc:`../../general/companies/email_template` documentation."
msgstr ""
"有關電郵範本的更多詳細資料，請參閱 :doc:`../../general/companies/"
"email_template` 說明文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:97
msgid "Send refusal email"
msgstr "發送拒絕電郵"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:99
msgid ""
"After clicking the :guilabel:`Refuse` button on an applicant form, a "
":ref:`refuse reason <recruitment/refuse-reasons>` is selected from the "
"*Refuse Reason* pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:102
msgid ""
"The applicant's email address automatically populates the "
":guilabel:`Applicant` field. The :guilabel:`Subject` and email body are "
"populated according to the corresponding email"
msgstr ""
"應徵者的電郵地址會自動填入 :guilabel:`應徵者` 欄位。:guilabel:`主旨` 及電郵內"
"文會根據相應的電郵"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:105
msgid ""
"To send the refusal email to the applicant, click :guilabel:`Refuse` at the "
"bottom of the *Refuse Reason* pop-up window. The refusal email is sent to "
"the applicant, and a red :guilabel:`Refused` banner appears on the "
"applicant's card in the corner."
msgstr ""
"若要向應徵者發送拒絕電郵，請點擊 *拒絕原因* 彈出視窗底部的 :guilabel:`拒絕`。"
"系統隨即會向應徵者發送拒絕電郵，而應徵者卡片的角落亦會顯示紅色的 "
":guilabel:`已拒絕` 橫幅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:110
msgid ""
"If an application should be refused but an email should **not** be sent (if,"
" for example, the application was spam), click the :guilabel:`Send Email` "
"toggle to deactivate it, and click :guilabel:`Refuse` at the bottom of the "
"*Refuse Reason* pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"如果要拒絕某份申請但 **不要** 發送電郵（例如該申請屬於垃圾訊息），請點擊 "
":guilabel:`發送電郵` 切換開關將其停用，然後點擊 :guilabel:`拒絕`（位於 *拒絕"
"原因* 彈出視窗底部）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:114
msgid ""
"The refuse reason pop-up window, with the email subject and body populated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:118
msgid "Refuse duplicate applicant"
msgstr "拒絕重複的應徵者"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:120
msgid ""
"Occasionally, applicants apply multiple times for the same job position. "
"When this occurs, it is possible to refuse all their applications at once, "
"instead of individually."
msgstr ""
"應徵者有時會多次申請同一職位。遇此情況，您可一次過拒絕他們的所有申請，而無需"
"逐一處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:123
msgid ""
"In this situation, a :guilabel:`Refuse Duplicate Applications` toggle "
"appears on the *Refuse Reason* pop-up window. Enable the toggle, and a "
":guilabel:`Duplicate Applications` field appears beneath it, listing the "
"applicant's name for each duplicate application in the system."
msgstr ""
"在此情況下，*拒絕原因* 彈出視窗上會顯示 :guilabel:`拒絕重複申請` 開關。啟用該"
"開關後，下方會出現 :guilabel:`重複申請` 欄位，列出系統中每份重複申請的申請人"
"姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:127
msgid ""
"To refuse *all* applications for that applicant, click the "
":guilabel:`Refuse` button."
msgstr "如要拒絕該應徵者的 *所有* 申請，請點擊 :guilabel:`拒絕` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:129
msgid ""
"The applicant is only sent one email, and all their applications for the job"
" position are marked as *Refused*."
msgstr "申請人只會收到一封電郵，其針對該職位的所有申請都會標記為*已拒絕*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:132
msgid "Duplicate applications refused in one email."
msgstr "在一封電郵中拒絕重複的申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:136
msgid "View refused applicants"
msgstr "檢視已拒絕的應徵者"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:138
msgid ""
"After refusal, the applicant's card is hidden by default. However, it is "
"still possible to view applicants who have been refused :ref:`by job "
"position <recruitment/refuse_applicant/job-refused>`, or view :ref:`all "
"refused applicants <recruitment/refuse_applicant/all-refused>`."
msgstr ""
"拒絕應徵者後，該應徵者的卡片預設會被隱藏。不過，你仍可:ref:`按職位 "
"<recruitment/refuse_applicant/job-refused>`檢視被拒絕的應徵者，或檢視:ref:`所"
"有被拒絕的應徵者 <recruitment/refuse_applicant/all-refused>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:145
msgid "By job position"
msgstr "按職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:147
msgid ""
"To view the refused applicants for a specific job position, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> By Job Positions`, then"
" click the desired job position Kanban card."
msgstr ""
"如要查看特定職位的已拒絕應徵者，請前往:menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 申"
"請 --> 按職位`，然後點擊所需職位的看板卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:150
msgid ""
"On the *Applications* page, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` button in the search bar, then click "
":guilabel:`Refused` in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:154
msgid ""
"All applicants that have been refused for the job position appear in the "
"stage they were in when they were refused, and all other applicants are "
"hidden."
msgstr ""
"所有在該職位申請中被拒絕的應徵者，均會顯示於其被拒絕時所處的階段，而所有其他"
"應徵者則會被隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:157
msgid "All applicants refused for a job position."
msgstr "職位的所有被拒絕應徵者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:163
msgid "All refused applicants"
msgstr "所有被拒絕的應徵者"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:165
msgid ""
"To view all refused applicants across all job positions, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> All Applications`. "
"Every applicant record is displayed in a default list view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:168
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` button in "
"the search bar, then click :guilabel:`Refused` in the :icon:`fa-funnel` "
":guilabel:`Filters` column."
msgstr ""
"點按搜尋列中的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`（切換搜尋面板）` 按鈕，然後"
"點按 :guilabel:`已拒絕`（位於 :icon:`fa-funnel` :guilabel:`篩選器` 欄）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:171
msgid ""
"All applicants that have been refused appear, with the text in red. Along "
"with the applicant's :guilabel:`Name`, the date they :guilabel:`Applied on`,"
" the :guilabel:`Job Position`, :guilabel:`Stage` they were in when refused, "
"their :guilabel:`Matching` percentage, any :guilabel:`Tags`, and the "
":guilabel:`Recruiter` responsible for the job position are listed."
msgstr ""
"所有被拒絕的應徵者均會以紅色文字顯示，並同時列出應徵者的:guilabel:`姓"
"名`、:guilabel:`申請日期`、:guilabel:`職位`、被拒絕時所處的:guilabel:`階"
"段`、:guilabel:`匹配度`百分比、所有:guilabel:`標籤`，以及負責該職位"
"的:guilabel:`招聘人員`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:176
msgid "All applicants refused for all job positions."
msgstr "所有職位的所有應徵者均已被拒絕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:3
msgid "Schedule interviews"
msgstr "安排面試"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once an applicant has reached the *First Interview* stage, it is time to "
"schedule an in-person, virtual, or phone interview. This can be done in one "
"of two ways through the **Recruitment** app, either by the :ref:`recruitment"
" team <recruitment/schedule_interviews/recruitment-scheduled>`, or by the "
":ref:`applicant <recruitment/schedule_interviews/applicant-scheduled>`."
msgstr ""
"當應徵者進入 *初次面試* 階段後，便可安排親身、網上視像或電話面試。此操作可透"
"過 **招聘** 應用程式以兩種方式進行：由 :ref:`招聘團隊 <recruitment/"
"schedule_interviews/recruitment-scheduled>` 安排，或由 :ref:`應徵者 "
"<recruitment/schedule_interviews/applicant-scheduled>` 安排。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:10
msgid ""
"With a single drag and drop action, Odoo sends the applicant an email with a"
" self-service scheduling link. The applicant selects an available time slot,"
" and the meeting is automatically added to the calendars of all "
"participants. This eliminates the need for back-and-forth emails or phone "
"calls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:17
msgid "Recruitment team scheduled interviews"
msgstr "招聘團隊已安排的面試"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:19
msgid ""
"When an applicant reaches an interview stage, the recruitment team schedules"
" the interview by first coordinating a suitable date and time with the "
"applicant and interviewers."
msgstr ""
"當應徵者進入面試階段時，招聘團隊會先與應徵者及面試官協調合適的日期與時間，然"
"後安排面試。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:22
msgid ""
"To schedule an interview, navigate to the applicant's card by going to the "
":menuselection:`Recruitment` app and clicking the relevant job card. Click "
"the desired applicant's card on the *Applications* page."
msgstr ""
"若要安排面試，請前往 :menuselection:`招聘` 應用程式並按一下相關職位卡片，以開"
"啟應徵者卡片。在 *應徵申請* 頁面中按一下所需應徵者的卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:26
msgid ""
"To schedule a phone, virtual, or in-person interview, click the :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`No Meeting` smart button at the top of the applicant's "
"record."
msgstr ""
"要安排電話、視像或親身面試，請按一下應徵者記錄頂部的 :icon:`fa-calendar` "
":guilabel:`無會議` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:30
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Meetings` smart button displays :icon:`fa-calendar` "
":guilabel:`No Meeting` if no meetings are currently scheduled. For "
"applicants who are new to the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage, this is the"
" default."
msgstr ""
"如果目前未有安排任何會議，:guilabel:`會議` 智能按鈕會顯示 :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`沒有會議`。對於剛進入 :guilabel:`首次面試` 階段的應徵者"
"，這是預設顯示狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:34
msgid ""
"If there is one meeting already scheduled, the smart button displays "
":guilabel:`1 Meeting`, with the date of the upcoming meeting beneath it. If "
"more than one meeting is scheduled, the button displays :guilabel:`Next "
"Meeting`, with the date of the first upcoming meeting beneath it."
msgstr ""
"若已安排了一場會議，智能按鈕會顯示 :guilabel:`1 場會議`，下方則會顯示即將舉行"
"的會議日期。若已安排超過一場會議，按鈕則會顯示 :guilabel:`下次會議`，下方則會"
"顯示下一場即將舉行的會議日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:38
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`Meetings` smart button loads a calendar, showing the"
" scheduled meetings and events for the currently signed-in user, as well as "
"the user's favorites configured in the **Calendar** app. To hide any user's "
"schedules from the calendar, uncheck the box next to their name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:43
msgid ""
"To view only the schedules of the user and the interviewers, click "
":guilabel:`+ Add Attendees` at the bottom of the :guilabel:`Attendees` list "
"and add each desired interviewer from the resulting drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"如要只查看用戶及面試官的日程，請點擊 :guilabel:`+ 新增參加者`（位於 "
":guilabel:`參加者` 清單底部），然後從顯示的下拉式選單中逐一新增所需面試官。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:47
msgid "The calendar view, highlighting how to change the displayed meetings."
msgstr "日曆檢視，重點顯示如何更改所顯示的會議。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:50
msgid ""
"To add a meeting to the calendar when in the *Day* or *Week* view, click on "
"the start time of the meeting and drag down to the end time. Doing so "
"selects the date, time, and length of the meeting. A meeting can also be "
"added by clicking the :guilabel:`New` button."
msgstr ""
"在*日*檢視或*週*檢視中，如要在行事曆新增會議，請點按會議的開始時間並向下拖曳"
"至結束時間，即可選取會議的日期、時間及時長。你亦可點按:guilabel:`新增`按鈕新"
"增會議。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:54
msgid ""
"Both methods cause a :ref:`New Event <recruitment/schedule_interviews/event-"
"card>` pop-up window to appear."
msgstr ""
"兩種方法都會彈出:ref:`新活動 <recruitment/schedule_interviews/event-card>`視"
"窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:60
msgid "New event pop-up window"
msgstr "新增活動彈出視窗"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:62
msgid ""
"Configure the information for the interview on the *New Event* pop-up "
"window. The only required information is the meeting title, date, and time."
msgstr "在*新增活動*彈出視窗中設定面試資訊。唯一必填的資料為會議標題、日期及時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:65
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-tag` :guilabel:`(Booking Name)`: Enter the title for the meeting. "
"The default subject is the applicant's name."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-tag` :guilabel:`（預約名稱）`：輸入會議標題。預設主題為應徵者姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:67
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Dates)`: Configure the start and end date and"
" times for the meeting. Clicking either of these fields opens a calendar "
"pop-up window. Click on the desired date to select it, enter the times in "
"the corresponding fields, then click :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`All Day`: Click the box to schedule an all-day interview. If this"
" box is ticked, the :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Dates)` fields change to "
"display the date only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:72
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-user` :guilabel:`(Participants)`: Select the people attending the "
"meeting. The default attendees are the prospective candidate and the "
"assigned recruiters for the job position. Add as many other people as "
"desired."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-user` :guilabel:`(參與者)`：選擇出席會議的人員。預設出席人員為準候"
"選人及該職位的指派招聘人員。您可按需要新增任意人數的其他人員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:75
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-map` :guilabel:`(Location)`: Enter the address for the interview."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:76
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-video-camera` :guilabel:`(Videocall URL)`: If the meeting is "
"virtual, or if a virtual option is available, click :icon:`fa-plus` "
":guilabel:`Video`, and a URL is automatically created and populates this "
"field."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-video-camera` :guilabel:`（視像通話網址）`：如會議為線上會議，或提"
"供線上參與選項，請點擊:icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`視像`，系統便會自動建立網址"
"並填入此欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:79
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-lock` :guilabel:`(Visibility)`: Determine who can see the meeting "
"using the drop-down menu. The default options are :guilabel:`Public`, "
":guilabel:`Private`, and :guilabel:`Only internal users`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-lock` :guilabel:`（可見度）`：使用下拉式選單決定誰可查看該會議。預"
"設選項為 :guilabel:`公開`、:guilabel:`私人` 及 :guilabel:`僅限內部用戶`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:82
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-sticky-note` :guilabel:`Notes`: Enter any relevant notes in this "
"field. There is an option to enter formatted text, such as numbered lists, "
"headings, tables, links, photos, and more. Use the powerbox feature by "
"typing a `/` to reveal a list of options. Scroll through the options and "
"click on the desired item. The item appears in the field and can be "
"modified. Each command presents a different pop-up window. Follow the "
"instructions for each command to complete the entry."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-sticky-note` :guilabel:`備註`：在此欄位輸入任何相關備註。你可以輸入"
"格式化文字，例如編號清單、標題、表格、連結、相片等。輸入 `/` 可使用 Powerbox "
"功能以顯示選項清單。捲動瀏覽選項並點擊所需項目，該項目隨即會顯示於欄位中並可"
"進行修改。每個指令都會顯示不同的彈出視窗，請按照各指令的指示完成輸入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:89
msgid ""
"Once the card details are entered, click :guilabel:`Save` to save the "
"changes and schedule the interview."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:92
msgid "The New Event pop-up window configured for an interview."
msgstr "已設定為面試的「新增活動」彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:98
msgid "More options"
msgstr "更多選項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:100
msgid ""
"To add additional information to the meeting, click the :guilabel:`More "
"Options` button of the :ref:`New Event "
"<recruitment/schedule_interviews/event-card>` pop-up window. Enter any of "
"the following additional fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:104
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration`: This field auto-populates based on the "
":guilabel:`Start` (and end) date and time. If the meeting time is adjusted, "
"this field automatically adjusts to the correct duration. The default length"
" of a meeting is one hour."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:107
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Linked to`: The applicant being interviewed. This field cannot be"
" modified. Click the applicant's name to view the applicant's card."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`連結至`：正在接受面試的應徵者。此欄位無法修改。按一下應徵者姓名即"
"可檢視應徵者資料卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: Select if the interviewers are marked as "
":guilabel:`Busy` or :guilabel:`Available` during the interview. This field "
"is set to :guilabel:`Busy` by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`狀態`：選擇面試官在面試期間是否標記為 :guilabel:`忙碌` 或 "
":guilabel:`有空`。此欄位預設為 :guilabel:`忙碌`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`# guests`: This field displays the number of people invited to "
"the meeting."
msgstr ":guilabel:`嘉賓人數`：此欄位顯示獲邀參加會議的人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`# Awaiting`: The number of guests that have not responded to the "
"meeting invitation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`# 待回覆`：尚未回覆會議邀請的嘉賓人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:113
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`Email`: Click this to email the meeting "
"guests with any updates."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`電郵`：點擊此按鈕即可透過電郵向會議賓客發送任"
"何更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:114
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-mobile` :guilabel:`SMS`: Click this to send an SMS message to the "
"meeting guests."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-mobile` :guilabel:`SMS`：點擊此處以向會議嘉賓發送 SMS 短訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:116
msgid "A new meeting card with all the details populated, and ready to save."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:120
msgid "Send meeting to attendees"
msgstr "將會議傳送給參加者"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:122
msgid ""
"Once the meeting details are correct, the meeting can be sent to the "
"attendees via :ref:`email <recruitment/schedule_interviews/email>` or "
":ref:`SMS <recruitment/schedule_interviews/sms>`. This is done from the "
":ref:`expanded event form <recruitment/schedule_interviews/more-options>`."
msgstr ""
"確認會議詳情無誤後，即可透過 :ref:`電郵 <recruitment/schedule_interviews/"
"email>` 或 :ref:`短訊 <recruitment/schedule_interviews/sms>` 將會議通知發送給"
"參加者。此操作可在 :ref:`展開的活動表單 <recruitment/schedule_interviews/"
"more-options>` 中進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:129
msgid "Via email"
msgstr "透過電郵"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:131
msgid ""
"To send the meeting via email, click the :icon:`fa-envelope` "
":guilabel:`Email` button next to the :guilabel:`Attendees` field on the "
"expanded meeting form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:134
msgid ""
"A *Contact Attendees* email configurator pop-up window appears. A pre-"
"formatted email using the default :guilabel:`Calendar: Event Update` email "
"template populates the email body field."
msgstr ""
"此時會彈出 *聯絡參與者* 電郵設定視窗。電郵內文欄位會自動填入預設格式電郵，該"
"電郵採用預設的 :guilabel:`日曆：活動更新` 電郵範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:137
msgid ""
"All meeting guests are added to the :guilabel:`To` field by default. Make "
"any desired changes to the email, then click :guilabel:`Send` to send the "
"email."
msgstr ""
"所有會議賓客預設都會新增至 :guilabel:`收件人` 欄位。對電郵作出任何所需的更改"
"後，請按一下 :guilabel:`傳送` 以傳送電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:143
msgid "Via SMS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:145
msgid ""
"To send the meeting via SMS, click the :icon:`fa-mobile` :guilabel:`SMS` "
"button next to the :guilabel:`Attendees` field on the expanded meeting form."
" A *Send SMS* pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"要透過 SMS 傳送會議通知，請在展開的會議表單上按一下 :icon:`fa-mobile` "
":guilabel:`SMS` 按鈕（位於 :guilabel:`出席者` 欄位旁邊）。系統隨即會顯示 *傳"
"送 SMS* 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:148
msgid ""
"At the top, a blue banner appears if any attendees do not have valid phone "
"numbers, and lists how many records are invalid. If a contact does not have "
"a valid mobile number listed, click :guilabel:`Discard`, edit the attendee's"
" record, then redo these steps."
msgstr ""
"如果有任何參加者沒有有效的電話號碼，頂部會顯示藍色橫額，並列出無效紀錄的數量"
"。如果聯絡人沒有列出有效的手提電話號碼，請點擊:guilabel:`捨棄`，編輯該參加者"
"的紀錄，然後重新執行這些步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:152
msgid ""
"When no warning message appears, type in the message to be sent to the "
"attendees in the main text field. To add any emojis to the message, click "
"the :icon:`oi-smile-add` :guilabel:`(smile add)` icon on the side of the "
"pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"若沒有出現警告訊息，請在主要文字欄位中輸入要傳送給出席者的訊息。如要在訊息中"
"加入表情符號，請點擊彈出視窗側邊的 :icon:`oi-smile-add` :guilabel:`(新增笑臉)"
"` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:156
msgid ""
"The number of characters and amount of text messages required to send the "
"message (according to GSM-7 criteria) appears beneath the text field. Click "
":guilabel:`Put in queue` to have the text sent later, after any other "
"messages are scheduled, or click :guilabel:`Send now` to send the message "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"發送訊息所需的字元數及短訊數量（根據 GSM-7 標準）會顯示在文字欄位下方。按一"
"下 :guilabel:`放入佇列` 可在所有其他已排程訊息之後稍後發送短訊，或按一下 "
":guilabel:`立即發送` 立即發送訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:162
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:95
msgid ""
"Sending text messages is **not** a default capability with Odoo. To send "
"text messages, credits are required, which need to be purchased. For more "
"information on IAP credits and plans, refer to the "
":doc:`../../essentials/in_app_purchase` documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:169
msgid "Applicant scheduled interviews"
msgstr "應徵者已安排面試"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:171
msgid ""
"Coordinating interview times typically requires several email exchanges or "
"phone calls, and can slow the recruitment process. Enabling Odoo's self-"
"service scheduling removes that bottleneck. When an applicant is moved to an"
" interview stage, the system automatically sends a scheduling link, records "
"the selected slot, and updates all relevant calendars."
msgstr ""
"協調面試時間通常需要多次電郵往來或電話溝通，這會拖慢招聘流程。啟用 Odoo 的自"
"助預約排程功能可消除這個瓶頸。當應徵者被移至面試階段時，系統會自動發送預約連"
"結、記錄所選時段，並更新所有相關日曆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:176
msgid ""
"This automation is turned off by default. To activate this, :ref:`modify "
"<recruitment/schedule_interviews/modify-stage>` the :guilabel:`First "
"Interview` and :guilabel:`Second Interview` stages and assign the "
":guilabel:`Recruitment: Schedule Interview` email template to them."
msgstr ""
"此自動化功能預設為關閉。如要啟用，請 :ref:`修改 <recruitment/"
"schedule_interviews/modify-stage>` :guilabel:`第一輪面試` 和 :guilabel:`第二"
"輪面試` 階段，並為它們指派 :guilabel:`招聘：安排面試` 電郵範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:186
msgid ""
":ref:`Modify <recruitment/modify-stages>` the :guilabel:`First Interview` or"
" :guilabel:`Second Interview` stage so the stage's :guilabel:`Email "
"Template` field is set to :guilabel:`Recruitment: Schedule Interview`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`修改 <recruitment/modify-stages>` :guilabel:`首次面試` 或 :guilabel:`第"
"二次面試` 階段，將該階段的 :guilabel:`電郵範本` 欄位設為 :guilabel:`招聘：安"
"排面試`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:190
msgid ""
"The Recruitment: Schedule Interview email template populating the Email "
"Template field."
msgstr "「招聘：安排面試」電郵範本填入「電郵範本」欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:194
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:55
msgid "Send email"
msgstr "發送電郵"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:196
msgid ""
"After configuring the :guilabel:`First Interview` or :guilabel:`Second "
"Interview` stages to :ref:`send emails "
"<recruitment/schedule_interviews/modify-stage>`, drag and drop the applicant"
" card into one of these stages to send the email."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`首次面試` 或 :guilabel:`第二次面試` 階段配置為 :ref:`發送電郵 "
"<recruitment/schedule_interviews/modify-stage>` 後，將申請人卡片拖放至其中一"
"個階段，即可發送電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:201
msgid "Self-scheduled interview"
msgstr "自助預約面試"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:203
msgid ""
"When the applicant receives the email, they click the :guilabel:`Schedule my"
" interview` button at the bottom of the email. This navigates the applicant "
"to a private online scheduling page, which is **only** accessible through "
"the emailed link."
msgstr ""
"應徵者收到電郵後，點擊電郵底部的 :guilabel:`安排我的面試` 按鈕，便會前往私人"
"網上預約頁面。該頁面 **只** 可透過電郵內的連結存取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:207
msgid ""
"This page displays the :guilabel:`Meeting Details` on the side of the screen"
" which includes the format and length of the meeting. In this example, the "
"interview is virtual (:icon:`fa-video-camera` :guilabel:`Online`) and the "
"duration is one hour (:icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`1 hour`)."
msgstr ""
"此頁面會在畫面側邊顯示 :guilabel:`會議詳情`，其中包括會議的形式及時長。在此範"
"例中，面試為虛擬形式（:icon:`fa-video-camera` :guilabel:`網上`），時長為一小"
"時（:icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`1 小時`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:211
msgid ""
"The applicant clicks on an available day on the calendar, signified by "
"purple text. Once a day is selected, they click one of the available times "
"to select that date and time."
msgstr ""
"應徵者在日曆上點擊可預約的日期（以紫色文字標示）。選擇日期後，再點擊其中一個"
"可預約時段，即可選定該日期及時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:214
msgid "The calendar screen with dates and times to schedule an interview."
msgstr "顯示日期與時間以安排面試的日曆畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:218
msgid ""
"Be sure to check the :guilabel:`Timezone` field beneath the calendar to "
"ensure it is set to the correct time zone. Changing the time zone may alter "
"the available times presented."
msgstr ""
"請務必檢查日曆下方的 :guilabel:`時區` 欄位，確保已設定為正確的時區。更改時區"
"可能會改變所顯示的可用時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:221
msgid ""
"Once the date and time are selected, the applicant is navigated to an *Add "
"more details about you* page. This page prompts the applicant to enter their"
" :guilabel:`Full name`, :guilabel:`Email`, and :guilabel:`Phone number`, all"
" of which are required. The contact information entered on this form is used"
" to remind the applicant about the scheduled interview."
msgstr ""
"選擇日期及時間後，申請人會跳轉至*新增更多個人資料*頁面。此頁面會提示申請人輸"
"入:guilabel:`全名`、:guilabel:`電郵`及:guilabel:`電話號碼`，以上均為必填項目"
"。在此表單中輸入的聯絡資料，將用於提醒申請人已預約的面試。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:226
msgid ""
"When everything is entered, the applicant clicks the :guilabel:`Confirm "
"Appointment` button, and the interview is scheduled."
msgstr "輸入所有資料後，應徵者點擊:guilabel:`確認預約`按鈕，面試即完成排程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:229
msgid ""
"After confirming the interview, the applicant is taken to a confirmation "
"page, where all the details of the interview are displayed. The option to "
"add the meeting to the applicant's personal calendars is available, through "
"the :guilabel:`Add to iCal/Outlook` and :guilabel:`Add to Google Agenda` "
"buttons, beneath the interview details."
msgstr ""
"確認面試後，應徵者會前往確認頁面，當中會顯示面試的所有詳情。面試詳情下方設有 "
":guilabel:`新增至 iCal/Outlook` 及 :guilabel:`新增至 Google 日曆` 按鈕，讓應"
"徵者將會議加到個人日曆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:234
msgid ""
"The applicant is also able to cancel the interview if necessary, with the "
":guilabel:`Cancel your appointment` button at the bottom of the "
"confirmation."
msgstr "如有需要，應徵者亦可按確認頁面底部的:guilabel:`取消預約`按鈕取消面試。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:237
msgid ""
"The confirmation page with all the details for the interview displayed."
msgstr "顯示所有面試詳情的確認頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Source analysis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"Reporting is a critical tool used by recruiting departments to gain insights"
" into the entire recruitment process."
msgstr "報告是招聘部門深入了解整個招聘流程的關鍵工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:8
msgid ""
"Determining where applicants come from can provide information about which "
"sources have the best results. This information is determined by the *Source"
" Analysis* report. With this data, recruitment teams can better pivot their "
"recruiting strategies to gain better applicants, in both quantity and "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"確認應徵者的來源有助了解哪些渠道成效最佳。這項資訊可透過 *來源分析* 報表取得"
"。運用這些數據，招聘團隊便能更靈活地調整招聘策略，從數量和質素兩方面吸納更優"
"秀的應徵者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:14
msgid "Open report"
msgstr "開啟報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:16
msgid ""
"To access the *Source Analysis* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Reporting --> Source Analysis`."
msgstr ""
"要開啟 *來源分析* 報表，請前往 :menuselection:`招募應用程式 --> 報表 --> 來源"
"分析`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:19
msgid ""
"This presents the data for the last 365 days in a default :icon:`fa-"
"database` :guilabel:`(Stacked)` :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(Bar Chart)`"
" view. It shows the amount of applicants by source and separated by status "
"(:guilabel:`In Progress`, :guilabel:`Hired`, and :guilabel:`Refused`),"
msgstr ""
"此檢視以預設的 :icon:`fa-database` :guilabel:`（堆疊）` :icon:`fa-bar-chart` "
":guilabel:`（棒形圖）`模式顯示過去 365 天的數據。它按來源顯示應徵者數量，並依"
"狀態（:guilabel:`進行中`、:guilabel:`已僱用`及:guilabel:`已拒絕`）區分，"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:23
msgid ""
"Hover the cursor over any color-coded section of a column to view the "
"specific numbers for that status column."
msgstr "將滑鼠游標懸停在直欄任何以顏色區分的區段上，即可查看該狀態欄的具體數字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:26
msgid "The default bar chart of the source analysis information."
msgstr "來源分析資料的預設長條圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:30
msgid "Source effectiveness report"
msgstr "來源成效報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:32
msgid ""
"To identify which sources (e.g., job boards, social media, employee "
"referrals, company website) produce the most hires, the pivot table view of "
"the *Source Analysis* report can be configured to display further details."
msgstr ""
"為識別哪些來源（例如招聘網站、社交媒體、員工推薦、公司網站）帶來最多聘用人數"
"，你可設定 *來源分析* 報表的樞紐分析表視圖，以顯示更多詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:36
msgid ""
"To view the *Source Analysis* report in a pivot table, click the :icon:`oi-"
"view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon in the corner. The data is presented in"
" a pivot table, with rows populated by sources, and columns populated by "
"stages."
msgstr ""
"要在樞紐分析表中查看 *來源分析* 報告，請點擊角落的 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` "
":guilabel:`(樞紐分析)` 圖示。數據會以樞紐分析表形式顯示，列代表來源，欄代表階"
"段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:40
msgid ""
"To expand this chart to show what specific job positions the applicants "
"applied to from each source, click the :icon:`fa-plus-square` "
":guilabel:`Total` box above the columns to reveal a drop-down menu, and "
"click :guilabel:`Job Position`."
msgstr ""
"要展開此圖表以顯示應徵者透過各來源應徵的具體職位，請點擊直條上方的 :icon:`fa-"
"plus-square` :guilabel:`總計` 方塊以開啟下拉式選單，然後點擊 :guilabel:`職"
"位` 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:44
msgid ""
"Each column is then grouped by the job position, such as *Accountant* or "
"*Carpenter*. Each job position displays a separate count for applications "
":guilabel:`In Progress`, :guilabel:`Refused`, or :guilabel:`Hired`, and an "
":guilabel:`Applications` column which displays the total count of all "
"statuses."
msgstr ""
"然後，每個直欄會按工作職位分組，例如 *會計師* 或 *木匠*。每個職位都會分別顯示"
"狀態為 :guilabel:`進行中`、:guilabel:`已拒絕` 或 :guilabel:`已聘用` 的申請數"
"量，並設有 :guilabel:`申請` 直欄顯示所有狀態的總數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:49
msgid ""
"The pivot table view displaying each job position and its source and stage."
msgstr "顯示每個職位及其來源和階段的樞紐分析表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:53
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "中等"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:55
msgid ""
"Viewing the medium for the applicants can be beneficial to see which "
"specific medium is more successful."
msgstr "查看應徵者的來源媒介有助了解哪個特定媒介更具成效。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:58
msgid ""
"*Mediums* are the specific methods the applicant used to discover and then "
"apply for job positions, such as a search engine, social media ad, email, "
"banner, etc."
msgstr ""
"*媒介* 是指申請人用來發現並申請職位的具體途徑，例如搜尋引擎、社交媒體廣告、電"
"郵、橫幅廣告等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:61
msgid ""
"To further group the results by medium, click into one of the :icon:`fa-"
"plus-square` :guilabel:`(Source)` rows then click :guilabel:`Medium` in the "
"resulting drop-down menu. The row presents the individual mediums relevant "
"to that specific source."
msgstr ""
"如要進一步按媒介將結果分組，請點擊其中一個 :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`"
"(來源)` 資料列，然後在隨即出現的下拉式選單中點擊 :guilabel:`媒介`。該資料列會"
"顯示與該特定來源相關的個別媒介。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:65
msgid ""
"Once :guilabel:`Medium` is selected for one source, clicking into another "
"row automatically reveals the specific metrics for the mediums for that "
"source."
msgstr ""
"為某個來源選擇 :guilabel:`媒介` 後，點擊另一資料行會自動顯示該來源各媒介的具"
"體指標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:69
msgid ""
"The only mediums that appear for a source are mediums that have been set on "
"an applicant's form. If a medium has **not** been set for any applicants, "
"the medium does not appear in the drop-down rows beneath the source."
msgstr ""
"來源下方只會顯示已在應徵者表格中設定的媒介。如果從未為任何應徵者設定某個媒介"
"，該媒介便 **不會** 顯示在來源下方的下拉式資料列中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:73
msgid ""
"For example, if no applicants applied with the medium *Google Adwords*, that"
" medium does **not** appear beneath the *Search engine* source row."
msgstr ""
"例如，若沒有應徵者透過 *Google Adwords* 媒體提出申請，該媒體便 **不會** 顯示"
"在 *搜尋引擎* 來源資料列下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:76
msgid "The source rows, expanded to also show the medium for each source."
msgstr "已展開的來源資料列，同時顯示每個來源的媒介。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:3
msgid "Team performance"
msgstr "團隊表現"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Team Performance* report in the **Recruitment** app shows how many "
"applicants each recruiter manages and what stage their applicants are at."
msgstr ""
"**招聘**應用程式中的*團隊表現*報表會顯示每位招聘人員管理多少位應徵者，以及其"
"應徵者目前處於哪個階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:8
msgid ""
"This information is determined by the individuals populating the "
":ref:`Recruiter <recruitment/add_applicants/applicant-details>` field on "
"each applicant form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:14
msgid ""
"To view the *Team Performance* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Reporting --> Team Performance`."
msgstr ""
"如要檢視 *團隊表現* 報告，請前往 :menuselection:`招聘應用程式 --> 報告 --> 團"
"隊表現`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:17
msgid ""
"For each recruiter, the number of :guilabel:`In Progress`, "
":guilabel:`Hired`, and :guilabel:`Refused` applicants is displayed in a "
"default :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(Bar Chart)` view. The default "
":guilabel:`Last 365 Days Applicant` filter shows all applicants for the last"
" 365 days."
msgstr ""
"每位招聘人員負責的:guilabel:`進行中`、:guilabel:`已聘用`及:guilabel:`已拒"
"絕`申請人人數，會以預設的 :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`（棒形圖）` 檢視模"
"式顯示。預設的:guilabel:`過去 365 天申請人`篩選條件會顯示過去 365 天內的所有"
"申請人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:22
msgid ""
"Hover the cursor over any column to view a popover window, displaying the "
"specific details for that column."
msgstr "將游標懸停在任何一欄上方，即可檢視彈出式視窗，當中會顯示該欄的具體詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:25
msgid "The default bar chart of the team performance report."
msgstr "團隊表現報表的預設棒形圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:33
msgid ""
"For a more detailed view of the information in the *Team Performance* "
"report, click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon. This "
"displays all the information in a pivot table."
msgstr ""
"如要更詳細查看 *團隊表現* 報表中的資料，請點擊 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` "
":guilabel:`（樞紐分析表）` 圖示。這會以樞紐分析表顯示所有資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:36
msgid ""
"In this view, the recruiters populate the rows, while the columns are "
"populated with the number of applicants in each stage. Each column displays "
"the total number of applicants who are still :guilabel:`In Progress`, have "
"been :guilabel:`Hired`, or have been :guilabel:`Refused`. The last column, "
":guilabel:`Applications`, is the total number of applicants across all "
"stages for that recruiter."
msgstr ""
"在此檢視中，招聘人員會佔據各橫列，而各直欄則顯示每個階段的應徵者人數。每一欄"
"都會顯示仍然:guilabel:`進行中`、:guilabel:`已錄用`或:guilabel:`已拒絕`的應徵"
"者總數。最後一欄:guilabel:`申請`則是該招聘人員在所有階段的應徵者總數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:42
msgid ""
"In this example, there are 59 applicants in total. Of those 59, 17 have been"
" hired, 18 have been refused, and 24 are still in the recruitment process."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，共有 59 位應徵者。在這 59 位之中，有 17 位已獲聘用、18 位已被拒絕"
"，另有 24 位仍在招聘流程中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:45
msgid ""
"Based on the data presented, :guilabel:`John Doe` is the most successful "
"recruiter, with a total of eight hires, while :guilabel:`Carol Bishop` has "
"the fewest hires, with only three."
msgstr ""
"根據所顯示的資料，:guilabel:`John Doe`是最成功的招募人員，共錄用了八人；"
"而:guilabel:`Carol Bishop`的錄用人數最少，只有三人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:5
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "推薦"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Referrals** application is a centralized place where all "
"information regarding referrals is housed - from points earned, coworkers "
"hired, and rewards selected. Users can recommend people they know for job "
"positions, and then earn referral points as those people progress through "
"the recruitment pipeline. Once enough referral points are earned, they can "
"be exchanged for prizes. The **Employees**, **Recruitment**, and **Website**"
" apps must all be installed for the **Referrals** app to function."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **推薦** 應用程式是一個集中平台，整合所有與推薦相關的資訊，包括所賺取"
"的積分、獲聘用的同事及已選取的獎賞。用戶可向認識的人推薦職位空缺；隨着被推薦"
"人在招聘流程中推進，推薦人便可賺取推薦積分。累積足夠推薦積分後，即可兌換獎品"
"。必須先安裝 **員工**、**招聘** 及 **網站** 應用程式，**推薦** 應用程式才可正"
"常運作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:14
msgid ""
"The only configurations needed for the **Referrals** app *after* it has been"
" installed, are related to the :doc:`rewards <referrals/rewards>`; "
"everything else is preconfigured when Odoo **Referrals** is installed."
msgstr ""
"安裝 **推薦** 應用程式*之後*，唯一需要進行的設定與:doc:`獎勵 <referrals/"
"rewards>`相關；安裝 Odoo **推薦** 時，其他所有項目均已預先設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:18
msgid ""
"Users with either :guilabel:`Referral User`, :guilabel:`Officer`, or "
":guilabel:`Administrator` access rights for the **Recruitment** app can "
"access the **Referrals** app. Only users with :guilabel:`Administrator` "
"access rights for the **Recruitment** app have access to the :doc:`referral "
"analysis <referrals/referral_analysis>` report and configuration menus. For "
"more information on users and access rights, refer to these documents: "
":doc:`../general/users` and :doc:`../general/users/access_rights`."
msgstr ""
"擁有**招聘**應用程式的:guilabel:`推薦用戶`、:guilabel:`專員`或:guilabel:`管理"
"員`存取權限的用戶，均可使用**推薦**應用程式。只有擁有**招聘**應用程"
"式:guilabel:`管理員`存取權限的用戶，才可存取:doc:`推薦分析 <referrals/"
"referral_analysis>`報告及設定選單。有關用戶與存取權限的詳細資訊，請參閱以下文"
"件：:doc:`../general/users` 及 :doc:`../general/users/access_rights`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:30
msgid ""
"When opening the **Referrals** app for the first time, a preconfigured "
"onboarding script appears. This script consists of four slides, each "
"explaining the different parts of the **Referrals** app. At the top of the "
"dashboard, the following message is displayed throughout all the onboarding "
"slides: :guilabel:`GATHER YOUR TEAM! Job Referral Program`. Behind this main"
" message is an image, and beneath it some more explanatory text."
msgstr ""
"首次開啟**推薦**應用程式時，系統會顯示預設的新手導覽內容。這段導覽包含四張投"
"影片，分別介紹**推薦**應用程式的不同部分。在所有新手導覽投影片期間，儀表板頂"
"部都會顯示以下訊息：:guilabel:`齊來組建團隊！職位推薦計劃`。這段主要訊息後方"
"是一張圖片，下方則有更多說明文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:36
msgid ""
"Each of the onboarding slides has a corresponding image and message that is "
"displayed. After reading each message, click the :guilabel:`Next` :icon:`fa-"
"angle-right` button to advance to the next slide."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:39
msgid "The text that appears on each slide is as follows:"
msgstr "每張投影片顯示的文字如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`OH NO! VILLAINS ARE LURKING THE CITY! HELP US RECRUIT A TEAM OF "
"SUPERHEROES TO SAVE THE DAY!`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`不好了！壞人正在城市潛伏！快協助我們招募超級英雄團隊拯救世界！`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`BROWSE THROUGH OPEN JOB POSITIONS, PROMOTE THEM ON SOCIAL MEDIA, "
"OR REFER FRIENDS.`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`瀏覽空缺職位、在社交媒體推廣，或推薦朋友。`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`COLLECT POINTS AND EXCHANGE THEM FOR AWESOME GIFTS IN THE SHOP.`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`收集積分，並在商店換領豐富禮品。`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`COMPETE AGAINST YOUR COLLEAGUES TO BUILD THE BEST JUSTICE "
"LEAGUE!`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`與同事一較高下，打造最強正義聯盟！`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:48
msgid ""
"The onboarding slides will appear every time the **Referrals** app is "
"opened, until all the slides have been viewed and the :guilabel:`Start Now` "
"button has been clicked. If the onboarding is exited at any point, or if the"
" :guilabel:`Start Now` button has *not* been clicked, the onboarding slides "
"will begin again when the **Referrals** app is opened. Once the "
":guilabel:`Start Now` button has been clicked, the onboarding slides will "
"not be seen again, and the main dashboard will load when the **Referrals** "
"app is opened from that point on."
msgstr ""
"每次開啟 **推薦** 應用程式時，都會顯示導覽投影片，直至已瀏覽所有投影片並點擊 "
":guilabel:`立即開始` 按鈕為止。如果在任何階段退出導覽，或 *未有* 點擊 "
":guilabel:`立即開始` 按鈕，下次開啟 **推薦** 應用程式時，導覽投影片將會重新開"
"始。一旦點擊 :guilabel:`立即開始` 按鈕，之後就不會再顯示導覽投影片；此後開啟 "
"**推薦** 應用程式時，系統會直接載入主儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:55
msgid ""
"At any point during onboarding, click the :guilabel:`Skip` button to open "
"the main **Referrals** dashboard."
msgstr ""
"在入職引導過程中的任何時候，點擊 :guilabel:`略過` 按鈕即可開啟主要的 **推"
"薦** 儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:58
msgid ""
"An onboarding slide with the skip and next buttons visible at the bottom."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:62
msgid ""
"If there are any candidates hired that the user had referred prior to "
"opening the **Referrals** app (meaning the onboarding slides have not "
"appeared before), when :guilabel:`Start Now` is clicked at the end of "
"onboarding, instead of going to the main dashboard, a :ref:`hired "
"<referrals/hired>` screen appears instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:68
msgid "Modifying onboarding slides"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:70
msgid ""
"Onboarding slides can be modified if desired. Only users with "
":guilabel:`Administrator` rights for the **Recruitment** app can modify "
"onboarding slides. To edit a slide, navigate to :menuselection:`Referrals "
"app --> Configuration --> Onboarding.` Each line displays the text for the "
"individual onboarding slide. To edit an onboarding slide, click on an "
"individual slide line to open the slide's onboarding form."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可以修改入職導覽投影片。只有擁有**招聘**應用程式:guilabel:`管理"
"員`權限的使用者才能修改入職導覽投影片。若要編輯投影片，請前"
"往:menuselection:`推薦應用程式 --> 配置 --> 入職導覽。`每一行都會顯示個別入職"
"導覽投影片的文字。若要編輯入職導覽投影片，請按一下個別投影片項目以開啟該投影"
"片的導覽表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:76
msgid ""
"Make any changes to the message in the :guilabel:`Text` field. A "
":guilabel:`Company` may be selected, as well. However, if this field is "
"populated, that slide is *only* displayed for that particular company."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`文字` 欄位中對訊息作出任何更改。您亦可選擇 :guilabel:`公司`；不"
"過，如填寫了此欄位，該幻燈片將 *只會* 顯示予該特定公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:81
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Company` field only appears when in a multi-company database."
msgstr " :guilabel:`公司` 欄位只會在多公司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:83
msgid ""
"The image can be modified, as well. Hover over the image thumbnail in the "
"top-right corner of the form. An :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon "
"and :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Clear)` icon appear. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon to change the image. A file navigator window"
" loads. Navigate to the desired image, select it, then click "
":guilabel:`Open`. The new image appears in the thumbnail. To delete an "
"image, click the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Clear)` icon, then select a "
"new image using the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon."
msgstr ""
"圖片亦可進行修改。將游標懸停在表單右上角的圖片縮圖上，即會顯示 :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示及 :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`（清除）` "
"圖示。點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示以變更圖片。系統隨即載"
"入檔案瀏覽視窗。前往所需圖片的位置並選取圖片，然後點擊 :guilabel:`開啟`。新圖"
"片會顯示於縮圖中。如要刪除圖片，請點擊 :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`（清除"
"）` 圖示，然後使用 :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示選取新圖片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:90
msgid "An onboarding slide in edit mode, with the main fields highlighted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:93
msgid ""
"The sequence in which the slides appear can be changed from the *Onboarding*"
" dashboard. Click the :icon:`oi-draggable` :guilabel:`(draggable)` icon to "
"the left of the slide text, and drag the slide to the desired position."
msgstr ""
"投影片的顯示順序可以在 *入職* 儀表板中更改。點擊投影片文字左側的 :icon:`oi-"
"draggable` :guilabel:`(可拖曳)` 圖示，然後將投影片拖曳至所需位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:97
msgid ""
"The onboarding slides in a list, with the drag and drop arrows highlighted."
msgstr "列表中的入職投影片，當中醒目標示了拖放箭頭。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:103
msgid "Hired referrals"
msgstr "已錄用的推薦人選"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:105
msgid ""
"When a candidate referred by a user is hired, the user *\"grows their "
"superhero team\"* and adds superhero avatars to their **Referrals** "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"當用戶推薦的候選人獲聘時，用戶便會 *「壯大其超級英雄團隊」*，並將超級英雄頭像"
"新增至其 **推薦** 儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:108
msgid ""
"After a referral has been hired, when the user next opens the **Referrals** "
"app, instead of the main dashboard, a hired page loads. The text "
":guilabel:`(REFERRAL NAME) HAS BEEN HIRED! Choose an avatar for your new "
"friend!` appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:112
msgid ""
"Below this message are five avatar thumbnails to choose from. If an avatar "
"has already been assigned to a referral, the thumbnail is grayed out, and "
"the name that the avatar has been chosen for appears beneath the avatar. "
"Click on an available avatar to select it."
msgstr ""
"此訊息下方有五個頭像縮圖可供選擇。如果某個頭像已分配給其他推薦對象，該縮圖會"
"顯示為灰色，而該頭像所屬的名稱亦會顯示於頭像下方。按一下可用的頭像即可選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:116
msgid ""
"If more than one referral was hired since completing onboarding in the "
"**Referrals** app, after selecting the first avatar, the user is prompted to"
" select another avatar for the subsequent hired referral. Once all avatars "
"have been selected, the dashboard loads and all the avatars are now visible."
" Mouse over each avatar and their name is displayed above them."
msgstr ""
"如果在 **推薦** 應用程式完成新手引導後已聘用超過一名被推薦人，選擇第一個頭像"
"後，系統會提示用戶為下一名獲聘的被推薦人選擇另一個頭像。選取所有頭像後，儀表"
"板便會載入並顯示所有頭像。將滑鼠游標移至各頭像上方，即可顯示其姓名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:121
msgid ""
"The hired screen. A selection of avatars are presented to choose from, with any already\n"
"chosen are greyed out."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:126
msgid "Modify friends"
msgstr "修改好友"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:128
msgid ""
"Friend avatars are able to be modified in the same manner that :ref:`levels "
"<referrals/levels>` are modified. Only users with :guilabel:`Administrator` "
"rights for the **Recruitment** app can make modifications to friends. The "
"preconfigured friends can be seen and modified by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Referrals app --> Configuration --> Friends`. Each friend's "
"avatar appears in the :guilabel:`Dashboard Image` column, and the "
"corresponding name appears in the :guilabel:`Friend Name` column. The "
"default images are a motley group of hero characters, ranging from robots to"
" dogs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:135
msgid ""
"To modify a friend's dashboard image, thumbnail, name, or position, click on"
" an individual friend to open the referral friend form. Type the name in the"
" :guilabel:`Friend Name` field. The name is solely to differentiate the "
"friends in the configuration menu; the friend's name is not visible anywhere"
" else in the **Referrals** app."
msgstr ""
"按一下個別好友以開啟推薦好友表單，即可修改好友的儀表板圖片、縮圖、名稱或職位"
"。在 :guilabel:`好友名稱` 欄位輸入名稱。該名稱僅用於在設定選單中區分好友，不"
"會在 **推薦** 應用程式的其他任何地方顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:140
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Position` can be set to either :guilabel:`Front` or "
":guilabel:`Back`. This determines the position of the friend in relation to "
"the user's super hero avatar. Click the radio button next to the desired "
"selection, and the friend will appear either in front of or behind the "
"user's avatar when activated."
msgstr ""
"可將 :guilabel:`位置` 設為 :guilabel:`前方` 或 :guilabel:`後方`。這決定了好友"
"相對於用戶超級英雄頭像的位置。點擊所需選項旁邊的單選按鈕，啟用後好友便會顯示"
"在用戶頭像的前方或後方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:145
msgid ""
"If desired, both the thumbnail :guilabel:`Image` and the "
":guilabel:`Dashboard Image` can be modified. Hover over the image being "
"replaced to reveal an  :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon and "
":icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Clear)` icon. Click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`(Edit)` icon, and a file explorer window appears. Navigate to the"
" desired image file, then click :guilabel:`Open` to select it."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，縮圖 :guilabel:`圖片` 及 :guilabel:`儀表板圖片` 均可修改。將滑鼠游"
"標停留在要替換的圖片上，即可顯示 :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示"
"及 :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`（清除）` 圖示。點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示，隨即會出現檔案瀏覽器視窗。導覽至所需的圖片檔案，然"
"後點擊 :guilabel:`開啟` 以選取該檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:151
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:220
msgid ""
"To cancel any changes made, click the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(Discard "
"all changes)` icon to delete any changes, and revert to the original "
"content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:154
msgid "A friend form in edit mode."
msgstr "處於編輯模式的朋友表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:158
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:192
msgid ""
"It is not advised to edit the images. An image file must have a transparent "
"background in order for it to render properly. Only users with knowledge "
"about transparent images should attempt adjusting any images in the "
"**Referrals** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:162
msgid ""
"Once an image is changed and the friend is saved, it is **not possible** to "
"revert to the original image. To revert to the original image, the "
"**Referrals** app must be *uninstalled then reinstalled.*"
msgstr ""
"一旦更改圖片並儲存推薦朋友記錄，便 **無法** 還原為原本的圖片。如要還原為原本"
"的圖片，必須將 **推薦** 應用程式 *解除安裝然後重新安裝*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:169
msgid "Levels"
msgstr "級別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:171
msgid ""
"The **Referrals** app has preconfigured levels that are reflected in the "
"user's avatar on the **Referrals** dashboard. As a user refers potential "
"employees and earns points, they can *level up*, much like in a video game."
msgstr ""
"**推薦** 應用程式設有預先配置的等級，並會反映在用戶於 **推薦** 儀表板上的頭像"
"中。當用戶推薦潛在員工並賺取積分時，便可以像電子遊戲一樣 *升級*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:176
msgid ""
"Levels have no functional impact on the performance of the app. They are "
"solely used for the purpose of adding achievement tiers for participants to "
"aim for, gamifying referrals for the user."
msgstr ""
"等級對應用程式的運作效能沒有任何功能上的影響，純粹用於為參與者增設可追求的成"
"就階級，讓推薦計劃更具遊戲化體驗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:180
msgid ""
"The user's current level is displayed at the top of the main **Referrals** "
"app dashboard, directly beneath their photo, in a :guilabel:`Level: #` "
"format. In addition, a colored ring appears around the user's photo, "
"indicating how many points the user currently has, and how many additional "
"points they need to level up. The cyan colored portion of the ring "
"represents points earned, while the white colored portion represents the "
"points still needed before they can level up."
msgstr ""
"用戶目前的等級會顯示在 **推薦** 應用程式主儀表板的頂部，位於其相片正下方，格"
"式為 :guilabel:`等級：#`。此外，用戶的相片周圍會顯示一個彩色圓環，指出用戶目"
"前擁有的積分，以及升級還需要多少額外積分。圓環中的青色部分代表已獲得的積分，"
"而白色部分則代表距離升級仍需獲取的積分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:187
msgid "Modify levels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:189
msgid ""
"Only users with :guilabel:`Administrator` rights for the **Recruitment** app"
" can modify levels."
msgstr "只有具備 **招聘** 應用程式 :guilabel:`管理員` 權限的用戶才能修改級別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:196
msgid ""
"Once an image is changed and the level is saved, it is **not possible** to "
"revert to the original image. To revert to the original image, the "
"**Referrals** app must be *uninstalled then reinstalled.*"
msgstr ""
"一旦更改圖片並儲存級別，便 **無法** 還原為原有圖片。如要還原原有圖片，必須將 "
"**推薦** 應用程式 *解除安裝，然後重新安裝*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:200
msgid ""
"The preconfigured levels can be seen and modified by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Referrals app --> Configuration --> Levels`. Each avatar "
"appears in the :guilabel:`Image` column, and the corresponding level number "
"appears in the :guilabel:`Level Name` column. The default images are of Odoo"
" superheroes, and each level adds an additional element to their avatar, "
"such as capes and shields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:206
msgid ""
"To modify a level's image, name, or points required to reach the level, "
"click on an individual level in the list to open the level form, then make "
"modifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:209
msgid ""
"Type in the name (or number) of the level in the :guilabel:`Level Name` "
"field. What is entered is displayed beneath the user's photo on the main "
"dashboard when they reach that level. Enter the number of referral points "
"needed to reach that level in the :guilabel:`Requirements` field. The points"
" needed to level up are the total accumulated points earned over the "
"lifetime of the employee, not additional points from the previous level that"
" must be earned."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`等級名稱` 欄位中輸入該等級的名稱（或編號）。當用戶達到該等級時"
"，所輸入的內容會顯示在主儀表板的用戶相片下方。在 :guilabel:`要求` 欄位中輸入"
"達到該等級所需的推薦積分。升級所需的積分是指員工在職期間累積賺取的總積分，而"
"非從上一等級起計需額外賺取的積分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:215
msgid ""
"If desired, the :guilabel:`Image` can also be modified. Hover over the image"
" to reveal an :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon and a :icon:`fa-"
"trash-o` :guilabel:`(Clear)` icon. Click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`(Edit)` icon and a file explorer window appears. Navigate to the "
"desired image file, then click :guilabel:`Open` to select it."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，亦可修改 :guilabel:`圖片`。將滑鼠游標停留在圖片上，會顯示 "
":icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示及 :icon:`fa-trash-o` "
":guilabel:`（清除）` 圖示。按一下 :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示"
"後，便會開啟檔案總管視窗。瀏覽至所需的圖片檔案，然後按一下 :guilabel:`開啟` "
"以選擇該圖片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:223
msgid "A level form in edit mode."
msgstr "處於編輯模式的級別表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:227
msgid "Level up"
msgstr "升級"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:229
msgid ""
"Once enough points have been accumulated to level up, the circle around the "
"user's photo is completely filled in with a cyan color, a large image "
"stating :guilabel:`LEVEL UP!` appears above the photo, and the phrase "
":guilabel:`CLICK TO LEVEL UP!` appears beneath the user's photo and current "
"level."
msgstr ""
"當累積足夠積分以升級時，使用者相片周圍的圓圈會完全填滿青色，相片上方會顯示寫"
"有:guilabel:`升級！`的大型圖像，而使用者的相片及目前等級下方則會顯"
"示:guilabel:`按此升級！`字句。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:234
msgid ""
"Click on either the :guilabel:`LEVEL UP!` graphic, the user's photo, or the "
"text :guilabel:`CLICK TO LEVEL UP!` beneath the user's photo to level up the"
" user. The user's avatar changes to the current level, and the ring around "
"the photo is updated to indicate the current amount of points."
msgstr ""
"按一下:guilabel:`升級！`圖示、使用者的相片，或相片下方的:guilabel:`按此升級"
"！`文字，即可為使用者升級。使用者的頭像會變更為目前等級，相片周圍的圓環亦會更"
"新，以顯示目前的點數總額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:238
msgid ""
"Leveling up does not cost the user any points, the user only needs to earn "
"the specified amount of points required."
msgstr "升級不會消耗用戶的任何積分，用戶只需賺取指定的所需積分即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:241
msgid ""
"A 'Click to level up!' appears beneath the user's image, and a large 'Level up!' appears\n"
"above their image."
msgstr ""
"用戶頭像下方會顯示「點擊升級！」，而其頭像上方\n"
"會顯示大字的「升級了！」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:246
msgid ""
"Once a user has reached the highest configured level, they will continue to "
"accrue points that can be redeemed for rewards, but they are no longer able "
"to level up. The ring around their photo remains solid cyan."
msgstr ""
"當用戶達到所設定的最高級別後，仍可繼續累積積分以兌換獎賞，但無法再升級。其相"
"片周圍的圓環會保持為實心青色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:251
msgid ":doc:`referrals/share_jobs`"
msgstr ":doc:`referrals/share_jobs`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:252
msgid ":doc:`referrals/points`"
msgstr ":doc:`referrals/points`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:253
msgid ":doc:`referrals/rewards`"
msgstr ":doc:`referrals/rewards`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:254
msgid ":doc:`referrals/alerts`"
msgstr ":doc:`referrals/alerts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:255
msgid ":doc:`referrals/referral_analysis`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:256
msgid ":doc:`referrals/rewards_report`"
msgstr ":doc:`referrals/rewards_report`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:257
msgid ":doc:`referrals/points_report`"
msgstr ":doc:`referrals/points_report`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:5
msgid ""
"In the **Referrals** application, it is possible to post a message, also "
"referred to as an *alert*, at the top of the dashboard to share important "
"information with users."
msgstr ""
"在 **推薦** 應用程式中，你可於儀表板頂部發佈訊息（亦稱為 *提示*），與用戶分享"
"重要資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:8
msgid ""
"Alerts remain on the main **Referrals** dashboard for the specified amount "
"of time configured on the individual alert."
msgstr "提示會在**推薦**主儀表板上顯示，保留時間為個別提示所設定的指定時長。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:11
msgid "Two alert banners appear above the user's photo."
msgstr "用戶相片上方會顯示兩個警告橫幅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:17
msgid "Create an alert"
msgstr "建立警示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:19
msgid ""
"Only users with *Administrator* access rights for the **Recruitment** app "
"can create alerts. To add a new alert, navigate to the "
":menuselection:`Referrals app --> Configuration --> Alerts`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:22
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` to open a blank alert form. Enter the following "
"information on the form:"
msgstr "按一下:guilabel:`新增`以開啟空白警示表單。在表單上輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date From`: the date the alert starts. On this date, the alert is"
" visible on the dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date To`: the date the alert ends. After this date, the alert is "
"hidden from view."
msgstr ":guilabel:`結束日期`：提示結束的日期。在此日期之後，提示將會隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: the current company populates this field, by default. "
"To modify the company the alert should be displayed for, select the desired "
"company from the drop-down menu in this field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:31
msgid ""
"If this field remains blank, the alert is visible to everyone with access to"
" the **Referrals** app."
msgstr "如果此欄位留空，所有有權存取 **推薦** 應用程式的人員都能看見此提示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:34
msgid ""
"If a company is specified, only users within that company (who also have "
"access to the **Referrals** app) see the alert. This field **only** appears "
"in a multi-company database."
msgstr ""
"如指定了公司，只有該公司內（且同時擁有 **推薦** 應用程式存取權限）的使用者才"
"能看到此提示。此欄位 **僅** 在多公司資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Alert`: enter the text for the alert. This message appears inside"
" the alert banner on the main **Referrals** app dashboard."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`警示`：輸入警示文字。此訊息會顯示在 **推薦** 應用程式主儀表板的警"
"示橫額內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Click`: there are three options for the alert. Click the radio"
" button next to the desired selection. The options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`按一下時`：提示共有三個選項。按一下所需選項旁邊的圓形按鈕。選項包"
"括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Not Clickable`: the alert only displays text, there is no link to"
" click."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Go to All Jobs`: the alert contains a link that, when clicked, "
"navigates to the website with all the job positions that are currently "
"posted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Specify URL`: the alert contains a link to a specific URL that, "
"when clicked, navigates to that URL. When selected, a :guilabel:`URL` field "
"appears below the :guilabel:`On Click` section. Enter the desired URL in "
"that field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`指定網址`：提示訊息包含前往特定網址的連結，點擊後會跳轉至該網址。"
"選取後，:guilabel:`網址` 欄位會顯示在 :guilabel:`點擊時` 區段下方。請在該欄位"
"輸入所需的網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:48
msgid "An alert form completely filled in with all selections entered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:52
msgid "Notify users"
msgstr "通知用戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:54
msgid ""
"In addition to posting an alert on the **Referrals** app, users can be "
"contacted directly via email, instead of waiting for users to view the alert"
" when they open the **Referrals** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:57
msgid ""
"After :ref:`creating an alert <referrals/create-alert>`, click the "
":guilabel:`Send Mail` button above the alert form. This causes a "
":guilabel:`Send Mail` pop-up window to load."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`建立提示 <referrals/create-alert>` 後，點擊提示表單上方的 "
":guilabel:`傳送電郵` 按鈕。系統隨即會載入 :guilabel:`傳送電郵` 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:60
msgid ""
"The currently configured users populate the :guilabel:`User` field, and the "
":guilabel:`Subject` is populated with `New Alert In Referrals App`, by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，目前已設定的用戶會自動填入:guilabel:`用戶`欄位，而:guilabel:`主"
"題`則會填入 `New Alert In Referrals App`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:63
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Body` is populated with `A new alert has been added to the "
"Referrals app! Check your dashboard now!`, with the word `dashboard` linked "
"to the **Referrals** app dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:66
msgid ""
"Make any desired modifications to the email, then click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr "對電郵作出任何所需修改後，點擊 :guilabel:`傳送`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:69
msgid "Dismiss an alert"
msgstr "關閉提示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:71
msgid ""
"It is possible to dismiss an alert, if a user does not wish to see a "
"specific alert again."
msgstr "如果用戶不希望再次看到特定警示，可以關閉該警示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:73
msgid ""
"To dismiss an alert, click the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(remove)` icon on"
" the far-right side of the alert on the **Referrals** app dashboard, to "
"remove the alert."
msgstr ""
"要關閉提示，請點擊 **推薦** 應用程式儀表板上提示最右側的 :icon:`fa-times` "
":guilabel:`（移除）` 圖示，以移除該提示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/alerts.rst:76
msgid ""
"This prevents the alert from appearing again, even when opening the "
"**Referrals** app for the first time in a new session."
msgstr "這樣即使在新工作階段中首次開啟 **推薦** 應用程式，也不會再顯示該提示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:3
msgid "Referral points"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Referrals* application allows employees to earn points that are then "
"exchanged for :doc:`rewards <rewards>`."
msgstr "*推薦* 應用程式讓員工賺取積分，然後用以兌換 :doc:`獎賞 <rewards>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:8
msgid ""
"Current referral points can be viewed on the main *Referrals* app dashboard,"
" which appears when the application is opened, after the :ref:`onboarding "
"<referrals/onboarding>` slides have been viewed or skipped."
msgstr ""
"目前的推薦積分可於 *推薦* 應用程式的主儀表板上查看；開啟應用程式並瀏覽或略過 "
":ref:`入門導覽 <referrals/onboarding>` 投影片後，該儀表板便會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:12
msgid ""
"At the top, a summary of the user's current points is displayed. The left "
"side of the summary displays the :guilabel:`Total` points earned, and the "
"right side displays the points that are available :guilabel:`To Spend`."
msgstr ""
"頂部會顯示用戶目前的積分摘要。摘要左側顯示已賺取的:guilabel:`總計`積分，右側"
"則顯示:guilabel:`可使用`的積分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:16
msgid ""
"To view the various referral stages, and their respective earned points, "
"click one of the referral statuses beneath the avatar. The options are: "
":guilabel:`Referrals`, :guilabel:`Ongoing`, and :guilabel:`Successful`."
msgstr ""
"若要查看各個推薦階段及相應獲得的積分，請按一下頭像下方的其中一個推薦狀態。選"
"項包括：:guilabel:`推薦`、:guilabel:`進行中`及:guilabel:`成功`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:20
msgid ""
"The current number of referrals that are still active in the recruitment "
"pipeline, but have not yet been hired or refused, appear above "
":guilabel:`Ongoing`. The number of referrals that have been hired, appears "
"above :guilabel:`Successful`. The total number of referrals, both the "
"ongoing and successful referrals combined, appears above "
":guilabel:`Referrals`."
msgstr ""
"目前仍在招聘流程中且尚未獲聘或被拒絕的推薦人數，會顯示於 :guilabel:`進行中` "
"上方。已獲聘的推薦人數會顯示於 :guilabel:`成功` 上方。推薦總人數（包括進行中"
"及成功的推薦人數總和）則會顯示於 :guilabel:`推薦` 上方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:26
msgid "My referrals"
msgstr "我的推薦"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:28
msgid ""
"To see all the referrals, both ongoing and successful, click "
":guilabel:`Referrals`. The :guilabel:`My Referral` screen page displays all "
"referrals, with each individual referral housed in its own referral card."
msgstr ""
"如要查看所有進行中及已成功的推薦，請點擊 :guilabel:`推薦`。在 :guilabel:`我的"
"推薦` 頁面中會顯示所有推薦，每項推薦均顯示於各自的推薦卡片內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:32
msgid ""
"A successful referral displays a white :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Hired` "
"badge in the top-right corner of the card, along with a vertical green "
"stripe on the left-side of the card. Referrals that are in process have a "
"purple :guilabel:`In Progress` badge in the top-right corner."
msgstr ""
"成功推薦的卡片右上角會顯示白色的:icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`已聘用`標籤，卡片"
"左側亦會有一條綠色垂直條紋。正在處理中的推薦，其右上角則會顯示紫色"
"的:guilabel:`進行中`標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:36
msgid ""
"Each referral card lists the name of the applicant, the subject/application "
"title as it appears on the applicant card in the *Recruitment* app, the name"
" of the job position, the person responsible for filling the role (i.e. the "
"recruiter), and the points earned."
msgstr ""
"每張推薦卡片均會列出求職者姓名、*招聘* 應用程式中求職者卡片上顯示的主題/申請"
"標題、職位名稱、負責填補該職位的人員（即招聘人員），以及所獲得的積分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:40
msgid ""
"For referrals that have been hired, the selected avatar also appears on the "
"card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:42
msgid "Two referral cards, one hired and one in-progress."
msgstr "兩張推薦卡，一張為已聘用，另一張為進行中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:47
msgid "Points"
msgstr "積分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:49
msgid ""
"The points that can be earned for a referral are the same across all job "
"positions. Each stage of the recruitment process has corresponding points "
"assigned to it. The stages listed correspond to the stages configured in the"
" *Recruitment* application."
msgstr ""
"推薦員工可獲得的積分在所有職位中均相同。招聘流程的每個階段均設有相應的積分。"
"所列出的階段對應於 *招聘* 應用程式中配置的階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:53
msgid ""
"On each individual referral card, beneath the points earned, is a progress "
"bar that displays how many points have been earned out of the total possible"
" points that can be earned, if the applicant is hired."
msgstr ""
"在每張獨立的推薦卡片上，已獲分數下方設有一條進度列，顯示若申請人獲聘時，目前"
"已賺取的分數佔可賺取總分的比例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:57
msgid ""
"Beneath the bar chart is a list of the various recruitment stages, and the "
"points earned when the referral moves to that stage. If a stage has been "
"achieved, and the points have been earned, a green :icon:`fa-check` "
":guilabel:`(checkmark)` appears next to the stage."
msgstr ""
"棒形圖下方列出了各個招聘階段，以及推薦對象進入該階段時所獲得的分數。如果已達"
"成某個階段並獲得分數，該階段旁邊會出現一個綠色的 :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`"
"(剔號)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:62
msgid "The preconfigured point structure for referrals is as follows:"
msgstr "推薦的預設積分結構如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:64
msgid ":guilabel:`Initial Qualification`: 1 point"
msgstr ":guilabel:`初步資格`：1 分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:65
msgid ":guilabel:`First Interview`: 20 points"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:66
msgid ":guilabel:`Second Interview`: 9 points"
msgstr ":guilabel:`第二輪面試`：9 分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Contract Proposal`: 5 points"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Contract Signed`: 50 points"
msgstr ":guilabel:`已簽署合約`：50 分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points.rst:70
msgid ""
"The default total points earned for a referral that is hired is 85 points. "
"Modifications of the points earned for each stage are made in the "
"*Recruitment* application. Refer to the :ref:`Recruitment "
"<recruitment/modify-stages>` documentation to modify the points for each "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"獲聘用的推薦個案預設可賺取合共 85 分。如需修改各階段可賺取的分數，請在 *招"
"聘* 應用程式中進行。請參閱 :ref:`招聘 <recruitment/modify-stages>` 說明文件，"
"了解如何修改各階段的分數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:3
msgid "Points report"
msgstr "積分報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:5
msgid ""
"The points report in the **Referrals** app allows managers to view the total"
" :doc:`point <points>` contribution from employees, which can provide "
"insight into the most effective referrers."
msgstr ""
"在**推薦**應用程式中的積分報表，讓管理人員查看員工的總:doc:`積分 <points>`貢"
"獻，從而了解最有效的推薦人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:9
msgid ""
"Only users with *Administrator* rights for the **Recruitment** app have "
"access to the reporting features in the **Referrals** app."
msgstr ""
"只有具備 **招聘** 應用程式 *管理員* 權限的用戶，才可存取 **推薦** 應用程式中"
"的報告功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:12
msgid ""
"To access the *Points* report, navigate to :menuselection:`Referrals app -->"
" Reporting --> Points`. This loads the :guilabel:`Points` report in a "
"default list view, grouped by :guilabel:`User`, with the users listed in "
"alphabetical order, by first name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:16
msgid ""
"All rows are collapsed by default, displaying the :guilabel:`User` name, the"
" total number of individual entries logged for the user, and the total "
":guilabel:`Points` they have earned."
msgstr ""
"預設會摺疊所有行，顯示 :guilabel:`用戶` 名稱、為該用戶記錄的個別項目總數，以"
"及其獲得的總 :guilabel:`積分`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:19
msgid ""
"Click on a row to expand the entries for that user. Each line displays the "
":guilabel:`Applicant`, the :guilabel:`Stage` the applicant reached, and the "
"corresponding :guilabel:`Points` earned for the stage. The displayed "
":guilabel:`Points` appear in green if the user earned points for the stage, "
"and appear in black if no points are received for the stage."
msgstr ""
"按一下其中一行，即可展開該使用者的記錄。每一行都會顯示 :guilabel:`應徵者`、應"
"徵者達到的 :guilabel:`階段`，以及在該階段獲得的對應 :guilabel:`積分`。如果使"
"用者在該階段獲得積分，顯示的 :guilabel:`積分` 會以綠色顯示；如果未在該階段獲"
"得任何積分，則會以黑色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:25
msgid ""
"Stages that do not earn referral points still appear on the list, if the "
"applicant reached that stage. In this example, applicants who reach the "
":guilabel:`New` stage do *not* receive any referral points, and zero "
"(:guilabel:`0`) appears in the :guilabel:`Points` column, in black."
msgstr ""
"如果應徵者曾到達某個不會賺取推薦積分的階段，該階段仍會顯示在清單上。在此範例"
"中，到達 :guilabel:`新增` 階段的應徵者 *不會* 獲得任何推薦積分，而零"
"（:guilabel:`0`）會以黑色顯示在 :guilabel:`積分` 欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:29
msgid ""
"Individual points earned by the user Bob Smith for all their referrals."
msgstr "使用者 Bob Smith 透過所有推薦所賺取的個人積分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:33
msgid "Use case: most effective referrers"
msgstr "使用案例：最有效的推薦人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:35
msgid ""
"One way to use the :guilabel:`Points` report is to assess which users are "
"referring successful applicants who become employees. This is done by "
"modifying the :guilabel:`Points` report to show only points earned from the "
":guilabel:`Contract Signed` stage."
msgstr ""
"使用:guilabel:`積分`報表的一種方式，是評估哪些用戶成功推薦應徵者並使其成為員"
"工。做法是修改:guilabel:`積分`報表，僅顯示在:guilabel:`已簽署合約`階段賺取的"
"積分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:39
msgid ""
"To view only the successfully hired referrals, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Referrals app --> Reporting --> Points`. Click into the "
"search box, and click :guilabel:`Custom Filter...` in the :icon:`fa-filter` "
":guilabel:`Filters` column. This opens a *Custom Filter* pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"如要僅檢視已成功獲聘的推薦人選，請前往 :menuselection:`推薦應用程式 --> 報"
"告 --> 積分`。按一下搜尋框，然後按一下 :guilabel:`自訂篩選條件...`（位於 "
":icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 一欄內）。此操作會開啟*自訂篩選條件*彈"
"出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:43
msgid ""
"By default, the first field is populated with :guilabel:`Stage`, and the "
"middle field is populated with :guilabel:`is equal to`. Using the drop-down "
"menu in the last field, select :guilabel:`Contract Signed`, then click the "
":guilabel:`Search` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:47
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Points` report now displays only the successful referrals who"
" were hired. The user with both the highest number of entries next to their "
"name, and the highest number of points in the :guilabel:`Points`, is the "
"most successful referrer."
msgstr ""
"現在，:guilabel:`積分` 報表只會顯示已獲聘用的成功推薦人選。名稱旁的紀錄數量最"
"多，且在 :guilabel:`積分` 中獲得最高分數的使用者，即為最成功的推薦人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:52
msgid ""
"In this example, it can be determined that :guilabel:`Joe Plumb` is the most"
" successful referrer, with three successful referrals, for a total of "
":guilabel:`150` points."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/points_report.rst:55
msgid ""
"The points report filtered to only show points earned from the Contract "
"Signed stage."
msgstr "已篩選的積分報表，只顯示在「已簽署合約」階段賺取的積分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Employees referral analysis"
msgstr "員工推薦分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Employees Referral Analysis* report in the **Referrals** app helps "
"recruiters and managers learn where applicants are applying from, when "
"referred by a current employee. Additionally, the *Employees Referral "
"Analysis* report shows the number of applicants hired, refused, and still in"
" the recruitment pipeline, for each medium."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:11
msgid ""
"Only users with *Administrator* rights for the **Recruitment** app have "
"access to the reporting feature in the **Referrals** app."
msgstr ""
"只有擁有 **招聘** 應用程式 *管理員* 權限的用戶，方可存取 **推薦** 應用程式中"
"的報告功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:15
msgid "Employees referral analysis report"
msgstr "員工推薦分析報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:17
msgid ""
"To access the *Employees Referral Analysis* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Referrals app --> Reporting --> Referral Analysis`. This "
"loads the :guilabel:`Employees Referral Analysis` report in a default "
":icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`Bar Chart`."
msgstr ""
"如要存取 *員工推薦分析* 報表，請前往 :menuselection:`推薦應用程式 --> 報"
"表 --> 推薦分析`。系統會載入 :guilabel:`員工推薦分析` 報表，預設顯示為 "
":icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`棒形圖`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:21
msgid ""
"The graph is presented in a :icon:`fa-database` :guilabel:`Stacked` view, "
"with the number of referrals on the y-axis, and the source, referred to as "
"the :guilabel:`Medium`, of the applicant (e.g.: *Facebook*, *LinkedIn*, "
"*Email*, etc.) on the x-axis. If a medium does **not** appear on the report,"
" that indicates there are no referrals from that particular medium."
msgstr ""
"圖表以 :icon:`fa-database` :guilabel:`堆疊` 檢視方式顯示，y 軸為推薦人數，x "
"軸為應徵者的來源，即所謂的 :guilabel:`媒體`（例如"
"：*Facebook*、*LinkedIn*、*電郵* 等）。若某個媒體 **沒有** 出現在報表上，則表"
"示該特定媒體沒有任何推薦記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:26
msgid ""
"Referral amounts for all stages are displayed, including :guilabel:`Not "
"Hired` (refused), :guilabel:`In Progress`, and :guilabel:`Hired`. The "
"default filter is set to the current month."
msgstr ""
"系統會顯示所有階段的推薦金額，包括:guilabel:`未獲聘`（已拒絕）、:guilabel:`進"
"行中`及:guilabel:`已獲聘`。預設篩選器設為本月。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:29
msgid ""
"Hover over any bar to view a popover containing specific data for that "
"particular bar."
msgstr "將滑鼠懸停在任何長條上，即可查看包含該特定長條詳細數據的彈出式提示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:31
msgid ""
"In this view, it is clear which :guilabel:`Medium` is the most successful."
msgstr "在此檢視中，可清楚看出哪個 :guilabel:`媒介` 最成功。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:34
msgid ""
"In this example, both :guilabel:`Email` and :guilabel:`LinkedIn` are the "
"mediums with the most referrals, but :guilabel:`Email` has the most "
"referrals that were hired."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，:guilabel:`電郵` 和 :guilabel:`LinkedIn` 都是帶來最多推薦的媒介，"
"但透過 :guilabel:`電郵` 獲得的推薦中，獲聘人數最多。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:37
msgid "The default report in the Referrals app."
msgstr "推薦應用程式中的預設報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:41
msgid "Use case: hired referrals"
msgstr "應用案例：已獲聘的推薦人選"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:43
msgid ""
"One way to use the reporting feature is to assess which employees are "
"referring the highest quality applicants. This is done by examining how many"
" of their referrals go on to become employees."
msgstr ""
"使用報告功能的其中一個方式，是評估哪些員工推薦了最優質的應徵者，方法是檢視他"
"們推薦的應徵者中有多少人最終成為員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:46
msgid ""
"In this example, data is examined to determined which employee has the "
"highest number of hired referrals for the current year."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:49
msgid ""
"To view this information, first click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` "
":guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon in the upper-right corner. Next, remove the current"
" filter in the search bar."
msgstr ""
"要查看此資料，請先按一下右上角的 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`（樞紐分析"
"）` 圖示，然後移除搜尋欄中的現有篩選條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:52
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` in the search bar "
"to reveal a drop-down menu. Click :guilabel:`Date` in the :icon:`fa-filter` "
":guilabel:`Filters` column, revealing a drop-down menu of available time "
"periods, and click the current year (in this example, :guilabel:`2024`), "
"then click away to close the window."
msgstr ""
"點擊搜尋列中的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`（向下箭頭）` 以顯示下拉式選"
"單。點擊 :guilabel:`日期`（位於 :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 欄中）"
"，隨即會顯示可用時間範圍的下拉式選單，然後點擊目前年份（在此範例中為 "
":guilabel:`2024`），最後點擊其他位置以關閉視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:57
msgid ""
"Next, click the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` button in the "
"upper-left corner, then deselect :guilabel:`Earned Points` and "
":guilabel:`Employee Referral Refused` to hide those metrics. Click anywhere "
"on the screen to close the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"接著，按一下左上角的 :guilabel:`計量` :icon:`fa-caret-down` 按鈕，然後取消選"
"取 :guilabel:`已賺取積分` 及 :guilabel:`已拒絕的員工推薦` 以隱藏這些指標。按"
"一下螢幕上的任何位置即可關閉下拉式選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:61
msgid ""
"The information displayed shows how many total applicants each employee "
"referred, and how many of those applicants were hired, for the current year."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:64
msgid ""
"In this example, it can be determined that :guilabel:`Bob Wilson` is the "
"most successful referrer, with three hired referrals, and nine total "
"referred applicants. Additionally, :guilabel:`Mitchell Admin` has the lowest"
" performance in terms of referrals, as he has only one applicant, and no "
"hires."
msgstr ""
"在此例子中，可以確定 :guilabel:`Bob Wilson` 是最成功的推薦人，共有三名獲聘的"
"被推薦人，以及九名總推薦申請人。此外，:guilabel:`Mitchell Admin` 在推薦方面的"
"表現最低，因為他只有一名申請人，且無人獲聘。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:68
msgid ""
"This information can be helpful to the recruitment team, so they can "
"determine the most active referrers in the company, and who is the most "
"successful in terms of hires."
msgstr ""
"這些資訊有助招聘團隊了解公司內最活躍的推薦人，以及哪位推薦人成功促成最多聘用"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:71
msgid ""
"The customized report showing which employees have the most referrals and "
"hires."
msgstr "顯示哪些員工擁有最多推薦及聘用紀錄的自訂報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:75
msgid ""
"The pivot table can be inserted into a new or existing :doc:`spreadsheet "
"<../../productivity/spreadsheet/insert>`, if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:78
msgid ""
"To do so, click the :guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` button right above the"
" chart. A pop-up window appears, asking which spreadsheet to insert the "
"pivot chart into. Select the desired spreadsheet or dashboard from the "
"presented options. Alternatively, select :guilabel:`Blank Spreadsheet` to "
"create a new one."
msgstr ""
"為此，請點擊圖表正上方的 :guilabel:`插入至試算表` 按鈕。畫面隨即顯示彈出視窗"
"，詢問要將樞紐圖表插入至哪個試算表。從顯示的選項中選擇所需的試算表或儀表板；"
"或選擇 :guilabel:`空白試算表` 以建立新的試算表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:83
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm`, and the selected spreadsheet loads, with the new "
"table in it."
msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`確認`，系統隨即載入所選試算表，並包含新增的表格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/referral_analysis.rst:85
msgid ""
"The spreadsheet is stored in the **Documents** application. This application"
" **must** be installed to use the :guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` option."
msgstr ""
"試算表儲存在 **文件** 應用程式中。您 **必須** 安裝此應用程式，方可使用 "
":guilabel:`插入至試算表` 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:3
msgid "Rewards"
msgstr "獎勵"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:5
msgid ""
"After employees have successfully earned referral points, they can exchange "
"their points by purchasing rewards in Odoo's **Referrals** application. "
"Rewards **must** be :ref:`created and configured <referrals/create>` before "
"employees can :ref:`redeem points for rewards <referrals/redeem>`."
msgstr ""
"員工成功賺取推薦積分後，可在 Odoo 的 **推薦** 應用程式中購買獎賞以兌換積分。"
"獎賞 **必須** 先經 :ref:`建立及設定 <referrals/create>`，員工才能 :ref:`使用"
"積分兌換獎賞 <referrals/redeem>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:13
msgid "Create rewards"
msgstr "建立獎勵"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:15
msgid ""
"Rewards are the only configurations needed when setting up the **Referrals**"
" application."
msgstr "設定 **推薦** 應用程式時，只需配置獎勵即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:18
msgid ""
"Only users with :doc:`Administrator rights "
"<../../general/users/access_rights>` for the **Recruitment** application can"
" create or modify rewards."
msgstr ""
"只有擁有**招聘**應用程式:doc:`管理員權限 <../../general/users/access_rights>"
"`的使用者，才可以建立或修改獎勵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:21
msgid ""
"To add rewards, navigate to :menuselection:`Referrals app --> Configuration "
"--> Rewards`. Click :guilabel:`New`, and a reward form loads. Enter the "
"following information on the form:"
msgstr ""
"要新增獎勵，請前往 :menuselection:`推薦應用程式 --> 配置 --> 獎勵`。點擊 "
":guilabel:`新增`，系統便會載入獎勵表單。請在表單上輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Name`: Enter the name as it should appear for the reward."
" This field is required."
msgstr ":guilabel:`產品名稱`：輸入獎賞所顯示的名稱。此欄位為必填。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cost`: Enter the amount of points required to redeem the reward."
msgstr ":guilabel:`成本`：輸入兌換該獎勵所需的積分數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company the reward is configured for using "
"the drop-down menu. If a reward is available for multiple companies, each "
"company **must** configure a reward for their specific company. This field "
"**only** appears in multi-company databases; if this field appears, it is "
"required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:33
msgid ""
"A database set up for three different companies offers a gift card as a "
"reward. In the database, there are three separate rewards listed for a gift "
"card, one for each of the three companies."
msgstr ""
"一個為三間不同公司設定的資料庫提供禮品卡作為獎勵。在該資料庫中，禮品卡分別列"
"出了三個獨立的獎勵，每間公司各一個。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gift Responsible`: Select the person responsible for procuring "
"and delivering the reward to the recipient using the drop-down menu. This "
"person is alerted when the reward is bought in the **Referrals** app, so "
"they know when to deliver the reward to the recipient."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`禮品負責人`：使用下拉式選單選擇負責採購並將獎勵派發給收件人的人員"
"。當在 **推薦** 應用程式中購買獎勵時，此人員會收到通知，以便得知何時向收件人"
"派發獎勵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Photo`: Add a photo of the reward, which appears on the rewards "
"page."
msgstr ":guilabel:`相片`：新增獎賞相片，相片會顯示於獎賞頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description` tab: Type in the description for the reward. This is"
" visible on the reward card, beneath the title. This field is required."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`描述` 分頁：輸入獎勵的描述。此內容會顯示在獎勵卡標題下方。此欄位為"
"必填。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:43
msgid "A filled out reward form with all details entered."
msgstr "已填妥所有詳細資料的獎勵表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:47
msgid ""
"It is advised to enter a :guilabel:`Cost` and add a :guilabel:`Photo`. If a "
"cost is not entered, the default cost is listed as zero, which would list "
"the reward as free in the reward shop. If a photo is not selected, a "
"placeholder icon is displayed on the rewards page."
msgstr ""
"建議輸入:guilabel:`費用`並新增:guilabel:`相片`。如果未輸入費用，預設費用會列"
"為零，該獎勵會在獎勵商店中顯示為免費。如果未選擇相片，獎勵頁面會顯示一個佔位"
"圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:54
msgid "Redeem rewards"
msgstr "兌換獎賞"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:56
msgid ""
"In order to redeem a reward, points must be earned. These points can then be"
" used to purchase a reward."
msgstr "如要兌換獎勵，必須先賺取積分。這些積分隨後可用作購買獎勵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:59
msgid ""
"To purchase a reward, click the :guilabel:`Rewards` button on the main "
":guilabel:`Referrals` dashboard. All the configured rewards are listed in "
"individual reward cards."
msgstr ""
"要購買獎勵，請按一下 :guilabel:`獎勵` 按鈕，該按鈕位於主 :guilabel:`推薦` 儀"
"表板上。所有已設定的獎勵均會顯示在各自的獎勵卡片中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:62
msgid ""
"The required point amount needed to purchase a reward is listed in the top-"
"right corner of the card."
msgstr "購買獎勵所需的積分數量會顯示在卡片的右上角。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:64
msgid ""
"If the user has enough points to purchase a reward, a :icon:`fa-shopping-"
"basket` :guilabel:`Buy` button appears at the bottom of the reward card. If "
"they do not have enough points for a reward, the reward card displays "
":guilabel:`You need another (x) points to buy this`, instead of a :icon:`fa-"
"shopping-basket` :guilabel:`Buy` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:69
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-shopping-basket` :guilabel:`Buy` button on a reward to "
"purchase it. A *Confirmation* pop-up window appears, asking if the user is "
"sure they want to purchase the reward. Click :guilabel:`Ok` to purchase the "
"item, or :guilabel:`Cancel` to close the window, and cancel the purchase."
msgstr ""
"按一下獎賞上的 :icon:`fa-shopping-basket` :guilabel:`購買` 按鈕，即可購買該獎"
"賞。此時會顯示 *確認* 彈出式視窗，詢問用戶是否確定要購買該獎賞。按一下 "
":guilabel:`確定` 即可購買項目，或按一下 :guilabel:`取消` 關閉視窗並取消購買。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:74
msgid ""
"After :guilabel:`Ok` is clicked, the pop-up window closes, and the points "
"used to purchase the reward are subtracted from the user's available points."
" The rewards presented are now updated to reflect the user's current "
"available points."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards.rst:78
msgid ""
"Buy button appears below a mug and backpack reward, while the bicycle reward states how\n"
"many more reward points are needed to redeem."
msgstr ""
"「購買」按鈕會顯示在馬克杯及背囊獎勵下方，而單車獎勵則會顯示尚欠\n"
"多少獎勵積分才可兌換。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards_report.rst:3
msgid "Rewards report"
msgstr "獎勵報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards_report.rst:5
msgid ""
"In the **Referrals** app, it is possible to view a report of the rewards "
"that employees have redeemed. This can help determine the most popular "
"rewards and which rewards employees do not request."
msgstr ""
"在**推薦**應用程式中，您可以查看員工已兌換獎賞的報告。這有助於了解最受歡迎的"
"獎賞，以及哪些獎賞沒有員工申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards_report.rst:9
msgid ""
"Incentivizing employees to recruit highly qualified applicants is aided by "
"offering :doc:`rewards <rewards>` that entice employees to earn points. "
"Additionally, it can be helpful for the **Referrals** app administrator to "
"see what rewards are popular, to ensure a stock of highly sought-after "
"rewards is always available."
msgstr ""
"提供可吸引員工賺取積分的 :doc:`獎賞 <rewards>`，有助激勵員工招募高質素應徵者"
"。此外，**推薦** 應用程式管理員亦可查看哪些獎賞較受歡迎，以確保熱門獎賞經常備"
"有充足存貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards_report.rst:15
msgid "Reward analysis"
msgstr "獎勵分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards_report.rst:17
msgid ""
"To view the *Reward Analysis* report, navigate to :menuselection:`Referrals "
"app --> Reporting --> Rewards`. This opens the :guilabel:`Reward Analysis` "
"report in a default stacked (:icon:`fa-database`) bar chart (:icon:`fa-bar-"
"chart`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards_report.rst:21
msgid ""
"The X-axis is populated with the various rewards, while the Y-axis is "
"populated with the number of rewards redeemed by employees. All employees "
"who have redeemed rewards appear in their own identifying color."
msgstr ""
"X 軸顯示各種獎勵，而 Y 軸則顯示僱員兌換獎勵的數量。所有曾兌換獎勵的僱員均會以"
"各自的識別顏色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards_report.rst:25
msgid ""
"This report shows that :guilabel:`Chocolate Covered Nuts` are the most "
"desired reward, with 23 distributed to employees. It can also be determined "
"that employees do not often request the :guilabel:`Sweatshirt`, "
":guilabel:`Backpack`, :guilabel:`Tablet`, and :guilabel:`Electric Bicycle`; "
"therefore, inventory for those items does not need to be as high as the "
":guilabel:`Chocolate Covered Nuts`."
msgstr ""
"此報告顯示 :guilabel:`朱古力果仁` 是最受歡迎的獎賞，已向員工派發 23 份。此外"
"，亦可看出員工較少兌換 :guilabel:`衛衣`、:guilabel:`背囊`、:guilabel:`平板電"
"腦` 及 :guilabel:`電動單車`；因此，這些項目的庫存無需像 :guilabel:`朱古力果"
"仁` 那樣高。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/rewards_report.rst:31
msgid ""
"The rewards report showing the chocolate covered nuts as the most requested."
msgstr "顯示朱古力果仁為最受歡迎項目的獎勵報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:3
msgid "Share job positions"
msgstr "分享職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo **Referrals**, users can earn referral points by sharing job "
"positions with potential applicants. Individual job positions can be shared "
"in several ways: via :ref:`email <referrals/email>`, :ref:`SMS "
"<referrals/sms>`, :ref:`WhatsApp <referrals/whatsapp>`, a :ref:`tracking "
"link <referrals/link>`, and various :ref:`social media platforms "
"<referrals/social>`."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo **推薦** 中，用戶可透過向潛在應徵者分享職位空缺賺取推薦積分。個別職位"
"可透過多種方式分享：經由 :ref:`電郵 <referrals/email>`、:ref:`短訊 "
"<referrals/sms>`、:ref:`WhatsApp <referrals/whatsapp>`、:ref:`追蹤連結 "
"<referrals/link>`，以及各種 :ref:`社交媒體平台 <referrals/social>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:10
msgid ""
"Additionally, *all* job positions can be :ref:`shared via email "
"<referrals/email-jobs>`, instead of sharing individual job positions."
msgstr ""
"此外，你亦可:ref:`透過電郵分享 <referrals/email-jobs>`*全部*職位空缺，而無需"
"逐一分享個別職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:14
msgid ""
"Sharing jobs can **only** occur after :ref:`onboarding "
"<referrals/onboarding>` slides have been viewed or skipped."
msgstr ""
"**只有**在檢視或跳過:ref:`新手導覽 <referrals/onboarding>`投影片後，才可分享"
"職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:20
msgid "View all jobs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:22
msgid ""
"To see all job positions that are actively recruiting candidates, click the "
":guilabel:`View Jobs` button on the main **Referrals** app dashboard. This "
"presents all job positions, with each job presented with its own card."
msgstr ""
"如要查看所有正在積極招聘候選人的職位，請點擊 **推薦** 應用程式主儀表板上的 "
":guilabel:`檢視職位` 按鈕。這會顯示所有職位，每個職位均會以獨立卡片顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:26
msgid ""
"The View Jobs screen, displaying all current open job positions. All information is\n"
"displayed on the card."
msgstr ""
"「查看職位」畫面顯示目前所有空缺職位。所有資訊均\n"
"顯示在卡片上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:30
msgid "Each job position card contains the following information:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:32
msgid ""
"The title of the job position. This information is taken from the *Job "
"Position* field of the job form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:34
msgid ""
"The number of :guilabel:`Open Positions` being recruited. This information "
"is taken from the *Expected New Employees* field of the *Recruitment* tab of"
" the job form."
msgstr ""
"正在招聘的 :guilabel:`空缺職位` 數目。此資訊取自職位表單 *招聘* 分頁中的 *預"
"計新員工* 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:36
msgid ""
"The total :doc:`points <points>` a user earns when the referred applicant is"
" hired for the position."
msgstr "當獲推薦的應徵者獲聘擔任該職位時，用戶所賺取的總 :doc:`積分 <points>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:38
msgid ""
"The job description detailing the job position. This information is taken "
"from the *Job Position* tab of the job form."
msgstr "詳述該職位的職位描述。此資料取自職位表單中的 *職位* 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:42
msgid ""
"Only published job positions are visible in the **Referrals** app. To check "
"which job positions are published or not, refer to the "
":doc:`../recruitment/new_job` documentation."
msgstr ""
"只有已發佈的職位才會在 **推薦** 應用程式中顯示。要查看哪些職位已發佈或尚未發"
"佈，請參閱 :doc:`../recruitment/new_job` 文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:46
msgid "Share an individual job"
msgstr "分享個別職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:48
msgid ""
"To share an individual job position, first click the :guilabel:`View Jobs` "
"button on the main **Referrals** app dashboard. This presents a list of all "
"currently published jobs. From this page, an individual job can be shared "
"with someone using one of the methods below."
msgstr ""
"如要分享個別職位，請先在 **員工推薦** 應用程式主儀表板上點擊 :guilabel:`檢視"
"職位` 按鈕。畫面會顯示所有目前公開發佈的職位列表。在此頁面，你可以使用以下其"
"中一種方法，將個別職位分享給其他人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:57
msgid ""
"To share an individual job position via email, click the :icon:`fa-"
"envelope-o` :guilabel:`Send Email` button on the specific job position card."
" A preconfigured email template appears in a pop-up window, using the "
":guilabel:`Send Job Offer by Mail` template. Enter the recipient's email "
"address in the :guilabel:`Email` field."
msgstr ""
"如要透過電郵分享個別職位，請點擊指定職位卡片上的 :icon:`fa-envelope-o` "
":guilabel:`發送電郵` 按鈕。彈出視窗會顯示預先設定的電郵範本，並使用 "
":guilabel:`透過電郵發送工作邀約` 範本。請在 :guilabel:`電郵` 欄位中輸入收件人"
"的電郵地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:62
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Subject` and :guilabel:`Body` are populated using a default "
"template. The :guilabel:`Subject` `Job for you` is present, by default, but "
"can be modified, if desired."
msgstr ""
"系統會使用預設範本填入 :guilabel:`主旨` 及 :guilabel:`內文`。預設的 "
":guilabel:`主旨` 為 `Job for you`，如有需要可自行修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:65
msgid ""
"The specific title of the job position populates the *Job Position* "
"placeholder in the email body. The `See Job Offer` text in the email body is"
" an individualized tracking link to the specific job position listed on the "
"website."
msgstr ""
"電郵內文的 *職位* 預留位置會自動填入該職位的具體名稱。電郵內文的 `查看聘書` "
"文字是個人化的追蹤連結，會指向網站上列出的該特定職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:69
msgid ""
"When the prospective employee receives the email, the link sends them to the"
" job position page, where they can apply for the position, and the person "
"who referred them is tracked in the **Referrals** app."
msgstr ""
"潛在員工收到電郵後，點擊連結即可前往職位頁面申請該職位，而推薦人亦會在 **推"
"薦** 應用程式中被追蹤記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:73
msgid ""
"If desired, add any text or closing salutation to the email body. When all "
"edits have been made, click :guilabel:`Send Mail` to send the email, or "
"click :guilabel:`Cancel` to close the pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:77
msgid "Referral email pop-up window with the email message inside it."
msgstr "載有電郵訊息的推薦電郵彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:85
msgid ""
"To share an individual job position with someone via SMS (text message), "
"click the :icon:`fa-mobile` :guilabel:`Send SMS` button on the specific job "
"position card. A preconfigured :guilabel:`Send Job Offer by SMS` pop-up "
"window appears. Enter the recipient's mobile number in the "
":guilabel:`Recipient` field."
msgstr ""
"如要透過短訊（文字訊息）與他人分享個別職位，請按一下指定職位卡片上的 "
":icon:`fa-mobile` :guilabel:`發送短訊` 按鈕。系統會顯示預先設定的 "
":guilabel:`透過短訊發送職位空缺` 彈出式視窗。請在 :guilabel:`收件人` 欄位中輸"
"入收件人的手提電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:90
msgid ""
"Modify the prepopulated :guilabel:`Body` message, if desired, then click the"
" :guilabel:`Send SMS` button to send the message, or click "
":guilabel:`Cancel` to close the pop-up window and cancel the message."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可修改預填的 :guilabel:`內文` 訊息，然後按一下 :guilabel:`傳送短"
"訊` 按鈕傳送訊息，或按一下 :guilabel:`取消` 以關閉彈出視窗並取消傳送。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:102
msgid "Send WhatsApp"
msgstr "傳送 WhatsApp"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:104
msgid ""
"To share an individual job position with someone via WhatsApp, click the "
":icon:`fa-whatsapp` :guilabel:`Send WhatsApp` button on the specific job "
"position card. A preconfigured :guilabel:`Send Job Offer by WhatsApp` pop-up"
" window appears. Enter the recipient's mobile number in the "
":guilabel:`Recipient` field."
msgstr ""
"若要透過 WhatsApp 與他人分享個別職位空缺，請按一下特定職位卡上的 :icon:`fa-"
"whatsapp` :guilabel:`傳送 WhatsApp` 按鈕。系統會顯示預先設定的:guilabel:`透"
"過 WhatsApp 傳送職位邀請`彈出視窗。請在:guilabel:`收件人`欄位中輸入收件人的手"
"機號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:109
msgid ""
"Modify the default message, if desired, then click the :guilabel:`Send "
"WhatsApp` button to send the message, or click :guilabel:`Cancel` to close "
"the pop-up window and cancel the message."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可修改預設訊息，然後點擊 :guilabel:`發送 WhatsApp` 按鈕發送訊息；或"
"點擊 :guilabel:`取消` 關閉彈出視窗並取消訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:113
msgid ""
"To send WhatsApp messages, WhatsApp must be configured in Odoo. For more "
"information, refer to the :doc:`../../productivity/whatsapp` documentation."
msgstr ""
"如要傳送 WhatsApp 訊息，必須先在 Odoo 中配置 WhatsApp。詳情請參閱 :doc:`../"
"../productivity/whatsapp` 文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:117
msgid "Job page"
msgstr "職位頁面"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:119
msgid ""
"To see all the details for a job position, click the :icon:`fa-globe` "
":guilabel:`Job Page` button on the specific card. Doing so opens the job "
"position webpage in a new browser tab. This is what an applicant sees before"
" applying for a position."
msgstr ""
"要查看職位的所有詳細資料，請點擊特定卡片上的 :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`職位"
"頁面` 按鈕。系統會在新的瀏覽器分頁中開啟該職位網頁，即應徵者在申請職位前看到"
"的畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:126
msgid "Share now"
msgstr "立即分享"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:128
msgid ""
"To share the job position with a customized tracking link, click the "
":icon:`fa-chain` :guilabel:`Share Now` button to copy the link. A pop-up "
"window in the corner of the computer loads, stating `Referral link: (link to"
" Job Position) has been copied to clipboard`."
msgstr ""
"要使用自訂追蹤連結分享職位，請按一下 :icon:`fa-chain` :guilabel:`立即分享` 按"
"鈕複製連結。電腦角落會顯示一個彈出式視窗，提示`推薦連結：（職位連結）已複製到"
"剪貼簿`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:132
msgid "Next, share the link with the prospective employee."
msgstr "接著，將連結分享給準員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:137
msgid "Share a job via social media"
msgstr "透過社交媒體分享職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:139
msgid ""
"Other than sending an email, SMS, WhatsApp message, or sharing a tracking "
"link, job positions can be shared via social media platforms (:ref:`Facebook"
" <referrals/facebook>`, :ref:`X <referrals/x>`, and :ref:`LinkedIn "
"<referrals/linkedin>`. On each job position card are the three corresponding"
" social media icons that can be used to share the job position, keeping "
"track of applicants in the **Referrals** application."
msgstr ""
"除了發送電郵、短訊、WhatsApp 訊息或分享追蹤連結外，亦可透過社交媒體平台"
"（:ref:`Facebook <referrals/facebook>`、:ref:`X <referrals/x>` 及 "
":ref:`LinkedIn <referrals/linkedin>`）分享職位空缺。每張職位空缺卡片上均有三"
"個對應的社交媒體圖示，可用作分享職位，並在 **推薦** 應用程式中追蹤應徵者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:148
msgid "Facebook"
msgstr "Facebook"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:150
msgid ""
"To share the job position using Facebook, click the :icon:`fa-facebook` "
":guilabel:`Share Now` button."
msgstr ""
"如要透過 Facebook 分享職位空缺，請點擊 :icon:`fa-facebook` :guilabel:`立即分"
"享` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:153
msgid ""
"If the user is already logged into Facebook, when the :icon:`fa-facebook` "
":guilabel:`Share Now` button is clicked, Facebook loads in a new tab, where "
"a :guilabel:`Create post` pop-up window loads with the tracking link "
"attached."
msgstr ""
"如用戶已登入 Facebook，點擊 :icon:`fa-facebook` :guilabel:`立即分享` 按鈕後，"
"系統會在新分頁載入 Facebook，並開啟附有追蹤連結的 :guilabel:`建立帖文` 彈出視"
"窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:157
msgid ""
"Type in any additional information to add to the post, then share the job "
"position using the available options in Facebook."
msgstr "輸入要加到帖文的任何額外資料，然後使用 Facebook 提供的選項分享該職位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:161
msgid ""
"To share the job via Facebook,first, the user **must** be logged into "
"Facebook. If the user is *not* already logged in, when the :icon:`fa-"
"facebook` :guilabel:`Share Now` button is clicked, a new tab loads, stating "
"`You are not logged in. Please login and try again.`"
msgstr ""
"如要透過 Facebook 分享職位，用戶首先 **必須** 登入 Facebook。如果用戶 *尚未* "
"登入，點擊 :icon:`fa-facebook` :guilabel:`立即分享` 按鈕時，系統會載入一個新"
"分頁，顯示 `You are not logged in. Please login and try again.`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:168
msgid "X (formerly Twitter)"
msgstr "X（前稱 Twitter）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:170
msgid ""
"To share a job position on X, click the :guilabel:`X Share Now` button."
msgstr "要在 X 上分享職位空缺，請點擊 :guilabel:`立即分享至 X` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:172
msgid ""
"If the user is already signed-in to X, when the :guilabel:`X Share Now` "
"button is clicked, an X page loads in a new tab with a pre-populated message"
" ready to post, in a draft pop-up window. If the user is *not* already "
"signed-in, a sign-in screen loads instead, prompting the user to first sign-"
"in to X."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:177
msgid ""
"Type in any additional information, or make any edits to the default "
"message, then share using the available options in X."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:183
msgid "LinkedIn"
msgstr "LinkedIn"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:185
msgid ""
"To share a job position on LinkedIn, click the :icon:`fa-linkedin` "
":guilabel:`Share Now` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:187
msgid ""
"If the user is already logged into LinkedIn, when the :icon:`fa-linkedin` "
":guilabel:`Share Now` button is clicked, a new tab loads in LinkedIn, with a"
" link to the job position at the top. If the user is *not* already logged "
"in, a log-in screen loads instead, prompting the user to log-in to LinkedIn "
"first."
msgstr ""
"如果用戶已登入 LinkedIn，點擊 :icon:`fa-linkedin` :guilabel:`立即分享` 按鈕後"
"，LinkedIn 會載入一個新分頁，並在頂部顯示職位連結。如果用戶 *尚未* 登入，則會"
"載入登入畫面，提示用戶先登入 LinkedIn。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:192
msgid ""
"The job position can be shared either in a public post, or in a private "
"message to an individual (or group of individuals)."
msgstr "職位可以透過公開帖文分享，亦可以私人訊息傳送給個人（或一群人）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:195
msgid ""
"Type in any additional information, or make any edits to the message or "
"post, then share using the available options in LinkedIn."
msgstr ""
"輸入任何附加資訊，或對訊息或帖文進行任何編輯，然後使用 LinkedIn 中提供的選項"
"進行分享。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:201
msgid "Share job list"
msgstr "分享職位清單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:203
msgid ""
"Another way to share job opportunities is to share the entire current list "
"of open job positions, instead of one job position at a time. To do this, "
"navigate to the :menuselection:`Referrals` main dashboard. Click the "
":guilabel:`Email a friend` button at the bottom of the screen. A "
":guilabel:`Send Job Offer by Mail` pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"另一種分享職位空缺的方法，是一次過分享目前所有開放職位清單，而非逐個分享。要"
"執行此操作，請前往 :menuselection:`推薦` 主儀表板，然後點擊畫面底部的 "
":guilabel:`電郵給朋友` 按鈕。畫面隨即會彈出 :guilabel:`透過電郵發送職位空缺` "
"視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:208
msgid ""
"Enter the email address in the :guilabel:`Email` field. The email can be "
"sent to multiple recipients by separating each email address with a comma "
"followed by a single space. The :guilabel:`Subject` is preconfigured with "
":guilabel:`Job for you`, but can be edited. The email :guilabel:`Body` is "
"also populated with preconfigured text."
msgstr ""
"請在 :guilabel:`電郵` 欄位輸入電郵地址。如要傳送給多位收件人，請用逗號及一個"
"空格分隔每個電郵地址。:guilabel:`主旨` 已預先設定為 :guilabel:`給您的職位`，"
"但可自行編輯。電郵 :guilabel:`內文` 亦已填入預先設定的文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:213
msgid ""
"The link to all active job positions is a tracking link to a complete list "
"of all job positions currently being recruited for. Add any additional text "
"and make any edits to the message body, if necessary. Then, click "
":guilabel:`Send Mail` to send the email. This sends the message, and closes "
"the window."
msgstr ""
"所有開放職位的連結是一個追蹤連結，指向目前正在招聘的所有職位的完整清單。如有"
"需要，請加入任何額外文字並編輯訊息內容。然後，按一下 :guilabel:`發送電郵` 以"
"發送電子郵件。系統會發送訊息並關閉視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Time Off** application serves as a centralized hub for all time-"
"off-related information. This application manages requests, balances, "
"allocations, approvals, and reports. The following documents explain each "
"aspect of the **Time Off** application:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **休假** 應用程式是所有休假相關資訊的集中管理中心，負責管理休假申請、"
"結餘、分配、審批及報告。以下文件將介紹 **休假** 應用程式的各個功能："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:13
msgid ""
"Before time off can be requested, the various time off types must be "
"configured."
msgstr "在申請休假之前，必須先設定各種休假類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:18
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:3
msgid "Public holidays"
msgstr "公眾假期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:18
msgid ""
"Configure all public holidays so employees receive the correct days off "
"according to local and national laws."
msgstr "配置所有公眾假期，讓員工可根據當地及國家法例獲得正確的休假日數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:24
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:3
msgid "Allocations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:24
msgid ""
"Some time off types require management to grant time off to employees before"
" they can request it."
msgstr "部分休假類型需要管理層先向員工授予假期，員工才可提出申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:30
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:3
msgid "Accrual plans"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:30
msgid ""
"If time off is earned as employees work, an accrual plan must be configured."
msgstr "如果休假是按員工工作累積計算，則必須配置累積計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:3
msgid "Request time off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:35
msgid "Before employees take time off, they must submit a time off request."
msgstr "員工休假前，必須先提交休假申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:40
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:3
msgid "My time"
msgstr "我的時間"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:40
msgid "Manage personal time off balances, allocations, and time off requests."
msgstr "管理個人休假結餘、假期分配及休假申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:45
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:3
msgid "Management"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:45
msgid ""
"Review time off and allocation requests from their respective dashboards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:50
msgid ""
"View a summary of all time off, by employee, time off type, or balance."
msgstr "按員工、休假類型或餘額，檢視所有休假的摘要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:58
msgid ""
"To view a color-coded schedule of the user's time off and the team they "
"manage, navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> Overview`. This loads "
"the *All Time Off* dashboard, which displays a Gantt view of all time off "
"requests for the user and their team, grouped by employee."
msgstr ""
"如要查看使用者及其所管理團隊以顏色標記的休假時間表，請前往 :menuselection:`休"
"假應用程式 --> 概覽`。系統會載入 *所有休假* 儀表板，並以甘特圖檢視方式顯示使"
"用者及其團隊的所有休假申請，並按員工分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:62
msgid ""
"The *All Time Off* dashboard presents three months of data, the previous, "
"current, and following months, with the current month visible by default. To"
" change the time period displayed, click the :guilabel:`Month` :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` button to reveal a drop-down menu. Then, select either "
":guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Quarter`, "
":guilabel:`Year`, or a custom time period."
msgstr ""
"*所有休假* 儀表板會顯示三個月的資料，包括上月、本月及下月，並預設顯示本月資料"
"。如要更改顯示的時間範圍，請點擊 :guilabel:`月` :icon:`fa-caret-down` 按鈕以"
"展開下拉式選單，然後選擇 "
":guilabel:`日`、:guilabel:`週`、:guilabel:`月`、:guilabel:`季`、:guilabel:`年` "
"或自訂時間範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:68
msgid ""
"To navigate forward or backward in time in the selected increment "
"(:guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Week`, etc.), click the :icon:`oi-arrow-left`"
" :guilabel:`(left arrow)` or :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(right "
"arrow)` buttons. For example, if :guilabel:`Month` is selected, the arrows "
"adjust the view by one month. To return to a view containing the current "
"day, click the :guilabel:`Today` button at any time."
msgstr ""
"要按所選時間單位（:guilabel:`月`、:guilabel:`週` 等）向前或向後切換時間，請點"
"擊 :icon:`oi-arrow-left` :guilabel:`（向左箭頭）` 或 :icon:`oi-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`（向右箭頭）` 按鈕。例如，若已選擇:guilabel:`月`，箭頭會將檢視畫面"
"調整一個月。要隨時返回包含當天的檢視畫面，請點擊:guilabel:`今天`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:74
msgid ""
"Team members are listed alphabetically by first name, and display their time"
" off requests with a status of *Approved* or *Second Approval*. Each "
"employee is color-coded. The employee's color is selected at random, and "
"does *not* correspond to the type of time off requested."
msgstr ""
"團隊成員按名字的字母順序列出，並顯示狀態為 *已批准* 或 *第二次批准* 的休假申"
"請。每位員工均以顏色區分。員工的顏色為隨機選取，*並不* 對應所申請的休假類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:78
msgid ""
"The status of the time off is represented by the color detail of the "
"request, either appearing solid (*Approved*) or striped (*Second Approval*)."
msgstr ""
"休假申請的狀態會透過顏色樣式顯示：實色代表 *已核准*，斜紋則代表 *第二次核"
"准*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:81
msgid ""
"Each time off entry displays the employee name, time off type, and the "
"amount of time requested."
msgstr "每筆休假記錄都會顯示員工姓名、休假類型及申請的休假時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:84
msgid ""
"If the time off entry is small and cannot display any text, the entry "
"appears as a solid color with no text. All other entries display the text, "
"but it may be cut off depending on the request size."
msgstr ""
"如果休假記錄過小而無法顯示任何文字，該記錄會顯示為純色且不含文字。所有其他記"
"錄均會顯示文字，但可能會視乎申請大小而被截斷。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:88
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the calendar, in the :guilabel:`Total` line, a bar graph "
"shows how many employees are projected to be out on any given day. The "
"number on each bar represents the number of employees out on the highlighted"
" days."
msgstr ""
"在日曆底部的 :guilabel:`總計` 一欄中，棒形圖顯示預計於任何特定日子休假的員工"
"人數。每條棒形上的數字代表在反白顯示的日子休假的員工人數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:92
msgid ""
"Click on a time off entry to open a *Time Off Request* pop-up window, "
"containing a summary of the time off entry. The :guilabel:`Employee`, "
":guilabel:`Time Off Type`, :guilabel:`Dates`, and notes are displayed."
msgstr ""
"點擊休假記錄，即可開啟 *休假申請* 彈出式視窗，當中包含該休假記錄的摘要，並會"
"顯示 :guilabel:`員工`、 :guilabel:`休假類型`、 :guilabel:`日期` 及備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off.rst:96
msgid "Overview of the user's team, with time off requests shown."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:5
msgid ""
"Some time off is granted to employees up front, while other kinds of time "
"off are earned through an *accrual plan*, meaning that for every specified "
"amount of time an employee works (hour, day, week, etc), they earn or "
"*accrue* a specified amount of time off."
msgstr ""
"部分休假會預先批給員工，而其他類型的休假則透過 *累計計劃* 賺取，即是員工每工"
"作一段指定時間（小時、日、週等），便會賺取或 *累計* 指定數量的休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:10
msgid ""
"If an employee accrues a vacation day for every week they work, they would "
"earn 0.2 vacation days for each hour they worked. At the end of a 40-hour "
"work week, they would earn one full vacation day (8 hours)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:15
msgid "Create an accrual plan"
msgstr "建立累計計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:17
msgid ""
"To create a new accrual plan, navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> "
"Configuration --> Accrual Plans`. Then, click the :guilabel:`New` button, "
"which reveals a blank *Accrual Plans* form."
msgstr ""
"若要建立新的累計方案，請前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 設定 --> 累計方"
"案`。然後按一下 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，即可開啟空白的 *累計方案* 表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:20
msgid ""
"First, enter a :guilabel:`Title` for the accrual plan. If in a multi-company"
" database, a :guilabel:`Company` field appears beneath the :guilabel:`Title`"
" field. Using the drop-down menu, select the company the accrual plan "
"applies to. If left blank, the accrual plan is available for all companies."
msgstr ""
"首先，為累積計劃輸入 :guilabel:`標題`。若使用多公司資料庫，:guilabel:`公司` "
"欄位會顯示於 :guilabel:`標題` 欄位下方。使用下拉式選單選擇此累積計劃適用的公"
"司。若留空，該累積計劃將適用於所有公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:25
msgid "Next, configure the following sections of the form:"
msgstr "接著，設定表格的以下部分："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:201
msgid "Configuration section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:30
msgid ""
"Configure the following fields in the *Configuration* section of the form:"
msgstr "在表單的 *設定* 部分設定以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`When the time is accrued`: Select when the employee begins to "
"accrue time off, either :guilabel:`At the start of the accrual period` or "
":guilabel:`At the end of the accrual period`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`休假累積時間`：選擇員工何時開始累積休假，可選 :guilabel:`於累積期"
"開始時` 或 :guilabel:`於累積期結束時`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`It is based on worked time`: Select how time off accrual is "
"determined. The options are:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`基於已工作時間`：選擇如何決定休假累積方式。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Yes, consider the worked hours, excluding any time off taken "
"during that period`: Days **not** considered as *worked time* do **not** "
"contribute to the accrual plan in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`是，計算工作時數，並扣除該期間內所放的任何休假`：**不** 被視為 *工"
"作時間* 的日數 **不會** 計入 Odoo 中的累計休假計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No, always consider the entire accrual period (whole calendar "
"days)`: Every day is calculated when determining worked time, with no "
"exclusions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:43
msgid ""
"An employee is granted time off from an accrual plan configured to accrue "
"one day of vacation for every five days worked. The accrual plan is based on"
" the employee's worked time (the :guilabel:`Yes, consider the worked hours, "
"excluding any time off taken during that period` option is selected), which "
"means they **only** earn vacation time for the five weekdays they work, "
"*not* the entire seven-day week period."
msgstr ""
"某員工透過累算計劃獲得休假，該計劃設定為每工作五天可累算一天假期。由於該累算"
"計劃根據員工的實際工作時間計算（即已選取 :guilabel:`是，計算已工作時數，但不"
"包括該期間內的任何休假` 選項），因此該員工 **只會** 針對其工作的五個平日獲得"
"假期，而 *非* 整個七天的週期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:49
msgid ""
"The employee works a standard 40-hour week. According to the accrual plan, "
"they should earn four vacation days per month."
msgstr "該員工每週標準工時為 40 小時。根據累計休假計劃，他們每月應可獲得四天假期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:52
msgid ""
"The employee takes five days off using a :doc:`time off type "
"<time_off_types>` with the :guilabel:`Counts as` set as an "
":guilabel:`Absence`. Because the plan grants vacation only for worked time, "
"those five days do not count toward accrual."
msgstr ""
"員工使用:doc:`休假類型 <time_off_types>`請了五天假，該類型的:guilabel:`計"
"為`設為:guilabel:`缺勤`。由於該計劃僅根據工作時間授予假期，因此這五天不會計入"
"假期累積。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:56
msgid ""
"As a result, the employee accrues only three vacation days that month "
"instead of four."
msgstr "因此，該員工在該月只累積三天年假，而非四天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`What should happen to the unused accrued time`: Select what "
"happens to the unused accrued time. The options are either :guilabel:`They "
"should be carried over` or :guilabel:`They should be lost (reset)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`未使用的累積時數應如何處理`：選擇未使用的累積時數之處理方式。選項"
"為 :guilabel:`應予結轉` 或 :guilabel:`應作廢（重設）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`When should unused accrued time be reset/carried over`: Select "
"when the employee receives previously accrued time. The options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`何時重設/結轉未使用的累計休假時間`：選取員工何時獲得先前累計的休假"
"時間。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`At the start of the year`: Select this if the accrual rolls over "
"on January 1 of the upcoming year."
msgstr ":guilabel:`於年初`：如累計結餘於來年 1 月 1 日結轉，請選擇此項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`At the allocation date`: Select this if the accrual rolls over as"
" soon as time is allocated to the employee."
msgstr ":guilabel:`於分配日期`：若累積假期在分配給員工時隨即結轉，請選擇此項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom date`: Select this option if neither of the other two "
"options is applicable. Once selected, set the date using the two drop-down "
"menus, one for the day and one for the month."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`自訂日期`：如果另外兩個選項皆不適用，請選擇此選項。選擇後，請使用"
"兩個下拉式選單設定日期，一個用於選擇日，另一個用於選擇月。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Switch employees to the new accrual level:` Select when the "
"employee moves to the next accrual level. The options are either "
":guilabel:`Immediately` or :guilabel:`After this accrual's period`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`將員工切換至新的累計級別：` 選擇員工移至下一個累計級別的時間。選項"
"為 :guilabel:`立即` 或 :guilabel:`在此累計期間之後`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:76
msgid "An accrual plan form filled out for a Seniority Plan."
msgstr "已填妥的年資應計計劃表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:80
msgid "Milestones"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:82
msgid ""
"Milestones must be created for employees to accrue time off from the accrual"
" plan. Each milestone determines when and how much time off the employee "
"earns."
msgstr ""
"必須建立里程碑，員工方可從累積休假計劃中累積假期。每個里程碑決定員工於何時獲"
"得多少假期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:85
msgid ""
"To create the first milestone, click the :guilabel:`Create a milestone` "
"button, or to create *additional* milestones, click the :guilabel:`Add a "
"milestone` button. Both options open a *New Milestone* pop-up window. Fill "
"out the following sections on the form."
msgstr ""
"若要建立第一個里程碑，請點擊 :guilabel:`建立里程碑` 按鈕；若要建立 *額外* 的"
"里程碑，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增里程碑` 按鈕。兩個選項都會開啟 *新增里程碑* 彈"
"出式視窗。請填寫表單上的以下部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:90
msgid ""
"Once milestones have been configured, click on a milestone to make edits, "
"click the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Delete)` icon to delete it, or "
"click :guilabel:`Add a milestone` to create additional milestones."
msgstr ""
"完成設定里程碑後，點擊某個里程碑即可進行編輯，點擊 :icon:`fa-trash-o` "
":guilabel:`（刪除）` 圖示即可將其刪除，或點擊:guilabel:`新增里程碑`以建立更多"
"里程碑。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:95
msgid "Accrual level options section"
msgstr "累算級別選項部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:97
msgid "This section determines how much the employee earns, and when."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Set the employee accrual frequency`: Configure how many hours or "
"days the employee earns in a set period of time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:102
msgid ""
"The first two fields set *how much* time off the employee earns, while the "
"remaining fields determine *how often* the employee earns the time off."
msgstr "首兩個欄位設定員工可獲得*多少*休假，其餘欄位則決定員工*多久*獲得一次休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:105
msgid ""
"Enter the numerical amount the employee earns in the first field. The "
"numerical format is `X.XXXX`, so that partial days or hours can be earned. "
"Next, set the middle field to either :guilabel:`Day(s)` or "
":guilabel:`Hour(s)`."
msgstr ""
"在第一個欄位輸入員工可獲得的數值金額。數值格式為 `X.XXXX`，以便計算不足一日或"
"一小時的休假。接著，將中間的欄位設為 :guilabel:`日` 或 :guilabel:`小時`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:109
msgid ""
"In the last field, use the drop-down menu to set the frequency the employee "
"earns the time configured in the first two fields. Some options require "
"additional fields to be configured. The default options are:"
msgstr ""
"在最後一個欄位中，使用下拉式選單設定員工賺取首兩個欄位所設休假時數的頻率。部"
"分選項需要額外設定其他欄位。預設選項如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:113
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hourly`: The employee earns the set amount of time for every hour"
" worked. There are no additional fields needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`按小時`：員工每工作一小時即可獲得設定的休假時數。無需填寫額外欄位"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:115
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Daily`: The employee earns the set amount of time for every day "
"worked. There are no additional fields needed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`每日`：員工每工作一天即可獲得設定的時數。此選項無需填寫額外欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:117
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Weekly`: The employee earns the set amount of time for every week"
" worked. When selected, use the drop-down menu to select the specific day of"
" the week in the field that appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Twice a month`: The employee earns the set amount of time, twice "
"a month, on two specific days. When selected, use the drop-down menus to "
"select the specific days of the month in the two fields that appear."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`每月兩次`：員工每月在兩個指定日子獲得設定的時數，共兩次。選取此選"
"項後，請在顯示的兩個欄位中，使用下拉式選單選擇每月的具體日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:123
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Monthly`: The employee earns the set amount of time for every "
"month worked. When selected, use the drop-down menu to select the specific "
"day of the month in the field that appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Twice a year`: The employee earns the set amount of time, twice a"
" year, on two specific dates. When selected, use the drop-down menus to "
"select the specific day and month, in the four fields that appear."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`每年兩次`：員工每年於兩個特定日期賺取兩次所設定的時數。選擇此選項"
"後，請使用隨即出現的四個欄位中的下拉式選單，選擇具體日期及月份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:129
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Yearly`: The employee earns the set amount of time, once a year, "
"on a specific day. When selected, use the drop-down menus to select the "
"specific day and month in the two fields that appear."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`每年`：員工每年在特定日期獲得設定的休假時數。選擇此選項後，請在隨"
"即顯示的兩個欄位中，透過下拉式選單選擇具體的日期及月份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Per Hour Worked`: The employee earns the set amount of time for "
"every hour worked. There are no additional fields needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`每工作小時`：員工每工作一小時，即可獲得所設定的時間額度。無需填寫"
"其他欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:135
msgid ""
":guilabel:`This milestone will be reached`: This selection determines *when*"
" the employee starts to earn the time off. The options are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:138
msgid ""
":guilabel:`At allocation creation`: The time off starts accruing "
"immediately."
msgstr ":guilabel:`建立配額時`：休假會立即開始累積。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`After (#) (Time) from the start of the allocation`: Use the first"
" two fields to set the time period the employee achieves the milestone. "
"Enter a number in the first field, then set the middle field to either "
":guilabel:`Days`, :guilabel:`Months`, or :guilabel:`Years`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:143
msgid "An accrual plan set to give 10 days a year to employees."
msgstr "設定為每年向員工發放 10 天假期的累積計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:147
msgid "Carry over options section"
msgstr "結轉選項區段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:149
msgid ""
"This section determines what happens to any unused time off at the end of "
"the year. Configure the following field:"
msgstr "此部分決定年底未使用休假的處理方式。請設定以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:152
msgid ""
":guilabel:`After a year, unused time off will be`: Select :guilabel:`Lost` "
"if any unused time off is lost, and does **not** carry over to the following"
" year. Select :guilabel:`Carried over` if time off is rolled over to the "
"next year. When this option is selected, two additional sections appear:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`一年後，未使用的休假將`：如果未使用的休假會作廢，且 **不會** 結轉"
"至下一年，請選擇 :guilabel:`作廢`。如果休假會結轉至下一年，請選擇 "
":guilabel:`結轉`。選擇此選項後，系統會顯示兩個額外部分："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:157
msgid ""
":guilabel:`How much time can be carried over`: Select :guilabel:`Unlimited` "
"if *all* time off can be carried over. Select :guilabel:`Up to (#) Day(s)` "
"if there *is* a limit. Enter the total number of days the employee can carry"
" over from one year to the next in the blank field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`可結轉多少時間`：若*所有*休假皆可結轉，請選擇:guilabel:`無限制`。"
"若*設有*上限，請選擇:guilabel:`最多（#）日`，並在空白欄位輸入員工可從一年結轉"
"至下一年的總日數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:160
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Define a carry over validity`: If there is an expiration date for"
" the carried over time off, enable this option. When enabled, the following "
"appears: :guilabel:`The days carried over will be effective for (#) (Days or"
" Months)`. Enter a number in the first field, then set the second field to "
"either :guilabel:`Days` or :guilabel:`Months`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`設定結轉有效期`：如果結轉的休假設有到期日，請啟用此選項。啟用後，"
"畫面會顯示：:guilabel:`結轉天數的有效期為 (#) (天或個月)`。請在第一個欄位輸入"
"數字，然後將第二個欄位設為 :guilabel:`天` 或 :guilabel:`個月`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:165
msgid "The Carry Over section configured to have unlimited carry over time."
msgstr "已設定為無限結轉時間的「結轉」部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:169
msgid "Cap options section"
msgstr "上限選項部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:171
msgid "This section sets limits on total time off earned."
msgstr "此部分會設定可賺取總休假時間的上限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:173
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Define a yearly cap`: Enable this option to set a limit on the "
"total amount of time that can be accrued every calendar year. When enabled, "
"the following line appears: :guilabel:`Accrual will stop until next carry-"
"over date if accrued time's reach (#) Day(s).` Enter the maximum number of "
"days the employee can earn in the number field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`設定每年上限`：啟用此選項，以設定每個曆年可累積休假總時數的上限。"
"啟用後，系統會顯示以下一行：:guilabel:`如累積時數達 (#) 日，累積將會暫停，直"
"至下一個結轉日期。` 在數字欄位中輸入員工可賺取的最多日數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:177
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Define a balance cap`: If there is a maximum amount of time the "
"employee can accrue with this plan, enable this option. When enabled, the "
"following line appears: :guilabel:`The plan will be on hold if the balance "
"reach (#) Day(s) of available time.` Enter the maximum number of days the "
"employee can have at any given time in the number field. Any time off beyond"
" this parameter is lost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:183
msgid ""
"When completed, click :guilabel:`Save` to save the milestone, or "
":guilabel:`Save & New` to save the milestone and create a new one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:186
msgid "A balance cap of 30 days set in the Cap Options section."
msgstr "在「上限選項」部分設定的 30 天結餘上限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:190
msgid ""
"This milestone form is configured so the employee earns two weeks (10 days) "
"a year when they are hired, three weeks (15 days) after three years, and a "
"month (20 days) after five years. They start to earn this time yearly, on "
"January 1st."
msgstr ""
"此里程碑表單的設定為：員工受僱時每年可獲得兩星期（10 天）假期，三年後每年可獲"
"得三星期（15 天），五年後每年可獲得一個月（20 天）。他們會於每年 1 月 1 日開"
"始累積此假期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:194
msgid ""
"The employee can never accrue more than 30 days in the first three years, 45"
" days from years 3-5, and 100 days after five years. Anytime they exceed "
"those amounts for the respective years, they will stop accruing more time "
"off."
msgstr ""
"員工在首三年內累積的休假不可超過 30 日，第 3 至 5 年不可超過 45 日，滿五年後"
"不可超過 100 日。一旦超過相應年資的上限，便會停止繼續累積休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:198
msgid ""
"Additionally, they can roll over all their unused time off during the first "
"five years, then they can only rollover 20 days from one year to the next."
msgstr ""
"此外，他們在首五年內可結轉所有未使用的休假；之後每年最多只能將 20 天休假結轉"
"至下一年。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:201
msgid ""
"Note that in year five, the employee can have a yearly cap of 60 days, and a"
" total balance cap of 100 days."
msgstr "請注意，在第五年，員工的年度上限可為 60 天，而總結餘上限則為 100 天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/accrual_plans.rst:204
msgid "A milestone form with all the entries filled out."
msgstr "已填妥所有項目的里程碑表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:5
msgid ""
"Allocations are amounts of time off given to employees, either granted "
"immediately or earned as the employee works, through an :doc:`accrual plan "
"<accrual_plans>`."
msgstr ""
"休假配額是給予員工的休假額度，可即時發放，或透過:doc:`累積計劃 "
"<accrual_plans>`隨員工工作而逐步累積。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:8
msgid ""
"Once :doc:`time off types <time_off_types>` and accrual plans have been "
"configured, the next step is to *allocate*, or give, time off to employees."
msgstr ""
"設定好 :doc:`休假類型 <time_off_types>` 及累計計劃後，下一步是向員工*分配*（"
"即發放）休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:12
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Management` menu, which is how the *Allocations* page is "
"accessed, is **only** visible to users who have either *Time Off Officer* or"
" *Administrator* access rights for the **Time Off** application. For more "
"information on access rights, refer to the :doc:`access rights "
"<../../general/users/access_rights/>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"用於存取 *配額分配* 頁面的 :guilabel:`管理` 選單，**僅** 對擁有 **休假** 應用"
"程式 *休假專員* 或 *管理員* 存取權限的用戶顯示。如需更多有關存取權限的資料，"
"請參閱 :doc:`存取權限 <../../general/users/access_rights/>` 文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:20
msgid "Allocate time off"
msgstr "分配休假"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:22
msgid ""
"To create a new allocation, navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> "
"Management --> Allocations`. This loads the *Allocations* dashboard."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的假期配額，請前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 管理 --> 配額`，"
"系統便會載入 *配額* 儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:25
msgid ""
"The dashboard displays a Kanban view of all allocation requests for the "
"user's team, awaiting approval."
msgstr "儀表板會以看板檢視顯示用戶團隊所有等待審批的分配申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:28
msgid "A Kanban view of all allocation requests waiting approval."
msgstr "所有待批核分配申請的看板檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:31
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` to allocate time off. This opens a blank "
":guilabel:`Allocations` form. Enter the following information on the form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: Enter a name for the allocation, typically containing the "
"type of time off, and the period of time it is available (example: `Annual "
"Vacation Time Off - 2025`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`名稱`：輸入休假配額的名稱，通常包含休假類型及適用期間（例如：`年"
"假 - 2025`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Off Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select the type of time"
" off that is being allocated to the employees."
msgstr ":guilabel:`休假類型`：使用下拉式選單，選取要分配予員工的休假類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allocation Type`: Select how the allocation is granted. The two "
"options are:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`分配類型`：選擇配額的發放方式。兩個選項如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Regular Allocation`: The time off is given immediately, all at "
"once."
msgstr ":guilabel:`常規分配`：休假會即時一次過全部發放。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Accrual Allocation`: The time off is earned through an "
":doc:`accrual plan <accrual_plans>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Accrual Plan`: If :guilabel:`Accrual Allocation` is selected for "
"the :guilabel:`Allocation Type`, the :guilabel:`Accrual Plan` field appears."
" Using the drop-down menu, select the accrual plan associated with the "
"allocation. An accrual plan is **required** when using the "
":guilabel:`Accrual Allocation` type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Validity Period/Start Date`: If :guilabel:`Regular Allocation` is"
" selected for the :guilabel:`Allocation Type`, this field is labeled "
":guilabel:`Validity Period`. If :guilabel:`Accrual Allocation` is selected "
"for the :guilabel:`Allocation Type`, this field is labeled :guilabel:`Start "
"Date`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`有效期限 / 開始日期`：若選取 :guilabel:`常規分配` 作為 "
":guilabel:`分配類型`，此欄位會標示為 :guilabel:`有效期限`。若選取 "
":guilabel:`累計分配` 作為 :guilabel:`分配類型`，此欄位則標示為 :guilabel:`開"
"始日期`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:53
msgid ""
"The current date populates the first date field, by default. To select "
"another date, click on the pre-populated date to reveal a popover calendar "
"window. Navigate to the desired start date for the allocation, and click on "
"the date to select it."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，第一個日期欄位會自動填入目前日期。如要選擇其他日期，請點擊預先填"
"入的日期以顯示彈出式日曆視窗。導覽至所需的分配開始日期，並點擊該日期以選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:57
msgid ""
"If the allocation expires, select the expiration date in the next date "
"field. If the time off does *not* expire, leave the second date field blank."
msgstr ""
"如果假期配額設有到期日，請在下一個日期欄位選擇到期日。如果休假 *不會* 到期，"
"請將第二個日期欄位留空。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:60
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Accrual Allocation` is selected for the :guilabel:`Allocation "
"Type`, this second field is labeled :guilabel:`Run until`."
msgstr ""
"若選擇 :guilabel:`累積分配` 作為 :guilabel:`分配類型`，則第二個欄位的標籤會顯"
"示為 :guilabel:`執行至`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allocation`: Enter the amount of time that is being allocated to "
"the employees. This field displays the time in either :guilabel:`Hours` or "
":guilabel:`Days`, depending on how the selected  :doc:`Time Off Type "
"<time_off_types>` is configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: Using the drop-down menu, select the employee being "
"allocated the time off."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：使用下拉式選單，選擇獲分配休假的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add a reason...`: If any description or note is necessary to "
"explain the time off allocation, enter it in this field at the bottom of the"
" form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`新增原因...`：如需任何說明或備註來解釋休假分配，請在表單底部的此欄"
"位中輸入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:69
msgid ""
"A new allocation form with all the fields filled out for the annual two week vacation\n"
"for a new employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:74
msgid "Accrual start date behavior"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:76
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Start Date` is in the middle of an accrual period, Odoo "
"adjusts it to the start or end of that period based on the *Accrued Gain "
"Time* entered on the :doc:`accrual plan <accrual_plans>`."
msgstr ""
"如果 :guilabel:`開始日期` 位於累積期間的中途，Odoo 會根據在 :doc:`累積計劃 "
"<accrual_plans>` 中輸入的 *累積獲得時間*，將其調整為該期間的開始或結束日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:81
msgid ""
"*At the start of the accrual period*: A :guilabel:`Start Date` of `06/16/25`"
" applies from `06/01/25`"
msgstr ""
"*在應計期間開始時*：將 :guilabel:`開始日期` 設為 `06/16/25`，即由 `06/01/25` "
"起生效"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:83
msgid ""
"*At the end of the accrual period*: A :guilabel:`Start Date` of `06/18/25` "
"applies from `07/01/25`"
msgstr ""
"*於累計期結束時*： :guilabel:`開始日期` 為 `06/18/25` 的設定將由 `07/01/25` "
"起生效"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:86
msgid ""
"Automatic adjustments on the start date to either the beginning or end of an"
" accrual period ensures accruals align with the defined period boundaries, "
"rather than the exact date entered."
msgstr ""
"自動將開始日期調整至應計期間的開始或結束日期，可確保應計項目與已定義的期間邊"
"界對齊，而非依實際輸入的日期計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:90
msgid "Group allocations"
msgstr "群組分配"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:92
msgid ""
"When allocating time off, it is common to allocate time to multiple "
"employees at once, instead of creating individual allocations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:95
msgid ""
"To allocate time to multiple employees in a single allocation, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> Management --> Allocations`. Click the "
":guilabel:`New Group Allocation` button, and a *New Group Allocation* pop-up"
" window loads."
msgstr ""
"如要透過單一分配為多名員工分配休假時間，請前往:menuselection:`休假應用程"
"式 --> 管理 --> 分配`。點擊:guilabel:`新增群組分配`按鈕，隨即載入 *新增群組分"
"配* 彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:99
msgid ""
"This form is identical to the individual :ref:`allocation form "
"<time_off/allocation-form>`, with two additional fields to determine how the"
" employees are selected."
msgstr ""
"此表單與個人:ref:`配額表單 <time_off/allocation-form>`相同，但額外設有兩個欄"
"位，用於決定如何選取員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:102
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select one of the following options for the "
":guilabel:`Grant` field:"
msgstr "使用下拉式選單，為 :guilabel:`授予` 欄位選擇以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:104
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Employee`: This option allows for the selection of multiple "
"individual employees that are unrelated in terms of department, company, or "
"tags. Selecting this reveals an :guilabel:`Employees` field. Using the drop-"
"down menu, select the employees to receive the allocation in the "
":guilabel:`Employees` field. There is no limit to the amount of employees "
"that can be selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Company`: This option allows for the selection of all "
"employees within a specific company. Selecting this reveals a "
":guilabel:`Company` field. Using the drop-down menu, select the "
":guilabel:`Company` to assign the allocation to. Only one company can be "
"assigned in the :guilabel:`Company` field. When a company is selected, *all*"
" employees within the company receive the allocation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`按公司`：此選項可選取特定公司內的所有員工。選擇此選項後，系統會顯"
"示 :guilabel:`公司` 欄位。請使用下拉式選單，選取要指派配額的 :guilabel:`公"
"司`。:guilabel:`公司` 欄位僅可指派一間公司。選取公司後，該公司內的 *所有* 員"
"工均會獲得該配額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Department`: This option allows for the selection of all "
"employees within a specific department. Selecting this reveals a "
":guilabel:`Department` field. Select the :guilabel:`Department` to assign "
"the allocation to. Only one department can be assigned in the "
":guilabel:`Department` field. When a department is selected, *all* employees"
" within the department receive the allocation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`按部門`：此選項可選取特定部門內的所有員工。選取後會顯示 "
":guilabel:`部門` 欄位。選擇要指派配額的 :guilabel:`部門`。在 :guilabel:`部"
"門` 欄位中只可指派一個部門。選取部門後，該部門內的 *所有* 員工都會獲得該配額"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Employee Tag`: This option allows for the selection of all "
"employees with a specific tag. Selecting this reveals an :guilabel:`Employee"
" Tag` field. Select the desired :guilabel:`Employee Tag` to select all "
"employees with that tag. Only one tag can be assigned in the "
":guilabel:`Employee Tag` field. When a tag is selected, *all* employees with"
" that tag receive the allocation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`按員工標籤`：此選項可讓你選取帶有特定標籤的所有員工。選擇此項後，"
"系統會顯示 :guilabel:`員工標籤` 欄位。選取所需的 :guilabel:`員工標籤`，即可選"
"取所有帶有該標籤的員工。:guilabel:`員工標籤` 欄位只能指派一個標籤。選取標籤後"
"，帶有該標籤的 *所有* 員工均會獲得此配額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:125
msgid ""
"Fill out the remainder of the :ref:`New Group Allocation form "
"<time_off/allocation-form>`, then click :guilabel:`Allocate Time Off` when "
"done. The *Generated Allocations* dashboard loads, displaying all the "
"employees granted an allocation on the form."
msgstr ""
"填寫 :ref:`新增群組配額表單 <time_off/allocation-form>` 的其餘部分，完成後點"
"擊 :guilabel:`分配休假`。系統隨即載入 *已產生的配額* 儀表板，顯示表單上所有獲"
"分配配額的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:129
msgid ""
"The Generated Allocations dashboard showing the accountants granted time "
"off."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:133
msgid ""
"A company wants to give their accounting department two days of training. "
"The training is happening over one week. Since it is a work-related event, "
"the company wants to grant time off to the accountants and let them decide "
"which two training days they will attend."
msgstr ""
"某公司希望為會計部門提供兩天培訓，培訓期為一星期。由於這屬於與工作相關的活動"
"，公司希望向會計人員批出休假，並讓他們自行決定參加哪兩天的培訓。"

