msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:164
msgid ""
"If an employee has used all their time off, or will run out of time off, "
"they can request an allocation for additional time. Allocations can be "
"requested in one of two ways: either from the main :ref:`Time Off dashboard "
"<time_off/dashboard-allocation>` or the :ref:`My Allocations dashboard "
"<time_off/view-my-allocations>`."
msgstr ""
"如果員工已用完所有休假，或即將用完休假，可以申請額外休假配額。申請配額有以下"
"兩種方法：透過主:ref:`休假儀表板 <time_off/dashboard-allocation>`或:ref:`我的"
"配額儀表板 <time_off/view-my-allocations>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:170
msgid ""
"Both options open a new *Allocation Request* form, but when requested from "
"the main **Time Off** *Dashboard*, the form appears in a pop-up window. When"
" requested from the *My Allocations* dashboard, the screen navigates to a "
"new allocation request page instead of presenting a pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"兩個選項均會開啟新的 *分配申請* 表單，但如從主 **休假** *儀表板* 提出申請，表"
"單會於彈出視窗中顯示；如從 *我的分配* 儀表板提出申請，畫面則會跳轉至新的分配"
"申請頁面，而不會顯示彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:180
msgid ""
"To request an allocation from the **Time Off** dashboard, open the **Time "
"Off** app, or navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> My Time --> "
"Dashboard`. On the *Dashboard*, click :guilabel:`New allocation request` "
"beneath :guilabel:`Pending Requests`, and a *New Allocation* pop-up window "
"loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:187
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Off Type`: Select the type of time off being requested using"
" the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`休假類型`：使用下拉式選單選擇要申請的休假類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:188
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ask for`: Enter the amount of time being requested, either in "
":guilabel:`Days` or :guilabel:`Hours`. The unit of time is determined by the"
" selected :guilabel:`Time Off Type`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`申請`：輸入所申請的時間數量，單位可為:guilabel:`日`或:guilabel:`小"
"時`。時間單位由所選的:guilabel:`休假類型`決定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:190
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add a reason...`: Enter a brief description why the time off is "
"being requested."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:192
msgid ""
"An individual request for more vacation time, requested from the Time Off "
"dashboard."
msgstr "從休假儀表板提交的個人額外假期申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:198
msgid "My allocations dashboard"
msgstr "我的配額儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:200
msgid ""
"To request an allocation from the *My Allocations* dashboard, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> My Time --> My Allocations`. Click the "
":guilabel:`New` button on the *My Allocations* dashboard, and an *Allocation"
" Request* form loads."
msgstr ""
"如要從 *我的配額* 儀表板申請配額，請前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 我"
"的休假 --> 我的配額`。按一下 *我的配額* 儀表板上的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，系"
"統便會載入 *配額申請* 表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:204
msgid "Enter the following information on the *Allocation Request* form:"
msgstr "在 *分配申請* 表單上輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:206
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: The name for the allocation request is populated based on "
"the default time off type, and displays both the time off type and the "
"amount of hours by default. As selections are made, the name of the request "
"is updated to reflect the request. The name **cannot** be manually modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`名稱`：休假配額申請的名稱會根據預設休假類型自動填寫，預設會同時顯"
"示休假類型及時數。作出選擇時，申請名稱會隨之更新以反映申請內容。名稱 **不"
"可** 手動修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Off Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select the type of time"
" off being requested for the allocation. After a selection is made, the "
":guilabel:`Name` updates with the time off type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`休假類型`：使用下拉式選單選擇申請分配的休假類型。作出選擇後"
"，:guilabel:`名稱` 會隨即更新為該休假類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Validity Period`: By default, the current date populates the "
"first field and the second field displays :guilabel:`No Limit`. To change "
"the time frame for the request, click on the date, and select the desired "
"date on the calendar popover. If there is an expiration date for the "
"request, select the end date in the second field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`有效期間`：預設情況下，第一個欄位會自動填入目前日期，而第二個欄位"
"會顯示 :guilabel:`無限制`。如要更改申請的時間範圍，請點擊日期，然後在彈出的日"
"曆視窗中選擇所需日期。如果申請設有到期日，請在第二個欄位中選擇結束日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:219
msgid ""
"This field is **only** visible to users who have either *Time Off Officer* "
"or *Administrator* access rights for the **Time Off** application. For more "
"information on access rights, refer to the :doc:`access rights "
"<../../general/users/access_rights/>` documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:223
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allocation`: Enter the amount of time being requested in this "
"field. The format is presented in either :guilabel:`Days` or "
":guilabel:`Hours`, depending on how the :guilabel:`Time Off Type` is "
"configured. Once this field is populated, the name of the allocation request"
" is updated to include the amount of time being requested."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`分配`：在此欄位輸入申請的時間數量。格式會以 :guilabel:`天` 或 "
":guilabel:`小時` 顯示，視乎 :guilabel:`休假類型` 的設定而定。填寫此欄位後，分"
"配申請的名稱會更新並包含所申請的時間數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:227
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add a reason...`: Enter a description for the allocation request "
"in this field. This should include any details that approvers may need to "
"approve the request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:230
msgid ""
"The information is automatically saved as it is entered. To view the "
"request, click the :guilabel:`My Allocations` breadcrumb, or navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> My Time --> My Allocations`. The allocation"
" request appears along with any other allocation requests awaiting approval."
msgstr ""
"輸入資料時系統會自動儲存。如要檢視申請，請按一下 :guilabel:`我的配額` 導覽路"
"徑，或前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 我的時間 --> 我的配額`。該配額申"
"請會連同其他等待審批的配額申請一併顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/allocations.rst:235
msgid ""
"An allocation request form filled out for an employee requesting an additional week for\n"
"training."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:7
msgid ""
"Time off requests and allocation requests undergo an approval process before"
" being granted. Requests either need one or two approvals, if any, depending"
" on how the specific type of time off is configured. All these "
"configurations can be found under the *Management* section of the **Time "
"Off** application."
msgstr ""
"休假申請及配額申請須經過審批流程方可獲批。視乎特定休假類型的配置方式，申請可"
"能需要一次或兩次審批（或無需審批）。所有這些配置均可在 **休假** 應用程式的 "
"*管理* 部分找到。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:13
msgid ""
"The *Management* section in the **Time Off** application is **only** visible"
" to users who can :ref:`approve allocation requests and time off requests "
"<employees/work-info-tab>`."
msgstr ""
"**休假** 應用程式中的 *管理* 部分 **只** 供可以 :ref:`批准配額申請及休假申請 "
"<employees/work-info-tab>` 的用戶查看。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:19
msgid "View time off requests"
msgstr "檢視休假申請"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:21
msgid ""
"To view time off requests waiting for approval, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> Management --> Time Off`. Doing so reveals "
"the *All Time Off* page. All time off requests appear in a default Kanban "
"view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:25
msgid ""
"The only time off requests that are visible on this page belong to employees"
" the user either has :guilabel:`Time Off Officer` or "
":guilabel:`Administrator` access rights for in the **Time Off** application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:29
msgid ""
"The default filter on the :guilabel:`All Time Off` page is :icon:`fa-filter`"
