"that need to be approved for current employees on the user's team, with a "
"status of either :guilabel:`To Approve` or :guilabel:`Second Approval`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:33
msgid ""
"On the left side of the :guilabel:`All Time Off` page, there are grouping "
"options that can be used to narrow down the presented time off requests, "
"located beneath the :icon:`fa-folder` :guilabel:`Status` heading."
msgstr ""
