"方設有分組選項，可用於篩選所顯示的休假申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:37
msgid ""
"Since only time off requests that need to be approved are shown, the only "
":icon:`fa-folder` :guilabel:`Status` options are :guilabel:`All`, "
":guilabel:`To Approve`, and :guilabel:`Second Approval`."
msgstr ""
"由於系統只顯示需要批核的休假申請，因此 :icon:`fa-folder` :guilabel:`狀態` 選"
"項只有 :guilabel:`全部`、:guilabel:`待批核` 及 :guilabel:`第二次批核`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:41
msgid ""
"If the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Waiting For Me` filter is removed, all "
"statuses appear."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:44
msgid ""
"If no requests fall under one of the status options, that status is **not** "
"visible on the side menu."
msgstr "如果沒有申請符合某個狀態選項，該狀態便**不會**顯示在側邊選單上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:47
msgid ""
"Time off requests with the filter, groupings, and status sections "
"highlighted."
msgstr "休假申請頁面，當中已標示篩選條件、分組及狀態部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:51
msgid "Approve or refuse time off requests"
msgstr "批核或拒絕休假申請"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:53
msgid ""
"To approve or refuse a time off request, navigate to :menuselection:`Time "
"Off app --> Management --> Time Off`. At the end of each time off request "
"Kanban card, two buttons appear: an :guilabel:`Approve` or "
":guilabel:`Validate` button, depending on the status of the request, and a "
":guilabel:`Refuse` button."
msgstr ""
"要核准或拒絕休假申請，請前往:menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 管理 --> 休假`。"
"在每張休假申請看板卡片的底部，會顯示兩個按鈕：視乎申請狀態而定，其中一個"
"為:guilabel:`核准`或:guilabel:`驗證`按鈕，另一個為:guilabel:`拒絕`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:58
msgid ""
"To approve a time off request, click the :guilabel:`Approve` button. To "
"validate a time off request that has already been approved and is waiting on"
" a second approval, click the :guilabel:`Validate` button. To refuse a "
"request, click the :guilabel:`Refuse` button."
msgstr ""
"要批准休假申請，請點擊 :guilabel:`批准` 按鈕。若要驗證已獲批准並正等待第二次"
"批核的休假申請，請點擊 :guilabel:`驗證` 按鈕。若要拒絕申請，請點擊 "
":guilabel:`拒絕` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:62
msgid ""
"If more information is needed before approving a time off request, click "
"anywhere on the Kanban card (except for the :guilabel:`Approve`, "
":guilabel:`Validate`, or :guilabel:`Refuse` buttons). Doing so loads the "
"detailed time off request form."
msgstr ""
"如在批准休假申請前需要更多資訊，請按一下看板卡片上的任何位置（:guilabel:`批"
"准`、:guilabel:`驗證` 或 :guilabel:`拒絕` 按鈕除外），以載入詳細的休假申請表"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:66
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:206
msgid ""
"Depending on the rights of the user, changes can be made. To modify the "
"request, make any desired changes to the form. All changes are automatically"
" saved."
msgstr ""
"視乎用戶權限，系統容許作出相應更改。如要修改申請，請在表單上作出所需變更。所"
"有更改均會自動儲存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:69
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:209
msgid ""
"It is also possible to approve, validate, or refuse the request from this "
"form. Click the :guilabel:`Approve` button to approve, the "
":guilabel:`Validate` button to validate, or the :guilabel:`Refuse` button to"
" refuse the request."
msgstr ""
"亦可以透過此表單核准、驗證或拒絕申請。按一下 :guilabel:`核准` 按鈕以核准，按"
"一下 :guilabel:`驗證` 按鈕以驗證，或按一下 :guilabel:`拒絕` 按鈕以拒絕申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`All Time Off` page. To view *all* requests, including approved "
"and refused requests, clear the default filters in the search bar."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`所有休假` 頁面。若要檢視*所有*申請（包括已批准和已拒絕的申請），請"
"清除搜尋欄中的預設篩選條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:76
msgid "The detailed time off request form for the employee George Davis."
msgstr "員工 George Davis 的詳細休假申請表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:82
msgid "Add missing time off requests"
msgstr "新增遺漏的休假申請"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:84
msgid ""
"If an employee forgets to request time off for days they did not work, a "
"time off record must be created retroactively. Missing time off records can "
"be done from the :ref:`All Time Off dashboard <time_off/management/all-time-"
"off>` or from the :ref:`Overview <time_off/management/overview>`."
msgstr ""
"如員工忘記為未工作的日子申請休假，必須補建休假紀錄。補建遺漏的休假紀錄可透過 "
":ref:`所有休假儀表板 <time_off/management/all-time-off>` 或 :ref:`概覽 "
"<time_off/management/overview>` 進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:91
msgid "From the dashboard"
msgstr "從儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:93
msgid ""
"To create missing time off requests from the *All Time Off* dashboard, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> Management --> Time Off`, and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:96
