":icon:`person_f` :guilabel:`Employee`: Select the employee missing the time "
"off request."
msgstr ":icon:`person_f` :guilabel:`員工`：選擇遺漏了休假申請的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:99
msgid ""
":icon:`label` :guilabel:`Time Type`: Select the :doc:`type of time off "
"<time_off_types>` for the request."
msgstr ""
":icon:`label` :guilabel:`休假類型`：選擇申請的 :doc:`休假類型 "
