#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:101
msgid ""
":icon:`schedule` :guilabel:`Dates`: Using the calendar selector, configure "
"the start and end dates for the time off request. Depending on how the "
":doc:`Time Type <time_off_types>` is configured, one of the following "
