msgstr "灰色方框會顯示用戶本年度的休假摘要，列出所有已批准的休假及剩餘假期餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:117
msgid ""
"Once the form is filled out, click either :guilabel:`Approve` or "
":guilabel:`Validate` to approve the request. The available button is "
"determined by the configured :guilabel:`Time Type`."
msgstr ""
"填妥表單後，點擊 :guilabel:`核准` 或 :guilabel:`驗證` 以批核申請。可用的按鈕"
"取決於所設定的 :guilabel:`時間類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:120
msgid "A time off form for missing time off."
msgstr "針對遺漏休假的休假表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:124
msgid ""
"If there is relevant documentation for the request, such as a doctor's note,"
" click the :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`(Attach files)` button in the "
"chatter, navigate to the desired file, then click :guilabel:`Open` to attach"
" the document."
msgstr ""
"如申請有相關證明文件（例如醫生證明書），請點擊通訊欄中的 :icon:`fa-"
"paperclip` :guilabel:`（附加檔案）` 按鈕，瀏覽並選擇所需檔案，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`開啟` 以附加文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:131
msgid "From the overview"
msgstr "從概覽"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:133
msgid ""
"To create a missing time off request from the *Overview* dashboard, navigate"
" to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> Overview`, and the *All Time Off* "
"dashboard loads."
msgstr ""
"如要從 *概覽* 儀表板建立遺漏的休假申請，請前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程"
"式 --> 概覽`，系統隨即會載入 *所有休假* 儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:136
msgid ""
"Click on any cell to select that day, or click and drag multiple consecutive"
" cells to select several days at once. The selected cells turn light blue, "
"and a :guilabel:`# selected` smart button appears at the top, indicating how"
" many entries are selected. Next, click the corresponding time type button "
"at the top of the screen, and the time off record is created."
msgstr ""
"點擊任何儲存格即可選取該天，或按住並拖曳多個連續儲存格以一次選取多天。所選儲"
"存格會變成淺藍色，畫面上方亦會顯示 :guilabel:`已選取 # 項` 智能按鈕，顯示已選"
"取的項目數量。接著，點擊畫面上方對應的時間類型按鈕，系統便會建立休假記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:141
msgid ""
"The Overview displaying five selected days to add missing time off recorss "
"for."
msgstr "概覽顯示五個已選取的日期，用以補加缺漏的休假記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:145
msgid ""
"If the time off record must specify a duration or a description is needed, "
"instead of clicking a time type button, click the :guilabel:`Apply` button "
"and a time off request pop-up window loads. Select the duration next to the "
":icon:`schedule` :guilabel:`(Dates)` icon. Enter an optional description "
"next to the :icon:`edit_f` :guilabel:`(Description)` icon. Once the pop-up "
"window is configured, click :guilabel:`Add` to add the missing time off "
"record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:151
msgid ""
"The quick add pop-up window, specifying sick time off for the afternoon."
msgstr "快速新增彈出式視窗，當中指明下午申請病假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:157
msgid "View allocation requests"
msgstr "檢視分配申請"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:159
msgid ""
"To view allocation requests waiting for approval, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> Management --> Allocations`. Doing so "
"reveals the :guilabel:`Allocations` page. All allocation requests appear in "
"a default Kanban view."
msgstr ""
"要檢視待批核的分配申請，請前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 管理 --> 分"
"配`，即可開啟 :guilabel:`分配` 頁面。所有分配申請均預設以看板檢視顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:163
msgid ""
"The only allocation requests that are visible on this page belong to "
"employees the user either has :guilabel:`Time Off Officer` or "
":guilabel:`Administrator` access rights for in the **Time Off** application."
msgstr ""
"此頁面只會顯示以下員工的假期配額申請：使用者在 **休假** 應用程式中對該等員工"
"擁有 :guilabel:`休假專員` 或 :guilabel:`管理員` 存取權限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:167
msgid ""
"The default filters on the :guilabel:`Allocations` page are :icon:`fa-"
"filter` :guilabel:`First Approval` and :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`My "
"Team`. These filters only present allocation requests that need to be "
"approved for current employees on the user's team, awaiting approval or "
"validation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:171
msgid ""
"On the left side of the :guilabel:`Allocations` page, there are various "
"grouping options that can be used to narrow down the presented allocation "
"requests, located beneath the :icon:`fa-folder` :guilabel:`Status` and "
":icon:`fa-users` :guilabel:`Department` headings."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`分配` 頁面左側，:icon:`fa-folder` :guilabel:`狀態` 及 "
":icon:`fa-users` :guilabel:`部門` 標題下方設有多種分組選項，可用於收窄顯示的"
"分配申請範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:175
msgid ""
"Since only allocation requests that need to be approved are shown, the only "
":icon:`fa-folder` :guilabel:`Status` options are :guilabel:`All`, "
":guilabel:`To Approve`, and :guilabel:`Approved`."
msgstr ""
"由於系統只會顯示需要批核的配額申請，:icon:`fa-folder` :guilabel:`狀態` 選項只"
"有 :guilabel:`全部`、:guilabel:`待批核` 及 :guilabel:`已批核`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:178
msgid ""
"The various departments the user is a member of, and manages employees "
"under, also appear on the left side of the page, under :icon:`fa-users` "
":guilabel:`Departments`."
msgstr ""
"使用者所屬及負責管理員工的各個部門，亦會顯示在頁面左側的 :icon:`fa-users` "
":guilabel:`部門` 下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:181
msgid ""
"To only display allocation requests for specific departments, click on the "
":guilabel:`Department` on the left-hand side of the page. Only requests "
"within the selected department are then presented."
msgstr ""
"如只想顯示特定部門的配額申請，請點擊頁面左側的 :guilabel:`部門`。系統隨即只會"
"顯示所選部門的申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:184
msgid ""
"If the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`First Approval` and :icon:`fa-filter` "
":guilabel:`My Team` filters are removed, all statuses appear."
msgstr ""
"如移除 :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`第一級批核` 及 :icon:`fa-filter` "
":guilabel:`我的團隊` 篩選條件，便會顯示所有狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:188
msgid ""
"If no requests fall under one of the status options or departments, that "
"status or department is **not** visible on the left-side menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:191
msgid "Allocations dashboard showing unapproved allocation requests."
msgstr "顯示未批核配額申請的配額儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:195
msgid "Approve or refuse allocation requests"
msgstr "批准或拒絕分配申請"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:197
msgid ""
"To approve or refuse an allocation request, navigate to :menuselection:`Time"
" Off app --> Management --> Allocations`. At the end of each Kanban card, "
"two buttons appear: an :guilabel:`Approve` or :guilabel:`Validate` button, "
"depending on the status of the request, and a :guilabel:`Refuse` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:202
msgid ""
"If more information is needed before approving an allocation request, click "
"anywhere on the Kanban card (except for the :guilabel:`Approve`, "
":guilabel:`Validate`, or :guilabel:`Refuse` buttons). Doing so loads the "
"detailed allocation request form."
msgstr ""
"如在批核配額申請前需要更多資料，請點擊看板卡片上的任何位置（:guilabel:`核"
"准`、:guilabel:`驗證`或:guilabel:`拒絕`按鈕除外）。系統隨即會載入詳細的配額申"
"請表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:213
msgid ""
"Once a request has been approved, validated, or refused, the Kanban card "
"disappears from the default :guilabel:`Allocations` page. To view *all* "
"requests, including approved and refused requests, clear the default filters"
" in the search bar."
msgstr ""
"申請一經核准、驗證或拒絕，看板卡片便會從預設的 :guilabel:`假期分配` 頁面消失"
"。如要查看 *所有* 申請（包括已核准及已拒絕的申請），請清除搜尋列中的預設篩選"
"條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:217
msgid "An allocation request in detail."
msgstr "分配申請詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:3
msgid "Mandatory days"
msgstr "強制工作日"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:5
msgid ""
"Some companies have special days where a specific department, or the entire "
"staff, is required to be present. Time off is not allowed on those specific "
"days."
msgstr ""
"部分公司設有特別日子，要求特定部門或全體員工必須上班。員工不得在該等特定日子"
"休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:8
msgid ""
"These types of days are called *mandatory days* in Odoo. Mandatory days can "
"be configured to be company-wide, or department-specific. When configured, "
"employees in the specified department or company are unable to submit time "
"off requests for these mandatory days."
msgstr ""
"這類日子在 Odoo 中稱為 *強制性工作日*。強制性工作日可設定為適用於整間公司或特"
"定部門。設定完成後，指定部門或公司的員工便無法就這些強制性工作日提交休假申請"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:13
msgid "No mandatory days are configured in Odoo by default."
msgstr "Odoo 預設沒有設定任何強制工作日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:16
msgid "Create mandatory days"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:18
msgid ""
"To create mandatory days, navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> "
"Configuration --> Mandatory Days`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:21
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button in the top-left corner, and a blank line "
"appears in the list."
msgstr "點擊左上角的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，清單中便會出現一行空白資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:23
msgid "Enter the following information on the new line:"
msgstr "在新一行輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:25
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: Enter the name of the mandatory day."
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`：輸入強制工作日的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: This field is only visible in a multi-company database."
" The current company is selected by default. Use the drop-down menu to "
"select the company the mandatory day is being configured for."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：此欄位僅在多公司資料庫中顯示，系統預設會選取目前的公司。請"
"使用下拉選單選擇要為哪間公司設定強制休假日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Departments`: This column is hidden by default. To display it, "
"click the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(additional options)` icon "
"in the top corner of the header row, next to :guilabel:`Color`, then click "
"the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Departments`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`部門`：此欄預設為隱藏。如要顯示，請點擊標題列頂角的 :icon:`oi-"
"settings-adjust` :guilabel:`（其他選項）` 圖示（位於 :guilabel:`顏色` 旁邊）"
"，然後勾選 :guilabel:`部門` 旁的核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:33
msgid ""
"Use the drop-down menu to select the desired departments. Multiple "
"departments can be selected; there is no limit to the number of departments "
"that can be added."
msgstr "使用下拉式選單選擇所需的部門。您可以選擇多個部門，可新增的部門數量沒有上限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:36
msgid ""
"If this field is left blank, the mandatory day applies to all departments "
"(the entire company)."
msgstr "如果此欄位留空，該強制日子將適用於所有部門（整間公司）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Position`: This column is hidden by default. To display it, "
"click the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(additional options)` icon "
"in the top corner of the header row, next to :guilabel:`Color`, then click "
"the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Job Position`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`職位`：此欄預設為隱藏。要顯示此欄，請點擊標題列頂角的 :icon:`oi-"
"settings-adjust` :guilabel:`（其他選項）` 圖示（位於 :guilabel:`顏色` 旁邊）"
"，然後點擊 :guilabel:`職位` 旁邊的核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:41
msgid ""
"Use the drop-down menu to select the desired job position. Multiple job "
"positions can be selected; there is no limit to the number of job positions "
"that can be added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:44
msgid ""
"If this field is left blank, the mandatory day applies to all employees."
msgstr "如果此欄位留空，該強制工作日將適用於所有員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Start Date`: Use the calendar picker to select the date the "
"mandatory days start."
msgstr ":guilabel:`開始日期`：使用日曆選擇器選取強制日的開始日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`End Date`: Use the calendar picker to select the date the "
"mandatory days end. If creating a single mandatory day, the end date should "
"be the same as the start date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`結束日期`：使用日曆選擇器選取強制休假日的結束日期。如只建立單一強"
"制休假日，結束日期應與開始日期相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Color`: Select a color from the available options, or select the "
"`No color` option, represented by a white circle. The selected color appears"
" on the main **Time Off** app dashboard, in both the calendar and in the "
"legend."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`顏色`：從可用選項中選取一種顏色，或選取以白色圓圈表示的 `無顏色` "
"選項。所選顏色會顯示在主要 **休假** 應用程式儀表板的日曆和圖例中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/mandatory_days.rst:52
msgid "The Mandatory Days section with four date ranges configured."
msgstr "已設定四個日期範圍的強制工作日部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *My Time* menu of the **Time Off** app houses all the various time off "
"information for the signed-in user."
msgstr "**休假** 應用程式的 *我的時間* 選單包含已登入使用者的所有各類休假資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:8
msgid ""
"This includes the main **Time Off** :ref:`dashboard <time_off/dashboard>`, "
"which displays an overview of the various time off balances, as well as "
":ref:`time-off requests <time_off/my-time-off>` and :ref:`allocations "
"<time_off/my-allocations>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:15
msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:17
msgid ""
"All users have access to the **Time Off** app dashboard, which is the first "
"page that appears when the **Time Off** app is opened. The dashboard can "
"also be accessed at any point by navigating to :menuselection:`Time Off app "
"--> My Time --> Dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"所有使用者均可存取 **休假** 應用程式儀表板，此頁面會在開啟 **休假** 應用程式"
"時最先顯示。您亦可隨時前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 我的時間 --> 儀表"
"板` 存取該儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:21
msgid ""
"The dashboard shows a summary of the user's time off, and the entire current"
" calendar year, with the current day highlighted in a red circle. The weeks "
"are notated in light grey, in the far left column of each month."
msgstr ""
"儀表板會顯示使用者的休假摘要及整個當前曆年，並以紅色圓圈標示當日。週數則以淺"
"灰色顯示於每月最左側一欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:25
msgid ""
"To change the view, click the :guilabel:`Year` :icon:`fa-caret-down` button "
"to reveal a drop-down menu. Then, select either :guilabel:`Day`, "
":guilabel:`Week`, or :guilabel:`Month` to present the calendar in that "
"corresponding view."
msgstr ""
"如要變更檢視模式，請點擊 :guilabel:`年` :icon:`fa-caret-down` 按鈕以顯示下拉"
"式選單。然後，選擇 :guilabel:`日`、:guilabel:`週` 或 :guilabel:`月`，以對應的"
"檢視模式顯示日曆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:29
msgid ""
"The dashboard displaying the days of the month, weekends, and the current "
"day."
msgstr "顯示該月日期、週末及當日日期的儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:33
msgid ""
"The calendar displays weekends by default. To hide the weekends, click the "
":guilabel:`Year` :icon:`fa-caret-down` button, and click :icon:`fa-check` "
":guilabel:`Show Weekends`. The dashboard reloads, and the weekends are "
"hidden from view."
msgstr ""
"行事曆預設會顯示週末。如要隱藏週末，請按一下 :guilabel:`年` :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` 按鈕，然後按一下 :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`顯示週末`。儀表板會重新載"
"入，週末亦會從畫面隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:38
msgid ""
"To change the displayed dates, click the :icon:`fa-arrow-left` "
":guilabel:`(Previous)` or :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Next)` buttons "
"to the left of the :guilabel:`Year` button. The calendar view adjusts in "
"increments of the selected view."
msgstr ""
"若要更改顯示的日期，請按一下 :icon:`fa-arrow-left` :guilabel:`(上一個)` 或 "
":icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(下一個)` 按鈕（位於 :guilabel:`年` 按鈕左"
"側）。日曆檢視畫面會按所選檢視模式的單位進行調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:42
msgid ""
"For example, if :guilabel:`Year` is selected, the arrows adjust the view by "
"one year."
msgstr "例如，如果選擇了 :guilabel:`年`，箭頭會將檢視畫面調整一年。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:44
msgid ""
"To reset the view, so it includes the current date, click the "
":guilabel:`Today` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:46
msgid ""
"Above the calendar view is a summary of the user's time off balances. Every "
"time off type that has been allocated appears in its own summary box. Each "
"summary lists the type of time off, the corresponding icon, the current "
"available balance (in hours or days), and if applicable, an expiration date."
msgstr ""
"日曆檢視上方會顯示使用者的休假餘額摘要。每種已獲分配的休假類型都會顯示在各自"
"的摘要方塊中。每份摘要均會列出休假類型、相應圖示、目前可用餘額（以小時或日數"
"計算），以及（如適用）到期日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:51
msgid ""
"To view the full details of a time off balance, click the :icon:`fa-"
"question-circle-o` :guilabel:`(question mark)` icon at the end of the "
":guilabel:`(Days/Hours) available` on the time off type summary. The "
"complete details for the year are presented in a popover window, including:"
msgstr ""
"要查看休假結餘的完整詳情，請點擊 :icon:`fa-question-circle-o` :guilabel:`(問"
"號)` 圖示（位於休假類型摘要中 :guilabel:`(日數/小時) 可用` 的末端）。該年度的"
"完整詳情會在彈出視窗中顯示，包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allocated (new request)`: The total amount of time off allocated "
"to the employee. Click :guilabel:`Allocated` to view a list of allocations "
"granted. To request more time, click :guilabel:`new request` and a :ref:`New"
" Allocation pop-up window loads <time_off/request-allocation>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已分配（新申請）`：已分配給員工的休假總時數。按一下 :guilabel:`已"
"分配` 可查看已批出的分配清單。如要申請更多假期，請按一下 :guilabel:`新申請`，"
"系統便會:ref:`載入「新增分配」彈出視窗 <time_off/request-allocation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Approved`: The total amount of time off that has been approved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已批核`：已獲批核的休假總量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Planned`: The total amount of time off that has been scheduled "
"for the future."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已計劃`：已安排於未來使用的總休假時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Available`: The total amount of time off available to the "
"employee after the approved and planned time off are factored in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:65
msgid ""
"Any time off type that contains expired time provides an alert. The "
":guilabel:`(Days/Hours) available` is highlighted in yellow, along with a "
":icon:`fa-exclamation-triangle` :guilabel:`(caution)` sign."
msgstr ""
"任何包含已過期時數的休假類型均會顯示提示。 :guilabel:`可用（日數／小時）` 會"
"以黃色標示，並附有 :icon:`fa-exclamation-triangle` :guilabel:`（注意）` 標誌"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:69
msgid ""
"A user can also select a future date to see an estimate of how much time "
"they should accrue by that point. On the right side of the time off summary "
"blocks, there is a :guilabel:`Balance at the (date)` field. Click on the "
"date, and a calendar selector popover appears."
msgstr ""
"用戶亦可選擇未來日期，以估算屆時應累計的休假時數。在休假摘要區塊右側，有一個 "
":guilabel:`於（日期）的結餘` 欄位。點擊日期後，會彈出日曆選擇器視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:74
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Balance at the (date)` field **only** appears if the user is "
"accruing time off through an :doc:`accrual plan <accrual_plans>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:77
msgid ""
"The current date is the default date selected. Navigate to the desired date,"
" and Odoo displays the time off balances the user should have on that date. "
"This takes into account all time off currently planned and approved. To "
"return to the current date, click the :guilabel:`Today` button to the right "
"of the date field."
msgstr ""
"系統預設選擇當前日期。前往所需日期後，Odoo 會顯示用戶在該日期應有的休假結餘，"
"當中已計算所有目前已計劃及已批核的休假。如要返回當前日期，請點擊日期欄位右側"
"的 :guilabel:`今天` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:82
msgid ""
"On the right side of the calendar, the various time off types are displayed,"
" each with their own corresponding color. The :guilabel:`Legend` explains "
"how the various statuses for time off requests are presented."
msgstr ""
"在日曆右側會顯示各種休假類型，每種類型均配有相應顏色。:guilabel:`圖例` 會說明"
"各種休假申請狀態的顯示方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:86
msgid ""
"Time off that has been validated appears in a solid color. Time off requests"
" that are still in the :guilabel:`To Approve` stage, appear with white "
"stripes in the color. :guilabel:`Refused` time off requests have a line "
"through the dates."
msgstr ""
"已核准的休假會以純色顯示。仍處於 :guilabel:`待審批` 階段的休假申請，會在顏色"
"上顯示白色條紋。:guilabel:`已拒絕` 的休假申請則會在日期上劃有刪除線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:90
msgid ""
"The color for each request corresponds to the specified color set with the "
"various time off types, listed in the section above the :guilabel:`Legend`."
msgstr ""
"每項申請的顏色對應於各種休假類型所設定的指定顏色，這些休假類型列於 "
":guilabel:`圖例` 上方的部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:93
msgid ""
"New time off requests can be made from the :guilabel:`Dashboard`. Click the "
":guilabel:`New` button in the upper-left corner, and a :doc:`New Time Off "
"<request_time_off>` pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"可從 :guilabel:`儀表板` 提出新的休假申請。點按左上角的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕"
"，隨即會顯示 :doc:`新增休假 <request_time_off>` 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:96
msgid ""
"New allocation requests can also be made from the :guilabel:`Dashboard`. "
"Click the :guilabel:`New allocation request` link to request more time off, "
"and a :ref:`New Allocation <time_off/request-allocation>` pop-up window "
"appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:100
msgid "A view of the complete time off balance details in the popover window."
msgstr "在彈出視窗中檢視完整的休假結餘詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:106
msgid "My time off"
msgstr "我的休假"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:108
msgid ""
"To view a list of all the signed-in user's time off requests, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> My Time --> My Time Off`. Here, all time "
"off requests, both past and present, appear in a chronological list view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:112
msgid ""
"The list includes the following information for each request: the "
":guilabel:`Time Off Type`, :guilabel:`Start Date`, :guilabel:`End Date`, "
":guilabel:`Duration`, and :guilabel:`Status`."
msgstr ""
"此清單包含每項申請的以下資訊：:guilabel:`休假類型`、:guilabel:`開始日"
"期`、:guilabel:`結束日期`、:guilabel:`時長`及:guilabel:`狀態`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:115
msgid ""
"A new time off request can be made from this view. Click the :guilabel:`New`"
" button to :doc:`request_time_off`."
msgstr ""
"您可從此檢視建立新的休假申請。按一下 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，以 "
":doc:`request_time_off`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:118
msgid ""
"Additionally, if the user has the necessary access rights, a :icon:`fa-"
"cross` :guilabel:`Refuse` or :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Validate` button "
"appears at the end of each line."
msgstr ""
"此外，若用戶具備所需存取權限，每行結尾亦會顯示 :icon:`fa-cross` :guilabel:`拒"
"絕` 或 :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`驗證` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:121
msgid "My Time list view with all requests."
msgstr "顯示所有申請的「我的時間」清單檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:127
msgid "My allocations"
msgstr "我的配額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:129
msgid ""
"To view a list of all allocations, navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app "
"--> My Time --> My Allocations`. All allocations and requested allocations "
"appear in a list view."
msgstr ""
"若要查看所有配額的清單，請前往:menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 我的時間 --> "
"我的配額`。所有配額及已申請的配額均會以清單檢視方式顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:132
msgid ""
"The information presented on the :guilabel:`My Allocations` page includes: "
":guilabel:`Time Off Type`, :guilabel:`Amount`, :guilabel:`Allocation Type`, "
":guilabel:`Accrual Plan`, and :guilabel:`Status`. If the signed-in user has "
"the appropriate access rights, a :icon:`fa-cross` :guilabel:`Refuse` or "
":icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Validate` button appears at the end of each "
"line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:137
msgid ""
"A new allocation request can be made from this view, as well. Click the "
":guilabel:`New` button to :ref:`request an allocation <time_off/request-"
"allocation>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/my_time.rst:140
msgid "My Allocations list view with all requests."
msgstr "顯示所有申請的「我的分配」列表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:5
msgid ""
"Since holidays vary by country, region, and even city, Odoo's **Time Off** "
"app does *not* include any public holidays by default. To account for public"
" or national holidays, configure the observed holidays in Odoo so employees "
"can receive the appropriate days off."
msgstr ""
"由於各地、各區甚至各市的假期都有所不同，Odoo 的 **休假** 應用程式預設 *不會* "
"包含任何公眾假期。為了計入公眾假期或法定假日，請在 Odoo 設定適用的假期，讓員"
"工獲得相應的休假天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:9
msgid ""
"Configuring public holidays helps employees clearly see their non-working "
"days and prevents unnecessary time off requests for dates already designated"
" as holidays."
msgstr ""
"設定公眾假期有助員工清楚了解非工作日，並避免員工就已指定為假期的日子提交不必"
"要的休假申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:12
msgid ""
"Public holidays configured in the **Time Off** app are also reflected across"
" other Odoo apps that use :doc:`working schedules "
"<../payroll/working_schedules>`, including **Calendar**, **Planning**, "
"**Manufacturing**, and more."
msgstr ""
"在 **休假** 應用程式中設定的公眾假期，亦會反映在其他使用 :doc:`工作時間表 "
"<../payroll/working_schedules>` 的 Odoo 應用程式中，包括 **日曆**、**規"
"劃**、**製造** 等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:16
msgid ""
"Because of Odoo's integration across these apps, configuring all public "
"holidays is considered best practice."
msgstr "由於 Odoo 在這些應用程式之間高度整合，設定所有公眾假期是最佳做法。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:20
msgid "Create public holidays"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:22
msgid ""
"To create a public holiday, navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> "
"Configuration --> Public Holidays`. All currently configured public holidays"
" appear in a default list view."
msgstr ""
"要建立公眾假期，請前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 設定 --> 公眾假期`。"
"所有目前已設定的公眾假期會顯示於預設清單檢視中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:25
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button and a new line appears at the bottom of the"
" list."
msgstr "按一下:guilabel:`新增`按鈕，清單底部隨即會出現新的一行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:27
msgid "Enter the following information on that new line:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:29
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: Enter the name of the holiday."
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`：輸入假期的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: If in a multi-company database, the current company "
"populates this field by default. It is **not** possible to edit this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：如果在多公司資料庫中，系統預設會在此欄位填入目前公司。此欄"
"位 **不可** 編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:34
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Company` field is hidden, by default. To view this field, "
"click the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(settings adjusts)` icon in "
"the top-right corner of the list, to the far-right of the column titles, and"
" activate the :guilabel:`Company` selection from the drop-down menu that "
"appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Start Date`: Using the date and time picker, select the date and "
"time the holiday starts, then click :guilabel:`Apply`. By default, this "
"field is configured for the current date, with a start time of `12:00 AM`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`開始日期`：使用日期及時間選擇器選擇假期開始的日期及時間，然後按一"
"下:guilabel:`套用`。預設情況下，此欄位設定為目前日期，開始時間為 `12:00 AM`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`End Date`: Using the date and time picker, select the date and "
"time the holiday ends, then click :guilabel:`Apply`. By default, this field "
"is configured for the current date, with an end time of `11:59 PM`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:47
msgid ""
"It is **not** recommended to change the public holiday hours of `12:00 AM` "
"to `11:59 PM`. This ensures all employees working all shifts receive the "
"public holiday."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours`: If the holiday should only apply to employees who"
" have a specific set of working hours, select the working hours using the "
"drop-down menu. If left blank, the holiday applies to all employees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:53
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Entry Type`: If using the **Payroll** app, this field "
"defines how the :doc:`work entries <../payroll/work_entries>` for the "
"holiday appear. Select the work entry type using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/public_holidays.rst:57
msgid "The list of public holidays in the configuration menu."
msgstr "配置選單中的公眾假期清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Time Off** app's reporting feature lets managers view team time off by"
" employee, type, or remaining balances. This allows managers to see "
":ref:`who is taking time off, how much they have used <time_off/by-"
"employee>`, :ref:`which types are more commonly used <time_off/by_type>`, "
"and :ref:`how much each employee still has available <time_off/balance>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:11
msgid ""
"The reporting feature of the **Time Off** app is **only** available to users"
" with the correct :doc:`access rights <../../general/users/access_rights>`, "
"typically managers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:17
msgid "By employee"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:19
msgid ""
"Viewing time off by employee helps managers track usage patterns, monitor "
"remaining balances, ensure policy compliance, and plan coverage for upcoming"
" absences. To view a list of employee time off requests, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> Reporting --> by Employee`."
msgstr ""
"按員工查看休假情況，有助經理追蹤休假使用模式、監察剩餘假期結餘、確保符合公司"
"政策，以及為即將發生的缺勤提前安排人手替補。若要查看員工休假申請清單，請前往 "
":menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 報表 --> 按員工`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:23
msgid ""
"The default report presents the current year's data in a pivot table, with "
"the months populating the columns, and the employees populating the rows. "
"The report displays the various time off taken by each employee, with a "
"status of either *Approved* or *To Approve*, the amount of time off used for"
" each month (the :guilabel:`Duration (Days)`), and the various totals."
msgstr ""
"預設報表會以樞紐分析表顯示本年度的數據，直欄為月份，橫列為員工。報表會列出每"
"位員工已休的各類休假（狀態為 *已批准* 或 *待批准*）、每月已使用的休假時數（"
"即 :guilabel:`時長（日）`），以及各項總計。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:29
msgid ""
"All time off is calculated in days, including time off types configured to "
"be taken in hours. Odoo automatically converts all time off hours into their"
" day equivalent. For example, two hours of time off is presented as `0.25` "
"days."
msgstr ""
"所有休假均以天數計算，包括設定為以小時為單位申請的休假類型。Odoo 會自動將所有"
"休假時數換算為等值天數。例如，兩小時的休假會顯示為 `0.25` 天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:33
msgid "Report of time off, shown by each employee in a pivot table view."
msgstr "按每位員工以樞紐分析表檢視顯示的休假報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:37
msgid ":doc:`Reporting <../../essentials/reporting>`"
msgstr ":doc:`報表 <../../essentials/reporting>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:42
msgid "By type"
msgstr "按類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:44
msgid ""
"Viewing company-wide time off by type can help managers determine if "
"employees are using their time off, which types are used more than others, "
"and can spot any trends. High totals in certain time off types, like sick "
"time off, can indicate health or morale concerns."
msgstr ""
"按休假類型查看全公司的休假情況，有助管理人員了解員工有否使用休假、哪類休假較"
"常使用，並察覺當中的趨勢。某些休假類型（例如病假）的總數偏高，可能反映員工健"
"康或士氣方面的問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:48
msgid ""
"To view a graph of all time off, organized by time off type, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> Reporting --> by Type`. This shows all time"
" off requests with a status of *Approved* or *To Approve* in a default bar "
"chart."
msgstr ""
"要查看按休假類型分類的所有休假圖表，請前往:menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 報"
"告 --> 按類型`。預設的長條圖會顯示所有狀態為 *已核准* 或 *待核准* 的休假申請"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:52
msgid "Each time off type displays three columns of information:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allocation`: This blue-colored bar indicates the total amount of "
"time off allocated to employees."
msgstr ":guilabel:`分配`：這條藍色橫條顯示分配給員工的休假總數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Off`: This red-colored bar indicates the amount of time off "
"requested, including both past and scheduled future time off, for both "
"approved and pending requests."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`休假`：這條紅色橫條顯示已申請的休假數量，包括過去及已安排的未來休"
"假，涵蓋已批核及待批核的申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Balance`: This green-colored bar indicates the total balance of "
"unused time off."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:61
msgid ""
"If the time off type is configured to not require an allocation, the "
":guilabel:`Allocation` column does *not* appear."
msgstr "如果休假類型設定為無需配額，則*不會*顯示:guilabel:`配額`欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:64
msgid "The various time off types in a bar chart."
msgstr "以長條圖顯示的各種休假類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:67
msgid ""
"Hover over a column to view the total :guilabel:`Duration (Days)` and click "
"on a bar to view a detailed list of all the individual records for that bar."
msgstr ""
"將游標懸停在直條上方，即可檢視總計 :guilabel:`時長（日數）`，按一下直條即可檢"
"視該直條所屬的所有個別紀錄詳細清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:70
msgid ""
"Each request is listed, with the following information displayed: the "
":guilabel:`Employee`, :guilabel:`Number of Days`, :guilabel:`Request Type`, "
":guilabel:`Start Date`, :guilabel:`End Date`, :guilabel:`Status`, and the "
":guilabel:`Description`."
msgstr ""
"每個申請均會列出，並顯示以下資料：:guilabel:`員工`、:guilabel:`日"
"數`、:guilabel:`申請類型`、:guilabel:`開始日期`、:guilabel:`結束日"
"期`、:guilabel:`狀態` 及 :guilabel:`描述`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:74
msgid ""
"The report can be displayed in other ways, as well. Click the corresponding "
"button option in the top-right corner of the page to view the data in that "
"way. The various options are a :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Graph)` "
"(the default view), :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(List)`, or :icon:`oi-"
"view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:79
msgid ""
"When a selection has been made, additional options appear for that "
"particular selection. For more detailed information on the reports, and "
"their various options, refer to the :doc:`reporting "
"<../../essentials/reporting>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"作出選擇後，畫面會顯示該選項的額外設定。如欲了解有關報表及其各種選項的詳情，"
"請參閱 :doc:`報表 <../../essentials/reporting>` 說明文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:86
msgid "Balance"
msgstr "結餘"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:88
msgid ""
"When some time off types have restrictions, such as rollover rules and "
"balance limits, viewing time off balances can help managers and time off "
"approvers see a high-level overview of time off. If certain employees have "
"time off that will expire soon, they can be infomred and adjust their "
"schedules accordingly."
msgstr ""
"當部分休假類型設有結轉規則及結餘上限等限制時，檢視休假結餘可協助管理人員及休"
"假核准人掌握休假的整體概覽。若個別員工有即將到期的休假，管理人員便可通知他們"
"相應調整日程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:93
msgid ""
"To view all time off balances for the current year, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> Reporting --> Balance`. The *Balance* "
"report shows all time off balances in a default pivot table. The employees "
"populate the rows, while the various time off types populate the columns."
msgstr ""
"如要查看本年度的所有休假結餘，請前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 報"
"告 --> 結餘`。*結餘* 報告會以預設樞紐分析表顯示所有休假結餘，其中列為員工，欄"
"為各類休假類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:97
msgid ""
"Each time off type displays the :guilabel:`Number of Days` and "
":guilabel:`Number of Hours` remaining for the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:100
msgid ":guilabel:`Left`: The remaining amount of time off for the year."
msgstr ":guilabel:`剩餘`：該年度剩餘的休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Planned`: The amount of time off scheduled for the remainder of "
"the year."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已計劃`：今年餘下時間已安排的休假時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:102
msgid ":guilabel:`Taken`: The amount of time off already taken for the year."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已放取`：本年度已放取的休假數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/reporting.rst:104
msgid "The various time off balances, in a pivot table."
msgstr "以樞紐分析表顯示各項休假餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:5
msgid ""
"When employees wish to take time off, they first submit a time off request "
"through the **Time Off** application."
msgstr "員工如欲休假，需先透過 **休假** 應用程式提交休假申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:8
msgid ""
"If the :doc:`Time Type <time_off_types>` does not require any approvals, the"
" time off request is automatically approved. If approval is needed, the "
"request is reviewed by either the employee's manager or their time off "
"officer, depending on who the employee's :ref:`time off approver is "
"<employees/approvers>`."
msgstr ""
"如果:doc:`休假類型 <time_off_types>`不需要任何審批，休假申請會自動獲得核准。"
"如果需要審批，申請將由員工的經理或休假管理員審核，視乎誰是員工的:ref:`休假審"
"批人 <employees/approvers>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:14
msgid "Submit time off request"
msgstr "提交休假申請"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:16
msgid ""
"To request time off, navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> My Time "
"--> Days Off` and the *My Time Off* dashboard loads. Click the "
":menuselection:`New` button, then :guilabel:`New Time Off`, and a blank *New"
" Time Off* pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:20
msgid ""
"Fill out the various :ref:`fields on the form <time_off/fields>`. Once "
"completed, click the :guilabel:`Submit Request` button, and the request is "
"sent to the corresponding manager and time off officer, and appears in their"
" :ref:`All Time Off <time_off/management/manage-time-off>` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"填寫 :ref:`表單上的各項欄位 <time_off/fields>`。完成後，點擊 :guilabel:`提交"
"申請` 按鈕，申請便會傳送至相應的經理及休假管理員，並顯示在他們的 :ref:`所有休"
"假 <time_off/management/manage-time-off>` 儀表板中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:27
msgid "Time off request fields"
msgstr "休假申請欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:29
msgid ""
"Enter the following information on the *New Time Off* pop-up request form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:31
msgid ""
":icon:`label` :guilabel:`(Time Off Type)`: Select the type of time off being"
" requested."
msgstr ":icon:`label` :guilabel:`（休假類型）`：選取所申請的休假類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:32
msgid ""
":icon:`schedule` :guilabel:`(Dates)`: Click into the first date field and "
"using the calendar selector, select the start date for the time off request."
" Set the second field to the end date for the request. When requesting time "
"off for a single day, set both fields to the same date. If applicable, set "
"the start and end times for the request. Depending on how the selected "
":guilabel:`Time Off Type` is configured, additional fields may appear. "
"Specify when the time off is being requested for a :guilabel:`Full Day`, the"
" :guilabel:`Morning`, or the :guilabel:`Afternoon`. These options appear as "
"either buttons or a drop-down selection."
msgstr ""
":icon:`schedule` :guilabel:`（日期）`：點按第一個日期欄位，並使用日曆選擇器選"
"取休假申請的開始日期。將第二個欄位設為申請的結束日期。如申請單日休假，請將兩"
"個欄位設為相同日期。如適用，請設定申請的開始和結束時間。視乎所選:guilabel:`休"
"假類型`的配置方式，畫面可能會顯示額外欄位。請指明所申請的休假是:guilabel:`全"
"日`、:guilabel:`上午`還是:guilabel:`下午`。這些選項會以按鈕或下拉式選單的形式"
"顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:39
msgid ""
":icon:`edit_f` :guilabel:`(Description)`: Enter a description for the time "
"off request. This should include any details that managers and approvers may"
" need to approve the request, such as `Sick with the flu` or `Family "
"wedding`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`edit_f` :guilabel:`（描述）`：輸入休假申請的描述。當中應包含管理人員及"
"批核人批核申請時可能需要的所有詳細資料，例如 `患上流感` 或 `家人婚禮`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:42
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`Attach File`: This field **only** appears if"
" the :guilabel:`Time Off Type` selected is :ref:`configured to require "
"documentation <time_off/time-off-config>`. Click the :icon:`fa-paperclip` "
":guilabel:`Attach File` button, and a file explorer window appears. Navigate"
" to the desired file, select it, then click the :guilabel:`Open` button. The"
" file is listed on the *New Time Off* pop-up window. Only one file can be "
"attached."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`附加檔案`：此欄位 **只會** 在所選的 "
":guilabel:`休假類型` 已 :ref:`配置為需要證明文件 <time_off/time-off-config>` "
"時出現。點擊 :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`附加檔案` 按鈕，系統會顯示檔案總"
"管視窗。前往所需檔案並選取，然後點擊 :guilabel:`開啟` 按鈕。該檔案便會列於 "
"*新增休假* 彈出視窗中。每次只可附加一個檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:49
msgid ""
"If the *Time Off Type* requires documentation, such as a doctor's note, "
":guilabel:`Required` appears in red text next to the :icon:`fa-paperclip` "
":guilabel:`Attach File` button."
msgstr ""
"如果 *休假類型* 需要證明文件（例如醫生證明書），:guilabel:`必填` 會以紅色文字"
"顯示於 :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`附加檔案` 按鈕旁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:52
msgid ""
"A time off request form filled out for an employee home sick, with a doctor's note\n"
"attached."
msgstr ""
"為因病在家休息的員工填寫並附上醫生證明書的\n"
"休假申請表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:57
msgid "Expanded time off request fields"
msgstr "已展開的休假申請欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:59
msgid ""
"On the  *New Time Off* pop-up request form, click the :icon:`expand_content`"
" :guilabel:`(Expand)` icon in the corner to view the request in a full-page "
"view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:62
msgid ""
"In the full-page view, additional fields may appear. If the employee has any"
" approved time off for the current year, it appears in a gray "
":guilabel:`Summary (year)` box. The summary box lists all time off types, "
"and the total amount of time scheduled."
msgstr ""
"在全頁檢視中，可能會顯示其他欄位。若員工在本年度有任何已獲批准的休假，便會顯"
"示在灰色的 :guilabel:`摘要（年份）` 方格中。該摘要方格會列出所有休假類型及已"
"編排的總休假時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:66
msgid ""
"If the time off request overlaps with another employee in the same "
"department, a blue :guilabel:`(Department) Overlaps` summary appears. This "
"box shows how many other employees have time off scheduled for the same time"
" period. Click :icon:`east` :guilabel:`View Overlaps` to load a calendar "
"view, displaying the overlaps."
msgstr ""
"如果休假申請與同一部門的另一名員工重疊，畫面會顯示藍色的 :guilabel:`（部門）"
"重疊` 摘要框。此摘要框會顯示同一時段內有多少其他員工已安排休假。點擊 "
":icon:`east` :guilabel:`檢視重疊`，即可載入顯示重疊情況的日曆檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:71
msgid "A time off request in full-page view, showing two summary boxes."
msgstr "以全頁檢視顯示的休假申請，當中展示兩個摘要方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:75
msgid ""
"A :icon:`calendar_today` :guilabel:`Calendar` smart button appears at the "
"top of this view. Click this button to view the employee's time off in a "
"calendar view."
msgstr ""
"此檢視畫面的頂部會顯示一個 :icon:`calendar_today` :guilabel:`日曆` 智能按鈕。"
"點擊此按鈕，即可以日曆檢視查看員工的休假紀錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:79
msgid ""
"If an employee requests more time than they currently have available, a "
"warning appears on the time off request form, stating :guilabel:`Only (#.#) "
"day(s) available` in red text. This aids employees if they are unaware of "
"their time off balances, and attempt to request more time than they have, "
"and can adjust the request before submitting it."
msgstr ""
"如員工申請的休假時間多於目前可用餘額，休假申請表單上會以紅色文字顯示警告： "
":guilabel:`僅餘 (#.#) 天可用` 。這可提醒尚未察覺自己休假餘額不足的員工，讓他"
"們在提交申請前調整申請內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/request_time_off.rst:84
msgid ""
"A warning note stating the request is for more days than the user has "
"available."
msgstr "一段警告提示，說明申請的天數多於用戶可用的天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:3
msgid "Time types"
msgstr "時間類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:5
msgid ""
"One of the first things that requires configuration in the **Time Off** app "
"are the time off *types*."
msgstr "在 **休假** 應用程式中，最先需要設定的項目之一是休假 *類型*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:8
msgid ""
"When employees request time off, they must specify the *type* of time off "
"they are requesting, such as sick time, vacation time, etc. The time off "
"type determines several things, including *how* the request is made (hours, "
"half days, or days), and how it is :ref:`approved <time_off/time-off-"
"requests>`."
msgstr ""
"員工申請休假時，必須指定所申請的休假*類型*，例如病假、年假等。休假類型決定了"
"多項設定，包括申請的*方式*（按小時、半天或天計算），以及申請如何獲得:ref:`審"
"批 <time_off/time-off-requests>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:13
msgid ""
"To view the currently configured time off types, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Time Off app --> Configuration --> Time Off Types`. The time"
" off types are presented in a list view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:16
msgid ""
"The **Time Off** app comes with six preconfigured time off types: "
":guilabel:`Paid Time Off`, :guilabel:`Sick Time Off`, :guilabel:`Unpaid`, "
":guilabel:`Compensatory Days`, :guilabel:`Extra Time Off`, and "
":guilabel:`Extra Hours`. These can be modified to suit business needs, or "
"used as-is."
msgstr ""
"**休假**應用程式預設提供六種休假類型：:guilabel:`有薪休假`、:guilabel:`病"
"假`、:guilabel:`無薪假`、:guilabel:`補假`、:guilabel:`額外休"
"假`及:guilabel:`額外工時`。你可按業務需要修改這些類型，或直接沿用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:21
msgid "Create time off type"
msgstr "建立休假類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:23
msgid ""
"To create a new time off type, navigate to :menuselection:`Time Off app --> "
"Configuration --> Time Off Types`. From here, click the :guilabel:`New` "
"button to reveal a blank *Time Off Type* form. Then, enter the following "
"information on the form."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的休假類型，請前往 :menuselection:`休假應用程式 --> 配置 --> 休假類"
"型`。然後，點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，以顯示空白的 *休假類型* 表單，再於表單"
"上輸入以下資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:28
msgid ""
"The only **required** configurations on the time off type form are the "
"following fields:"
msgstr "在休假類型表單上，唯一 **必填** 的設定為以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:30
msgid ":guilabel:`Time Off Type`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`休假類型`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:31
msgid ":guilabel:`Payroll Code`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`薪酬代碼`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:36
msgid ""
"This section outlines the high-level information for the time off type. "
"Enter the following information at the top of the form:"
msgstr "此部分概述休假類型的基本資料。請在表單頂部輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Off Type`: Enter the name for the particular type of time "
"off, such as `Vacation` or `Bereavement`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payroll Code`: Enter the code used by the **Payroll** app when "
"computing this time off."
msgstr ":guilabel:`薪酬代碼`：輸入 **薪酬** 應用程式在計算此休假時使用的代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Country`: If multiple countries are associated with the database,"
" and this time off type is restricted to one country, select the country "
"from the drop-down menu. If this field is left blank, the time off type "
"applies to all countries. This field **only** appears in a multi-country "
"database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`國家/地區`：如果資料庫關聯了多個國家/地區，而此休假類型只限於單一"
"國家/地區，請從下拉式選單選擇該國家/地區。如果此欄位留空，該休假類型將適用於"
"所有國家/地區。此欄位 **只** 會在多國家/地區資料庫中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:50
msgid ""
"The *Payroll* tab includes all information that affects the **Payroll** app,"
" including details used to calculate pay based on the time off type, such as"
" the rate, how it is displayed, and any applicable codes."
msgstr ""
"*薪酬* 分頁包含所有影響 **薪酬** 應用程式的資訊，包括根據休假類型計算薪酬的詳"
"細資料，例如計算比率、顯示方式及任何適用的代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:55
msgid "Computation section"
msgstr "計算部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:57
msgid ""
"The *Computation* section determines how Odoo calculates time off in the "
"**Payroll** app:"
msgstr "*計算* 部分決定 Odoo 如何在 **薪酬管理** 應用程式中計算休假："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rate`: Enter the percentage of pay earned using this time off. "
"Typically, this is `100%`, but in situations where the employee should earn "
"more or less, adjust this field. For example, if they should earn double the"
" rate, enter `200%`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`比率`：輸入使用此休假可獲得的薪金百分比。通常為 `100%`，但若員工應"
"獲得更多或更少薪金，請調整此欄位。例如，若員工應獲得雙倍薪金，請輸入 `200%`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Added to Monthly Pay`: Enable this checkbox if the time off "
"counts as extra time, and is added as a bonus on top of the regular salary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`計入每月薪酬`：若該休假計作額外時間並作為獎金加到常規薪酬之上，請"
"勾選此核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shortcut Behavior`: Select how :doc:`../payroll/work_entries` are"
" created by clicking the corresponding radio button. :guilabel:`Add` creates"
" additional work entries for the time off type, and :guilabel:`Replace` "
"creates a work entry for the time off and deletes any other work entries "
"recorded for that time."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`捷徑行為`：按一下相應的選項按鈕，選擇如何建立 :doc:`../payroll/"
"work_entries`。:guilabel:`新增` 會為該休假類型建立額外的工作記錄，而 "
":guilabel:`取代` 則會為該休假建立工作記錄，並刪除該時段內已記錄的所有其他工作"
"記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Considered as`: Select how the time off type is counted toward "
"accrual plans by clicking the corresponding radio button. Click "
":guilabel:`Working Time` if the time off *does* count, and select "
":guilabel:`Absence` if it does *not* count toward any type of accrual."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`視為`：點選相應的單選按鈕，選擇此休假類型如何計入累計計劃。如果休"
"假 *確實* 計入，請點擊 :guilabel:`工作時間` ；如果 *不* 計入任何類型的累計，"
"則選擇 :guilabel:`缺勤` 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Period Unit`: Select the format the time off is requested in by "
"clicking the corresponding radio button. The options are:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`時段單位`：點擊相應的單選按鈕，選擇申請休假的時間格式。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Day`: Time off can only be requested in full-day increments (8 "
"hours)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`日`：只可以整日（8 小時）為單位申請休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Half Day`: Time off can only be requested in half-day increments "
"(4 hours)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`半日`：只可以半日（4 小時）為單位申請休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:76
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:129
msgid ":guilabel:`Hours`: Time off can be taken in hourly increments."
msgstr ":guilabel:`小時`：休假可以小時為單位申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display Hours`: Enable this checkbox to display the time off type"
" on the payslip worked days line. This field does **not** appear if "
":guilabel:`Hours` is selected for the :guilabel:`Period Unit` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rounding Method`: Select how the time off type is rounded. This "
"field does **not** appear if :guilabel:`Hours` is selected for the "
":guilabel:`Period Unit` field. The options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`捨入方式`：選取休假類型的捨入方式。如果選取了 :guilabel:`小時` 作"
"為 :guilabel:`期間單位` 欄位的選項，此欄位將 **不會** 顯示。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Closest`: The time off is rounded to the closest value, either up"
" or down."
msgstr ":guilabel:`最接近`：休假會四捨五入至最接近的數值（向上或向下取整）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:85
msgid ":guilabel:`Up`: The time off is always rounded up."
msgstr ":guilabel:`向上取整`：休假時數一律向上取整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:86
msgid ":guilabel:`Down`: The time off is always rounded down."
msgstr ":guilabel:`向下取整`：休假時數一律向下取整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpaid in Structures`: If the time off should not be calculated "
"in a specific pay structure, select the structure using the drop-down menu. "
"Leaving this field blank indicates it is always paid."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`不計薪的薪資結構`：如果休假不應在特定薪資結構中計算，請使用下拉式"
"選單選擇該結構。將此欄位留空表示一律計薪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:93
msgid "Display section"
msgstr "顯示區段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:95
msgid ""
"Enter the following fields in the *Display* section of the *Payroll* tab:"
msgstr "在 *薪酬* 分頁的 *顯示* 部分中輸入以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display Code`: Enter a three-character code for the time off "
"type. This is for display purposes only and does not affect any computations"
" or accounts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`顯示代碼`：輸入休假類型的三個字元代碼。此代碼僅作顯示用途，不會影"
"響任何計算或帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:99
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:261
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Color`: Select a color to be used in the **Time Off** app "
"dashboard."
msgstr ":guilabel:`顏色`：選擇要在**休假**應用程式儀表板中使用的顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show On Payslip`: Enable this checkbox to display this time off "
"type on employee payslips."
msgstr ":guilabel:`在糧單上顯示`：勾選此複選框，即可在員工糧單上顯示此休假類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:104
msgid "Exports code section"
msgstr "匯出代碼部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:106
msgid ""
"Enter the following field in the *Exports code* section of the *Payroll* "
"tab:"
msgstr "在 *薪酬* 分頁的 *匯出代碼* 部分輸入以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`External`: Enter a code to use when exporting data to use with "
"third-party apps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:111
msgid "Description section"
msgstr "說明部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:113
msgid ""
"Enter any important information in this section, such as when the time off "
"type is used."
msgstr "在此部分輸入任何重要資料，例如此休假類型的使用時機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:115
msgid "The payroll tab of a time off type configured for Training Time Off."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:119
msgid "Time off tab"
msgstr "休假分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:121
msgid ""
"The *Time Off* tab contains all information related to the **Time Off** app,"
" including details for displaying, allocating, requesting, and approving "
"time off."
msgstr ""
"*休假*分頁包含與**休假**應用程式相關的所有資料，包括顯示、分配、申請及核准休"
"假的詳細資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:124
msgid "Configure the following fields at the top of this tab:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unit of measure`: Select the format the time off is requested in "
"by clicking the corresponding radio button. The options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`計量單位`：按一下相應的單選按鈕，選擇申請休假時所使用的格式。選項"
"包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days`: Time off can only be requested in full-day increments (8 "
"hours)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`日數`：申請休假只可以整日（8 小時）為單位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration Type`: Select the format the time off is requested in by"
" clicking the corresponding radio button. The options are:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`時長類型`：點擊相應的單選按鈕，選取申請休假所用的格式。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:135
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Full Day`: Time off can only be requested in full-day increments "
"(8 hours)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`全日`：只可以全日（8 小時）為單位申請休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Half-Day`: Time off can only be requested in half-day increments "
"(4 hours)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`半天`：僅可按半天（4 小時）為單位申請休假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:137
msgid ":guilabel:`Custom Hours`: Time off can be taken in hourly increments."
msgstr ":guilabel:`自訂時數`：休假可以按小時為單位放取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:142
msgid "Time off requests section"
msgstr "休假申請區塊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:144
msgid ""
"This section determines how approvals are handled for time off requests for "
"this time off type."
msgstr "此部分決定系統如何處理此休假類型的休假申請批核。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:146
msgid ""
"Select what specific kind of :guilabel:`Approval` is required for the time "
"off type. The options are:"
msgstr "選擇此休假類型所需的特定:guilabel:`批核`方式。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`None needed`: No approvals are required when requesting this type"
" of time off. The time off request is automatically approved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`無需審批`：申請此類休假時無需任何審批。休假申請會自動獲得批准。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Time Off Officer`: Any time off officer is required to approve"
" the time off request. This option is selected by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Employee's Approver`: Only the employee's specified approver "
"for time off, which is configured in the *Settings* tab of the "
":ref:`employee's form <employees/approvers>`, is required to approve the "
"time off request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`由員工的批核人`：只有員工指定的休假批核人需要批核休假申請。該批核"
"人是在:ref:`員工表單 <employees/approvers>`的 *設定* 分頁中設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Employee's Approver and Time Off Officer`: Both the employee's"
" :ref:`specified time off approver <employees/approvers>` and the time off "
"officer are required to approve the time off request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`由員工的批核人員及休假管理員審批`：員工的 :ref:`指定休假批核人員 "
"<employees/approvers>` 及休假管理員必須共同批核該休假申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:161
msgid "Allocation requests section"
msgstr "分配申請部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:163
msgid ""
"This section determines how allocation requests are handled for this time "
"off type."
msgstr "此部分決定如何處理此休假類型的配額申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:165
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Requires Allocation`: If the time off must be allocated to "
"employees, enable the checkbox. If the time off can be requested without "
"time off being previously allocated, uncheck the box. If unchecked, no other"
" options appear in the *Allocation Requests* section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:168
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allow Employee Requests`: Check the checkbox if the employee "
"should be able to request more time off than was allocated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`允許員工申請`：如果員工可以申請超過已分配額度的休假，請勾選此核取"
"方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:171
msgid ""
"If employees should **not** be able to make requests for more time off than "
"what was allocated, leave the box unchecked."
msgstr "如 **不應** 讓員工申請超過已獲分配額度的休假，請勿勾選此方格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:175
msgid ""
"Ten days are allocated to the employee for this particular type of time off,"
" and the :guilabel:`Allow Employee Requests` option is enabled. The employee"
" wants to take a vacation for twelve days. They may submit a request for two"
" additional days, since the :guilabel:`Allow Employee Requests` option is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"員工獲分配十天此類休假，且已啟用 :guilabel:`允許員工申請` 選項。該員工想申請"
"十二天假期。由於已啟用 :guilabel:`允許員工申請` 選項，因此可額外申請兩天假期"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:181
msgid ""
"It is important to note that requesting additional time off does **not** "
"guarantee that time off is granted."
msgstr "請注意，申請額外休假並 **不** 保證該休假會獲得批准。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:184
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Approval`: Select the type of approvals required for the "
"allocation of this particular time off type."
msgstr ":guilabel:`審批`：選擇分配此特定休假類型所需的審批類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:187
msgid ""
":guilabel:`None needed`: No approvals are required when requesting "
"additional allocations for the time off type. The allocation request is "
"automatically approved."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`無須批核`：申請此休假類型的額外配額時無須批核。配額申請會自動獲批"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:189
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Time Off Officer`: Any time off officer can approve the "
"allocation request. This option is selected by default."
msgstr ":guilabel:`由休假管理員`：任何休假管理員均可批核分配申請。此選項為預設選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:191
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Employee's Approver`: Only the employee's specified approver "
"for time off, which is set on the *Work Information* tab on the "
":ref:`employee's form <employees/work-info-tab>`, is required to approve the"
" allocation request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:194
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By Employee's Approver and Time Off Officer`: Both the employee's"
" :ref:`specified time off approver <employees/approvers>` and a time off "
"officer are required to approve the allocation request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`由員工的審批人及休假管理員批核`：員工的 :ref:`指定休假審批人 "
"<employees/approvers>` 及休假管理員均須批准該配額申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:203
msgid ""
"This section determines all other details regarding the time off type, aside"
" from approvals and allocations."
msgstr "此部分決定除審批及分配以外，有關休假類型的所有其他詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:206
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ignore Public Holidays`: Enable this option if public holidays "
"should *not* be included in time off requests."
msgstr ":guilabel:`忽略公眾假期`：如果休假申請 *不應* 包括公眾假期，請啟用此選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:210
msgid ""
"An employee in the United States requests time off for the week of July 4th,"
" for a total of five days. Since the 4th of July is a holiday in the United "
"States, the time off request is automatically modified to use four vacation "
"days and one public holiday, instead of five vacation days. That is because "
"the holiday is ignored, and the user does not need to use their own vacation"
" time for a public holiday."
msgstr ""
"美國的一位員工申請於 7 月 4 日所在的一週休假，合共五天。由於 7 月 4 日是美國"
"的公眾假期，系統會自動修改該休假申請，改為扣減四天年假及一天公眾假期，而非五"
"天年假。這是因為系統會略過公眾假期，用戶毋須在公眾假期動用自己的年假。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:216
msgid ""
"This option reduces extra work for users, enabling them to make only one "
"time off request for the entire week, instead of making two separate "
"requests, one for the days *before* the holiday, and another one for the "
"days *after* the holiday."
msgstr ""
"此選項可減少用戶的額外操作，讓他們只需為整個星期提交一次休假申請，而無須分開"
"提交兩次申請（一次針對假期 *前* 的日子，另一次則針對假期 *後* 的日子）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:220
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hide On Dashboard`: Enable this option if this type of time off "
"should *not* appear on the dashboard."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在儀表板上隱藏`：如果此休假類型*不應*顯示在儀表板上，請啟用此選項"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:222
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Require Supporting Document`: Enable this option if the employee "
"**must** attach documents to the time off request. This is useful in "
"situations where documentation is required, such as long-term medical leave "
"or jury duty."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`要求證明文件`：如果員工 **必須** 在休假申請中附上文件，請啟用此選"
"項。此選項適用於需要證明文件的情況，例如長期病假或履行陪審員職責。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Deduct Extra Hours`: Enable this option if the time off request "
"should factor in any extra time accrued by the employee."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:229
msgid ""
"If an employee works two extra hours for the week, and requests five hours "
"of time off, the two extra worked hours are counted toward the request. As a"
" result, the time off request only uses three hours of the employee's "
"accrual."
msgstr ""
"如果員工在該週額外工作了兩小時，並申請五小時的休假，該兩小時的額外工時會計入"
"休假申請中。因此，該休假申請只會消耗員工三小時的累計假期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:233
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Eligible for Accrual Rate`: Enable this checkbox if the time off "
"type is included when calculating worked time for an accrual plan. This is "
"enabled by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`符合累積比率資格`：如果在計算累積計劃的工作時間時需包括此休假類型"
"，請啟用此勾選方塊。此選項預設為啟用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:235
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allow Request on Top`: Enable this checkbox if employees can "
"request additional time off, concurrent with this time off type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`允許疊加申請`：如果員工可以申請與此休假類型同時進行的額外休假，請"
"剔選此方格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display Time Off in Calendar`: Enable this checkbox to create "
"entries in the **Calendar** app when time off is requested for this time off"
" type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在日曆中顯示休假`：啟用此勾選框後，當申請此休假類型的休假時，系統"
"會在**日曆**應用程式中建立記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:241
msgid "Negative cap section"
msgstr "負上限區段"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:243
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Allow Negative Cap` option if employees should be able"
" to request more time off than they currently have, allowing a negative "
"balance. If enabled, an :guilabel:`up to` field appears. In this field, "
"enter the maximum amount of negative time allowed, in hours or days, "
"depending on what was selected in the :guilabel:`Unit of measure` field."
msgstr ""
"如要讓員工申請多於現有餘額的休假（允許負數結餘），請啟用 :guilabel:`允許負數"
"上限` 選項。啟用後，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`最多` 欄位。在此欄位中，輸入允許的"
"最多負數休假時間（以小時或日數計），具體取決於 :guilabel:`計量單位` 欄位的所"
"選項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:249
msgid ""
"Sara currently has three days of the `Vacation` time off type. She is "
"planning a trip that requires five days of time off."
msgstr "Sara 目前有三天 `假期` 類型的休假。她正計劃一趟需要五天休假的旅程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:252
msgid ""
"The `Vacation` time off type has the :guilabel:`Allow Negative Cap` option "
"enabled, and the :guilabel:`up to` is set to three days."
msgstr ""
"`年假` 休假類型已啟用 :guilabel:`允許負數上限` 選項，且 :guilabel:`最多` 設為"
"三天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:255
msgid ""
"These settings allow Sara to submit a request for five days of the "
"`Vacation` time off type. If approved, her `Vacation` time off balance will "
"be negative two (-2) days."
msgstr ""
"這些設定讓 Sara 可以提交 5 日 `年假` 休假類型的申請。如果申請獲批，她的 `年"
"假` 休假餘額將會是負二 (-2) 日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:259
msgid "Display option section"
msgstr "顯示選項部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/time_off_types.rst:263
msgid "The time off tab configured for paid time off."
msgstr "已設定有薪休假的休假分頁。"
